      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radca policyjny z nienawiści zszarzał na obliczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były owszem zbyt sztywne, jak na panujący pół zmrok, aby to było naturalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem w ręku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bryłowata noga gniewnie tupnęła w podłogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim zdołałem ująć tę wizję, mnich na nowo stał się mnichem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na co pan czeka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę lubię rozważać co by było, gdyby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłoby najmądrzejsze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miałem prawa szukać ulgi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadziwiające, że pan go nie słyszał!?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez sekundę ogarnęła mnie trwoga: co będzie, gdy zabłądzę?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłoby to: wątpliwości zasiać w tem nieszczęśliwem sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem schwyciła nagle mą rękę i zaśmiała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Chcesz powiedzieć: pan Pernat!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krótkie skrzypienie desek zdradza, gdzie jego trzewik, zwlekając, dotknie podłogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mi przeszkadza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Baczność!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jozue Prokop wesoło mrugnął powiekami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W piętnastym roku życia urodziła dziecko i odtąd już się nie pokazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gorączka mu widocznie podsuwa takie fantastyczne opowieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zawsze ta sama twarz, i nigdy innych rysów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem elastyczna, tłuczniem zbita ziemia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem przywlokły nagą kobietę, olbrzymią, jak spiżowy kolos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ręką trzymałem za klamkę, ale znów ją cofnąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie był on zawsze przyjacielski i dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyśliłem się, że ona już nie myśli, aby co kolwiek ukrywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróble o zmokłem upierzeniu siedziały nieruchomo na rynnach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23615233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech mi pan, przerwie, mistrzu Pernat, gdy będę znów zbyt popędliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele aspektów rynku funkcjonuje źle\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szanowni Posłowie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżające się majowe posiedzenie komitetu przygotowawczego stanowi ważny etap przygotowań do tej konferencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nie demokracja jest tu zagadnieniem kluczowym, to rządy prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyczerpaliśmy listę posłów chcących przedstawić wyjaśnienia dotyczące sposobu głosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę oczywiście głosować za ich odrzuceniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to ludność różnorodna, liczna, lecz należy ją traktować jako całość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowisko Republiki Cypru należy uszanować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się, że szczyt jest ważną ku temu okazją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tragedią jest, gdy członek misji pokojowej traci swoje życie chroniąc życie innych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oszczędność energii jest koniecznym i najefektywniejszym rozwiązaniem - to wiemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie dlatego Parlament Europejski ponowił swój apel o ustanowienie minimalnego dochodu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość już powiedziano o Grecji - chcę teraz przejść do przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolontariat stanowi wyraz europejskich wartości społecznych, takich jak solidarność i niedyskryminacja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W żaden sposób nie odzwierciedla to naszej opinii na temat treści sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przekonany, że ten fundusz powinien także być przeznaczony dla właścicieli przedsiębiorstw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed rozpoczęciem głosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasadnicze jest sprawiedliwe i przejrzyste ustalenie celów krajowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki wymiar finansowy przybierze partnerstwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gratuluję sprawozdawcy i dziękuję mu za tę przyjemną i konstruktywną współpracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skutki zmian klimatu będą dotkliwe przede wszystkim dla krajów Europy Południowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadzi mnie to do kwestii minimalnej lub maksymalnej harmonizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie może ona spaść na drugie miejsce w wyniku obecnych trudności gospodarczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie u nas!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże inne poprawki mogą spowodować niepożądane konsekwencje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obwinianie rolnictwa wielkoobszarowego, konkurencji cenowej czy jeszcze innych zjawisk zupełnie nie ma sensu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim chciałbym wszystkim podziękować za bardzo interesującą debatę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Francja przewodzi tej bitwie, a nadchodząca francuska prezydencja jest wspaniałą okolicznością do jej zrealizowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polska także obiecała dostarczyć znaczącą pomoc\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadałam bardzo szczegółowe pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic, jeno hańba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że Parlament Europejski traktuje priorytetowo walkę z chorobą Alzheimera\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szwedzka prezydencja przedstawiła ambitny plan działania, który obejmuje wniosek dotyczący większej przejrzystości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dzięki niemu miliony Europejczyków lepiej dbają o swoją kondycję fizyczną i psychiczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W wielu krajach sytuacja w zakresie demokracji i praw człowieka jest niepewna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Niemczech istnieje wiele wytwórni biogazu, w których wytwarzana jest jedynie energia elektryczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Edukacja nie może być zdana na łaskę rynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym poznać pańskie zdanie na temat wniosku zawartego w sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebują też pomocy technicznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwdziałanie temu zjawisku jest priorytetem Unii Europejskiej, jest także zapisane w celach milenijnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby to osiągnąć, musimy w maksymalnym stopniu skorzystać z każdej możliwej opcji finansowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiany te idą w kierunku większej mobilności siły roboczej i szkoleń zawodowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środek jest zbyt ważny i wartościowy, by go trwonić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30559953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy unikać tych kierunków działania i określić kwestie wymagające dalszych działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy cierpienia, czy szczęście?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywiązaliśmy konie i siedliśmy przy dużym odłamie skały naprzeciw siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nogi dotykały się szerokich, kamiennych stopni, posypanych żwirem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę absolutnie żadnych układów i proszę o ostre warunki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są chwile, kiedy Maciuś nie na żarty się gniewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bywaj więc zdrów, gdyż wracam do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zawiodło mnie ono.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie poznałem tak szybko człowieka, jak Bartha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo i cóż go to obchodziło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wchodzi w ubraniu pod prysznic?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzenie ściętej głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wolałbym zobaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem człowiek całe życie, sto lat myślał, potem napisał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więcej niż życie“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co to, to nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym jej mógł przynajmniej pomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy nie wysłucha z uśmiechem skarg dziecięcia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"gdybym tego nie robił, zapomniałbym gdzie co leży... stawy zaśniedziałyby w członkach...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale uprzedzam cię, że moje skrzydła już rosną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak przyjemnie siedzieć na kamieniu nad samą przepaścią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co rozkaże?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zawsze różnica, czy kogoś zamordują, czy też rozstrzelają go według prawa wojennego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pisałem cały tydzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Narysowałbym coś, ale weny brak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas zwykle zajmujące rozmowy, wspomnienia miłosne, przyszłe zamiary małżonków, były rozbierane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się z roztargnieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Błogosławieni którzy płaczą...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"twój puls bije tak silnie, krew uderza ci do twarzy... O!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapomniałem jednak, w jakiem szczególnem znajduję się mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czyż nie mogłem go wsunąć pod jakiś kamień przy bramie wchodowej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno zostawić w wodzie odciśnięty ślad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nikt cię nie trzyma!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy kocham rodziców czy nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego towarzysz spojrzał na niego z przerażeniem i zgrozą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla wszystkich dusz silnych lub organizacyj szczęśliwych, zastanowienie jest potężnym posiłkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieraz napadają na nas chwile słabości, nawet na najodważniejszych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie mamy się udać i co robić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem naraz zmieniała postępowanie względem Jaromira, udając, że nagle znajduje w nim upodobanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle, jak to u dzielnych ludzi bywa, przyszła mi wspaniała myśl do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chytra z ciebie dziewka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gubernator zwrócił machinalnie oczy na ramiona swojego więźnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem zachwycona, że poznałam osobę tak przyjemną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Też coś?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25002320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszny krzyk przedarł się do nas z lasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ktoś zagwizdał, zastukały koła i pociąg pojechał w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek ów zostawił rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wcześniej wymyślałem sobie różne śmieszne powiedzonka, błyskotliwe zapowiedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to bardzo ładna kobieta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są dalekie kraje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojechaliście kajakiem w górę rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwni ludzie, kochają ojczyznę swych martwych pól.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał jednak brzydki zwyczaj mówić z lekceważeniem o jej ośmiu latach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samotni, Lewa ręka nie klaszcze to świetne czeskie filmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy ty używasz managera haseł? A może masz łeb jak sklep?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jeszcze na samym brzeżku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz następnego rana żar uczy nił się na świecie okropny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż ci się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak zwane wegetariańskie kotlety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Kobiety takich rzeczy nie rozumieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem już obie posłyszały dźwięk, który przeszkodził jej mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patologia i demoralizacja. Toż to profanacja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jasne światło dzienne dodało obojgu dzieciom otuchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tęczowe majtki, czarne koszule.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co zrobisz? — Nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Disco Polo: tzw współczesna polska muzyka taneczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale szyja już sama wyschła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miękka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem znów do okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rycerz Konrad przeciągnął się, wyprostował kości i odetchnął głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ministerstwo głupich kroków. Skecze brytyjskiej grupy komików\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz przystąpimy do uczty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to tak ciężko okazywać twarde serce swojej własnej krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wystarczy, że jedno z nas żyje w jej cieniu“, rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżał się wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możecie przenocować u mnie, ale jutro marsz w drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy patrzyli w jedną stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palił fajkę i milczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina szesnasta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21088812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden tylko pokutnik odprawiał spowiedź przed opatem i właśnie odchodził rozgrzeszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to kartka, na której nabazgrałem zagadkową wiadomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możesz pójść na rynek, gdzie kupcy rozkładają swoje za pasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uspokojony pod tym względem, począł łamać głowę, jakby zabezpieczyć ją od deszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc pyta się: co to jest? i do czego służy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jadalni była poważną i milczącą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogąc zmienić, wykreśliłem to wszystko, co mu się śniło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwi za sobą zamyka, och! Nareszcie sami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ona także niegłupia, ta bestia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21089037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczebrzeszyn to miasto w województwie lubelskim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy spojrzeć na inne kraje, w których to także miało miejsce w przeszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapadła demokratyczna decyzja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja wspiera również te państwa członkowskie, które chciałyby przeprogramować Europejski Fundusz Społeczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konieczne jest ponowne przeliczenie podatków od samochodów na podstawie kryteriów emisyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczy samej w przemówieniach ujawniały się czasem zupełnie różne punkty widzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę zwrócić uwagę, że będziemy najpierw głosowali nad poprawkami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekuję silnego poparcia Parlamentu w tym zakresie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Większość tych problemów dotyczy jednak nie tylko Serbii, ale również i innych krajów bałkańskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to dobry kierunek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wskutek tego zaniedbane dotąd regiony stały się najbardziej widocznymi przykładami naszego rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym miło mi słyszeć, że Komisja pracuje nad rozwiązaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że jest to oczywisty przykład sytuacji, w której reakcja jest potrzebna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobom, które go nie otrzymały, możemy oczywiście przesłać kopie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę dokładnie przyjrzeć się powyższym aspektom tych wyborów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz będziemy głosować na \\\"nie\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysłali jednak naprzeciw kilkunastu jeźdźców, bo takiej zawiei najstarsi ludzie nie pamiętają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakkolwiek, była to decyzja podjęta kilka lat temu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem zadowolony, że porozumienie, ta ugoda, zawiera kilka warunków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35161644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nakładanie na przedsiębiorstwa dodatkowych obciążeń finansowych w tym trudnym ekonomicznie czasie wydaje się nierozsądne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Metoda ta nie opóźniała ani nie narażała na ryzyko osiągnięcia celów Europejskiego Funduszu Społecznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego źródłem są plotki, całkowicie wyssane z palca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowczo sprzeciwiamy się metodzie wykorzystywania takich kwestii do budowy unijnego państwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Komisja przeprowadzi odpowiednią ocenę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrażamy naszą solidarność z nimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezależnie od tego, czy się to komuś podoba, czy nie, nasz Parlament podjął decyzję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wszystkim Gradom też!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W swobodniejszej chwili wyjaśnię ci moje plany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż jest znaczna potrzeba prowadzenia badań naukowych nad biopaliwami pierwszej generacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cześć ich pamięci!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.332,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jednocześnie zwrócić uwagę, że istnieje kilka sprzeczności dotyczących ostatecznej listy dofinansowywanych inwestycji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zawiodła tu technologia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz dziękuję sprawozdawcom i mam nadzieję, że ostateczna decyzji nastąpi w bliskiej przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podkreślamy zróżnicowanie tych krajów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ta dyskusja jest tak ważna i dlatego jest ważne wysłuchanie nawzajem swoich argumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są one bez wątpienia bardzo lukratywne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często napotykamy na problemy w egzekwowaniu europejskich przepisów prawa dotyczących rynku wewnętrznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wyzwanie, z którym w reformie wspólnej polityki rybołówstwa musi się zmierzyć komisarz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc dzisiaj o Turcji, nie możemy pomijać istotnych wydarzeń w jej szerzej pojętym regionie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Finlandii ten sport wymaga licencji i jest uprawiany pod ścisłym nadzorem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To niezbędna i solidna podstawa na przyszłość, potrzebna zwłaszcza w odniesieniu do żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Parlamencie podkreślamy potrzebę pogodzenia dwóch celów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Iran, jak państwo wiedzą, wpływa destabilizująco na sytuację w Libanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłoby jakieś osiągnięcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35174178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba zaproponować instrumenty wsparcia, które pomogą odbudować pogłowie owiec i kóz w Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I między Murzynami miał Maciuś wrogów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapomniałem nadmienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie było bardzo przyjemnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oczach jej czytałem, iż zapomniała, że tu jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż, sprzeciwia się pan stanowczo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Napijcie się herbaty, jeszcze gorąca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas kolacji, w sali jadalnej, było cicho, bo jedzono kurczęta; to wymagało skupienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż tam u ciebie słychać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, muszę iść do swojej roboty — powiedział Filip i poszedł do swojego śledzia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz, ile w nim papierów i rupieci! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co dobre, szybko się kończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubrał się i wybiegł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mówią o skrzydłach dla ludzkości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, ale sprawdzę w internecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rzeczywiście — przyznał towarzysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ciągle się myj i myj! — krzyczy ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apetyt rośnie w miarę jedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzisiaj mamy być tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja twojego starego bardzo lubię, i to jest w swoim rodzaju morowy typ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynieś no wiadro, Tomaszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zmieniłem zamiar i jadę do stacji końcowej na tej linii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tymczasem wiedzą już królowie, dokąd zajechał samochód z Maciusiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to są skutki alkoholu, rzec by można, dodatnie, ale chwilowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mimo wszystko zrobiłabyś tak, jakbyś chciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo to licho przecież nie je, nie pije, tylko wyśmiewaniem żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy postanowił zaatakować go wprost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Opowiedz mi o swej rodzinie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda i pożytek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie Boże itd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdarzenie, które miało miejsce rok temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jerzy, przytrzymaj chwilę prawe ramię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę myślałem, że to twój kolega z pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelkie nazwy będą fałszywe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę i nic nie rozu miem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przeczuwał, jakie huragany zawiera w sobie to wezwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyja to transkrypcja? — To właściwie wcale nie jest transkrypcja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem — odpowiedział Podlasiak i z dumnym poczuciem rozbudzonej niejasno nadziei spojrzał na wyrwany kędzior.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc padał śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cynamonki w Kofikadzie to prawdziwy hit, zapraszam na nie wszystkich znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy inwestować więcej w szkolnictwo i edukację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ostrożnie odsunąwszy rąbek firanki, wyjrzała przez szparę na korytarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ucieknie! — pocieszał siebie samego jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mam go jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję — odparł, pokrywając zdumienie wymuszonym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczę jednak, że to wkrótce nastąpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ponura twarz jego świadczyła, że słowa przeciwnika nie odniosły skutku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to trójkąt w kole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci Amerykanie mieli dobre wiadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka siedzących koło niego osób słyszało te słowa i przyjęto je oklaskami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przystałem na to chętnie i zeszliśmy wszyscy razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krew się tu poleje jeszcze dzisiaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest to jakieś nie troszczące się o wynik, rządowe przedsiębiorstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległ się głośny szmer potwierdzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podróżny w tej chwili podniósł rękę lewą do swojego oka lewego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to widok nie dla kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to, powtarzam, wybieg, celem wprowadzenia śledztwa na trop fałszywy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to w sobotę pewnego majowego wieczoru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to, ma się rozumieć, ordynarne i potworne“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Detektyw miejscowy spoglądał bezradny to na jednego, to na drugiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie podpił sobie porządnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kartkę, którą miał zamiar złożyć na moich zwłokach, położyliśmy obok niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może dlatego muzyka przejmuje nas tak do głębi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty i podobni tobie byli wrogami Boga i ludzi w tych stronach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21398039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjedz, a trochę się pożywisz… nie będziesz tak głodna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co z wzajemnością w zakresie piątej swobody?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podkreślę tu jeden z celów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynie w taki sposób konsumenci będą w stanie dokonać świadomego wyboru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co więcej, istnieje sposób umożliwiający osiągnięcie tego celu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób w Unii Europejskiej zaczną formalnie funkcjonować liczne kategorie pracowników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pomidory, banany oraz sektor zwierząt gospodarskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cypr i Grecja są - i nadal pozostaną - ogromnie ważne dla Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale musi pan zrozumieć, że toczy się wojna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako lekarz zdecydowanie popieram takie podejście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przedmiotowej dyrektywie tworzy się wstępne warunki dla Europy bez granic w dziedzinie medycyny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem polega na tym, że bieda i wykluczenie społeczne to cechy dziedziczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że powinniśmy także przywiązywać większą wagę do integracji i swobodnego przemieszczania się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyślmy, jakie może to mieć następstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Imigracji nie można traktować wyłącznie jako kwestii bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy zapobiec sytuacjom, w których użytkownicy są ofiarami braku dialogu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec, panie przewodniczący, pragnę wspomnieć o trzeciej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecna propozycja Komisji przynosi poprawę we wszystkich tych aspektach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przegląd kandydatów zawsze był elementem procesu przedwyborczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Streszczenia powinny być opracowywane i udostępniane publicznie za pośrednictwem punktu kompleksowej obsługi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.532,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ingerowanie w treści informacyjne przez właścicieli stacji telewizyjnych i radiowych narusza standardy demokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto należy zobowiązać laboratoria do informowania krajowych władz nadzorczych o przypadkach przekroczenia dopuszczalnych wartości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jedna osoba, jedno prawo do emisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oświadczyli to wyraźnie moi przedmówcy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27683337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłoby zabawne, gdyby sprawa nie była tak poważna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A brzuszek mu pęcznieje…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mimo wszystko nie trzeba mi było pozwolić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To mi nie pomaga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęliśmy mówić o tresowanych zwierzętach, co kto widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, wszystko jedno!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem przed willą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nim ją zabiorą, to Ewa ma za swoje jaki miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ja zrozumiem, to będę musiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale pan tutaj u nas zostanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale słuchali o sobie plotek z praw dziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety o zbyt grubych nogach w kostce wyglądają na plaży całkiem dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było przyjemnie niekonsekwentne, bo postanowił się stąd wyprowadzić ze względu na małą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę na mnie spojrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie pojadą, gdzie cieplej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliła się łaskawie pocałować, patrząc na latarnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypominasz mi lalkę, którą miałam, gdy byłam mała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chodzenie na spacer było jeszcze nudniejsze niż siedzenie w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotowałem Ci niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pauzie bawiono się w zabawę, podczas której kawalerowie wybierali sobie damy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór dębowy połapał się od razu w swym nowym na ziemi stanowisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysz rozpytywał ciekawie o stosunki w cukrowni i w okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to Zuzia nie przychodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo go to obchodziło, ale można było na ten temat rozprawiać długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzięki temu nie patrzymy na to ciało jako na model anatomiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najgroźniejszym jest strach przed czymś nieuchwytnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki miły — podobny do doktora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcemy cię wziąć na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rutyna, panie inspektorze, rutyna zawodowca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj, czy zdołasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile wyszło?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy inwestować więcej w szkolnictwo i edukację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec trawę palcami poczesał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona pokazała język czerwony jak mak i wklęsły jak czółno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba nie pozostaną długo na lądzie, jak sądzisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Król popełnił wobec ciebie niesprawiedliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie przystąpiliśmy dotychczas do właściwej rzeczy, która mnie tu sprowadza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już się tak nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo włada szczęściem wszystkich, nędzą się rozczula.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazwisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Człek i wygodę ma, i rozkurczenie wszelakie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często przerywam wizje, aby zapisywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjął mnie z chmurą na czole i wyrzutem w oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z debaty jasno wynika, że posiadamy wspólny cel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc innymi słowy, dobrowolne i nieodpłatne dawstwo ma bezwzględnie istotne znaczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochrona byłaby wreszcie przystępna cenowo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te słowa wciąż niosą mądre przesłanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi zostać zniesiona blokada Gazy, aby umożliwić obustronny ruch towarom i ludziom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy w grę wchodzi statystyka, zawsze pojawia się wiele dyskusji i niezgody\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła całkowita zmiana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jednak zwrócić uwagę na szkodliwe efekty tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bądźmy praktyczni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to aż tak bardzo istotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obszary prac agencji zazębiają się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzięki dzisiejszemu głosowaniu ten dzień był dobrym dniem dla Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wsparcie dla rozwoju obszarów wiejskich pomoże ograniczyć ubóstwo i ulepszyć infrastrukturę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że Unia Europejska powinna jak najszybciej doprowadzić, sfinalizować to partnerstwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28269795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzi o to, że zbiegły się w czasie dwa wydarzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska zawsze popierała suwerenność i terytorialną integralność Chin, włączając Tybet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja jest świadoma tej sytuacji, co widać w naszych wnioskach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Państwa będą musiały przyjąć zobowiązania na konferencji w Kopenhadze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas, by przywódcy polityczni zastanowili się nad tym, co się dzieje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym zadaniem jest wykorzystanie nowej mechaniki w celu zapewnienia nowej dynamiki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego powodu głosowałam przeciwko przyjęciu sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże zapewnimy, że to, czego chcieli prawodawcy, zostanie osiągnięte w odpowiednim kształcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy je wykorzystać na ochronę środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dane z tej oceny pozwalają nam lepiej uwzględniać ich interesy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja ta wymaga zmiany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wdrożeniu takich środków konsumenci uzyskają większą kontrolę przy zakupie towarów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to sprawi, że rynki lotnicze będą bardziej konkurencyjne i bezpieczniejsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże w ostatnim roku sytuacja w zakresie zatrudnienia i zadłużenia znacząco się pogorszyła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas zapoznać się z faktami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28280074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z kolei większości adwokatów nie powiadomiono o miejscu, w którym odbywały się rozprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprzez wpływ na proces negocjacyjny posłowie mogą należycie wypełniać mandat poselski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich osobiste ataki są oznaką braku argumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To faktycznie częściowo kwestia kompetencji krajowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy do czynienia z europejskim problemem politycznym o strategicznym charakterze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zwycięstwo konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są one chronione przepisami dyrektywy dotyczącej reklamy wprowadzającej w błąd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można odłożyć celów strategii lizbońskiej na okres późniejszy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy w końcu rezolucję w sprawie Ukrainy przyjętą przez Parlament\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeci pakiet energetyczny miał za zadanie służyć klientom przede wszystkim na naszym kontynencie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłby pokaz prawdziwej solidarności, ale niestety tak się nie stało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubolewam, że w związku z konfliktem Grecja rozważa obecnie użycie weta wobec członkowstwa Macedonii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż temu szkodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym pogratulować Tunezyjczykom odwagi i wytrwałości w domaganiu się szans i swobód\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za wyjaśnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28304281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to zatem jedno z najpilniejszych wyzwań Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie lubię przesądnych mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła chwila ponownego wyczekiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko na tematy teoretyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fałszywy to przyjaciel!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Idź po mamę! Była ogromna, biała, ciepło buchało od niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrzył na Emila z wielkim zdziwieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w stadium jednej ze swych słynnych „ucieczek”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do własnej torby ją złowię, jak niegdyś zająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strach przed światłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obok siedzi delegat królów i drzemie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiała czuć dotyk rączki wiolonczeli na policzku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płakał od ósmego roku życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A teraz poślij no kogo, by mi kupił materiału na turban.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klementyna umarła od udaru sercowego, umarła z nadmiaru życia i radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krążę uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak głęboko wpadł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko że ja znacznie ciężej od was!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety postępują tak albo inaczej z miłości do mężczyzn, nigdy z miłości do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komu w drogę, temu czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracował dla agencji, z którą mamy rozmawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To moja tajemnica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne, że wiem, do której szkoły mam iść, na którą ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mądry Polak po szkodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli Twoja dawna szkoła została zlikwidowana, możesz uzyskać zaświadczenie o przebiegu nauczania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy z nas nigdy ich nie stracili\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocham cię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwórz przeglądarkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm — mruknął staruszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy razem udali się do izby opata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech dusza powraca do ciała!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba szukać nowej gospody, póki jeszcze brzuszek pełen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mieliśmy czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymi ojcami byli: wielki pisarz, filozof Joachim i cielesny ojciec Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Eter to kłamca, i to na krótką metę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie od razu postanowiliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bramy ciężko okute.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodzimy w gęsty kolor turkusowy, kałamarnica o bladoniebieskich i bladozielonych światłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słuchał jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona napisała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbrzydnie im to bardzo prędko i całkiem przestaną się mną zajmować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może kto dla kawału puścił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na podwórko już nie wychodzę, tylko czekam, żeby się pauza skończyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz uciekajmy, dopóki zajęte zbieraniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże mam wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W porządku, aktywowałem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy zdawał się nie zwracać nań najmniejszej uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich czasach zdaje się ustawicznie czegoś nasłuchiwać, na coś czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie mam koleżanek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło, robi się ciemno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy umilkli, lecz po chwili rozmowa potoczyła się dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za głośno targowali się z babcią o mycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już! Już! — zakrzyknął Podlasiak i wraz z kulawcem zbliżył się do dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie w tym widzę najpiękniejszy motyw tej historii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uścisnęli się w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna nie będzie trwała długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pytanie jest bezzasadne, proszę pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeśli mi wolno odgrzebać dawne wspomnienia, łączy nas niejaka znajomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz znajdziemy pani telefon, proszę się nie martwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem nalewał wody do wanny i robił okręty z papieru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło tylko o zobaczenie tego, co jest na dnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nas powiadomiono o wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bał się jej, mimo że była naprawdę grzeczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Królu, proszę o turniej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ich nie słyszała naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mam co robić — ciągnęła dalej Mary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym był na środku tamy, nadbiegła druga fala powodzi i rozstrzaskała się o belkowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna powtórzyła: — Wejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez pracy nie ma kołaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to z pewnością tylko szczur lub coś podobnego pod podłogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem położył się i patrzył uporczywie w sufit, przez który było widać gwiazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domagali się od niego, by im wyjaśnił, co mają czynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To co, do zobaczenia za miesiąc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi oto w oknie wagonu, uśmiechnięta, szczęśliwa, młoda mężatka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę wielki gmach z czerwonej cegły, zwrócony do mnie kantem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to zenit, po którym nie spodziewał się już żadnych niespodzianek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płakał od ósmego roku życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrozumiesz w toku akcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie rozmawialiśmy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie nauczyli się zabijać swój czas, to znaczy zabijać życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyzywał wszędzie na turniej królewskich pieśniarzy i zawsze odnosił zwycięstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona nie weszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znaleźli duży balon sylwestrowy na środku pustej jezdni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co pani zamówi? — zapytał, gdy przyszedł kelner.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego na ten punkt zwracam największą uwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła przez zęby, bo trzymała między nimi szpilki do włosów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robi pan same gwiazdy, pointy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówili o głupstwach, ale on pomyślał, że będzie z nią bardzo trudna historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrodziła się ciekawość poznania, z kim się właściwie miało do czynienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu była granica panowania Amora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem kłótnie, przypominające sceny małżeńskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedł szybko przez Verne’a i Maya do powieści kryminalnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sumie to nie wiem na ile to naprawdę Google.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to jak starzy przyjaciele, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie warto się tedy sprzeczać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona klęka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotąd jeszcze, po rocznej przerwie, było w tym śmiechu coś poobiedniego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałaś moich skarpetek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzenia obecnych skrzyżowały się na purpurowych wargach dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosłownie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pana dane będą przetwarzane w celu realizacji wybranych usług cyfrowych dostępnych w serwisie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generał zaś był bez czapki, palił papierosy i patrzył w ogień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Damian zauważył, że biegnie sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ten nosek, co się do góry zadzierał, był taki śmieszny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały myślał, że to z powodu niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, jakże się jasnemu panu wędrowało w powietrzu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już po tym postępku od razu poznałbym Francuza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego włóczysz się koło tego domu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce znów żeglowaliśmy gondolą po lagunie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Roboty chyba nie brak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale, nie, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niżej, w ciemności, są parki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pietrek na folwarku… — martwiła się panna Karolina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem okiem na wstążkę napisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dni rozłąki jakże gorzkie, jakie złe są!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa nie miała trzech duchowych ojców ani biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mów, czego żądasz, a wszystko damy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz posępnie słodką pochyliła ku ziemi, w palcach przesuwała korale różańca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maksimum osiągnąłem jako uczeń ósmej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysiedliśmy i przekroczywszy bramę opactwa oo. Franciszkanów, weszliśmy w krużganek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tejże chwili stanął nad powierzchnią wysoki słup wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo woli rodziło się podejrzenie, czy puchar nie zawiera trucizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętam obawy z tym związane, ale i doświadczenie zebrane przy tworzeniu gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ze śniegiem wolno robić, co się chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz była to noc nieprzyjemna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech no pani pozwoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy będę pół bogiem, pół czarnoksiężniczkiem, aby mieszać, lepić i rozpalać ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chmury są wyjątkowo piękne przed zachodem słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarli się o siebie milczą co policzkami i Emil poczuł bardzo lekki zapach perfum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęliśmy się spuszczać z góry…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropny uścisk nie zelżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem położył ołówek i papier przed sobą, co nie było jego zwyczajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim prosto, przy tym szczerze, no i co najważniejsza — przyjaźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bartek odszedł ze swymi wilkami — wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę, abym mógł zapomnieć o tem, co usłyszałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi, że musimy przerwać tę miłą rozmowę, ale przyjdziesz jeszcze kiedy, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Choćby tak i było, widzisz przecież, jak jest chory!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko nie upadać na duchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyświadcz mi pan teraz małą usługę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziewiąta trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdumiewającymi były też nasze apetyty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co uczyniwszy uczuł ulgę i ze swobodniejszym umysłem wracał do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22546347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjawił się przed nimi, jako wódz całej karawany, zbrojnej w broń europejską, ze słoniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak przynajmniej mówili niektórzy mądrzy ludzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy przyszedłem do siebie, udałem się natychmiast w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdzie ich widać nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwałem się z kolan i spojrzałem na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem o organizacji tego „Uśmiechniętego“ i miałem tutaj przed sobą praktyczny jej przykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże chętnie byłbym poczekał, aby przyjąć życzenia tych wspaniałomyślnych przeciwników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nikt nie żądał ode mnie słowa honoru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ej no, wystraszylaś kiciusia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymałem się w jej pobliżu i szedłem za jej biegiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skręciłem na ścieżkę, prowadzącą do skraju lasu i pobiegłem szybko do starego świerka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już od dwóch dni staram się o danie mu umówionego sygnału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tem szerokiem polu nie mogli rozpoznać, w którym kierunku się zwróciłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj skoczyli do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieliśmy rozmaite ostrzeżenia, że na nie może być zrobiony zamach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem każde słowo z ich rozmowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezarek wykonał swe postanowienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie nadeszła chwila najwyższego triumfu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to już było ich rzeczą, nie moją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie denerwuj mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale z ciebie dzidzia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chce ktoś grzanki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabawy - zresztą niewinne - łazęgostwo i urwisostwo, pochłonęły go jak jakiś żywioł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22719731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieszczęście chciało, że tejże nocy zwaliła się do mieszkania rewizja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oblałbym go wrzącą oliwą — powiedział Zbigniew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słabo mi się robi na widok krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjadł śniadanie i puścił się w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Marcinku, trzeba na lekcji uważać — upomina pani łagodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszło pół roty wojska, otoczyło dwór i zabudowania i zrewidowano wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdziwiło go to zbytnio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki wyciągnął z torby kubek blaszany, obejrzał go starannie i schował z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różne rodzaje ciemności, poprze- rzynane błyskawicami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idę do domu, możesz mnie odprowadzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach, tak — mówił swobodnie, jak gdyby nigdy nic — awansowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napastnicy, pobici i odparci, uciekli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, w piosenkę… żeby mieć cię blisko ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten drugi pojechał na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Rynku będzie można odwiedzić stragany z najróżniejszymi wyrobami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął czarować, żeby choć odwrócić role.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niech i tak będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zrobił w ścianie dziurę gwoździem na znak tego zdarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dać mu za żonę najpiękniejszą pannę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykra to była przygoda z pomylonym panem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjawy stają się coraz bardziej nieprzyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki jest twój ulubiony film?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieszczęścia chodzą parami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek nawet się wyspać nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powiem, bo nie chcę, żeby mieli przykrości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz siną pręgę na twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęście, że byl park, przez który ona musiała przejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To proszę cię, powiedz mi, że się przeprosiłaś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręciła się przed kliniką, jak dzikie zwierzę, uwiązane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było nam śpieszno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieśni poety były na ustach wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwie usiadł, ledwo pani weszła, nowe nieszczęście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do nieba go zaniosło! — odparł kulawiec, palcem niebo wskazując.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I powiedział: — Mała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkańcy przyzwyczaili się już do ścisku, złego dojazdu do cmentarza oraz korków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił na wszelki wypadek czekać podczas wszystkich pauz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, są silni awanturnicy, którzy szukają zaczepki ze słabszym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież takie były miękkie, jedwabiste, taki miały żywy połysk!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech sama wedle chęci wargami rozporządza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to są wszystko dzieciństwa, najdroższa — uspokajałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecie pies też boskie stworzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów, Tereso, w dziewczynę się zmień!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora źrenice miałem rozszerzone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cudowna celowość natury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że jest rozpięty w oczekiwaniu, jak motyl pomiędzy szpilkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stół Emila: maszyna do pisania, bałagan, papiery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadłeś jakiś podwieczorek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za świństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ty byłeś raczej predestynowany do mojej roli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekund kilka — jak wiek długich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc to prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozsunęli się nieco, ustąpili i Cezary znalazł wolne miejsce na ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był poza tym w najwyższym stopniu wstrętny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc mi powiedz to słowo jedyne: czy kochasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane w ten sposób, żeby on myślał inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miarę możności powinno ono rosnąć pod ochroną i odpowiedzialnością rodziców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończyła pierwszy rok chemii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na rozstaju wszystko powie! — oświadczył w imieniu dziwożony Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym momencie zauważył, jak Ewa rusza wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrzyła, lekko podnosząc brwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożar nie jest nawet zabawą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za bajeczne okładki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całą pewnością zarządzono za nami pościg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I gniewa się, że się pomyliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprawdę, za rok jeden takiego szczęścia warto było oddać resztę życia…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś ludzie mówili gwarą, nie tak jak teraz mówimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co mi to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzech! — odpowiedział kulawiec, ukazując bez potrzeby zresztą trzy palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz pendrive'a, którego ci dałem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety postępują tak albo inaczej z miłości do mężczyzn, nigdy z miłości do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem gotowy do pomocy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia skrzydełka, łebkiem śmiesznie kręci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnemu we wszystkim ładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię bardzo obserwować go w godzinach porannych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On miał amerykański akcent, a Anna miała australijski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hańba okrywa was, Rosjan, a wy tego nie możecie zrozumieć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam o jakimś horrorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są uprzejmi nawet wobec mnie: to jest najgorsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli się uda, będę od razu najsławniejszym adwokatem na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Malinowe? Skinęła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuśćmy, że wsiadłem w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrwał dwie kartki z zeszytu i pisał: „Postanawiam dużo o sobie wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My tutaj byliśmy i jesteśmy na tym punkcie ułomni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem razem z nimi przeglądać ten tomik jako pamiętnik szczęśliwie przebytego koszmarnego okresu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż „strach na wróble” jeszcze nie wstał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniejsza o to!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż takiego zaszło między wami? — zapytałem, nie zdradzając swych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się tak, aby to mogło na wszelki wypadek wszystko oznaczać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze mną jest tak samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomacał dziurkę ręką, palcami poszerzył\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może się nauczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz dopiero jednoręki zoczył uchodzącą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jest nas pięciu, panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież to idziesz sama i w tak zawalanym ubraniu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwo skończyła mówić, do pokoju weszła Amelia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina ósma czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaskoczona tym pytaniem, opuściła nagle ramiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Są jakieś napisy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic nie znaczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak się nazywał twój ojciec?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pies nagle podejrzliwie nasrożył uszy. Zwolnił bieg w czujny krok, potem w baczny poślizg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była nim przepełniona, rozlewało się poza nią, było dobre i szalone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym niebywałą zaletę tego świetnego gracza, stanowiła jego błyskawiczna szybkość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy to, co jest teraz grą, stanie się nieodwołalnie naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy to obgadać przy browarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz postawił twardo szklankę na stole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20871460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takim sobie zwykłym grzebieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20872162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I chociaż nie wprawiona, wcale się nie dławi...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20872163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak sądzę, dziewczyna poszła na przechadzkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20872164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nim szumiała wielka woda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20872165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20872166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tedy stałby się po prostu panem położenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bosych nogach miał pantofle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poślubił Zofię Radomicką, córkę Kazimierza Władysława Radomickiego, kasztelana kaliskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mnie nie poznajesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest, zdaje się, jasne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Emil oparł się o poduszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polacy lubią robić awantury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt się nie sprzeciwiał temu zdaniu proroczemu Jegomości w białej kamizelce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rząd egipski i Anglicy ją taili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, po co miałby zostawiać ślady?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żonę na bok odrzucił niby sprzęt zużyty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed oczyma zaczęły mu latać czerwone plamy, a w szczękach do znał przeraźliwego bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Początkowo był katedrą Bytomskiego Seminarium Nauczycielskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety nie mogę potwierdzić bezpośrednio, ale podoba mi się jak pan kombinuje w śledztwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usprawnienie przepływów informacyjnych przy rejestracji Kontrahentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możliwość wykorzystania gotowych plików muzycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziesiąta trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nel dyszała, jak ptak, więc Staś oddał jej gumową flaszkę i krzyknąwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes podszedł do biurka i wylał z każdej flaszeczki nieco atramentu na bibułkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20911356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świadectwo z czerwonym paskiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noel przerwał kłopotliwe milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podwiezie mnie pan pod moje mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przyznałaby się do tego za Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widna noc, rozjaśniona świeżo spadłym śniegiem, ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się odwlecze to nie uciecze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęła się bardzo dobrze uczyć, i to uczyć całymi wie czorami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i Wojtek nic a nic nie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi, syn krawca — dziewięcioro małych dzieci — bieda wielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to? — zawołał, wskazując na trawę o kilka kroków od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę umrzeć, leżąc na tobie, tak, właśnie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz w górze, raz w dole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Panie skrzydlaty, uważaj na przeciąg!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płakał, nie kręcił się, nie przeszkadzał, tylko był bardzo smutny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten przełącznik wydaje się być już włączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jakże mi brak tu zieleni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płacząc i rycząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa zbladła, widział ją, siedziała w pierwszej ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym kapitanem i gospodarzem był dyrektor różnych towarzystw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostęp ze wszystkich stron odcięty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może zawrócę, a może nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolina chodziła rankiem po tych alejach i odnalazła ślady kopyt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ile lat kończysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadzwoń na sto dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoby odpowiedzialne za wychowanie dziecka i kierowanie nim powinny mieć na względzie jego dobro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo na pewno mi go wziąć nie pozwolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szepty zapełniły mały park.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy raz jestem na żaglówce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina Małej Łąki w Tatrach w zimie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mary słuchała jak zahipnotyzowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warszawa jest pięknym miastem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milcząc, odwinął rękawy, aż do łokci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu przestałaś mnie kochać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego duma nie pozwalała na to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym w niektórych miejscach akompaniament o tyle tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno widzę się z uśmiechem na twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki i kulawiec ze czcią na ów sęk teraz spojrzeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja w ogóle nie wiem, co on robi, jak żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba wycierpieć i coś stracić, żeby zyskać więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz uciekajmy, dopóki zajęte zbieraniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarne źrenice, czarne długie rzęsy, oczy spokojne, utkwione we mnie bez drgnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż jest wyższego ponad słowo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś ze mną na rybackim bacie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oblicze stare, przeorane siecią fałd i zagłębień, jakby dwoiło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co? — Idź, przyprowadź mamę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myślałem nawet, czy są naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W taką pogodę nawet pies z kulawą nogą nie chciałby wyjść na dwór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom z lukami, marokański trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zależy od nastawienia z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na autostradzie utworzył się długi korek, przez co wiele osób spóźniło się do pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w rozpaczy i zdawało mu się, że spadnie na ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł się i pocałował ją w usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadłeś jakiś podwieczorek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może jest to strach o własny portfel, jak niektórzy próbują zauważyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo jej mama kazała w gnieździe posprzątać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na gwiazdkę postanowiłem sobie sprawić smartwatcha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smutny, ale spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówisz dobrze po francusku, więc możesz pomagać w nauce młodszym dziewczynkom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ku niemiłemu zdumieniu zauważył, że nie jest sam: miał towarzysza podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się nie ma co się lubi, to się lubi co się ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecał, że będzie przysyłał pieniądze co miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, jak długo jeszcze zdołam w pobok was przebywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ozwij się, ozwij! — powtórzył z kolei Podlasiak, tym samym słowom nadając odcień modlitewny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś dotknął lekko mego ramienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z góry obiecuję spełnić wszystko co do joty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fredek zwisał jak worek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jednak zawsze już bliżej końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to miałoby u niej wywołać objawy chorobliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kształtowała swoją przyszłość, która była zwinięta w niej, jak sprężyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się boi, jest bity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obronić się przed straszną koalicją wrogów — otóż pierwsza idea.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie stwierdzono ani śladu czegoś podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda chwila zużyta, wyciśnięta, wyssana do ostatniej kropli rozkoszy ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc wojna nareszcie się skończy?! — zawołałem głośno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu zaświtał przed nami wylot sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy powitaniu wyczytałem w jej oczach utajoną obawę i niepewność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieważne, na ja kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzekam, że nie ruszę się z tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko są uczonymi albo wielkimi artystami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To rzekłszy, odwróciła się i wybiegła z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ty wyjdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście ostatnio trochę więcej czasu spędzałem w pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolka robiła właśnie kluski na stolnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan naczelnik — podkreślił z przekąsem — żartuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja je lubię i one mnie lubią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem wegetarianinem, ale nie jem mięsa codziennie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś jak pięknie kwitną wiśnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To licho małe jak igła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20810391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gram pierwszy temat zupełnie po pijacku, zupełnie zataczając się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę, nie mogę! — zawołała dziwożona, tuląc do piersi obydwie dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął czarować, żeby choć odwrócić role.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przydałby się tu jakiś wybieg dla psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączyłem dziesięć przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawe, co z tego wyniknie!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy razy na dzień byłem świadkiem ceremoniału ablucji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja jestem sentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę zawiązać listy w ceratę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza twa należy do nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak minęła w milczeniu długa chwila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że jestem cholerykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Klęknę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy pływały jak lilie na wodzie i drgały lekko; niebo było jak jezioro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z prawdziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O czym ty myślałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten drugi — to Stanisław Krzemiński.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To on! — zaświtała myśl pewna jak oczywistość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy się rozdzielić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są narody czyste i są brudne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwał i oczyma wzniesionymi ku sklepieniu śledził ruch dymów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głupio się stało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczeństwo zbliżało się szybko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wbrew zakazowi usiadłem na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzą na młodego króla, on nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, jak łatwo zgubić śpiew swój w czarnym lesie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny demon: świadome chcenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może kto dla kawału puścił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielkie radości i wielkie smutki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona myśli: — Wieś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut później pożegnaliśmy się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz piosenka mi została z ciebie dziś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi z kolei kulawiec zauważył wszystko, co się stało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na każde pytanie jedno tylko powtarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ci zależało na tych studiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokarm wchodzi w nas, gdy jemy, i sprawia to nam przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak urośniecie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale muszę się uczesać i zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale się wstydzę przeprosić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posadził ją na kolanach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie jestem? — usłyszałem pytanie, rzucone między marmurowe trzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tysiąc razy lepszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę — tłumaczyłem się niezgrabnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie kobiety: jeden świat dla mężczyzn, drugi dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trąciła mnie wachlarzem w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bramy ciężko okute.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Symbole siedmiu planet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak długo nie wracają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie warto się tedy sprzeczać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był sam; nikt nie przerywał sennego dumania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pożegnanie wręczyła mu swoją gabinetową fotografię, zdjętą przed paru dniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nachyliłem się i pocałowałem, a on oczy przymrużył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebo od samego rana już pokrywały chmury, a około dziesiątej zaczął padać silny deszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ci zależało na tych studiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież ty mieszkasz we „Florydzie”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to stany poprzedzające omdlenie spowodowane nadmiarem narkotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszał, jak szła po schodach, jak otwierała drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pomieszczeniu rozległ się lekki pomruk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapach bije spod podłogi, bo to jest szczytowa ściana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i nie chce się przywitać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W weekend majowy pojechałem w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale się wstydzę przeprosić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucać im przeznaczenia, których treścią byłby czysty przypadek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój kolega lubi grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z sonatą B-mol męczę się potwornie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te rozmowy, urwane w środku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wepchnął mocniej i złamała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce za szybą i grysik, którym go karmiła służąca Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego z przodu idzie dwóch, a z tyłu czterech?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę, jak czas przepływa za plecami, jak gdybym leżał nad brzegiem rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie odczuwam na razie żadnego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nadzwyczaj dziwny list.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem jeszcze w stanie tego zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona była wściekła i zmęczona poznawaniem tylu ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczegóż nie teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy razy na dzień byłem świadkiem ceremoniału ablucji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracała do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład ten «Rocznik psychologiczny» i rozprawa Szumana o peyotlu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Planowaliśmy w trójkę pojechać w Bieszczady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nie ma w głowie człowieczków, ale czy nie wszystko jedno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robotnicy ogłosili strajk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem długo jak wryty, nie mogąc uczynić kroku naprzód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech sama wedle chęci wargami rozporządza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rozpusta umysłowa jest potrzebna, aby wyładować irracjonalne części naszego intelektu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo tak tu czekacie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ramach programu rozwoju bibliotek zakwalifikowaliśmy się do tego projektu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wziął pocisk do ręki, wydał mu się on strasznie ciężki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kanapa, jeśli nie skakać, przetrwa dziesiątki lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip nie miał nawet czasu zamachnąć się pałką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze mną jest tak samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłam na ulicy kotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to tzw. w magii „powrotne uderzenie”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrwał dwie kartki z zeszytu i pisał: „Postanawiam dużo o sobie wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że dał się nabrać, że wygłupia się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście są choroby, na które nie ma ratunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła, mimo że nie zależało jej na nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem w klasie, gdzie są okna, wiedziałem, że tylko do dzwonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał wówczas i wyszedł z izby, nie mówiąc ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba przestanę jej słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyć to jest prawie zawsze „żyć”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał i wyszedł z pokoju, omijając Elę szerokim lukiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem kłótnie, przypominające sceny małżeńskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem pomału ściągnął rękawiczkę i wyszedł, chwiejąc się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak urośniecie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, jak łatwo zgubić śpiew swój w czarnym lesie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem na jednej z ławek i utonąłem w zadumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jej dotknąć, podobnie jak lubię dotykać małe koty i psy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieję wszędzie i nigdzie, zawsze i nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karykaturalne typy męskie w kostiumach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaraz, zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje mi się, że nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął ją pod rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachował dużo cech dziecinnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zatrzymuje się na stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to się nazywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochylone są ku ziemi te kształty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego zdania są napięte jak łuki, jak pupa młodej dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od początku widzimy, że z listonoszem coś jest nie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wcale nie wiedziałem, że mam serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myślałem nawet, czy są naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i powiedział, że nie chce widzieć tego kretyna, dyrektora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przeważa się obojętnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gęsiej skórki wywołanej imponującym wstępem nie można filmowi odmówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jestem byle kto — sucho mówił Ben.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż jest wyższego ponad słowo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem wtedy jak nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odeszła, cofając się wolno, tyłem, jak teatralny paź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotował się kretyn do tej nocy bohaterskiej jak toreador.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięciu warty z jednej strony, pięciu z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu przestałaś mnie kochać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan normalny, tylko lekkie ogłupienie i dezorientacja w przestrzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wiesz, że zmieniłaś się? — Wiem o tym dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie, rozpatrujecie nadal pewne bardzo ważne wnioski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"właśnie zostały zawarte porozumienia z czterema producentami wyrobów tytoniowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pewnością ta sesja miesięczna posiada wielkie znaczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kosowo, który dotyka takie istotne zasady, jak stabilność granic w całej Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotne jest uwzględnienie specyfiki zarówno wschodnich, jak i południowych krajów partnerskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"po co Parlament Europejski ma w ogóle debatować nad tym sprawozdaniem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama z Krzysiem włożyli sianko pod obrus.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio Komisja opublikowała szóste sprawozdanie na temat poważnych naruszeń zasad wspólnej polityki rybołówstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że rezultaty takiego projektu pilotażowego będą bardzo przydatne dla innych regionów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to całej debaty na temat ustalenia ram prawnych, regulacji i innych ambitnych planów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dialog jest kluczem do tolerancji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tylu głosach, raczej polskich głosach, mam tylko dwie uwagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jedyny sposób, aby uniknąć coraz większej izolacji Białorusi i jej obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Solidarność jest szczególnie potrzebna, gdy ktoś ma kłopoty, gdy jest w potrzebie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę, aby Europejczycy mieli dostęp do medycyny na najwyższym poziomie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdziwa perspektywa finansowa musi znacznie wykraczać poza okres siedmioletni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jak i dlaczego do tego doszło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W obecnej debacie należy podkreślić trzy aspekty wynikające z trzech zagadnień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ulega wątpliwości, że energia stała się prawdziwą bronią we współczesnych negocjacjach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj otrzymałem telefon od trzech osób znajdujących się w tej sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę pozwolić, że w drodze wyjątku pozwolę sobie na osobistą uwagę wstępną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedstawiłam jednak również szereg zaleceń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ważne dla całej Europy, a w szczególności dla Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawy jest tytuł omawianego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgłoszono następujące pytania do Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"uczyń mnie czystym, ale jeszcze nie teraz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy również stale kształcić w tej dziedzinie specjalistów od dydaktyki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspólnie mamy jedną piątą światowego handlu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie z tego względu nasza grupa odmawia uczestnictwa w głosowaniu nad przyjęciem przedmiotowej rezolucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli wyjadą do innego kraju, będą mogły uzyskać lepiej ukierunkowaną opiekę o lepszej jakości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że osiągnęliśmy zadowalający wynik\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powinniśmy pozwalać na bezkarność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego ludzie naprawdę chcą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To czwarta kobieta powieszona tam w ciągu minionego miesiąca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też będziemy głosować za nim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej jednak kwestii musimy jasno stwierdzić, że nie powinniśmy tu uprawiać partyjnej polityki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyskusja na forum publicznym zbyt często skupia się na niepożądanych skutkach globalizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Solidarność musi przeważyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"a mianowicie, że mają do czynienia z hitlerowskim pozdrowieniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dalszego wykorzystywania energii odnawialnych i poprawy wydajności energetycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32259767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Winston Churchill nauczył nas, że odwaga jest tym, co potrzebne, aby wstać i przemówić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33876502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecność perspektyw finansowych umożliwiła realizację programów Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33876503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezależnie od tego, o którym z dwóch błędnych pojęć mówimy, musimy wyzbyć się obu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33876504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma wolnej prasy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33876505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę potrzebujemy większej obecności Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33876506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starajmy się tego uniknąć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wykrzyknąłem po dwukrotnym przeczytaniu tego niezwykłego anonsu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie wzrok człowieka, który trzymał latarkę, padł na puhar z winem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment, zajrzę w szufladę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dziwiłem się już niczemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle z marzeń mych wyrwało mnie zachowanie się mego towarzysza podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawka była wysoka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skierowano ją do robót publicznych w porcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwaga zaczęła mnie opuszczać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszny krzyk przedarł się do nas z lasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak rycerscy wrogowie postępują między sobą w wojnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obowiązek i honor powołują mię w szeregi dawnych towarzyszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiało więc być coś poza domem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest prawda, jak w ewangelii, bo z początku byłem cieślą okrętowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za szczególne stworzenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez chwili wahania zabrałem się do roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego się wszystko zaczęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepszy wróbel w garści, niż kanarek na dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ja, nie, on powiedział, iż szlachetne zwierzę wymaga także szlachetnego jeźdźca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pan może myśli, że nie wiem, kim jesteś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak przepiękna melodia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż miałem począć w takich okolicznościach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praktyka moja nigdy mnie zbytnio nie absorbuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lodówkę się zamyka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten potrafi więcej, niż jeść zupę łyżką!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znasz może jakąś dobrą restaurację?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie ustawałem ani na chwilę, dodawałem sobie odwagi i pędziłem dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy obydwaj milczeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko lis biegł jeszcze przede mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważył mię także i krzyknął czym nie ranny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok ten wprawił mnie początkowo w takie osłupienie, iż skamieniałem prawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybaczcie mi panowie, ale starość ma zawsze swoje słabostki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie był wcale nieboszczykiem, gdy go chowaliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im dalej posuwaliśmy się w góry, tem surowszą i dzikszą stawała się droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie rany, sierżancie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mi się zdaje, że to raczej nie teges.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam się zbadaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba mówił, że Android jest dla biedaków?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawało mi więc dokładne zastanowienie się nad pierwszą częścią wyprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiałeś sam zauważyć, jak one były wytarte, pomięte i poplamione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokąd się wybierasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po śmierci matki o ojcu przestał już myśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Też coś?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję już, jak ono mnie ogarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22732719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamo, pralka się zepsuła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22930362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22930363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapoznali się i odtąd szli już razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22930364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjmuj bilet, widzę kanara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bał się, że nad ranem, po burzy, zrobi się chłodno, jak bywało poprzednich nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nietyle wysiłkiem fizycznym, ile natężeniem umysłu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drodze szedł odgłos kopyt i szczęk stali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O dziadkach wiem mało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Wyślij mnie, dokąd chcesz!”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta pierwsza czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opis straconego dnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"albo coś podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Kiedy to zawalił się kamienny most?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W podwórzu było już zupełnie ciemno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może dzwonił sam generał, ale zauważyłem, że ręce jego martwo zwisały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wsuwa się pod kołnierz marynarskiego ubranka i zasypia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25744966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem doprawdy, co mam począć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kucharka? — Ma dziś wychodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Ziewnął w końcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem innego pomieszczenia, ale słyszę, że tam będzie czysto i wygodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godzinę będzie Maciuś rysował, bo mu to bardzo potrzebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praca nie była tak ciężka, by jej nie potrafił dokonać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak było i ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy teraz... czy teraz nie prowadzisz także gry podwójnej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynajmę to mieszkanie za ustaloną kwotę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami wiecie, jak mało promieni słonecznych pada na ciemne uliczki Pragi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nel po dwu lub trzech przejażdżkach, zapewniała, że nie ma nic rozkoszniejszego na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbujmy jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klnę się na Boga, iż byłem bardzo zadowolony, wydostawszy się z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzcie go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarła zapałkę i przytknęła ją do pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem się rozglądać na wszystkie strony, jak tylko oko sięgało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rywale obrzucali się wzajemnie ostrymi kamieniami, podobnymi do brył węgla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanuciła przekornie słowa tej piosenki:\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszym miesiącem roku jest styczeń, a ostatnim grudzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dwaj przyjaciele po raz ostatni uścisnąwszy dłonie, rozłączyli się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, oficerowie, zamieszkiwaliśmy osobne skrzydło i tworzyliśmy szczególny ludek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle usłyszałem kroki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oczach jej czytałem, iż zapomniała, że tu jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli oni dadzą ognia, Watsonie, to nie wahaj się i pal do nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam tylko wie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież jestem niewinny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciwem spojrzeniem ogarnęliśmy w mgłach stojące zbocza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwaga zaczęła mnie opuszczać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale chciałem zobaczyć, co się z tobą dzieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nogi się uginają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie trać czasu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, jak biła dwunasta, gdy jeszcze trzymałem ją w ramionach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciał o niem ze mną mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bierz kapelusz i chodźmy na miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25745689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mógłby cię przecież strasznie pokaleczyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo szczepień w niektórych krajach eksport został całkowicie wstrzymany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wznowienie izraelsko-palestyńskich negocjacji przez większą część roku było uzależnione od kwestii osiedli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy, że w przypadku tej choroby wczesna diagnoza zwiększy szanse na wyleczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klęski to oczywiście konsekwencja globalnego ocieplenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem takie wypowiedzi nie są ani uczciwe, ani właściwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobił to nocą, zrobił to, kiedy spała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję Panu oraz komisarzowi Almuni za współpracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnym punktem posiedzenia jest debata łączna nad\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym osiągnięcie porozumienia, co do tekstu kompromisowego jest istotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotychczasowe rozmowy to za mało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kontrowersyjna jest kwestia powołania krajowych ośrodków referencyjnych, które miałyby być powołane na szczeblu krajowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, nie poruszam tego tematu po raz pierwszy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to dziecinne i niegodne dla założycielskiej ojcowskiej europejskiej wizji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że to też jest bardzo pilna sprawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki obraz naszych rolników mają w oczach zwolennicy tej dyrektywy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On chyba to źle zrozumiał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie zacytuję słowa poety\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo swoich wad, komisja tymczasowa była odpowiednim sposobem rozpatrzenia zagadnienia horyzontalnego, takiego jak to\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi, ale jeśli o mnie chodzi, nie ufam metodom stosowanym przez władze amerykańskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to droga trudna, lecz właściwa dla obydwu stron tworzących Europę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy z wyborów prezydenckich z ostatniego roku, że wciąż jest sporo do poprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie pisały o tym, że mieszkańcy Rodezji głodują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spełniła ona wszystkie wymogi związane z dorobkiem Schengen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz nareszcie zaczynamy to dostrzegać i doceniać, mówiąc naszym obywatelom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rynki nie funkcjonują bez pomocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie jednej trzeciej wszystkich chorób nowotworowych można zapobiec\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nastąpi to możliwie szybko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłoby więc dobrze, gdyby Komisja uwzględniła w swoim komunikacie również te aspekty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Recesja gospodarcza sprowokowała socjalistów do pokazania w końcu prawdziwego oblicza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza to również solidne wsparcie w celu tworzenia społeczeństwa obywatelskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sektor finansowy nie ma możliwości powrotu do czasów sprzed kryzysu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadajemy pytania, a odpowiedź brzmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przypadku wykrycia jakichkolwiek anomalii zostaną podjęte odpowiednie kroki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby rzeczywiście wprowadzono system w tym kształcie, to mielibyśmy falę bankructw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prosił natomiast i prosi o wsparcie polityczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No cóż, jednym z rozważanych środków jest nałożenie sankcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, my w Unii Europejskiej musimy wykazać się solidarnością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety nie mają równych szans na sukces w przemyśle o wysokiej wartości dodanej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyskryminowane są także rodziny wielodzietne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popieram tę decyzję, ponieważ dalsza pomoc będzie niezbędna w celu zapewnienia bezpiecznego demontażu reaktorów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kryzys finansowy uwypuklił fakt, że w tej branży występują trzy problemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że plan ten jest dobrym narzędziem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto będzie finansował to działanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pełni rozumiem pani słowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostosowaliśmy się już częściowo, ale mamy jeszcze trochę do zrobienia w tym zakresie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma sensu podejmować dziś w pośpiechu żadnych decyzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32380052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś odwiedził nas węgierski premier, który przejął prezydencję Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszał ją płaczącą i zamilkł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjął sukmanę, porwał miotłę i zaczął robić porządek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chcecie, to was znów niezadługo odwiedzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochmistrzyni ruszyła ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciej puścił Dolę i szedł obok niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nim jednak mogłem zasnąć, przewracałem się z boku na bok...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głębi domu wszczął się ruch, zamknęły się gdzieś z trzaskiem drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Królewna była spokojną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na drugi dzień morze wyrzuciło na brzeg szczątki rozbitej łodzi Piotra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pytałem tylko w interesie naszej klientki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech Smoka i wycie zwierząt ścigały ją czas długi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszczanie rozstępowali się z szacunkiem na obie strony, dając przejście jakiemuś wspaniałemu orszakowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staszek podziękował i w kierunku wskazanym poszedł do dworu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy już czas, aby z tem skończyć“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazałem mu podać kawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nie mylili się, jak skutek okazał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo wesela i dostatku, Maryś prawie żałowała swojego dworku i ogródka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes siedział całkiem nieruchomo przy kominku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz wiem, że tak nie jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie opuszczę cię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staszek wzruszony nic mówić nie mógł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeka więc, żebym mu rzucił tę kulę, gdyż bardzo potrzebuje żelaza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Junak bez bojaźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staszek porwał się z ławy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawało tylko odlać dzwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zafrasowany chodził marszałek po izbie radzieckiej w ratuszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybity był, upokorzony i jak najnieszczęśliwszy tłumił w sobie łkanie i jęki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybiegł król z komnaty i czule witać począł cudownie ocaloną córę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naraz… krzew rozmarynowy rozchylił swe gałęzie i wyszła z niego przecudnej urody dziewica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie namyślając się długo, rzuciły się na biedne dziewczę i poczęły je bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem lubię książki i chętnie wśród nich przebywam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21463910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nierychło kobieta w ręce plasnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszedł i sołtys.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie miałem jeszcze jeden sposób sprawdzenia mego rachunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, jeżeliby to był on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą postanowienie moje jest niezłomne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trumnie leżał trup człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes wszelako, biorąc jeńca naszego za słowo, rozwiązał ręcznik, którym związaliśmy mu stopy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O Stachu nie było wieści i na pozór zapomniano o nim nawet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaszła w nim jakaś nieuchwytna zmiana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiodła do tego tylko jedna droga i tę wybrałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez trzy dni i trzy noce nie zaznał snu, ani odpoczynku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile go znam jednak, człowiek zupełnie przyzwoity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było śladów walki, nie miała też ofiara broni, którą mogłaby zranić napastnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Królowej urodziło się nie dzieciątko, lecz… krzak rozmarynowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21464234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy i tak dosyć kłopotów, bez kobiet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodząc do sprawy, którą chciałam poruszyć, jak rozumiem sprawa jest jeszcze w toku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba dostarczać informacji, prowadzić debatę i rozmowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy wyraźnego zobowiązania Rady i Komisji do bezzwłocznego przedłożenia projektów stosownych przepisów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadanie temu postępowaniu charakteru rutyny jest już zbrodnią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mojej partii rzeczą dość niespotykaną był wówczas sprzeciw wobec niej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tu leży problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawiły się śmigłowce wojskowe, żeby usunąć ciężkie fragmenty gruzu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowania imienne zwiększają odpowiedzialność posłów względem obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy być w stanie przekonać innych, aby byli tak samo ambitni jak my\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budżet kolegium jest ustalany corocznie przez organy budżetowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdawca słusznie zauważa, że konwencjonalne źródła energii pozostaną nieodzowne przez kilka najbliższych dekad\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy może wskazać ramy czasowe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem za przyjęciem przedmiotowego ważnego dokumentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27961992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Węgry zasługują na nasze uznanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzi jednak nie tylko o formę, lecz również o treść\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to problemy społeczno-gospodarcze na szczeblu europejskim, które wykraczają poza granice krajowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kraj ten nie potrzebuje kolejnego dyktatora, ale przywrócenia demokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy poważny problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma Pan w parlamencie większość dwóch trzecich i jest to większość prawowita\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Alarm ten oceniam jednak jako fałszywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Regulacje w strefie euro nie były w przeszłości przeprowadzane wystarczająco sprawnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojednanie jest niemalże niewyobrażalne, jeśli nie zostanie wprowadzony nowy porządek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym głosowaliśmy przeciwko całemu sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego nasz Parlament powinien domagać się nałożenia na Iran sankcji finansowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rolach oprawców wystąpili nieumundurowani funkcjonariusze miejscowej policji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to z pewnością ważny czynnik, pozwalający rzeczywiście ocenić znaczenie tego środka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz pozostaje tylko ją wdrożyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następną pozycją porządku obrad jest głosowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakkolwiek by nie było, wydarzenia w Birmie przyjmują nieoczekiwany obrót\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można opisać tego zarzutu innymi słowami niż hańba\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezbędna jest wczesna diagnoza, niezbędna jest specjalistyczna opieka i szkolenie opiekunów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27962025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Producenci opon oczywiście również odniosą korzyści\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27967803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że wszyscy możemy się od niego uczyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27967804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje pięć elementów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27967805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z antydemokratycznymi siłami należy walczyć w sposób demokratyczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27967806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj Europa potwierdziła raz jeszcze swoją wiodącą rolę w zwalczaniu zmian klimatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27967807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo cieszy mnie fakt, że faktycznie jest tu z nami dwoje komisarzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41091993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41091995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle do Bogdańca!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41091998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że obecne wezwanie ze strony Grupy Socjalistycznej w Parlamencie Europejskim jest całkowicie jasne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41091999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rok po tej deklaracji trzeba nam przyznać, że jesteśmy dalecy od osiągnięcia tego celu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41092006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę pogratulować Serbii postępów osiągniętych w procesie reform\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41092007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba obniżyć pensje i wynagrodzenia i być może podnieść podatki konsumpcyjne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41092009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konieczne jest też trochę więcej szczerości, ponieważ w Rosji nadchodzi czas ważnych wyborów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41092011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie obecny model i koncepcja wzrostu są sprzeczne z zasadą zrównoważonego rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41092017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprojektowany jest w taki sposób, by organizacje społeczeństwa obywatelskiego otrzymywały pomoc bezpośrednio\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41092020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zdobywałem majątek dla niej!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mógłby z taką głową walczyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadanie to słyszałem na pewnym myśliwskim obiedzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc mów, kto mordował mych żołnierzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W nagrodę za dotrzymanie słowa może pan osiągnąć najwyższe szczęście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wilson aż gwizdnął ze zdziwienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wnet oszołomienie minęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie tłum przerzedził się i procesja wraz z dragonami ruszyła na ostatku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generał był zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to lejek z czarnej skóry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rękach trzymał postrzępioną gazetę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było tu nic takiego, coby mogło rozjaśnić duszę, pogrążoną w smutku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprzeciwko mojego ten chłopak zgaśnie, jak świeca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daj mu jeszcze raz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem panu coś powiedzieć o Mistrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do końca Mistrz nie wytrzyma za nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszedłem tutaj dziś, aby się z nią zobaczyć, jesteśmy bowiem po słowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli pan chcesz zaczekać, to proszę siąść sobie w poczekalni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje mi się, że tym razem indusi gotują się do czegoś poważnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy odeślę je panu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to piękny chłopiec i matka słusznie patrzała nań z dumą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarze wszystkich promieniały radością, wiedzieli bowiem, że znajdą tutaj niezliczoną moc lisów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź pan, tę gazetę i przeczytaj sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale Mistrz jest już gotów do wagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego rodzaju uderzenia mają moc decydującą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Belinda“ już dawno ciekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom pogrążony był w milczącej poświacie księżyca, jakby we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Momenty jego nie miały nic zajmującego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I rzeczywiście, klacz starego łowczego robiła już bokami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Psy wpuszczano za pół ceny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam nie powiodło się im.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłszy się na wzgórzu, zwierzęta zaczęły ciężko sapać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz będzie miał nauczkę, aby z pięściami nie włazić każdemu w paradę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piersi i ręce miał poprostu zastraszające; szedł, nieznacznie utykając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz go, teraz da radę Mistrzowi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepewność mnie zabijała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz z kolei ja zapytam, prosząc o wyjaśnienie, co to wszystko znaczy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili i my zabraliśmy się do odwrotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zaś do wódki, będziecie dostawać oznaczoną porcję, ale nie więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawałoby się, że ten olbrzymi lokal nagle zaległa pustka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, za nic!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie przeciął im drogę most.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem zdarzyło się coś, co uwagę naszą zwróciło w inną zupełnie stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21661328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polowanie odbywało się w tak uciążliwych warunkach, że połowa sfory zaniemogła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21661329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim razie sprawa mogła mieć następujący przebieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21661330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Królem tym jest lis, który posiada szatańskie talenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21661331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle poczułem, że serce przestało mi bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21661332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od słowa do słowa, grubo się powaśnili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I doskonale tłumaczy sny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu była granica panowania Amora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli jeszcze w ogóle daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Próbowałaś kiedyś malować wewnętrzną stronę skrzydełek nosowych? — Jesteś matoł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W czasie podwieczorku mówiliśmy mało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję dookoła siebie złe, wrogie mi wiry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz zasnął na przyrodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem, otoczony zewsząd ludźmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil ma stosunkowo małego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostałem właśnie Twojego maila dotyczącego naszego wyjazdu służbowego do Paryża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie zabrzmiała trąbka i pociąg ruszył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak my się zawsze wszystkiego wstydzimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wierzę w nią ani trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy bardzo bolą cię ręce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy płonęły mu dziwnym blaskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad jej oczami zwisały pojedyncze kłosy trawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dama nie siadała, ale za to zaczęła się śmiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20589516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żartować nie lubił! — dodał kulawiec, z uznaniem pokręcając głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyciągnął rękę ku mej papierośnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pyta, nie błądzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to niepojęty cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła na niego, zawiedziona, że nie sprawił jej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio dużo myślałem nad własnym stanem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z lepszych thrillerów jakie widziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekającego najczęściej goni się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wróżby zmieszały się z okrzykiem Moniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stefania czytała na głos wolno i uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Podlasiak rozwiódł dłonie na znak swej nieodpowiedzialności za własną urodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy znaleźli się w rytualnym miejscu, w którym żegnali się zawsze, podali sobie ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjść musisz po chleby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy, jak żywi — idzie wszystko, jak było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż ludzie wysiadają przed zamkiem, z miasta, z Pragi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To honor walczącego proletariatu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyła, jakie to na nim robi wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tego właśnie chciałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolina chodziła rankiem po tych alejach i odnalazła ślady kopyt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To musiało się tak skończyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy zobaczyłem ją po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócili na obiad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałem do dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy otoczeni wrogami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty tu? — zapytał mistrz zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo tam przecie nie ma komfortu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy na tarasie i oglądaliśmy seriale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan zaczął ją z lekka ruszać i całować, ale był to widać początkujący pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba coś zrobić z czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lśniła się od zgrzebnej, zrudziałej na słońcu czystości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten moment operacyjny zaszedł znacznie wcześniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy tu w tym pokoju, gdzie teraz stukot maszyny nasuwa skojarzenia ostatniej jazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór zawahał się przez chwilę, jakby dla namysłu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zatrzymuje się na stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz dopiero jednoręki zoczył uchodzącą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina trzecia dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przewraca się na plecy i przytrzymuje brzuszek pękaty jak balonik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest bardzo zadowolony, że już ćwiczenie odrobił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziewiętnasta czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina ósma piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo cóżbym wtedy miał do roboty? — pomyślał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz mi z oczu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina jedenasta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani nauczycielka czytała w szkole dzieciom śliczną baśń o krasnoludkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ale to musiał być typ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Serce ludzkie zdradza się łatwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewno ktoś z mojej szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za śmieszny głuptas!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie z nim, a z każdym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę jej przypomnieć rocznicę naszego ślubu, tak, by jutro…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozdrawiam wszystkich z okazji dzisiejszego święta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mechanizmy kontrolne, wykluczające celowe lub przypadkowe blokowanie numeru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytknął równo kutasa, popchnął i uderzył\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się, że czynimy pewne postępy, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzuszek mu się zapadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyłka w tym wypadku jest niemożliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolega w czarnym wytłumaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli więc jedno przy drugiem, wśród rozłożystych konarów, moknąc i czekając dnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaskini nie jest wcale ciemno, gdyż rozświeca ją księżyc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby więc… tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było wystarczającym powodem, aby mój pomysł nazwać głupim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to było to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozdrawiam śmieszków z Internetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możesz się przewrócić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż to znaczy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kapitan wziął bambusową ramkę, do której arkusz był przytwierdzony, i czytał co następuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wycieczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowieku, to chyba czary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Normalnie, chyba, że pan jest mańkutem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staszek szybki jest!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak osioł usłyszał: „stój!”, to od razu ruszył z miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdawała sobie sprawy, co ma czynić i mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostaje tylko: „Ja jestem rzeczywistością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż dokuczali, aż żartowali z niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś trzymał przed sobą Nel, Kali jechał z Meą na drugim koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było widać nawet akacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21307436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, Janku, chodź!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc cóż z tego wyniknie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział więc o nim Staszek i choć ślepy mógł trafić łatwo...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja patrzę tylko na to wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu ona tak się o mnie wyraża?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co ciekawego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„A dlaczego nie miałby grywać? On go zna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Beduini zasypali wielbłądom durry, po czym wsiadłszy na dwa luźne, pojechali w stronę Nilu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądziłbym raczej, że przyjechał tu dla zupełnego wypoczynku, aby leczyć się na nerwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już niczego nie pragnę, niczego się nie spodziewam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miss Amelia pobladła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ściągnął na dół majteczki, śliczne, koronkowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyślij ją tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Opowiedz mi teraz wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale najbłahsze niedomaganie przejmowało go do głębi i czyniło zeń bezprzykładnego tchórza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"najnowszy film: licencja na zabijanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różnica o dwanaście funtów, ale za nim przemawia młodość i zwinność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na heraldycznych tarczach były wyryte herby rodowe i pokrewnych rodzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant podniósł bilet, który leżał na podłodze obok trupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzej zalotnicy dumnie i zawiadacko poglądali wzajem na siebie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co? — zaperzył się ptak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szliśmy staroświecką ulicą wioski, między dwoma rzędami drzew olchowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przestraszyła ją myśl zamieszkania przez kilka tygodni w namiocie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minęło tak lat kilkanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddamy ci wszystkie hołdy i całą cześć umarłym należną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co u państwa słychać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas dojrzeliśmy wyraźnie okręt, powalony na bok na straszliwe rafy podwodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kapitan brutalnie zaklął po niemiecku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21698729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy mi się podoba? — zawołała Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki był początek opowieści o przybyszu z Indii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął wreszcie orszak w pobliżu umyślnie wzniesionego na falach Nilu pomostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młody Murzyn tłumaczył na język miejscowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po kilku minutach szczęśliwie wylądowaliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto był jego zabójcą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem groził, że mnie wyda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I któż ci tego złośliwego figla wypłatał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnie, że nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O grubasie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale za to zobaczył siebie w lustrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy urwało się coś w nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, proszę cię, nie umieraj już drugi raz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinąłem głową twierdząco i stanąłem przy drzwiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego miałby się obawiać zasadzki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastała śmiertelna cisza oczekiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio jeden z takich zjawił się w kopalni Wilsona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnij się do monitora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21704644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pismo to poszło przez umyślnego posłańca do Wólki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26729509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bilans ponad trzech lat negocjacji jest godny pożałowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26729510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to region, gdzie polityka powinna być szczególnie delikatna i wyważona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26729511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzięki temu możliwe będzie zapoczątkowanie rozwoju zatrudnienia i wzrostu gospodarczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26729513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa musi rozmawiać z Rosją, jednak w sposób pryncypialny i konsekwentny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26729514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogłębia to jedynie problemy społeczne i może trwale zagrozić spokojowi społecznemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26729536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zadać tutaj jednak jedno pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26729537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Gospodarcza i Walutowa wymaga podstawowej reformy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26729538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich latach podejście do \\\"wolnego\\\" handlu było całkowicie ideologiczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miło jest pomarzyć, ale trzeba zejść na ziemię i wziąć sprawy w swoje ręce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament Europejski przygotuje się wtedy odgrywania efektywnej roli we wzmocnieniu tych środków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, będziemy musieli również zadać pytanie, czy naprawdę zapewniają one większą ochronę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzrost średniej długości trwania życia to pozytywne zjawisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozwiązanie tego problemu wymaga znacznych inwestycji w obszarze kształcenia i szkolenia zawodowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie są panele słoneczne i turbiny wiatrowe w Kenii?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwzględnia ono praktyki stosowane w innych częściach świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale był czas, kiedy lew i owca mieszkały razem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma on znaczenie strategiczne dla całej europejskiej tkanki przemysłowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja kobiet na obszarach wiejskich zasługuje na naszą szczególną uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inne kraje i regiony powinny zrobić to samo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wprowadzajcie ograniczeń, które zaszkodzą najsłabszym\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inni już tak ocenili Europę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoznacznie zgadzamy się z celem tego przepisu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to sprawa, z której moim zdaniem Komisja musi być dumna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto mógłby współdziałać w tym zakresie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno dopuścić, by prowadziła do prawnego dzielenia włosa na czworo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy, że poważnie się nad nimi zastanowicie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W odniesieniu do niniejszego rozporządzenia, uwaga Komisji Prawnej skupiła się na trzech głównych zagadnieniach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję sprawozdawcy za wykonaną pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas, aby wyjść poza działania pilotażowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak powiedziałem, mówię obywatelom, że są chronieni, ale nie mogę tego zagwarantować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podjęliśmy wyjątkowo ważny temat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego zdecydowane działanie jest dziś niezbędne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Działalność przestępczą należy karać odpowiednio na szczeblu krajowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawa w dużym stopniu dotyczy zestawu narzędzi, które skutecznie odstraszałyby od stosowania antykonkurencyjnych praktyk\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy podsektor transportu powinien pokrywać koszty, które rzeczywiście powoduje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawda, że obecnie występują sprzeczne postawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj jest kwestia nie jakiegoś wewnętrznego chaosu, tu jest kwestia innej cywilizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieją obszary w centrach miast, gdzie de facto rządzą nakazy szariatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.116,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więzienie dysydentów i politycznych przeciwników to typowa cecha państw komunistycznych, nadmiernie charakteryzująca Kubę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam międzynarodową wymianę handlową za czynnik o decydującym znaczeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak głęboko wierzę, że Europa jest dobrze przygotowana do globalizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że temat stał się tak ważny z uwagi na sprawozdawców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy dołożyć wszelkich starań, by współpraca sądowa między państwami członkowskimi była jak najbardziej efektywna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Specjaliści Komisji pragną dokonać aktualizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje obawa, że podmiot, pospiesznie zaaprobowany przez niektóre państwa, okaże się kolejną porażką\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście istnieje nadal szereg problemów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem to nie ma sensu, ale właśnie w takim kierunku zmierzamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28498960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Administracja Luli zaangażowała się w sposób szczególny w ochronę praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym względzie być może poparłabym wprowadzenie amerykańskich warunków w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to kraj dla Europejczyków niezwykle atrakcyjny turystycznie, jednak boryka się również z problemami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W komunikacie przeanalizowano wszystkie środki, jakie muszą zostać do tego celu wykorzystane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Który komisarz zapewni tę spójność?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałam jednak jasno, że nie chodzi o to słowo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to, czy ma się poglądy pro- czy antyeuropejskie, to już zupełnie inna sprawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno mi zrozumieć, dlaczego socjaliści usiłują uciec od odpowiedzialności za socjalistyczną politykę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymagane będzie porozumienie tymczasowe od Rady, jak początkowo zaproponowaliśmy w Komisji Spraw Konstytucyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prosimy o korzystanie z tych nowych narzędzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet dziś jest ich w węgierskich więzieniach kilkudziesięciu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo rozumiem o co mu chodzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi, że droga wybrana przez Stany Zjednoczone została zdyskredytowana przez historię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabójstwa obrońców praw człowieka w Rosji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy kilka dużych grup, które zamierzają poprzeć Komisję Barroso\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagłosuję za odrzuceniem tego wypaczenia demokracji, które potępiam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rząd Japonii wydał miliard dolarów na badania nad zastępowaniem i recyklingiem metali ziem rzadkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadza się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mieliście państwo odwagi, by z niego zrezygnować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzywam szanownych kolegów i koleżanki na tej sali, aby robili tak w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były również setki tysięcy ofiar\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli o mnie chodzi, ta właśnie kwestia ma zasadnicze znaczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możliwości prowadzenia monitoringu są niewystarczające, a często i rządy niechętnie podejmują jakiekolwiek działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, położenie kobiet to kwestia polityczna, chodzi o ukierunkowanie, a także o działanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poziom ceł, które Korea może zrefundować w ramach zwrotu cła, ulega stopniowo redukcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Solidarność i odpowiedzialność muszą działać dwukierunkowo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądziłam, że sprawdzamy głosowanie poprzednie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem strażakiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu istotna jest nie tylko metoda pracy, ale i strona merytoryczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, jakie są losy międzynarodowych zobowiązań dotyczących wielostronnego finansowania handlu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można tolerować przemocy seksualnej wobec dziewcząt i kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto możemy się również cieszyć z likwidacji klauzuli opt-out\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.964,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proponowany system jest mylący i byłby wyraźnym zaprzeczeniem celu zakładającego zrównoważone stosowanie pestycydów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje rzeczywiście wielka obawa dotycząca zwiększenia napięć w regionie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to skandaliczne uprzedzenie, wyrażane po to, by po raz kolejny marginalizować społeczność Romów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagłosowałam za przyjęciem przedmiotowego sprawozdania, ponieważ należy bezzwłocznie położyć kres przemocy wobec kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego - moim zdaniem - odniesienia historyczne nie stanowią kryteriów sprawiedliwych, przejrzystych czy obiektywnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi zostać wdrożony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę również państwa zapewnić, że Komisja rozpatrzy uważnie poprawki do proponowanego rozporządzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pora, abyśmy porzucili retoryczne rozważania i przeszli do sedna sprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie cechuje wiele różnych zalet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podziękować panu za tę debatę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego właśnie względu stworzona została procedura wzmocnionej współpracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkańcom Strefy Gazy należy udzielić niezwłocznej pomocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest to, czego chcemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzecią sprawą, którą chcę poruszyć, jest regulacja rynków finansowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spójrzmy jednak na te państwa członkowskie, które teraz naprawdę mają problemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W swoim wystąpieniu chciałbym skupić się na spójności terytorialnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27755514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tych powodów, wnioskowane rozporządzenie musi jak najszybciej wejść w życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielce się uradował podstarzały pan Gajowiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pędziły po niej auta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimno go owionęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi bracia sofiści, którzy byli daleko na Wschodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciepło, nie za gorąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłum ludzi szedł w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem — szepnął z uśmiechem i pogardliwie spojrzawszy na jednorękiego, przywołał go ruchem dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieka przed tym duszącym dymem, wciąż kichając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego było za wiele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie twoje rzemiosło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A on mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należałoby przecież odróżnić uczucia, które są wrażeniami czysto or ganicznymi, od nastrojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapalił małą lampkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staliśmy oboje na tym maleńkim skrawku ziemi, a wokół nas, wszystko pokryła woda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz tatko coś dołożył i kupili rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ulicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety stosunki meksykańskie utrudniają bardzo dostanie prawdziwego preparatu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czegóż pan chce więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziemniaki i jajka w zupełności wystarczą, nic innego w diecie nie potrzebuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto jest twoja myśl o śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej chwili nie mogłem skupić uwagi na żadnym zajęciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyły go nieprzeniknione ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę tylko powiedzieć, że przeżyliśmy wiele okrutnych dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wykręcaj się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze mam zrobić cztery zadania matematyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poproszę coś na kaszel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szereg komnat, które zmieniają się w cyrk podziemny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką odpowiedź przywieźli gońcy? — zapytałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruchome masy gadów porcelanowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z naszych nikt nie był zabity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od dwóch dni był nowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy podoba ci się ta myśl, Lizo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Późno już i strażnik wzywa do opuszczenia cmentarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był tak mały, że poręcz fotela sięgała dużo wyżej niż jego głowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli chodzi o Europę, to nie zwiedziłam tylko krajów skandynawskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym właśnie sęk! — zawołał Podlasiak, wstydliwie obmacując wybitną pozostałość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś spojrzał smutnemu królowi prosto w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest na miarę lat siedemdziesiątych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy mówiła: „nie bawię się” albo: „nie potrzebuję”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocucił nas dopiero jęk cichy, przeciągły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu — było ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wskazała mi miejsce w łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo radzili, co czynić, żeby się jak najbezpieczniej o wszystkim przekonać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z góry obiecuję spełnić wszystko co do joty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pianista dlatego nie może grać, bo zdaje sobie sprawę, że może nie móc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wolno może takiego człowieka jak ja puścić, aby swobodnie krążył po świecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odetchnąłem dopiero, gdy w końcu został wypuszczony na swobodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie leży Koguci zaułek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Koguci zaułek, wielmożny panie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaromir znów powtórzył gest uśpienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc to tu miałby być Koguci zaułek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy pan mnie rozumie, panie Szafranek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko domy nowo zbudowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko mi stało się tak niepojęcie nowe: domy, ulice, zamknięte sklepy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakieś nieopisanie uroczyste uczucie ogarnia mię w pełni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwarny, dość czysty lokal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego książęca mość wziął kij, nacelował, zrobił kiksa, twarz ułożył żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem literatem i bardzo mię to zaciekawia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza moja się radowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko zapach i blask.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przewoźnik żegna się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech że pan to bierze rozsądnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaka skromność w całej postawie, jaka czystość rysów!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23976198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie mogę w to żadną miarą uwierzyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod tym względem ma Pan moje bezwarunkowe poparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okazuje się, że grupa ta obiecuje jedno, a robi co innego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często bardziej odpowiednią i skuteczną metodą może być przekazanie informacji, edukacja lub samoregulacja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Główną funkcją rolnictwa jest i pozostaje produkcja żywności dla naszych obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta kwestia dotyczy każdego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest kilka oczywistych ograniczeń w obrębie Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konfederacyjna Grupa Zjednoczonej Lewicy Europejskiej - Nordycka Zielona Lewica zagłosuje za odrzuceniem przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym byłabym zainteresowana pani poglądami na te kwestie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele już zostało powiedziane, a ja chciałabym dodać odmienne zdanie do tej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nasza nieskuteczna i kosztowna strategia nikogo nie kusi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Instytucje te zostały do maksimum wykorzystane przez samorząd lokalny i inne organy państwowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz jeszcze pragnę wyrazić swoje podziękowania dla wszystkich, którzy pomogli w tej pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to tragedia, o której trudno jest mówić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26250535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to nic wspólnego z terminowym działaniem, ukrywaniem czegoś bądź wymawianiem się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje potrzeba działań w tej dziedzinie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że sprawozdanie jest niewyważone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym przypadku można by ją niemal określić mianem kampanii dezinformacyjnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugą rzeczą, o której wspomniał, jest przebudowa infrastruktury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasiadam tu już sześć i pół roku i na Boga słyszałem niejedną brednię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym konflikcie chodzi o geopolitykę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Program prac węgierskiej prezydencji w Radzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kultura ma również wartość gospodarczą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takich sytuacjach potrzebne są wyjątkowe środki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochodzę z Irlandii, mówię po angielsku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co nam przeszkadza najbardziej w uzyskaniu pełnego sukcesu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie o to musimy się postarać w okresie dwóch, trzech lat przed następnymi wyborami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, nasza reakcja powinna dotyczyć przyszłości całej energetyki jądrowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26257927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwie partie, które nie mogą się nawzajem znieść, usiadły razem i pracowały ze sobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przymorski obszar Tamizy rozciągał się przed nami jak początek nieskończonego wodnego szlaku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziła namiętnie do kina i nazajutrz miewała takie stany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez namysłu schowałem kukłę do wewnętrznej kieszeni żakietu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwał i oczyma wzniesionymi ku sklepieniu śledził ruch dymów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko weszli do pokoju, usiadła na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na powitanie krócej, na pożegnanie - dłużej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi w ogóle żadnej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To pani pchnęła go w objęcia śmierci, seniora — odpowiedziałem niemal surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulice były wilgotne, błotniste, śliskie, przysłonięte zimną a posępną mgłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekł tylko jeden żołnierz, dwóch leżało z przestrzelonymi głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fortecę zburzono do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłukli i pieścili ją oboje na przemian; na złość sobie, nawzajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co dzień tu przychodzić będę — oświadczył Radek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz była to noc nieprzyjemna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdzić, co robili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem dlaczego tak cię to bawi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wrzaskach i płaczu mocno jej się spało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, dobrotliwy nasz panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara spostrzegła, że było ich sześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wiesz, że zmieniłaś się? — Wiem o tym dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dan wciąż popłakiwał przy sterze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Andrzej ani drgnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby być zdrowym powinieneś jeść więcej owoców i warzyw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spójrz w oczy moje lśniące!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę zostawiać tylko cyfr dla statystyki, chcę przyszłą historię wzbogacić w dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy na tarasie i oglądaliśmy seriale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W każdym razie coś pokrewnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie widzę związku z naszą rozmową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pewnie dorośli tak samo myślą, że dzieci nic nie wiedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak my się zawsze wszystkiego wstydzimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, zwariowałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszła mimo jak symbol cierpienia i śmieszności splecionych w tragiczny węzeł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toteż musi opustoszeć, a wówczas nikt nam nie będzie przeszkadzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden cukierek zjadła, a drugi mnie kazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz Podlasiaka rozjaśniła się nagłym pomysłem i poszerzyła z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był nagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli obok siebie, nie mówiąc wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamąciło się w głowie, mignęło przed oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki rozejrzał się naokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje bilet ulgowy, a ile normalny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała rozbitą głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocaliłeś mi życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarne źrenice, czarne długie rzęsy, oczy spokojne, utkwione we mnie bez drgnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie broniła, milcząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było sobie miasteczko nad rzeczką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zależało jej na tym, a jednak nie istniał już poza nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodźmy prędzej do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez tereny ówczesnych Świętochłowic wiódł odwieczny szlak z Bytomia do Mikołowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem pochylił się i w zupełnej ciszy usłyszeliśmy plusk wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było przyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przytoczył pan kilka niedoskonałości rynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawrócili ku miastu, na którego krańcu stała w pobliżu kanału willa pana Rawlisona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli w ogrodzie i wiedli zacięty spór w kwestii sanskrytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę bezwarunkowo dziś jeszcze być w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara zrazu nie otwierała oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z młodych poetów najzdolniejszy Jesienin, w samobójstwie szukał wyzwolenia z dręczących go wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie podał mi rękę, i uścisnął ją setnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nie mam o tym żadnego pojęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brednie, paplanina, zrzędzenie jako czasowniki dotyczące mowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25699997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również i to nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25700001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to była tylko chwilowa przerwa w grozie srożącej się burzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25700036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powróciła więc śpiesznie do komnaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25700037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał i płakał, póki go nie zabrała starsza dziewczynka do szatni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25700038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, Janku, chodź!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25700039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pistolet w pośpiechu zostawiłem w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25700040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolno wyłaniał się z jego piersi dziki bas o specjalnie hebrajskim akcencie gardłowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25700083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był on jak natchnienie, któremu nie można było się oprzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25700084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kutasem także zwane, chociaż częściej bywa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25700085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walka trwała niedługo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25700086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przewrócił się quadem na rżysku i poharatał sobie dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25700087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"który pewnie od niej godniejszym go będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał na mnie przerażony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie należałem jednak do tych, którzy potrafią rozpaczać nad stłuczonym dzbankiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest ciekawe w tym wypadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz robi się jeszcze czerwieńszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko parę słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam wyjaśnię ci wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy można kochać umarłych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uproszony kasztelan wyznaczył termin, do którego obiecał powstrzymać wykonanie wyroku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Córka łódź po ojca przysłała, coby się stary zbytnio nie trudził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smutne to jest, ale cóż robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja wiem, że pan tak myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myśl, że będę mówił o tobie źle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech nie spostrzeże, że ci tak pilno!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciemnościach krążyły dwa lwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazł się u siebie jeszcze przed wieczorem, wzburzony i pełen nieopisanego lęku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto widział tak się kłócić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby był odkrył kopalnię złota, oblicze jego nie mogłoby być rozpromienione większą radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chcesz herbaty?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic ci złego nie zrobię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Synku, chodź, dam ci powideł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Same nowe domy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłam pięć złotych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozwarły się podwoje, coś tam z cicha trzasło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25701884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięta pan godzinę odjazdu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziemniaki i jajka w zupełności wystarczą, nic innego w diecie nie potrzebuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje kolej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co najmniej drugi syn!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj razem dostąpimy wyzwolenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie stwierdzono ani śladu czegoś podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzeknij mi, że się nic nie zmieni, myślę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłócą się starsze z młodszymi, chłopcy z dziewczynkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walkę jednak stoczył on sam jeden, o własnych siłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na moim koniu po pocztę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzę, któremu utkwiła strzała w grzbiecie; tarza się, biega, ryczy, pluje, krew zalewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda była chyba jeszcze gorsza niż w dniu poprzednim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stała, odziana w szlafroczek, z rękami założonymi na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już nie mogę niczego zmyślać na jawie — rzekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widziałem, jak mu ręce drżały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetny to orszak widzów, świetny, zaprawdę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja babcia zaczęła mi wysyłać memy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się wtedy Sebastian pienił ze złości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jak wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może nie czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba poszli grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Banki nie wydawały złożonych kapitałów i nie wypłacały procentów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z trwogą podawano sobie wiadomość o stopniu ich gwałtowności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła przez zęby, bo trzymała między nimi szpilki do włosów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na świecie trwało jeszcze ciemne rano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła na niego, zawiedziona, że nie sprawił jej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jakaś lekcja odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem wtedy do siebie: „Każda chwila jest godna Szekspira”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zeszłoroczna zbiórka poszła naprawdę kiepsko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co też tym kobietom do głowy przychodzi — rzekł mąż pani Emilii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja mamusia zawsze mówi, że dzieci powinny się ubierać skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie zbliżają się środkiem ulicy trzy cienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc między nami, o ile to oczywiście odpowiada twym planom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość — łzy — i modlitwę młodą, dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo jednak nie wracał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płakał od ósmego roku życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mam iść do kancelarii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uścisnęli się w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W naszym mieszkaniu są wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kruk, przelatujący nad lasem, zakrakał nagle na śmierć temu właśnie dębowi, pod którym siedzieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem położył się i patrzył uporczywie w sufit, przez który było widać gwiazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wykręcaj się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc — panno Klementyno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc żeby się potem nie gniewali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyjmij ode mnie sześć pensów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak kamień w wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go uczucie dziwnego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszyłem ramionami i umyślnie przeszedłem do innego tematu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20732687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki z błyskawiczną szybkością poprawił torbę, sposobiąc ją do zamierzonego celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad jej oczami zwisały pojedyncze kłosy trawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A każdy inaczej opisał, jak Maciuś uciekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim zawahał się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne nerwowe wyczerpanie wskutek podróży?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadek ma rower, to i ja chcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U niej widocznie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chmury są wyjątkowo piękne przed zachodem słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, wyłączyłem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bliżej ona drapała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama jest ciągle inną; niby ta sama, a jednak inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To się zdarzało bardzo rzadko, i dlatego była niespokojna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grosz do grosza, a będzie kokosza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam są Anka i Rena i one go poznają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawiają się zjawy zwierzęce, morskie potwory, jakiś jakby znany mi brodacz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał mi głęboko w twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby dziecko mniej czuło, miało inną skórę niż oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce zaszło, zmierzch padł na rzekę i światła zaczęły się ukazywać wzdłuż brzegu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatkała mu usta ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — to on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz — tłumaczył, zatrzymując się przede mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki głową uparcie pokręcił, zaprzeczając z góry wszelkim domniemaniom łatwowiernego Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy bardzo bolą cię ręce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucała się w oczy od razu oryginalna kompozycja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz pendrive'a, którego ci dałem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje mi się, że szkoda mu było na to czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba mnie na to nie stać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to przecież śmieszny zabobon, Halko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec zawczasu nachylił się ku dziwożonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę mieć spokój i wygodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego tylko pożądał: wichru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił, widać, oślepić rozwścieczonego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to się nazywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechaj i tak będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo może pan stać, jeśli tak jest wygodniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dozorca uderzył batem w ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podziękowaliśmy i zamyśleni zeszliśmy do gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miesiączka jest ciągłym memento vivere.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A i te były za duże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zabijają go na wiele sprytnych sposobów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się pan wystrzega tej brunetki i towarzystwa pijaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem powiedział: — Pogadamy o tym dokładnie wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za robota!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś aportował jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bywaj, chłopcy, tu do mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby być zdrowym powinieneś jeść więcej owoców i warzyw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostałem sam u wylotu tonącej w półmroku uliczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo i władze państwowe powinny otaczać szczególną opieką dzieci niemające rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wszystko złoto, co się świeci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zróbmy lepiej tak: niech każdy rzuci pięć razy do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam widzę go każdego ranka…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej o Ewie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział do mnie z zamkniętymi oczami «Przynieś swój pamiętnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nachylić się nisko, do ziemi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłoniła głowę na znak zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wzięto nas za małżeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozgląda się dzikie wiejskie dziecko po ogromnym mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przełykać ślinę i zapatrzył się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zróbmy tak: niech każdy doprowadzi do porządku fabrykę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest truizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem wegetarianinem, ale nie jem mięsa codziennie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za człowiek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo krótka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jest pan moim rodakiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ten przyrząd do czego służy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam oczy przy zapalonej lampie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ona — ona mnie kochała — i byłem szczęśliwy, bez miary szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była blada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec w przedziale pierwszym znaleźli zwłoki nieszczęśliwej ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co powie Ewie? Musi jej wszystko wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe lalki nie zamykają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zatrzymał się, padł na kolana i oczy oburącz zasłonił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto mój adres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One wyglądają jak cygara — i Ela była znów niby dorosła, poważna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy była chora, leżała na brzuchu, rozkrzyżowana; czasem, gdy miała miesiączkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to lekkomyślne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejka, panie łaskawy, wielka rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I drzewo żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co cię nie zabije, to cię wzmocni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli czerwone uszy i byli nie bardzo przytomni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już wyłączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś tchórz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podał ją z wyszukaną nonszalancją, oczywiście podnosząc ją momentalnie w dwójnasób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U mnie będzie pan całkowicie bezpieczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróć się zaraz, to sama sprawdzę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dziś są twoje urodziny, więc zapraszam cię na lody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko pomyślę, że masz przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tam ładna ślizgawka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blisko miesiąc byliśmy w niebie, w niebie cudów i marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieraz o tym słyszałem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozsunęli się nieco, ustąpili i Cezary znalazł wolne miejsce na ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mocno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest ktoś inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wszystko ucichło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posprzątałem dom i odkurzyłem podłogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie dobrzy! — jęknął przerażony Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochający cię i pełen głębokiego szacunku, kuzyn Krzeszowski“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz dopiero Rzecki przypomniał sobie obowiązek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zbytnio sobie nie dufaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głowę dałbym sobie uciąć, że Stach niczem więcej nie zajmuje się tylko polityką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski przekładał obie z rąk do rąk; zdziwienie jego wzrosło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu zaprosił Machalski mnie i Wokulskiego do siebie na wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przepadam za nim!!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj wieczór zaznałem jednak rzadkiej uciechy, jaką jest samotność wśród tłumu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to choroba, nic więcej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więzy każ mu zdjąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po ulicach rozlegał się wesoły gwar przechodniów; w sercu Wokulskiego zasiadł radosny spokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spadaj, mała pchło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"byłam bardzo głupia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się masz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże mama miała słuszność; może ten koń wart cztery albo pięć tysięcy franków...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wraca do kraju boso i na piechotę, tak jakoś wypada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodź na herbatę mój panie, i zachowaj się jak przystoi gentlemanowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nas troje?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"uciszcie się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wydobył księgi, umaczał pióro i, nibyto, zaczął rachować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta jej dotykały twarzy chłopca, który się wstawił, jak żądała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy mi tego na parę lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczność nikogo nie krzywdzi...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś czyta płynnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz panna Izabela spuściła oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest bardzo przystojny i byłby z niego dzielny żołnierz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inteligentny, odbiór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"patrz!...“ Ale on nie uważał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wrzeszczał, chwytając się za głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dała go Ala, uśmiechała się do niego: i do kamyczka i do Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobisz to, moja droga?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie robota była skończona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzę na mamę....\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyśnił mi się wczoraj!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie, koniecznie trzeba było uciekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż zeń prostaczek w szarej sukience.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim gosposie wypoczęły, przybyli goście; musiały się więc gorączkowo spieszyć, żeby ich przyjąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za jej nawet pośrednictwem Wokulski nabył weksle Łęckiego i srebra panny Izabeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to omdlenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co mi to za ród!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W piwnicy zrobiło się pusto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka miła muszelka, taka jedyna na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski stracił wszelką władzę nad sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególniej gdy się już zagnieździ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi się podobał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tylko było mu trochę przykro, że Starski siedzi obok Izabeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj pan!...“ „Zresztą możesz pan sprawić Beli małą przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju jadalnym rozlegał się śmiech kobiecy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24401616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski spostrzegł to i znowu zmieszał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzdrygałem się na myśl, że muszę znów wracać do swego smutnego domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wino Machalskiego było tak mocne, że w tej chwili straciłem przytomność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z każdą sekundą zbliżałem się do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekaj, wybiła twoja ostatnia godzina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skręciłem na ścieżkę, prowadzącą do skraju lasu i pobiegłem szybko do starego świerka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakonnice, przynajmniej mają krewnych, mają przyjaciół, którzy je odwiedzają choć przez kratę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodź ze mną, gospodarzu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym grać, jak on, albo przynajmniej tak, jak Walenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wyjeździe męża wszystkiego się tutaj bała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytem poruszał ustami i bez głosu wymówił jakieś zdanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mi rosło na myśl o czynie, który mnie czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież lada chwila mogą mnie stąd wylać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy ten dom palił się kiedy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zepsuł mi się zasilacz od laptopa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzył na pannę Izabelę w milczeniu i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Żyję niby w błogosławieństwie sennem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie wzrok człowieka, który trzymał latarkę, padł na puhar z winem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W marcu jak w garncu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytałbym się Walentego, ale się wstydzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boi się Maciuś, żeby Felek nie odszedł, więc nic już nie mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co tam mówi twoja matka w niebie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewidzialne nici wyciągały mnie na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie nie byłem tak głupi, abym sam z niej korzystał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznałem obcą twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toż nieraz mi pan życzliwie podawał rękę pomocną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To już był taki zwyczaj cesarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trwało to jedno okamgnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby Stefan Gerard dał się powstrzymać sforze psów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty siermięgo toruńska, mendo obmierzła, łajzo przebrzydła i poczochrana!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewna przygoda w mojem dzieciństwie, zawsze mi to na myśl przywodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko było dokładnie obmyślone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry, przyszedłem odebrać zaświadczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepsza sieć, bo nie rani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienawidziłem tego pilnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas zawierania pokoju w Tylży, byłem tylko ubogim porucznikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem turkot kół powozu na bruku i wściekły galop podków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Automatycznie zdmuchnąłem świecę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja muszę jechać za niemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wodę w kiblu się spuszcza...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej chwili zgasiłem światło i ukryłem się za kotarą przy oknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napisane w nim było, iż ponieważ zarżnąłem lisa, przeto muszę go też zjeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź naucz się higieny, no i sio mi z kuchni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego się wszystko zaczęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piękność jej była tak zdumiewająca, żem powstrzymał oddech i stałem jak zaklęty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeto nie może być w niej bzdur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna tylko jeszcze migała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięto urząd ministra cyfryzacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z warty najlepiej mi się podoba Walenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to zapadły, nędzny placyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłanie było nadspodziewanie wygodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniały w proporcjach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokąd poszły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem szedł dalej, potem znów zaczynało się wszystko od początku, potem otworzono drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pocałuję nikogo! — odrzekła dziwożona ze stanowczością, potrząsając worem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w dobrem zdrowiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cha, cha, cha!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc to prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadłem, że Podlasiak! — pochełpił się jednoręki, zwracając się do kulawca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest o rok spóźniona, bo chorowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Banki nie wydawały złożonych kapitałów i nie wypłacały procentów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma tego złego, co by na dobre nie wyszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kropka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, nie miał żadnej broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dłużej tu dzisiaj pozostać nie możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ilu was tam jest? — ozwała się niespodzianie dziwożona z wnętrza torby żebraczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Część krytyków zaznacza jednak, że wielbiciele kina artystycznego będą mieli czym nacieszyć oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To samo tutaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi, nie mam nic na ten temat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyją cukierki i czekolada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki postrzegł ów rumieniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznam ich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawiązała sobie na ręku niebieską tasiemkę dla pamięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubiłem wygarnąć po nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oczywiście, prawda co do joty — potakiwał Ole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchała z nich wtedy nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęli biec gdy spadły pierwsze krople.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały dzień przewalały się chmury, jakby gotując się do walnej rozprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak zamilkł i palcem potarł sęk nad prawym okiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co miałem widzieć? — odezwał się sennym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczał chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz o północy nie daruję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądam za firankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewałem się znaleźć odpowiednie elementy z tą etykietą, ale nie udało mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było staczać ustawiczne walki z wrogimi szczepami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głosie jej drgnęły dźwięki przyobiecanego płaczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ich dwóch: prawy — kulawiec, a lewy — jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale mnie potrzebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były nastawione ku północnemu zachodowi, gdzie jeszcze niebo jaśniało dość pogodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jakże mi brak tu zieleni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z książkami jest inaczej, niż mi się zdawało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem czy lepszy jest żel czy pianka do golenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napięcie w filmie tworzy się na wielu płaszczyznach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie — syknął niechętnie pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W „pańskiej” Polsce… — zaczął mówca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem nalewał wody do wanny i robił okręty z papieru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosiliśmy go na lunch w pobliskiej knajpie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale przynajmniej ta pociecha, że nie spotkałam się z diabłami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśliby Jurand był zabit lub pojman, pan Bergow wyjdzie bez wykupu z niewoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety wszyscy przyczyniliśmy się do zmarnowania tej szansy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłoby to korzystne nie tylko dla konsumentów, ale również dla poważnych przedsiębiorstw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"naszym celem nie jest tylko i wyłącznie krytykowanie innych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby były realizowane, kilka problemów wymaga rozwiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było to moim zamiarem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym wygląda na to, że sprawy idą właśnie w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmawiałem z jednym wpływowym człowiekiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczę, jakto dziś wygląda...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada boryka się z poważnym problemem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego dokonujecie cięć w tej dziedzinie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich latach częstość, skala, złożoność i skutki klęsk żywiołowych wzrosły znacząco w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z takim rozwiązaniem zaleconym przez Komisję Prawną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego Turcja musi spełnić te wymagania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Połowy skorupiaków, mięczaków i innych bezkręgowców wodnych trzeba całkowicie włączyć do wspólnej polityki rybołówstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej oczy napełniają się łzami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwzględniając istotną rolę zamówień publicznych w promowaniu i wspieraniu nowych technologii, poparłem omawiane sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście hodowcy także odnoszą korzyści, ponieważ ich straty finansowe są redukowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie wysoki przedstawicielu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym czymś jest wola, wolność wypowiedzi i wolny duch narodu chińskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacny człowiek... Prawda panie Rzecki, że już jest wpół do dziesiątej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg z pewnością nie chce wymuszonej czci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym podkreślić jednakże dwie kwestie, do których przywiązuję szczególną wagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.62,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo słusznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mieliśmy szansy wysłuchania wszystkich stron, biorących udział w debacie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie dlatego preferowalibyśmy dokonanie rozróżnienia pomiędzy zgodnością z przepisami a udziałem w procedurze odwoławczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję bardzo za powtórzenie pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doprecyzowaliśmy więc i ułatwiliśmy zrozumienie definicji dokumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obywatele tego kraju uczestniczą w wyborach, podejmują swobodnie decyzje i oczekują, że zostaną wysłuchani\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obywatele Europy mają rację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelako, jeśli się boicie, to można borem objechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedzą biedaki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na piśmie - Głosowałem za udzieleniem absolutorium budżetowego Europejskiej Agencji Środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40006992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeszcze zapytać, jako tam mam ludziom rozpowiadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy sprawdzić, jak obecne prawodawstwo irlandzkie chroni prawa takich dzieci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym względzie, intencja była jasna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogliśmy również udowodnić jak bardzo konkurencyjny jest europejski przemysł kosmiczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzecki zbliżył swoje usta do jego ucha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł z impetem na fotelu i wskazał gościowi drugi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma czystego, ostatecznego wzoru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiam się, że będę mniej dyplomatyczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy jeszcze popracować nad rozpoznaniem luk oraz zastanowić się, jak je usunąć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie należy mu się sprzeniewierzać, ani go dzielić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład musimy ostatecznie zapewnić wprowadzenie przez Libię systemu azylowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40039098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O tym mówi niniejsza rezolucja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40039099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zarządzanie Regionem Arktycznym w zglobalizowanym środowisku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40039100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spójrzmy na przykład na badania, które zaliczają się do kategorii wzrostu jakościowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40039101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oczywiście nie jest prawdą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40039102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Które sytuacje są priorytetami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bądź w gorącej wodzie kąpany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poszukam sobie innego gniazda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oboje mieli tę samą śmiertelną ranę, koło lewej pachy nad sercem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mi zesłał tę nieznajomą kobietę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągnęła się samotna i naga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schował rewolwer do kieszeni i chwycił pałkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natychmiast zauważyła zmieniony wygląd Filipa, co sprawiło jej widoczną przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinno być na dziś jeno sześćdziesiąt i cztery!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz się przygotować na daleką drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Umiem obchodzić się z bronią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To było nieuniknione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tymczasem wiedzą już królowie, dokąd zajechał samochód z Maciusiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Część krytyków zaznacza jednak, że wielbiciele kina artystycznego będą mieli czym nacieszyć oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiwnął jej głową, uśmiechnął się i poszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trudno: nie jestem tak delikatny jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę razy przesiąkł jak mgła przez pnie drzew w alei lipowej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę osób otoczyło przestraszoną kobietę, pytając o powód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolę zadać standardowe pytania, a potem po prostu słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Rynku będzie można odwiedzić stragany z najróżniejszymi wyrobami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale skąd znów ta ranga i mundur naczelnika?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Argumentacja godna stołowej nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy nim jest klęcznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrobię to dla was, jeszcze raz pójdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostali wciągnięci w wiatr, który ciął w wirujące płatki śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi ani połowy takiej przy jemności, jak z P.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ja nienawidzę tego bydlęcia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem babci bukiet goździków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec w twarz mu wprawnie, jak koniowi w zęby, zajrzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku pracować mi zbrzydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tylko tyle możemy zrobić w zamian za nową broń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem o tym i nie do was mówię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O tych podziemiach chodziły po mieście tylko głuche wieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zegarka nie nakręcisz, to stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ćwicz dalej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat, przeznaczony dla mężczyzn, jest okrutny i „logiczny”, wystawiany na pokaz i na licytację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umawiała się z różnymi chłopcami, dawała się czasami całować; bez przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale żeby ośmielić się nocą wchodzić do mego domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystrzelił Maciuś w powietrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że nie jesteś już normalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłodno tu jakoś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jadł śniadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niespodzianka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było przyjemnie niekonsekwentne, bo postanowił się stąd wyprowadzić ze względu na małą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszła ze szkoły o jedenastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trawie wrzało od owadów, jak w wonnym ukropie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli milcząc, zanurzeni w zapachu kobiety, która stąd odeszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja tak lubię, gdy tobie zaczynają drżeć usta przed płaczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W uszach dzwoniła wciąż na alarm krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzała go cały rok: wszystkie pieniądze wydawała na maskotki — same koty, tylko jedna małpa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre węże łączyły się po kilka naraz w fantastyczne potwory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo trwało jej osłupienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie wyjrzałem i zobaczyłem swego brunatnego sąsiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do Sary i wpatrzyła się w nią z uwielbieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani ma wyjątkowe stanowisko, wyjątkowe przywileje na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciepło, nie za gorąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Janek go pocałował w szyję, a raczej musnął ją delikatnie wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniej więcej o jedenastej wieczorem Emil przynosił ciąg dalszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda była chyba jeszcze gorsza niż w dniu poprzednim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna powtórzyła: — Wejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wieczne napięcie pomiędzy tymi drogami: obłąkanie — normalność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gadaj! — krzyknął pierwszy kulawiec, niecierpliwie wychuchując z gęby zapach połkniętego tataraku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do domu było jeszcze daleko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój mąż — dokończyła z dziwnym, nie znanym mi dotychczas uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie odbiegajmy od tematu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywarłem ustami do jej ręki na długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę sobie w świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nas jest zamknięty we własnej nocy, sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapraszam pana do tablicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed chwilą żona, teraz mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzyły nań wary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Kazimierz zamyślił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jest tam co kupić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szaleństwo wyzierało z jego pałających, szeroko rozwartych, nieruchomych oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do każdej herbaty dodaję kilka kropel cytryny i miód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi też opadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogień natychmiast zaczął szybko posuwać się wzdłuż kanału pomiędzy klocami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grosz do grosza, a będzie kokosza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali towarzysze stanęli mu po bokach gwoli przecięcia możliwej ucieczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mało w tym było pozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co znaczą argumenty wobec „nie sprawiło mi przyjemności”? Poczuł, że jest całkiem bezradny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można tu wyczuć pewne jakby stopniowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meteor pędzi pode mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opierała się na jego udach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyna pyta z niedowierzaniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy z jednoczesnym pośpiechem ruszyli z miejsca i dobieżawszy do strumienia, przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby się miało grzęznąć coraz głębiej, choćby się wiedziało, że koniec będzie zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widział jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nic nie mówisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na szyszce i wsłuchał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dotknięcie jej było jak słońce, leżące na powiekach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ich twarzach malowały się głęboki szacunek i przestrach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko mi się pomieszało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Popatrz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytaj moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię do ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotąd ciągle było morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O nikogo nie byłam zazdrosna, ale o nią jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż ci się stało nagle?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Basia da radę przyjechać na pogrzeb?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodzony w Egipcie, mówił po arabsku jak Arab.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli tego płomienia nie ugasi, to padnie trupem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak zwykle urządzają się podróżnicy, którzy z Kairu wyjeżdżają na dłuższy pobyt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczom ich ukazał się las... Las krzyży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani Małgorzata dumna była z tego, że zawsze bez ogródek wypowiadała swe zdanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tu poczuł, że nie ma sił iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko brednie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyna w jej wieku poprawia pończochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, nie pisz wcale!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byłam jeszcze na samej górze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan chciał postawić zły stopień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy drzwi się otwarły, z ust jej wyrwał się cichy okrzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osioł to osioł, wiadomo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"o ho, pierścionek, jasne. Ja tam wolę jak ona ma gołe pięści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to kartka, na której nabazgrałem zagadkową wiadomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że wiesz, iż jesteś sierotą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina trzecia piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aha! — pomyślał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego chciałbym zobaczyć Anię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina osiemnasta czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsza bomba zabiła obcokrajowca, Francuza, pracującego nad renowacją stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale właśnie myśl, że można by mówić o tym, przerażała młynarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech nie spostrzeże, że ci tak pilno!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadła koło niego na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem, że ktoś siada tuż przy firance dotykającej mego łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zejdzie nam na teren parę godzin, a ty tymczasem prześpisz się i wzmocnisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno i drugie jest możliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w jakim celu człowiek ów pozostawił ten rower?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł dalej mówić, głos odmówił mu posłuszeństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ni wśród całej rozlicznej szlachty zaściankowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja chciałam, żebyś ty się przysłuchiwała — rzekła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daj mi kącik w twym domu i weź za swoją niewolnicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodź już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten człowiek zaniesie wasze rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz wszystko się już wyda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryby o smutnych twarzach przepływały koło niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę do kancelarii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozwarły się podwoje, coś tam z cicha trzasło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja ci pomogę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostali na dole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znużonym jest srodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągał się i przeginał: dotknął jej jednej rączki i drugiej, potem obu ramion.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robiłam z nim to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20928670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I małą wyrwał z niewoli — i ją ocalił!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wzruszony świat rzeczywistości traci swój ciężar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wy kończony, dopasowany i martwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustrzeliliby go niezwłocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dałam się pomacać trochę fotografowi z przeciwka i zdjęcia już są.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągłe szycie, cięcie, mierzenie i znowu szycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostali wciągnięci w wiatr, który ciął w wirujące płatki śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest by często nawadniać organizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daremne byłoby usiłowanie spać w noc taką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdziło się to na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym tle nastąpił ogromny rozwój rękodzieła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy grasz? — Trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozdrów Pana swego, jak na cię przystało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zginęliby oboje, bez żadnej pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję! — odkrzyknął oddalając się wybrzeżem ku miastu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zachodzi tu pewne rozszczepienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szaleństwo wyzierało z jego pałających, szeroko rozwartych, nieruchomych oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam się nachylić? — spytał pokornie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziedziczka pokiwała znacząco głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie dobrze będzie wypuścić go ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona milczała uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja tak lubię, gdy tobie zaczynają drżeć usta przed płaczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka trocha mi nie wystarcza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co powiedziała, było prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął przed nią i powiedział: — Dalej nie pójdziesz, aż się nie wyplączemy z tej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, żeś mądry nad swe lata: tedy posłuchaj moich słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jeszcze nie dowód!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozglądam się ciekawie po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąży do szczęścia i czasem jest szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha! — rzekła Marta z radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzmożone uczucia metafizycznego nienasycenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chuda twarz chorego skurczyła się w bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam jej zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie odczuwam na razie żadnego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie domyślam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu po pieniądze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zegarka nie nakręcisz, to stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrzekłem się jej dobrowolnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczęliśmy się cofać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I potem dziesiątki wejść i wyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie słońce zsunęło się nisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy byś został, gdybym… gdybym zrobiła się lepsza?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc jeszcze bardziej je to zachęciło i jeszcze więcej zaczęły dawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypominasz mi lalkę, którą miałam, gdy byłam mała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinno być na dziś jeno sześćdziesiąt i cztery!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszedłem na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy tu tylu prowokatorów i szpiegów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłeś wyjść na przerwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary podział godzin znał na pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co teraz będzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za osobliwa choroba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot fantazja szaleńca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mam począć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo wydał dziki okrzyk i jak szalony rzucił się ku stojącym kolumnom francuskim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pleciesz jak na mękach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dłonie przedtem ściśnięte w pięść rozwarły się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy przelazłem przez otwór, spostrzegłem, iż była to druga połowa celi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka i ojciec siedzieli, jak zwykle, każde po przeciwnej stronie wielkiego komina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Innym działo się jeszcze gorzej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego dnia wieczorem, Estera wyszła odwiedzić chorego dzierżawcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zaraz spojrzał na mnie stary prezydent, jak tygrys na swój łup.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto mówił on ustawicznie sam do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle krew mi zastygła w żyłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na miłość twoją dla mnie, Stefanie, zaklinam cię, ustąp!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliłem się schwytać tym łotrom, którzy mnie wyprowadzili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ze wszystkich miast, które odwiedziliśmy, najniekorzystniejsze i najśmieszniejsze położenie posiada Wenecja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wypadkiem tylko te oba morderstwa zostały udaremnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce moje przez ciebie zostało złamane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Około ósmej wieczorem umilkła niespodzianie i nie odezwała się więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posunąłem się wzdłuż konara i stanąłem na dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przekonaliśmy się o tem często.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę zastanawiałem się nad oporem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujrzałem przed sobą bawełnianą pończochę i gruby, za gumowe uszy wciągnięty trzewik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale powtarzam wam, moi panowie, Łucja była wyszukanie piękną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Goście, dziennikarze i żebracy nie są mile widziani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobnie przed wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpocznę sobie z tydzień po ukończeniu pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ton jego głosu i wyraz twarzy były poważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ona mu powiedziała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie upłynęło i pięć minut, kiedy zapominała o najsroższych swoich groźbach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotka cię za to straszliwa kara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie pojmuję doskonale, że miałem sen, który został tutaj opisany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pora obiadowa już minęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Występuje wyłącznie na półkuli północnej, głównie w jej północnych regionach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego chude, kościste ręce drżały ze wzruszenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmarzliście w tych fotelach, podczas gdy ja otuliłam się tak ciepło kołdrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22229698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ćwiczenia obserwowały najwyższe władze Związku Radzieckiego i przedstawiciele generalicji z krajów tzw. demokracji ludowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś tortury są czymś nieprawdopodobnym, ale jutro!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc mi powiedz to słowo jedyne: czy kochasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Albo o ile mnie to obchodzi! — rzekł Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że ma głowę zanurzoną we krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócił do pensjonatu, który nazywał się „Złocień”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bagno nie zamarzło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz oto szli znikąd — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaszedł tedy do starego sklepikarza na Starym mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasia stała przy mamie, a mama ją czesała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo ja to źle zrobiłem, albo ona jest nieco dziwna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył drzwi, szedł wolno w piżamie wzdłuż korytarza, wykładanego zielonym linoleum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki postrzegł ów rumieniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli przodem do wnętrza koła, na złość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli chodzi o Europę, to nie zwiedziłam tylko krajów skandynawskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona łasa jest na miód i pszczołom go stale wyjada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nic w świecie! — krzyknęła, tupiąc nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był tak mały, że poręcz fotela sięgała dużo wyżej niż jego głowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Premier spotkał się dzisiaj z prezydentem za zamkniętymi drzwiami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas mi na Bródno, czas…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogo nie chcą słuchać dorośli, ten idzie do dzieciaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem stawia na przemian — raz duży, raz mały krok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj odetchnęli głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zerwał się z posłania i gorączkowo zaczął szukać zapałek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie robił z tego tajem nicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta wyraziłby się, że zachowała niezatarte ślady piękności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co? — W klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dać się skusić tej „dobroci” i rżnąć dalej — oto zadanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczuł niby zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blisko miesiąc byliśmy w niebie, w niebie cudów i marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie jak we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród grupy pasażerów u stopnia wagonu powstało zamieszanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maria już nie usiłowała nawet zapanować nad swą wściekłością i upokorzeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był czas, kiedy mówiono o ich małżeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyłapał go natychmiast i pacierz z radości odmówił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt długo milczałem, korzeniąc się w ziemi i szumiąc ponad nią! — ciągnął dalej Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie ty go chyba nie kochasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd się tu wzięły skały pierwotne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała rozbitą głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie twoje rzemiosło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego było za wiele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nich miał niezmierną ochotę pogadać szczerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy opuszczałem restaurację, była godzina druga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz ode mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest znowu nieznane miasto i obcy zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdzie do haremu jako małżonka monarchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ileś pisał, Hannibalu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad nimi wiruje i unosi się „nigdy” i śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przyszła już moja paczka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcieli nawet chwili pogadać z nim cierpliwie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzdrygnąłem się jak pod ukąszeniem węża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako pszczelarz, osobiście spotkałem się w Puławach z pszczelarzami, którzy przyjechali z całej Polski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owoce tych związków będą zbierać następne generacje, czego nie można powiedzieć o projekcie Galileo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie jest wyważone, ponieważ jego głównymi punktami są\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament postanowił wprowadzić tę zasadę krok po kroku w odniesieniu do wszystkich rodzajów transportu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urząd Nadzoru Bankowego podejmuje znaczne wysiłki poprzez ścisłą ocenę wyników tego ćwiczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie się na niej opierać przyszłość Europy i wspólne dobro jej mieszkańców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie zdarzają się wypadki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wejściu ustaw w życie sytuacja często niewiele się zmienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce może to być główny problem w otwarciu rynku kolejowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brytyjczycy nie cierpią ekstremizmu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym przedstawić najświeższe informacje dotyczące aktualnej sytuacji uchodźców na granicy libijskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedzmy wprost z praktyk międzynarodowych, że dzieje się to nie po raz pierwszy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest to zbyteczna ambicja polityczna, ani działanie na pokaz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym ponownie podkreślić, że dziś rano wyrażam współczucie dla tych ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy raczej wykorzystać dodatkowe środki finansowe na nowe inwestycje infrastrukturalne, aby poprawić efektywność energetyczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w związku z tym wybór dodatkowych posłów może potrwać dłużej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy wyciągnąć rękę do Serbii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzi w tym wieku wciąż zbyt często wyklucza się z badań klinicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba ich skrupulatnie przestrzegać, żeby nie podważać zaufania obywateli do instytucji europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedsiębiorstwa nie są już tylko nastawione na zysk\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To z pewnością oznacza, że musimy coś zrobić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popieram konkurencyjny rynek części zamiennych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdecydowana większość Europejczyków sprzeciwia się przystąpienia do naszej Unii kraju nieeuropejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz obydwoje kandydaci przedstawią się zwięźle\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy czas, aby nie tylko pasażerowie połączeń lotniczych, ale także kolejowych, nabyli prawa minimalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy je teraz urzeczywistnić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero w tym momencie możliwe będzie określenie wspólnych standardów rachunkowości i kontroli międzynarodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głód to plaga, która dotyka coraz większą liczbę ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Punkt ten odnosi się do rzekomej opłaty bankowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwiedziłem tam małe miasteczko Ilulissat, a tuż na północ od Ilulissat znajduje się lodowiec\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze stanowiskiem tym zgodziła się większość członków Komisji Transportu i Turystyki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie ma zostać zatwierdzone przez zdecydowaną większość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam złudzeń, że dyrektywa pozwoli rozwiązać wszystkie problemy dotyczące migracji zarobkowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdziwa równość oznacza prawo do dokonania wyboru bez podlegania ocenie za podjętą decyzję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35585839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zgadzamy się na finansowanie instrumentu mikrofinasowego rezerw budżetowych czy z innych działów budżetu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lufthansy, Iberii i Air France\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję panu komisarzowi za przegląd budżetu, który wreszcie pojawił się tutaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak będzie działo się nadal w obecnej formie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam kilka uwag na temat wykorzystania środków unijnych w procesie rozszerzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna rzecz musi być powiedziana wyraźnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grecja ma potencjał dostępu do znacznych kwot w ramach polityki spójności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przewodniczący w imieniu Parlamentu przekaże ofiarom oraz dotkniętej tragedią społeczności wyrazy solidarności oraz kondolencje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym samym czasie dziennikarzom państwo grozi karą śmierci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ludzie powinni płacić za błędy popełnione za namową instytucji finansowych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli miałby to być podatek ogólnoświatowy, to oczywiście popieram go\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kryzys nie został złagodzony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z czego to wynika?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament będzie informowany na wczesny etapie o zmianach personalnych w Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dwie wielkie łzy spłynęły mu po ogorzałych policzkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35586095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zyskało zaufanie na świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tej decyzji instytucji europejskie ignorować przecież nie mogą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie prawa człowieka będą również priorytetem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawcy tych czynów muszą być surowo karani\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była bardzo zła i krótkowzroczna decyzja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciężko pracował i nakreślił wady i problemy związane z teledetekcją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nie do zaakceptowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rola parlamentów, krajowych bądź Parlamentu Europejskiego, jest w demokracji niezmiernie ważna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasza polityka dotycząca zdrowia macierzyńskiego w krajach rozwijających się zawodzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doceniam pani dobrą wolę i determinację w udzielaniu zwięzłych odpowiedzi na nasze pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Irlandia, prawdopodobnie nie opracują programów informacyjnych, jeżeli handel nie wykaże zainteresowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrażenie \\\"sprawozdanie z własnej inicjatywy\\\" nie jest w pełni trafne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie sposób się z tym nie zgodzić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę dodać tu nic więcej, niż powiedziałem w pierwszym wystąpieniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymieniliśmy informacje w sprawie naszych celów i strategii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolność sumienia jest niewątpliwie wolnością o istotnym znaczeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie moje największe obawy budzi zakres bieżących informacji przekazywanych tej Izbie, a dotyczących rokowań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale teraz musimy się przyjrzeć sytuacji po roku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.964,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowaliśmy za odrzuceniem całego sprawozdania i wnioskujemy o gruntowny przegląd całego wniosku legislacyjnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomoże to nam uwzględnić kolejne opinie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zadanie Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacny to pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła pani o odpowiedzialności państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inne środki będą dotyczyły państwa portu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Decydenci europejskiej polityki fiskalnej i monetarnej muszą być na to przygotowani\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy jasnych zasad regulujących systemy premii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewątpliwie produkcja rolna odgrywa tutaj zasadniczą rolę, ale istnieje w tej sferze wiele rozwiązań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako że nie mam wiele czasu, podam tylko jeden przykład\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytyczne dla polityki zatrudnienia państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prześladuje się mniejszości, zwłaszcza bahaitów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie pragnę podziękować wszystkim kolegom posłom, z którymi pracowałem przy opracowywaniu przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zjednoczmy się, by powstrzymać w Europie handel ludźmi, który jest nowoczesną formą niewolnictwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem sprawozdawcą komisji opiniodawczej Komisji Rolnictwa i Rozwoju Wsi w sprawie przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście migracja jest jednym z największych problemów współczesnej Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz mówią państwo, że musimy działać, a nie rozmawiać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedłem piechotą „pleny”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj zadał pan trzy wyraźne pytania i odpowiem na nie po kolei\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludziom się to nie podobało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odbieramy przedstawione sprawozdanie pozytywnie, choć zawiera ono kilka punktów, z którymi się nie zgadzamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście mój głos był w znacznym stopniu umotywowany przez niektóre z nich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowa rezolucja jest ważna, a my mamy swoje własne poglądy na jej temat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Presja windowania kosztów osłabia rynki na całym świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Tchórze,“ mruknął szyderczo Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto wielki wór słomy na drewnianych kołkach, z ogonem z powróseł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak pozwolę sobie dodać trzy komentarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezakłócona współpraca między Unią Europejską a Radą Europy jest niezwykle ważna dla powodzenia Agencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak wśród obywateli panuje błędne przekonanie co do naszych przychodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W skład pakietu wchodzi sześć wniosków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że w sprawozdaniu uwzględnione zostały również te fakty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Logika strefy Schengen pozostaje niezmienna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38572688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosuję za przyjęciem całego zestawu środków i propozycji przedstawionych w przedmiotowym sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zaprosić pana do wspólnego udziału w takim oto konkursie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo rozumiem, czemu dziś okazujemy zaniepokojenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego krzesło było puste, ponieważ rząd kubański nie zezwoliłby mu na powrót do domu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy rzecz jasna respektować pańskie decyzje, panie przewodniczący, lecz uznałem moje uwagi za konieczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Instytucja ta opowiada się po stronie innych antydemokratycznych imperiów, a nie wolnych narodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liga Arabska omówi sprawę strefy zakazu lotów w sobotę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"to najgorsza opcja, jeśli nie liczyć wszystkich innych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnią rzeczą, jaką podatnicy mają prawo mieć zagwarantowane, jest pomoc państwa dla linii lotniczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po przejęciu Fabryki Broni w Radomiu Niemcy kontynuowali produkcję Visa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się tyczy zasobów, będę upierała się przy elastyczności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Międzynarodowe koncerny wymagają coraz więcej zysku z badań naukowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"to narody i państwa powinny decydować o swoich priorytetach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Turcja uważa się za najwyższą władzę narodu tureckiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wręcz przeciwnie, stanowią one punkt wyjścia do dalszej analizy i poprawiania przepisów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wbrew niektórym doniesieniom mediów dyrektywa dotyczy tylko produktów leczniczych wydawanych na receptę lekarską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest sedno zagadki, z którą mamy do czynienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym wspólnym celem jest sprawienie, aby transport drogowy był bardziej wydajny i zrównoważony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdecydowanie zagłosowałem za przyjęciem przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że uda nam się go zrealizować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, i co istotniejsze, mamy już dość!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się nam, że potrzebujemy większych kompetencji europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ono oznacza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele przedstawionych w nim propozycji pokrywa się z różnymi innymi inicjatywami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast zabronić tej praktyki, rząd Malezji zachęca do jej stosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znamy zasięgu, w jakim dopuszczalne będzie ustanawianie krajowych wymagań w zakresie jakości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie tak, jak zechcesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak możemy poradzić sobie z tym problemem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.9,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto zmiana kryteriów wyłączeń uwzględnia skutki społeczno-gospodarcze związane z ochroną zdrowia i środowiska naturalnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament ma tylko jedną siedzibę i tą siedzibą jest Strasburg\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie uda się rozwiązać problemu za pomocą prostego sloganu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Somalia stała się obszarem konfliktu, żeby nie powiedzieć piekła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska musi stanąć na czele akcji niesienia wsparcia i pomocy ludności Haiti\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że teraz potrzebujemy działań, a nie kolejnych uwag\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że jest to naprawdę potrzebne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże jeżeli rozmawia się z inwestorami, stale powtarzają oni to samo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wiąże się z przedmiotem badań i innowacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakwestionował przy okazji też cyfry, jeżeli chodzi o ilość ofiar holocaustu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawarliśmy umowę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednym ze sposobów osiągnięcia tego drugiego jest dobre zarządzanie lasami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Decyzja wynika często z kontekstu kulturowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam nic do dodania na temat kwestii proceduralnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przeciwieństwie do propozycji Komisji jesteśmy za przesunięciem terminu zamknięcia kopalń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.396,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadmierny rozwój gospodarczy, rosnące bezrobocie, ciągłe skargi na zwiększone ceny energii itp\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele miejsca poświęca pan znaczeniu partnerstwa społecznego i to dobrze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zarządzający transportem, jak już wspomniano, odgrywa ważną rolę w dostępie do zatrudnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy nastąpiły zmiany, jeśli chodzi o techniki przetrzymywania i przesłuchiwania więźniów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja będzie również zarządzać dwustronnymi pożyczkami od państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ponownie mamy do czynienia z olbrzymimi wyzwaniami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest na to wyjaśnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37147313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, czego teraz potrzebujemy w odniesieniu do osiągnięcia celów, to zdrowy rozsądek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli Państwo pozwolą, omówię szerzej kilka punktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"emisji pyłów z motorowerów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy Traktat spełnia wymogi z Laeken?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcemy uczestniczyć w procesie negocjacji, ale chcielibyśmy monitorować to, co pani robi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam też, że dyrektywa ramowa być może nie była najlepszym rozwiązaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wcześniej projekt traktatu konstytucyjnego został odrzucony w referendach we Francji i w Holandii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprosiliśmy też o natychmiastowe działanie Trybunał Obrachunkowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zerwać z mentalnością \\\"zrywania czereśni\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.98,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słusznie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto można było zaakceptować większość poprawek, które również zostały przedłożone w duchu porozumienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy współdecydentami, a w tym kontekście współprawodawcami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada nadal analizuje wniosek Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka strategia powinna obejmować pomoc rozwojową i dialog polityczny z tymczasowym rządem federalnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sposobem postępowania jest likwidacja wszelkich barier handlowych, szczególnie w przypadku gospodarek rozwiniętych i wschodzących\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Handel wyrobami przemysłowymi i usługami ma rzeczywści strategiczne znaczenie dla gospodarki europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to doprowadziło do sytuacji, w której znajdujemy się dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedzialność w tej materii jest najważniejsza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam to za realne i aktualne zagrożenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to początek kompromisu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spekulacja zdecydowanie stanowi problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patriarchat całkowicie zawładnął naszymi społeczeństwami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim przypadku Komisja powinna zebrać odpowiednie dane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biednych nie stać na opłacanie lobbystów w Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obowiązujące obecnie rozporządzenie nie jest odpowiednie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, musi ona wzmacniać reformę we wszystkich swoich sektorach i strukturach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczymy na pańskie zdolności polityczne w przygotowaniu reakcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieją obecnie już cztery takie dyrektywy, a projekt kolejnej jest już praktycznie gotowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to tylko i wyłącznie wewnętrzna sprawa Węgier?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze członkostwo Rosji w Światowej Organizacji Handlu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Glukoza i laktoza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten brak informacji budzi nasze zaniepokojenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od wielu lat Parlament Europejski śmiało występował w obronie praw człowieka w Tybecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że wszystkie przemowy prezentują podobne stanowisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym kontekście wymienię choćby ropociągi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę Państwu dziś uczciwie powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zatem podjąć działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze wspólne bezpieczeństwo nie ogranicza się już do obrony przeciw atakiem z zewnątrz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zamierzamy je do tego zobowiązać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wiemy, jest to ostatnia dyktatura w Europie i powinniśmy pokazać pełną solidarność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowanie odbędzie się w trakcie pierwszego posiedzenia w październiku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popieram sprawozdanie, ponieważ daje ono mniejszym przedsiębiorstwom możliwości przyciągnięcia większej liczby klientów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem przeciwko temu rozwiązaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z pańskim kolegą, posłem Verhofstadtem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uznajmy jednak, że może się to zdarzyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego ci trzeba?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uprości to stary system komitologii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"że każdy proces reform jest trudny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co najważniejsze, potrzebujemy przejrzystości, odpowiedzialności i niezależnego nadzoru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prezydent Litwy już odmówił podpisania tej ustawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30497752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Energia odnawialna powinna także przyczynić się do zmniejszenia ubóstwa paliwowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudził się i spojrzał przytomnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jerzy, przytrzymaj chwilę prawe ramię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za szybą ciągnęły się rzędy regałów z książkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opierała się na jego udach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz znać sądzonym było inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochanie, wróciłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekającego najczęściej goni się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jadł śniadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabrali tron, zabrali koronę, a teraz chcieli i mnie zrabować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znów wywołuje, kto jest, kogo nie ma, kto się spóźnił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już się tak nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzięki ci! — wtórowały mrówki chórem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On też był pierwszym i ostatnim rektorem Uniwersytetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał o wspaniałych lokomotywach, które odjeżdżają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czy można było tak zaraz, od razu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rousseau wzywał: powróćmy do natury!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociągnął nosem, węsząc jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ala duża, Ala chce na wojnę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pietrek na folwarku… — martwiła się panna Karolina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec końcem kija zmacał pogięty jak fala kark zwiniętej w kłębek dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chory pokpiwa sobie z lekarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśli: „nareszcie mam ją”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie broniła, milcząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nagłym oburzeniem kopnęła wór, tuż obok na trawie poległy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A przecież panu coś na mnie zależy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Odprowadzę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakaś młoda matka wżerała się w policzki swego rocz nego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzekam, że nie ruszę się z tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był szybki, ale na pewno przemyślany i rozsądny wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mongołowie uczynili to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myję zęby po każdym posiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wypadek na Katowickiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili wszedł Filip zupełnie tak, jakby wchodził po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłem mu się doskonale przyjrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest dziewka, którą miałem przed chwilą tu, na kolanach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Bóg łaskaw — sypiam jak suseł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zestawienie: twórczość — perła, wywołuje mdłości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój pies dostaje smakołyki za robienie sztuczek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy? — Dziś albo jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej o Ewie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana — proszę o bilet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest Kim, a tam są oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy bowiem warunek jednorękiemu, a drugi kulawcowi by nie odpowiadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie jeleń obalił go na ziemię uderzeniem przednich nóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawię się w słowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zamknij okna i zasłoń rolety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie stwierdzono ani śladu czegoś podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nimi piętrzył się las bukowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sposób w jaki Ania opowiada o malowaniu zaintrygował nawet mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc co jest w naczyniu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23343173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Później twarz Rozyny i postać starca zniknęły w mrokach sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23343174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak chłodno i tak specyficznie surowo nie mówił jeszcze nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23343175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co przeszło to przeszło.“ Starałem się czytać w jego oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23343176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem, jak ogłuszony i wciąż czułem na twarzy oddech jej ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23343178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Harmonika urwała swą grę i tylko poświstuje chwilami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23392483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to jest opuszczona boczna wieżyczka greckiego kościoła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23392484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogłoszenia w gazetach: „Wracaj!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23392485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę trwonić swych najlepszych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23392486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wargi podniósł do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23392487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie mogę sobie przypomnieć, czyli mówił gdzie mieszka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23392488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprzód babka, potem matka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23392489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż w świecie może być ważniejsze od wolnej woli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23392490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekkie uczucie zgrozy zakradło się we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23392491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinął na mnie, abym milczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23392492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wiązka zardzewiałych ostróg na spleśniałym rzemieniu i inne na wpół zbutwiałe rupiecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23409995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak tak, jak wówczas miałem świadomość tej twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23409996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest od chwili, gdy zaczęłam myślić“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23409997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan mnie zrozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23409998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może jest ona między nami, ale my nie uważamy jej za rzeczywistą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23409999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostało mi jeszcze dosyć czasu do jutra rana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23410000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od niego zależy postanowić czy za moją radą pójdzie czy nie pójdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23410001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieustannie musiałem myśleć o Rozynie, jak ta nago we fraku tańcowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23410002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z uśmiechem kiwnął głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23410003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może sama powie teraz rozstrzygające słowo i ja będę mógł wszystko jej wyznać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23410004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstrętny zapach wystygłych węgli leżał w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23468846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z radością pobiegłem do drzwi i szarpnąłem je.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23468848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Gdzie serce z czerwonego kamienia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23468851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ściemniaj, przecież Dominik cię tam widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23468852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po minucie wszystko ucichło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23468855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starałem się uniknąć jej wzroku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23535652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nigdy nie można być siebie pewnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23535656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale za każdym razem odrzuciłem precz tą decyzję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23535661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wtedy zwierz popełnił samobójstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23535663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem do koła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23535665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa płynęły z niewidzialnych ust, stawały się żywe i zbliżały się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prosimy kontynuować - będzie pan miał wsparcie Parlamentu Europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Który raz prawa człowieka są bezkarnie poniewierane tuż za wschodnią granicą Unii?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejnym punktem porządku obrad jest debata łączna na temat zagadnienia ubóstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rybołówstwo ma na Litwie głębokie tradycje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejczycy wymagają od Unii Europejskiej reakcji w tak wielu kwestiach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konieczne jest ustalenie priorytetów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazywamy to demokracją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można tego samego powiedzieć o obywatelach Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako sąsiedzi uznalibyśmy przyjęty przez państwa kierunek za słuszny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę podziękować sprawozdawczyni za jej rzeczywiście znakomite i wyczerpujące sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma dla niego innego sposobu na zachowanie resztek godności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz większość z nich ją stosuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja podziela pogląd sprawozdawcy, że istotna jest kontynuacja naszych wysiłków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To niedopuszczalne i naruszałoby zasadę solidarności, którą Unia Europejska uosabia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy także zdać sobie sprawę, że nasz model nie jest dzisiaj jedynym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż by to zliczył!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne mi się wydało, że mam z chłopakami się gonić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starość nie radość, młodość nie wieczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ja muszę jechać, bo mają mi robić operację ślepej kiszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzecim przepisem, który muszę podać, jest płukanie pewnego mojego znajomego dentysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mów, czego żądasz, a wszystko damy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz słuszność, Kamo — przyznałem biorąc ją za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już od lat kilku w lesie przebywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie poczułem do niego obrzydzenie, że tylko splunąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz w takim razie skąd się tu wzięła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaraz, zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynurzymy ją z torby! — rzekł Podlasiak troskliwie i stanowczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zastępowali tego gwarą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I słusznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem położył ołówek i papier przed sobą, co nie było jego zwyczajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz daleka, obca, tak obca, że nie wolno mi na nią patrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogadamy z nią na osobności — rzekł kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy zobaczyłem ją po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz na swoją obronę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeptać będę! — uprzedziła go z uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to kocham cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko oglądał na nowo, jakby dawno nie widziane, jakby na nowo odkrył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Gajowiec — dobrze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło między nami milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto jest twoja myśl o śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszych latach życia nie wolno dziecka oddzielać od matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy chyba raz w życiu odważyła się ostrzej odpowiedzieć ojcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W internecie napisali, że nie testują na zwierzętach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzniosłem tylko okrzyk na cześć naszej skrzydlatej patronki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Półhalucynacje, które były zmieszane z drzewami w parku, z bawiącymi się dziećmi, z ulicami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci wszystkiego dokładnie wyłuszczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej sprawdź to w słowniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W czasie podwieczorku mówiliśmy mało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W każdym razie coś pokrewnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widzieli, jak ją powstrzymać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę mieć spokój i wygodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale kołysała się bez przerwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś wie co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyna wstała, żeby dorobić herbaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piekło w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ta jedna krótka noc blaskiem oblała całą drogę mego życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całkiem innego powodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na naszą korzyść przemawiała jedna okoliczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meduzy nie bieskie i różowe kołysały się jak kwiaty o grubych i miękkich koronach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dziewczęta go znają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle jest marnych żywotów ludzi o wielkim dziele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dymy drgnęły, zakołysały się, skłębiły…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Onanizowałam się na próbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz z nikotyną, alkoholem i wszelkimi «białymi obłędami».\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kamień węgielny organizacji państwowej mieści się w znoszeniu msty rodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz smutek ten „nie do mnie należał”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem stawia na przemian — raz duży, raz mały krok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Źle się stało — szepnął powstając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuwałem nad babunią przez całą noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje mi się, że szkoda mu było na to czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki zręczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz jednak siedział nieruchomo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze nie skończyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe wygięte nozdrza odchylały się przy oddechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie dostrzegam w tym, com powiedział, nic niegrzecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli po obu stronach balonu i pocałowali się ponad nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem; może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdybym był dziewczyną, tobym na pewno był kurwą — pomyślał, ale zaraz wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie wiadomo, czym jest naprawdę: parą, wodą czy lodem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Baron żegnał każdego z osobna, poważnie i surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walkę jednak stoczył on sam jeden, o własnych siłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę zawsze sama, albo z mężczyznami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korytarze są puste, kroki rezonują, jakby szło dziesięciu łudzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocalał guzik i część drutu rozpiętego na parkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko głowa ciążyła okropnie, w skroniach pulsowały głośno tętna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyszedł z sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił, machając dłonią, kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten uścisk symbolizował o wiele więcej niż tylko wzajemną ochronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę! — odparła dość krzykliwie dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadłeś jakiś podwieczorek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąż istotnie ani się nie ruszył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ściany pochylają się nade mną i wyginają, jak widziane przez wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rutyna, panie inspektorze, rutyna zawodowca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zasnąłem?… — wytrzeszczył na mnie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd? Nie wiadomo! — odpowiedział Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rotunda ją prześladuje!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś gdzieś Szymona?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno zapomniana teoria Jamesa-Langego a miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umiał zatrzymywać moczu i zanim zdołano cośkolwiek zrobić, miał mokre majtki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiłował nie wziąć tego na serio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"«Nikogo nie widzi poza nią» — to nie jest tylko powiedzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak przyjemnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mnie! — szepnął jednoręki, który dotąd trwał w zupełnym milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poeto mój, przyszłam do ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widział kto wronie gniazdo na głowie dziewczynki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko w najbliższej przegrodzie coś się poruszyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłącz światło w dużym pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil myślał: — Można od tego zdechnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy są kolejne wybory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Och! — zawołaliśmy jednogłośnie i umilkliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież jest w naszych rękach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spotykali się często.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie ulega wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie pójdzie do niej żebrać o miłość po tamtym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz najbardziej zdumiał go wyraz twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponury, pełen nie spodziewanych blasków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nic w świecie! — krzyknęła, tupiąc nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to idźże jeszcze raz i dobrze poszukaj!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czegóż pan chce więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Neurolog zgasił papierosa — Nie chcesz chodzić do szkoły, prawda? — Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż znalazłem przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto służyć i wyładowywać siłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja chcę czuć pewien opór, pewną walkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się nie ma co się lubi, to się lubi co się ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatoczyłem się tylko jak pijany i poszedłem dalej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oblicza z dwóch stron mej głowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witkiewicz nazywa to napięciem kierunkowym w malarstwie, można domyślić się ładnych ud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyna owych ucieczek pozostała nigdy nie wyjaśnioną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczynać wszystko sprawiedliwie, z Boga i z siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygnać go z granic państwa i nigdy nie puścić z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O ile się nie mylę, jesteśmy starzy znajomi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyć to jest prawie zawsze „żyć”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko dziś nie ma na to czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to ciężka puszka z lanego żelaza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najczęściej jednak gramy dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myśl, że zgubię się w innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu zmiana ról wytrąciła cię z równowagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale twój tato musi mieć kupę pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może nie czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto rozprysnęło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, nie miał żadnej broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo cóż się właściwie z nami stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na miłość boską!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmęczenie po trzech seansach portretowych zniknęło zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był tak mały, że poręcz fotela sięgała dużo wyżej niż jego głowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nich miał niezmierną ochotę pogadać szczerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zamiast zniechęcić, jeszcze bardziej rozpala się w Maciusiu niecierpliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil dziwił się, że Janek tyle mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy umilkli, lecz po chwili rozmowa potoczyła się dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Jak one wyglądają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pi, pi — pokaźna liczba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W takim razie — odpowiedział cicho — poniósłbym porażkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle się od razu dowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryby pływały, wystawiając nad wodę płetwy, widocznie rozkoszując się ciepłem słonecznym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle obudził mnie szelest lekkich kroków poza mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedzcie sami na zdrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale zapłaciliśmy za to drogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Źle się stało — szepnął powstając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz ci coś szepnę, jeno się nachyl, boś za wysoki — odparła dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nie ma sensu przekonywać, tłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil podszedł do Adama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwa zemsta kochanki dosięgła mnie w samo serce…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdzić, co robili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko głowa ciążyła okropnie, w skroniach pulsowały głośno tętna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej ojciec miał tam sklep.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20662112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź szczotkę i mydło i wyszoruj ręce jak należy — mówi mama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszałem jakieś chrzęsty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pędzą jak plewy w wichrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydzielał się z niej zapach pleśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu znalazł szukane miejsce i wskazał mi je.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radca policyjny z nienawiści zszarzał na obliczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś powołany sam przez siebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwracam uwagę pańską, że tym sposobem poprawi pan swoje położenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja tylko chcę spytać o której wracasz z roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeczuwałem; on znajdzie dla niej radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej jasne włosy rozpostarły się przed moim wzrokiem, jak złoty welon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, że jak zostawisz otwartą lodówkę, to wcale się zimniej nie zrobi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"to słabo powiedziane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie podobna wytrzymać tego ciągłego oczekiwania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzkie serce szukało u mnie pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sumie masz mikrofon w kamerce, pewnie zadziała, ale nie zalecam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja to mówię, gdyż bywałam tam często jako dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ją zaciekawi widok zwalonego mostu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to dla mnie okres czasu nieskończony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włosie wydobywało się z krawędzi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My to obaj dobrze wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja chcę tylko dojść do swych pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ależ to rozumiało się samo przez się“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne, jak ten starzec był do nich podobny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zwak, nie opowiesz nam nic więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były to męki raju!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, twarz Rozyny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prezentuj broń!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wkrótce się dowiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę traktować rzecz na zimno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdumiony byłem jego nieświadomą, duchową wrażliwością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ale teraz, panie Pernat, przechodzę do prośby, którą panu chce przedstawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie była to książka, co przemawiała do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprężyny moich czynów i myśli spoczywają w innym zapomnianym bycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy był stary czy młody?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzydziestego czerwca można świętować dzień rozwalania zabawek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wychodzi na jedno.“ „Pan go chce zamordować!“ krzyknąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od niego zależy postanowić czy za moją radą pójdzie czy nie pójdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemy i nieruchomy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz głos, który te widzialne wypowiadał słowa, umarły był i bez echa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz może nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"krzyknął mi radca policyjny w twarz jakieś nazwisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo może pan w to nie wierzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym wybiegł na ulicę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miał on żadnej ozdoby, jak więzienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw zapalić światło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjrzałem mu się, lecz natychmiast cofnąłem swe podejrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23629265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelką formę, którą spostrzegasz, myślisz okiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23632853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wiesz pan, że Golem znów się ukazał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23632854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ściemniaj, przecież Dominik cię tam widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23632855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstrzymałem nawet oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23632856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też kochał je i dumnie ubierał w błyskotki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23632857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"on wszędzie węszy zdradę i nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomagał jej zapiąć biustonosz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest znowu nieznane miasto i obcy zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wchodzi do szkoły podczas lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię — dodałem łagodniej — nie mówmy teraz o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil jest jak dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że rozmowa półsłówkami, którą prowadzili, rozmowa półtonami, była grą wysokiej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby ktoś zapytał mnie, czy jestem patriotą lokalnym, odpowiedziałbym, że tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie możemy iść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I podał Maciusiowi papier, wciąż stojąc na baczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz przejdziemy do ustaleń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostry szum maszyny do strzyżenia trawników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie brak — potwierdził jednoręki, posłusznie biegnąc wzrokiem za dłonią Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za głośno targowali się z babcią o mycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwił się, że gazet nie czytam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walkę jednak stoczył on sam jeden, o własnych siłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jeszcze twoi rodzice nie odjechali? — burknął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ono uprawnione do tego, by zdrowo rosło i rozwijało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę tylko, ale zrobiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki zręczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię spać przy otwartym oknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem wrzód pękł sam bez przecinania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pchał go sanitariusz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc padał śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogłam opierać się dłużej: przyszedłeś jak przeznaczenie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodząc, pułkownik zawołał wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadziliśmy je za uzdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekającego najczęściej goni się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś trochę wyczerpana nerwowo i stąd może przewrażliwiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynalazł dla mnie obalony przez burzę olbrzymi cedr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I one pewnie pierwsze odpadną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech ten brzmiał w uszach Filipa niby krwawa obelga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedne duże, że dwóch może się wozić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znaleźli duży balon sylwestrowy na środku pustej jezdni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może i słyszałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwagi te mogą się wydać niektórym nie na czasie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napisałem drugą książkę: Co lepsze: czy guziki blaszane, czy rogowe?.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięć ulatuje i ludziom chyba nie zależy, żeby pamiętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś powinnam mieć miesiączkę i nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nienormalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądała wtedy tak: cierpiała na zanik nosa na perkato.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Emil komicznie się zachowywał, gdy mu powiedziałam o łące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nicość jest nieskończonością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nachylił się ku niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest takie proste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Markowi, jako najstarszemu, dostało się największe wymyślanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ja będę udawała, że ty nie płaczesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy znalazł się u siebie, położył się natychmiast na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zużyliśmy osiemdziesiąt naboi, rozdzieliliśmy po połowie moją miesięczną rację żywności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc ich tam chyba nie zostawisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W komplecie z tym multimedialnym zestawem komputerowym dostanie Pani głośniczki i kamerę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hugon również na takie rzeczy nie zważał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny był dziewczak — rzekł wreszcie kulawiec i spojrzał na przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22759881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trefle były atutem, rozumiecie teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22759882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem o organizacji tego „Uśmiechniętego“ i miałem tutaj przed sobą praktyczny jej przykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22759883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do rannego, który jęcząc i wzdychając leżał przy ogniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22759884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie dowody, jakich świadków miałem na swoją obronę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22759885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno oznaczyć jego wiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22759996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął i zaczął się uważnie przysłuchiwać memu opowiadaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22759999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodziak z ciebie, wiesz o tym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jak się stąd wydostać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli oni dadzą ognia, Watsonie, to nie wahaj się i pal do nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłem go w namiocie zatopionego nad jakąś mapą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą piliśmy krajowe wino i zabijaliśmy czas, jak się zdarzyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj znajdę z pewnością wszystko, czego mi potrzeba będzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co tu tak śmierdzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ drzwi nie były zamknięte, wsunąłem się tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedłem po niej i ukryłem się wygodnie w sianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem się rozglądać na wszystkie strony, jak tylko oko sięgało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby jego wołania nie usłyszano, z powodu silnego wycia wichru?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem na niem także w Bristolu, ale o tem opowiem panom innym razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pułkownik Stefan Gerard umrze niezwykłą śmiercią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie sprzeciwiaj mu się pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polowanie przelatywało obok mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem tylko rycerzem, ale nie dworakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem się zastanawiać, jak się tu wydostać z beczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dłuto i worki masz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale oczy każdego, nawet cudzoziemca, musiał uderzać ten wzrok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ósmej do dwunastej miałem cztery godziny czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po śmierci matki o ojcu przestał już myśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz należał już do mnie i nie mógł mi się wymknąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22760160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z każdą sekundą zbliżałem się do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę sobie przypomnieć, czym kogo widział tak odpowiedniego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam jestem „bratem“ i znam ich działalność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiałem wyczyścić dane z telefonu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co byłbyś począł w takich samych okolicznościach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarłem zimny pot z czoła, i zacząłem na nowo kuć plany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co do wieku, byli ode mnie starsi, ale pod każdym innym względem młodsi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnij się, bo wyglądasz normalnie jak hobbit!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cyrk, czy coś podobnego, hę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagrywałeś coś na cmentarzu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozsiedli się na meblach i zagarnęli wszystko, co było w mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy powrócę z życiem, do mego wieńca wawrzynowego przybędzie znowu jeden listek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli nie wyruszy natychmiast, będzie musiał pozostać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może polecimy sobie do Londynu, co wy na to?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy ten potwór przyjdzie, będziemy musieli wszyscy trzej zginąć straszną śmiercią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22765677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz co, chyba zostawiłam słuchawki w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27598179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś ministrowe spotykają się w Sztokholmie, by omówić program sztokholmski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27598180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotychczas robi to jedynie Komisja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27598181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie ma siły bez jedności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27598182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podejrzewam, że posiedzenie w Lizbonie nie było spotkaniem, z którego brytyjski premier będzie dumny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27598183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zrobić wszystko dla uproszczenia procedur wdrażających rozwiązania innowacyjne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27598304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W czasie wprowadzania zmian w dyrektywie pojawiło się szereg problemów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27598305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie, dziękuję obywatelom europejskim, będącym świadkami tej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27598306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba zatem w wyraźny i przejrzysty sposób określić obszar zastosowania przedmiotowej dyrektywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27598307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może pani komisarz zechciałaby podjąć tę kwestię w swojej odpowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziliśmy od drzwi do drzwi z pustymi żołądkami i zbieraliśmy podpisy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często używa się wyrażenia „żyje” w innym znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście w tejże chwili nadszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Janek go pocałował w szyję, a raczej musnął ją delikatnie wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinął mi głową i skierował się ku drzwiom mieszkania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak mówię, że przyjdę, to przyjdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mnie się wydaje, że ona wyjechała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łakomym ruchem zgarnął leżące pieniądze i prędko wsunął do kieszeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwienie odmalowało się na twarzy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się pożegnać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienawidzę tego obłudnego frazesu, tego żargonu impotencji…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile lat miała najstarsza osoba na świecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo wysoko ubezpieczony!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed samą wieczerzą wrócili do obozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całą pewnością zarządzono za nami pościg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przyszła już moja paczka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze na miejsce jednego powieszonego stawało do walki dziesięciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucać im przeznaczenia, których treścią byłby czysty przypadek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę ci poza tym donieść, że za miesiąc wychodzi moja epidemiologia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma dziwny rytm ta piosenka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witaj, co mogę dla Ciebie zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odległość między nimi nie zmniejszała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mi zesłał tę nieznajomą kobietę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajrzałem przez wybitą szybę w głąb trzeciej izby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod żadnym pozorem nie trzeba przez kilka dni przyjmować wieczornych zaproszeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o to…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdarzenie, które miało miejsce rok temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że Nowak przepędził popołudnie na gorzkich rozmyślaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystko trzeba po kolei powiedzieć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale są świetnie wycelowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież mi się wargi pokurczą od niechęci! — tłumaczyła się żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to baw się dalej, baw się pojęciami, jak kulkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas rozmowy usłyszałem w sąsiednim pokoju lekkie kroki, szelest szat kobiecych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, ale sprawdzę w internecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął poruszać się niespokojnie na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosił ją na lody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wasza królewska mość raczy się pakować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwila ciszy takiej, że słychać było chrzęst badyla, który się uginał pod ciężarem jaszczurki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie promieniał tak niepospolitą urodą, ani kostiumem ani dowcipem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robiła w tej chwili Hela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to bóg wojny, zjawiający się powtórnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz boli, że kradną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze wstępnego szkicu wnioskuję, że ten komputer będzie wyglądał jak tarka do sera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżynier drżał z niecierpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc czy ja mogę się o coś zapytać? — Możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co tam pojedzie z takimi nowinami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiamy przynależeć dodatkowo do jakiejś mniejszej grupy kulturowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatoczyłem się tylko jak pijany i poszedłem dalej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc chyba śniłem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przylepiać się do niej, zdrabniać jej imię, nazwy części ciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimy w Polsce są trudne dla obywateli gdyż jest ciemno i zimno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bachory pisiały na jezdnię; były wyblakłe, złośliwe i mądre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że trzyletnia debata była bardzo przydatna przy przygotowywaniu podstaw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Składam Państwu wielkie gratulacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie to się zmienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy dziś wspaniałą okazję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska usilnie-popiera pokojowe pojednanie władz chińskich z Dalajlamą i jego przedstawicielami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze ostateczne stanowisko w sprawie zwiększonych dodatków będzie uzależnione od wyników tej oceny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Handel ludźmi to również jedna z najrentowniejszych form działalności organizacji przestępczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawując mandat, w centrum mojej uwagi pozostawały równość płci i prawa kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspomniał pan o swojej matce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak utrzymać nasze miejsca pracy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to jeden z głównych powodów, dla którego poparłem sprawozdanie Csaby Őryego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze względu na osobiste zainteresowanie niecierpliwie czekam na jutrzejsze głosowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska podjęła już własne decyzje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracownicy jednak potrzebują ochrony, a nie forum\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37232404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie musimy podejmować działania w obszarach leżących u podstaw imigracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37257952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sobie dłuższej perspektywy w tej sytuacji nie wyobrażam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37257953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie mamy Partię Odbudowy, która ma swoją gazetę \\\"Liberazione\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37257954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby przetrwać, Europa musi teraz zmienić kierunek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37257955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To podstawowy warunek utrzymania równowagi pomiędzy instytucjami europejskimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37257987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sektor lotnictwa ogólnego pozwala na realizację niezbędnych usług na bardzo różnych obszarach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37257988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Rada przygotowana jest na ocenę tego na podstawie naukowych dowodów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37257989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zwrócić państwa uwagę na dwa bardzo ważne fakty dotyczące przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37257990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem to już w związku z innymi rozporządzeniami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37257991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy brać także pod uwagę popyt rynkowy, a w szczególności siłę nabywczą obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37258007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że istnieją twórcze idee, szczególnie jeżeli chodzi o projekt europejski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37258008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gazpromie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37258009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytyczne mają charakter długoterminowy, podczas gdy wizja wzrostu gospodarczego jest zadaniem rocznym, dotyczącym meritum\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37258010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby projekt mógł się dalej rozwijać potrzeba dalszych wskaźników porównawczych i dalszych uproszczeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37258011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc mówmy, jakie jeszcze dodać dzieciom prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że wszystkie grupy w Parlamencie Europejskim osiągnęły kompromis co do zabezpieczenia tego porozumienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy łączymy się w bólu z poszkodowanymi rodzinami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybiera postać hydry, jest nieludzki, barbarzyński i nieustępliwy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ wynik głosowania powoduje zmianę sprawozdania, proszę o usunięcie mojego nazwiska z dokumentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artykułu tego nie zastosowała jeszcze żadna instytucja Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że dziś musimy postawić sprawę bardzo jasno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.108,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To praktyczne propozycje uproszczenia otoczenia regulacyjnego, fiskalnego oraz finansowego małych i średnich przedsiębiorstw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Użytkowanie nieruchomości w oznaczonym czasie jest formą produktu o charakterze wakacyjnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest rzeczą ważną, byśmy wspierali pracę rzecznika i Komisji Petycji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwraca to uwagę na brak koordynacji pomiędzy instytucjami Wspólnoty a państwami członkowskimiw negocjacjach międzynarodowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie dotyczy komunikatu zatytułowanego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybory działają jak barometr w każdej demokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Darfurze celowa ochrona zbrojna gwarantuje możliwość prowadzenia akcji humanitarnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37269688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli nasze poprawki nie zostaną przyjęte, nie będziemy mogli zagłosować za przyjęciem sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37271702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Początki wspólnot chrześcijańskich na Bliskim Wschodzie sięgają wczesnych lat chrześcijaństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37271703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stabilność finansowa jest warunkiem koniecznym konkurencyjnej i gospodarczo bezpiecznej Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37271704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przystąpiła do Unii dla Śródziemnomorza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37271705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś każdy z was ma władzę w postaci przysługującego wam głosu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37271706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Większa przejrzystość i lepsza komunikacja idą ze sobą w parze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37271712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest, aby Unia Europejska konstruowała swój punkt widzenia właśnie w taki sposób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37271713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz laczki, to wal tego komara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37271714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"System musi być sprawny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37271715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy oczywiście spojrzeć na tę kwestię w długoterminowej perspektywie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37271716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani ekoterroryści, ani sędziowie Europejskiego Trybunału Sprawiedliwości własnych dzieci nie posyłają pod koła tirów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za typy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyją cukierki i czekolada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale przestał, bo po co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Och, och! Nie wiem: mieszka w hotelu \\\"Pod Różą\\\".\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzała poprzez podwórze ku piekarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał w półmroku, bo bał się ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję panu, doktorze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Termin dla mnie niezupełnie jasny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chce czegoś bardzo, tylko narazie nie wie czego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas kolacji, w sali jadalnej, było cicho, bo jedzono kurczęta; to wymagało skupienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Późno już i strażnik wzywa do opuszczenia cmentarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mają po kilkaset metrów długości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadł na ławce, zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest ktoś inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram, mając do pomocy swoje dzikie bestie, był pewny zwycięstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech zobaczą salę balową, wydeptaną przez słonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz za interes?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez szyby dojrzałem wkrótce białe czoło, brwi ciemne, wiśniowe usta…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A teraz poślij no kogo, by mi kupił materiału na turban.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiem, ale szeptem i każdemu na osobności…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza w warunkach tak dla jej zdrowia nieodpowiednich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że nie zgodziłby się tak łatwo na utratę Stachy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż znalazłem przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozsunęli się nieco, ustąpili i Cezary znalazł wolne miejsce na ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczerwienił się, bo uważał, że powiedział to nie potrzebnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę umrzeć, leżąc na tobie, tak, właśnie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dziś — jedzie ze mną w tym samym przedziale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy pojawiła się sprawa szkoły przy torach kolejowych, o której mało osób wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On zauważył, że ona ma często w palcach skurcz naczyń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby wiedzieć jaka kultura tutaj była, jaka gwara była.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieść pełza cicho po lesie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One są jak Bernard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo krótka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiała czuć dotyk rączki wiolonczeli na policzku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Eureka” — ryczał i tańczył biedaczek z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fałszywy to przyjaciel!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem gasi świecę, otwiera okno i wygląda na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre węże łączyły się po kilka naraz w fantastyczne potwory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama musiała je zdobyć w jakiś sprytny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł jej niczym zastąpić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to proroctwo się sprawdziło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę wiedzieć to, czego nie mogę wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączyłem dziesięć przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz uczestniczy w spotkaniach, ale to było dużo, dużo wcześniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Każecie odejść? — pyta się Maciuś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo szybkości przemian widzę to z mikroskopijną dokładnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale chcę się cofnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przyłożyłem ucho do piersi nędzarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt drogo to można okupić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daj odprawę i zbądź kłopotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście w tejże chwili nadszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napięcie w filmie tworzy się na wielu płaszczyznach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy i tak czasu sporo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy w życiu nie widziałem ani tego dziecka, ani jego matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wojownik musi być śmiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ma wisieć, nie utonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chyba zewsząd, bo i leśna jest, i ruczajna, i górska, i wszelaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teorie i plany rozpadają się i czezną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto naraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co kraj, to obyczaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zakotłowało się w głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz jest spokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykułem wszystkie pytania na blachę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałam go, jak miałam sześć lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To co mam zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki wyciągnął z torby kubek blaszany, obejrzał go starannie i schował z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja mówię o czymś zupełnie innym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko niech mnie pan na tej stacji nie pozdrawia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zróbmy lepiej tak: niech każdy rzuci pięć razy do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem podniósł ją cicho i oddalił się bez pożegnania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20785753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz piosenka mi została z ciebie dziś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Używasz menadżera haseł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, czas wracać — przyznała zamyślona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ja jej to wybiję z głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Darowanemu koniowi nie zagląda się w zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest trochę dzikich zwierząt, tylko trzeba wiedzieć, gdzie szukać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"«Nikogo nie widzi poza nią» — to nie jest tylko powiedzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona już spała, a on słuchał, czy oddycha, czy nie umarła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na podwórko już nie wychodzę, tylko czekam, żeby się pauza skończyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciepły wiatr gwizdał między jodłami, które chwiały się i trzeszczały w ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wystarczyło, aby się Emil nią zainteresował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza twa należy do nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę, jak czas przepływa za plecami, jak gdybym leżał nad brzegiem rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odtrącam rękami natrętny pstrokaty łeb, bronię ciała mego od jej dotknięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha! — rzekła Marta z radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawiły się nam humory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poproszę coś na kaszel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cygaro żarzyło się powoli, rozpylając po przedziale obłoczki sinawego dymu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20787292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ty umiesz zawsze uspokoić mnie, Jur!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A drugie trochę starsze, ale też małe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby umiał pan czytać w cudzych duszach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reprodukcja cyfrowa wykonana przez Bibliotekę Narodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ci zależało na tych studiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ej, panie Michale…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytuje mnie, co robi w tej chwili dr Tadeusz Sokołowski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja pierwszy to zauważyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego właśnie przyjemnie się bawić samemu, bez dorosłych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawały się zielonym i spadzistym znijściem do nieskończenie dalekich i na opak wybujałych przeciwświatów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On miał amerykański akcent, a Anna miała australijski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary podział godzin znał na pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli jeszcze w ogóle daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyleczył pana człowiek bez doktorskiego dyplomu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz — tłumaczył, zatrzymując się przede mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20788700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj zrozumieli, że bójka, którą toczyli przed chwilą, stała się już zbyteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno oko tak zbielało, że aż zgasło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwo wyszedł, wyskoczyłem z łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po ich właściwym brzęku znać było, iż bronią zaskarbionych w dębie miodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ci też nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw trzeba będzie powiedzieć mamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nie ma w głowie człowieczków, ale czy nie wszystko jedno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nim ją zabiorą, to Ewa ma za swoje jaki miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam byle robociarz wie więcej od naszego niejednego filaru krytyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba, że tego nie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przystanęli, aby się odsapać i uporządkować bezład uwięzłych w gardle oddechów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgromadzenie Ogólne apeluje do rodziców i indywidualnie do mężczyzn i kobiet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Albo zacznę płakać tak, że nikt mnie uspokoić nie zdoła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczytano jego los.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy nie mógłbyś i ty chodzić do szkoły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłoniła głowę na znak zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie tego cudu zaniedbało się obejrzeć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jest brzyki i niegrzeczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął ją na ramę i pojechali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młodzież nie jest łatwym jury, a ocenia każdy krok i każdy ruch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generał zaś był bez czapki, palił papierosy i patrzył w ogień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocham cię dlatego najprawdopodobniej, bo cierpię z powodu utraconego narcyzmu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty, głupi, może jeszcze myślisz, że rząd chce źle dla robotników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan wie doskonale, jak!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich przyjaźń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stracił całą ochotę na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazywają go Przyjacielem całego świata, a zowią go także Przyjacielem gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawał na przystankach tramwajowych i pomagał wychodzić panom z siwymi brodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nagłym oburzeniem kopnęła wór, tuż obok na trawie poległy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, teraz pójdę, minęła już dziesiąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przymorski obszar Tamizy rozciągał się przed nami jak początek nieskończonego wodnego szlaku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopak był tak zdziwiony, że zapomniał ją sprać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dla mężczyzn życie jest sztuką, gdzie większość z nich zaledwie istnieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To pani pchnęła go w objęcia śmierci, seniora — odpowiedziałem niemal surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu spotkał Anię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pietrek na folwarku… — martwiła się panna Karolina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieraz o tym słyszałem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostał powideł i wrócił do rysowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zatrzymał się, padł na kolana i oczy oburącz zasłonił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sięga się trzeci raz i czwarty — zostaje coraz mniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdę mówiąc, nic nie myślałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za mistrzowska taktyka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bartek odszedł ze swymi wilkami — wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wypadek na Katowickiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiosłował powoli, z odpoczynkami, żeby się nie zmęczyć tak bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To „wnętrzności” boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz co ci to właściwie szkodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy bałwana ulepić, czy wskoczyć z rozmachu obiema nogami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mamo, czy odchodzisz? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę minut po dziewiątej byłem w mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dwanaście, nauczyła się gwizdać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie przyjemnie się wypróbować albo pokazać, że się nie boję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaczęliśmy zstępować ze schodów, śpiewając Bohaterów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chłopcami mało rozmawia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądała najwyżej na lat dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc czemuż się ich obawiać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty, głupi, może jeszcze myślisz, że rząd chce źle dla robotników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co najmniej drugi syn!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do harmonijnego rozwoju swej osobowości dziecko potrzebuje miłości i zrozumienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chory zmarł jeszcze przed jego przybyciem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadł, pił, spał i pracował od świtu do nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem już było miasteczko i kawiarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mógłbyś zagrać? Zagrał go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, panie Andersen!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec zawczasu nachylił się ku dziwożonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie tego cudu zaniedbało się obejrzeć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak myślę — tak wierzę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robiły wrażenie zbytecznego dodatku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ani nie przypuszcza, z kim jedzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trupy leżą na drodze, która mnie od nich dzieli, jak progi kolejowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dymy drgnęły, zakołysały się, skłębiły…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co działo się dotąd, odbywało się jakby przed jakąś kurtyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie zbliżaliśmy się do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakie to piękne, seniora — rzekłem w zamyśleniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwarantuje to chyba dobroć tego opisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw zauważyłem kolbę karabinu, ukrytego na łóżku pod stosem poduszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę minut po dziewiątej byłem w mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ojciec nic o tym nie wie jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok reszta! — krzyknął Podlasiak, podniecony otrzymanym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powtarzam: Niech polityką zajmują się przynajmniej specjaliści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to zarówno dobre dla niej, jak zbawienne dla niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była przyzwyczajona do ukrywania się nawet wtedy, gdy była sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była za piękna, by nie przyznać jej racji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie nauczyli się zabijać swój czas, to znaczy zabijać życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiaków dwóch znałem, a Żegnajty ani jednego — przypomniał sobie nagle jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mogę tam iść? — spytała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłaby trzecia skrobanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pierwszy tydzień zapisywał Maciuś, ile dni jest w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła — odparł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty to rozumiesz, przyjacielu „Mostowy”, i zrobisz, jak ja proszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadek i Danusia pękają ze śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Miała panienka rację — rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie chcę, żebyś był.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młodzież nie jest łatwym jury, a ocenia każdy krok i każdy ruch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapłać mi w dwójnasób, skoro przyjdą pieniądze! — odkrzyknął pisarz poza siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myć się nie chcieli, a w taką wielką wodę lecą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądam w lustrze wygniecioną twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dałby Bóg, żeby z tej głupoty nareszcie wyrosła — westchnął tatuś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odprowadził ją do drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spójrz w oczy moje lśniące!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam inne rzeczy: naukę, pisanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jasnowłosy był jak ty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może instynktem kobiety wyczuła przy nim bliskość anioła śmierci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20659398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie jest lewica, jest prawica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz co to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oswobodziłem siebie i was od hańby — rzekłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dębowy… — szepnął porozumiewawczo do jednorękiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane w ten sposób, żeby on myślał inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwił się, że gazet nie czytam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas mi na Bródno, czas…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O ile się nie mylę, jesteśmy starzy znajomi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nicości wszystko powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan to wszystko może wiedzieć? — zapytał szczerze zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowiła, że się od niego nie odczepi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyczytać to było można z jej oczu, z wyrazu twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram klęczał, odwrócony do nich plecami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza w warunkach tak dla jej zdrowia nieodpowiednich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak śmiesznie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to znany, sławny nawet, śpioch czwartej dywizji ciężkiej artylerii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrazy leżą we mnie zastygłe, wyschnięte jak rośliny w zielniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każde pismo istnieje w pewnym celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co dzień tu przychodzić będę — oświadczył Radek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój pies dostaje smakołyki za robienie sztuczek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego było za wiele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się cieszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nigdy żadnej śmierci nie zrozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biednemu zawsze wiatr w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marek często chodził na piesze wędrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja wiem, że ona nie lubi żadnego ruszania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytuliłem ją do siebie i tak szliśmy czas jakiś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powtarzam: Niech polityką zajmują się przynajmniej specjaliści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładę się znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekanie przyprawiało go zawsze o lekki bół brzucha i potrzebę oddania moczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co się bawisz jeszcze? — W kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się i zawrócił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Połów był przedziwny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko ani słowa, rozumiesz, bo tajemnica służbowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostaje coraz mniej możliwości, szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przestań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nic nie powiedział, jeno ukosem spojrzał na spuchniętą od żądeł lewicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zero szacunku dla wykształconego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ilu was tam jest? — ozwała się niespodzianie dziwożona z wnętrza torby żebraczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale łazienki trzeba też umieć używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem jasno Jego istnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę sobie wyrobić nowy paszport.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się odwlecze to nie uciecze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rycz, bo cię zatłukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie był dobry znak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samotność, wiadomo, jest złym towarzyszem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? W tej chwili zadzwonił telefon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę tak powiedzieć, bo to nie jest prawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był pierwszy dzień przedwiośnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieję tylko dzięki innym, których rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz oto szli znikąd — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomagał jej zapiąć biustonosz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ślepiec — ten, psiawiara, jurny był i nie w ciemię bity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W biały dzień na jawie zdarzały się wypadki niepodobne do wiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak najbardziej uwagę przykuwają długie linki przymocowane do pleców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na podwórko już nie wychodzę, tylko czekam, żeby się pauza skończyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnie wyglądasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sięga się trzeci raz i czwarty — zostaje coraz mniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się pan nie zapomina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech wypije szklankę wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzęta ryją prymitywne kretowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto ma wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział do mnie z zamkniętymi oczami «Przynieś swój pamiętnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kuj żelazo póki gorące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest mistrzynią w sztuce kochania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil ma stosunkowo małego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wolałabym wstrzymać się od wróżby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach tak, teraz rozumiem — to też rodzaj wróżby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czterech fortepianach, w czterech krańcach pensjona tu, ćwiczyli uczniowie Finsena.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazuję ci ciągle moje słabe i bezbronne strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kosz, spadając w koziołkach, wysypał całą swą zawartość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie dobrzy! — jęknął przerażony Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ja nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wystąpienie Rosjan oburzyło władze chińskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę mówić, żeby nie zapeszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciusiowi krew uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, będziemy spali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pytanie jest bezzasadne, proszę pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz częściej zatrzymywał się, bezradnie i z przerażeniem oglądając się wokoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pal ich licho! — odparł koń — Muszę znaleźć tego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz wyczuwał jeszcze pocieszający uścisk dłoni proboszcza, widział jego zasmucone spojrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nim pan przyjechał, ja zawsze wiedziałam, z którego miasta są goście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wrzaskach i płaczu mocno jej się spało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale u wuja czekała na niego dobra nowina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było już koło piątej po południu, gdy otworzyłem ociężałe powieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był poza tym w najwyższym stopniu wstrętny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To pani pchnęła go w objęcia śmierci, seniora — odpowiedziałem niemal surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mieli rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chłopcami mało rozmawia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Komuż to służysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liza zaśmiała się szyderczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęliśmy się spuszczać z góry…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła — odparł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób ich dialogi stawały się coraz mniej zrozumiałe dla otoczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz uciekajmy, dopóki zajęte zbieraniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic się nie stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Organizatorzy starają się podkreślić przede wszystkim świąteczną i rodzinną atmosferę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejdźmy do ruchów ubocznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecał, że będzie przysyłał pieniądze co miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kącie stało składane łóżko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy, jak żywi — idzie wszystko, jak było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była doskonale piękna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan zaczął ją z lekka ruszać i całować, ale był to widać początkujący pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W pogoni za dziewczakiem odbił się zbytnio od ziemi i odleciał bezpowrotnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc jeszcze bardziej je to zachęciło i jeszcze więcej zaczęły dawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę być w oknie pociągu w Rudawie, gdzie będę wsiadała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pracuję nad alternatywnym planem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno wpadł do szuflady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinno być na dziś jeno sześćdziesiąt i cztery!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo całej baczności nie spostrzegłem powrotu nieznajomego myśliwca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sypianie pod dachem wybieliło cię jak migdał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas nam w drogę! — rzekł nagle kulawiec i zajął zwykłe po prawej stronie stanowisko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie zwyczajne „nie”, ani patetyczne, ani ciche, i tym „nie” przywiązała go do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do włączenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała: — Jesteś komediant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radio grało z daleka na pełnym głośniku łzawy szlagier, ohydnie sentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ja zrozumiem, to będę musiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapisałem je, odczytałem na trzeźwo — kompletna bzdura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czymże właściwie było to młode dziewczę dla Brama?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wasze królewskie mości, jeszcze nie koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Balon chodził za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dla niego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozbawieni oparcia, nie opuścili nawet swych miejsc dotychczasowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauka ta jest bezpłatna i obowiązkowa, przynajmniej w zakresie szkoły podstawowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwnie ruch się wzmaga na namacalnie ciemnym podwórzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nachyliłem się i pocałowałem, a on oczy przymrużył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była szczytem kobiecości, jej szczytem i zarazem otchła nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To stało się ideałem mego życia i przysiągłem sobie zostać co najmniej sekretarzem sądu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest mi przykro, gdy się wygłu piasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie ich powiedziało mi wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma co się namyślać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy pełnoletni obywatel, który mieszka w Polsce, musi mieć dowód osobisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbym powiedzieć, czego, ale mi się nie chce myśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodziły koło niego kobiety i, jak komety, ciągnęły za sobą smugi zapachów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieodpowiedni ubiór był powodem przemarznięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jaki niezgrabny, gdy nabierze innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem i nie jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrazy te przeszyły Cezarego do szpiku kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto co znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja bym chciał, żeby wszyscy pamiętali…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co wy jesteście za jedni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek nawet się wyspać nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko, wezwij karetkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa, patrząc na pantofle, zupełnie serio: — Zobaczysz, one się jeszcze zrobią ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął się śmiać histerycznie, Janek zdziwił się, a Pola zbladła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błagać ją o co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedno z podstawowych dzieł starszego okultyzmu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliła się łaskawie pocałować, patrząc na latarnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodziłeś z domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiesz, co czytasz, i nie wiesz, co się dzieje w kinie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Leżymy jeszcze na dnie morza? — Ja tak, a ty nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, obawiam się, że nie mam pojęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łódź leży stosunkowo niedaleko Warszawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem przed willą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krążę uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjął strzelbę z ramienia i podał jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grupki na podwórzu zmieniają się w karawany śmiertelnie przerażonych zwierząt czujących pożar kniei.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien sobie dobrze poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za długo już siedzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ty? — zaśmiała się przekupka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piękny i młodzieńczy, jak ten letni poranek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była robota!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż bardzo lubiła leżeć w łóżku, wstawała od razu i buch do łazienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie chcesz, żeby Sara była twoją mamusią?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym czasie czytał już książki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty robisz zresztą to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówili bezładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwko niemu kierowali wszystkie te straszliwe historie i swój śmiech bezlitosny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smutny, ale spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem przy niej, pojąc oczy harmonią jej ruchów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bywaj, chłopcy, tu do mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A miałeś jakiś wybór?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwą musiała być siła, która przeszła przez ten łachman człowieczy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczynał odczuwać znużenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Premier spotkał się dzisiaj z prezydentem za zamkniętymi drzwiami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To musiało się tak skończyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo krótka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- A czy ktoś jeszcze wiem o tym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi oto w oknie wagonu, uśmiechnięta, szczęśliwa, młoda mężatka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gasiła światło, rozbierała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pański bank raczej nie stoi frontem do klienta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jeśli woli, niech się w torbie prześpi i sił dla nas nabierze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom z lukami, marokański trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądam w lustrze wygniecioną twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedziała, co teraz się z nim stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam ochotę na zupę szczawiową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary głupiec byłby żył zdrowo do tej pory, gdybym był trzeźwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłby może zasnął, gdyby nie powtórne zjawienie się starego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodzi mi o partie górne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pietrek na folwarku… — martwiła się panna Karolina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna noga już jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gotowi są wasi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukałem odpowiednich produktów oznaczonych etykietami, ale ich nie znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jesteś silniejszy niż ci chłopcy, z którymi się bawisz? — Fredek jest słabszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam tu i tu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłoby to dla mnie zbyt pochlebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął nóź kuchenny i podszedł do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Usiądźmy tam na ławce w alei cyprysów — zaproponowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądała wtedy tak: cierpiała na zanik nosa na perkato.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno w żadnym razie zmuszać ani upoważniać do wykonywania jakiegokolwiek zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, przypomniałem sobie to — bąknął Jakub.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podał ją z wyszukaną nonszalancją, oczywiście podnosząc ją momentalnie w dwójnasób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obie strony licytują się w obojętności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś tchórz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosłyszę! — odpowiedział radośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ona mówiła do niego: — Opowiem ci jak to było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzniosłem tylko okrzyk na cześć naszej skrzydlatej patronki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani ma wyjątkowe stanowisko, wyjątkowe przywileje na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwykle początkujący palacze nie palą rano, oszczędzając najlepsze godziny dnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blisko miesiąc byliśmy w niebie, w niebie cudów i marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przebył pan szczęśliwie nader poważną chorobę; wszelkie wzruszenia mogłyby panu zaszkodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20627738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejka, panie łaskawy, wielka rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie nie czuje się na siłach do otwartej walki ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzała go cały rok: wszystkie pieniądze wydawała na maskotki — same koty, tylko jedna małpa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bałam się zawsze, że przyjdą na mnie takie ciężkie chwile…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożar nie jest nawet zabawą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mówiąc już o rozkoszy, którą mi to daje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymać: godzinę, dwie, choćby trzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapraszam pana do tablicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdował tylko swoje ręce i swoje nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyjął watę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to godzina przedwieczorna, milcząca, nieruchoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, jeśli przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój współlokator i jego gość grają w karty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, gdy już wszystko wiadomo… — zaczął uroczyście Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mu się wyśmiewać z ciebie, a sam pójdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrzyła, lekko podnosząc brwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciągła pieszczota pocałunku, pożegnalne zwarcie się spojrzeń… i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyźni krążyli koło prostytutek, jak tokujące gołębie; śmieszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Balon chodził za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyła nauczycielka, ale myśli, że się przyzwyczają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko należy przypisać prądowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spaceruję po lesie, z duszą na ramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zastanów się pan — podjął Filip.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest chyba jakiś grzyb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle zaczęła mówić, szybko i gorączkowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięć ulatuje i ludziom chyba nie zależy, żeby pamiętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To już mój trzeci grill z rzędu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż dystans do Warszawy będzie rósł…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znowu zwyciężał Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś już można powiedzieć, że poniekąd są uzasadnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu, przed nim!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idziemy jutro pograć w kosza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce za szybą i grysik, którym go karmiła służąca Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynie łatwość kombinacji znanych elementów daje niedoświadczonemu pijakowi to złudzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maszyny porosłe włosami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc przeminęła, burza ukoiła się, woda odpłynęła powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzyły nań wary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co roku tu jestem i zawsze mi mało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warszawa jest pięknym miastem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tego śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kanapa, jeśli nie skakać, przetrwa dziesiątki lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noel przerwał kłopotliwe milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie wyłączyłem ten przełącznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pies szczeknął, Maciuś wyrwał zakrwawioną rękę i schował do kieszeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piekielna nuda tego obrazu przeraża mnie dotąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładzie się na łóżko i pyta półserio, ostrożnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do południa — powtórzył — do południa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meteor pędzi pode mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym jest Anna, matka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Andrzej uścisnął mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy szoferzy znali ją już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co powie dyrektorowi? Ze chciałby kogoś zapisać do szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Twoja mamusia powiedziała, że nie będzie cię więcej biła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całą pewnością zarządzono za nami pościg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolę zadać standardowe pytania, a potem po prostu słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest w tej nieszczęśliwej coś niepokojącego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiecie, co jest najsmutniejsze w tej całej sytuacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona spojrzała na niego ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajrzałem przez wybitą szybę w głąb trzeciej izby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on to robi z umysłu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał o wspaniałych lokomotywach, które odjeżdżają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja, choć też nienawykły, całego zająca, patrząc na owe mdłości, schrupałem do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ucieknie! — pocieszał siebie samego jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla zaprzestania palenia trzeba wybrać odpowiednią chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy zbudować drewniany barak dla Maciusia i straży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mam co robić — ciągnęła dalej Mary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem sama, czy ruchy, czy gra działają na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można tu wyczuć pewne jakby stopniowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadaj, a ja zagotuję wodę na herbatę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On wszedł w nią całkiem i ona odczuwała go, jak psy chiczny płód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zło, zdaniem twoim, jest równie wiecznym jak dobro?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę tylko hałas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz jestem już u siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz przypomniał sobie i zapragnął mieć blisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż i wpadliśmy w sedno sprawy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt wszakże nie słuchał już jego rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ilość plastiku którą produkujemy jest zatrważająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mimo wszystko zrobiłabyś tak, jakbyś chciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To stało się ideałem mego życia i przysiągłem sobie zostać co najmniej sekretarzem sądu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały napad pracy, choroba lenistwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobieta rozejrzała się nerwowo i zmrużyła oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekka nieobecność samego siebie w świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przełykać ślinę i zapatrzył się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Seniora — odparłem, tonąc oczyma w jej oczach — jestem panią oczarowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie o czymś głęboko się zamyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było nam śpieszno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cudna kobieta! — pomyślałem, przestępując próg sali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięte powieki błyszczały, jak zrobione z białego metalu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Codziennie niemal przypomina o tym, wysyłając mi na spotkanie Rotundę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tej reguły nie warto już opisywać, tak jest znana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siedzę na dnie i czekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekają panią w niedalekiej przyszłości zawody i niepowodzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gadaj teraz, gdzie się dziewka ukrywa? — zagadnął Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed świtem mróz brał coraz większy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapłaci pan za to karę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki kamień, który ma zastąpić kotwicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze na miejsce jednego powieszonego stawało do walki dziesięciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozorną lub prawdziwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce pod jedną z arkad mostowych zamajaczyły zwłoki ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinał jej suknię, która była łatwa do rozpinania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zapadniętej głęboko twarzy sterczały kości policzkowe ostro, niemiłosiernie, wyzywająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil odczuwał strach i opór przed posuwaniem się dalej, Janek — ani strachu, ani oporu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzwonił długo, bardzo długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie te środki wypróbował autor osobiście ze znakomitym skutkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jadła, chudła z dnia na dzień, a nie sypiała wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewyobrażalne cierpienie konającej nastolatki miało być zadośćuczynieniem za \\\"splamienie honoru\\\" rodziny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawda, że nadal musimy koncentrować naszą politykę na kwestiach zapobiegania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy otwartości w negocjacjach w sprawie Acta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak właśnie wygląda sytuacja społeczna w Tunezji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejskim politykom należy uświadomić fakt, że premierzy często błędnie nazywają to reformą instytucjonalną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście pozostaje jeszcze straszliwy problem przemocy wobec kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest dwóch Kłyczków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chorwacja ma nadal wiele do zrobienia w dziedzinie reformy systemu prawnego czy procedur sądowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego jest to podsektor potrzebujący wsparcia i rozsądnej regulacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rządy muszą pracować w oparciu o ten rezultat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W imieniu mojej grupy pragnę przedstawić poprawkę ustną do omawianego punktu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W chwili obecnej między tymi państwami członkowskimi działa połączenie typu ro-ro\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym w tym miejscu gorąco pogratulować panu komisarzowi Kallasowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę udzielić odpowiedzi w oparciu o moje rozeznanie w sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, uwolnienie wszystkich arbitralnie aresztowanych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aczkolwiek w ten sposób, podzieleni narodowymi egoizmami przegrywamy z ofensywą energetyczną Gazpromu w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ograniczenie zakupów interwencyjnych oraz zniesienie kwot mlecznych spowodowałoby większe wahania rynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie działania zamierza pan podjąć dla obrony euro podczas prezydencji czeskiej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wcześniej traktat konstytucyjny został odrzucony w referendach we Francji i w Holandii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż nie zgadzamy się z niektórymi aspektami zawartymi w sprawozdaniu i jesteśmy im przeciwni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego powodu przedmiotowe propozycje są właściwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wręcz przeciwnie, czujemy, że znajdujemy się w sercu problemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszą być po prostu odpowiednio finansowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezolucja ta zawiera jednoznaczne przesłanie do Komisji oraz państw trzecich, dlatego ją popieram\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotne są zalecenia zawarte w omawianym sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście jednak Hiszpania uznaje ten nakaz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego część musi zatem pochodzić z rozwiązań rynkowych, ale pozostała część z inwestycji publicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska zrodziła się cieniu dwóch reżimów totalitarnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę również przypomnieć zasadę szczerej współpracy określoną w Traktacie o funkcjonowaniu Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wstydźcie się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu nie popierają Państwo, tu i teraz, zaproponowanych rozwiązań?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Źle to świadczy o jedności Europy w kontekście tego ważnego wydarzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyznaję, że na początku tej debaty byłem sceptyczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rejestr ten musi się stać dynamicznym instrumentem, poddawanym corocznej ocenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wraz z moimi kolegami witam tu dziś pana premiera\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wielkie zwycięstwo europejskich socjalistów popieranych przez związki zawodowe jest zwycięstwem wszystkich Europejczyków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak nadal być nie może, ponieważ dziś spajają nas nie tylko zasady gospodarcze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten pakiet stanowi szansę dla Europy, by zaprezentowała się z jak najlepszej strony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tych czasach kryzysu nasi obywatele oczekują wiele od Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odnotowywane obecnie na świecie schematy podróżowania oznaczają, że choroba jest zawsze blisko nas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to zalecenie i dlatego jest dobrowolne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my powinniśmy być dumni z naszych osiągnięć w naszej demokratycznej Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wyciągnąć Europę z kryzysu, w którym się znalazła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj jest to islamska opinia publiczna, która znacznie wykracza poza granice państw arabskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla każdego z nich musimy potrafić zdefiniować czynniki sukcesu i potencjał możliwości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan prezydent Klaus musi przyjąć tę historyczną odpowiedzialność i podpisać traktat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To moja pierwsza uwaga\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstrzymałam się od głosowania nad tym wieloznacznym ustępem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc, dla jakich zasad, jakich wartości, jakich względów można zakwestionować władzę rynku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisarz Špidla nie może rozwiązać tej sprawy samodzielnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewnianie ochrony tego prawa jest tak samo istotne jak sądowe uregulowanie tej sprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy szybciej i mądrzej podejść do tego, w jaki sposób to robimy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27112937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doskonale włada Pan językiem francuskim i dobrze zna pan mój kraj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy klął w skrytości serca tych dwu, którzy odeszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż ludzie na to powiedzą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” — Tak, gra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wstyd ci to przed ludźmi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach! Zosiu, ach Zosieńko, jak mi niewygodnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant obracał go w wielkich swoich palcach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dowaliłeś się do jakiejś dziewczyny? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż uczyni, kiedy ja…?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieli nas od niego ogrmona przestrzeń Egiptu i cała Nubia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbudowany jest z prekambryjskich gnejsów, wznosi się piramidalnie ponad płaskowyżem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zosia myślała, że śpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyźnie i naczelnikowi karawany nie wypadało płakać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A z tym fotografem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak niegdyś Staś ze lwem, tak teraz tych dwoje stało naprzeciw siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ze mną z Komendy Wojewódzkiej w Opolu aspirant Seweryniak. Chodźcie Seweryniak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy przy ognisku rozpoczęła się następująca rozmowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż się dowiedziałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczył, że Józia jest ubrana do wyjścia, ale siedzi na stołku i płacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak dojechać z Poznania do Katowic?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wsadził głębiej, językiem jak młynkiem obracał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłosierny ponad wszelkie rozumienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Es” był pierwszym asystentem i miał dyżur tej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostanie również prawdziwy angielski sztucer i wszelkie potrzebne dla myśliwego przybory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczucie odpowiedzialności nakazuje podjąć natychmiastowe kroki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Żebyś wiedział, że święto! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta ciekawość, połączona z lękiem, pociągnęła wzrok Sary w jej stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego musiał być oddany wcześniej, niż nam to powiedziano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyprowadź ją tutaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aczkolwiek zwięzły w swych początkach staje się ku końcowi gadatliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21155880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Kot chodzi cicho, bo może pazury wsuwać między poduszki łapek”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziała przy ogniu w sypialni w swoim szlafroku, z głową wspartą na rękach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upadek Chartumu i śmierć Gordona każą ludziom zapomnieć o wszystkim innym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urok psuły mu jedynie chwile, w których musiał się kłaniać spotykanym kobietom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod koniec obiadu Staś jął wypytywać, dlaczego rząd egipski zabrał wszystkie kraje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka kroków zaledwie dzieliło ich od łuczników majstra Piotra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była godzina dziesiąta, a deszcz lał strumieniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do czego chcesz je wykorzystać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kobieta uczy się z łatwością robót ręcznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz całuje synka i wychodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli, jak zmokłe ptaki, na gałęzi, nasłuchując, co się dzieje na dole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, po co miałby zostawiać ślady?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyrzeknijcie mi natychmiast!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz zadumani przyjaciele nie słyszeli dalekich okrzyków zapodzianego w niebiosach upiora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Służący przyniósłszy ciało, złożyli je w chacie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ptak, nie ptak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Góra z górą się nie zejdą, ale przyjaciel z przyjacielem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Funkcjonalności obsługi przejścia dozorowanego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak i młynarz nie zauważył nawet, że potknął się o koty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozum, Aniu, że ja so bie sam wyjaśniam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem, znajdzie się i dla nas czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stasiowi, który wysłuchał dokładnie całej tej rozmowy, zabłysnął promyk nadziei.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale spać nie mogła — choć przemocą zamykała oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była bardzo wzburzoną, drżała cała, ale nie próbowała zejść na dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mówmy o czymś innym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrobię ci trzy pary skarpetek z najlepszej wełny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On by chciał, żebyśmy czekali tysiąc lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczuł strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Najbliższa zginęła od bolszewików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem bogiem, a bóg jest mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz się ścigać z tramwajem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mnie się wydaje, że ona wyjechała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku pracować mi zbrzydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnajta — odpowiedział kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pomieszczeniu rozległ się lekki pomruk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrozumiesz w toku akcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze znużenia i z ciągłego napięcia nerwów dostałem ataku nerwowej febry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mu się wyśmiewać z ciebie, a sam pójdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do gardła można mu zajrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdy nie kochamy, doznajemy spokoju i możemy grzać się w słońcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów, Tereso, w dziewczynę się zmień!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu tych czterech dni odeszła przedostatnia fala moich czytelników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz Andrzej nie dowierzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział krótki, urwany śmiech kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po ich właściwym brzęku znać było, iż bronią zaskarbionych w dębie miodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc padał śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pracowity jak pszczoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem sama, czy ruchy, czy gra działają na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie, mój synku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I kolega Adama, Stach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani pozwala na bójki podczas lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, byłem zaślepiony i nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale straszne było przebudzenie z upojeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech sprawdza! — zaprzeczył odważnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daremne byłoby usiłowanie spać w noc taką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi i weszła matka Emila, mówiąc: — Jak ładnie grasz dzisiaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To najpiękniejsza rzecz w całych Włoszech\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrzyła, lekko podnosząc brwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniej więcej o jedenastej wieczorem Emil przynosił ciąg dalszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkanie Pawła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20668441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Królu, proszę o turniej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawiązała sobie na ręku niebieską tasiemkę dla pamięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno przyjmować do pracy zarobkowej przed osiągnięciem odpowiedniego, minimalnego wieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy spostrzegł wystającą z wewnętrznej kieszeni jego żakietu fotografię Stachy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obok inna tarcza z lwem rozkraczonym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem; może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie zbliżaliśmy się do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechaj będzie wielkim wezyrem i niech zarządza moim królestwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza twa należy do nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, jakby ich w ogóle nie słyszała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę prosić o powtórzenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co? — Idź, przyprowadź mamę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chyba zewsząd, bo i leśna jest, i ruczajna, i górska, i wszelaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary musiał przyznać, że jest sens w tych wywodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynurzymy ją z torby! — rzekł Podlasiak troskliwie i stanowczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy się ciotka w końcu zorientowała, powiedziała: — Emilku, przyjdźcie do mnie z mamusią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy są kolejne wybory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz oświadczył, że to apopleksja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego włóczysz się koło tego domu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawe, co z tego wyniknie!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tych wrażeń żadne nie robi specjalnej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszno ci w torbie? — spytał ze współczuciem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milcząc, pobiegli we wskazanym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nic nie poradzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie udawał, że ma coś załatwić w gabinecie dyrektora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy rozpoczyna się życie z kapitału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram usłyszał wołanie, nie przystanął jednak, tylko przyspieszył jeszcze bieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem bardzo zmęczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawiły się nam humory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na moim łóżku i siedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy seniora ma gości? — zapytałem go niechętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak głęboko weszła w swój trans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Eee, już znamy, już wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś znowu szedł, więc Cezary ociężale powrócił do swej łopaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była wstawka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Depesza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak najbardziej uwagę przykuwają długie linki przymocowane do pleców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz słuszność, Kamo — przyznałem biorąc ją za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie powinny nosić krótsze od innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc pieniędzy nie przyjęła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz mógł dokładnie spojrzeć jej w dotąd półmrokiem nocy zakrytą twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włazić w skórę innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kosz, spadając w koziołkach, wysypał całą swą zawartość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idiota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się cieszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym przy stosunku zachowuje się też dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięta doskonale: kiedyś przeziębił się — przyszło zapalenie płuc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy kochamy kobiety, jest to dobre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, jakże się jasnemu panu wędrowało w powietrzu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W internecie napisali, że nie testują na zwierzętach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznali się w konserwatorium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi z trud nością przyszło wypowiadanie pewnych słów w obecności dyrektora i wychowawcy klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kamień węgielny organizacji państwowej mieści się w znoszeniu msty rodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż chce, abyś mu dał schronienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie zabrzmiała trąbka i pociąg ruszył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona klęka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pal ich licho! — odparł koń — Muszę znaleźć tego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem i na drugim posterunku także wszystko było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz w takim razie skąd się tu wzięła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie trzeba mi było pozwalać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za mało się znamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogadamy z nią na osobności — rzekł kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech pan lepiej to czyta, bo są czyste przynajmniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykała się na klucz w małym pokoju, który sobie wywalczyła po wielu awanturach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile razy przychodziłem do niej, matka jej głaskała mnie po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wzruszyła ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ja panu coś powiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na kogo idzie, to idzie, a trafi w sam carat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla niej ta rozmowa była skończona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co właściwie stanęło na przeszkodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wierzę w nią ani trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa nie miała trzech duchowych ojców ani biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miało to oznaczać, że Bartek wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jednak słyszeli, jak nadchodziła bona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj, aż on wróci na spoczynek… a potem: jeden celny strzał!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Plaże nad Bałtykiem latem są pełne Polaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie promieniał tak niepospolitą urodą, ani kostiumem ani dowcipem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może o dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że nie jesteś już normalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim odepchnął je na chybił trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokój! — wołał z uniesieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc ich tam chyba nie zostawisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy mu się marsz pogrzebowy, był to bowiem wojownik nieustraszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki idiotyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali towarzysze stanęli mu po bokach gwoli przecięcia możliwej ucieczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz nas obejrzyj, dziewulinko płochliwa! — szepnął nieśmiało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przespałeś bez mała całą dobę, młody smyku — brzmiało powitanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapach bije spod podłogi, bo to jest szczytowa ściana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z łomocącym głośno sercem zapytałem sługę, czy panienka w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zdziwiło mnie, że pierwszy raz płacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest gładki, okrągły, ubiera się pięknie i nie ma żadnych trosk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zwariowałaś”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy grasz? — Trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem uspokoiłem się trochę i spróbowałem rzecz rozważyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tekst opracowany na podstawie: Antoni Lange, W czwartym wymiarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstydziłam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo być nadal chłopcem na posyłki — i czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak myślicie, czy on mnie pamięta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za przypuszczenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest jej kuzynem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór dębowy połapał się od razu w swym nowym na ziemi stanowisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam do powiedzenia o tej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają zdolności organizacyjnych i dlatego nie potrafią organizować rzezi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko mnie powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz i ja zauważyłem zmiany u niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Codziennie niemal przypomina o tym, wysyłając mi na spotkanie Rotundę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcieliśmy go najpierw obudzić, żebyśmy mogli porozmawiać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dominującą religią w Polsce jest katolicyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała historia zaczęła się niewinnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego z przodu idzie dwóch, a z tyłu czterech?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz więcej gorąca napływało mu do twarzy i zasłaniało oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty nie jesteś moją matką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko przyswoję sobie biegłość w pisaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz szedłem powoli, umyślnie zwolniwszy kroku, by się wewnętrznie opanować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil uczył ją grać na fortepianie, bo była muzykalna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go niezdecydowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawał na przystankach tramwajowych i pomagał wychodzić panom z siwymi brodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem o tym i nie do was mówię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest chyba jakiś grzyb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odprowadził ją do drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem do miłego widzenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że umiem niektóre rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaleca się udzielanie pomocy finansowej, państwowej lub innej, wielodzietnym rodzinom na utrzymanie dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąży do szczęścia i czasem jest szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś kiedyś tego człowieka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani pozwala na bójki podczas lekcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz jest rozkosz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż ty takiego wyrabiasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to Zuzia nie przychodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc powiedz, co chcesz uczynić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem się na krzesełko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.124,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożar w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pani Wąsowska nie zachwycała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tuż obok na stole stała butelka białego wina i opróżniona do połowy szklanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Za nic w świecie nie chciałbym tam pójść, protestował zezowaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie dawaj, bo jak będę musiał przerwać proces, wszystko zmarnieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy wzięłyście ładne chusteczki do nosa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda dziewucha mnie pana wskaże!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy skończyłem jedenaście czy dwanaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina pierwsza trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ósmej do dwunastej miałem cztery godziny czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uprzedziłeś tylko moje chęci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pewnością ona“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród tłumu zbudził się szalony zapał dla Wokulskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrenuję sobie cardio i może stracę pare kilo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc niewiadomo, czem jest naprawdę: parą, wodą czy lodem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dochód po potrąceniu wydatków przeznaczony był dla zwycięzcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozważałem rozmaite plany, ale sądzę, iż wybrałem najlepszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co za myśl!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25321446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pod kim dołki kopie, ten sam w nie wpada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25328710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Widzę, że cię to nudzi, ale przedtem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25328713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cicho być, nagrywam podcast.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25929801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podjęto działania mające na celu reformę Banku Światowego, ale od tego czasu upłynęły dziesięciolecia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25929817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można więc powiedzieć, że Rada po raz kolejny nie przedstawia właściwych dokumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25929833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważna jest tu też przyszła współpraca z parlamentami krajowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25929834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko kiedy taka współpraca była w tak oczywisty sposób korzystna dla całego świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25929835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostępność energii ma znaczenie kluczowe dla życia gospodarczego i społecznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25929840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Referendum irlandzkie stało się zwycięstwem Irlandii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25929852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaki sposób możemy zwiększyć efektywność indywidualnych środków transportu i ich łączenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pańska prośba jest teraz spóźniona, więc z całą pewnością nie będzie uchwały\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieliśmy okazję wysłuchać w tej Izbie osób negujących zmiany klimatyczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na piśmie - Głosowałem za przyjęciem tego ważnego dokumentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To bardzo dobrze, ponieważ klimat nigdy nie przestał być przedmiotem debaty naukowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z postulatami zawartymi w przedmiotowym projekcie rezolucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że nasze obowiązki w tej kwestii dzielą się na trzy rodzaje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdzaliśmy tę kwestię już wcześniej w kontekście zagadnienia dotyczącego prawa głosu z pożyczonych akcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te kraje, które pozostały poza granicami strefy euro, ucierpiały bardziej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele koleżanek i kolegów posłów omówiło już szczegóły\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"podobnie jak grupa innych posłów podpisałem protest przeciwko wykluczeniu Bośni i Hercegowiny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To są ci sami ludzie, którzy walczą w obronie rządów prawa i demokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie środki Komisja planuje przyjąć w tej kwestii?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjemy obok siebie i musimy siebie przynajmniej akceptować, aby zlikwidować zjawisko wykluczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie wiele osób podniosło kwestię zarządzania kryzysowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Indiach nadal rośnie liczba chrześcijańskich męczenników, w okrutny sposób mordowanych przez hinduistycznych oprawców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konkurencja potrzebuje ludzi, którzy mogą i chcą przyjąć na siebie odpowiedzialność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem mamy przepisy dotyczące samochodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę jego jednego oni się boją!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leszczyna, którą bór był poszyty, pokryła się jasną zielenią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłam jedną z osób, które krytykowały ogromne kwoty pomocy z pieniędzy podatkników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa nie może być nieobecna w obozie Aszraf\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rynkiem zbytu dla produktów powinna być Unia Europejska utrzymująca brak surowców i niektórych wyrobów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy to powiedzieć ludziom, którzy słuchają tej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wniosłem poprawkę, a pozostali wnieśli podobne poprawki sugerujące następujące rozwiązanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37040461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj wchodzi oczywiście w grę temat dzieci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa nie miała trzech duchowych ojców ani biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po lewej, nad brzegiem urwiska, zamajaczył dom — chata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzięła polnego świerszcza i na piersiach skryła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był już wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opatrzyliśmy też tymczasem swoje, na szczęście lekkie rany i trochę wypoczęliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Organizatorzy starają się podkreślić przede wszystkim świąteczną i rodzinną atmosferę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostał powideł i wrócił do rysowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wszystko złoto, co się świeci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu wróciła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie jeleń obalił go na ziemię uderzeniem przednich nóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście im wiek późniejszy, tym bardziej charakter komórek jest inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki potwierdzająco kiwnął dłonią, lecz słowem się nadal nie ozwał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kościół nie identyfikuje się z żadną specjalną formą rządów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nagłym oburzeniem kopnęła wór, tuż obok na trawie poległy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I doskonale tłumaczy sny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była przyzwyczajona do ukrywania się nawet wtedy, gdy była sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem ryk, a potem nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęliśmy się spuszczać z góry…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na pniu, patrzy na mrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A źle ci u nas?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W latarniach, które były wmurowane do bram domów, syczały kaganki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy się umówić, będziemy walczyli przy świadkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W pogoni za dziewczakiem odbił się zbytnio od ziemi i odleciał bezpowrotnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uznałem, iż stanowisko to właśnie mi odpowiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, przez długie lata byłem nieobliczalnie smutną ofiarą nieustannej i niestrudzonej wstydliwości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem gotów oddać je za życie Halszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiłaby teraz wszystko, czego by chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idiota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzenia obecnych skrzyżowały się na purpurowych wargach dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wjechaliśmy w czeluść wodną pomiędzy Wyspą św. Heleny a Ogrodami Publicznymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla niej ta rozmowa była skończona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz szedłem powoli, umyślnie zwolniwszy kroku, by się wewnętrznie opanować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieniądze szczęścia nie dają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można jej było powierzać najtrudniejsze zlecenia i posyłki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic z wykorzystywania sposobności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nagromadzaj przeszkód! — ostrzegł ją zawczasu kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina była spokoju pełna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Którędy do ratusza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona wprost tyje… a niedawno wyglądała jak wygłodzony gawron.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem i na drugim posterunku także wszystko było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miało to oznaczać, że Bartek wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokojówka pomyliła się i zapomniała dać ojcu jedyne miękkie krzesło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracowałem nadgodziny, ze względu na goniące mnie terminy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On czekał, jak prawie zwykłe, na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie poczułem do niego obrzydzenie, że tylko splunąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to idźże jeszcze raz i dobrze poszukaj!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie kupuj mu tyle zabawek, ma ich już dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął w progu, zajrzał w głąb i żachnął się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała filozofia religijna katolicyzmu i cała cywilizacja łacińska oparte są na personalizmie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szary dzień szary dom wyglądał ponuro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wsiedliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To pani pchnęła go w objęcia śmierci, seniora — odpowiedziałem niemal surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli czerwone uszy i byli nie bardzo przytomni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pal ich licho! — odparł koń — Muszę znaleźć tego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejcie oczy dookoła głowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rozumiesz, Jerzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bójcie się śmierci!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka osób rzuciło się nawet w pogoń za zbiegłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile się nie mylę, przeszedł pan dwukrotnie operację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uspokojony nieco tą oczywistością, zaczął się rozbierać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale pozostanie pan chyba na wieczerzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wilka się nie nadaję, nie ten charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko w najbliższej przegrodzie coś się poruszyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan tak dobrze tańczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A chleba nie wyżarła? — spytał znowu kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona myśli: — Wieś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy możemy od razu przejść do konkretnych ustaleń?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co? — Idź, przyprowadź mamę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nawet skończona z pointą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto przed oglądaniem filmu nie czytać, o czym jest film.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki i kulawiec ze czcią na ów sęk teraz spojrzeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli nabierze łaskawy pan rozmachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oby wszystko było dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co słychać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dofinansowano ze środków Ministra Kultury i Dziedzictwa Narodowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież jest w naszych rękach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba przestanę jej słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co znaczy ogień, błyskający z pośród tamtych sosen?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęło tlić się na mnie ubranie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ich włosach rosną wodorosty, w granatowej, połyskującej wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W pogoni za dziewczakiem odbił się zbytnio od ziemi i odleciał bezpowrotnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A miała ta przejażdżka pomiędzy kamienicami szczególny urok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pomogę pamięci — ciągnąłem, poprawiając się na krześle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myślałem nawet, czy są naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan wojenny bywał dla mnie zagadką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciwszy na mnie przelotne spojrzenie, skupił całą swą uwagę na Wieruszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za martwą ciszą równika….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W porządku, dezaktywowałem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On „żyje” z nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykładam mu dziesięć razy dziennie, jak się ma zachowywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A nie zaśpiewasz nam na pożegnanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszycie, jak wołają „hura” w pracowniach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu pożegnali się, umówiła się z nim na jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo, bardzo źle…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas rozmowy usłyszałem w sąsiednim pokoju lekkie kroki, szelest szat kobiecych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był sam; nikt nie przerywał sennego dumania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem na płocie przycupnęła wrona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent miał już otworzony brzuch, w którym było widać tylko żółto- -białą masę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby znał ten dziwny język?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego wieczoru zdarzyło się tak, że Emil odprowadzał Ewę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Potrzebuję nareszcie umyć się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niby — sfora psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko kształty przesuwają się wolno, schodzą i rozchodzą w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy kochamy mężczyzn — wiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż jest wyższego ponad słowo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał wówczas i wyszedł z izby, nie mówiąc ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwiami trzaskają, krzyczą, wiercą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko że ja znacznie ciężej od was!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Albo zacznę płakać tak, że nikt mnie uspokoić nie zdoła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zdziwiło mnie, że pierwszy raz płacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej nie zlezę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są chwile, kiedy Maciuś nie na żarty się gniewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądź zdrowa, moja luba; nie wstawaj, mój paź czeka na mnie w przedpokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leży Maciuś w szpitalu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardziej niż umrzeć, chciałem tylko jednego: żyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Silna wola, to jakby minister wojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest Maciuś królem, bo nie chce, ale za rok może znów zechce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było wszystko, czego się mogłem dowiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drewniany słup na lewo i na prawo koło ściany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym odpocząć trochę, zanim ruszę dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tych słowach wyciągnąłem płaszcz przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pali go złoto ojcowskie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak postawisz piwo, to możemy pogadać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zdaje mi się, że należałoby teraz potańczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamte sarenki były przeurocze, niemal tak, jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski kazał dojechać swemu powozowi bliżej hrabiny i wrócił do pań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na to pani Małgorzata znowu w płacz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejrzała potem z dziesięć stronnic w kajeciku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w dawnej surowości prawidłach wychował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Westchnął Maciuś: strasznie dużo ma do roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy minęła pierwsza chwila gorączki, zaczęła oczekiwać co dalej nastąpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle spojrzał na tor i zobaczył wjeżdżający do szranków powóz hrabiny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świeży wiatr powiewa od rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście mówię wedle monety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"panie Julianie, któż tak mówi?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smutny król przysłał powinszowanie i lunetę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, toby mu zdradziło, gdzie mnie szukać należy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„To zależy“ odrzekł spokojnie, ale jakiś sens był dwuznaczny w jego słowach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"byłam bardzo głupia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle tylko była pod ręką!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułem, jak cała krew spływa mi się w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Teraz jednak chodźmy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem człowiek całe życie, sto lat myślał, potem napisał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jest więc tam gra w piłkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili opanował go nowy atak podejrzliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24991991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzęsy rudowłosych są dla mnie tak wstrętne, jak królicze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24992001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz gdy odpoczęła, trzeba było znowu iść do ciężkich robót.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24992004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę o potwierdzenie, czy dane są zgodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24992005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt mi gorzko pisać o tem wszystkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24992107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żądam zatem milczenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24992109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wiązka zardzewiałych ostróg na spleśniałym rzemieniu i inne na wpół zbutwiałe rupiecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24992112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem znowu moją nieznajomą: mieszka w jednym z domów na tarasie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24992113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jęknął Rzecki, zrywając się z łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24992115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyślałem o zamiłowaniu pomocnika do fotografowania i o ciągłem znikaniu jego w piwnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27422598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej linie te obsługują jedynie niewielką liczbę lotów w Irlandii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27422599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Także nie jest możliwe wynagrodzenie osobom dotkniętym ich cierpienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27422600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dużo powiedziano na temat środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27422601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podziwiam prezydencję francuską za jej zdecydowane przewodnictwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27422602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie dałoby kompletnie nic\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37487014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również i Meksyk zakazał handlu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37487015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożyczyła klubowy komplet czerwonych, aluminiowych zbijaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37487016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie postanowiliśmy także, że karalność zakładać będzie popełnienie czynu niedozwolonego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37487017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trakcie pierwszego wystąpienia mówił Pan przez trzy minuty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37487018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tej sali nie będzie całego kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37487039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym zgłosić jedną uwagę do sprawozdania, sporządzonego przez Antoniosa Trakatelisa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37487040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co więcej, nie zostały za to ani rozliczone, ani ukarane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37487041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schadenfreude, jak mawiają cynicy - to znaczy, że prawdziwą radość sprawiają niepowodzenia innych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37487042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wnikliwość przeprowadzanych kontroli ma zasadnicze znaczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz ta nie żyła i nie myślała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przymknąłem na chwilę olśnione oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechaj będzie wielkim wezyrem i niech zarządza moim królestwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się zmieszał i powiedział: - Mogą być na wszelki wypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz kolana ośmioletniej dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara spostrzegła, że było ich sześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszał jeszcze za sobą zawstydzony głos Filipa: — Przepraszam kolegę na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żelazne wrota blokowały im przejście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biały ogier arabski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłaby wymrzeć w trochę piękniejszych i potężniejszych formach — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drodzy państwo, pozwólcie, że już zacznę wykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To trup — oświadczyłem po chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary już nic nie widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzuszek ma pękaty jak to ziarnko grochu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypominał pilota, który dla marynarza jest wcieleniem tego, co zasługuje na najwyższe zaufanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż to rok mamy teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ufaj też pięknej jasnowłosej osobie, która chwilowo zdołała cię opętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nawet byłem zły i nie podobało mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muzyka i śpiew nieustanny, uczty i igrzyska zapełniały jego życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co tu się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyliśmy ją kołem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak śmiesznie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kanarek wesoło zaśpiewał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec nieraz mi wyjaśniał wszystko, a ja wam to zaraz powtórzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba obmyślić dokładnie, w co się przebierze, co weźmie na drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja ci, Kazik, powiem, jak jestem katolik…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie nauczyli się zabijać swój czas, to znaczy zabijać życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mi się trochę podoba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec w przedziale pierwszym znaleźli zwłoki nieszczęśliwej ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Weź, Felku, ten pierścień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja babcia zaczęła mi wysyłać memy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po zamknięciu pogadanki zbliżył się do mnie pierwszy i przedstawił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruchome masy gadów porcelanowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodatkowo, przypuszczam, że jest zwierzęciem jadowitym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A karmiąc swe dziecię, matka czuje się szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech pan lepiej to czyta, bo są czyste przynajmniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończyło się na gadach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też istota organiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak trzeba, tak być powinno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy odpowiem, że wolę ustrój B, ze względu na moją książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kelner przyniósł lody i trzy grube, okrągłe wafle, we tknięte w usta lodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nie zaprzeczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ślicznie to powiedziałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan wie doskonale, jak!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnięta odruchem ręka chciała wstrzymać wroga, lecz spętana opadła z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozgląda się dzikie wiejskie dziecko po ogromnym mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamstwo ma krótkie nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Komuż to służysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchała z nich wtedy nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nimi piętrzył się las bukowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłuchani w plusk wiosła, rozkoszowaliśmy się w milczeniu żeglugą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem, polecenia ma od najpotężniejszych protektorów — odpowiedział opat stanowczym tonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze mam zrobić cztery zadania matematyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z kim? — Sam albo z Fredkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20806508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, przypomniałem sobie to — bąknął Jakub.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyją naturalnie i — być może — lepiej od mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opanowała nas zaduma i byliśmy zdolni tylko do spokojnego patrzenia przed siebie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale nie będziesz się ze mnie śmiał? Zmieniam glos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dniem i nocą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dużo jest jeszcze nie zbadanych rzeczy na świecie! — szepnął głosem przenikliwym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby tak było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w domu sierot różne były dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłaniałabym się bardziej do tego, żeby na tym, co jest, stworzyć coś lepszego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widzieli, jak ją powstrzymać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto to mógł być? — spytałem zdumiony swego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utopił spojrzenie szalone od gniewu i męki w twarzy rywala…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno mi powiedzieć: — Powieście się, ja chcę żyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A na rachunki przyszedł pan inspektor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powiem, bo nie chcę, żeby mieli przykrości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz z ubraniami na wyrost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Plaże nad Bałtykiem latem są pełne Polaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał, podszedł do okna i zobaczył niebieską mgłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerka co chwilę na elegancki zegarek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wyspach Polinezji istnieje piękna legenda o pochodzeniu śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie, zdaje się być dla niej wrogo usposobionym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwolę na to! — wrzasnął Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli ktoś jest zawsze wesoły, a raz smutny, najbardziej żal wtedy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spór, teoretyczny w swej istocie, zaostrzał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc ja na nowo się urodziłam, na nowo życie rozpoczynam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę i nic nie rozu miem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo chciałem wziąć łódkę i spróbować, czy będę mógł wiosłować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Eureka” — ryczał i tańczył biedaczek z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno wpadł do szuflady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nic nie mówisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co teraz będzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Seniora — odparłem, tonąc oczyma w jej oczach — jestem panią oczarowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Woda jaśniała spokojnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam do powiedzenia o tej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona pokazała język czerwony jak mak i wklęsły jak czółno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O co chodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstydziłam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę mi tylko nieprzyjemnie, że zaczynamy nasze wycieczki od tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na pewno myślał o tym — odrzekł Hal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz się ścigać z tramwajem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak było zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny demon: świadome chcenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynieś no wiadro, Tomaszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad Wisłą standardowo tłumy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tatarak wkrótce zjedzono do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko było po dawnemu zwyczajne, codzienne i przeciętne…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, ta to się będzie złościć, jak mnie zobaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy jeszcze można bez wysiłku zawrócić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały świat się zbroi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahali się chwilę i potem poszli dalej, zostawiając głębokie ślady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jutra wystarczy — oświadczył jednoręki i po namyśle dodał: — Do południa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem tyłek całowała i jadła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma tego złego, co by na dobre nie wyszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęliśmy mówić o tresowanych zwierzętach, co kto widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za dużo to niezdrowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szedł powoli, niby chmura jesienna, a potem usiadł na tronie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tegoż dnia Tybetańczycy opuścili klasztor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bieganina, szepty, słowo: „uciekł, uciekł”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedną mi dłoń wypuśćcie na swobodę! — napierała się, zerkając błagalnie na Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam na ciebie dość długo, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na mnie? No, to odprowadź mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż jakie, zdaniem pańskim, mogą być zamiary takiego psychicznego rekonesansu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi fantazja!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto to jest Bernard? — Bernard to jest nakrapiany pies, który zdechł zeszłe go roku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to jest najwyraźniej w świecie obmierzła twarz konduktora!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem to włączyć, ale było już włączone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ty piłeś wódkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem: pies, który dużo szczeka, nie gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu nagle — już zapomniałeś nawet —- i nagle znalazłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co do mnie mówisz? — pyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, czas wracać — przyznała zamyślona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daj mi odejść, daj mi odejść — prosiła go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz neurolog po raz pierwszy popatrzył na Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Impotent dlatego nie może, ponieważ boi się, że nie będzie mógł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie daj mi znormalnieć, bo to jest śmierć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę się przekonać, kto to taki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimy w Polsce są trudne dla obywateli gdyż jest ciemno i zimno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby obawiało się, że mogę zapomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna zostaje tu na całe życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłuchani w plusk wiosła, rozkoszowaliśmy się w milczeniu żeglugą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie umrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Buruburu, ten stary portier.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama niech nie udaje świętej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Jak one wyglądają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak gdyby nigdy nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zatrzymał się, padł na kolana i oczy oburącz zasłonił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciąża byłaby dla Stelli prawdziwą katastrofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleżanki mi opowiadały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego tylko pożądał: wichru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On doznał wrażenia, że stopy jego puszczają korzonki, że jest wrośnięty w ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarł czoło, zmienił senną pozycję i spojrzał przytomnie po wagonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widział nic, gdyż księżyc skrył się poza chmurą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała zmęczonym głosem: — Muszę jeszcze powtórzyć łacinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadę dzisiaj do kina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to mi się podoba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, już nie kochałem siostry Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najczęściej w lasach przygodnej szukali przystani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze mam zrobić cztery zadania matematyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była własność cudza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty się mylisz, Andrzeju!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szkło się łatwo tłucze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drodzy państwo, pozwólcie, że już zacznę wykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczach rosły niebieskawe jodły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Deformacje rzeczywistości przy wpatrywaniu się w ciemnym pokoju bardzo znaczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak wam się udało zepsuć latarnię? — pyta się Maciuś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie robił z tego tajem nicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siadłszy na kubełku wapna, począł obmyślać fortele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa jest chora na głód świata, ty jesteś chory na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego wieczoru zdarzyło się tak, że Emil odprowadzał Ewę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzmożone uczucia metafizycznego nienasycenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiał sprzątnąć i dostał od nas niezłe wymyślanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiosłował powoli, z odpoczynkami, żeby się nie zmęczyć tak bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drodze mrużył oczy, które wydawały się jak wprawione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uważaj na nogę, Tomasz! — krzyknął Dan z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20757496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wilki ledwo dyszały; Bartek również gonił ostatkiem sił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie moge powiedzieć, że nie mam na nich ochoty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni usiłowali prowadzić z nią rozmowy i udawało im się czasem objąć ją wpół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puk, puk! — pukało dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdzić, co robili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co dwie głowy, to nie jedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I on to zrobił bez prezerwatywy, zresztą mam już miesiączkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawił się, idąc ulicą, jak mu się nudziło, w kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby kózka nie skakała, to by nóżki nie złamał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ramach programu rozwoju bibliotek zakwalifikowaliśmy się do tego projektu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie konduktorzy zauważyli brak jednego z kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upijała się tą swoją „wyższą” muzyką niczym pijak gorzałką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tego właśnie chciałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem sypia u mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z jakiego? — Nie gniewaj się, że będę przykry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z punktu widzenia nawyków codziennych wyglądał niedorzecznie, jak przesadnie wielki zbieg okoliczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bachor wrzeszczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się kręcił, ten garbus, dookoła mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spod odrzuconego w tył kaptura wychyliła się twarzyczka zaczerwieniona ze zmęczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszli do niej i poczuli obaj ostry za pach, jaki wydziela podniecona kobieta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jednak słyszeli, jak nadchodziła bona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A muszą się ukrywać, bo im nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona czekała na to, aż się pożegna, i on wiedział o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytyczne mówiły, że raz ogłoszone pogotowie bojowe nie powinno być odwołane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczyłbyś, jakby cię ona przepraszała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A widzi łaskawy pan, jak mu się język rozwiązał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak my się zawsze wszystkiego wstydzimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żłopią coś w ranach tej czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki rozejrzał się naokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkanie Pawła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spała nigdy skurczona, nigdy na boku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż znowu? — zaprzeczyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrafisz być normalna, dobra? — Potrafię być tylko zła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wy także jesteście książętami i księżniczkami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Opłatek cudzysłowu” należy wziąć w cudzysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jak łykanie śliny, gdy się chce pić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wydajesz mi się przerażona tym wszystkim, moje biedne dziecko! — odezwała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U niej widocznie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cud stał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazywają go Przyjacielem całego świata, a zowią go także Przyjacielem gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, nago.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A źle ci u nas?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę mieć spokój i wygodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem mimowolny dreszcz grozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem taniec słoni… a teraz, już po mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto pieczęć — dar mojego ducha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem gotów oddać je za życie Halszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to zarówno dobre dla niej, jak zbawienne dla niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ty pomóż mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem znów wraca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale będzie wiedzieć i myślę, że osiągnie to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I złączyli się w długim, przeciągłym pocałunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobiegli do rozstaju i znów przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dozorca uderzył batem w ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to trwało może kwadrans: nie całując się, dotykali się nawzajem wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki on śmieszny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy przebiegł go dreszczyk, jak mała mysz, wzdłuż kręgosłupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc tylko dziewką służebną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy się umówić, będziemy walczyli przy świadkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekka nieobecność samego siebie w świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłem w jego gabinecie, urągał mi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z drugiej strony… hm… co się tyczy twojego odejścia stąd…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W uszach dzwoniła wciąż na alarm krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nią nie jest — wie prawie zawsze, co by ją mogło uczynić szczęśliwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Wiesz, to jest ten inteligentny kawaler, który miał ochotę, opowiadałam ci, pocałować mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oj, jak śmieszna jest ta nadęta buzia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem nim też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak jest zima i lato, dzień i noc, sen i czuwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny indyk, nie ma co mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podwiezie mnie pan pod moje mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip na wpół nieprzytomny od dymu, kicha potężnie i budzi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwko niemu kierowali wszystkie te straszliwe historie i swój śmiech bezlitosny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jest to wspaniałe dzieło o którym mówiłaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież wiesz, że nie będziesz jej czytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałem… ale i to jeszcze nastąpi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nas jest zamknięty we własnej nocy, sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różowe koła ze światła i krwi toczyły się jak baletnice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej, dotychczas przykucnięci, powstali nagle z ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cha, cha, cha! — roześmiał się Wierusz, przerywając mi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem i rozmyślałem długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet wolę pójść na nogach niż autobusem pojechać, żeby się z ludźmi nie spotkać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz słyszę już…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale przynajmniej ta pociecha, że nie spotkałam się z diabłami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już nie mogę niczego zmyślać na jawie — rzekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ela patrzyła na niego i nic nie mówiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące kierunków, dziesięć tysięcy niepotrzebnych ruchów, kroków i chwytów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasadę tę stosuje się zarówno w stosunku do dziecka, jak i do jego rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli ktoś jest zawsze wesoły, a raz smutny, najbardziej żal wtedy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mama miała dzwonić, jako koleżanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ustach jego ukazał się lekki uśmiech i pozostał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem w towarzystwie czterech równie zachwyconych tą sytuacją osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo w uśmiechu kobiety czaił się odcień fałszu i okrucieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszli szybko na „ty”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto garść szczegółów zebranych przeze mnie u sąsiadów i znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Teresa — ta prawdziwa — jest w Warszawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona cię przecież kocha, mówisz, mimo że się do tego nie chce przyznać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokuczamy jej czasem, ale dzielna z niej dziewczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odbiliśmy od przystani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnajta — odpowiedział kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ślepiec — ten, psiawiara, jurny był i nie w ciemię bity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak widzicie, trzyma się ściśle prawdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kropka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to się często zdarza?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temperamenty: spala się w każdym zdaniu, napisanym czy wypowiedzianym, i odradza się w następnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy skończyłaś już robotę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20639986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nieważne, czyja będę o tym wiedziała, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ślady nieznajomego wiodły właśnie przez wzgórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadaje mi niemal fizyczny ból.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W porządku, aktywowałem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz sługa nie dała zbić się z tropu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegli żwawo poprzez gąszczary i przesmyki leśne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ty myślisz, że między „chcieć” a „nie chcieć” jest jakaś różnica? Żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszność wisi pod sufitem i kładzie się na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widzę, Saro, że wodzisz oczyma po klasie, zamiast patrzeć w książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mówią o skrzydłach dla ludzkości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39944652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądźmy zatem odpowiedzialni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39944653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysoki sądzie, to jakieś nieporozumienie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39944654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym względzie chciałabym wyrazić wdzięczność dla mojego kolegi Carla Casiniego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39944655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.476,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba także narzędzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39944661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy opracować ogólne ramy europejskie na rzecz ochrony kobiet przed tego rodzaju przemocą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39944662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wyborach prezydenckich Ukraina musi zbliżyć się do Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39971920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekamy zatem, aby się przekonać, czy te nowe środki okażą się przydatniejsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39980759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowiedzieliśmy się, że Laurent Gbagbo na pewno się podda, czemu następnie zaprzeczono\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39980760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chodzi tu o model francuski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39980761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym miesiącu odbędzie się posiedzenie krajowych organów certyfikujących\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39980762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czym tutaj rozmawiamy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39980763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz szczere podziękowania dla posłów i sprawozdawcy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39980764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, ma to związek z moją poprzednią działalnością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39980765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto obywatele, jako konsumenci, bezwzględnie powinni być lepiej informowani\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39980771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet nieliczne kontakty pomiędzy dzieckiem i ojcem napotykały na liczne przeszkody\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39980777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazwałabym je nawet podążaniem w ślepą uliczkę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39980778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma to ważne znaczenie z punktu widzenia zapobiegania wypadkom, zwłaszcza z udziałem jednego pojazdu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zmyślamy faktów, nie jesteśmy mili dla Komisji czy państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę pozwolić mi przedstawić jeszcze kilka krótkich uwag\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kwestii dotyczącej dywersyfikacji dostaw, Komisja ma niewielkie pole do działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Celem połączenia tych czterech dyrektyw jest wzmocnienie rynku wewnętrznego i propagowanie handlu transgranicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tych okolicznościach Rada i rządy centroprawicowe postanowiły ograniczyć szczyt do posiedzenia trojki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zlituj się, niech cię nie zobaczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebo chmurzyło się, ciemność zapadała coraz szybciej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Judym nie stracił przytomności i nie spuścił oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedłożony tekst uwzględnia to zagrożenie i pozostawia operatorom elastyczność wystarczającą do zarządzania sytuacjami kryzysowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg wybiegł na szerokie błonia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem cztery państwa członkowskie wciąż nie korzystają z zasady wzajemności, która została wdrożona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy doktór wchodził, wszystkie oczy patrzały na niego, jakoby ten dzień jesienny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie może być hierarchii dyskryminacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawi ona, że literatura i nauka staną się łatwiej dostępne dla pokolenia cyfrowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalibóg, im więcej patrzę, tem większa ochota do żeniaczki, żeby choć i jutro!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że na tych zmianach w kształceniu zawodowym skorzystają gospodarki wszystkich państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"uproszczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże część pakietu rozczarowuje i nie jest tak wyrazista, jak powinna być\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest problem dotyczący głównie ochrony konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę, zatem podkreślić w szczególności, że jeśli chodzi o Lizbonę to możemy być optymistami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto działania te będą przejściowe i stosowane tylko w krótkim okresie czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tak to się zwykle zdarza roztargnionym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokonałam już formalnego sprostowania, lecz chciałam to oznajmić również i tu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubolewamy nad odrzuceniem wniosków przedłożonych przez naszą grupę, w szczególności o następującym brzmieniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Turcja musi wypełnić następujące zobowiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39992167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym osobiście podziękować Komisji i państwom członkowskim za przywiązywanie dużego znaczenia do prostowania faktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moi koledzy wkrótce przedstawią bardziej szczegółowo wiele z tych kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życzę państwu szczęśliwego Nowego Roku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.124,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ha; dobrzy sobie...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogromnie ważne jest, aby odbyło się to bez obniżenia bezpieczeństwa i higieny pracy pracowników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40007539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Infrastruktura w dziedzinie badań i transportu także stanowi ważną kwestię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tę koncepcję należy obalić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sędziowie krajowi odgrywają istotną rolę gwarantów rządów prawa, także prawa wspólnotowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oby ta kropla była ożywcza, to jest potrzebne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.908,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzućcie mi jałmużnę!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd zatem bierze się ten problem, którego według pana komisarza nie da się zmierzyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Że w nas nad jedną druga dusza płonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie zawiera pewną liczbę punktów, które warto jest poprzeć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy osiągniemy w Europie porozumienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja również pochodzę z Finlandii i wiem, że mamy znakomity system urlopów macierzyńskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nikt tego nie robi, pomimo że szkodliwe działanie tego związku jest ogólnie znane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na wojnę turecką... Na wojnę turecką!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_40024307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę gorąco podziękować za wszystkie cenne uwagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuśćmy, że wsiadłem w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbliższy tydzień upłynął niemal cały na przygotowaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie była nieświadoma tego, na co się naraża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie ci niemiłe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona już spała, a on słuchał, czy oddycha, czy nie umarła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ano, kichnął dwa razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniejsza o to!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli jeszcze w ogóle daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród funkcjonariuszy stacyjnych podobno nastrój dla władz nader nieprzychylny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie są bardzo sceptyczni na ten temat i poniekąd mają rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta śpiewał, król nasłuchiwał, a wszyscy obecni głośno objawiali swój zachwyt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czym marzysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to siedzi we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wierzę, Antoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakimże to sposobem sześćdziesiąt i pięć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wiedzieć, co postanowili moi wrogowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz oświadczył, że to apopleksja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko, mówię ci, albo nie uratuje go już żadna siła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ty umiesz zawsze uspokoić mnie, Jur!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy zostawszy twoją żoną, nie przestałabym cię kochać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zostawił po sobie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja będę musiał powiedzieć: „Mama umarła”, chyba tak? Co? Ona milczała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał wówczas i wyszedł z izby, nie mówiąc ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech żyje rajfurstwo, pośrednictwo do nierządu itd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A widzi łaskawy pan, jak mu się język rozwiązał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między ogródkami działkowymi biegnie wąska ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jaki może mieć ona związek ze śp. mężem seniory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po całym mieście i wypożyczam do niej płyty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale będzie wiedzieć i myślę, że osiągnie to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jednak słyszeli, jak nadchodziła bona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc wbijam okrągłym, niewygodnym i uderzyłem się w palec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dama nie siadała, ale za to zaczęła się śmiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kogo pan szuka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bierzcie czym prędzej siekiery i pędźcie na lewo na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła — odparł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był już wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palto miał rzeczywiście krzywo zapięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- I od mojego przyjazdu nie odgadujesz więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło o białego ogiera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— My nic nie wiemy — mówią dozorcy więzienni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy na dobre zamilkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy jeszcze nie panowała taka wesołość w dziecinnym pokoju Dużej Rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co zobaczył, poza śmiesznością jej pozycji, było dziwne i poniosło go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to mi się podoba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłukli i pieścili ją oboje na przemian; na złość sobie, nawzajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odchyliła ku mnie głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz zarosła już prawie zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem mag ginie w tym wypadku zatruty własnym jadem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tą ziemią, która teraz do nas należy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby obawiało się, że mogę zapomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic, no nic — zagadnął żwawo tamten.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żłopią coś w ranach tej czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze było przed kolacją i nudził się, i przykrzyło mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosłownie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem smutny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz jeszcze zamroczyły się oczy kalifa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi z trud nością przyszło wypowiadanie pewnych słów w obecności dyrektora i wychowawcy klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc pieniędzy nie przyjęła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Podlasiak gdzie? — zapytał z niepokojem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję panu, cudowny lekarzu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci i ryby głosu nie mają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest mi przykro, gdy się wygłu piasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem pewne myśli nadciągają nie wiadomo skąd i dlaczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaatakowała mnie brylantami swych oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką odpowiedź przywieźli gońcy? — zapytałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pożegnanie wręczyła mu swoją gabinetową fotografię, zdjętą przed paru dniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witkiewicz nazywa to napięciem kierunkowym w malarstwie, można domyślić się ładnych ud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliła się łaskawie pocałować, patrząc na latarnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aleś ty pierwszy trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie rosło, aż się w końcu zazieleni…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyja to transkrypcja? — To właściwie wcale nie jest transkrypcja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę sobie wyobrazić, że jest chory, który umrze, jeśli się czegoś nie postanowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo kaptur i czepiec to prawie to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uważaj na nogę, Tomasz! — krzyknął Dan z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie jest podobny innym: nigdy nie widziałem takiego jak on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Impotent dlatego nie może, ponieważ boi się, że nie będzie mógł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W każdym razie spróbuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapisałem je, odczytałem na trzeźwo — kompletna bzdura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewątpliwie jest to zbiorowy kompleks mniejszej war tości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oparcie dla pleców było z czerwonego aksamitu i otoczone złotą lamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż ty takiego wyrabiasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jędrek siedział na koźle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak głęboko wpadł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłabła? — troskał się młody Baryka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzeniem moim byłoby to samo, nad czym pracowali alchemicy: — eliksir młodości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To się tylko tak mówi: „czytam”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba szukać nowej gospody, póki jeszcze brzuszek pełen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie pojadą, gdzie cieplej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór dębowy połapał się od razu w swym nowym na ziemi stanowisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może weź parę dni urlopu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten uśmiechnął się blado i zmarszczył czoło, jakby coś sobie przypominając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu wszyscy w śmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na początku jest zdanie: wszystko jest możliwe i wszystko jest prawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To najpiękniejsza rzecz w całych Włoszech\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno zapomniana teoria Jamesa-Langego a miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spotykali się często.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ograniczała się przynajmniej do zamkniętego pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na razie nie widzę żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często byłem tak zmęczony, że w ubraniu zasypiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej spokojny, obojętny głos mówił: — De, przepraszam, że rękę źle trzymam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W strachu i wściekłości bełkotał: — Tylko ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Człek i wygodę ma, i rozkurczenie wszelakie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za osobliwa choroba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pewnie dorośli tak samo myślą, że dzieci nic nie wiedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smok nie był poplecznikiem świętego stanu małżeńskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy uczułem, że drży cała i słania mi się w uścisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie tutaj — rzekł pan — chodźcie ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko bierze dosłownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młoda dziewczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyciągnął się wygodnie na składanym łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pomysł trzeba było odłożyć, bo zdawał maturę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, co za rozkosz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc tylko dziewką służebną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chwal dnia przed zachodem słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowie się pan po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z przeciwnej strony, zza rzeki, nadchodził wolnym krokiem jakiś mężczyzna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płacząc i rycząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szedł powoli, niby chmura jesienna, a potem usiadł na tronie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hańba okrywa was, Rosjan, a wy tego nie możecie zrozumieć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39792958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament Europejski buduje zamki na piasku, a rzeczywistość wygląda zupełnie inaczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39792960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta kwestia wykracza jednak poza ramy tej agencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39792961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanęłam twardo po stronie sreber.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39792962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, narody Europy, nie możemy tolerować tej wielkiej niesprawiedliwości poprzez zaniechanie działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzenie znikło, Wokulski ocknął się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tablica nie umożliwia szczegółowego odniesienia do wszystkich rynków lub wszystkich grup konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Judym dostrzegł i to także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To od siebie, gdzie mi dom odnawiają, to z Warszawy...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozwój demograficzny jest wynikiem trzech czynników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też futryny okien tworzyły istną polichromię w tem dziwnem schronisku ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Islandia nie jest członkiem strefy euro, a zbankrutowała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy rozpocząć od obszarów, w których kobiety cierpią z powodu autentycznego upośledzania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę jednak zlekceważyć znaczenia promowania takich pomysłów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tysiącach dokumentów powołujemy się na wartości europejskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należą się im gratulacje za postawę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rysy tej damy były mi gdzieś znajome.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest tak dlatego, że państwu nie wolno kontrolować zgodności z przepisami w prywatnych domach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego nie jest konieczna gruntowana zmiana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto obiad w hotelu Europejskim z powodu otwarcia nowego sklepu...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że ta rezolucja pomoże im dokonać przemiany, której powinni dokonać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzeliśmy sobie obaj w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może powinniśmy rozważyć również wprowadzenie sankcji w nowej dyrektywie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Energetyka ma ważne znaczenie dla naszego stylu i standardu życia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzi mianowicie o rozwijanie współpracy pomiędzy policją a organami sądowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie i ich demokratycznie wybrani przedstawiciele czy bogacze i menedżerowie spółek naftowych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego powodu nie zamierzam głosować za przedmiotowym rozporządzeniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życzę inicjatywie obywatelskiej wszystkiego najlepszego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprowadziwszy się tu, poznałyśmy wszystkich sąsiadów, prócz was.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Organy nadzoru nie powinny podejmować wszystkich decyzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale was uprzedzam, że to dwie mile drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od naszej kolumny oderwał się sznur tyralierów i pobiegł ku badylom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawił się obecnie problem głosowania przez Irlandię \\\"przeciwko\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawę ta jest pomijana i ledwo wspomniana w naszym programie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba jednak patrzeć w przyszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czwarty fort śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżyła się do niego staruszka łagodna jak zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy wytyczyć drogę dla korekty czasów jazdy i odpoczynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę powiedzieć o komunikacie dotyczącym wzmocnionego zarządzania strefą euro\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbowałam odegrać swoją rolę w tym zakresie, odwiedzając Irlandię w zeszłym tygodniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden hrabia jest moim królem i panem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To proste ćwiczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciemność, ciemność gęstą od kwaśnego czadu rozświecał tyko czasem daleki ognik niewidzialnej postaci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam gdzieś daleko, daleko ciągnie ze sobą na święte pole, jasną murawą zasłane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie, przedłużenie czasu trwania programu do trzech lat wydaje się dobrym pomysłem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja w zakresie praw człowieka w Iranie jest nie do przyjęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na początku chciałabym pogratulować sprawozdawczyni świetnej pracy, jaką wykonała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kmicic puścił ją wreszcie i uderzył się po kontuszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam jedno mądre słowo, o którem Wacek nic nie wiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się ze mnie ludzie śmieli!“ rzekła pani Ludwika, kręcąc głową z przerażeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego panaceum nie ma\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie zasiada on aby w tej Izbie od jakiegoś czasu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego byś pragnął: złota?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem po jej wargach zamkniętych przewinie się blady, chory, krótki uśmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na rozpoczęcie negocjacji z Waszyngtonem mamy zaledwie dwa miesiące i jeden tydzień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W celu uzupełnienia ich niedoboru nie powinno być konieczne uruchamianie instrumentu elastyczności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szanowni państwo, pani przewodnicząca, panie komisarzu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problemem jest przekazanie wiadomości i powiedzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem, w piątym roku pożycia, pani Małgorzata nagle poczęła się malować...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten trend nieprzyjmowania rezolucji jednak się utrzymuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak, czy sami zwolennicy traktatu nie twierdzą, że istota traktatu pozostaje taka sama?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39793226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciężcy byli nieprzyjacielowi, ale i obywatelstwu ciężcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była też bardzo ciekawa, co z tego wyniknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahała się, zakołysała na miejscu, nie mogąc iść dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radek sam wyglądał jak obrazek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprzytomny jak bela….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczu góry, wrzeźbiony w skałę, stał pensjonat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On siedział, jej głowa leżała na jego kolanach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po długich staraniach uzyskałem miejsce drugiego nauczyciela w niższym zakładzie naukowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mam iść do kancelarii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosła głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do odpowiedniego wyżywienia i mieszkania, rozrywek i opieki lekarskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pół czaszki oddziela się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz dochodzenia spełzły na niczym: sprawcy mordu nie wykryto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ołtarzyku, wśród polnych kwiatów, wisi fotografia Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dziś są twoje urodziny, więc zapraszam cię na lody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo trwało jej osłupienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ów woreczek był dla Filipa prawdziwym skarbem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież powiedziałeś, że nie chcesz tam iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogień w klasztorze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram klęczał, odwrócony do nich plecami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochałem cię jak syna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłoby to dla mnie zbyt pochlebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stała, odziana w szlafroczek, z rękami założonymi na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy płonęły mu dziwnym blaskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej chwili nie mogłem skupić uwagi na żadnym zajęciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie w tym widzę najpiękniejszy motyw tej historii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowo daję, przynajmniej dobrze, żem ciebie spotkał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisnąłeś — miękko uderzyła i rozpadła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jednak nawet za królestwo niebieskie nie oddałbym jednej chwili pełnej świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nic — pocieszał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniały w proporcjach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieważne, na ja kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na horyzoncie widniał budynek, którego wcześniej tam nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ślicznie to powiedziałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzała poprzez podwórze ku piekarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy będę pół bogiem, pół czarnoksiężniczkiem, aby mieszać, lepić i rozpalać ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Halszka wzbraniała się, prosząc o zwłokę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widna noc, rozjaśniona świeżo spadłym śniegiem, ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja również będę mieć go na oku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zero szacunku dla wykształconego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś ty nigdy nie udawała niczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogoś mi przypominała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Usiądźmy tam na ławce w alei cyprysów — zaproponowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie wstał i nie spojrzawszy na mnie więcej, wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inna rzecz, że to z Panem było całkiem na wariata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się boi, jest bity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda chwila zużyta, wyciśnięta, wyssana do ostatniej kropli rozkoszy ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam nadzieję, że połowa uczestników odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — to on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież tego nie wyrzucę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oblicza z dwóch stron mej głowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodzi mi o partie górne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wiesz, czyje te paznokcie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Policzki mu pobladły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś poruszyło się we mnie, niby nieznacznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki postrzegł ów rumieniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet nie wiesz, o co im idzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, nago.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla ciebie tylko ryzykuję tę podróż na północ, do twego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo cóż się właściwie z nami stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynurzymy ją z torby! — rzekł Podlasiak troskliwie i stanowczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja sama wyszłam i udałam się do domu swego mistrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I od tego czasu ludzie przestali się odradzać i zaczęli umierać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj, po długich, długich latach porzuciła ową ziemię lśniącą życiem i słońcem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za co by cię mieli zabijać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj ładni i mają takie czerwone usta, jakby ciągle się całowali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropny uścisk nie zelżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdźmy z naszym problemem pomiędzy lud prymitywny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Honor za honor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie powinny nosić krótsze od innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„My nimi jesteśmy” — brzmiała nasza odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu była granica panowania Amora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrafisz być normalna, dobra? — Potrafię być tylko zła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden się wymawiał, że śpiący i woli się rano myć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Śmiech i groza — szczególne połączenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomiędzy oboma brzegami rozpiął się łuk mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Fragment bez końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wierzę, Antoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może coś ci się w nim ciągle powtarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym gwiazdę z nieba i szybkę z okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie postanowiłem mu rzecz całą zakomunikować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy dni się szykowali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ano, kichnął dwa razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał może czterdzieści lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy psuję go, i nagle zaczyna się w nim coś poruszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasia wyszła na podwórko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem, jak ręka Andrzeja wpija mi się kurczowo w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba siedzieć całą noc z otwartymi oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj byłem u znajomego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do aktywacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę mówić, żeby nie zapeszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja widzę, że on będzie siedział do drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z niecierpliwością oczekuję przyszłego poniedziałku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc może z uduszenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił, widać, oślepić rozwścieczonego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ja panu coś powiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co tobie, Stasiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Był pan tam już może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A kiedy ją będę widział? — Za kilka dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem, że to zależy od kategorii, ale powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby obawiało się, że mogę zapomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciała rozstaju, ma rozstaj! Niech gada! — gorącował się kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dama nie siadała, ale za to zaczęła się śmiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To musiało się tak skończyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nasi klienci dowiedzą się, że współpracujemy z takimi ludźmi, mogą wyniknąć kłopoty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znalazłem nareszcie punkt zaczepienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowo daję, przynajmniej dobrze, żem ciebie spotkał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przy mojej pomocy wyszła na marmurowy cokół nabrzeża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nam? Jakim — nam? — wycedził przez zęby kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda szepce, krzyczy, mówi co innego, i mieszają się ich głosy, jak gwar tłumu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo jej mama kazała w gnieździe posprzątać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się jest czynnością rytualną, prastarą, jak miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil stał za dużą palmą i oglądał księcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy kwiaty do uczty! — rzekła patetycznie, zdejmując wianuszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki potwierdzająco kiwnął dłonią, lecz słowem się nadal nie ozwał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym kończyło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciemni rozbrzmiewa stada wycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolina chodziła rankiem po tych alejach i odnalazła ślady kopyt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu właśnie Emil przestał pisać i popatrzył na rzekę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, jak długo jeszcze zdołam w pobok was przebywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujęty hojnymi napiwkami, ułatwiał kochankom schadzki w iście mistrzowski sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę się przekonać, kto to taki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22722995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wobec niebezpieczeństwa człowiek może zachować stalowe nerwy, ale nigdy wobec wzruszenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22722996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bronił się, jak dziki kot, ale co zdziałać mógł swą krótką bronią?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22722997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą wątpił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22722998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż to mogło być ostatecznie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22722999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umieściłem swój rewolwer z odwiedzionym kurkiem na szczycie skrzyni, za która przycupnąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze tylko było, iż ci górale mieli zwyczaj owijania nóg szmatami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tak pędziłem, ukazały się nagle przede mną w ciemności dwa jarzące światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśliznąłem się do rowu i zacząłem się okolicy przypatrywać przez lunetę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstała pewnie lewą nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyszał lekko, jak po wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogier jakby się wściekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podciągnij no spodnie, plecy ci widać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wydostałem się na dwór, byłbym ze zdumienia głośno krzyknął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz otworzyły się drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy po raz pierwszy dopiero rozjaśniło się cokolwiek jego oblicze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty wychodzisz za tego śmiecia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mi pomogła moja dobra ręka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jechałem powoli, gdyż było tak ciemno że nie było widać ręki przed oczyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ta twarz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś pan kiedy zauważył, że uszy jego są przekłute?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciwem spojrzeniem ogarnęliśmy w mgłach stojące zbocza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem i spostrzegłem wysokiego, brodatego mężczyznę w niebieskim, podobnym do uniformu kubraku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie szło mi jakoś, rzuciłem więc karty pod stół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedługo tam jednak pracowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niski budynek był prawdopodobnie stajnią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upaliłem już z pięć mil, nie natrafiwszy na najmniejszą nawet przeszkodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To niezły chłopiec, chociaż kompletny niedołęga w swoim zawodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja, moi panowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiała wiedzieć o wszystkim, przewidywać, zapobiegać, rozkazywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udziel mu pan wszelkiej informacji, której od pana zażąda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posterunki opryszków ustawione były w wąskim wąwozie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pod kim dołki kopie, ten sam w nie wpada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłupił na mnie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mówiąc, pochwycił oboma rękami moje włosy i targnął, ażem zawył z bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On dał damę i szanse nasze były równe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz cię załatwię, raz, dwa, trzy i po tobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli oni dadzą ognia, Watsonie, to nie wahaj się i pal do nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wyekwipowany wymknąłem się z kwatery i popędziłem do lasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grajmy w kości o to, kto z nas ma być jeńcem drugiego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na dobrym koniu czuję się na miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, panowie, nie sądzę, aby to były uczucia wrogie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę mógł za pana się tem zająć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cesarz oddał się w moją opiekę i teraz nie żył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważył nas, chyba mamy przerąbane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź no przerwę, chłopie, daj strunom głosowym odpocząć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wyszliśmy z lasu na wolne pole, słońce było już bardzo nisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wściekłości byłbym się był tarzał po ziemi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary był sam i nie sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz, tylko się uczeszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem jeszcze, czy będę mógł pana uratować, ale przynajmniej spróbuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co nam pozostawało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy stary lis zaczął mi pokazywać zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A po kiego ci mój numer telefonu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrób, jak ci rozkazałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekali na ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwila moment, jeszcze kawy nie zdążyłam wypić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wy cały czas tylko internet i smartfony!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoczył do mnie, jak dzikie zwierzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy ten potwór przyjdzie, będziemy musieli wszyscy trzej zginąć straszną śmiercią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wreszcie nic sobie z matki nie robił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kradzieże i bójki były ścigane, ale najwięcej zdrada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kup mąkę, to zrobię naleśniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22723197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego mam panu oddać moje ubranie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był nagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pewnie ten nowy sąsiad z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za mistrzowska taktyka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzałem przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapłać mi w dwójnasób, skoro przyjdą pieniądze! — odkrzyknął pisarz poza siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co właściwie stanęło na przeszkodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale bo jasny pan lekki jak pióro…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A każdy inaczej opisał, jak Maciuś uciekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stój pan — szepnął Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Rozpoznał w nocy swoje mieszkanie, idąc boso wzdłuż korytarza, w stronę królików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mógłbyś zagrać? Zagrał go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosił mnie do siebie jeszcze tegoż wieczora na „skromną kolację”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten człowiek wciąż jeszcze stoi na korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo mi nie dałeś znać, że przyjeżdżasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krużganki między domami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocham cię dlatego najprawdopodobniej, bo cierpię z powodu utraconego narcyzmu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo i władze państwowe powinny otaczać szczególną opieką dzieci niemające rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mamo, czy odchodzisz? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha — domyślił się wreszcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy, jak żywi — idzie wszystko, jak było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, teraz jesteś dostatecznie zła, więc możemy roz mawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił, widać, oślepić rozwścieczonego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niestety, człowiek ten nie żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznali się w konserwatorium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądam w lustrze wygniecioną twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim się zdecyduję, dam ci jedną dobrą radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meduzy nie bieskie i różowe kołysały się jak kwiaty o grubych i miękkich koronach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może przypomniały jej się lata miłości i szczęścia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temat przez nas poruszony i mnie nadzwyczajnie zainteresował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwoje Narcyzów między sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś gdzieś Szymona?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I po co było tak bić szczeniaka? — krzywi się felczer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co się dzieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my i rozpłakaną połasuchować się potrafimy… — odpowiedział kulawiec, mrużąc oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przemawia z pana syn Północy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wychodzi na złe albo na dobre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, jakże się jasnemu panu wędrowało w powietrzu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyna wstała, żeby dorobić herbaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Śmiech i groza — szczególne połączenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłuchani w plusk wiosła, rozkoszowaliśmy się w milczeniu żeglugą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjść musisz po chleby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idź już, Jur! — rzekła łagodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żaden nie wpadł w sidła, żaden ran ciężkich nie odniósł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem przestał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kanarek wesoło zaśpiewał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytała: — Idziesz też do miasta? — Czekam na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się pan nie zapomina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ich Eskimosi bardzo obchodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to mi się podoba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego za granicą nie ma tego podobno zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myśl, że zgubię się w innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem z drzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden cukierek zjadła, a drugi mnie kazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale u wuja czekała na niego dobra nowina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo! — pocieszył go Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trochę patologiczne, że siedzimy tu razem i udajemy, że to normalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Komuż to służysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ta kobieta znała tak dokładnie pewne szczegóły z mego życia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwała się z miejsca i nachyliła nad Cezarym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec przemilczał, coraz zapalczywiej oddając się namysłom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wezwał Andrzeja do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy te bezwiednie stroniły od przepychu zdziwienia, jak od niedostępnych bram zamkniętego pałacu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Waga po prostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sednem jest prosta prawda\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Agencja jest usprawniona i wzmocniona, a jej zadania i potrzeby są również lepiej zdefiniowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Psychiatrzy mają na to wymyślne określenie, i to nawet bardziej wymyślne, niż Weltanschauung\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego, że cywilizacja i człowieczeństwo stanowią dwie z wielu podstawowych zasad Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Kosowie utrzymano stabilność, która nadal jest krucha\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję pani posłance za zapoznanie nas z tą informacją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewątpliwie są to sprawy zasadnicze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech ich pan pokocha, a odwdzięczą się tym samym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To z kolei wynika z nieuzasadnionej obawy przed islamem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako chrześcijanin jestem głęboko zasmucony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest nią w istocie europejska petycja obywatelska, innego rodzaju prawo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te dodatkowe koszty mogą stanowić od trzech do czterech centów od pojazdu za kilometr\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zakresie procedur dotyczących państw członkowskich kontrole mogą sprawować przedstawiciele tych państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkiem niedawno na bułgarskim rynku znaleziono dwudziestoletnie mięso baranie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy do czynienia z tematem, który odzwierciedla oczekiwania ludności europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech mi wolno będzie teraz przejść bardziej konkretnie do omawianych trzech krajów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy wyczerpującego europejskiego rozwiązania legislacyjnego, i to szybko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jaki jest nowy element synergii czarnomorskiej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat stoi w obliczu sprzeczności, które mogą być trudne do rozwiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"chodzi o budowanie pluralistycznego społeczeństwa obywatelskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre aspekty rezolucji są ważniejsze niż inne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy uszanować te różne rozwiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.9,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za pośrednictwem tego sprawozdania chcemy zademonstrować obywatelom, że my jako Parlament Europejski potrzebujemy ulepszeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja Europejska zaproponowała ustalenie kryteriów umożliwiających nam wskazanie \\\"fałszywych\\\" samozatrudnionych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoimy obecnie przed dwoma długoterminowymi wyzwaniami, a mianowicie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porozumienie jest trudne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Beztrosko antycypujemy tutaj negocjacje przyszłej konferencji pokojowej, nie mając ku temu żadnego prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspólnie z Komisją i stroną amerykańską odbyliśmy tak zwane rozmowy wstępne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowody jego przestępstwa to dwadzieścia biblii i dziesięć taśm z wyznaniem wiary\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedstawiono tę sprawę w rezolucji przyjętej przez Parlament w październiku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka praw człowieka jest przecież, w perspektywie Parlamentu Europejskiego, znakiem rozpoznawczym polityki europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzecie zagadnienie dotyczy doprowadzenia Agencji do stanu gotowości i jej prowadzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym podkreślić, że zwiększenie zaangażowania rządu afgańskiego stanowi jedyne i dyplomatyczne rozwiązanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzywamy Komisję, by wypełniła swe zobowiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwarcie granic było jednym z największych osiągnięć Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowisko to jest zgodne z prawem i praktyką międzynarodową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"konsumenci o najniższych dochodach, konsumenci z grup najsłabszych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nowa prezydencja Rosji mogłaby być naznaczona nowym stylem wielkiej klasy na skalę wielkiego aktora\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawa człowieka są uniwersalne, niezbywalne i wzajemnie od siebie zależne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważamy to za istotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, w istocie pamiętam pańskie przemówienia, pamiętam pańskie słowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sugeruję, abyśmy byli szczerzy w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jasne jest, że nasza sytuacja nie ma w sobie nic przejściowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy również opracowywać pomoce dydaktyczne dla internautów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwa dni temu na ścianach czterech szkół miasta Burgas pojawiły się rasistowskie hasła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest uwzględnienie tej deklaracji w protokole i jej odczytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walka z terroryzmem skupia się obecnie na Jemenie, który jest wylęgarnią islamskich ekstremistów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym państwu podziękować za tak liczne przybycie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złożyliśmy kilka poprawek na mocy wspólnego porozumienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie będę omawiała wszystkich z nich szczegółowo, lecz podkreślę te najistotniejsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko niczego to nie rozwiązuje, ale przeciwnie, nasila to problem zmian klimatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szczególności przypominamy jego wkład w proces pokojowy w Gruzji po inwazji wojsk rosyjskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34185999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy dobrze, że w wielu krajach prześladuje się chrześcijan\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34186000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z góry dziękuję za państwa cenny wkład w tę debatę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34186020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konsumenci nie będą musieli płacić więcej za mleko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34186021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego potrzeba nam tej pewności prawnej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34186022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowa strategia jest nam jednakże potrzebna w celu dotrzymania kroku reszcie świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34186023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy bazować na pracach Rady Arktycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34186024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę prosić o uzasadnienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34186040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielka Brytania potrzebuje jednolitej waluty europejskiej jak tonący brzytwy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34186041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gazociągu Północnoeuropejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34186042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale musimy zapobiec wykorzystywaniu historii do złych celów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34186043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inna poważna kwestia w tych negocjacjach dotyczy zarządzania częstotliwościami radiowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34186044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kandydat opozycji został wybrany przewodniczącym parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ukrywali jej, ale nie mogli odejść od siebie, aby nienawiść minęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zeszłym roku Jarmark cieszył się olbrzymią popularnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczach rosły niebieskawe jodły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba coś zrobić z czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przylepiać się do niej, zdrabniać jej imię, nazwy części ciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszaj natychmiast! — brzmiała gniewna odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby tak było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To wszystko przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jak gdybyśmy się zupełnie nie znali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyli pamięta pani moment wprowadzania gimnazjów już z perspektywy nauczyciela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej życie biegło ostrymi, gwałtownymi skrętami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna noga już jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja także — nalegał dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znasz tu jakąś dobrą knajpkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na człeka tak ledwo ledwo zakrawasz, jakbyś go naprędce i od biedy jeno zmałpował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapalił małą lampkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę wam podziękować i pobłogosławić… wam wszystkim…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała szeroko otwarte oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan to wszystko może wiedzieć? — zapytał szczerze zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A drugie trochę starsze, ale też małe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na gwiazdkę postanowiłem sobie sprawić smartwatcha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawezwany lekarz oświadczył się za natychmiastową operacją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam do trzydziestego roku życia nie piłem prawie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle obudził mnie szelest lekkich kroków poza mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś z uczucia żegnania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest gładki, okrągły, ubiera się pięknie i nie ma żadnych trosk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co też tym kobietom do głowy przychodzi — rzekł mąż pani Emilii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiamy się, że kapitał, który włożyliśmy w ten projekt może być zmarnowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzmi to patetycznie, brzmi to może trochę na wyrost, ale tak jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tam, tam, za biurkiem, w kącie, pod ścianą!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Magiczne; i to w wysokim stopniu rozwinięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeka znowu na jego wyznanie — długo, tęsknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szereg komnat, które zmieniają się w cyrk podziemny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu pochody egipskie i asyryjskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bóg nierównowagi, w której wirują nieskończone byty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On zauważył, że ona ma często w palcach skurcz naczyń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Należało wcześniej pomyśleć o tym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Część krytyków zaznacza jednak, że wielbiciele kina artystycznego będą mieli czym nacieszyć oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkowita prawda została mu przezna czona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny motyw dla malarza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem jeszcze dzieckiem, ale wiedziałem, co to znaczy, wiedziałem doskonale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przez trzy dni nie mieliśmy żadnych informacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadłem, że Podlasiak! — pochełpił się jednoręki, zwracając się do kulawca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oswobodziłem siebie i was od hańby — rzekłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podnieśli się na nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Podlasiak rozwiódł dłonie na znak swej nieodpowiedzialności za własną urodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myślałem, że dzieci są dobre, tylko nieszczęśliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy padł strzał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gromkie okrzyki powitały ten wspaniały pochód; radość tłumu przeszła granice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja myślałem, że mogliście zapomnieć o mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od słowa do słowa począł go badać stary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maryś słuchała z kąta, nie odpowiadając nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trumnie leżał trup człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczem poszedł pod szubienicę i usiadł pod nią, oczekując nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skórę schował tak starannie, że mimo najusilniejszych poszukiwań znaleźć jej nie mogła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznośny jego uśmiech zdradzał więcej obłudnej szczerości i cynizmu niż przedtem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posuwaliśmy się po cichu dalej, aż Holmes otworzył znowu drzwi jakieś na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kociołku, na dnie, pozostało cokolwiek płynu, czerwonego jak krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pobiegła uradowana do komory i poczęła odsuwać worki z mąką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to obliczenie bardzo proste, ale nie chcę pana tem nudzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uszliśmy szczęśliwie pościgu i mogliśmy już odetchnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21444245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubraliśmy się obydwaj starannie i wyglądaliśmy jak dwaj obywatele wracający z teatru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz smutek ten „nie do mnie należał”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego zwykle obieram samotny przedział i płacę za to gruby napiwek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można tego wypluć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo i władze państwowe powinny otaczać szczególną opieką dzieci niemające rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśli: „nareszcie mam ją”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hm… szczególne, szczególne…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pozwól, mamo, to jest mój kolega.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nago, jestem pewien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odetchnął z pewną ulgą: Darek nie zabrał ze sobą strzelby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyła więc w półśnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy oto przysięgam i pierwszy będę dbał o wypełnienie umówionych warunków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na skinienie stryja wyszedł ponownie, zostawiając ich samych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy oczekiwałem go na stacji, gdy mnie zobaczył, trzeba było widzieć jego oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co u ciebie słychać, to znaczy — co czytasz? — „Złotego osła” i „Ars amatoria”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Był pan tam już może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyśliłem się, kogo znajdę w tym gronie, ale walka trwała krótko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś byłem zapalonym podróżnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech mnie ten wóz wiezie, gdzie chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktor przechadzał się zamyślony po celi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad wszystkimi wirował śnieg i ostre, podobne do cięcia, wrażenie: nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maria już nie usiłowała nawet zapanować nad swą wściekłością i upokorzeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż o tym myślicie, panie kolego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten uścisk symbolizował o wiele więcej niż tylko wzajemną ochronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niskiej i niby na jeża ostrzyżonej murawie przyleśnej stał dąb ustronny i rozłożysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jednej jej szali leży góra złota, na drugiej męski członek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przewidziane są zniżki dla studentów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy leżeć na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy można tą ścierką, to wytrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmaite mogłyby być sposoby rodzenia się, umierania i odradzania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie unoś się — przemówił miękko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota myślał, że to skrzep, i próbował operować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko drgało w tym szczególnym rytmie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym wstąpiłem do różnych politycznych i społecznych zrzeszeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Serce ani drgnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytaliśmy o redaktora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widzę, Saro, że wodzisz oczyma po klasie, zamiast patrzeć w książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kim lubisz być, zbójem czy policjantem? — Lubię być policjantem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest bardzo słaby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic z tego! — rzekł, siadając w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś dawał się strącać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczuł niby zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama ułożę porządek naszych wędrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płakał, nie kręcił się, nie przeszkadzał, tylko był bardzo smutny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o nich — to jest rasa wymierająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okresy, kiedy się leży na samym dnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Latem dojeżdżam rowerem, a zimą autobusem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ciebie nam było żal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nas jest zamknięty we własnej nocy, sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapałka zgasła właśnie, gdy stanęli na najniższym piętrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem bogiem, a bóg jest mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W weekend majowy pojechałem w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien sobie dobrze poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął rozwiązywać mały woreczek ze skóry renifera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo Jankę, co nosi krótkie suknie, albo Helę, co nie nosi stanika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przeczuwał, jakie huragany zawiera w sobie to wezwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przemoczona do suchej nitki… przeziębiona… i głodna śmiertelnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, ciężko mi się myśli w tej temperaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jędrek siedział na koźle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozluźnia skurcz naczyń, zmniejsza ciśnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powoli, stary, tylko aby nie za prędko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tegoż dnia Tybetańczycy opuścili klasztor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na upór nie ma lekarstwa, może was inni przekonają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed świtem mróz brał coraz większy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę mi tylko nieprzyjemnie, że zaczynamy nasze wycieczki od tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.541,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.175,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 0.705,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 0.705,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 0.862,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.071,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 0.914,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.019,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 0.862,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.071,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 0.914,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.254,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.175,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.598,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan jesteś pierwszy, więc muszę nagadać się z panem za wszystkie czasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dojedziemy tylko do Nilu, a Nilem do El-Wasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.985,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mam począć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błyszczał przy świetle świec ołtarzowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.011,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i tu był sznur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.03,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w głębi duszy nie jest lojalnym bratem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.829,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość była wielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.978,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiedz mu, że to jest bezcelowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.866,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Patrzył przez długi czas na nie istniejące rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.251,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno sobie wyobrazić krajobraz spokojniejszy, cichszy i bardziej spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22656342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.415,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto rzekł wreszcie, jak przedstawia się ta tajemnicza sprawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22684285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.482,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszyj mi pan serce, przyjacielu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22684286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.403,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy sprowadzi ją powrót trucizny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22684292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.187,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spełniają pewną rolę, kiedy język w ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22684298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możesz się przewrócić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22684299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.019,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22684313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.154,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie siedziały w rogu pokoju, ale powstały, gdy wszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22684322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nim umrę, opowiem panu, co wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22684326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.187,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc już nigdy nie zobaczysz swych koleżanek!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22684327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.142,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem już księżniczką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22684338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.194,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konie powinny dzisiaj wypocząć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22684345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.593,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawą zajmę się sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22715901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.743,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy jeszcze kiedyś wstąpi w te progi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22715902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz lepiej daj mu spocząć, później znów kochanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko brednie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25837003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwił się, że gazet nie czytam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25837004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Kura do rosołu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25837010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz z nim mówić nie można — rzekł lodowatym tonem dyżurny lokaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25837021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym był kobietą, to puszczałbym się bardzo i męczyłbym takich mężczyzn, jak ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25837032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po dwóch godzinach Beduini wrócili z wielbłądami, dźwigającymi napełnione wodą skórzane wory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25837038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem zapalić lampę; ale dałem pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25837044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.692,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, teraz już pamiętam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25837045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc wie, co lekarze…?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25837048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Język natomiast smakiem prócz dotyku włada\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25837054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka dni ostatnich byłaś taka spokojna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25837060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina osiemnasta trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25889756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dreszcz zgrozy przejmuje, czytając tą opowieść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25889792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klęczeli nad nią i przyglądali się jej uważnie przy świetle latarki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25889798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ja się cieszę, że szczepienia na grypę nie są obowiązkowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25889809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Możemy jechać? — zapytał Idrys.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25889860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbym przysiądz wtedy, że nigdy przedtem nie czuła się z siebie tak dumną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25889891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.548,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nikt cię nie trzyma!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25889902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest dobrze uzbrojony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25889918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumowanie było ścisłe, ale wnioski, jak dla mnie, zbyt naciągane i przesadne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26201426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szanowny komisarzu, drodzy koledzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39936826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Oto jest moja nagroda... Moje życie!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39936827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"mieszkalnictwa i transportu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39936828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się o potencjale partnerstwa w wielu obszarach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39936829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym z całą mocą podkreślić, że to nie wina sprawozdawcy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39936830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważamy jednak, że prawo karne stanowi sprawę wyłącznie krajową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mógłbyś wreszcie zamknąć dziób?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Daleko wyżej niż pomoc zewnętrzną, powiedziałem, należy cenić wewnętrzną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Automatycznie zdmuchnąłem świecę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sięgnął do kieszeni, wyjął jakąś książkę i długo przewracał w niej kartki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Gdzie mamy schować te listy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułem, jak cała krew spływa mi się w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie miałem prawa do szczęścia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dreszcze, jeden po drugim przechodziły mi po skórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosłem się przerażony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzmi to jak komenda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed chwilą, ta dama to była „ona“?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nikt nie wie, że to byłem ja!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co bądź, zanim wpadnę w obłąkanie“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest od chwili, gdy zaczęłam myślić“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie mnie nie widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posiadam to w swojej mocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem to winien swoim dobroczyńcom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było najlepsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem się na podłogę i znów skoczyłem na nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Tak, każdej chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie posiadając się z zachwytu, biegałem bezmyślnie po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starczy, starczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zeszliśmy tym czasem w dół po schodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaspokoiła ona resztki drzemiących w nim właściwości: żądzę złota i złośliwą rozkosz samoudręczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem na swobodnem łóżku i czekałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jechać na spacer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona chce tajemnicę sama wyjaśnić, zanim tandeciarz ją zdradzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybełkotał kilka słów wymówki w swoim niemożliwym żargonie; potem potwierdził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem pomieszanie zmysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wołało coś we mnie; znajdą je, jeśli ja umrę tutaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mi się, że z sufitu pada słaby, zaledwie dostrzegalny promień światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilę milczeliśmy i oddawaliśmy się naszym myślom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Iskry się sypały z czerwonych szklanych lamp.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żadnych mebli prócz dwóch krzeseł, stołu i komody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość mego serca dawała mi pewność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech mi pan, przerwie, mistrzu Pernat, gdy będę znów zbyt popędliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No już bez przesady, aż taka głupia to ona nie jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śnieżysty zabójczy mróz zaległ nagle pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce drętwego kurczu dotykały znów mego gardła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jakto wyjaśniła?“ spytałem zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pan jest z nim zaprzyjaźniony?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podajemy ją w oryginale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym chciał za sobą zamknąć szklane drzwi, ktoś mi wyjął klamkę z ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie tak, jak on to robił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby dzisiaj dopiero zamieniła się dla mnie w rzeczywistość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ścisnąłem zęby, żeby nie słyszeć ich szczękania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu rozejrzałem się po pokoju: nic, coby mi mogło objaśnić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wiecie coś o Golemie, Zwak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak na mój gust to on cię po prostu robi w konia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Będzie musiał pan podnosić rękę przed sądem, gdy rozchodzi się o flaki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłoby to: wątpliwości zasiać w tem nieszczęśliwem sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„To panią trapi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezdolny, cośkolwiek myśleć lub czynić, runąłem prosto przed siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I harfa wciąga w siebie swoje dźwięki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzięliśmy powóz i pojechaliśmy na spacer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była napisana językiem hebrajskim, zupełnie dla mnie niezrozumiałym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godziny moje nabrały treści, treści bogatej i świetnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był człowiek, z którym miałem rozmawiać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godny jej, choć nie równy pochodzeniem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepodobna, aby tandeciarz na dole głosy te mógł słyszeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ale co się z panem dzisiaj dzieje, panie Pernat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem wpadł mi szczególny pomysł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze zdziwienia o mało nie upadłem z krzesła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22998992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomiędzy niemi przejście na szerokość jednego kroku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno zdawało mi się okropniejsze niż drugie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to pani nie nasuwa jakiegoś przypuszczenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju przytykającym do naszej sypialni wisiał na ścianie ludzki szkielet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A złe było, że strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A może pani wiadomo, gdzie ona teraz przebywa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21086207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiełbasa i karkówka z grilla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmierć stała pomiędzy nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej pory przynajmniej nie byłam nigdy samotna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież w tym nie ma nic śmiesznego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowiła uczynić to i obecnie, pomimo że nie odzyskała jeszcze swej zwykłej równowagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc odejdź pan, doktorze, nie drażnij mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Możesz go już włożyć z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sam czas przynosicie te płachty!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziesiąta czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za jakiego łotra musiał mnie poczytywać!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwunasta czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za skałami odzywało się ciągle żałosne skomlenie szakali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cook dostarcza namiotów, służby, kucharzy, zapasów żywności, koni i osłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ręka była duża?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, a co było dalej, to wcale nieciekawe…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Same kopalnie diamentów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młody, Murzyn, otworzywszy jedno oko, odpowiedział tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawała w białej, półdziecinnej kombi nacji przed lustrem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wyczytałem w oczach jego podejrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Informację o cięciach budżetowych ogłoszono w ostatniej chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To rzeczywiście ciekawe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"By tymczasem poczekać, aż mu kutas stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś, który ułożył już sobie wszystko w głowie odpowiedział natychmiast.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał być dobry i zły policjant, a nie dobry i głupi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Człowiek, dbający o czystość, nie weźmie już do ust słowa «Bóg».\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łabędzie, białe plamy, szły spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyrzucono mnie znów ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyobrażam sobie już, jak cię będę ubierał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina siedemnasta czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minął już czas zażywania lekarstw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielce się w używaniu sztuki onej wprawił\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli tam zabawić koło miesiąca i uzyskali na to urlopy od własnej kompanii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Książka ta jest próbą odpowiedzi na to wyzwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A grymasom nie ma końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spod łapy czarnego kota wyfrunął gołębiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smok cierpiał widocznie wskutek tej niejasności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ważne czy mówią o tobie dobrze czy źle, ważne, że mówią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielkie dzieło Lessepsa wymaga ciągłej pracy i czujności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"System detekcji i raportowania anomalii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Facebook jest dla starych ludzi, czyż nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo pomyłek grzeje mi doskonale nogi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemuż jemu ukazujesz się właśnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozbawiona przywilejów macierzyństwa i pokrewieństwa, posiada jeno miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno awantury w mieście?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogłabym spróbować, proszę pani?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, albowiem musimy odpocząć — my i nasze wielbłądy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewny, jak skała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"może nawet basem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina czternasta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wypełniła całe moje obecne życie, przeto zabieram ją z sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzikie hordy oblegały już miasto od półtora miesiąca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedł pomału, pomału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara potarła koniuszek nosa i zamyśliła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kształty i barwy przepływały poprzez nią, i głowa jej po dobna była do ekranu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest. Podaliście portret pamięciowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co tu się dzieje? — pyta zdziwiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw lizał po wierzchu, rozpalał kobietę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszyłam się bardzo, powróciwszy do rodzinnego domu, odzyskaną wolnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21087707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paradygmat programowania funkcyjnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jakże wydaje się prawdziwe!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mariola wraca jutro z Mazur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz — tłumaczył, zatrzymując się przede mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd rozkoszne złudzenie nowości, iluzja czegoś jeszcze nie doznanego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz smutek ten „nie do mnie należał”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak myślę — tak wierzę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mieli rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do widzenia! — odparł, podnosząc ku ustom jej rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszno ci w torbie? — spytał ze współczuciem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakończywszy zwycięsko czwartą z rzędu partię, pożegnałem się i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za złudzenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci wszystkiego dokładnie wyłuszczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbliższy tydzień upłynął niemal cały na przygotowaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za mało się znamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I chce mi się pisiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z konwencjonalno-fizjologicznego punktu widzenia to on mię miał pewną ilość razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To naprawdę było przyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Damy sobie radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno wyrzucać zużytych baterii do zwykłych śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zaakcentować tę kwestię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wessała Emila kompletnie i bez żadnego trudu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok pociągów, które przejeżdżały z hukiem przez most, wywoływał w niej strach i niepokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedzieli, że będą za pięć minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chłopcami mało rozmawia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepszy rydz niż nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, cóż, idziemy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobiegli do rozstaju i znów przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok reszta! — krzyknął Podlasiak, podniecony otrzymanym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet z godziny na godzinę! — odpowiedział Hugon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy znaleźli się w rytualnym miejscu, w którym żegnali się zawsze, podali sobie ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec nieznacznie poprawił się na swym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem w krzakach, tuż obok, niesamowity pisk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A zatem myśl pani przeniosła się na mnie — wyciągnąłem wniosek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No mam nadzieję, że jest w dobrym humorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala waliła go batem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chęci pieszczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wymiany: ty wciągany przeze mnie, ja przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może on… może on właśnie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trupy leżą na drodze, która mnie od nich dzieli, jak progi kolejowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znam ja te wasze gorączki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szary dzień szary dom wyglądał ponuro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stój pan — szepnął Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawiają się zjawy zwierzęce, morskie potwory, jakiś jakby znany mi brodacz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie nie było mu źle — ale ciasno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama jest ciągle inną; niby ta sama, a jednak inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz Podlasiaka rozjaśniła się nagłym pomysłem i poszerzyła z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Waga po prostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przeleciał przez mur! — zawołała Maria, śledząca lot ptaszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zamknij okna i zasłoń rolety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno kłamał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurz osiadał na nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetny to orszak widzów, świetny, zaprawdę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nuż pokrwawi! — schlebił sobie czupurnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zacząć od samego mojego wyboru książki na nasze zajęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uchowaj Boże od takiej niedoli! — wtrącił z zadumą jednoręki i westchnął na wszelki przypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego tylko pożądał: wichru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut potem znów pozostali sami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu obraz zaczyna wirować, już znikł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy nie mógłbym prosić szanownego pana o ogień?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Troje zaczerwienili się z całkiem różnych powodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty, głupi, może jeszcze myślisz, że rząd chce źle dla robotników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z moją skłonnością do pisania jest tak, jak z tubą pasty do zębów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamstwo ma krótkie nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co zobaczył, poza śmiesznością jej pozycji, było dziwne i poniosło go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś stał przy nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To naprawdę było przyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja też zrobię świnkę! — zawołał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo też — co prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim kulawiec zdążył powstać z upadku, znikła w rozbłyskanej słońcem zieleni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie wtedy pociąg, zwolniwszy biegu, wjechał w las.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety w moim wieku są coraz starsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z rowów przydrożnych podniosły się stłumione brzęki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ja muszę jechać, bo mają mi robić operację ślepej kiszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie wchodzili i wychodzili i Emil myślał o Krystynie, o zdarzeniu przy śniadaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzecim przepisem, który muszę podać, jest płukanie pewnego mojego znajomego dentysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdowali się we własnym oszołomieniu: ty i ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A bo i prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż na stację wtoczył się pociąg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwą musiała być siła, która przeszła przez ten łachman człowieczy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat pełen jest larw i masek zrodzonych w ten sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż to rok mamy teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nie wypuszczał ze zbolałej lewicy krwawo zdobytego skarbu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radek sam wyglądał jak obrazek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy oczekiwałem go na stacji, gdy mnie zobaczył, trzeba było widzieć jego oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Padał deszcz, gdy wyszli ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil płynie powoli po własnych zdaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co powie Ewie? Musi jej wszystko wytłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wrzaskach i płaczu mocno jej się spało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie jest to zgodne z prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszano ciche kwilenie jak gdyby zranionego zwierzątka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Magiczne; i to w wysokim stopniu rozwinięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolka robiła właśnie kluski na stolnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tarcza herbowa wrosła w węża i rozlała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam własne lepsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsze partie co śmielszych przechodzą przez murek i wsiąkają w miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast odpowiedzi Andrzej przybliżył mi do oczu kukłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiś stół, ława, dwa zydle i łóżko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd rozkoszne złudzenie nowości, iluzja czegoś jeszcze nie doznanego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieję wszędzie i nigdzie, zawsze i nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu na chwilę zacisnęło oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leniwie i z nerwowym drżeniem wyłażę z ciepłego łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I kulawiec zaśmiał się ochryple stłumionym śmiechem, który podkreślił udatność i pożywność smakowitego zdarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myśl, że zgubię się w innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak powinien wyglądać świat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zginęliby oboje, bez żadnej pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć przyćmiona długo oczekiwanymi konkurentami, może budzić emocje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pies szczeknął, Maciuś wyrwał zakrwawioną rękę i schował do kieszeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy zaczęła powstawać przepaść między nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem tylko o tym dziwnym człowieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa potrafiła być nadzwyczajna tylko w sobie samej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo na morzu szaruga…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze burzliwe czasy wymagają ofiarności i męstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieszczęścia chodzą parami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinał jej suknię, która była łatwa do rozpinania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to pieśń Schuberta „Gratchen an Spinnrade”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadeszła ciemność bezwładu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do każdej herbaty dodaję kilka kropel cytryny i miód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on to robi z umysłu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech sama wedle chęci wargami rozporządza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach, tak — mówił swobodnie, jak gdyby nigdy nic — awansowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niech i tak będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już chcę, mimo tego, że uważam to wszystko za rozpustę umysłową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę mi tylko nieprzyjemnie, że zaczynamy nasze wycieczki od tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jaru! — zawtórował jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczycielki były jej mniej lub więcej obojętne, stary profesor łaciny był „słodki”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do Moskwy! — powtórzyła, wszystko mieszcząc w tym słowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona spojrzała na niego ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20710855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed snem zaglądał pod łóżko, czy tam ktoś nie leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że to ważne i zdecydowane przesłanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Izraelska napaść w Strefie Gazy stanowi zbrodnię wojenną i zbrodnię przeciwko ludzkości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie proszę pozwolić mi wyrazić wdzięczność słoweńskiej prezydencji w Radzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego właśnie oczekujemy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewątpliwie Afryka nabrała teraz międzynarodowego wymiaru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrażając uznanie dla jego pracy, muszę zaznaczyć, że jest to druga modyfikacja regulaminu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka tygodni temu prezydent zawetował ustawę zakazującą dyskryminacji, ponieważ uznał ją za zbyteczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Handlowcy muszą otwarcie i szczerze informować o najważniejszych cechach charakterystycznych świadczonych usług\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie dotyczy istotnego niedociągnięcia w obowiązujących ramach regulacyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję wszystkim za ich wkład w debatę, z zadowoleniem przyjmując każdą wypowiedź\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż nie jest przypadkiem prawdą, że Europa ma najwyższy poziom ochrony pracowniczej na świecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak chcemy to osiągnąć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nami wciąż daleka droga\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziesiątki milionów obywateli europejskich nadal żyje w ubóstwie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy sytuacja ta spowodowała przyspieszenie prac nad projektem Rail Baltica?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zakres objęty nową regulacją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak według mnie w beczce miodu jest łyżka dziegciu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy filar dotyczy badań technologicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może być pani tego pewna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak mówimy tu o bardzo konkretnym rozmieszczeniu sił zbrojnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba znaleźć rozwiązanie, które będzie mogła zaakceptować większość Irlandczyków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie robią tego ani instytucje, ani państwa członkowskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli zamykane są duże przedsiębiorstwa, to bez wątpienia małe pójdą w ich ślady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego, panie komisarzu, chciałbym uzyskać odpowiedzi na te pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś zamierzamy wzmocnić rolę kobiet w Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To słuszne postępowanie, ponieważ jest to bardzo ważny temat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja możliwie szybko rozpocznie teraz negocjacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest istota tej rezolucji, której przyjęcie popieram\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również głosowanie w komisji przebiegło bardzo pomyślnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pozbądźmy się barier skutkujących fragmentacją i mniejszą skutecznością w kategoriach ekonomicznych i społecznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy stawić temu czoła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chodzi o to, by dać rybę, ale wędkę, jak mawialiśmy w tej Izbie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nowy prezydent uwzględni proeuropejski kurs, za jakim opowiada się większość Ukraińców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za kilka miesięcy ma ona zamiar przedłożyć plan działania zawierający konkretne rozwiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że tak czy inaczej wszyscy spotkamy się podczas kampanii wyborczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podziękować panu komisarzowi i czekam na wrześniowe propozycje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chodzi tylko o dostawy energii z Turkmenistanu przez Kazachstan\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wskazują już na to rynki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34579997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"katastrofy naturalne i został zmieniony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym regionie Europy może dojść do takiej sytuacji, jaka miała miejsce w Japonii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"rekrutacja urzędników Wspólnot Europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsza z nich dotyczy korzystania z portalu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero teraz, poniewczasie, bezrobotnym oferowane jest skromne wsparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pakiet socjalny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nad tego rodzaju sprawami może nie być dyskusji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oznacza, że przepisy wykonawcze, które zostały przyjęte będą musiały zostać odpowiednio zmienione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednym z priorytetów prezydencji szwedzkiej było oczywiście uporanie się z kryzysem gospodarczym i finansowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz kilka słów o zawieszeniu, a raczej o możliwości zawieszenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy muszą sprostać swoim obowiązkom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To również jest cecha demokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cożeś od onej pory porabiał i gdzieś się obracał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście czuję się Hiszpanem, bo jestem Europejczykiem, i czuję się Europejczykiem, bo jestem Hiszpanem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym przypadku nie było tak, że nikt nie wiedział, nad czym głosuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po nich w styczniu nastąpią obszerne konsultacje dotyczące ogólnego zarządzania i systemów kontroli wewnętrznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobiście za wielki sukces uważam postępy dokonane przez Islandię w obszarze edukacji i kultury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieją się z nas wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W czasach kryzysu gospodarczego wzrasta bowiem agresja w stosunku do Romów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego z dużym entuzjazmem przyjmuję prace Komisji Europejskiej w tym zakresie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prowadzi do niewłaściwych decyzji w zakresie zdrowia publicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele krajów importuje wykwalifikowanych specjalistów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim musimy zapewnić twórcom możliwość utrzymania się ze swej twórczości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego właśnie władze regionalne w różny sposób reagują na problemy, przed którymi stoją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę tu o przekazywaniu akt i informowaniu osób szczególnej troski o ich prawach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym podziękować posłowi sprawozdawcy za niniejsze sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten formalny obowiązek w praktyce powoduje unieważnienie praw przyznanych na mocy Traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34580794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"same fundusze publiczne nie wystarczą, aby pobudzić i utrzymać rozwój\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bój się wora, dziewczyco! Już nie powrócisz do niego! — pocieszył ją jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie chcę o tym słuchać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęli biec gdy spadły pierwsze krople.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było po deszczu, parowała rozmokła ziemia, w parku ławki już wysychały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto skierował okręt ku niegościnnym wybrzeżom Alaski?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Wierusz odprowadzał chorą materię już ku palcom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo ma trwać to spotkanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pędzi na swoim czółnie jak wicher.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gówno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyzywał wszędzie na turniej królewskich pieśniarzy i zawsze odnosił zwycięstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zaraz na drugi dzień było nowe przedstawienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maria już nie usiłowała nawet zapanować nad swą wściekłością i upokorzeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbował wszystkiego, co mu strzeliło do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było staczać ustawiczne walki z wrogimi szczepami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy zawibrował telefon wszyscy zamilkli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samotność, wiadomo, jest złym towarzyszem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego większość kobiet, które mają mało przyjaciół, jest niemożliwie ograniczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor zdjął płaszcz i rozpiął parę guzików przy obcisłej urzędowej bluzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona nie weszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez pracy nie ma kołaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżyniera przeszło mrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za miastem odbyło się wszystko według programu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza saniami biegło trzydziestu ludzi otulonych w filtra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bona zaprowadziła go do łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O walce myśleć nawet nie było można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dziwią już liczne komentarze na temat jej najnowszego dzieła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20664192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieco chorobliwie dokładne mycie genitaliów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę uratować tę odrobinę ziarna, jaka jeszcze pozostała pomiędzy kamieniami młyńskimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko zachowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane głosem, który nie powstał w krtani; głosem brzuchomówcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za miesiąc żeby flota była!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wygodnie — jestem mały, jak wygodnie — tom duży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wsadził głowę między jego liście, i to mu przyniosło ulgę, bo męczył się bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gęstwinie bielały ściany kaplic i małych zabudowań mongolskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś stał przy nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jej dotknąć, podobnie jak lubię dotykać małe koty i psy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna odchodzi do Emila, który ma osiemnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie konduktorzy zauważyli brak jednego z kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha — domyślił się wreszcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrazy te przeszyły Cezarego do szpiku kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie publiczne musi być organiczne lub mechaniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta jej wyrzucały słowa ciemne dla mnie i niezrozumiałe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachmurzyła się dumnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakończywszy zwycięsko czwartą z rzędu partię, pożegnałem się i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczam, że morderca spełniał akt w stanie na pół przytomnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To są stosy papierów i nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi spaść w nocy lub rano, żeby nie zdążyli uprzątnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włazić w skórę innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofając się, zostawiliśmy trzech zabitych przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przystanęli, aby się odsapać i uporządkować bezład uwięzłych w gardle oddechów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, cóż, idziemy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj ładni i mają takie czerwone usta, jakby ciągle się całowali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał przy mikroskopie, na biurku leżał stos otwartych książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadek ma rower, to i ja chcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział szeptem: — Ludzie z gumowymi wężami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patelnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie są moje marzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ano, kichnął dwa razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Horoskopy wcale nie zachęcające — odezwał się ktoś z przeciwnej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filozof Joachim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznali się w konserwatorium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon dzwonił długo, bardzo długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korzystając z tej sposobności Filip wysunął się pospiesznie ze swej kryjówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20792301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak mrugnięcia nie zrozumiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ja jej powiem, jakiś ty był dla mnie dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł drżącą rękę szklankę i wychylił ją, zanim zdobył się na odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczy go pan przed upływem godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Częste wzywanie milicji...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepodobna sobie wyobrazić, żeby złączone razem nie dały badaczowi inteligentnemu pożądanych wyników“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawiliśmy go wśród retort i butelek i skierowaliśmy się w stronę mojego hotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oka mgnieniu człowiek jest spętany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli posuwa się czas: wierz, spodziewaj się i czekaj... rewizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź kapelusz i chodź z nami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj policjanci drzemali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O przygodach ich mówiono ciągle wśród okrzyków zachwytu i wybuchów śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ci obiecuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nożownictwo... Zraniony toporem w plecy wychowawca... Ustawiczne napaści na przechodniów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy swoje drogi i metody, różniące się od chicagowskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwał ją przewodniczący.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były tam i szczegóły nowe dla mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możesz mi wierzyć, że wkrótce będziesz wolny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak jest wszędzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocalał z pogromu tylko pewien procent warsztatów pracy, resztę zaś trzeba było odbudować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja wezmę tę, którą ty pozostawisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli chcecie, pojedziemy tam po śniadaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przystanek trwa już za długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poruszyć się ich obawiały, gdyż wiedziały dobrze, jaką moc i potęgę stanowią one.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilku napastników rozpoznano i może da się im winę udowodnić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Och, ojcze, ojcze, co my poczniemy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to za plamy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam drugie tyle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułem coraz wyraźniej, że ci ludzie byli zamieszani w nieszczęsną sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes zanotował adres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urzędnik, człowiek o bladej nieruchomej twarzy, spełniał obowiązki swoje obojętnie, machinalnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek krwi nie może przewyższać jednej milionowej części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas krzyknęłam i w tej samej chwili syn mój, Artur, wszedł do pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze środka wyciągnął ciężarek, który rzucił w kąt do drugiego ciężarka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli obrazisz jednego, drugi uderza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszy się szacunkiem w mieście i okręgu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma się co wstydzić, chociażbyś się go bał!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciszę przerwał jednak głos kobiecy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale polecono mi widzieć się z panem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich czasach władze sowieckie poczęły wprowadzać oszczędności kosztem świadczeń socjalnych robotniczych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To banda morderców, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał moc człowieka w napadzie epileptycznym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapamiętaj to sobie raz na zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na miłość Boską, co mam czynić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy słyszałeś coś o Loży w tych stronach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciałem cię obrazić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nóż upadł na podłogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wam dać dobrą radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minęły dwa miesiące i sprawa powoli zatarła się w samej pamięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawiłem tam dobrych przyjaciół, z których jeden pracuje w urzędzie telegraficznym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przemysł rosyjski w pierwszych latach rewolucji został zniszczony prawie że doszczętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwycił go jedną ręką za gardło i rzucił na beczkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóżeście zrobili później?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że to już niedługo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Córka wybuchła płaczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugim „smutnym objawem“ jest nader słaby udział w pracy sił kulturalnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przeżyłby wówczas nawet miesiąca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy wobec tego pokryć wszelkie zobowiązania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"We dnie trudno do niego przystąpić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli go wyjawię, przyjdzie do morderstwa, to pewne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłby pan mieć do nas nieco więcej zaufania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyna roześmiała się, uradowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócę i upomnę się o ciebie, mój skarbie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w dzień, czy w nocy, spojrzę wam w twarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiejesz się, przyjacielu, Watsonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył okno i poplamił krwią futrynę, aby upozorować ucieczkę mordercy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21385311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież zniżali ją na manufakturę i żelazo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamigotała przed oczami latarka krasnoludka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta kobieta jest stokroć piękniejsza i bardziej wyrafinowana, niż przypuszczałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A te znaki tu, na obwodzie koła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tej chętce poznałem od razu, że Podlasiak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To należy podtrzymać za wszelką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co musisz? — Tam chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie twoje rzemiosło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest chodzenie po ostrzu brzytwy, fantastycznie wąska via media.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Źle się stało — szepnął powstając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie mogą liczyć na pewną dyskrecję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nagi konar drzewa ukazał się niespodzianie tuż za szybą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nie śpisz, to znaczy, że ją znalazłem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Och, och! Nie wiem: mieszka w hotelu \\\"Pod Różą\\\".\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu się pożywię — szepnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umieli mu na to odpowiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu przestał dlatego, że Emil przestał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż dziś, prawie mimo woli, wiedziony jakimś tajemnym przeczuciem spróbowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te wszystkie wizje są wielkości „naturalnej” albo nawet jakby trochę pomniejszone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli po obu stronach balonu i pocałowali się ponad nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze delegat podpisał w księdze więziennej pokwitowanie, że odebrał Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy ostatnio z nią rozmawiałaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bóg nierównowagi, w której wirują nieskończone byty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani jeść, ani uczyć się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem szedł dalej, potem znów zaczynało się wszystko od początku, potem otworzono drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oczywiście, prawda co do joty — potakiwał Ole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Snadź powzięła nowe postanowienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieniądze szczęścia nie dają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co teraz będzie? — powtórzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyśliłem się, kogo znajdę w tym gronie, ale walka trwała krótko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mógł prowadzić rozmowy, której przedtem nie obmyślił szczegółowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przeszkadzaj mu, nie przeszkadzaj! — zaszeptał skwapliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali je w domu i przynosili na spotkania, pisali je nawet czasem na spotkaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprostowała się dumnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już idę! — odpowiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas przestał płynąć, a świat istnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się nie ma co się lubi, to się lubi co się ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzbanek stojący w drugim kącie pokoju ożył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki postrzegł ów rumieniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od sprawy Małkowskiego wieża olsztyńskiego ratusza budzi mieszane skojarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty jesteś Narcyzem, ja też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pianista dlatego nie może grać, bo zdaje sobie sprawę, że może nie móc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bagno nie zamarzło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie — powiedział prędko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu zaległo milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączyłem dziesięć przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oswobodziłem siebie i was od hańby — rzekłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie minuty przed wschodem słońca to najzimniejszy moment w ciągu doby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mi smakuje wyciskany sok z jabłek, kiwi i mango.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na horyzoncie widniał budynek, którego wcześniej tam nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna tylko pozostała osoba: sześćdziesiąta i piąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj na obiad hamburgery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedłem na ścieżkę ogrodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czym całkiem cicho: — I nauczy się pan rezygnować z efektów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dziś — jedzie ze mną w tym samym przedziale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość — łzy — i modlitwę młodą, dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy zdawał się nie zwracać nań najmniejszej uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna nie będzie trwała długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to tylko gra przed tym drugim i sobą zarazem, komedia nieunikniona i podniecająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś goni po przedpokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mam co robić — ciągnęła dalej Mary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W pociągu — zawsze tylko w pociągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie szkodzi, zaraz je uspokoję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łóżko — sen, śmierć, miłość, narodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zbliżyło się znowu do pytona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sześćdziesiąt i cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko ani słowa, rozumiesz, bo tajemnica służbowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pomimo, to nadejdzie dzień, w którym my zobaczymy się z sobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak; tylko w ten sposób mogło się to odbyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za delikatność i wykończenie w tych płasko-rzeźbach i wypukłościach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"biegałem za twoim interesem mistrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżę w łóżku i mieszkam w hotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czego się spodziewałaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Same nowe domy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracający nad ranem jegomość napił się przy bufecie wódki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym był malarzem, nie potrzebowałbym mieć ją przed oczyma, by zrobić jej portret.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mechanik ukłonił się i wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co było istotną prawdą, nie powiedzieliście bowiem do siebie ani jednego słóweczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatrzymać się nie mogę: Kamień jest gładki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kopce zwalisk, kamieni i odłamki murów zamykały przejście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spadnie pan do Jeleniego Jaru i połamie pan kark i wszystkie kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O mój Boże!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szyldwach przechadzał się na tym tarasie, drugi czuwał u dołu muru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze w upadku chwytam za gzyms okna, ale zbaczam z drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela zwróciła się do niego z uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dozorca obiecał mi się dowiedzieć o tem przy sposobności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cały ten wielki pałac na mieszkanie dla jednej dziewczyny z ochmistrzynią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Sądzę, że z pewnych oznak mogę taki wniosek wyprowadzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z uśmiechem głową potrząsnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Guldena“ powtórzył stary i zaraz zaczął kręcić korbą swojej pozytywki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I coś tak zamyślony?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież lada chwila mogą mnie stąd wylać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wahał się chwilę, potem rzekł, nawet nie drgnąwszy powieką: „Morderstwo na tle seksualnem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiało więc niech pan patrzy w przyszłość i niech pan nie wątpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Więc gdzie jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaśnie wielmożny wielki mistrzu pałaców królewskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał na piersiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po kilku godzinach znów zazgrzytały rygle i dozorca zaprowadził mnie do sędziego śledczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeszcze w obecności „tej”, która zasługuje, aby jej aniołowie śpiewali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyślmy... Może odwiedzić jakiego więźnia, brata pewnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy też jeszcze otrzymam z jego strony jaki list potajemnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z koroną na głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy się prędko zobaczymy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może tam w liście jest co o niej, taką sobie robiłem nadzieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem otrzymawszy przyrzeczoną nagrodę, udał się dalej, nie oglądając się nawet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Dlaczegóż mam z więzienia uciekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy podnoszę się i muszę sobie przypomnieć, gdzie jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doznane dawniej nieszczęścia uczyniły teraz Franciszka I-go tak roztropnym, jak pierwej był nierozważnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem go okiem wspomnienia: jego płomienne oczy, suchotnicze ramiona, wysokie, szlachetne czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu czytałem na drzwiach porcelanową tabliczkę z nazwiskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym po pewnym czasie spojrzał, zauważyłem, że wycina z papieru nożyczkami sylwetki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drogi mój przyjacielu i dobroczyńco!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwała Bogu, już niewiele godzin, świt zapewne niedaleko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najprzód wyrwał cztery gwoździe, które pozostały i utrzymywały blachę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ich jeszcze dziewiętnastu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"moje złote marzenia, o!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na środku sali na trójnożnym bilardzie spał kelner i chrapał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zapytałem, drżąc z trwogi i z zapartym oddechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy słyszałaś Blanko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tem wszystkiem nie wyjawiła wcale przed Blanką swoich litościwych zamiarów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Widocznie w głowie biednego gubernatora coraz bardziej mieszać się zaczynało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może istotnie uwierzyła, żem popełnił morderstwo dla rabunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co do Katarzyny i ucznia zajętego rysowaniem, ci tworzyli między sobą najwyraźniejszy kontrast.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noga była tak zdrętwiałą, że początkowo żadnej nie czuł boleści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trwało to jedno okamgnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewolno było rozmawiać ze sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszka, gdzie żaden żywy człowiek mieszkać nie może: przy murze pod ostatnią latarnią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie ze staranną czułością wysuszył papier i z powrotem schował go pod prycze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądziłem już, żem się omylił, ale znów usłyszałem ten głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ileż cierpieć musi, bo zapewne jest tak dobra jak piękna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszedłem z kilku przyjaciółmi, celem przypatrywania się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23732775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Panienko, jak się nazywa markier?“ powtarzam swe pytanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy, kiedy ty ze Stanisławem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie zamierzałam tego powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci przy kartach zaczynają się podniecać i krzyczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, czas wracać — przyznała zamyślona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tamten jest trójdzielny — odpowiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem gotów oddać je za życie Halszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ani porównania z ospałą, gęstą i cuchnącą wodą kanałów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kamień węgielny organizacji państwowej mieści się w znoszeniu msty rodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20602992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już je widzę, o, już je mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co myślisz o tym, aby Połę wziąć na kolację? Ojciec lubi ładne dziewczęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tego nie odpuszczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewielu chyba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten człowiek wciąż jeszcze stoi na korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet wilki zawyły z trwogi..\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korzystając z tej sposobności Filip wysunął się pospiesznie ze swej kryjówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam uczucie, że tam byłaś w tym ogrodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęła się nienormalnie szorować, i to jej zostało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bartek odszedł ze swymi wilkami — wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Detale na ten temat później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiam czarną kawę o poranku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadrżała w posadach góra, struchleli ludzie i zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej z tych ścian przez otwór sączyło się światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zacząć od samego mojego wyboru książki na nasze zajęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nawet skończona z pointą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak biegły dni szczęśliwe, niezmącone niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piekło w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wjechaliśmy w czeluść wodną pomiędzy Wyspą św. Heleny a Ogrodami Publicznymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ścisnął głowę rękoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był czas, kiedy mówiono o ich małżeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała oczy zamknięte już nie tak kurczowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzysiek i Aga dołączyli do reszty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetny to orszak widzów, świetny, zaprawdę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby się chciało trochę przesadzać, można by powiedzieć, że jego zdania mogą zabijać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa nie miała trzech duchowych ojców ani biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za myśli, co za koncepty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Horoskopy wcale nie zachęcające — odezwał się ktoś z przeciwnej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co to?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pobaw się z nami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wystąpienie Rosjan oburzyło władze chińskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle się od razu dowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim prosto, przy tym szczerze, no i co najważniejsza — przyjaźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrzucona ze zmierzchu wora na blask południa broniła się słońcu zmrużonymi na chwilę oczyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mama z ciocią rozmawiały i nic nie widzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem położył ołówek i papier przed sobą, co nie było jego zwyczajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami sieją waśń między rodzeństwem i dlatego nie może być zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to zenit, po którym nie spodziewał się już żadnych niespodzianek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś siedzi nad morzem, rzuca w wodę kamyki i myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba jeszcze głośniej, i pani się rozgniewała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co dzień tu przychodzić będę — oświadczył Radek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropne rzeczy, ale raz trzeba powiedzieć je otwarcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale teraz nie chciał przestać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z góry obiecuję spełnić wszystko co do joty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nietrudno domyślić się: jeden z nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy nie mógłbyś i ty chodzić do szkoły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę minut po dziewiątej byłem w mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli dla siebie dziwną sympatię i szacunek — z daleka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… — chrząknąłem — mieliście się zejść na moście Św. Floriana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znając ciebie, na pewno zrobiłeś wszystko w porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu wróciła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim na śmierć zapomniał o konieczności małej pogadanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie wystarczy ci twoja własna porcja?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli obok siebie, nie mówiąc wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Wierusz wrócił?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wiele przebaczyć możemy, jeżeli widzimy: dobroć i szczerość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On ze swoimi mizernymi orgaźmikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — to włosy z warkocza mej narzeczonej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy realistycznych decyzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że w następnych latach będziemy podążać w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chcemy zwiększać tę i tak już wielką rzeszę ludzi żyjących na skraju ubóstwa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak dziękuję za wykonaną pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę, aby Parlament poszedł dalej i pomógł nam zrealizować ten piękny projekt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktat z Lizbony nie wszedł jeszcze w życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech Bóg da zdrowie obum księżnom!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie uczestniczyła pani ani w negocjacjach, ani w sporządzaniu tych umów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym również złożyć życzenia i gratulacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądy powinny zająć się zbrodniami wojennymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kończąc, chcę jeszcze podkreślić, że omawiane tu agencje odgrywają również rolę polityczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka koordynacja ma jednak miejsce w ramach przeglądów, które obecnie prowadzimy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydajemy po prostu naszą opinię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proponuję, żeby Parlament rozpoczął kampanię na rzecz przyjęcia diety śródziemnomorskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cele te muszą zostać urzeczywistnione w praktyce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.828,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy również udoskonalić połączenia pomiędzy sieciami w państwach członkowskich w celu zwiększenia solidarności energetycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejski pakt na rzecz zatrudnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ministrowie krajowi odpowiedzialni przed parlamentami krajowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31840734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowczo cena na rynku światowym powoduje wzrost cen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31841642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale na ten temat w deklaracji końcowej nie ma żadnej wzmianki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31841643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak temu zaradzić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31841645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysłuchał różnych zainteresowanych stron i wziął pod uwagę także propozycje Komisji Rozwoju Regionalnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31841646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak teraz należy ją rozwinąć i w tym kontekście nie uwzględniono wszystkich aspektów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31841647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie jest to bardziej oczywiste niż podczas zagranicznych podróży obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31841654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.26,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja również głosowałem za przyjęciem przedmiotowego sprawozdania i niniejszej rezolucji - na rzecz Macedonii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31841655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalezienie złotego środka wydaje się tu trudne, ale tak nie jest\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31841657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście powiadomię Parlament o tym, co zostało osiągnięte\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31841658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę walczyć o moje zasady i niech was wszystkich diabli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jednakże nie sędziowie mają ustalać zasady, ale politycy powinni wziąć na siebie odpowiedzialność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moi koledzy prawdopodobnie uważają ich za lepszych partnerów niż obecny rząd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego na konferencji w Nagoi musimy walczyć o jej ochronę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zeszłym tygodniu Niemcy zdecydowały się przeprowadzić szczegółową kontrolę swoich systemów wytwarzania energii jądrowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się wtedy stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto proces ten ma poważny wpływ na najbardziej bezbronne warstwy społeczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"to prawda, że trzeba żądać gwarancji i że to jest delikatna sprawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze względu na znaczenie tej kwestii, została jednak wykorzystana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, żadna z nich nie została wdrożona w sposób skuteczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też konieczna jest koordynacja środków politycznych i rynkowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawód ten musi być wystarczająco atrakcyjny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"instytucje polityczne, instytucje służące praworządności, system sądowniczy oraz wolność prasy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykorzystywanie seksualne dzieci i pornografia dziecięca są bardzo poważnymi przestępstwami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytyczne dyrektywy powinny dopingować, a nie zniechęcać, tak państwa członkowskie jak i rolników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie nie jesteśmy pewni, jak wielkie są emisje pochodzące z obecnego parku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Igrzyska olimpijskie to wydarzenie sportowe, a nie polityczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I można by nawet rzec, że bardzo niesprawiedliwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy jednak zadbać, by poszczególnym regionom przydzielano zasoby finansowe w sposób sprawiedliwy i przejrzysty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weźmy przykład Indii, gdzie praca dzieci jest zabroniona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to doskonały przykład korzyści płynących z Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"poznaję cię dobrze po tym postępku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasadniczo i tak byłby to koniec tej historii, jednak wspomniano czas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.9,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysiedlenia w Zimbabwe są oburzającym brakiem poszanowania dla uznanych przez społeczność międzynarodową praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dążenia na rzecz poprawy zarządzania finansami nie wolno ograniczać jednak do uproszczenia przepisów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pewnością należy wyciągnąć pewne wnioski z przypadku Iranu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogólnie rzecz biorąc, osiągnęliśmy dobry kompromis\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówili o tym przedstawiciele Memoriału kila razy w tej Izbie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy także nieustannie podkreślać znaczenie prowadzonych badań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zapewnić naszym obywatelom najwyższe standardy bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli żołnierzami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na obszarach poza Libią Komisja wspiera wstępne lokowanie zapasów interwencyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, zapomniał o spotkaniu z opozycją, które w przypadku innej osoby byłoby spotkaniem zwyczajowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy wspierać działania na rzecz przemysłu związanego z kulturą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa musi zyskać większą zdolność zatrzymywania badaczy i pozyskiwania utalentowanych ludzi z państw trzecich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymiana handlowa może być istotną częścią długoterminowego rozwiązania gospodarczego dla Pakistanu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można powiedzieć, że doszło zarówno do pozytywnego, jak i negatywnego rozwoju sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pełni popieram przedmiotowe sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31854715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy postępować zgodnie z dokumentem w sprawie porządku głosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewnią one państwom członkowskim nowe środki na wyjście z kryzysu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chodzi o budynki, jesteśmy obecnie właścicielami prawie wszystkich naszych budynków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że rozważy pan ponownie tę kwestię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako Parlament od dawna walczymy o zwiększenie naszych uprawnień, w szczególności w dziedzinie rolnictwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jasna lekcja udzielona nam przez kryzys, a zapobieganie jest nie mniej ważne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo postępów w tym obszarze, należy zrobić jeszcze więcej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto nie prosicie nas o żwawe ruchy, prosicie nas o dokonanie złego ruchu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wycofaniem takim wysłano by sygnał, że wszyscy poważnie podchodzimy do sprawy wyeliminowania biurokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego w końcowym głosowaniu wstrzymaliśmy się od głosu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to stanowisko się nie zmieni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada Europejska ma w tym tygodniu bardzo napięty program prac\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu będę głosował za wspólnym Domem Historii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za pański wniosek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję też, że mówił pan zwięźle\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli są błędy, co czasami się zdarza, staramy się je naprawiać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy kontynuować stosowanie przepisów dyrektywy w sprawie telewizji bez granic\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to czynnik kulturowy, któremu nie sposób zaprzeczyć ani którego nie można zignorować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego właśnie potrzeba\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykłady te wyraźnie obrazują ukierunkowaną strategię, którą przyjęła Rada\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodem jest nasze głębokie przekonanie, że przedmiotowe głosowanie nie byłoby właściwe w obecnym czasie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiadaj, coście o niej między Niemcami słyszeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strefa euro nie znajduje się w kryzysie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umacnianie reguł wielostronnych jest częścią tego procesu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ sama jestem hodowcą bydła mlecznego, mogę jedynie ostrzec państwa przed tym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż nie odpowiedzieliśmy na kilka bardzo ważnych pytań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję mu również za podkreślenie wagi finansowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto nasze stanowisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dla Bliskiego Wschodu nie ma rozwiązania polegającego na przemocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kończę akcentem osobistym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osiemdziesiąt sześć procent soi importowanej w postaci pasz dla zwierząt jest obecnie zmodyfikowane genetycznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem za\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest on rewolucyjny, ale pomimo to stanowi przykład dla reszty świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem pewien, czy moje służby posiadają takie informacje, ale zapytam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy do dyspozycji środki, które należało zainwestować między innymi w sektor energetyczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani przewodnicząca, panie wiceprzewodniczący\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd moje pytanie do urzędującego przewodniczącego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zamierzamy z tym zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było pana niedopatrzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prezydencja postąpiła właściwie w kwestii zmian klimatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważamy, że to ważne, i to właśnie musi definiować nasze partnerstwo w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobiście popieram takie wsparcie dla osób praktykujących coś, co jest zawodem ginącym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy zaprzepaścić szansy wspólnego działania na tym polu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostaje jednak wiele do zrobienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do czego to się sprowadza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Historia już dowiodła czarno na białym, że koncentracja władzy nigdy nie służy niczemu dobremu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodam też, że państwa plan doprowadzi do niedoboru mleka w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj te uprawnienia nie istnieją, co z kolei wytworzyło bardzo niebezpieczną próżnię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Martwi mnie, że obecna treść umowy raz jeszcze nie objęła takich przepisów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej pory będzie tak samo jak dotychczas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jakie doświadczenia mieli ludzie z dzierżawą załogową ?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś zadał pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłowie nalegali na szybkie działania i taki jest właśnie nasz cel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże przyjęcie do wiadomości to pierwszy krok\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.9,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od czasu utworzenia Unii Europejskiej walczymy o poddanie kontroli marnotrawienia i niewłaściwego wykorzystania pieniędzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czwartym priorytetem są dla nas obywatele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska musi zainicjować tę zmianę i dać przykład swoim partnerom handlowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten długotrwały proces dał wszystkim możliwość wypowiedzenia swojego zdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę spojrzeć także na swój kraj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się tyczy międzynarodowej pomocy na rzecz rozwoju, słowo \\\"konkurencyjność\\\" należy zastąpić słowem \\\"współpraca\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście z tym są związane zagrożenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zaszkodzi przypomnieć sobie, jak ważne są te debaty na temat rybołówstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Plantatorzy warzyw doświadczają strat dochodu dokładnie w szczytowym momencie zbioru plonów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy wziąć na swoje barki odpowiedzialność za zniwelowanie luki rozwojowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno wytłumaczyć Europejczykom zasady funkcjonowania Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.396,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę, panie przewodniczący, traktować to jako drobny gest z podziękowaniem za pana znakomitą pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to kolejny powód, dla którego powinniśmy nawoływać kraje azjatyckie do poszukiwania rozwiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36988966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielu posłów wspominało tu o wadach testów warunków skrajnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas zaintrygowani widzowie zebrali się wkoło hrabiego, prosząc o objaśnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I musi być tak, jak chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprężyłem się jak struna i salutowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle drzwi się otworzyły i do chaty wszedł jakiś człowiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"fuszery, nie umieli odebrać we czterech jednemu człowiekowi tysiąc talarów złotych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię ci z przekonaniem, iż należy mieć nadzieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle z marzeń mych wyrwało mnie zachowanie się mego towarzysza podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela kręciła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę sam z niego korzystać, czy chcesz go?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chcesz go podpalić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podaj pan tyły!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary nie dał się jednak zastraszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższą i zarazem najniższą formą krytyki jest autobiografia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle uczyniła się straszliwa cisza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary był sam i nie sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez trzydzieści lat pracy napatrzył się wszystkiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Więc kłamstwo uważa pan za rzecz gorszą od zabójstwa na tle płciowem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"krew mi uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czyżby i on mnie posądzał i śledził?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż ten pan mówił?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiądę na swoim kamieniu i będę grał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zdołasz mieć taką stałość, wyznaj, czy czujesz się dość silną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tegoż samego dnia, gubernator wszedł do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nigdy nie udało mi się wyjaśnić przyczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwałem mu natychmiast mowę i uspokoiłem go szczerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co miałbym uciekać z więzienia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istoty widziały w niem duchowe cierpienia bytu i rozkosze, jakie z nich wynikają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czem już dziś nie wątpię, szczególniej po rozmowie z Szumanem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wylogowałem się i szybko wyłączyłem komputer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że tak nie jest, ale nie rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała moja istota była nią nasycona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie środki ochronne musi zapewnić pracodawca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W domu słychać było tylko uderzenia zegara, zresztą panowała zupełna cisza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiałem czem prędzej szukać jakiejś kryjówki, gdyż inaczej byłbym zgubiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On ciebie kocha to prawda, lecz on i mnie tak tkliwie kochał!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz za to dolegały coraz dokuczliwiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zeszliśmy tym czasem w dół po schodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów długo myślałem, jak się myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mnie tak kocha!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekuj w tem schronieniu pod strażą Boga i naszej przyjaźni, skutku moich usiłowań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słuchaj, jak mruczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niby uboga, a trzyma w ręku iPhone'a.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym nie poszedł, wiedziałem, jakie nieszczęście się rozpęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zakazane jest przesyłanie listów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więzy każ mu zdjąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jakoś wychodzi, że człowiek musi kłamać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grajmy w kości o to, kto z nas ma być jeńcem drugiego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pisałem cały tydzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez chwili wahania zabrałem się do roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim się to sposobem stało, dowie się czytelnik w rozdziale następującym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Iskry się sypały z czerwonych szklanych lamp.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja i mój sztab jemy śniadanie w mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twój brat ma nierówno pod sufitem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy się obejrzałem, spostrzegłem, że przeorysza dąży tuż za mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani jest za dobra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz cóż ci to Blanko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski czuł, że opuszcza go odwaga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce już zachodziło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z każdą chwilą zbliżałem się do lisa, nastawała chwila czynu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość będzie Maciuś wesół i już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hartmann stał chwilę zdumiony tem niezwykłem postępowaniem swego mniemanego kolegi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głowa Marsa nie błyszczała, ciemność panowała dokoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25064833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwak kiwnął mi: „To pan nic o tym nie wie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25073309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiałem wyczyścić dane z telefonu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25073310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski spostrzegł to i znowu zmieszał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25073312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi Maciuś przeczytać wszystkie na świecie książki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25073313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale Walenty powiedział, że nie pozwoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiza na przekraczanie granic zewnętrznych państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te kraje mają prawo do tego, by stać się częścią strefy swobodnego poruszania się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście uwikłał się on również w konflikt między chińską a europejską drogą do globalizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście transport morski jest, niestety, odpowiedzialny za część tego zanieczyszczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem przeciwko rezolucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto, co ciekawe, branża odnotowuje stały wzrost liczby telefonów komórkowych używanych przez obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety w polityce społecznej jeszcze nie wszystko możemy uczynić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to kwestia, którą należy również uwzględniać w ramach europejskiej polityki sąsiedztwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy zobaczymy ten protokół?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie stwierdzenie nie przyczyniają się do rozsądnej dyskusji na temat równości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Protokół, który zostanie poddany pod głosowanie jest dokumentem o szczególnej wadze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy obecna debata dotyczy pieniędzy i władzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektorzy powiedzieli, że musi on być w pewnym miejscu, które wskazał system\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To odpowiedź na potrzebę usprawnienia koordynacji działań państw członkowskich służących zwalczaniu nielegalnej imigracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to prawdziwe wyzwanie dla przyszłości europejskiej konkurencyjności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyskutujemy w Strasburgu, a nad Bałtykiem betoniarki pracują na rzecz Nordstream\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieją obawy, że morderstwo Taseera jedynie odzwierciedla rosnącą falę ekstremizmu i nietolerancji w Pakistanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często powtarzane jest pytanie, które kiedyś zadał Henry Kissinger - kto odbierze telefon?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Izrael i Palestyna mogą je wykorzystać jako podstawę do wymiany ziemi za pokój\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie każcie nam ich przekraczać\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy bardzo długą listę chętnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli chodzi o pierwsze pytanie, myślę, że wszystko jest jasne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konserwatywna większość w Parlamencie Europejskim raz jeszcze zignorowała głos obywateli i głos zdrowego rozsądku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gruziński nacjonalizm, rosyjski nacjonalizm, abchazyjski nacjonalizm i południowoosetyjski nacjonalizm oznaczają wojnę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co roku Trybunał Obrachunkowy prezentuje sprawozdania specjalne w kontekście absolutorium dla Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to umowa idealna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to droższe i bardziej skomplikowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobowiązania finansowe są dobrym krokiem, oczywiście pod warunkiem że zostaną dotrzymane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie, zachęci do kolejnych przybyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popieram także dystrybucję owoców i warzyw pochodzących ze Wspólnoty, tam gdzie jest to możliwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem dumny, że decyzję tę podjęto jednomyślnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"rozporządzenie finansowe i rozporządzenie techniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrażenia te wyraźnie sobie zaprzeczają\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec chciałbym podkreślić, że powodzenie systemów transportowych zależy od udziału obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poświęcił pan zresztą dużo uwagi zasadom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak prawo karne leży w gestii poszczególnych państw, a nie Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracujemy nad tym od wielu lat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, iż możemy dzisiaj podsumować dyskusję, którą prowadziliśmy przez ostatnie miesiące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że rozwijanie kreatywności już od urodzenia jest bardzo ważne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dość oczywiste, kto atakuje wolność poglądów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inicjatywy i programy na rzecz unowocześniania szkolnictwa wyższego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może możliwe byłoby nawet renegocjowanie stuprocentowego finansowania europejskich funduszy strukturalnych z Radą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważamy, że Igrzyska Olimpijskie nie są wydarzeniem politycznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto musimy sprawić, by postępowania w sprawach o zbrodnie wojenne były bezstronne i obiektywne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to rodzaj podwójnych norm, z jakimi musimy tu żyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również w Komisji brak jest specjalnego pełnomocnika do spraw najmłodszych obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Informacje o naturze wirusa są chronione, utajnione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapominacie jednak o najważniejszym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwie pracujące osoby będą musiały utrzymywać jednego emeryta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa nie musi stać się niczym innym, ani gonić za innymi modelami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas na szybkie, jasne działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak, co oczywiste, musimy szanować obowiązujące podstawy prawne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są zbyt nieśmiali i zawstydzeni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to szczególnie zakresu władzy uznaniowej przyznanej Agencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co się okazuje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję bardzo - słusznie raz jeszcze podkreślił Pan to zagadnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska nie jest doskonała, ale pozostaje niezastąpiona w roli, jaką odgrywa na świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłoby także sprzyjać małym i średnim przedsiębiorstwom w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dochodzenia w sektorze bankowości detalicznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza to, że mamy długie, gorące okresy letnie i ulewne deszcze w całej Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak, naprawdę jest nam to potrzebne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko stanowi dla mnie nowość i uważam dyskusję za bardzo inspirująca i pouczającą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oświadczenie pana komisarza odebrałem bardzo pozytywnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska nie jest stroną w tym procesie wprowadzania zakazu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kryzys związany z zadłużeniem wymaga reakcji europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Rada nie zamierza podjąć kwestii bezpieczeństwa środowiska w najbliższych rozmowach z Rosją?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30530775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę pani podziękować za przygotowane przez panią sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego pogardzał tymi ludźmi, czasem nienawidził ich nawet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil myślał: — Można od tego zdechnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pisząc o moich osobistych przeżyciach nie mogę pominąć siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś idzie do kancelarii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech no jasny pan skosztuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy nim jest klęcznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Król popełnił wobec ciebie niesprawiedliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej spokojny, obojętny głos mówił: — De, przepraszam, że rękę źle trzymam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręciła się przed kliniką, jak dzikie zwierzę, uwiązane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie doskonałe, obfite pastwiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu potrzebna gimnastyka, musztra, one mogą być dobre albo złe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O czym ty myślałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięte powieki błyszczały, jak zrobione z białego metalu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą — kiedyś nie było też alkoholu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Emil znikł za rogiem, zaczął biec i biegł tak aż do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan jest wybitnie samobójczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przydałby się tu jakiś wybieg dla psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno uwierzyć, że ktoś tam mieszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mógł wysunąć się na łóżko i wpaść w ręce męża?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być na granicy normalności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W chwilkę po wypowiedzeniu tych słów odłożył motykę i powstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obławę potem robili na nas w całej okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór z wolna prostował swe drgające jeszcze rozpędnym pośpiechem przeobrażeń członki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy ja się przy tobie rozpływam zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oparcie dla pleców było z czerwonego aksamitu i otoczone złotą lamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego piekła ręka i był zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery dni temu budowałem schron z całym systemem sznurków zamykających prymitywne klapy i zasłony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W celu zdobycia dalszych wskazówek zachęcam do kontaktu telefonicznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to również byłoby nieszczęściem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukradła ci mózg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi, że go królowie oszukali, że port zabrali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie idzie w kierunku głosu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwórz przeglądarkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to koń młynarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkimi ulicami, zaułkami i placami sunęły barwne tłumy ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką odpowiedź przywieźli gońcy? — zapytałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocham cię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzech! — odpowiedział kulawiec, ukazując bez potrzeby zresztą trzy palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś nie żałuje, że uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachował dużo cech dziecinnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Całuj! — ryknął dominując nad rechotem wyznawców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W postać geniusza ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bliżej ona drapała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co mi to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na początek muszę zadać pytanie - skąd się pani o mnie dowiedziała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwiejąc się, poszedł szerokim korytarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, ciężko mi się myśli w tej temperaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz poczekaj tu na mnie chwilkę, drogi przyjacielu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież sama uparłaś się, że z nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc może postawić pałki tym, którzy myśleli o lekcji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lśniła się od zgrzebnej, zrudziałej na słońcu czystości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ograniczała się przynajmniej do zamkniętego pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja mówię o czymś zupełnie innym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy możemy od razu przejść do konkretnych ustaleń?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu wszyscy w śmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zdziwiło mnie, że pierwszy raz płacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję panu, cudowny lekarzu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem ile.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie ich powiedziało mi wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przysiągłem sobie wtedy, że widzę ją po raz ostatni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzieś w pobliżu przejechał w tej chwili baron…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chwal dnia przed zachodem słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego neurologowi było nieco trudno pogłaskać go po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem na płocie przycupnęła wrona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ej, panie Michale…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkałem ją raz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno i drugie jest możliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był daleko; nie mógł sprzeciwić się temu związkowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśmy załatwili się z niemi należycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało się to jakąś upiorną bajką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ zbliżały się święta Bożego Narodzenia postanowili, że Staś i Nel pojadą z nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Będziesz miała do roboty coś więcej, niż uczenie najmłodszych dziewczynek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę spalić szyfrowaną wiadomość, która obecnie nie może mieć dla pana żadnej wartości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maryś w domu państwa łowczych rozkwitała jak różyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko widząc, co się dzieje, przeraziło się także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszny krzyk przedarł się do nas z lasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce zachodzi, niezadługo będzie ósma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem zatem pewien, że jeszcze przez czas jakiś przynajmniej pozostanie przy dotychczasowym zawodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cyfry: zero, jeden, dwa, trzy, cztery, pięć, sześć, siedem, osiem, dziewięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę do ogrodniczego, wracam za parę minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mu się stało właściwie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę potrzebował twojej pomocy dziś w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj rano wybrał się tutaj na rowerze z strzelbą ukrytą pod kurtką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie było słychać skrobania pazurkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadeusz jej nie słucha, lecz jebie powoli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakrztusił się kilka razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedtem mówiłam: «Proszę cię, jeszcze nie, teraz nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Typ jakiego jeszcze nigdy nie widziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejsce to było ze wszystkich stron okrążone sznurami na wysokości metra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona urocza, on nieznaczący i tego tylko pragnie, żeby mógł w cieniu pozostawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jest w domu? — Nie, ale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowieku, to chyba czary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejrzała potem z dziesięć stronnic w kajeciku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też mój kapitał ciągle wzrastający, był w ciągłym ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądał zwierza z niecierpliwością; czuł, że gonitwa z przeszkodami wyjdzie mu na dobre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25835996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem jest jeszcze piła, ale ta nie jest tak popularna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jakieś nieporozumienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina siódma zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hamburger sojowy z ciecierzycy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnim razem pozwoliłem sobie przeglądnąć jego papiery, z nieprzewidzianym zupełnie rezultatem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pszenica ładnie wygląda, jak rośnie,“ odezwał się Alfred.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem już starym człowiekiem, wobec czego nie potrzebujesz się mnie wstydzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go nagłe wzruszenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mieście znajduje się agent francuski nazwiskiem Hubert.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cud prawdziwy, iż nie padłem na ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz wybrać nieodwołalnie, raz na zawsze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopóki mąż był w domu, on był osobą - ona cichym i pokornym cieniem osoby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małgorzata, najstarsza z dziewcząt, miała lat szesnaście; była bardzo ładna, pulchna i biała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sali dał się słyszeć szmer zdumienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale odległość od gościńca zmniejszała niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boże... Wiem, że miał prawo...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się z roztargnieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szkoda, że tam nikt nie mieszka — westchnęła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pytam się, jak mamy na nie odpowiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Litość brała patrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może chce oczyścić winogrona, może chce wyhodować na nich inny, mniej szkodliwy bakcyl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odpowiadała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"lokaj nie mógł odgadnąć, ponieważ rozmowa toczyła się w obcym języku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A tymczasem źli ludzie porwą i zabiją mi dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przebaczał im i puszczał je na wolność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy drożyźnie cen żywności nie wystarcza to nawet na chleb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było nigdy moim zwyczajem przytwierdzać takim pochwałom, choć byłoby głupiem zaprzeczać im.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest mi to obojętne teraz, kiedy was trzymam w ręku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero o wiorstę za miastem, w południowej stronie, leżała grupa wzgórz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie żył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nic mi nie mogli dowieść, te dranie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwałem mu natychmiast mowę i uspokoiłem go szczerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawa pańska jest nadzwyczaj niezwykła i przyjemnie mi będzie się nią zająć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Machnął ręką i zrzucił kasztany ze stołu na podłogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże chodziłbyś pan w nim po mieście, nie narażając się na schwytanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mi się, że mnie uderzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyślmy... Może odwiedzić jakiego więźnia, brata pewnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śliczna to była gonitwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25836425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasiadała ona też na tronie francuskim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jemu — swoją fotografię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma żadnej ceremonii ani etykiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem listy, listy, listy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starość nie radość, młodość nie wieczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybierać się, jak sójka za morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz powiedz, dlaczego jesteś zły? — Bo on cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to trwało może kwadrans: nie całując się, dotykali się nawzajem wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może on… może on właśnie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W internecie napisali, że nie testują na zwierzętach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak trzeba, tak być powinno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle się od razu dowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nawet byłem zły i nie podobało mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli wczoraj wieczorem w parku i trzymali się jak zakochani za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znaczy nie miziała się z żadną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz neurolog po raz pierwszy popatrzył na Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— tak Go zaklinał i prosił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz częściej zatrzymywał się, bezradnie i z przerażeniem oglądając się wokoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Podlasiak gdzie? — zapytał z niepokojem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak wam się udało zepsuć latarnię? — pyta się Maciuś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na torebce, którą przyciska do boku, widać kolorową nalepkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że się uderzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szło im trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że on nie bardzo pragnie, bym żył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwa zemsta kochanki dosięgła mnie w samo serce…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ulicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szkło się łatwo tłucze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żona nie powinna wiedzieć, że wieczór się nie odbył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my i rozpłakaną połasuchować się potrafimy… — odpowiedział kulawiec, mrużąc oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jem przeszłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj na obiad hamburgery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jest jakiś wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądał jak zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż ludzie wysiadają przed zamkiem, z miasta, z Pragi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka była przerażona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolka robiła właśnie kluski na stolnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu wróciła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dałem wam naukę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jak wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśli: „nareszcie mam ją”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to dowód oczywisty! — zgodzili się jednomyślnie słuchacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat pełen jest larw i masek zrodzonych w ten sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna zostaje tu na całe życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan normalny, tylko lekkie ogłupienie i dezorientacja w przestrzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wesela się zagoi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok z nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schudłem cztery kilo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż znalazłem przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dozorca uderzył batem w ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje bilet ulgowy, a ile normalny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni muszą tak pisać, inni mogą tego sposobu nie używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym, zamykam drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Panie! — protestował inspektor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każde pismo istnieje w pewnym celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to, jak we własnym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam was! — krzyknął Archibald.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej życie biegło ostrymi, gwałtownymi skrętami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To komiczne, że mama miała siedemnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz mieszkam w nim ja i to niech ci wystarczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W pogoni za dziewczakiem odbił się zbytnio od ziemi i odleciał bezpowrotnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na razie nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mało panu jeszcze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby był sam, to by mu się nudziło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za medalion? — zapytała nagle, sięgając ręką ku mej szyi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25441984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybiła północ i duch znikł, chłopiec zaś pozostał sam w ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25441985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzisiejszego rana nie dostaliśmy nic do zjedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25441986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było wspanialszej roboty w krwawych rocznikach towarzystwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25441987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leśniczy spojrzał na zegarek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25441993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż dziecko to nie jest członkiem własnego rodu twego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25441994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy tym głodny był ogromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeczytał głośno odnośny ustęp.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odtwarzanie niezależnych komunikatów głosowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znienawidziła od razu swój dom i życie dotychczasowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ku memu zdumieniu tuż koło mnie stał jakiś człowiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Używasz czasowników, zaczynasz naprawdę pisać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz wracajcie do domu, bo zimno na dworze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie jakimś katem, zbójem, mordercą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybywszy na mury, ujrzałem, że nie miałem tam co robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszak sam pan przyzna, że przed doktorem ukryć tego nie można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Felek został u Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim ja znużony!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co mężczyzna, to nie taka mała mucha, jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Deszcz szeleścił po ścianach, oknach i dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"o zgrozo! chyba jestem jedyną aktywną dzisiaj osobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już i chłopcy się dziwią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"o ho, pierścionek, jasne. Ja tam wolę jak ona ma gołe pięści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świadczyły o tem szerokie ramiona i kościste, węzłowate ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę pana mieć w swoim domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widząc to, panna Izabela uczuła nieprzepartą chęć pochwycenia tygrysa za ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dorosła, aby to zrozumieć, jak należy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Alboż pan biednym też nie daje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też silna i wypróbowana klacz Matylda poprostu mknęła lotem błyskawicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żaden jednak nie chciał posłuchać rozkazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.98,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmierć i łechtaczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Zdaje się, że o pokoju nie mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kabul został ostatecznie wzięty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzi w twoich warkoczykach i śmieje się z ciebie do rozpuku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy podały mu swe łapy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie w psa, a w kota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj jest poniedziałek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały okres kwarantanny nie możesz opuszczać domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, to niedorzeczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepodobieństwo, żeby pana osądzono, nie zbadawszy stanu pańskiego ducha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kawalkada znalazła się w głębokiej kotlinie, którą przecinała rzeka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los jego podzieliło ośmiu przywódców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zażółć gęślą jaźń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja w to nie wierzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąłbym także twoje kości ucha, jeżeli ich sam nie będziesz potrzebował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy słyszał pan, że w naszej zatoce, rozbił się okręt?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wylądowałem z tamtej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego jestem, żeby kombinować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko stanęło mi w jednej chwili przed oczyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drżysz ciągle jak liść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto jest przedmiot mojej zadumy, Najjaśniejszy panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba nam jednak przed naszą wyprawą przekąsić nieco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że wielkie towarzystwa, na wzór towarzystw mniejszych, będą wolały zapłacić, niż walczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.412,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się stało, wiesz sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pan sądzi, że gdybym miał wybór, to bym popełnił morderstwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłam jakiś czas prawie obłąkana, zupełnie obłąkana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle powstało ogólne zdumienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje mi się, że wychudłaś jeszcze bardziej ostatnimi czasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie spieszyła się, nie zdawała się szczególnie wzruszoną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zeszedłem do piwnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo zachowała się i teraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ojciec wszakże pierwszy spostrzegł, że dziecko zamieniło się w dziewicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A zatem, jeżeli chłopiec nie będzie dla was ciężarem… — mruknął ojciec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Bumble nie długo czekać musiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie ryzykując nic!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.548,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tam on jest!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostałby tak niezawodnie do rana, gdyż rozpoczął już czwarty oddział swoich marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trefle były atutem, rozumiecie teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tu się było mu dostać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25442154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, to prawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebym miał pieniądze, tobym mu mleka kupił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszłość jest przeszłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie! Oto moment, na który czekaliście!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór niespokojnie wzdrygnął się na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał wówczas i wyszedł z izby, nie mówiąc ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci przy kartach zaczynają się podniecać i krzyczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi z trud nością przyszło wypowiadanie pewnych słów w obecności dyrektora i wychowawcy klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ojej, usta otworzył jak wrota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marysia skinęła rzęsami, tak jakby kto inny skinął głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po jałmużnę idę! — odparł zuchwale kulawiec i z powikłanym wysiłkiem powstał z ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby serce moje było złotem, wyszłoby świetne z tej próby ogniowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było też rytualne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsza sesja przed nim, wsparcie mu się przyda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sięga się trzeci raz i czwarty — zostaje coraz mniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Haczyk od okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrzucona ze zmierzchu wora na blask południa broniła się słońcu zmrużonymi na chwilę oczyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedzieli, że będą za pięć minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem to przy innych mężczyznach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nim stała dama, bardzo gniewna, bardzo zirytowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Horoskopy wcale nie zachęcające — odezwał się ktoś z przeciwnej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiatr wieje między twoimi włosami, jak między gałęźmi nadmorskich krzaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostał powideł i wrócił do rysowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rousseau wzywał: powróćmy do natury!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widzieli, jak ją powstrzymać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam określonego tytułu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym tkwi gra polityczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu chyba znowu rozbijamy się o nieuchwytność zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż i to zawodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiam czarną kawę o poranku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarli się o siebie milczą co policzkami i Emil poczuł bardzo lekki zapach perfum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugie, że każą im dawać dobry przykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja myślę, że czterdzieści dwie — rozległ się cienki głosik spoza burty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20624980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspomniałem, że nagle na szybie żywą muchę dostrzegłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doznał wrażenia, że wrasta w kanapę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miało to oznaczać, że Bartek wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic z wykorzystywania sposobności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu spotkał Anię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należałoby przecież odróżnić uczucia, które są wrażeniami czysto or ganicznymi, od nastrojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zestawienie: twórczość — perła, wywołuje mdłości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla kogo dobry, dla tego dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąb, lecz odmieniony nie do poznania! — usprawiedliwiał się prawdomówny Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli obok siebie, nie mówiąc wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak też nas wtedy wydaje się wiele!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem on odwraca głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego właśnie przyjemnie się bawić samemu, bez dorosłych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Obrączka więc uwarunkowała wizję nieboszczyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli dla siebie dziwną sympatię i szacunek — z daleka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech pan lepiej to czyta, bo są czyste przynajmniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic, no nic — zagadnął żwawo tamten.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest takie proste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzbanek stojący w drugim kącie pokoju ożył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile razy przychodziłem do niej, matka jej głaskała mnie po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil czuł, że się dusi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba coś zrobić z czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje mi się, że to wszystkie pytania, które mam na ten moment.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mnie zaś nie wydaje się to niezwykłym u osobnika tego pokroju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil płynie powoli po własnych zdaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak by wyglądało, lecz to sprawy nie wyjaśnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczynił jeszcze jedną próbę, która, wiedział o tym, mogła tylko zaszkodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto ma wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oszalałe w swej zawziętości pszczoły nie ominęły zbliżonej do nich lewicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszli do niej i poczuli obaj ostry za pach, jaki wydziela podniecona kobieta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam skierowaliśmy z Halszką swe kroki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kelner przyniósł lody i trzy grube, okrągłe wafle, we tknięte w usta lodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ojciec zawołał go i powiedział: — Wiesz Emil, będziesz miał brata albo siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiamy przynależeć dodatkowo do jakiejś mniejszej grupy kulturowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20625730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu była granica panowania Amora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20626006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem Paweł wykładał o nie istniejących stworzeniach, fąflach, których istotą jest — udowadniał — nicość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrafisz być normalna, dobra? — Potrafię być tylko zła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie kobiety: jeden świat dla mężczyzn, drugi dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ścisnął głowę rękoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dziewczęta go znają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem jak woda, która przylega do ścian naczynia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakimże to sposobem sześćdziesiąt i pięć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nalał eteru na chustkę i wdychał go powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokarm wchodzi w nas, gdy jemy, i sprawia to nam przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzą na młodego króla, on nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bolała go głowa i oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może we śnie widział pan twarz podobną do mojej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniejsza o to!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogą się oderwać od biopodłoża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oko widziało zawsze jej ciąg dalszy, zatracając w próżni niepochwytną resztę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co wy jesteście za jedni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy typ ma swoje dwa nieomal przeciwne bieguny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panika pierwsza spada na sklepy i knajpy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że od najbliższego nowiu zacznie tutaj polować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I duch jego unosił się samotny i cierpiał z powodu swojej samotności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po przerwie: — To, co ostatnio powiedziałem, jest też prawdą, ale nie tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodatkowo, przypuszczam, że jest zwierzęciem jadowitym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I balon za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest stanowczo ktoś inny — uspokoił ją, wchodząc do wnętrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I może zabrzmi to pompatycznie, ale stwierdziłem, że chcę podjąć się wyzwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszno ci w torbie? — spytał ze współczuciem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachował dużo cech dziecinnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oficer stał na ulicy i wymyślał komuś ostatnimi słowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że jest rozpięty w oczekiwaniu, jak motyl pomiędzy szpilkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu kobiety nie zbuntują się przeciw tym strojom?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmianę ekspozycji mamy w czerwcu, więc na pół roku można obejrzeć dwie wystawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biały ogier arabski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotąd jeszcze, po rocznej przerwie, było w tym śmiechu coś poobiedniego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, ciężko mi się myśli w tej temperaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ja muszę jechać, bo mają mi robić operację ślepej kiszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygnać go z granic państwa i nigdy nie puścić z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział, że drzwi nie będą zamknięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, co za rozkosz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzył ją w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do strumienia, ludzie dobrzy, do strumienia! — wrzasnął uradowany nową obietnicą Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie słońce zsunęło się nisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jak łykanie śliny, gdy się chce pić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muzyka i gramofon z dołu psują powagę wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż bardzo lubiła leżeć w łóżku, wstawała od razu i buch do łazienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze zdziwieniem zauważyła, że w jej domu mieszka dwóch starszych chłopców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drodze mrużył oczy, które wydawały się jak wprawione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było powiedziane głosem, który nie powstał w krtani; głosem brzuchomówcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem na portalach poświęconych kinematografii film otrzymał dość słabe oceny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— My nic nie wiemy — mówią dozorcy więzienni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przestań — mówiła ta pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział szeptem: — Ludzie z gumowymi wężami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciusiowi krew uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie tylko wartości naszej firmy, ale i nasze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezultaty pewne otrzymuje się tylko indukcją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czym marzysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie uciekł Maciuś, nie wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może choć w części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O jedenastej znowu poszedłem do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli natknąłeś się na opisane stworzenie - będę wdzięczny za kontakt!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poproszę coś na kaszel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wierzę, Antoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może coś ci się w nim ciągle powtarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kosz, spadając w koziołkach, wysypał całą swą zawartość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za długo już siedzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc przeprowadzono chłopców z więzienia tu, do domu sierot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siłował się wszakże niedługo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albatrosy nie wrzeszczą, i to nie jest ładne wyrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marysia skinęła rzęsami, tak jakby kto inny skinął głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż może powiedzieć, ile biedny asceta w tych strasznych dniach wycierpiał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nalał eteru na chustkę i wdychał go powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Używasz menadżera haseł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest mistrzynią w sztuce kochania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz pospieszył do sieni i niecierpliwie otwarł drzwi wiodące na podwórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, wyłączyłem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna żyć, jak ciotka-tancerka, tylko lukiem o wiele wyższym i in nym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja twoich pieniędzy nie potrzebuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiam się, że tego nie zrozumiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panika pierwsza spada na sklepy i knajpy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę się połapać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niewidziane dawał się odczuwać kulisty i odległy pośpiech nadchodzącego spoza ziemi słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkiem mi to niepotrzebne!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spójrz w oczy moje lśniące!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli nastawione zegarki dokładnie na tę samą godzinę i byli bardzo punktualni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastrojem będzie rodzaj miłości, który nie daje żadnych objawów somatycznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybyś był uważał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego włóczysz się koło tego domu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem — odpowiedział pan i wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ja muszę jechać, bo mają mi robić operację ślepej kiszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż z tym dzieckiem, adoptowanym przez Rosjan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwna rzecz, ta Ewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza jej epilog nad ranem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pietrek na folwarku… — martwiła się panna Karolina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech no by go spytał o paszport ten przechodzący patrol…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie lubił przymusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zbyt nieśmiała, aby nie pojechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wpadli na korytarz, zaczęli przeszukiwać klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie tutaj — rzekł pan — chodźcie ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz prawo zachować milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opracował zasady i zbiory idei, które ja dzisiaj noszę w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy płonęły mu dziwnym blaskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy będę pół bogiem, pół czarnoksiężniczkiem, aby mieszać, lepić i rozpalać ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ich włosach rosną wodorosty, w granatowej, połyskującej wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poeto mój, przyszłam do ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbuję zajść z jednej strony, z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięcie w sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koło dziewiątej wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknął jej usta pocałunkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To należy podtrzymać za wszelką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał w półmroku, bo bał się ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ślicznie to powiedziałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schowali się na centralnej poczcie, w dużej hali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo wszystko od Janka pachniało lekko jakimś obcym zapachem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyna leży zdaje się w wyczerpaniu nerwowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od dwóch dni był nowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilowy zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie jak we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obraz był skończony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad wszystkimi wirował śnieg i ostre, podobne do cięcia, wrażenie: nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Magiczne; i to w wysokim stopniu rozwinięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież tego nie wyrzucę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na skinienie stryja wyszedł ponownie, zostawiając ich samych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz rację; w chwili gdy usłyszałam dźwięk jego głosu, złudzenie prysło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem — szepnął z uśmiechem i pogardliwie spojrzawszy na jednorękiego, przywołał go ruchem dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadaje mi niemal fizyczny ból.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co powie dyrektorowi? Ze chciałby kogoś zapisać do szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienaturalne podniecenie wzrasta do południa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest możliwe, żeby po dwudziestu rzutach monetą za każdym razem wyszedł orzeł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż na stację wtoczył się pociąg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki syknął z bólu i z rozkoszy, która się wraz z bólem narzuciła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po kwadransie była wyleczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż dziś, prawie mimo woli, wiedziony jakimś tajemnym przeczuciem spróbowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się załamuje, pryska, rozwiewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obok siedzi delegat królów i drzemie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ściany pochylają się nade mną i wyginają, jak widziane przez wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wtedy byłem nieszczęśliwy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz oto szli znikąd — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżynier drżał z niecierpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uścisnęli się w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umieli mu na to odpowiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci są lekkomyślne i niedoświadczone…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięcie w sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W „pańskiej” Polsce… — zaczął mówca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłócą się starsze z młodszymi, chłopcy z dziewczynkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam przy sobie gotówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tłumaczyłam ci już sto razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nie zwracał na niego uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten się śmieje, kto się śmieje ostatni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyczytać to było można z jej oczu, z wyrazu twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jednak nawet za królestwo niebieskie nie oddałbym jednej chwili pełnej świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grasz z nami w gry planszowe w niedzielę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świadomość opinii publicznej oczywiście pomaga reporterowi i sprawie, za którą walczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięść, mój kochany, to za ordynarny argument.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Policzyłem dni i zrobiło mi się nieswojo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech tylko jeden drugiemu wręcza ją ostrożnie, żeby nie uciekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęła je bić po tyłku i biła je długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziliśmy od drzwi do drzwi z pustymi żołądkami i zbieraliśmy podpisy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały ciąg owych daremnie straconych lat jaśniałeś w sercu moim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co się bawisz jeszcze? — W kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okresy, kiedy się leży na samym dnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś szarpnął mnie silnie za rękaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Część zginęła w boju, część siedzi w obozie dla jeńców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koty i psy to najpopularniejsze zwierzęta domowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz, mnie, mój drogi, jest bardzo trudno stworzyć człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment ten uwiecznił rzeźbiarz w marmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy spostrzegł wystającą z wewnętrznej kieszeni jego żakietu fotografię Stachy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może podać wody?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może nie czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę wyjść! — krzyczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy Emil zrobił nieokreśloną minę i rozbeczał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ślepiec — ten, psiawiara, jurny był i nie w ciemię bity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się trochę zmęczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączanie siedmiu przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na palcach podeszliśmy do sztalugi, by śledzić przebieg pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Połów był przedziwny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może, że po drodze wypadnie nam się bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla takiej frajdy nie trzeba było iść tak daleko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jesteś? Przecież masz ładne włosy, zwłaszcza gdy je rozrzuca wiatr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż dystans do Warszawy będzie rósł…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bona zaprowadziła go do łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niby nic się nie zmieniło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz te chwile buntu trwały krótko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była od niego o dwa lata starsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas potopu, pogasły gwiazdy na niebie i znikły światła na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lubię ten szum, Jerzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, byłem zaślepiony i nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja już nie pamiętam hasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Galeria organizuje wystawy indywidualne i zbiorowe artystów polskich i zagranicznych oraz wystawy problemowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób zmieniano swoje „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spaceruję po lesie, z duszą na ramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między dwoma miastami wyrósł kamienny mur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daremny trud, drzwi są szczelnie zasłonięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak nie poruszył on dotąd wcale portfelu... Dlaczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całuję twoje kręcone włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiedz mi, jakimi środkami osiągacie takie cuda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba znów zacząć; ale na złość jeszcze lepszą buduję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na leśnej, na polanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewien mądry człowiek o chrystianizmie: „Stal można złamać, guma jest niezwal- czona”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w nogi, nie czeka nas tu nic dobrego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pod dotknięciem różdżki czarodziejskiej przeistoczyła się jej postać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła ją łagodnie i znikła w głębi domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci mają swoje troski i smutki, ci swoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawiało im przyjemność ryzyko, że zostaną zobaczeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba żaden z was nie był jeszcze w Wenecji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie to nowiny w krótkich, bezładnych słowach przynosił nam telefon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odprowadźcie doktora i pannę Irving do domu, dobrze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapamiętajcie to sobie; bo nuż wypadnie i z tymi się spotkać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby go te mniszki nie odkryły, musiał go Hubert ukryć starannie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę to zresztą zrobić dla bezpieczeństwa mej własnej osoby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w dobrem zdrowiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obok siebie ścierają się dwa wpływy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Na czele oddziału artylerzystów rzuciłem się naprzód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmyślając tak, nie spostrzegł kiedy sen zmorzył mu powieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo to, widzi pan, podziałała tak na niego śmierć syna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem zatem więźniem w tym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałeś pan zdarzenie dziwne i wyszedłeś z niego cało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozejrzał się podejrzliwie po wagonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz to zrobimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczy się pan wytrzymywać efekty, przygoto wywać je jak wielki pianista crescenda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasz pan nie przyjaźni się z nikim w okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zechcesz mię pan przedstawić pani i tej młodej damie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa jej ścięły mi krew w żyłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiadomości spod Chartumu były złe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miał nigdy trudności z włożeniem do piczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie jednakże uszedł kilkadziesiąt kroków, inna niespodzianka go spotkała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozdrawiam śmieszków z Internetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędzej prędzej na wroga...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szewca ani słychu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złowrogi kapral podążył za nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może, że nie zabawisz długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezwykła wycieczka samochodem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza kępą drzew płomienie objęły dymiący niedawno dom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdemu niebezpieczeństwu wiadomemu umiał stawić czoło mężnie, ale niepewność przyprowadzała go do rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człek skurczony przyczołgał się bliżej i zasłania się fałdami spódnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozbili go w proch w oka mgnieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopiec schwycił topór i jednem uderzeniem rozłupał kowadło, wbijając w nie brodę starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie drzwi od sieni zamknęły się za naszym gościem, Holmes zbiegł ze schodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powietrze napełniło się krzykiem i donośnem dźwięczeniem łańcuchów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego towarzysz spojrzał na niego z przerażeniem i zgrozą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poślemy tego szala na wystawę paryską!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tutaj nic się nie zmieniło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowczo było to coś niezwykłego i natychmiast postanowiłem wyświetlić podejrzaną sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to za radość, kiedy pan stanie u celu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zagrzmiały trąby i w mgnieniu oka napełniły dolinę rozgłośnem, nieulękłem graniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemożliwie się zachowuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rząd nasz jak tylko mógł najśpieszniej, ładował wojsko na okręty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinął mi głową i skierował się ku drzwiom mieszkania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czerwone języki strzelały wysoko w górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiłował się uśmiechnąć, szare oczy spotkały moje z lękliwym, niepewnym wyrazem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słynne muskuły i tym razem zapewniły mu powszechny „głęboki“ szacunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po powrocie przywitamy was serdecznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem to po nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszczęły się rozmowy i hałas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjaciel towarzyszył mu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To już chyba jest więcej aniżeli zwykły śmiertelnik znieść może!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to się powtórzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22571897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żołnierze wiedzieli, dokąd i po co idą, i cieszyli się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłodno tu jakoś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyna pyta z niedowierzaniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak byłoby najciekawiej, najlepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spiesz się, mamy czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za tymi światłami skręć w lewo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że od dziecka uczyłem się angielskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może w ogóle mnie nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mając lat siedem czuł już, jak należy postępować z lekarzami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stan jest wybitnie samobójczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczuł strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nim ją zabiorą, to Ewa ma za swoje jaki miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Abraham zrodził Izaaka, Izaak zrodził Jakuba, to jest po dobne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma powodu do obaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny demon: świadome chcenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Później nastała noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za napój?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie mogę się tak mę czyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil uczył ją grać na fortepianie, bo była muzykalna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każde pismo istnieje w pewnym celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi na fortepianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie uprzedzajmy wypadków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie jesteś głodna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wyście to przysłali? — powtórzył staruszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przymknąłem na chwilę olśnione oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię do ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, ale on mieszka tam z jedną panienką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie podszedł pod okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do Moskwy! — powtórzyła, wszystko mieszcząc w tym słowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paluszek i główka to szkolna wymówka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie wasza dziewka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurczowo zacisnął dłoń na kolbie rewolweru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aleś ty pierwszy trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robotnicy ogłosili strajk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę prosić o powtórzenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czy można było tak zaraz, od razu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora źrenice miałem rozszerzone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przebudziłem się… — powtórzył z namysłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże to nagłe zamyślenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuśćmy, że wsiadłem w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudził mnie śpiew ptaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak można sprzeciwiać się pani?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Załatwiłam bez pana wiedzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś nie żałuje, że uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przydałby się tu jakiś wybieg dla psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej, w czym mogę Ci pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kolega po zawodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałam go, jak miałam sześć lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodziłeś z domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha! — rzekła Marta z radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś gdzieś Szymona?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza jak makiem zasiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To moja tajemnica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, moja droga, tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja już nic nie chcę — nic nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to chciej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Malutka jest, paluszki ma malutkie i tak strasznie mało rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawdopodobnie będzie najlepsze określenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona się denerwuje widać, w sposób specyficzny, i zamknęła oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My pragniemy pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona stropiła się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widzi ich też ktoś inny prócz mnie na moście?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pompuje się wodę, robi się studnie podziemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z prawdziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to nawet ładnie z naszej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wiedzieć, ile? Dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli przez miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłuchał pokorny jak baranek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan tak dobrze tańczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczemu on robi błędy, jak nas uczy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może drży wskutek zimna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drodzy państwo, pozwólcie, że już zacznę wykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w męczącej sytuacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale stawianie diagnoz nie leczy jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ma innej rady, jak powiedzieć? — Nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecał, że będzie przysyłał pieniądze co miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym pragnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta śpiewał, król nasłuchiwał, a wszyscy obecni głośno objawiali swój zachwyt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włazić w skórę innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech dusza powraca do ciała!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gasiła światło, rozbierała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasztan zaczął z wolna wydzielać swój nocny zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta jej wyrzucały słowa ciemne dla mnie i niezrozumiałe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz iść do kina na „Hotel du Nord”? — Nic nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina była spokoju pełna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmęczenie po trzech seansach portretowych zniknęło zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą więc uwagę skierowałem na konia, widocznie tracącego resztki sił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skorzystaj z tego, jeżeli ci życie miłe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy zaczęli przeskakiwać przez płot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On pytał: — Jak szłaś tak przez miasto, dziewczynko? Ona milczała, rozpinała płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czterech fortepianach, w czterech krańcach pensjona tu, ćwiczyli uczniowie Finsena.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy uczułem, że drży cała i słania mi się w uścisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już się gdzieś podziała jego liberia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ten przyrząd do czego służy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One wyglądają jak cygara — i Ela była znów niby dorosła, poważna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech wypije szklankę wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że jestem cholerykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego pan nie kupił na stacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej nozdrza drgały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co dzień tu przychodzić będę — oświadczył Radek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala waliła go batem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił znowu kulawiec i znowu machnął ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miesiączka jest ciągłym memento vivere.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno wyrzucać zużytych baterii do zwykłych śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie przypomina kształtem kłącza małego człowieczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeptać będę! — uprzedziła go z uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stacji, jak zwykle, czekał już mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy się człowiek spieszy, to się diabeł cieszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę mieć spokój i wygodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem mag ginie w tym wypadku zatruty własnym jadem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykała się na klucz w małym pokoju, który sobie wywalczyła po wielu awanturach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idź już, Jur! — rzekła łagodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano krzyknął: — Marysiu! Otwarła oczy, zanurzone w śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Publicznie spotykamy się ponownie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to zarówno dobre dla niej, jak zbawienne dla niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze śnię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Bóg łaskaw — sypiam jak suseł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście istnieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Wierusz wrócił?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu się tak wpatrujesz we mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielki Pisarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo i tak jest zaiste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z moją skłonnością do pisania jest tak, jak z tubą pasty do zębów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gniewa się pan? — uśmiechnął się kapitan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem, choroba naszej babuni była to nowa młodość, nowe życie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabory, Druga Wojna Światowa i powstania to często poruszane wśród Polaków tematy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przekona się pan o tym wkrótce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A przecież panu coś na mnie zależy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczynał odczuwać znużenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A na drugi dzień miał już Maciuś cały plan złożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległo się uderzenie trąb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze jesteś taki, jak ja chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieść pełza cicho po lesie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak śmiesznie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem z drzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybierać się, jak sójka za morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważał, że to są formy przymusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hela, nie powiedziawszy ani słowa, zamknęła się w swoim pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie cierpię czarnych rzeczy — zawołała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przebył pan szczęśliwie nader poważną chorobę; wszelkie wzruszenia mogłyby panu zaszkodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem w towarzystwie czterech równie zachwyconych tą sytuacją osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła? — spytał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę wyjść! — krzyczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło, robi się ciemno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odbiliśmy od przystani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięść, mój kochany, to za ordynarny argument.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale biada temu, kto da się przeważyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmaite mogłyby być sposoby rodzenia się, umierania i odradzania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pierwszy ten lepszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie chcę o tym słuchać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem podobny do mokrej szmaty, do psów po deszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie rozmawialiśmy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nigdy nie wiadomo, co jest potrzebne, a co zbyteczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tu sama gospodyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień jej na horyzoncie pańskiego życia już zaświtał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jest miła i dość ładna kokotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj zgodnym krokiem ruszyli w jednaką zawsze drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadzwoń na sto dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie możemy iść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, że będą się spotykać, ale nie tak, jak do tychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio dużo myślałem nad własnym stanem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Obyśmy wszyscy żyli dobrze i zgodnie z sobą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już jest prawie jasno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odszedłem z uczuciem ulgi i wkrótce zasnąłem głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączanie siedmiu przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdawało mi się, że nad strumieniem wszystko się wyjaśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pamiętam kiedy ostatni raz widziałem policjanta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak… nie wiesz o tym nawet…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego tu szukasz? — zapytałem ostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon zadzwonił znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ty myślisz, że między „chcieć” a „nie chcieć” jest jakaś różnica? Żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Wiesz, to jest ten inteligentny kawaler, który miał ochotę, opowiadałam ci, pocałować mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągnęła się samotna i naga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oboje mieli tę samą śmiertelną ranę, koło lewej pachy nad sercem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jutro rano odbędzie się tutaj konferencja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta nasze spotkały się, a ciała splotły w miłosnym szale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I on niewiele więcej wie o tobie, aniżeli ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego Jaś się nie nauczy, tego Jan nie będzie umiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak widzicie, trzyma się ściśle prawdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona była uparta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były nastawione ku północnemu zachodowi, gdzie jeszcze niebo jaśniało dość pogodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wywołać go może zbytnie nasilenie myśli lub nadzwyczajne napięcie uczuciowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież to jest cudowna rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Filologia na usługach astronomii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech i łopot serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na leżaku i zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takiej chwili pasiecie się? — zawołał młody muł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan pójdzie tam ze mną, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, dziecko, dziecko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona oznajmiła gestem, że chciałaby także coś robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysze mojej wędrówki odeszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od przybytku głowa nie boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie: Cyganki mają twarde włosy, a ona mięciutkie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip był dużym chłopcem, ale nieprzyjemnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrzyła, lekko podnosząc brwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jeszcze twoi rodzice nie odjechali? — burknął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drgnął jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, jak ludzie żyją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawo wyraźnie zezwala na to!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno uderzenie polanem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z literatury rosyjskiej uznawał tylko Dostojewskiego i Babla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz mnie zgubić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciał jechać koleją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to bym zrobiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem swą pracę i zauważyłem niebawem, że zbliżający się egzamin to sprawa pilna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla dwu ludzi znalazło się jeszcze miejsce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo godzina twoja już się zbliża, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedź pan — powiedział, ale sanitariusz nie odjeżdżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz te chwile buntu trwały krótko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie zapytał, Ewa nie powiedziała mu nic o wyniku oględzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maria, popróbuj i ty; ja też spróbuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprzód nie czułem, ale teraz, kiedy siedzę spokojnie i mam zmartwienie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczycielki były jej mniej lub więcej obojętne, stary profesor łaciny był „słodki”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć przyćmiona długo oczekiwanymi konkurentami, może budzić emocje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to również byłoby nieszczęściem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wpuszczono mnie do wnętrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno! — odparł z westchnieniem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba nie pozostaną długo na lądzie, jak sądzisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może weź parę dni urlopu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co teraz będzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w nogi, nie czeka nas tu nic dobrego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadanie swoje objaśniła rysunkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieśni poety były na ustach wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekka nieobecność samego siebie w świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy jestem bardzo zdenerwowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież takie były miękkie, jedwabiste, taki miały żywy połysk!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy postanowił zaatakować go wprost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ma wisieć, nie utonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spuść do połowy masztu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To szaleństwo i zabobon! — krzyknąłem wzburzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach! — krzyknęła płaczliwym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba zajrzę po drodze do księgarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W postać geniusza ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na początku jest zdanie: wszystko jest możliwe i wszystko jest prawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo na morzu szaruga…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba stąd odjeżdżać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecku należy dać wszelkie możliwości do zabaw i rozrywek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocham cię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten warunek nie jest już teraz dla Kamy nieodzowny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwny to był most!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywidziało ci się, Stacha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc może postawić pałki tym, którzy myśleli o lekcji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale są świetnie wycelowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec, milcząc, ssał swój tatarak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filozof Joachim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz oświadczył, że to apopleksja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz się zdobyć na cierpliwość, Jerzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbrzydnie im to bardzo prędko i całkiem przestaną się mną zajmować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę nosić okulary które mają aż dziesięć dioptrii dla prawego oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na krótką chwilę zapanowała między nami kłopotliwa cisza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spodziewałam się tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkajmy się na piwko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak powinien wyglądać świat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent miał już otworzony brzuch, w którym było widać tylko żółto- -białą masę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Malinowe? Skinęła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się z obrzydzeniem i skierowałem spojrzenie w dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie uciekł Maciuś, nie wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jeśli ona nie wsiądzie po drodze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście trzeba na to woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przecież dawno miniona przeszłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko z trudem uratowaliśmy córkę, której groziło poważne niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W sklepie się woda zapaliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wracaj do przedziału!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wojownik musi być śmiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciemności czuł się jak w dużej wodzie i bał się zanurzyć w sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wolałabym wstrzymać się od wróżby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety musiałem wyjechać nie zobaczywszy się z nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chyba zewsząd, bo i leśna jest, i ruczajna, i górska, i wszelaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mieliśmy czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięta doskonale: kiedyś przeziębił się — przyszło zapalenie płuc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwiaty jesienne rychło przemijają…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogłem napisać coś więcej, skoro nic więcej nie wiedziałem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz zasnął na przyrodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Ciebie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponury, pełen nie spodziewanych blasków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20623590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazajutrz po południu rozpętała się burza, a woda lała się strumieniami z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28716365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiem również w sprawie Kosowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28716367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczba ludności na świecie rośnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28716422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada tego nie chciała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28716424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszej obecnej polityki migracyjnej dłużej nie można akceptować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28716486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W budżecie jest wiele niefortunnych działów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28716488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doprowadzi to do katastrof społecznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28716910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasługuje on na nasze pełne uznanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28716912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsze dotyczy celów redukcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28716923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nasz święty obowiązek jako demokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28716924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Politycy muszą uznać ogromne znaczenie branży turystycznej w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28725288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazuje to, że nasza polityka warunkowości działa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28725291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważna dla mnie jest jeszcze jedna sprawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28725293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za wszystko, co pani zrobiła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28776291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, tego nie da się zrobić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28776292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że pan rzecznik o tym wie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28776294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przymierze mówi do każdego z nas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28776295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, możecie państwo wierzyć, albo i nie, referendum\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28776296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zbrodnia nie obywa się bez ofiar\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28776297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo Pani dziękuję za oddanie tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28776299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy mówić jednym głosem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28776300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kontrola i monitorowanie to zadania państwa członkowskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28797967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc wprost\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28797968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"z uwagi na nieobecność delegacji Czadu, czy jakoś tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28797970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej będziemy bezbronni, za co zapłacimy naszym bezpieczeństwem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_28797971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.684,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie na naszych oczach rozgrywa się druga rewolucja w świecie arabskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29073848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mobilizujecie skrajną prawicę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29073850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starszym kobietom trudniej jest się bronić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29111094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałam to wyjaśnić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29111096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w ten sposób rok cennych prac poszedł na marne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29111097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego typu sytuacje są głównym przedmiotem dzisiejszej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29111098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reakcja zależy zatem od nastroju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29111105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma ona trzy główne cele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29111110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właśnie ta idea stoi za konwencją z Aarhus\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29111112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to właśnie robimy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29111113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miliony osób głodują, brakuje wody\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29246149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samoregulacja nie wystarczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29246152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogą to sobie Państwo wyobrazić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29246180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I drugie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29246182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można mówić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29246183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie protestują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29246184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinny być pożyczki kryzysowe i nic więcej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29246214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacytuję z języka angielskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29246217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodząc do meritum sprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29304387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludziom w Rosji żyje się coraz lepiej, a Rosja staje się krajem demokratycznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29304396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak żniwo śmierci jest coraz większe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29304397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że władze litewskie opamiętają się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29304515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W stanowisku Parlamentu nie ma na ten temat żadnej wzmianki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29304516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jedyne rozwiązanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29304521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, niewystarczająco, powiedziałabym - jeszcze nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29304693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszej kolejności potrzebujemy odpowiedzi na liczne pytania, na przykład\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29304696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwalczanie przemocy wobec kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_29304699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tabele wyników rynku wewnętrznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30338976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiam się, że nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30338978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo trudno jest mi mówić panu, że jedno jest lepsze od drugiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30338980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie w toku jest kilka spraw, ale wszystkie one toczą się przed sądami krajowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30338981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że będziemy zdolni do wykorzystania tych technologii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30338983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz pozwolę sobie omówić Hiszpanię z punktu widzenia Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30338984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy jednak działać rozważnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30338985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to możliwie jak najszybciej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30339009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec sprawa nie mniej ważna - temat pytań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30339012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy teraz będziemy obserwować powtórzenie tej sytuacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30339014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest on doskonałym przykładem naszych wspólnych wysiłków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30339015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sadzenie drzew pomaga w walce z pustynnieniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30357543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego oczekuje od nas europejska opinia publiczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37813442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na to zgody być nie może\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37813445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy stanowić przykład, wspierając handel międzynarodowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37813517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.412,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37813518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widoczny jest zupełny brak zdolności przewidywania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37813519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym kontekście ogłoszenie niepodległości stanowi normalny proces\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37813520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma tu z pewnością żadnego usprawiedliwienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37813521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyliżbym cię obraził?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że nowy kompromis nie zawiera tych antykonsumenckich poprawek, więc proponuję jego zaakceptowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzi głównie o telekomunikację, ochronę środowiska, transport, finanse i usługi prawnicze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod koniec tego roku przyjmiemy komunikat \\\"W kierunku nowego kompleksowego podejścia do zapobiegania katastrofom\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekuję, że Komisja przedstawi wkrótce wniosek dotyczący nadzoru stosowania środków przeciwdrobnoustrojowych w sektorze hodowlanym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Likwidację i demontaż należy przeprowadzać zgodnie z surowymi zasadami i standardami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę im wierzyć, ale to twierdzenie trzeba udowodnić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka Komisji Europejskiej wymaga zmiany kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko jeden kandydat europejski podjął odpowiednią kampanię, nawiązując kontakty z różnymi państwami członkowskimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak mogą państwo oczekiwać, że przekonają państwo ludzi, jeśli sami brzmią państwo tak nieprzekonująco?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas ostatniej sesji plenarnej wywołaliśmy pozytywne poruszenie władz gospodarczych, aby zabezpieczyć Europę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polscy pracodawcy chcą szerszego otwarcia rynku pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś zagryzł wargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy mieć możliwość konkurowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka podstawa prawna istnieje i powinny jej towarzyszyć przepisy dotyczące różnorodności i pluralizmu mediów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Alternatywnie, zasilą szeregi posłów niezrzeszonych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To samo odnosi się do zamówień publicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje doświadczenia ze Szwajcarii przypominały doświadczenia moich kolegów przebywających w innych krajach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaka jest sytuacja, na przykład, w zakresie naszego prawodawstwa dotyczącego własności intelektualnej i patentów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy ponadto radzić sobie z zewnętrznymi wpływami politycznymi, które mogą mieć niekorzystne reperkusje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja ostatnia uwaga będzie bardzo krótka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poważne przeformułowanie tych celów będzie wymagało refleksji nad sposobami wdrażania procesu w państwach członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że po podpisaniu traktatu, nie będzie powodu, aby spocząć na lurach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoli to konsumentom na wcześniejsze uzyskanie kupowanego produktu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym im w imieniu naszej grupy szczerze za to podziękować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W traktacie z Lizbony takie rozwiązanie zostało ustanowione i przyniosłoby ono korzyści\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Procedura wizowa to jest tak naprawdę upokarzanie milionów ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą co ich sprawa Maciusia tak bardzo obchodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłowie i senatorowie polskiego parlamentu mają szereg uprawnień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo panu nie wolno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"gdy dana grupa jest atakowana, musi reagować jako jedna całość i solidarnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako główny obserwator nie brałem osobiście udziału w tych konsultacjach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rynki mają dziś pierwsze i ostatnie słowo i należy zapytać, dlaczego tak jest\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ten Parlament Europejski nie zaakceptuje \\\"zwykłego stanu rzeczy\\\" w europejskiej strategii zatrudnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zatem Europa zamierza obwieścić w Stambule?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fundusze hedgingowe i niepubliczny rynek kapitałowy są właśnie sukcesorami dążenia do liberalizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Największa tragedia Chińczyków wiąże się jednak z katastrofami politycznymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości powiedziałem coś zupełnie odwrotnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi się to zmienić, by ustalanie priorytetów mogło odbywać się w sposób właściwy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele z nich nie ma wystarczających zasobów finansowych, aby prowadzić postępowanie patentowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, należy wysłać do Gruzji prawdziwą wielonarodową misję pokojową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samo to, że przeszedłem operację znaczy, że nie posiadam mocy czynienia cudów - nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto Unia Europejska jest największym dawcą pomocy rozwojowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to właściwe, jeżeli podlega rygorystycznym kontrolom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejne pokolenia muszą uczyć się o wydarzeniach tamtego okresu, ponieważ nie doświadczyły ich bezpośrednio\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwalczanie terroryzmu musi stanowić wspólny wysiłek, w którym mają udział wszystkie demokracje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego typu represyjne polityki są prawdziwą przyczyną największej tragedii Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.532,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym podziękować Trybunałowi Obrachunkowemu, ale chciałabym też powiedzieć, że jestem rozczarowana tym rocznym sprawozdaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życzymy panu wielu sukcesów zarówno w Komisji, jak i w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze chciałbym podziękować posłom do Parlamentu Europejskiego za ich bardzo pozytywne głosy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"skutki transgraniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyrektywy, która znalazła się pod obstrzałem po niektórych bardzo kontrowersyjnych wyrokach Europejskiego Trybunału Sprawiedliwości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to szczyt innowacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż można jednak nie uwzględnić niezaprzeczalnych korzyści handlowych jednolitego rynku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Katastrofa w Japonii zmusza nas do ponownego dogłębnego rozważenia kwestii bezpieczeństwa jądrowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególnie zależało nam, aby działać zgodnie z zasadą, którą znają państwo jako najważniejsze przykazanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobiście chciałbym jednak skorzystać z okazji i zadać panu komisarzowi pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że jutro będziemy w stanie znaleźć właściwe rozwiązanie, czyli to, które proponuję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotem polemiki jest klasyfikacja atlantyckiego tuńczyka błękitnopłetwego żyjącego w wodach Morza Śródziemnego i Atlantyku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka państw członkowskich już uznało Kosowo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"możemy wygrać jedynie, gdy będziemy pracować w oparciu o wspólne cele i wspólną wolę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak stało się w przypadku programów bliskowschodnich, Partnerstwa Wschodniego i w wielu innych obszarach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"taka osoba zostaje oskarżona, nawet jeśli nie miała zamiaru spowodowania takiego aktu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36942999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rodzi się jednak pytanie, jak osiągnąć ten cel?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36943000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie nie istnieje jednak kompleksowa strategia, a przecież musimy działać bezzwłocznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36943001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta różnica jest skutkiem braku organów do przeszczepienia w porównaniu do potrzeb\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36943002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na potwierdzenie tego faktu chciałbym przytoczyć tylko jeden przykład\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36943003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cel był jasny, wspieramy rolę kobiet we współpracy na rzecz rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36943004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje pytanie także dotyczy strategii dla regionu Dunaju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36943005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzajemne połączenia pomiędzy sieciami krajowymi to pierwszy krok w stronę jednolitego wewnętrznego rynku energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36943006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotny wkład w te postępy miało członkostwo w Europejskim Obszarze Gospodarczym i strefie Schengen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36943007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dane statystyczne dotyczące połowów i działalności rybackiej na północno-zachodnim Atlantyku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36943008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się tyczy sąsiedztwa wschodniego, pragnę poruszyć trzy kwestie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, nie miał żadnej broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugie, że każą im dawać dobry przykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytali je najczęściej na spotkaniach, rzadziej w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby człowiek miał cztery ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nietrudno domyślić się: jeden z nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim kulawiec zdążył powstać z upadku, znikła w rozbłyskanej słońcem zieleni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wiesz, dlaczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wessała Emila kompletnie i bez żadnego trudu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odebrać i oddać natychmiast w moje ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez namysłu schowałem kukłę do wewnętrznej kieszeni żakietu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy nie mógłbym prosić szanownego pana o ogień?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość bym jej zrobił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobista współpraca zbyteczna — recytował ogłoszenie, którego się nauczył na pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu była granica panowania Amora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, teraz jesteś dostatecznie zła, więc możemy roz mawiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas! — powtórzył jednoręki i poprawił torbę na plecach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z punktu widzenia nawyków codziennych wyglądał niedorzecznie, jak przesadnie wielki zbieg okoliczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jasnowłosy był jak ty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała ona lat dziewięćdziesiąt jeden, to znaczy trzynaście razy po siedem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tego nie odpuszczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się jest czynnością rytualną, prastarą, jak miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chowali go, chronili, by nie wpadł we wrogie ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie oczekuje od ciebie milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, zgniecie mu żebra, zdruzgoce klatkę piersiową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetny to orszak widzów, świetny, zaprawdę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dla mężczyzn życie jest sztuką, gdzie większość z nich zaledwie istnieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli spóźni ci się autobus, to ewentualnie mogę cię podwieźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W pociągu — zawsze tylko w pociągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ani porównania z ospałą, gęstą i cuchnącą wodą kanałów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W zaczarowanym pałacu, jeśli już chcesz koniecznie wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w głębi ducha postanowiłem zrezygnować z tego zaszczytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne mi się wydało, że mam z chłopakami się gonić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przekona się pan o tym wkrótce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, cóż, idziemy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic wam, bracia i siostry, nie mogę powiedzieć, choć wiem wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby chciało mnie ostrzec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo i tak jest zaiste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy przez sień do izby na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że on nie bardzo pragnie, bym żył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W torbie, przerzuconej przez plecy, ma zapasy na cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybierać się, jak sójka za morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie chciał „uciekać”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręgosłup moralny nie pozwoliłby ani pani, ani mnie robić wspólnie interesów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeważa członek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tobie zawdzięczam wszystko, bo moja młodość, moje życie jest twoim dziełem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schudłem cztery kilo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę minut po dziewiątej byłem w mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzyma się za tę cienką nić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił znowu kulawiec i znowu machnął ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwudziestego dziewiątego czerwca imieniny obchodzą Piotr i Paweł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20677346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tulił głowę do jej kolan w pokorze uwielbienia…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One wyglądają jak cygara — i Ela była znów niby dorosła, poważna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Burza z wichrem szalała pod samotną chatką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mieszka tu gdzieś w pobliżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znam ja te wasze gorączki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił pisać o morzu, o jechaniu okrętem, bo uważał, że to też była wycieczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tamten jest trójdzielny — odpowiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wpadli na korytarz, zaczęli przeszukiwać klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz spróbuję je sparaliżować choć w części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego dobrze robi mężczyzna, gdy jej przypina odłamki świata do uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odgłosy te i szmery nie uszły uwagi zaczajonych nasłuchiwaczy niedomówień leśnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I drzewo żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znaczy nie miziała się z żadną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie publiczne musi być organiczne lub mechaniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To należy podtrzymać za wszelką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec nieraz mi wyjaśniał wszystko, a ja wam to zaraz powtórzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast odpowiedzi Andrzej przybliżył mi do oczu kukłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście, ceny mogą być dla niektórych zbyt wysokie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20678569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie z gumowymi wężami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czterech fortepianach, w czterech krańcach pensjona tu, ćwiczyli uczniowie Finsena.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palto miał rzeczywiście krzywo zapięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym tkwi gra polityczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz na tym nie koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecież lekko cuchnąć nie jest rzeczą przykrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulice były wilgotne, błotniste, śliskie, przysłonięte zimną a posępną mgłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten nabożny wysiłek potwierdził w bacznych oczach kulawca wartość zdobyczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym mieć swój dom albo mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My się żremy, a dla nich tylko zabawa…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest trochę dzikich zwierząt, tylko trzeba wiedzieć, gdzie szukać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Szczur wodny” — to niby rybak, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy? — Dziś albo jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To naprawdę było przyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dama nie siadała, ale za to zaczęła się śmiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W postaci kolejarza zaszła w tej chwili zagadkowa metamorfoza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, dobrotliwy nasz panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o wzięciu kremu do opalania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez namysłu schowałem kukłę do wewnętrznej kieszeni żakietu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie lubił przymusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz co ci to właściwie szkodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wierzaj mi, że ci zabalsamowani ludzie są mało podobni do żywych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacznijmy od monologów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciej był tego pewien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się, wydając jakieś rozkazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach tak, teraz rozumiem — to też rodzaj wróżby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspomniałem, że nagle na szybie żywą muchę dostrzegłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż takiego zaszło między wami? — zapytałem, nie zdradzając swych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj lat sześćdziesiąt — jutro dwadzieścia, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście była zajęta wyłącznie sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, zwariowałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym gwiazdę z nieba i szybkę z okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co właściwie stanęło na przeszkodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec nieraz mi wyjaśniał wszystko, a ja wam to zaraz powtórzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość bym jej zrobił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil ma stosunkowo małego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był już wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasia wyszła na podwórko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż mi zabroni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pytanie jest bezzasadne, proszę pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schudłem cztery kilo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż jest wyższego ponad słowo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powtórz jeszcze raz — prosił Krzysiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli spóźni ci się autobus, to ewentualnie mogę cię podwieźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20694715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję panu, doktorze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On też był pierwszym i ostatnim rektorem Uniwersytetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysze mojej wędrówki odeszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Mój chłopcze, mama obiecała mi dzisiaj, że pojadę sama na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przyłożyłem ucho do piersi nędzarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczynania tego reżysera są obserwowane od dłuższego czasu przez krytyków filmowych oraz opinię publiczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zejdę jeszcze na dół, mam kilka rzeczy do zrobienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój kolega lubi grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochał Indian, detektywów, włamywaczy i psy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota lekarz dyżurny myśli, że będę od razu chciał popełnić samobójstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No i przypuszczam też, dzielny człowiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekretarz wyjął notatnik i ołówek z kieszeni surduta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na leżaku i zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To już mój trzeci grill z rzędu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz poszedł do pokoju, ale zostawił otworem drzwi do sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wieloma uprawiałem seks\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ptaszek odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A było tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, obawiam się, że nie mam pojęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, ta to się będzie złościć, jak mnie zobaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zdziwiło mnie, że pierwszy raz płacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez krzyż, znak śmierci widzę szczelinę w kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki kamień, który ma zastąpić kotwicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Seniora — odparłem, tonąc oczyma w jej oczach — jestem panią oczarowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapraszam pana do tablicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinał jej bluzkę, a ona pozwalała na to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na upór nie ma lekarstwa, może was inni przekonają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali towarzysze stanęli mu po bokach gwoli przecięcia możliwej ucieczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej skoczyli na równe nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tem nic nie wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, po co tu dużo mówić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puls był przyśpieszony i nerwowy, gorączka niezmiernie wysoka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchały z niej kłęby pary, jak z okna pralni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę, masz pan!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jutro oczekujemy przybycia karawany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie pan, nie mam zaufania do tego jegomościa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to nader przyjemna niespodzianka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed walką nie dowie się w każdym razie o niczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu obcych nie puszcza się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio jeden z takich zjawił się w kopalni Wilsona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Psy przeleciały pod parkanem i znalazły się już na drugiej stronie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jacy to dobrzy ludzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To on tam stoi w wejściu pomiędzy tłumem rozwścieczonych i awanturujących się robotników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie daj, Boże, dostać się w jego ręce!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie ojciec mój jest bardziej, niż kiedykolwiek zaniepokojony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, Mistrz to pies potężny, to nasza chluba w całem hrabstwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świadczyły o tem szerokie ramiona i kościste, węzłowate ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyż to się skończy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewniam pana, że bynajmniej nie ustępujemy pańskiemu rodowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Groźnie zaciśnięte pięści podniosły się ku górze...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wskazówki zegaru stały na godzinie wpół do dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój syn tak samo odmawiał modlitwę, gotując się na śmierć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie zdecydowałem, że spotkanie to polepszyło nasze położenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On z największą przyjemnością przyjmie pana na praktykę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak minął tydzień, drugi, trzeci, wreszcie minął miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjechał tu, ażeby przynieść ci ulgę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszak sam pan przyzna, że przed doktorem ukryć tego nie można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do miłego widzenia, dobranoc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądając zaś kata, nie wyrzekła ani słowa“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie odważał się spojrzeć mu prosto w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten cios był wspaniały!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle światełko znikło, lecz zjawiło się zaraz w innem, wyższem oknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właśnie najniebezpieczniejsze miejsce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idźcie do domu kapralu, za chwilę i ja tam przyjdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stronnicy Wilsona wyli poprostu z zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnicy spojrzeli na siebie z ciekawością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Propozycję tę przyjął bardzo chętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okazało się, że mięśnie miał cudowne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po skończonym deserze zaczęliśmy palić cygara i rozmawiać o koniach i polowaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wnet oszołomienie minęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeregi indusów topniały, jak lód pod rozpalonem słońcem równika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwetu nie dostał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja stawała się przykra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pustka i samotność stanowiły wybitną cechę tej okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obmyślimy wszystko i postaramy się o to, aby panu źle nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego rodzaju uderzenia mają moc decydującą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że byli to kupcy, udający się do Europy za interesami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starszy oficer niemiecki zachował się względem niego bardzo łaskawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciemne ich twarze, czarne włosy, wskazywały, że byli to indusi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzeba mu było ni mniej ni więcej tylko sześćdziesiąt funtów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tępych i złych oczach migotały mu złowrogie blaski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Karawanę spotkaliśmy u wejścia do doliny, późnym wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i górnik również nie liczył na opór i dlatego nie uniknął uderzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do ostatniego dnia swego życia nigdy nie będziesz pan od niej bliżej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można przewidzieć, jaki obrót wezmą wypadki w najbliższej przyszłości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biorę na siebie obowiązek wypełnienia wszystkich luk i niedomówień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj przynajmniej byliśmy wolni od ciekawych sąsiadów, którzy nas podpatrywali i obmawiali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samotność nie przestraszała nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostała tylko przykra dolegliwość w karku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce w domu wszystko ucichło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciężko to żyć w takiej atmosferze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje mi się, że tym razem indusi gotują się do czegoś poważnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mistrz nie będzie miał z nim kłopotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mi pan dasz na kolację?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tuż przed nimi znajdował się Czarny zamek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z postaci jego tryskało zdrowie i siła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem nerwowy, szalenie nerwowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale lisa, na którego polowano teraz, nikt jakoś nie widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było tu nic takiego, coby mogło rozjaśnić duszę, pogrążoną w smutku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, to niewdzięczny gruboskóry lud!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kapitan zaczął wydawać rozkazy szeptem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że powinniśmy reagować z całą siłą na każdy przejaw agresji wobec Tajwanu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skupmy się na innych grupach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Także prasa krajowa mogłaby odegrać pożyteczną rolę w badaniu tej sprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli ta poprawka nie zostanie przyjęta, należałoby to uwzględnić w wersji pierwotnej tekstu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Martwi mnie dobrostan koni i tyle\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolność wyznania jest dla mnie najważniejszą ideą w naszej polityce dotyczącej praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi główny obszar tematyczny nadchodzącego szczytu będzie obejmował\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.612,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To supermocarstwo, tak gospodarczo, jak i militarnie, i ulega przekształceniom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety nie ma tu dziś ich przedstawicieli, ale mam nadzieję, że usłyszą to przesłanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.396,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim trzeba ocenić straty, a następnie sporządzić i złożyć wniosek o przyznanie pomocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestie te stanowią integralną cześć każdej strategii długoterminowej, jeżeli chcemy zachować swoją wiarygodność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doprowadziłoby to do porażki zasady spójności na szczeblu europejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym przedstawić pewną propozycję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że odnosi się to również do traktatu lizbońskiego w aspekcie ogólnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadal możliwe jest wydłużenie obowiązywania protokołu z Kioto, co jest korzystne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, może to potrwać co najmniej następnych pięć lat albo i dłużej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska bez wątpienia przechodzi przez szczególnie trudny okres kryzysu wiarygodności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja pytałem państwa w tej chwili o dwie rzeczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"do demokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że wysoki przedstawiciel wyraża chęć dołożenia starań w kierunku osiągnięcia tego celu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjemy w krytycznych czasach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie sądzimy również, by znajomość dwóch języków powinna stanowić wymóg do wykonywania zawodu prawnika\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przeszłości Komisja zbyt często przyjmowała niestety podejście zakładające, że papier zniesie wszystko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewna, że to pomoże przybliżyć Unię Europejską jej obywatelom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie, pojawia się argument nieekonomiczny względem przedstawionego argumentu ekonomicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.612,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten aktywny udział organizacji powinien być bardzo dobrze wykorzystany w realizacji tejże strategii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Źle to wygląda, gdy supermocarstwo jest zmieszane, ponieważ jego godność w oczach innych ucierpiała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36967949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kpiną jest jednak mówienie, że przyczyną wzrostu cen są cięcia dotacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.756,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro będziemy przyjmować obszerne i wyważone sprawozdanie, na którym Ukraina naprawdę skorzysta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"autorka projektu opinii Komisji Praw Kobiet i Równouprawnienia -\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokładnie taka jest Europa i dokładnie tak ona wygląda\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akceptuję neutralny, matematyczny sposób ważenia siły poszczególnych krajów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto, w sprawozdaniu tym pokreślono znaczenie konstruktywnego partnerstwa z pracownikami i organizacjami związków zawodowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przemiany te są bowiem zbyt wielkie i zbyt znaczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie jestem przekonany, że musimy pójść znacznie dalej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że jest to sprawa zasadnicza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdzimy to jeszcze raz, ale to jest to, co ustaliliśmy teraz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuację pogarszają wahania cen, które są konsekwencją ufinansowienia światowej gospodarki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego wcale nie jestem zaskoczony, że broni tego rozwiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to zwłaszcza regionu Bałkanów zachodnich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"w żadnym razie nie mówimy o czymś niejasnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisarz wspomniał o ustawie o zamówieniach publicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż mordowani są ludzie z powodu swej religii - tylko dlatego, że są chrześcijanami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę przy tej okazji ponowić to wezwanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karygodne jest to, że większość tych zbrodni do dziś nie została w pełni wyjaśniona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apeluję do producentów, aby zareagowali na nasza sugestię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak niezależnie od wszystkich środków technicznych mogą wystąpić wypadki o wielkiej skali\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę oczywiście podać państwu wiele danych liczbowych, jeśli to konieczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako jeden z konsumentów chciałbym być pewien, że żywność, którą kupuję, jest bezpieczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W roku kryzysu ważny dla Parlamentu jest wizerunek charakteryzujący się dyscypliną i kontrolą kosztów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tych państwach jednak zapamiętano to to, o czym zapomnieli niektórzy posłowie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwycięstwo było nieczyste, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fakt ten pokazuje, że uznajemy naszą odpowiedzialność wobec podatników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zapominajmy, że jeżeli czegoś nie wyprodukujemy tu w Europie, będziemy to importować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawiasem mówiąc ma to także negatywne skutki dla drobnych, lokalnych producentów europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejską opcję obraną przez mieszkańców Mołdowy widać teraz na szczeblu politycznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu musimy wkroczyć i ocalić ten naród\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta sprawa jest jednak ważniejsza niż kiedykolwiek dotąd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proponujemy naszą współpracę w celu możliwie jak największego uproszczenia procedur\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szczególności sprawdza się to w stosunku do migracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powinniśmy spierać się, kto jest winien czemu, a kto czego nie zrobił\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinni powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynymi wygranymi będą producenci dotowanego rzepaku i wytwórcy elementów wiatraków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego zakres przekracza aspekty własnościowo-finansowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymamy się tego tekstu kompromisowego, który był tak intensywnie negocjowany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Określonych zostało i przedstawionych do konsultacji społecznych wiele opcji obciążania opłatami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale uzasadnienie ma również wiele oczekiwań ze strony Białorusi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wola polityczna obrony euro jest ogromna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym zmienić kierunek myślenia niektórych z obecnych tu posłów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę także podziękować sprawozdawcy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doszliśmy wreszcie do końca długiego i mozolnego procesu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to właśnie są rodzaje miejsc pracy, które często przypadają kobietom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klonowanie zwierząt jest kontrowersyjnym osiągnięciem naukowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36968495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tych sytuacjach wskazanie miejsca pochodzenia jest obowiązkowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczę rozstawało się z nim ze łzami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wyjściu Holmesa na koncert, położyłem się na sofie i usiłowałem zasnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnie ten, co je tam niegdyś włożył, dawno już nie żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ten wypadek obmyślałem następujący plan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacierze swe odmawiała chodząc, przy robocie...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwycił ją i począł całować w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najrozmaitsze straszne przypuszczenia powstały w jego głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obok siebie ścierają się dwa wpływy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszna klęska nas dotknęła… grozi nam zagładą, nam i dzieciom naszym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyrost partyjny nader słaby“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ożywcze powietrze górskie, balsamiczna woń sosen zastępowały dziewczęciu starania matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed naszym domem zatrzymał się elegancki powóz, zaprzężony w dwa rasowe, rwące rumaki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiekolwiek są pobudki tych niezwykłych zbrodni, rabunek jest zupełnie wyłączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skóra zaś wyschła do tego stopnia, że była twarda, jak kamień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem udzielił wskazówek jakby należało działać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To Dolina Trwogi...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To rzekłszy, ruszył wraz z całym orszakiem ku ratuszowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktor mi zdjął szczęśliwie tę zasłonę...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie mnie to dręczyć wiecznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszedł i sołtys.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko bardzo ładnie - pozostaje nam tylko oznaczenie ceny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z sąsiedniego pokoju dochodził szmer rozmowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król rozkazał zanieść to wszystko do zamku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można ją było łatwo włożyć do walizki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej chwili uprzytomniłem sobie wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to jeden tylko przykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosypał później jakichś ziółek, dorzucił parę kostek i wymówił słowa zaklęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż to za człowiek i gdzie go znajdę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za lektyką znów postępował oddział jeźdźców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stara była sama około pieca...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lejek z czarnej skóry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obserwowaliśmy jego krępe barki i świecącą łysinę na tyle głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas ten nadejdzie, stanowczo nadejdzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyzną tym mamy się właśnie zająć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyrzekliście warunek ten spełnić, tymczasem, jeśli obiegające wieści głoszą prawdę nie dotrzymujecie przyrzeczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wysokiej górze wznosił się ongi, przed laty, wspaniały zamek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczę nie odpowiedziało zrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomógł mu drugi pachołek i wnet wyciągnęli na wierzch ciało chłopca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to wysoki, chudy mężczyzna w czarnej szacie, z twarzą surową i wycieńczoną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopak stał, konia trzymając za uzdę i rozpatrując się około dworku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz więc, że jego ofiary są wobec niego bezsilne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Źle robiłem, to prawda, ale może mi Pan Jezus teraz dopomoże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widzę dlaczego miałoby to pana dotknąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tchu mi zabrakło na te słowa mego przyjaciela, wypowiedziane w tonie silnego postanowienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachwiał się i runął na biurko charcząc przeraźliwie i szarpiąc odruchowo papiery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie wiedział kto należy do tego okrutnego stowarzyszenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób szukam wyjaśnienia, rozumie pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale miasto utrzymywało się wyłącznie na poziomie brzydoty i brudu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21535381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Majster może powróci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nie ociągali się z wypełnieniem ślubu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co tu kopać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaiskrzyły się oczy więźniom, nadstawili uszu, by lepiej usłyszeć, co to za droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robotnicy, nie zauważywszy tego, przechylili kocioł i spiż popłynął do formy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z głodu nie pomrzemy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była jedna moja pociecha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedługiem jednak było ich szczęście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaki sposób może człowiek zmusić człowieka do zażycia trucizny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Droga, wierzbami i brzozami wysadzana, prowadziła do wioski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piotr się obudził i spojrzał dokoła zdumionym wzrokiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten, który wczoraj uchodził za szarlatana, jutro uznany zostanie za profesora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olbrzymy postawili trumnę na podłodze; junak podszedł do niej i zdjął wieko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale było to pismo mężczyzny wykształconego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedł przez wagon, usiadł przy młodym podróżnym i wyciągnął rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samemu w domu nudno...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes pozieleniał ze wzburzenia i złości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to przemawia za twoją hipotezą, Watsonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłałam więc Magdę, dziewkę służebną, by je wyszukała i przywiodła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natychmiast stary kazał zaprzęgać i pojechał, ale chorego już zastał na marach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z Szerokiego Brodu zjechali natychmiast wszyscy, i łowczy energiczne śledztwo zarządził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maryś za kolana ją ścisnęła, płacząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był bowiem z natury językiem dzielny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To temat naszej rozmowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle naszego co się użyje!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21540853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieli się oboje do siebie, z początku nie mogąc przemówić słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym chciała być dla ciebie taką serdeczną przyjaciółką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kościół nie identyfikuje się z żadną specjalną formą rządów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, gdy już wszystko wiadomo… — zaczął uroczyście Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król usiłował znaczącymi spojrzeniami zachęcić swego poetę do ostatniego wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nic nie rozumiał, każdy czekał jutra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż Ewa odkleiła ten list wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąłem teczkę, uporządkowałem papiery i poszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola złapała Emila za rękę: — Coś ci muszę powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam mechanizm ten dokładnie na sobie samym — oczywiście w miniaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujął go pod ramię i potrząsnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy taki piękny dzień!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz teraz włożyła strój zgoła odmienny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz istota przejawu pozostaje ta sama: zła, występna i tajemnicza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Manna po niemiecku, a Manna tak swobodnie, jak Emil po polsku S.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy inwestować więcej w szkolnictwo i edukację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Opowiedz mi o swej rodzinie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozorną lub prawdziwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wara ode mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już jem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod żadnym pozorem nie trzeba przez kilka dni przyjmować wieczornych zaproszeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak było zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nienormalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęka i drze się w strzępy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszła ze szkoły o jedenastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę sobie wyobrazić, że jest chory, który umrze, jeśli się czegoś nie postanowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic nie szkodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Wiesz, to jest ten inteligentny kawaler, który miał ochotę, opowiadałam ci, pocałować mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zostaw pan Janka tutaj u nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem babci bukiet goździków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie pomykali tymi chodnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój kolega lubi grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko należy przypisać prądowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrzyła, lekko podnosząc brwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za drzwiami matka krzyczaia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech patrzy — powtórzył jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tobie się podobał ten głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważałem to podniecenie za zdenerwowanie wskutek oczekiwania mających nadejść wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy postanowił zaatakować go wprost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pamiątkę, dziewulinko? — spytał domyślnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możliwe, że moja filozofia okaże się w pewnych punktach błędna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz ci coś szepnę, jeno się nachyl, boś za wysoki — odparła dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą twarze obu po zajściu metamorfozy były zupełnie różne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ta wyspa jest za blisko lądu, gdzie mieszkają Murzyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy mu się marsz pogrzebowy, był to bowiem wojownik nieustraszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrafię panu tego dokładnie powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że od dziecka uczyłem się angielskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi też opadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę tylko hałas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrzebowała wyrazów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spór, teoretyczny w swej istocie, zaostrzał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkanie Pawła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja bym chciał, żeby wszyscy pamiętali…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezwład i zniechęcenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały napad pracy, choroba lenistwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A bo dziś jest pierwszy śnieg, a wy nie uważacie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobnie przez owe trzy dni nie spał wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak i jednoręki nic nie odrzekli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś zrozumiał moje słowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem długo jak wryty, nie mogąc uczynić kroku naprzód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby było inaczej, nie okazałby pan tej chwalebnej przezorności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat, przeznaczony dla mężczyzn, jest okrutny i „logiczny”, wystawiany na pokaz i na licytację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do Sary i wpatrzyła się w nią z uwielbieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wy daje się, że już nigdy nie można się będzie stamtąd wydobyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słabo mi się robi na widok krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otępienie urwało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednym kącie siedziała grupa znajomych, rozprawiających głośno, z ożywieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy w szkole jest ci przyjemnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukali innej planety\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na górach spokojnie żerowały stada reniferów i jaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie ma być: „rąk”, napisane: „rak”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie chciał „uciekać”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tobie je składam w ofierze, o piękny, połyskujący płomieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem i na drugim posterunku także wszystko było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy razem udali się do izby opata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pani, i Łatek, i matka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy jeszcze można bez wysiłku zawrócić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy tu tylu prowokatorów i szpiegów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Papier jest bezczelnie biały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąb? — zaśmiała się nagle dziwożona i napełniła wnętrze wora klaśnięciem drobnych dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinał jej suknię, która była łatwa do rozpinania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zupełnie nierzeczywista.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekka nieobecność samego siebie w świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamówiłam w sklepie internetowym chleb, ryż, kaszę, dżem wiśniowy i sok jabłkowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama musiała je zdobyć w jakiś sprytny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno było sobie wyobrazić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączanie siedmiu przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bagno nie zamarzło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nerwie i mózgu i serce świata!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie było bardzo przyjemnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budowla jest jeszcze nieukończona, ale wierni chętnie skorzystali z mszy w nowym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż tam u ciebie słychać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni napadają, a drudzy kryją się i uciekają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie brak — potwierdził jednoręki, posłusznie biegnąc wzrokiem za dłonią Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mówią o skrzydłach dla ludzkości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nachylił się ku niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie lubię przesądnych mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli łagodnie i lekko pijani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widział jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciał jechać koleją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bona zaprowadziła go do łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była od niego o dwa lata starsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, znów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulice były wilgotne, błotniste, śliskie, przysłonięte zimną a posępną mgłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni tu będą za chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład ten «Rocznik psychologiczny» i rozprawa Szumana o peyotlu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasadę tę stosuje się zarówno w stosunku do dziecka, jak i do jego rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał uczucie niesmaku, niemal wstrętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paluszek i główka to szkolna wymówka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak skrzyżował dłonie na żołędnych wzorach zbryzganej słońcem kamizeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajomość była zawarta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Księża za granicą nie chodzą już w takich spódnicach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś poruszyło się we mnie, niby nieznacznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma dymu bez ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odmy w prawym płucu doc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż na stację wtoczył się pociąg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem w towarzystwie czterech równie zachwyconych tą sytuacją osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ich Eskimosi bardzo obchodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym właśnie twórcą przeznaczeń chcę być, chcę zrozumieć tajemnicę losów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy znacie tekst pieśni Schuberta „Der Todt und das Madchen”? Jest dziwnie dwuznaczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak… nie wiesz o tym nawet…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak rozwiązujemy kwestię zakwaterowania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogląd na istoty żywe: witalizm z pewnymi zastrze żeniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział krótki, urwany śmiech kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdź ze mną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał i jesienne słońce świeciło na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie kucharek sześć, tam nie ma co jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleje, kopalnie, tartaki i przedsiębiorstwa okrętowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On trzyma, a ty zrzuciłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No dobrze już, dobrze — odparła, podając mu rękę na pożegnanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmieniłaś opony w samochodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczesny, jesienny zmrok zalegał ulice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oboje mieli tę samą śmiertelną ranę, koło lewej pachy nad sercem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co on sobie o niej pomyśli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastrój w wartowni był błędny i niewyraźny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się pożegnać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło, robi się ciemno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię — dodałem łagodniej — nie mówmy teraz o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałem… ale i to jeszcze nastąpi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy mówiła: „nie bawię się” albo: „nie potrzebuję”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego większość kobiet, które mają mało przyjaciół, jest niemożliwie ograniczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio dużo myślałem nad własnym stanem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odetchnął z pewną ulgą: Darek nie zabrał ze sobą strzelby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wstrząsnęła złocistą grzywą i schyliwszy głowę na bok, kolejno spojrzała na wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza Fauna — to sen o śnie, sen posępny i niespokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem kupić cukier zwykły czy trzcinowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20742241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce za szybą i grysik, którym go karmiła służąca Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadal istnieją tam poważne słabe strony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała całe grono lalek, które były wzorowo prowadzone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.532,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym zadaniem ma to zasadnicze znaczenie dla zagwarantowania właściwego stosowania proponowanych środków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy skazani na Fenicjan współczesności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy pamiętać, że spoczywa na nas obowiązek zagwarantowania dobrej, bezpiecznej i najwyższej jakości żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym samym czasie Francja udziela poparcia gazociągowi północnemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególnie ta intensyfikacja wynika z produkcji biopaliw i biomasy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto w tym mruku może się kochać?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"gnaj do panny Małgorzaty i powiedz, że wesele zaraz po Wielkiej Nocy...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wciąż ma rację, bo nie ma możliwości rozróżnienia pomiędzy dobrymi i złymi inwestycjami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym poruszyć sprawę Johna Zafiropoulosa, który znajduje się w więzieniu w Grecji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg niech mnie sądzi!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że czasem jest to niezgodne z jego poglądem na handel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby wierzyć tej rezolucji - są one dobre\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postacie męskie i żeńskie zawsze były używane w reklamie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla nas, żyjących w kraju o małym rynku wewnętrznym, jest to szczególnie ważne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak pomimo tego konsensusu ciąg dalszy był mniej obiecujący\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Efharisto, dziękuję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała gromada z oznakami oburzenia cofnęła się do przedpokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni także oczekują solidarności ze wszystkich stron Unii Europejskiej - solidarności szybkiej i skutecznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staruszka nalegała, ażeby natychmiast przyjeżdżał i zabawił u niej parę tygodni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.892,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwracam się do Komisji, aby w nadchodzących miesiącach przedstawiła szczegółowe badania i wnioski prawne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reformy gospodarcze również są zagrożone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zagrożenie wciąż istnieje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomoc techniczna ma wielkie znaczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele władz rządowych zawiodło zwykłych obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nie widzę rozbieżności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że gdy uda się to zrealizować, zaczniemy wreszcie widzieć zmiany sytuacji w Birmie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie oświadczenie polityczne zatwierdził sam Parlament Europejski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego mamy nadzieję, że ta konferencja zakończy się dobrym rezultatem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjmujemy działania przeciwko nadużyciom związanym z wykorzystywaniem tanich bander lub statków niespełniających norm\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odnotowuję sprawiedliwość, z jaką przewodzi pan tym debatom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karola Wielkiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekujemy, że to się zmieni w sprawozdaniu za kolejny rok\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu wziął dorożkę i pojechał do adwokata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten kiedyś bogaty kraj został przewrócony do góry nogami przez swojego własnego prezydenta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczerze przyznam, że z punktu widzenia prezydencji Parlament odegrał decydującą rolę w osiągnięciu wyników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chcemy prawdziwej Unii Europejskiej, musimy szanować ten rynek wewnętrzny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mamy odpowiednią liczbę ekspertów, którzy są wystarczająco niezależni, żeby podejmować decyzje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa poważnie zastanawia się, czy można się uzależniać od rosyjskiej ropy i gazu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Simcyp jest pionierem alternatyw wobec takich badań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy w grę wchodzą te sprawy, mówimy o zasadniczym obszarze europejskiej polityki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłaniał się na całej przestrzeni ode drzwi do stołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy niejasne swe żądze poznali?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastrzeżenia i wątpliwości okazały się nieuzasadnione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była więc sama jedna z Władysławem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleje impasy w rundzie dauhańskiej to złe wiadomości dla świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy planujecie przyjęcie tego wniosku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy wiele powodów, by zmienić wspólnotową współpracę i troskę o Bałtyk w działanie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiem na oba pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do kroćset!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z przyczyn przedstawionych powyżej zdecydowaliśmy wstrzymać się od głosu w sprawie tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem za to niezmiernie wdzięczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłby to dla Chin krok naprzód\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skargi w zakresie organizacji czasu pracy są skargami pilnymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie dostrzegam zawarty w sprawozdaniu apel o zwiększenie środków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym przypadku obawiam się, że tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyraźnie zabrania się mieszania rtęci metalicznej z innymi substancjami w celu wywiezienia rtęci metalicznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to również lekcja wypływająca z odrzucenia Traktatu przez Irlandczyków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też na początku skoncentrowaliśmy się na rozwiązaniu problemu emisji występujących w dużych ilościach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kierunek jest przecież bardzo prosty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było coś więcej, niż tylko obalenie skorumpowanego, wstecznego reżimu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma procedury wykrywania i eliminowania konfliktów interesów, a taka procedura jest nam potrzebna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynym partnerstwem międzykontynentalnym, jakie udało się zbudować Unii Europejskiej, jest partnerstwo strategiczne z Afryką\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj zapewnienie bezpieczeństwa i uznania państwa izraelskiego jest zadaniem pilnym, słusznym, prawowitym i koniecznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj w Paryżu odbywają się konsultacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy szczegółowych informacji dotyczących poziomów błędów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zatem zwrócić uwagę, że Komisja sama spowodowała część problemów poprzez zwiększenie ilości mleka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To straszni ludzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech mu Bóg da zdrowie za to, że stąd wylazł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochodzę z kraju, w którym dyrektywy o usługach nie transponowano do prawa krajowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknęła drzwi i odeszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszymy o ankietach, zbieraniu informacji oraz spotkaniach zainteresowanych grup\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_41096249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadzieja na pokój, na braterstwo, na rozwój\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Druga kwestia dotyczy kontroli politycznej Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wyglądały nasze stosunki z Kadafim przed bombardowaniami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacznijmy od zasobów i środków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajmijcie się zapobieganiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepsze stanowienie prawa nie jest celem samym w sobie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"talentu, techniki i tolerancji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcecie udowodnić wyborcom, że odpowiedzialnie zarządzacie ich pieniędzmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto sprzeciwi się tak prostemu i skutecznemu środkowi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec, pragnę zwrócić państwa uwagę na sprawę odpowiedzialności w skali globalnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie stanowi główny czynnik powodujący wystąpienie kryzysu finansowego i gospodarczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezbędne są także dalsze działania wspierające prawidłowy rozwój europejskiego rynku usług\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczę na to, że uda nam się zachować to podejście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłaniają się tu następujące wnioski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powinniśmy umiejscawiać groźby terroryzmu w Bośni i Hercegowinie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu zaproponowano praktycznie, abyśmy rabowali wykształconą populację innych krajów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim dziękuję wszystkim za dzisiejszą szczerą dyskusję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pakiet klimatyczny jest niezwykle ważną i delikatną kwestią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi wymagać od Rosji chęci przestrzegania wymogów Międzynarodowej Organizacji Handlu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pan poseł słusznie zauważył, w niektórych przypadkach powstają nowe rynki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie będę kontynuował tego tematu, gdyż będę miał wiele okazji, by rozmawiać z Parlamentem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to istotny argument, wart przywołania w aktualnej sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak dziś możemy stwierdzić, nie jest to łatwe ani proste zadanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże to nie zmniejsza zapotrzebowania na reformę, wręcz przeciwnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet ktoś równie silny i utalentowany jak pan sam wobec kryzysu finansowego będzie bezradny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem ten jest jednak powszechny w bardzo biednych krajach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nasz cel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszczególne projekty nie powinny być wobec siebie konkurencyjne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukazuje raczej paradoksalny język, dość powszechnie stosowany w Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W międzyczasie rząd cypryjski przysłał również zaktualizowany program stabilności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem jest to skuteczny, jakkolwiek wciąż niewystarczający, wkład w walkę z bieżącym kryzysem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę wdzięczna za uwzględnienie tego wniosku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulepszone rozporządzenie zapewniłoby lepszy poziom przejrzystości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zainteresowaniem czekamy również na inicjatywę ustawodawczą w sprawie inteligentnych sieci energetycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie te elementy będą miały poważne konsekwencje dla europejskich dostaw żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet jeżeli punkt docelowy jest niewyraźny, to kierunek jest dobrze znany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszej chwili chciałem zabić pijaka, lecz spojrzawszy na nią, pośpieszyłem ku niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"musimy trzymać się naszych zobowiązań, dotyczących milenijnych celów rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Romowie są specyficzną mniejszością, której nie można zaliczać do typowych mniejszości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często to właśnie wskutek zawiłości poszczególnych etapów systemu dystrybucji wprowadzane zostają produkty wysokiego ryzyka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy wyjaśnić korzyści z dokonania słusznego wyboru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W wielu przypadkach prowadzić to będzie do różnego rodzaju sporów, w tym sporów prawnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niszczenie gruzińskiej suwerenności znajduje obecnie swoje odbicie w niszczeniu suwerenności ukraińskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze zdecydowana większość tego Parlamentu chce doprowadzić do szybkiego zawieszenia broni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zapewnić, aby wspomniane szczepionki trafiły do rąk krajów, które najbardziej ich potrzebują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwalczanie wykorzystywania seksualnego dzieci i pornografii dziecięcej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życzę panu samych sukcesów, panie komisarzu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proces integracji Serbii z Unią Europejską uwypukla pewien fakt, który od dawna wskazujemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo ma nadzieję zatem, że ktoś z zewnątrz rozwiąże ten problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam to za zaszczyt i przyjemność, że właśnie my możemy prowadzić ten końcowy dialog\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szanowny panie prezydencie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyrektywa w sprawie obronności przewiduje jednak możliwość zastosowania rozwiązań alternatywnych dla offsetów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odpowiedziałam na to, słyszałam to i jestem tego bardzo dobrze świadoma\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekując, że tak się stanie, popieramy pańską kandydaturę i trzymamy kciuki za pańskie przywództwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, jest ważna, interesująca, ale też osobliwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to po części za sprawą państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym żebyśmy rozważyli trzy sprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako dziennikarza uderzyło mnie w szczególności, że wśród zabitych było trzydziestu dziennikarzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwoma niezbędnymi aspektami ożywienia rynku są zarządzanie i partnerstwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Decyzje podejmowaliśmy szybko - niektóre może zbyt szybko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoordynujmy się naprawdę i dowiedźmy - podpierając się przykładami - szczerości tych słów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy widzieliśmy na ekranach telewizorów sceny sprzed masakry, sprzed ucieczki do Tulzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie z tego względu głosowałem za przyjęciem sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"poszanowanie praw człowieka, wolność mediów, demokratyczne rządy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy pozwolić na to, żeby Rosjanie tę spiralę obaw nakręcali\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pakiet obejmuje szereg działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próby porozumienia w sprawie uregulowania dobrowolnego okazały się żałosnym błędem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zagwarantować, że żadne przeszkody nie będą utrudniały przepływu pomysłów i wiedzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym roku powstanie dziesiąte roczne sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłby nasz Janek nie zginął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagwarantowanie minimalnego poziomu ochrony pracy tymczasowej jest jednym z elementów budowania Europy socjalnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Afryka zasługuje na nasze wsparcie, i to nie tylko z tego względu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podzielam stanowisko zaprezentowane w tej sprawie przez posła sprawozdawcę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to przede wszystkim wiadomości tekstowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brazylii, Argentyny i Chile\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym problemem należy zająć się szybko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32363278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo wielu zapewnień ze strony białoruskiej, dotychczasowe zmiany są niewielkie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak przyjemnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy woda ciebie kąsa? — żartowała z niego Danusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw zauważyłem kolbę karabinu, ukrytego na łóżku pod stosem poduszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu właśnie Emil przestał pisać i popatrzył na rzekę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz powędrował powoli za nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobista współpraca zbyteczna — recytował ogłoszenie, którego się nauczył na pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będziesz sam chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak najbliżej, jak najbliżej koło ust…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Jak gwiazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko powinno otrzymać takie wychowanie, które podnosi jego kulturę ogólną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pamiątkę, dziewulinko? — spytał domyślnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzęta tłumaczą sobie owo prawo inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość i łaska spływały z pałacu chana, zamienionego w świątynię szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daremne byłoby usiłowanie spać w noc taką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiem, czemu mimo tej szybkości widzę wszystko wyraźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo przyszło, łatwo poszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zapadniętej głęboko twarzy sterczały kości policzkowe ostro, niemiłosiernie, wyzywająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubiła chodzić do kina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno! — odparł z westchnieniem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyzna ów nazywał się Filip Brant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekanie przyprawiało go zawsze o lekki bół brzucha i potrzebę oddania moczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to i dobrze, że tam nie pojechaliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapadło na chwilę milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nic nie mówisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, wszystko jedno!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakież, u licha, mam prawo zajmować się kościołem świętego Barnaby?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Setki komunikatorów obejmują cały nasz świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach, tak — mówił swobodnie, jak gdyby nigdy nic — awansowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie idzie mi tu oczywiście o walkę z logiką…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota lekarz dyżurny myśli, że będę od razu chciał popełnić samobójstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem babci bukiet goździków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on to robi z umysłu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiarkował od razu! — rzekł do Podlasiaka, wskazując ramieniem przyjaciela i chełpiąc się jego zgadliwością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O matko, włącz klimę bo umrę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy grasz? — Trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Abraham zrodził Izaaka, Izaak zrodził Jakuba, to jest po dobne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie, gdzie mieszkają lisy, wydry, borsuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy jestem bardzo zdenerwowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja boję nawet ruszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poszukam sobie innego gniazda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z łomocącym głośno sercem zapytałem sługę, czy panienka w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego wieczoru zdarzyło się tak, że Emil odprowadzał Ewę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Możesz chcieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawał na przystankach tramwajowych i pomagał wychodzić panom z siwymi brodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął rozwiązywać mały woreczek ze skóry renifera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miała zapewne nic do powiedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Została tylko opancerzona powierzchnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha — odrzekł po chwili — o to chodzi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostali wciągnięci w wiatr, który ciął w wirujące płatki śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to koń młynarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, puść już, puść!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Rynku będzie można odwiedzić stragany z najróżniejszymi wyrobami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, ale nie mogłem znaleźć informacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to również byłoby nieszczęściem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, nie kocham go, lecz nie chcę z nim zrywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką odpowiedź przywieźli gońcy? — zapytałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siadłszy na kubełku wapna, począł obmyślać fortele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy przyszedł mi w pomoc szczęśliwy przypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, ale on mieszka tam z jedną panienką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grupki na podwórzu zmieniają się w karawany śmiertelnie przerażonych zwierząt czujących pożar kniei.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotowałem Ci niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten nie zwracał na to żadnej uwagi, zatopiony w obserwacji krajobrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paluszek i główka to szkolna wymówka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była najpiękniejsza piosenka, jaką kiedykolwiek słyszałam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czterdzieści dni i czterdzieści nocy siedziałem w niej zamknięty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czymże właściwie było to młode dziewczę dla Brama?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cicho… on śpi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla zaprzestania palenia trzeba wybrać odpowiednią chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi ani połowy takiej przy jemności, jak z P.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy mężczyzna zgubił się gdzieś w tłumie pasażerów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżynier nie rozumiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Kuba Bogu, tak Bóg Kubie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już chcę, mimo tego, że uważam to wszystko za rozpustę umysłową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zewnątrz trzeba być w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbym powiedzieć, czego, ale mi się nie chce myśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda dzisiaj będzie mroźna i wietrzna, należy się ciepło ubrać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w czarnoksiężników, w krasnoludki i wróżki wierzą tylko dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam się nachylić? — spytał pokornie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o to…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty to rozumiesz, przyjacielu „Mostowy”, i zrobisz, jak ja proszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co tu się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he! — zarechotało coś w drugim kącie przedziału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piotr został przy drzwiach, ukłonił się i z nieufnością oglądał starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wymienione przeze mnie ruchy są więc fikcją?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż znalazłem przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powtórz jeszcze raz — prosił Krzysiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz ta nie żyła i nie myślała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co do mnie mówisz? — pyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A i te były za duże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj jeszcze, daj mi dokończyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pi, pi — pokaźna liczba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oblicze stare, przeorane siecią fałd i zagłębień, jakby dwoiło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była w dalszym ciągu bardzo grzeczna, bardzo dziecinna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mnie nic nie obchodził, ten Otto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta umiejętność nie jest jeszcze gotowa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dziś są moje urodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak naprawdę to chciałbym pojechać do Hagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogłam opierać się dłużej: przyszedłeś jak przeznaczenie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szum chodził wierzchem lasu, nie przenikając do głębi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje czekanie jest napięte i wytężone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom z lukami, marokański trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja czuję, że pewnego dnia wyrwę się stąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kształtowała swoją przyszłość, która była zwinięta w niej, jak sprężyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ona mówiła do niego: — Opowiem ci jak to było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz rację; w chwili gdy usłyszałam dźwięk jego głosu, złudzenie prysło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Fragment bez końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20638034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam tu i tu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trąciła mnie wachlarzem w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie — odrzekła dziwożona i wspięła się ku niemu na palcach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszedł Felek brudny i obdarty, chudy i nieszczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd, jak i dokąd ma uciekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyłem na jego ruchy osłupiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ooo! — zapłakał chór mrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co też tym kobietom do głowy przychodzi — rzekł mąż pani Emilii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęła się nienormalnie szorować, i to jej zostało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt na to nic powiedzieć nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nie wypuszczał ze zbolałej lewicy krwawo zdobytego skarbu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ala duża, Ala chce na wojnę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmuś się! — pisnął kulawiec i pięścią powahał w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm! — westchnął Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano zostaje sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy umilkli, lecz po chwili rozmowa potoczyła się dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyna leży zdaje się w wyczerpaniu nerwowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc byłem aresztowany!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mali symulanci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest przez chwilę naciągnięty jak struna, nim się ją puści, nim wyda dźwięk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A dlaczego się wykręcałaś od tego? — Nie wiem sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pielgrzym ukląkł przy kracie, bijąc się w piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziliśmy od drzwi do drzwi z pustymi żołądkami i zbieraliśmy podpisy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zależało jej na tym, aby była czysto ubrana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli milcząc, zanurzeni w zapachu kobiety, która stąd odeszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koło dziewiątej wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rozmowach z Cezarym wskazywał palcem na kilka „cudów”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo to nie moje — odparła Marta z godnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt ciężko względem niej zawiniłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedną mi dłoń wypuśćcie na swobodę! — napierała się, zerkając błagalnie na Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to dowód oczywisty! — zgodzili się jednomyślnie słuchacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacznijmy od monologów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze śnię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była naprawdę wielce zakłopotana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w niedzielę, jak lunatyczka, poszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do odpowiedniego wyżywienia i mieszkania, rozrywek i opieki lekarskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony przychodzi refleksja, żeśmy się jednak trochę zagalopowali!!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic, no nic — zagadnął żwawo tamten.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tropiła go jak pies, chodziła za nim jak lunatyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smok nie był poplecznikiem świętego stanu małżeńskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20698294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi z trud nością przyszło wypowiadanie pewnych słów w obecności dyrektora i wychowawcy klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie są moje marzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A miała ta przejażdżka pomiędzy kamienicami szczególny urok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie od razu postanowiliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykułem wszystkie pytania na blachę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowód ten był odwróceniem jednego z dowodów istnienia Boga św.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja pierwszy to zauważyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu mówił: — Mamo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weźcie pod uwagę ilość popularyzujących dzieł w Niemczech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil miał o trzy lata młodszego brata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20737596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gram pierwszy temat zupełnie po pijacku, zupełnie zataczając się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20737597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Moje sumienie nic mi nie wyrzuca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20737598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki nie wypuszczał ze zbolałej lewicy krwawo zdobytego skarbu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20737599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybór masz wolny… — szepnął głosem drżącym i spuściwszy głowę, znieruchomiał od wstydu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20737600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obraz był skończony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20744441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro będę u was znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20744442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W weekend majowy pojechałem w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20744444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teresa transportowała tirem do tartaku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20744445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może byś do szkoły nie poszedł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20744446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeka, kiedy zaczną znów rozpytywać, kim jest i skąd przybył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20744478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kulawych nam nie trzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20744479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchała z nich wtedy nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20744480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gondola odbijała od brzegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20744481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypominam, że prosiłem, aby Maciusia nie nazywać królem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20744482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo radzili, co czynić, żeby się jak najbezpieczniej o wszystkim przekonać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jeżeli to nie był pies, to któż to był?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą było to do przewidzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie należysz chyba do pospolitaków, którzy dźwigają karabin?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się tylko dobierze do tego młokosa, to poskacze on, jak na nitce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wypadkiem tylko te oba morderstwa zostały udaremnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten przynajmniej poślubił i to jest zawsze pociecha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trumnie leżał trup człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opór był tu daremny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tynk z sufitu zleciał, połamane sprzęty leżały dokoła, ale dziury nie było żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten widok mam przed sobą, jak na obrazie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie cieszymy się zbytnią sympatią wśród naszych sąsiadów, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudna rada, muszę wytrwać, pomimo wszystko, na co się narażam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednem słowem zaniemógł troszeczkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę pozwolić sobie na to, gdyż praca moja posunęła się już dobrze naprzód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary mało co wiedział o tych matczynych wycieczkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To już był taki zwyczaj cesarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdowałem się przecież w kraju nieprzyjacielskim!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę do ogrodniczego, wracam za parę minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22771011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz gdy odpoczęła, trzeba było znowu iść do ciężkich robót.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przysunęła się jeszcze mocniej i przytuliła się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Biedny?“ zawołałem przerażony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"krew mi uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw zapalić światło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zawsze ta sama twarz, i nigdy innych rysów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy pan nie może być chwilę poważnym, panie Pernat“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umywam swoje ręce w niewinności.“ Z trwogą probowałem czytać w jego twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hrabina jest niewinna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa, które mówił Zwak, przewiały jakoś ponad moją świadomością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak, tak, to był jego chód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również i we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zjawiło się nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilę milczeliśmy i oddawaliśmy się naszym myślom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I cóż mi przyszło z tego wszystkiego: z owych wieści z królestwa nadrzeczywistości?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama, on mi zabrał czekoladę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko kształt głowy Ibisa egipskiego trwał najdłużej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jak pan to może przypuszczać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem w zupełnej ciemności i macałem ją powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23608642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny, który przeciwnie głęboko był tem dotknięty, to był on!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma w tym nic dziwnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie kobiety: jeden świat dla mężczyzn, drugi dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żal ścisnął go za serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to wyglądało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To wszystko przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż by to zliczył!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O jedenastej znowu poszedłem do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyły go nieprzeniknione ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale pozostanie pan chyba na wieczerzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten uśmiechnął się blado i zmarszczył czoło, jakby coś sobie przypominając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rozumiesz, Jerzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była robota!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety musiałem wyjechać nie zobaczywszy się z nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę osób otoczyło przestraszoną kobietę, pytając o powód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i powiedział, że nie chce widzieć tego kretyna, dyrektora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł żwawo głowę jak cebulkę i zobaczył mały wózek z jarzynami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę razy przesiąkł jak mgła przez pnie drzew w alei lipowej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, tak — pamiętam — odpowiedział ponuro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praktyka czyni mistrza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię bardzo obserwować go w godzinach porannych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię muzykę klasyczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden chłopak wiedział, gdzie się pali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo było się domyśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze było przed kolacją i nudził się, i przykrzyło mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie inne maszynki, które wypróbowałem, są wobec niego niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I duch jego unosił się samotny i cierpiał z powodu swojej samotności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pana dane będą przetwarzane w celu realizacji wybranych usług cyfrowych dostępnych w serwisie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, nago.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, będziemy spali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy seniora ma gości? — zapytałem go niechętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, mówiąc o życiu, obejmuję teorię życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cześć! Jak mogę Ci pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ósmego roku życia nie płakałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazuję ci ciągle moje słabe i bezbronne strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytali je najczęściej na spotkaniach, rzadziej w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział wolno: - Możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak przeważnie widziałem je leżące w łóżkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli jeszcze w ogóle daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale cierpliwie, żeby nie bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fortecę zburzono do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepyszna broń! — pochwalił ze szczerym uznaniem rywal, biorąc pistolet do ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakaś młoda matka wżerała się w policzki swego rocz nego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W internecie napisali, że nie testują na zwierzętach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tylko weszli do pokoju, usiadła na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z jej życia zaczy nało rozwijać się dzieło sztuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam na ciebie dość długo, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadarła ogonek i poleciała na płot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma ludzi i nikt nie wyciągnie strzały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była doskonale piękna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie publiczne musi być organiczne lub mechaniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie żal go wam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To trup — oświadczyłem po chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami sieją waśń między rodzeństwem i dlatego nie może być zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz na tym nie koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz już prawo jazdy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meduzy nie bieskie i różowe kołysały się jak kwiaty o grubych i miękkich koronach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co to?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic się nie stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król sam oniemiał z podziwu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem smutny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starość nie radość, młodość nie wieczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tego nie odpuszczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś kowalem swojego losu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odchyliła ku mnie głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał mnóstwo wszelakich książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może on… może on właśnie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciej był tego pewien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mogę tam iść? — spytała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądała najwyżej na lat dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech wypije szklankę wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niestety, człowiek ten nie żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociągnął nosem, węsząc jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął ją na ramę i pojechali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Organizatorzy starają się podkreślić przede wszystkim świąteczną i rodzinną atmosferę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziesz miał wolną drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadek i Danusia pękają ze śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wilki ledwo dyszały; Bartek również gonił ostatkiem sił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywidziało ci się, Stacha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To on! — zaświtała myśl pewna jak oczywistość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale muszę się uczesać i zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spuść do połowy masztu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniejsza o to!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut później pożegnaliśmy się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochylone są ku ziemi te kształty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecie mówiłem, że ci daruję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzę więc w kącie na łóżku, jak osaczony kot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz poczekaj tu na mnie chwilkę, drogi przyjacielu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuśćmy, że wsiadłem w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozejrzałem się po blacie, który miał zastępować wigilijny stół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę, że jak zawsze przygotowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie plotkować na całą szkołę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że grasz na harmonijce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia skrzydełka, łebkiem śmiesznie kręci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest ważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oboje nie chcieliśmy czasu marnować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie chcę — rozpłakała się dziewczynka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szczegółów nie znam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tysiąc razy lepszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to nawet rzecz przynosząca dochód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka boska siła tworząca coś z niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza jak makiem zasiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, obawiam się, że nie mam pojęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotarli wreszcie do pierwszego jaru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maria, popróbuj i ty; ja też spróbuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Została tylko opancerzona powierzchnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są uprzejmi nawet wobec mnie: to jest najgorsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądź spokojny; potrafię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cicho… on śpi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie trzymacie mopa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Później nastała noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym — zapewnił tamten badając wylot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem jeszcze w stanie tego zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziewczynko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadanie swoje objaśniła rysunkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie? — pyta się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy z nas nigdy ich nie stracili\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad Wisłą standardowo tłumy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To moja tajemnica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komu w drogę, temu czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś nie żałuje, że uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedł do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyśl rozumnie i spokojnie o tym wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słuchał jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieśni poety były na ustach wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba nie pozostaną długo na lądzie, jak sądzisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hubert jak zwykle palnął jakiś suchar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie chciał wierzyć, ale uwierzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za facet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu właśnie Emil przestał pisać i popatrzył na rzekę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grosz do grosza, a będzie kokosza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zazdrosny, że nie wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę do nich!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż i to zawodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatkała mu usta ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie będę opowiadał o swojej rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie powinny nosić krótsze od innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza że tak długo mówił Emilowi prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak jest, wtedy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawda wyjdzie zawsze na jaw!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żelazne wrota blokowały im przejście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla jakiejś tam przyczyny nie rozpoczynaliśmy partii domina\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzą na młodego króla, on nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma ludzi i nikt nie wyciągnie strzały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś gdzieś Szymona?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma wśród nas prawa i sprawiedliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zagrożona snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochylił się nad łóżkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz ustąpił mu z drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjął strzelbę z ramienia i podał jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wiedzieć, ile? Dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takim będzie mój koniec…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosyć nudzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem smutno: — Ja wcale nie mam własnej duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczenie nie zgadzało się z temi domysłami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy dni, cztery dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczałem, gdyż nie wpadła mi na myśl żadna odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolano moje trafiło na blaszany kubeł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiłem do niej to, co mi chwila przyniosła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosyć to zdumiewające, że dają je ludzie, którzy żadnych wrażeń nie posiadają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelką formę, którą spostrzegasz, myślisz okiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym chciał za sobą zamknąć szklane drzwi, ktoś mi wyjął klamkę z ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to mi na co się przyda, gdy tam wejdę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne, jak ten starzec był do nich podobny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co najpierw przynieść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co za obrona konieczna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starczy, starczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym jej mógł przynajmniej pomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I za każdym razem znajdowałam pieniądze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„No to, wielkie szczęście dla mnie.“ „Jakto?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwak przysłuchiwał się rozmowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obłąkany z miłości zatopiłem usta w jej dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem, że pochodzi on z krainy snów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ależ to rozumiało się samo przez się“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo musiałem marudzić, jeżeli nie zauważyłem, że teraz jest już tak późno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż miałem wejść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie trafiła do celu: jeszcze zobaczyłem, jak błysnęła, między tańczącymi; tam nagle zniknęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co on mógł oznaczać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiejsi badacze twierdzą, że posługiwał się latarnią magiczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W odrętwieniu zmysłów świadomość moja była zdolna pochwycić parę słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem panu umożliwić wyjście z tej sprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Baczność!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na nowo cisza, tłum przysłuchuje się bez oddechu, co się dalej stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy drzwi były zamknięte?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co też panu do głowy przychodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprzeczę, naturalnie zaprzeczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niech cię szlag trafi i krew nagła zaleje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23613696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko parę słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulice pokrywała gęsta lepka warstwa błota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, jak więźniowie się obudzili i, ziewając, prowadzili rozmowę po czesku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Książka leżała na podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest w pół do trzeciej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc nie mogłem się uspokoić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To się wyrówna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włosie wydobywało się z krawędzi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za kogo pan mnie ma?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu wybiła piąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądź spokojny, zaręczam ci, że to nic wielkiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzyło go to, że przy nich nikt nie stał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę się nie śmiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młoda dziewczyna wahała się przez chwilę, sądziła bowiem, że cudzoziemiec żartował z niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz jeżeli chce wojny...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głęboko wzruszony omal nie wypuściłem listu z ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23662999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapukał trzy razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sto pytań huczało mi kołowrotem w głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą jest bardzo wesoły i przyjemny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się to stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokażmy mu, że jesteśmy gotowi na wszystko dla zachowania pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dym krążył po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy lubi mieć władzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gładki jak kawał słoniny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja w to nie wierzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za nudy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daję za to głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były to męki raju!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała dzielnica żydowska była jedną kamienną pustynią, jakby trzęsienie ziemi zburzyło miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież jestem niewinny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Same ruiny dokoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pan sądzi, że gdybym miał wybór, to bym popełnił morderstwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił to, chodząc; podszedł do okna i spojrzał w dół na sklepik kramarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz niech sobie szukają wiatru w polu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I czego chce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"We mnie natomiast coś raduje się w dzikiej tryumfalnej ekstazie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była godzina jedenasta!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oprócz tego będę ci płacił za wszystkie dzieła, które dla mnie wykonasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknąłem oczy i udawałem śpiącego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23663080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on ma świadomość tego, co się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23709248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się strzegł, by „jemu“ „tam“ jakąś broń dawać w rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23709249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pomimo, to nadejdzie dzień, w którym my zobaczymy się z sobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23709250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„To nic nie znaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23709251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może za godzinę już mnie wyprowadzą stąd, aby mi przeczytać wyrok śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leniwie i z nerwowym drżeniem wyłażę z ciepłego łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie daj mi znormalnieć, bo to jest śmierć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie ma być: „rąk”, napisane: „rak”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrwali protokół młodego króla — podpisali, że tak właśnie dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albatrosy nie wrzeszczą, i to nie jest ładne wyrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłażą robaki różowe, nieprzyzwoite i rosną dalej, jak trawa do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość bym jej zrobił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc spuściłem milcząco głowę i słuchałem dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tamten jest trójdzielny — odpowiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jak gdybyśmy się zupełnie nie znali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz była to noc nieprzyjemna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jaru! — zawtórował jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz jeszcze zamroczyły się oczy kalifa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za co by cię mieli zabijać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wsadził głowę między jego liście, i to mu przyniosło ulgę, bo męczył się bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, wyłączyłem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie dobrzy! — jęknął przerażony Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja chcę zaraz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąski sierp ubywającego księżyca siał słabe światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem szukać posady, opuścić szkołę lekarską.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj wyjaśniono sprawę w oka mgnieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic, no nic — zagadnął żwawo tamten.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy ją przywitał, nie miał już ochrypłego głosu i cały czar znikł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkiem mi to niepotrzebne!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł żwawo głowę jak cebulkę i zobaczył mały wózek z jarzynami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wessała Emila kompletnie i bez żadnego trudu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem siadł nagi przy fortepianie i zaczął grać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem, że się dasz złapać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uznałem, iż stanowisko to właśnie mi odpowiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się kręcił, ten garbus, dookoła mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest potrzebne dla uczynienia mnie nieżywym, abym się zmieścił do jakichś tam książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myć się nie chcieli, a w taką wielką wodę lecą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy nie mógłbyś i ty chodzić do szkoły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z dumą pokazał Pukowi ukończony rysunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy zostawszy twoją żoną, nie przestałabym cię kochać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my, niestety, nie możemy czuwać nad nim w owych chwilach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale oczywiście, wystarczy to, aby głupiemu chłopu zabić ćwieka w głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed oczyma jadących zaczęły rozwijać się pierwsze akordy gór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trybuny widziane z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebo od samego rana już pokrywały chmury, a około dziesiątej zaczął padać silny deszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała oczy zamknięte już nie tak kurczowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przegrał parę pięknych koni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale będzie wiedzieć i myślę, że osiągnie to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pewnie ten nowy sąsiad z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Organizatorzy starają się podkreślić przede wszystkim świąteczną i rodzinną atmosferę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak schodzi mi noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech wypije szklankę wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hela, nie powiedziawszy ani słowa, zamknęła się w swoim pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak najbardziej uwagę przykuwają długie linki przymocowane do pleców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie udawał, że ma coś załatwić w gabinecie dyrektora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta wyjął z szafy swe rękopisy i rozrzucił po podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ja nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stracił całą ochotę na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczynił jeszcze jedną próbę, która, wiedział o tym, mogła tylko zaszkodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekł tylko jeden żołnierz, dwóch leżało z przestrzelonymi głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Detale na ten temat później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blada jak płótno obsunęła się bez pamięci w moje ramiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właśnie, że nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Bóg łaskaw — sypiam jak suseł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa nie miała trzech duchowych ojców ani biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba mnie na to nie stać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się pan wystrzega tej brunetki i towarzystwa pijaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagłe zmiany nastrojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnie mnie będą jeszcze prześladować, ale mój naczelnik mnie obroni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie chcę — rozpłakała się dziewczynka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwórz przeglądarkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet wręczę panu dopiero później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle obudził mnie szelest lekkich kroków poza mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil — bo wstydził się za Janka; Janek — bo wiedział, co myśli Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie ich powiedziało mi wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastrój w wartowni był błędny i niewyraźny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było już koło piątej po południu, gdy otworzyłem ociężałe powieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalszy pościg był bezcelowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajomy jest wiatr, woń zgniłych ryb, wodorostów i muszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budowla jest jeszcze nieukończona, ale wierni chętnie skorzystali z mszy w nowym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czytaj od trzeciego wiersza z góry!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20774235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod żadnym pozorem nie trzeba przez kilka dni przyjmować wieczornych zaproszeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dużo jest jeszcze nie zbadanych rzeczy na świecie! — szepnął głosem przenikliwym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, zwariowałaś? W tej chwili pożałował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręgosłup moralny nie pozwoliłby ani pani, ani mnie robić wspólnie interesów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość bym jej zrobił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wiadomo foki zapędza się po prostu do rzeźni niby barany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz zasępił się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Królowie mieszkają w hotelu, ja wynająłem mały pokoik w rybackiej chacie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawdziwie, nie mogę sobie przypomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyciągnął rękę ku mej papierośnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzał na wskazany napis.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecież nie był szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ty robisz, licho zatracone?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden rozpalił się prawie do białości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, nic nie wiem — powtórzył parę razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Źródłem wszelkiego zła jest świadomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On wszedł w nią całkiem i ona odczuwała go, jak psy chiczny płód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogoś mi przypominała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zerwał się jak raniony jeleń, pełen rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Źle się stało — szepnął powstając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to godzina przedwieczorna, milcząca, nieruchoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu się bałaś? — Dlatego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem trzeba wiedzieć kiedy się przebranżowić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech kochankowie — ale dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre z nich, pierzchając w rozsypkę, szukały piwnicznego schronu po jarach i krzewach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął kaganek ze stołu i oświetlił twarz Konrada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nic — pocieszał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi dopiero rozmach, co się zowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad rzeką włóczyli się ludzie, suszący siebie na słońcu, jak pieluchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warczała jak pies, któremu zabierają kość; kością była jej zupełna samotność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścili nas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ma pan rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymiotować się chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka godzin byłam poza zasięgiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kanarek wesoło zaśpiewał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, co za rozkosz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rozumiesz, Jerzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oficer stał na ulicy i wymyślał komuś ostatnimi słowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi guzik na trzecią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi z kolei kulawiec zauważył wszystko, co się stało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak też nas wtedy wydaje się wiele!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc wbijam okrągłym, niewygodnym i uderzyłem się w palec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie wie i o to chodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czym polega pańskie bogactwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko wam mogą wejść w drogę insi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba szukać nowej gospody, póki jeszcze brzuszek pełen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc i dorosły czuje się sierotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pomyliłeś się, bratku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oboje nie chcieliśmy czasu marnować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłażą robaki różowe, nieprzyzwoite i rosną dalej, jak trawa do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie rosło, aż się w końcu zazieleni…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybór, wybór! — przedrzeźniała go dziwożona, podrzucając ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak minęła w milczeniu długa chwila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piękny i młodzieńczy, jak ten letni poranek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co też pan mówi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy naznaczyła mu pierwszą schadzkę w… pociągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak jest, wtedy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj byłem u znajomego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosyć nudzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wzruszyła ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, są silni awanturnicy, którzy szukają zaczepki ze słabszym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była jedyna rzecz, oprócz Ewy, na którą zwrócił uwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jest dla ciebie w życiu najważniejsze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś otworzył drzwi na platformę i szarpnął sygnał alarmowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrzucona ze zmierzchu wora na blask południa broniła się słońcu zmrużonymi na chwilę oczyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znaczy, nigdy nie oddam mu się już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile razy przychodziłem do niej, matka jej głaskała mnie po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomóc ci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmawiają o tym, o owym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najczęściej w lasach przygodnej szukali przystani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle ryknął jej tuż nad samym uchem sygnał parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciał widocznie tą wargą przytrzymać w czas sypkie i rozrzutne okruszyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież one chyba nie robią tego tylko dla forsy? Jesteś bał wan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była już na linii moich schodów i widocznie chciała tu wylądować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ja się zaraz sprowadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzenia obecnych skrzyżowały się na purpurowych wargach dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderza w pilotów takich jak ja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma idealnych praw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W imieniu grupy socjalistycznej proszę pozwolić mi skierować do przewodniczącego Barroso poważne ostrzeżenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jednak w żaden sposób nie przeszkadza współpracy i solidarności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byliśmy tu przedtem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym w tym kontekście skomentować jeszcze jedna kwestię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie służy wykorzystaniu Europejskiego Funduszu Dostosowania do Globalizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszym rzędzie chciałbym życzyć panu sukcesów podczas pełnienia nowej funkcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środki wspierania rynku są uznawane za ważny element wspólnej polityki rolnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że będzie to istotną wskazówką dla całego sektora gospodarki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Juże mi dość!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To gwarantuje jednocześnie ochronę praw własności intelektualnej związanych z produktami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, to jest polityka - polityka Nord Streamu i jego właściciela - Kremla\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest usatysfakcjonowany sposobem ich funkcjonowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będą przepytywać, i może się dowiedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"One wolą pietruszkę od koperku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy jednak oczywiście upewnić się, że zostanie ono wysłuchane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zwrócić na to szczególną uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Energetyki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znamy znaczący wpływ religii na decyzje polityczne i na sferę fundamentalnych praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idę do apteki wykupić lek z recepty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja słusznie zaproponowała, abyśmy podjęli próbę osiągnięcia ogólnoeuropejskiego porozumienia w tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tej szansy nie można zmarnować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego w interesie wolnego handlu głosowałem przeciwko temu sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"lepiej się bać, niż się przestraszyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy pozostać biernymi obserwatorami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To doskonale, a zagadnienie jest ważne, dziękuję zatem sekretarzowi generalnemu, który sprawnie podjął działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Romowie nie są mniej inteligentni od większości, nie są też żebrakami ani urodzonymi przestępcami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje niebezpieczeństwo złamania równowagi miedzy interesem kapitału a konsumentem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jurand podjechawszy bliżej, zrozumiał powód tego ptasiego wiecu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz dziękuję wszystkim i gratuluję mianowania panu komisarzowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojutrze, nie oszukujmy się, będzie to Mediolan, a zaraz potem Bruksela i Paryż\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja przedstawiła dobre projekty i uważam, że Rada powinna się nimi kierować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To moja propozycja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie z tego względu to rozczarowujące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomoc finansowa dla państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowo honoru, nie pojmuję szału, który opanował umysły do sztuk zwanych pięknymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Został uznany za przebrzmiały przez tych, którzy w rzeczywistości są przeciwnikami celów klimatycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No cóż, tu się myli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy byłam w dżungli, byłam osobą mającą twarz i nazwisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postępując w sposób bardziej ukierunkowany, moglibyśmy ustanowić bardziej skuteczne wymogi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejski Fundusz Dostosowania do Globalizacji jest kontrowersyjnym mechanizmem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Syreny wyją bo dziś jest rocznica Powstania Warszawskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejną kwestią poruszoną w tej debacie jest kwalifikowana migracja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te same zasady sprawiedliwości mają także zastosowanie do sytuacji wspólnot mniejszości etnicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy nadal handlować z krajami w strefie euro\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada szczegółowo przeanalizuje to sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym dowiedzieć się, co ma zamiar zrobić prezydencja w tej kwestii?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"praktykom trudno jest zrozumieć toczoną tu batalię polityczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tymczasem w ramach unijnej polityki zasadniczo zapomina się o nich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Euro będzie miało do odegrania kluczową rolę w tym nowym układzie stabilności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez nich nie udałoby się sporządzić tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie powiem tylko, że finanse międzynarodowe potrzebują ścisłych i przejrzystych ram\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takich praktyk nie można usprawiedliwiać względami tradycji kulturowej czy religijnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"niech ta Bóg szczęści Zakonowi, jak na to zasługuje!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co my mamy robić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Służby Komisji poszukują teraz rozwiązań, które będą mogły być szybko wprowadzone w życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludność Kosowa chętna jest szybkiemu przystąpieniu do Unii Europejskiej i zostania równoprawnym państwem członkowskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałby zacytować po angielsku jednego z kenijskich obserwatorów, który napisał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy czwarte posłów tej Izby głosowało za uznaniem Kosowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zbadać przyczyny i siłę napędową, która przyciąga tych ludzi do Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto, co mogę państwu uczciwie powiedzieć, lecz będę uważnie słuchał kolejnych wystąpień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja będzie promować rozwój sieci portów oraz zapewni rozwój dobrych inwestycji towarzyszących\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poziom ambicji i precyzji tych pierwotnych zobowiązań jest jednak nierówny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi, że nie można nic zrobić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ja jestem zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kajdany zdjęli, i nawet się trochę wstydził, że jest wyjątkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy działać razem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspieram oczywiście ambicje Wrocławia, który konkuruje o siedzibę Europejskiego Instytutu Technologii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy innego wyjścia, jak tylko się zgodzić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy to szybko uczynić i zablokować wszelkie próby obejścia tego traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nic nie rozwiązuje w średnim horyzoncie czasowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było jedno wystąpienie, którym najzwyczajniej gardzę, ale nie zamierzam go komentować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30729696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak, czy nie jest tak, że załamanie jest lepsze niż alternatywa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30737870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Profilu tego nie użyto, aby nakierować budżet na poszczególne inicjatywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30737871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30737872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy prawa nakazywać, ale mamy prawo promować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30737873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że minister nie wierzy w świętoszkowate efekciarstwo w tej Izbie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30737874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem za przyjęciem sprawozdania, w którym zatwierdza się odpowiedni wniosek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinni na nim być jakieś dziesięć minut temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"lub rozgniewam się na tak nieufnego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To niezły chłopiec, chociaż kompletny niedołęga w swoim zawodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"w czoło... w policzek... czy wszędzie po trosze?..\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co by to mogło być?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odskoczyłem jak oparzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski uczuł, że z serca zsuwa się mu ogromny ciężar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzekłszy to, pokazała małego, szarego ptaszka wśród liści drzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każde jej pytanie zaspakajał z pełnym wyrozumienia uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet to, że tym samym pociągiem jedzie pan Starski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on jeszcze jest u pana?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez alergię na zewnątrz łzawią mi oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz na rany Chrystusa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie dokoła barykady z kamieni brukowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tynk z sufitu zleciał, połamane sprzęty leżały dokoła, ale dziury nie było żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy ów stwór runął bez życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, do widzenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poślizgnąłem się i mało co nie spadłem ze skały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewolno było rozmawiać ze sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak nie, to nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jest... U nas tak zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż miał począć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Książęta niemieccy, protestanccy, zawiązali tajemną ligę przeciwko cesarzowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brygada zerwała się z ziemi i jęła formować długą, w czwórki wyciągniętą linię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczy samej był to malowniczy widok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś się stało widocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maćko widocznie miał się lepiej, bo oddychał równiej i spokojniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pozwolisz, że się roześmieję z szacunkiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawka była wysoka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25228902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest główna jego wada; ale w ogóle jest to dobry chłopak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniej rezolutny człowiek ode mnie byłby rozpaczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąwóz, który spadzisto prowadził na dół?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwie kule przeszyły mur i spłaszczyły się na ścianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość będzie Maciuś wesół i już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy był stary czy młody?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed dwoma laty rękę chłopakowi urwało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie był on zawsze przyjacielski i dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora została ich ledwie połowa, lecz ani jeden Francuz nie pokalał progu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On wszystko może Blanko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie, pewnego dnia, Stach Wokulski całkiem zniknął mi z oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy byłeś ze mną despotyczny i szorstki i wszystko robiłeś po swojemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On to, jak się później przekonano, wyższym był od wszystkich otaczających.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"w twoim ręku jest wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzałem przez lunetę na księżyc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małego pożaru, kradzieży, nadużycia zaufania, awantury?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wrzeszczał, chwytając się za głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukam cię i oczekiwałem dość długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże dość o tem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, że jak zostawisz otwartą lodówkę, to wcale się zimniej nie zrobi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król przez kilka chwil w milczeniu te arcydzieła oglądał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie obliczyłem się z siłami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdziłem je i roztrząsnąłem, dodając kilka swoich spostrzeżeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem synem wolnej Ameryki i to wszystko tutaj jest dla mnie nowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna tylko osoba została.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale o stryju zupełnie już zapomniałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie żądam, nic nie pragnę, chcę tylko miłości Blanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgarbiła się, skuliła, zmalała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy stary lis zaczął mi pokazywać zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki Napoleon I. kochał się naprawo i nalewo i mimo to trząsł Europą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynym usprawiedliwieniem dzieł nieużytecznych jest wywołana nimi potęga zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszym rzędzie było dla mnie jasnem, że nie mogłem powracać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej chwili mój przyjacielu, jest twoją i będziesz ją miał kiedy zechcesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„To panią trapi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udało mu się wreszcie papieża przekonać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem o organizacji tego „Uśmiechniętego“ i miałem tutaj przed sobą praktyczny jej przykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bez wątpienia jest zakochany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba ująć sprawę rozumowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu zostali we dwu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odbierz ten telefon!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sceny wydają mi się fantastyczne jak pod działaniem opium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to wielka uroczystość, bo większa część uczonych z południowych Niemiec będzie przytomną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał na sobie ciemny uniform i jakiś kapelusz z białem piórkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nigdy nie był kochliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbiegła spiesznie ze schodów; żal ścisnął mi gardło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O niczym innym nie marzę, jak o powrocie do biura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zapomnij co do ciebie powiedziała, i każ jej zapomnieć co jej odrzekłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Burza zimowa w całej swojej bezmyślnej wściekłości szalała nad miastem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25229511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeszcząc rozszerzają się włókna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To więc jest wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Namyślać się, do pioruna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ostatnie zdanie było jakby wydechem szeptane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za kwadrans zniknie zupełnie z celi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie mogłem się doczekać chwili jego przebudzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobił pojednawczy wyraz twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prosto z wyścigów Wokulski pojechał do Szumana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jakie wyzwanie na pojedynek lub coś podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała na pergaminie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zostawcie mnie tu, błagam was.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczyłem na jutro, na wspólną przechadzkę więźniów po dziedzińcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czasy zmieniają się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie, zdawało mu się, że to wszystko snem było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koniec końców: jestem tu i basta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Korzystając z chwili, Wokulski chciał ich minąć, ale wysoki pan zatrzymał go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski zbliżył się do powozu hrabiny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy konie z miejsca ruszyły cwałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrzeba więcej, ażebyś został jej najlepszym przyjacielem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela zaczęła mówić po angielsku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minuty czasu nie mamy do stracenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pan podpisał, że się przyznaje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakim się to sposobem stało, dowie się czytelnik w rozdziale następującym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie trzeba się tak rumienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ci ostatni nie spodziewając się gradu co ich osypał, cofnęli się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy też nie marzył, ażeby rozmawiała z nim tak łaskawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę aby dworak ocalił rzeźbiarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbudził go okrzyk tłumu, dzwonek i brawo... To odbył się pierwszy wyścig.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela przedstawiła panów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co pan sobie o mnie myśli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym choć jeszcze raz mógł mu rękę uścisnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko było tam w porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest, pisał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadzwoniono na trzeci wyścig.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilę się zastanawiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił, jakby to rozumiało się samo z siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał po obecnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę sam z niego korzystać, czy chcesz go?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród tłumu zbudził się szalony zapał dla Wokulskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"spodziewam się, że nie masz mnie pan za takiego grubianina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wstydź się tak żartować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jest to rzecz rzadka; mów, mów panie sekretarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej chwili mój przyjacielu, jest twoją i będziesz ją miał kiedy zechcesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż pan tak straszliwego popełnił?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podskoczyłem ze zdumienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23796917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oblężeni zasłonięci dotąd murem, nagle zostali odkryci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może być, że mi się śniło na jawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to rozprawa o kolorze i formie włosów ludności zamieszkującej Królestwo Polskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tem gorzej dla niej; czekałem ja także przeszłej niedzieli, dziś na nią kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piękną napisali intercyzę, co?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zirytowana hrabina kazała jechać do domu, nie czekając końca wyścigów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak więc znalazł on swoją drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przysięgam, że ten hultaj drogo przypłaci chwilę, jaką przepędziłem dzięki twej przyjaźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fasada była zdjęta całkowicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie nadszedł dzień wyścigów, pogodny ale nie gorący; właśnie jak potrzeba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co też on mógł popełnić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzeba dobrze uważać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się z roztargnieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże dość o tem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski wskoczył do swego powozu i otworzył lornetę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"twój puls bije tak silnie, krew uderza ci do twarzy... O!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy nie masz mi nic więcej do powiedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądziła dotąd, że piękność była pierwszą na tym świecie potęgą; zapomniała o geniuszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koźle lokaj hrabiny półgłosem zakładał się z furmanem, że Wokulski wygra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pan nie wierzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prezesowa była wesoła, hrabina uśmiechnięta, pan Łęcki promieniejący.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blanka zaś dozwalała patrzeć na siebie z anielską ufnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Resztę opowie panu Wencel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz pod tem wszystkiem jest przepaść, kolego, przepaść pełna błota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Mówię ci, bądź spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy pan już był na przesłuchaniu“ zapytałem po chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Właśnie stamtąd przychodzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech mi przebaczy, że go oskarżam, lecz sprawiedliwość dzieci dobrą ma pamięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski zerwał się o piątej i natychmiast pojechał odwiedzić swoję klacz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam więc do mojego rozporządzenia przywilej królewski na to mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela przyjęła paczkę z uśmiechem i prześlicznem spojrzeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojsko konetabla niespodziewanie stanęło pod Rzymem, i przypuściło szturm do wałów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski ledwo miał czas dopaść powozu i pożegnać się z damami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem kupił sobie karnet i robił notatki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23797075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela stanęła na siedzeniu; na twarz jej wystąpiły rumieńce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całkiem innego powodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama leżała wciąż w głębokim uśpieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wtedy byłem nieszczęśliwy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym chciała być dla ciebie taką serdeczną przyjaciółką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był poza tym w najwyższym stopniu wstrętny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiam czarną kawę o poranku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ona to przeczuwa i dlatego boi się stanowczego kroku?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Opłatek cudzysłowu” należy wziąć w cudzysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na moim łóżku i siedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chyba zewsząd, bo i leśna jest, i ruczajna, i górska, i wszelaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To się zdarzało bardzo rzadko, i dlatego była niespokojna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie nie było mu źle — ale ciasno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę mieć spokój i wygodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobieństwo często jest nieintuicyjne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięciu warty z jednej strony, pięciu z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż znowu? — zaprzeczyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zacząć od samego mojego wyboru książki na nasze zajęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wy także jesteście książętami i księżniczkami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy świeciły jasno, cisza była niezmierzona…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzniosłem tylko okrzyk na cześć naszej skrzydlatej patronki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc aż cały miesiąc leżałem w malignie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cudna kobieta! — pomyślałem, przestępując próg sali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiło na mnie wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, już nie powiem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagłe zmiany nastrojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwny to był most!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego się śmiejesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona pokazała język czerwony jak mak i wklęsły jak czółno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora źrenice miałem rozszerzone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ja nienawidzę tego bydlęcia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałaś tego gościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem w towarzystwie czterech równie zachwyconych tą sytuacją osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąłem teczkę, uporządkowałem papiery i poszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł miał wstać już trzy drzemki temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmaite mogłyby być sposoby rodzenia się, umierania i odradzania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka takich pisemnych relacji udało się już zebrać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To tylko fason jej bucików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgasił lampę i położył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil poprosił o dwa fartuchy i powiedział do Ewy: — Mogłabyś zostać siostrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nagi konar drzewa ukazał się niespodzianie tuż za szybą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A miała ta przejażdżka pomiędzy kamienicami szczególny urok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tymczasem wiedzą już królowie, dokąd zajechał samochód z Maciusiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20690999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przegrał parę pięknych koni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżcie się teraz trochę do mnie! — rozkazał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już dwie szyby w tym roku stłukli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok reszta! — krzyknął Podlasiak, podniecony otrzymanym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z kim bądź, ale zaraz i za wszelką cenę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka godzin byłam poza zasięgiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkiem mi to niepotrzebne!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unikam wszelkich poprawek i przeróbek! — odpowiedział pośpiesznie i niespokojnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różne rodzaje ciemności, poprze- rzynane błyskawicami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobała mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechże matka ma rozum!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że grasz na harmonijce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daremny trud, drzwi są szczelnie zasłonięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy ja się przy tobie rozpływam zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko mnie powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go uczucie dziwnego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziwne: muszka mogła fruwać, a człowiek nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz wszystko ma swój koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umawiała się z różnymi chłopcami, dawała się czasami całować; bez przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przydałby się tu jakiś wybieg dla psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaludnili więc sam widok lasu, jakby w celu uzupełnienia i ożywienia nieprzynależnego nikomu obrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale chcę się cofnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo miłe sąsiedztwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przejdę przez ogród i popatrzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im za to płacą, niech się grzebią w gównie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grosz do grosza, a będzie kokosza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wepchnął mocniej i złamała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To okropna nuda nic nie robić, tylko wciąż chodzić do budy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest jasne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie dobrzy! — zawołał znowu, życzliwie kiwając głową i uśmiechem popierając każde kiwnięcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz ostrożność nie zawadzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogut myślał o niedzieli, a w sobotę łeb mu ucięli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już się tak nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kraju, gdzie nie było Ewy, duch unosił się nad wodami i niepokojem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za pozwoleniem — wstrzymałem go gestem — nie miałem zamiaru częstować cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zmiany atmosferyczne tak wpłynęły na ich światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwiłem się też, jak ludzie w takiej atmosferze mogą wytrzymać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwna jednak rzecz zdarzyła się nocy ubiegłej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż on sobie myśli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tknięty złem przeczuciem wybiegł przed dom i ujrzał w dali uciekającą syrenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głos ten brzmieć mi będzie zawsze w uszach, jak najcudowniejsza muzyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszałem nagle krzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan jesteś owym parlamentarzem angielskim, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po dachu przesuwał się jakiś człowiek wprost na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22232501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włożyłem na jej życzenie kapelusz i wyszliśmy z domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22242787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byłem w stanie wydobyć głosu z gardła, ani też uczynić najmniejszego ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22242788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zaraz temu zaradzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22242790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zadrwi z nas przecież, bo jesteśmy razem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22242793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widział nic, oprócz tych dwojga ramion ściskających gwałtownie jego szyję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22242796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, skonsumowaliśmy dość sporo zawartości pierwszego cylindra na powrócenie do życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległy się śmiechy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale akurat w tym czasie przyłapał ich patrol ułanów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to wrażenie tak silne, że medykowi ścisnęło się gardło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu obcych nie puszcza się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Serce ludzkie zdradza się łatwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to lejek z czarnej skóry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrzebowali już obawiać się najgorszej choćby wojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z dala coraz wyraźniej płyną dymy bliskiej już wsi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały ruch uliczny jest wstrzymany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz w chwili, w której zwrócił się do niego, stało się coś takiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staszek szybki jest!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był teraz niespokojny tylko o własny rozsądek, byleby go nie stracić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręczę, że Pan Bóg nie będzie się gniewał, chociaż to dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce w domu wszystko ucichło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22494279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże to nazywacie takich?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22752765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jużeś pan naraził na szwank całą naszą wyprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22752766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie spostrzegłem, iż zbliża się do nas szybko jakaś latarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22752767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daj no rogala...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22752768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To były trzy etapy mej wyprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22752769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech i tak będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwicie się, panowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dlaczego?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę, jakie pan przedsięwziąłeś kroki, kiedyś znalazł tę kartę na drzwiach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mów pan z nim otwarcie, gdyż inaczej każe pana przepiłować między dwiema deskami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukraść sweter to rozumiem, ale pojedynczy guzik?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boże, jak ten czas się wlókł, każda minuta wydawała się wiecznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wartownik otworzył drzwi i przepuścił mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego powodu nie przedsięwzięto nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś jest sobota, więc spodziewam się, że w poniedziałek przyjdziemy do ostatecznych wyników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeczytał list i siedział potem prawie pół godziny bez ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypadek w cudowny sposób przyszedł mi z pomocą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chcieli mnie tak łatwo wypuścić, ci eleganccy myśliwi na lisy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty wychodzisz za tego śmiecia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziałem mu: w świetle księżyca swe białe zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale skłoniłem się tylko i milczałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego lub więcej może pokaleczyłem, ale czy nie postąpilibyście tak samo, panowie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz pan przecie, iż nie chcę z panem walczyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A idź ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22756268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zrobisz tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybiegłem przez bardzo uszkodzoną bramę klasztorną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie trzeba mi było tego dwa razy powtarzać, to też wybiegłem czem prędzej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem kiedy puszczę na nich światło, szybko ich schwytajcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie nie byłem tak głupi, abym sam z niej korzystał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Testament ściśle to określa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miała już siły prosić urwisa, żeby nie chodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla ciebie to może bazgroły, ale ktoś wydał na to niezłą sumkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tam było na Mazurach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obraca się przeciwko niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drabinka prowadziła na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze jedno spojrzenie w ciemną noc; nic się nie poruszało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozsiedli się na meblach i zagarnęli wszystko, co było w mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22790275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak czy siak, misja się powiodła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezadługo przemknęli obok mego okna i zniknęli mi z oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygrał asa pikowego, mogłem odrzucić tylko damę karową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że nie lubisz Androida, ale ja po prostu mam inne gusta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba mi się wydaje, ale coś z tym gościem jest nie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale gdzie ją znaleźć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże mi przyjemnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza mną znajdowało się ponure więzienie i ciężka ręka króla angielskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się pan nazywa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywiązaliśmy konie i siedliśmy przy dużym odłamie skały naprzeciw siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszył na to ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czyż nie mogłem go wsunąć pod jakiś kamień przy bramie wchodowej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich podniósł latarkę do twarzy nieszczęśliwego, poczem obydwaj wybuchnęli szatańskim śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż Murat nie zamienił swej czapy huzarskiej na koronę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani słyszeć o tem nie chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy mu rozgorzały, grzywa się najeżyła, stanął dęba i zaczął dziko tańczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze jeden skok i wszystkie psy znalazły się za mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedziała, od czego zacząć, gdzie jest droga i jak nią iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarłem zimny pot z czoła, i zacząłem na nowo kuć plany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stefan Gerard splunął i przestał opowiadać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od marszałka otrzymałem mapę, kompas i rozkaz zachowania się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natychmiast poznałem, iż szczęście samo mi się pcha w ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze więzienie posiadało jedno jedyne, małe okno, wychodzące na podwórze, otoczone podwójnym murem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowiedziałem się coś o nim przedtem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego tyle przewracania się i podnoszenia, tyle biegu i zmęczenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trasa przez Pojezierze Drawskie jest bardziej malownicza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W znikającym mroku biegłem naprzód i ufałem ślepo memu szczęściu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten stary złodziej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bolało mnie to, iż moi chłopcy tak byli osamotnieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeczytał list i siedział potem prawie pół godziny bez ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich zauważył mnie przy blasku lampy, powstał i zawołał na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymałem tak jeszcze trzy godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyłem, iż byli to chłopi, którzy ładowali na wózki próżne beczki od wina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponury, długi budynek znajdował się tuż przede mną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśl o odkryciu mnie wywietrzała mi zupełnie z głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co miała znaczyć ta nocna wyprawa i dlaczego miałem iść uzbrojony?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy zbliżyliśmy się, spostrzegłem stojących tam dwóch mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na samym brzegu stoku stała jedna z beczek od wina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziałem mu: w świetle księżyca swe białe zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prócz tego przed nocą potrzeba mi było trochę pożywienia i wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, o gustach się nie dyskutuje, ale sukienka w kwiatki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spoglądałem jeszcze za nim z gorzką zawiścią, gdy wtem ktoś dotknął mego ramienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Plecak cię zbyt nie obciąża?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za cztery godziny bądź pan gotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Roześmiałem się gorzko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoro ustawa tak rzecze, to niech będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się od zabitego lisa, pozdrowiłem wszystkich pałaszem i pognałem dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łzy mi stanęły w oczach, gdy ujrzałem, że osiągnąłem podziw tylu dzielnych ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciec z tego wygnania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, zniknął zupełnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim się mogłem opamiętać, wyciągnięto mnie z wozu za nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprowadź mnie do tej swojej szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cień musiał nabrać woli, władzy, decyzji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrenuję sobie cardio i może stracę pare kilo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przegoniłem i tych dwóch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według mego powierzchownego badania musiał być taki sam, jak pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porozmawiali obydwaj przez chwilę, poczem skinęli obydwaj głowami i spojrzeli w moją stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadłem na łóżku i czekałem, co mnie za kara spotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopóki mąż był w domu, on był osobą - ona cichym i pokornym cieniem osoby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszła potem jego siódemka pikowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem na niem także w Bristolu, ale o tem opowiem panom innym razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym oczom przez chwilę nawet wierzyć nie mogłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawali mi się być wesołymi ludźmi, gdyż śmiali się serdecznie, idąc obok wozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wschodzie zaczęły się już ukazywać pierwsze promienie światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieźle, jest grochówka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem się na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba pół kilo zdołasz unieść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasz przyjaciel jest podziwienia godnym człowiekiem w tropieniu zwierzyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kląłem, ściągałem cugle, rwałem, ale byłem bezsilny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwi się zamyka, to nie Afryka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże pan chcesz umrzeć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego mu potrzeba, to starego psa, aby mu pomagał w upolowaniu jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daj no rogala...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze ci iPhone potrzebny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy rzuciłem się ku niemu, stanął i spojrzał na mnie z osłupieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ten szelma Anglik zrobił?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam pozostałem na ziemi, niepokojony nadzieją i oczekiwaniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to wyznam, że przez to stracę mego wista.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brać się natychmiast do roboty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierścień na palcu mnicha jest niemożliwem zjawiskiem, gdyż przysięga on na bezwzględne ubóstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22716525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tam chcesz, ważne, żeby działało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż mi zabroni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem położył ołówek i papier przed sobą, co nie było jego zwyczajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem przerywa, aby podejść do fortepianu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pewnie ten nowy sąsiad z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czym szli zgodnie i umownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co teraz będzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król odbywa dalekie wycieczki łodzią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz pan! — przerwała mi, wskazując na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż zamierzył się Felek na majstra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok reszta! — krzyknął Podlasiak, podniecony otrzymanym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzi do mnie wtedy, gdy w domu są awantury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostałem sam u wylotu tonącej w półmroku uliczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy utkwione w powałę, twarz azjatycka, bez wyrazu, nieludzka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po przerwie: — To, co ostatnio powiedziałem, jest też prawdą, ale nie tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociągnął nosem, węsząc jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetny to orszak widzów, świetny, zaprawdę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w męczącej sytuacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bawię się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też zaręczał, że jej chorej matce nie zabraknie niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym właśnie sęk! — zawołał Podlasiak, wstydliwie obmacując wybitną pozostałość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał mnóstwo wszelakich książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteśmy otoczeni wrogami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz z nikotyną, alkoholem i wszelkimi «białymi obłędami».\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To francuska kapela — oznajmił trochę drwiąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj razem dostąpimy wyzwolenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby człowiek miał cztery ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za mistrzowska taktyka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruchome masy gadów porcelanowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwudziestego dziewiątego czerwca imieniny obchodzą Piotr i Paweł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy bowiem warunek jednorękiemu, a drugi kulawcowi by nie odpowiadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oni wkrótce zaczną nas szukać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawość to pierwszy stopień do piekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie lubię z nikim dzielić się miłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu właśnie tkwi istota symbolu i jedna z zasadniczych zagadek bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się tłumaczył, pani i tak nie uwierzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ogóle lubię podróżować w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziała: „Dobrze”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybieraj, póki czas! — zawołał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostałem właśnie Twojego maila dotyczącego naszego wyjazdu służbowego do Paryża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę się dalej bawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziemniaki i jajka w zupełności wystarczą, nic innego w diecie nie potrzebuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To są rady banalne dla zupełnych już prymitywów golenia się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiam czarną kawę o poranku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście zabieg nie był mi obcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą lepiej się myśli w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generał zaś był bez czapki, palił papierosy i patrzył w ogień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skorzystaj z tego, jeżeli ci życie miłe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec nieraz mi wyjaśniał wszystko, a ja wam to zaraz powtórzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mi się trochę podoba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba ten niebieskooki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toruj drogę jako młodszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatoczyłem się tylko jak pijany i poszedłem dalej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko wszakże zamieszka taka się zdarzała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i przestałem się pytać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wjechaliśmy w czeluść wodną pomiędzy Wyspą św. Heleny a Ogrodami Publicznymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo leżało takie kółeczko, od zegarka czy czego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Węże w pustynnych źródłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nachylić się nisko, do ziemi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ty umiesz zawsze uspokoić mnie, Jur!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam nadzieję, że połowa uczestników odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż to rok mamy teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich przyjaźń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem — szepnął z uśmiechem i pogardliwie spojrzawszy na jednorękiego, przywołał go ruchem dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie umrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok z nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę sobie wyrobić nowy paszport.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie znajdę jakieś fajne knajpki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież mieli szukać spotkania z bogami, z dobrymi i złymi duchami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo tam przecie nie ma komfortu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekam, aż obrazy podniosą się przede mną, jak przed zaklinaczem wężę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryby pływały, wystawiając nad wodę płetwy, widocznie rozkoszując się ciepłem słonecznym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic wam, bracia i siostry, nie mogę powiedzieć, choć wiem wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nami rozwinęła się wspaniała panorama portu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż, sprzeciwia się pan stanowczo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co? — W klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej barwy świąt udało nam się zachować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nuż pokrwawi! — schlebił sobie czupurnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy mówił o widmowej twarzy, oczy Hanny rozszerzyły się przerażeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pędzi na swoim czółnie jak wicher.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz sen nie spływał na powieki od jego pieśni monotonnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nogi miała zwieszone z obu stron konia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyrzekliście warunek ten spełnić, tymczasem, jeśli obiegające wieści głoszą prawdę nie dotrzymujecie przyrzeczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyna roześmiała się, uradowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawróciłem mu w głowie porządnie, ale może się mieć na ostrożności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczył przywiązaną królewnę i począł się zbliżać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tak ważnej sprawie, jak ta, której się podjąłem, trzeba zaryzykować wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No to w takim razie możemy przystąpić do układów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znam i ja to uczucie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godzina ma sześćdziesiąt minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skóra w tym miejscu jest poszarpana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem od pana, że jesteś pan zastępcą panny Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postąpię jak sam będę uważał za odpowiednie i może jeszcze wyśmieję tych dudków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że wielkie towarzystwa, na wzór towarzystw mniejszych, będą wolały zapłacić, niż walczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ode mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspólność pracy zbliżyła nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechaj wybierze jednego z nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak cię złapie w pazurki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"iPhone pojawił się przed androidem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo więc przyszło to i owo znaleźć przeciwko niemu, nagadać, uprzedzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to mało prawdopodobne, ale wobec podniesienia mostu, nie było innej drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawarzyłaś piwa... i na Boga, wypijesz je!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyznaję, że nie widzę sposobu powiązania tych wszystkich faktów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dlaczego wchodzisz do nas w ten sposób?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I „pa” z daleka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic się jednak nie trafiało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było wspanialszej roboty w krwawych rocznikach towarzystwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta okoliczność była początkiem wszystkiego, co nastąpiło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech raczy się pofatygować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko bardzo ładnie - pozostaje nam tylko oznaczenie ceny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko widząc, co się dzieje, przeraziło się także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lejek z czarnej skóry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Światło wśród ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległ się głośny szmer potwierdzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okrywała ją szata obszerna i biała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z poważnej jego twarzy wyczytała niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje uszanowanie panom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero przebiegłszy dobre dwie mile angielskie Holmes się zatrzymał i począł nadsłuchiwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pełną ręką zaczerpnął, przetłuścił kutasa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli przemoczeni i nieuczesani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopiec wziął nową zapałkę i zrobił drugą nóżkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W podwórzu było już zupełnie ciemno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdumione stały siostry królewskie, gdy dziewica wśród nich stanęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał chwilę obok mnie w milczeniu ze świecą w ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz pozwolę sobię w miarę możności dokładnie opisać scenę, którą ujrzałem we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyż więc zaczynamy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż nadszedł czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko, my, synowie wieku oświeconego, wtrąciliśmy ją do rzędu zabobonów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My zrobimy swoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takich rozmowach całe dwa dni upłynęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W serce Stasia wstąpiła nadzieja, że pogoń potrafi uczynić to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyś nie słyszała, co mówił lekarz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi, że chce się z panem widzieć w tej chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powrócił do swej nędznej izby, mając plan zemsty gotowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktor przybyły znalazł i chorobę wątroby, i różne inne naruszenia organizmu...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Integracja z kamerami systemów telewizji przemysłowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale teraz, skoro spełniłem swoje zadanie, wszystko mi jedno kiedy umrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Charkowie zaburzenia robotnicze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— E, to są grymasy — śmieje się mama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakub znowu skinął głową, wpatrując się tępo przed siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał w ręku bat i wywijał nim na wszystkie strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma się rozumieć, jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż on może o nas wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazajutrz rano poszli razem do ogrodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże Serbowie otrzymali jej zbyt mało, aby przekazać część Rosjanom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to wysoki, chudy mężczyzna w czarnej szacie, z twarzą surową i wycieńczoną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyroda wszelako nie jest jednostajna na tej ponurej przestrzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21636236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to klub dobroczynny i miejsce zebrań towarzyskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nierówności wewnątrzregionalne w niektórych przypadkach mają większe znaczenie niż dysproporcje między regionami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego właśnie chciałbym podkreślić to, co postrzegam jako argumenty przemawiające za pojazdami elektrycznymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"prewencyjne i stymulujące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudności w negocjacjach z Mercosurem nie są błahostką\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem głęboko przekonany, że to fałszywie rozumiana solidarność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie kwestia ta została zbadana przez Komisję Europejską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to odzwierciedlenie nowej sytuacji w Unii oraz potrzeb językowych naszych obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy patrzeć w milczeniu, gdy rząd morduje swoich własnych obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejny typowy aspekt tego podejścia to propozycja stymulacji przedsiębiorczości kobiet w celu zwiększenia zatrudnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludność musi nabyć zaufania nie tylko do rządu, lecz również do systemu prawnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całymi latami rozmawialiśmy o zrównoważonym rybołówstwie i o biurokratycznych kontrolach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wy mieliście jedno i my także\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naciski zewnętrzne mogą zmusić juntę do ogłoszenia demokratycznych wyborów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wspaniałe rezultaty, dowodzące, że Europa kroczy ścieżką zrównoważonego rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26946621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aktywny dialog ze społeczeństwem obywatelskim stanowi najważniejszą metodę wzmocnienia legitymacji Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okrywała ją szata obszerna i biała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem od pana, że jesteś pan zastępcą panny Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często się gniewałam na siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemiec popędził za nim, lecz wkrótce wrócił zmęczony strasznie, nie dogoniwszy zająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prosta droga do grzechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale chciałem zobaczyć, co się z tobą dzieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekajcie, teraz wam je przykrócę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracaj znów do trumny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cierpi na tym braku sił fachowych produkcja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedłem z lejkiem do światła i zacząłem go dokładnie oglądać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem go wówczas nogą i przyłożyłem mu dłoń do serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem oglądnął pokój, do którego detektyw miał zostać zwabiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu objawił życzenie, aby mu za dyktandem Staszek coś napisał na próbę...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zapłaciłbym i to dobrze“, rzekł „gdybym dowiedział się czegoś odpowiedniego dla redaktora“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, teraz, kochana żono, dowiedziałem się, co to jest strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielu jednak już tam poszło, lecz ani jeden nie wrócił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płacząc podeszła ku nim ochmistrzyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tych jaskiniach, według opowieści mieszkańców, przemieszkiwał straszny czarownik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek ledwie sam się wyżywi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pańska rzecz decydować, czy to słuszne, czy nie słuszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że cię tu widzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes rozejrzał się szybko dokoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to panu nie będzie przeszkadzało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W reszcie mogę wyłożyć karty na stół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tych słowach wstał i począł się ubierać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg raczył wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich był bardzo zwinny i trudno go było dojrzeć, bo.... uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W lecie odwiedzają go tłumy ludzi, ale w zimie jest pusty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj rano wybrał się tutaj na rowerze z strzelbą ukrytą pod kurtką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spokojny w obejściu, prowadził życie systematyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż wreszcie nadszedł dzień dzisiejszy...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pan jest doktorem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W osobnej kolumnie, złożonej w ostatniej chwili, przeczytał: „Napad na Redakcję Gońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz stało się przeciwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawarzyłaś piwa... i na Boga, wypijesz je!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drobiu hodowało się mnóstwo i bardzo szczęśliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że pora włożyć maski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do drzwi zapukano głośno trzy razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wierz mi, dziewczyno, nie mogę wyjeżdżać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrócił się do stojącego sługi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz pozwolę sobię w miarę możności dokładnie opisać scenę, którą ujrzałem we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego czasu nie pojawił się on już nigdy w Warszawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to, jakby dalekie światło, przenikające przez mroki bezpośredniej przyszłości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W całej Rosji panuje stały terror włościański przeciwko przedstawicielom władzy sowieckiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dążył więc do nich, na nic nie zważając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21582384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od słowa do słowa, grubo się powaśnili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21595993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ze łzami w oczach wróciła do pałacu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21595994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam przedstawił się jej straszny widok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21595995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja już za stary na naukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21595997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo więc przyszło to i owo znaleźć przeciwko niemu, nagadać, uprzedzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21595998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trwało to jednak krótką chwilę, bo trucizna działała piorunująco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21595999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oberżysta, usłyszawszy to, roześmiał się i rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy drożyźnie cen żywności nie wystarcza to nawet na chleb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj są pełni zapału, energiczni, ale żaden z nich nie grzeszy pomysłowością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robotnik rosyjski w przeciągu ostatnich lat dziesięciu przedziwne przechodził koleje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest tam co napisane na odwrotnej stronie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że miałeś małe starcie z policjantami, kiedy wysiadłeś z pociągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęła go ponownie żądza wódki i kazał mi stanąć przed szynkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często bywa, że podejrzenie pada na człowieka w kilka miesięcy po spełnieniu zbrodni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoro ich raz wypędzimy, potęga naszego związku będzie złamana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobna jest raczej do widma, niż do kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można poznać starego mistrza po jego robocie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sługę mieć mogła rzadko... czasy były ciężkie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale, jakaż olbrzymia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włościanin lubi przykład, poglądowość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okazuje się, że moje przypuszczenia są słuszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz się z nim rozmówić, inaczej te psy rzucą się na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz mam nadzieję, żeś nauczył się trząść ze strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod jakim kątem widzenia rozpatruje autor te „siły“?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On cię zabije.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był tam mały pokoik, zastawiony beczkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodniki były wąskie i pełne wyrw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21596288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bolszewicy system ten doprowadzili do szczytu doskonałości, wszelkiego typu donosicieli otaczając szczególną opieką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21891706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie robił komentarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21891707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez jednego słowa wsiedliśmy do samochodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21891708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasz przyjaciel jest niemożliwy jak zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21891709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednem słowem, nic się nie dowiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21891710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedział nastroszony, jak stary, siwy kruk i trząsł się ze złośliwego śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21891721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż za głupiec ze mnie, cóż za głupiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21891722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż pozostało oprócz grobów na cmentarzu i trumien zgniłych, zjedzonych przez robactwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21891723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzięki panu całą drogę byliśmy jak w kabarecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21891725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łodzi nie ma ani okruszyny chleba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosiliśmy go na lunch w pobliskiej knajpie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z trwogą podawano sobie wiadomość o stopniu ich gwałtowności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno tu ma się coś takiego robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały film swoją scenerią idealnie wpisuje się w nurt ekspresjonistyczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez okno leje się woda i kapie na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło mamie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale straszne było przebudzenie z upojeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ich dwóch: prawy — kulawiec, a lewy — jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedzialność ta spada przede wszystkim na rodziców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Mój chłopcze, mama obiecała mi dzisiaj, że pojadę sama na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jużci, że wiadomo… — przerwał mu jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był też nieprzytomny tego wieczoru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybył tutaj jako zbieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Ciebie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lubisz kogoś? — Ale skąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoła była dużo lepiej zbudowana jak jej lekki domek letni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego Jaś się nie nauczy, tego Jan nie będzie umiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wstrząsnęła złocistą grzywą i schyliwszy głowę na bok, kolejno spojrzała na wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba iść do klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona wsunęła mu rękę pod ramię ruchem łagodnym i zdecydowanym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasadę tę stosuje się zarówno w stosunku do dziecka, jak i do jego rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem jeszcze dzieckiem, ale wiedziałem, co to znaczy, wiedziałem doskonale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby było inaczej, nie okazałby pan tej chwalebnej przezorności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieczenie gorącej oliwy, ale nie bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej teraz nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla dwu ludzi znalazło się jeszcze miejsce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stasiek chodził na demonstracje, ale wracał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, muszę iść do swojej roboty — powiedział Filip i poszedł do swojego śledzia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Latem dojeżdżam rowerem, a zimą autobusem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech ten brzmiał w uszach Filipa niby krwawa obelga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie luty podkuj buty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzielni są wasi chłopcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz stała się rzecz najsmutniejsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał i jesienne słońce świeciło na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż tam u ciebie słychać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc by tańczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los smutny odniósł walne zwycięstwo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi mały ołtarzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, posiada pan duży talent konwersacyjny, zwłaszcza w kierunku parowania pytań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie sądziłem że tak mi się to spodoba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szczotka jest na dole w izbie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciał jechać koleją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym momencie zauważył, jak Ewa rusza wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Naturalnie, jak w ogóle przy każdym choćby tylko częściowym rozszczepieniu jaźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś już można powiedzieć, że poniekąd są uzasadnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gluten występuje w takich zbożach jak pszenica, żyto czy jęczmień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kozioł obrócił się do niej tyłem i podniósł kitę ogona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bona lubi wychodzić, wtedy przychodzi tutaj Marta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On załatwił na mnie szybko swoje sprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem nie do rozwiązania…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały świat się zbroi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedna z nich jest znacznie krótsza od drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz niedługo trwały chwile ukojenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gruncie rzeczy zadowolona jestem z tego, co zaszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ta wyspa jest za blisko lądu, gdzie mieszkają Murzyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wasza królewska mość raczy się pakować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na całe życie dość mam tej jednej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to podczas obiadu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi ani połowy takiej przy jemności, jak z P.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spór, teoretyczny w swej istocie, zaostrzał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza saniami biegło trzydziestu ludzi otulonych w filtra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżyc wchodził pomału, jak aktor na scenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzenie Ani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz, pokażę ci teraz króliki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytaj moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien sobie dobrze poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tańczyli, wprawdzie na palcach, po cichutku, lecz do upadłego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciemność i morze gotują się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśli przechodziły koło niego, jak duchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę panu zrobić niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem poczuł, że coś się niedostrzegalnie zmieniło w nim albo poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę sobie wyobrazić, że jest chory, który umrze, jeśli się czegoś nie postanowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę opowiedzieć, jak do tego doszło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daremne byłoby usiłowanie spać w noc taką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I myślały, że ich dary tak prędko dojechały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gondola odbijała od brzegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak była mała, to nie dostrzegałam tych cech, które teraz widzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłeś wyjść na przerwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hugon również na takie rzeczy nie zważał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nią poszła druga, trzecia, czwarta…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadziliśmy je za uzdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali powinni się usunąć… — ciągnął dalej Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic dziwnego; jest pan wychowankiem miasta…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pracuję nad alternatywnym planem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma co się namyślać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed chwilą żona, teraz mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazwisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znowu najechałeś na mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stole zastał dwa listy i dużą kopertę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Abraham zrodził Izaaka, Izaak zrodził Jakuba, to jest po dobne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma dymu bez ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny demon: świadome chcenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przeląkł się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwolę na to! — wrzasnął Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wódka była bez smaku, jak woda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sypianie pod dachem wybieliło cię jak migdał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pełnia winy może być tylko tam, gdzie istnieje premedytacja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to pieśń Schuberta „Gratchen an Spinnrade”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i powiedział, że nie chce widzieć tego kretyna, dyrektora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, zbliża się czas, by pomyśleć o powrocie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się teraz Filip cieszył, że puścił się tymi śladami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno zapomniana teoria Jamesa-Langego a miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów wiatr i deszcz prosto w twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłuchałem pełen sprzecznych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożałujecie tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do włączenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę, nie mogę! — zawołała dziwożona, tuląc do piersi obydwie dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo chciałem wziąć łódkę i spróbować, czy będę mógł wiosłować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to sprzyjać jedynie pracy mechanicznej, nie wymagającej twórczego wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór dębowy połapał się od razu w swym nowym na ziemi stanowisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I już nie zobaczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dawali listom nagłówków, aby nie używać pewnych słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za facet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, który z danych mi do wyboru domów wariatów bardziej mi odpowiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką odpowiedź przywieźli gońcy? — zapytałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze znajdywałem przyjemność w czytaniu dwuznacznych wierszy i jednoznacznych kpin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wszyscy razem nadzwyczajnie rozpuszczone łobuzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jędrek siedział na koźle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem dojmujący chłód wilgoci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nim ją zabiorą, to Ewa ma za swoje jaki miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż takiego zaszło między wami? — zapytałem, nie zdradzając swych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej, w czym mogę Ci pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam na ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temperamenty: spala się w każdym zdaniu, napisanym czy wypowiedzianym, i odradza się w następnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I powiedział: — Mała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani musiała długo stać, tylko nie wiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olsztyn to nie tylko jeziora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil myślał: — Można od tego zdechnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem w klasie, gdzie są okna, wiedziałem, że tylko do dzwonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na palcach podeszliśmy do sztalugi, by śledzić przebieg pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwo wyszedł, wyskoczyłem z łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zresztą można czasem śnić i na jawie — wtrącił niby od niechcenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewątpliwie jest to zbiorowy kompleks mniejszej war tości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już się tak nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oczu jej najbardziej mi właśnie potrzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żreć, ile wlezie, i spać, choćby co chwila — nic to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to duży, tłusty samiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden plus, że można z nim iść do kawiarni i pogadać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy pełnoletni obywatel, który mieszka w Polsce, musi mieć dowód osobisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Adam wypróbował wszystkie pozy, opisane od czasów starokreteńskich do Magnusa Hirschfelda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic nie mówi u cholery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż z tym dzieckiem, adoptowanym przez Rosjan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie ona lepiej od nas, co czynić na oczach ludzkich, a co na stronie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyciągnął się wygodnie na składanym łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz teraz włożyła strój zgoła odmienny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Morze i niebo w oddali spajały się z sobą bez śladu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozstawione daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale muszę się uczesać i zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś idzie dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się z obrzydzeniem i skierowałem spojrzenie w dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież sama uparłaś się, że z nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed świtem mróz brał coraz większy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ja nienawidzę tego bydlęcia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała: — Jesteś komediant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jaru! — zawtórował jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na świecie trwało jeszcze ciemne rano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie była nieświadoma tego, na co się naraża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego nie powiesiłeś, tego nie masz — mówi woźny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakaś wyższa moc splata coraz zwarciej dotychczas rozbieżne tory naszych losów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyny poszły zobaczyć zachód słońca, a ja zostałem z małym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Autor: Jan Baptysta Porta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak to podobno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, ale on mieszka tam z jedną panienką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie jest wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20671755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza w dziedzinie matematyki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien był się cieszyć, jak gdyby się po raz drugi urodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ślicznie to powiedziałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej po południu zapaliłem bez wielkiej przyjemności pierwszego papierosa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko pomyślę, że masz przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedaleko od Cytadeli do Muranowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem przestaje się nawet za tym tęsknić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem gasi świecę, otwiera okno i wygląda na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hm… szczególne, szczególne…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech Jej Wysokość wraca do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głębokie cienie kontrastują z jasnymi punktami kadrów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnięta odruchem ręka chciała wstrzymać wroga, lecz spętana opadła z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym momencie doszedł mnie złowrogi trzask przepalonych belek pułapu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Królu, proszę o turniej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On doznał wrażenia, że stopy jego puszczają korzonki, że jest wrośnięty w ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przez trzy dni nie mieliśmy żadnych informacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W taką pogodę nawet pies z kulawą nogą nie chciałby wyjść na dwór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawa te rozciągają się na wszystkie dzieci, bez żadnego wyjątku i bez żadnej różnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspominała o nich ani razu w ciągu krótkiej, upalnej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stała, odziana w szlafroczek, z rękami założonymi na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym jest skąpy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanalizowałem drogą alchemiczną wodę przepojoną fluidami tej kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno przyjmować do pracy zarobkowej przed osiągnięciem odpowiedniego, minimalnego wieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W imieniu Boga i proroka jego Mahometa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, co mówię! — odparł jednoręki i spojrzał na dziwożonę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę się jeszcze ogolić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy znaleźli się w rytualnym miejscu, w którym żegnali się zawsze, podali sobie ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz o północy nie daruję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to nie wygląda na paradoks?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest ktoś inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę leżeć cicho i nie wykonywać żadnych gwałtownych ruchów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz oto szli znikąd — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sumie to nie wiem na ile to naprawdę Google.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dajcie mi Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okej, jaka jest pogoda dzisiaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sięgało w samo dzieciństwo, ta niemożność urwania w środku, zatrzymania się, skończenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jest pan moim rodakiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty jesteś Narcyzem, ja też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zobaczyłem jakąś lalkę, która miała być poprzednio moją mamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety stosunki meksykańskie utrudniają bardzo dostanie prawdziwego preparatu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadł na ławce, zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie w tym widzę najpiękniejszy motyw tej historii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jeśli woli, niech się w torbie prześpi i sił dla nas nabierze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chwała Bogu — zawołał jeden z panów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Psia krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dick usiadł na piętach jak Marta, gdy czyściła kominek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąż istotnie ani się nie ruszył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od dwóch dni był nowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Usiądźmy tam na ławce w alei cyprysów — zaproponowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie kucharek sześć, tam nie ma co jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to trudne do przetworzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszał jej mruczenie bulgocące cicho w gardle, jak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre węże łączyły się po kilka naraz w fantastyczne potwory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczu góry, wrzeźbiony w skałę, stał pensjonat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbował wszystkiego, co mu strzeliło do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyczytać to było można z jej oczu, z wyrazu twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc ja ci udowodnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pędziły po niej auta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Michasiu, powiedz mi, co się ze mną dzieje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spoglądał w milczeniu i niepewnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ojca i od Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do odpowiedniego wyżywienia i mieszkania, rozrywek i opieki lekarskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda była chyba jeszcze gorsza niż w dniu poprzednim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza w warunkach tak dla jej zdrowia nieodpowiednich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa podeszła, jak lunatyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala waliła go batem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla dwojga przyjaciół wyglądał z bohaterska po zbójecku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głosie jej drgnęły dźwięki przyobiecanego płaczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pójdziesz się bawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna zostaje tu na całe życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie chcę o tym słuchać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieję tylko dzięki innym, których rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło, robi się ciemno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak mówię, że przyjdę, to przyjdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób zmieniano swoje „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wywołuj wilka z lasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myszki nie robią takiego hałasu! — zauważyła Żaneta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz cudowny głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem o parę kroków przed nim i zacząłem go usypiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil podszedł do Adama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu pochody egipskie i asyryjskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem, pisałem, robiłem różne rzeczy, ale ciężaru z serca zrzucić nie mogłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytuliłem ją do siebie i tak szliśmy czas jakiś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z powodu grożącej burzy dyrektor mój wcześniej skończył naukę i zamknął szkołę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.291,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.03,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.109,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.291,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.299,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.612,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.612,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.429,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.885,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ściągnęła brwi mocno, lecz nie odpowiedziała ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.605,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyłącz się do nas!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.721,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj był huragan, a my jesteś porwani i to jest jaskinia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Francuz spadł teraz na niego, jak jastrząb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie więc byłem blisko celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.571,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw na nie popatrzał, potem je rozchylił\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.042,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo napadnięty okręt nie myślał zwijać żagli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.355,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt, nawet tata nie wiedział, jak szła na operację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.139,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałem zawsze, iż dotąd jeszcze nie przebaczyła mi dawnego traktowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.269,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujął głowę swą w obie ręce i zaczął śmiać się niepowstrzymanym śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.101,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to naszą jedyną nadzieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszli więc nocą, wybrali wszystkie pieniądze i przenieśli je do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.807,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to równie niepojęte jak okropne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.023,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokój był teraz uporządkowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno było dojrzeć cośkolwiek przed sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.713,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet Matylda zaczęła okazywać zmęczenie i bieg jej był wyraźnie ociężały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.669,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezwarunkowo musiał znajdować się przy ścianie, prowadzącej do magazynu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.963,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu poza barykadą znajdowała się nasza straż przednia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szarpał się na wszystkie strony, wymachując rękoma, byle się tylko uwolnić z uścisków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.918,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zaraz temu zaradzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.434,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież przejścia tych ostatnich dni powinny były czegoś cię nauczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.971,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarze zwrócone mieli ku nam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.113,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebawem profesorowa wróciła, niosąc pięć filiżanek dymiącej czekolady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.945,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po raz pierwszy w życiu drgnąłem ze strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.161,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Treść jest zupełnie jasna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niańka zawróciła i pchała pośpiesznie wózek pod górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.094,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Emil wszedł, ona czytała Lothara „Romanza F-dur”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę zastanawiałem się nad oporem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.329,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też pośród wszystkich ludzi najbardziej nienawidzę pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwantowa dystrybucja klucza umożliwia bezpieczną komunikację przy użyciu mechaniki kwantowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.154,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzyszu, służyłem Francji dobrze, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.239,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sali tej różne pokoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.706,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciało nasze jest raczej źródłem zmęczenia i cierpień, przypomina nam bezustannie nasze niedołęstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.885,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam więc dom i chleb i pracować nań nie potrzebujemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym ogromnie zasmucony, gdyby pan opuścił ten zamek, nie poznawszy się ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.971,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie się musiał w to wdać ktoś z Londynu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.851,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko kiedy w życiu, panowie, znajdowałem się w tak brzydkiem położeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.873,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie koniec na tem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.396,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wyraziłem się jasno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.034,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek leżący ukazał się tak wyraźnie, jak kobieta, której się uchwycił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.415,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważył mię także i krzyknął czym nie ranny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.486,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę się opędzić od myśli o moim przyjacielu — wyjaśniła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.217,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kieszeni miałem przecież środek, który sprowadzał natychmiastową śmierć bez bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem mu je podać, gdy nagle przed bramą usłyszałem szczęk broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.191,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokół niego i poza nim panował najzupełniejszy spokój i cisza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.963,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maryś słuchała z kąta, nie odpowiadając nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.545,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proch znajduje się w pokoju przeoryszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.605,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę cię, odbierz telefon!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.251,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina Trwogi leżała spowita w grubych ciemnościach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.911,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam już wszystko w ręku, cała sprawa jasna, jak dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.527,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadchodzą, Stefanie, nadchodzą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.105,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tysiąc dziewięcset siedemdziesiątym roku wieżowiec zaprojektował łódzki architekt Aleksander Zwierko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.467,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nim umrę, opowiem panu, co wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś struchlał na chwilę i zapomniał o strzelbie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.251,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porwał już wszystkie nasze stworzenia, teraz i nas chce wyniszczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.158,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kapitana objęło przyjemne ciepło idące z kominka, i oczy zaczęły mu się przymykać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.945,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszał, jak odkręca kurki, zakręca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.206,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja siostra zrobi tak, jak jej polecę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.303,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powróciwszy, rozpalił na nowo ogień, i zaczął się grzać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natomiast pracownik zapobiegliwy jest bardzo ostrożny w zapełnianiu swego strychu mózgowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.374,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż nasuwa się pytanie, o której godzinie wyszliśmy z zatrutych sfer?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.721,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Własność jej zatem musiała być oznaczona herbami królewskimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.251,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaskini nie jest wcale ciemno, gdyż rozświeca ją księżyc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj zaś znalazłem obfite pole do rozmaitych, ciekawych dociekań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.415,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepsze talerze tylko ze Słupska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.415,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Alem się wybrał za późno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.691,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podobam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.545,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina czternasta czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.538,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz będzie miał nauczkę, aby z pięściami nie włazić każdemu w paradę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22605894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.31,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radca skoczył ku niemu, jak tygrys.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20945998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co mu z tego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20945999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Tarkowski byłby skoczył w ogień i wodę za małą Nel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, już jedzie! — zawołał jakiś chłopiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego spiłowano lufy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koczowisko dekadencji i pigułki zmieniające pociąg seksualny na pęd ku karierze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znaki są nieco szersze od podeszwy każdego buta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To bardzo ciekawe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan ma słuszność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ależ moje gazety muszą wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piętro niżej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I z nocy pozostało niewiele! — burknąłem pod nosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili uwagę jego zwrócił jakiś białawy przedmiot, zaplątany w pnącze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina czwarta piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz, zaraz, chwileczkę, moment, halo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powrócił pan zatem mniej więcej w czasie jego małżeństwa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym nikt jej nie odwiedza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki był początek opowieści o przybyszu z Indii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możliwość rozbudowy modułu wraz ze zwiększeniem zapotrzebowania na nowe funkcjonalności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A można między cycki, lub też na podnietę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało się, jakby wieczór wstydził się jego milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba koniecznie zdjąć tego latawca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem… ale może byłoby najlepiej… nie, to na pewno głupie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniosłem mu buty, kiedy szedł po policję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile mi się zdaje, mówił pan o płaskiej stopie...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarła zapałkę i przytknęła ją do pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakoś trza radzić, ale jak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janusz, Grażyna, Brajanek i Dżesika schowali się za parawanem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj szklankę przysunął do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie miała się położyć już spać, kiedy uwagę jej zwróciło gwałtowne dzwonienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest. Podaliście portret pamięciowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach! Zosiu, ach Zosieńko, jak mi niewygodnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę bardzo przyjemny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy to prawda, cioteczko — spytał — że ty umarłaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem im, że wyjechał do Europy, ale nie wiem, gdzie go szukać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drażnią mnie politycy i urzędnicy wtrącający się w moje życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czy ty myślisz, że nie ma nic między Ewą i Jankiem? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmuszony bowiem będę przeciwstawić się pewnym powszechnie uznanym pojęciom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina osiemnasta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopiec syknął niecierpliwie i podskoczył na krześle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opadała po woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróciła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brud rozmazany wodą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor zmienił się pod wpływem wzburzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam go dosyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś dudniło z daleka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, babciu, taki śliczny, z czerwonym oczkiem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tydzień ma siedem dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili zegar wybił godzinę drugą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie złoży obciążającego świadectwa przeciw mordercy swojej siostry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale światło dzienne wygnało trwogę z ich serc, gdyż powitały Stasia krótkiem, przyjaznem rżeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ziemia do kwiatów!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Synek, a może powtórzymy angielski?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu powiedziała do niego: — Jeszcze by tego brakowało, abyśmy się rozumieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krótkie modlitwy odmówić i pogrzebać w ogrodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było tam wyrażenia „okrutnie“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął rozmyślać nad tym, co powie, gdy Ania przyjdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było przecież najważniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby błyskawica zapaliła się w nim i zgasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwunasta trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz poszedł do kuchni i dał dziewczynie odpowiednie polecenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witek: zamknij oczy, kiedy zamykał drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podkomorzy zaś wałem kutasa nazywa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy słyszysz, że mój tatuś nie żyje?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"o ho, pierścionek, jasne. Ja tam wolę jak ona ma gołe pięści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do dziury ją zapędzasz? zaraz ją poczujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce stało jeszcze dość wysoko, ale przetoczyło się już na stronę jeziora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gacie przemoczone na krześle położył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasiedli potem do śniadania, gorący rosół z pantarki smakował im wybornie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rybna zupa, którą jadłem dziś rano, miała taki wyśmienity smak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina szesnasta piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdobny w dwa wielkie jaja, jak dwa jabłka w sadzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy pani jest jeszcze? — spytałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląd jej uderzył mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, ponieważ most był podniesiony, ucieczka inną drogą była niemożliwością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem w domu czekała ich podczas obiadu dobra nowina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rewolwer nosił zawsze w kieszeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W grubej garści trzymając jakiś przedmiot wielki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaraz dostaniesz w skórę, niegrzeczna dziewczyno!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo sama biegnę na pomoc, albo…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes stanął nad brzegiem bagna i spojrzał na nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zastałam Anię płaczącą gorzko, albowiem przypaliła śmietankę przeznaczoną do twojej zupy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wnosiłam z pewnych jego słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrodzony mu akcent dźwięczał, jak kij na szynach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20946451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeregi bardzo starych drzew w dziwnych figurach otaczały go dokoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęście jest kobietą i dzielnego huzara nie opuszcza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mnie ich krzyk obchodził?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi, że aplikacja nie działa, czy coś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musze panu pogratulować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjaśniło się dla mnie wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jak tu uciec?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napisane w nim było, iż ponieważ zarżnąłem lisa, przeto muszę go też zjeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to niby moja wina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale muszę się uporać z tą sprawą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprężyłem się jak struna i salutowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiłem zwrot, ale nagle strzeliła mi nowa myśl do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak że dziś jest sobota, to utrudnia poważnie sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzielny czyn na wojnie lub w jakimś sporcie zawsze rozpali ich serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle, jak to u dzielnych ludzi bywa, przyszła mi wspaniała myśl do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ku mojemu zdumieniu spostrzegłem, iż moje przybycie było oczekiwane z przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę odczuwałem potrzebę podjechania do niego i uściskania go, panowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co komu nowa technologia, jak stara już dobrze działa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klnę się na Boga, iż byłem bardzo zadowolony, wydostawszy się z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przestań tak ostro skręcać, aż żygać mi się chce!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rusz no cztery litery i chodź mi pomóc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sorki, nie korzystam z Facebooka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem nagle poskoczył naprzód, uścisnął mi rękę i serdecznie mi pogratulował powodzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spostrzegł niebezpieczeństwo i zrzucił z siebie mundur, ja zrzuciłem dołman.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według mojego obliczenia musiałem mieć więzienie o jakie dwadzieścia mil angielskich poza sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę panów, nie zrozumcie mnie fałszywie, co do mego zamiaru na tym punkcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyślałem o zamiłowaniu pomocnika do fotografowania i o ciągłem znikaniu jego w piwnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci, pomóżcie mi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodziak z ciebie, wiesz o tym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz przyszedłem do przekonania, że przypadek wyrządził mi wielką przysługę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym musiał podzielić pański los, gdybym się był chociaż chwilę zawahał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A bo ja wiem, mogę sobie połazić po Krakowie przez chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnij się, bo wyglądasz normalnie jak hobbit!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy na Twitterze o tym gadają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział mi tylko, że jeśli poczekam, to dowiedziałbym się czegoś przez pocztę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże ja zmykałem i z jakim pośpiechem, przez moczary wśród deszczu i burzy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakto, dla Boga, to brzmi głucho, powiedział podnosząc oczy z zadziwieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzcie, co miałem; as treflowy i walet treflowy, dama karowa i walet karowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie otuliłem się znowu w płaszcz i zacząłem się zastanawiać, co dalej począć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wodę w kiblu się spuszcza...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miał już matki, nie miał ojca i nie miał nic z dawnego dostatku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyliczyłem sobie według postępowania wołów naprzód, iż na godzinę robiliśmy dwie mile.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinął ręką, obrócił się na pięcie i zniknął w jednej chwili w tłumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przystąpił do okna i podniesionym głosem krzyknął, że wolne miejsce jest zajęte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było nigdy moim zwyczajem przytwierdzać takim pochwałom, choć byłoby głupiem zaprzeczać im.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to za rozkosz siedzieć na koniu i mieć broń w ręku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale oczy każdego, nawet cudzoziemca, musiał uderzać ten wzrok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oczach świata nie byłem przecież niewinnym, można mnie było uważać za mordercę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy, co tam na Netflixie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tem wszystkiem pozyskanie wolnego miejsca nie wydawało się tak bardzo łatwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jechali truchtem, pomyślałem sobie więc, iż gonią jakiegoś bardzo powolnego lisa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Test mikrofonu, raz dwa, raz dwa...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazało się, iż moje przypuszczenie, że tu mieszkają wyżsi oficerowie, jest słuszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boże, co za zgroza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc zapowiadała się bardzo burzliwa, co właśnie było mi bardzo na rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobra, może jest ze mnie skarżypyta, ale zasady to zasady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ah, panowie, jakże mam opisać, co się wtedy ze mną działo?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dłuto i worki masz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzała się, skoro tak chce on, głowa domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym właśnie zapamiętać sobie porządek domów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród paproci zachowywałem się bardzo spokojnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radia słucham, a co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłem w nim obie połowy lisa, tak, jak go pozostawiłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź naucz się higieny, no i sio mi z kuchni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie nie byłem tak głupi, abym sam z niej korzystał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usunąłem czem prędzej sztabę żelazną, i poleciłem memu towarzyszowi, aby przełaził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W środku polanki stoi olbrzymie, stare drzewo, zwane „bukiem opata“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jest w tem, jeżeli mi pan daruje, że tak powiem, trochę komizmu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdowałem się w winnicy, tyki sterczały wprawdzie jeszcze, ale liści już nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej chwili dwanaście pałaszów wyleciało z pochew i sprezentowało przede mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co miałem począć w mych butach z cholewami, z ostrogami i pałaszem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary nie zadawał sobie takich pytań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał na mnie, jak nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy indziej wyjaśniono, że dostał się \\\"prawdopodobnie\\\" do niemieckiej czy austriackiej niewoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź mi przypomnij, żebym gaz wyłączyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien być guzik Play, taki mały trójkącik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telewizor znowu mi szwankuje...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś, po latach czterdziestu, rumienię się jeszcze, gdy sobie to przypomnę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę, jakie pan przedsięwziąłeś kroki, kiedyś znalazł tę kartę na drzwiach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez minutę, albo dłużej, sterczała ręka z podłogi, poruszając palcami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnej nocy około godziny dwunastej stałem przed głównym namiotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już mi więcej nie było potrzeba, wolność miałem zapewnioną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wybaczy mi pan, pewny jestem tego, że przedsięwezmę niezawodne środki ostrożności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rysowanie łusek rybich w ten sposób przez delikatne ukłucie jest właściwe Chinom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja i mój sztab jemy śniadanie w mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22731975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzał, jak się w tej robocie odznaczali marynarze oraz rozmaite osoby urzędowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna jaskółka wiosny nie czyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy mogę dowiedzieć się bliższych szczegółów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz za interes?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz przede wszystkim postawię ci jeden zasadniczy warunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na świecie trwało jeszcze ciemne rano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie — powiedział prędko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale łazienki trzeba też umieć używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki zręczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Namyślam się, czy miejsce wybuchu jest na Ukrainie czy na Pomorzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna tylko pozostała osoba: sześćdziesiąta i piąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy pojawiła się sprawa szkoły przy torach kolejowych, o której mało osób wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się załamuje, pryska, rozwiewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Bartek coraz gwałtowniej, coraz silniej tęsknił za głosem ludzkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko w jaki sposób? O mało nie wpadli pod taksówkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest o rok spóźniona, bo chorowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo powie, jak nad jarem i nad strumieniem! — gardłował kulawiec, podrygując niecałą nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chciałabyś usłyszeć resztę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One są jak Bernard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez namysłu schowałem kukłę do wewnętrznej kieszeni żakietu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem wtedy do siebie: „Każda chwila jest godna Szekspira”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O coś się złościł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjęliśmy z niego siodło i ciężary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przyłożyłem ucho do piersi nędzarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmaite mogłyby być sposoby rodzenia się, umierania i odradzania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego się śmiejesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świadomość opinii publicznej oczywiście pomaga reporterowi i sprawie, za którą walczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wystąpienie Rosjan oburzyło władze chińskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co zjesz, mała? — zapytał, a ona płakała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że dzieje ludzkości coraz to bardziej przypominają historię ucznia czarnoksięskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam mechanizm ten dokładnie na sobie samym — oczywiście w miniaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyna owych ucieczek pozostała nigdy nie wyjaśnioną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Goethe jest zdania, że chrześcijańskie słowo „Bóg” jest tylko inną odmianą słowa „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosił ją na lody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil mówi, że to wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego wybrałem ten zawód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem w towarzystwie czterech równie zachwyconych tą sytuacją osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pójdźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mu się wyśmiewać z ciebie, a sam pójdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już! — zawołał w stronę obydwu towarzyszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że umiem niektóre rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy punkt tamy znajdował się nie wyżej siedemnastu stóp nad poziomem gruntu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzę, któremu utkwiła strzała w grzbiecie; tarza się, biega, ryczy, pluje, krew zalewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze się poskarży, że sam wziąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mieli zresztą ani kąta, ani stanowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to sprytnie obmyślane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnie powiedziane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była od niego o dwa lata starsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno drugiemu pomaga znakomicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo przytrzaśniesz komuś palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dałam się pomacać trochę fotografowi z przeciwka i zdjęcia już są.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś trochę wyczerpana nerwowo i stąd może przewrażliwiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zaraz na drugi dzień było nowe przedstawienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, gdy już wszystko wiadomo… — zaczął uroczyście Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki gatunek filmu lubisz najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I on niewiele więcej wie o tobie, aniżeli ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszony, z opuszczoną nisko głową wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale chcę się cofnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miarę zbliżania się nocy wzrastała zaciekłość huraganu i rosła siła deszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, ale co tu gadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni napadają, a drudzy kryją się i uciekają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie nie czuje się na siłach do otwartej walki ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiał sprzątnąć i dostał od nas niezłe wymyślanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się, że prawdziwe rozumienie wiedzy jest wtedy, gdy umie się ją przekazywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie były nogi żywej dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pasterki nie wiedziały, kto gra i skąd pieśń dolatuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz ostrożność nie zawadzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądząc, że nie zaśnie, wolał oczekiwać w łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie zdecydowali się na ślub cywilny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale może wojna, która nadchodzi, przyniesie tu jakieś zmiany na lepsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajomy jest wiatr, woń zgniłych ryb, wodorostów i muszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na morzu zaskoczyła ich taka sobie burza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana; wziąłem rzecz zbyt osobiście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rewolucja huczała rozpętana i zwycięska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ty, kobieta do głębi, nie jesteś sentymentalna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ono uprawnione do tego, by zdrowo rosło i rozwijało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wybuchu śmiechu zaci nało się coś w niej: zegar, który przestał nagle chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jeszcze jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wara ode mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne to, śmieszne, lecz prawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wieloma uprawiałem seks\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jednak nawet za królestwo niebieskie nie oddałbym jednej chwili pełnej świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochał Indian, detektywów, włamywaczy i psy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ulicy ulewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z dalszych wizji przypominam sobie niewyraźnie jakiś jakby rajski ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest śmierć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W treści Fauna była północ dusz greckich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radek sam wyglądał jak obrazek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak naprawdę to chciałbym pojechać do Hagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zbliżyło się znowu do pytona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Dziś są moje urodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź szczotkę i mydło i wyszoruj ręce jak należy — mówi mama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On przyszedł po ten nóż!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bierzcie czym prędzej siekiery i pędźcie na lewo na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość bym jej zrobił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan to wszystko może wiedzieć? — zapytał szczerze zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odpowiadała czas dłuższy, utkwiwszy przerażone oczy w drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za człowiek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą sprawia wrażenie gentlemana w całym tego słowa znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad wszystkimi wirował śnieg i ostre, podobne do cięcia, wrażenie: nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem wtedy do siebie: „Każda chwila jest godna Szekspira”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz dochodzenia spełzły na niczym: sprawcy mordu nie wykryto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poszła do nieba — odpowiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie mam koleżanek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja chcę czuć pewien opór, pewną walkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam ochotę na zupę szczawiową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałem do dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dlaczego właściwie pan mi to wszystko przypomina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec przemilczał, coraz zapalczywiej oddając się namysłom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak rozwiązujemy kwestię zakwaterowania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20808010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz przyniósł fotografie porn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wywołuj wilka z lasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw udał się do probostwa nie bez pewnej trwogi w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była ciemna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę by pomieszkać między Eskimosami, między Murzynami albo Indianami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedna, dwie — powtarza Ala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krużganki między domami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdejmuje mokrą sukienkę i kładzie do miednicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan zaczął ją z lekka ruszać i całować, ale był to widać początkujący pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała rozbitą głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na człeka tak ledwo ledwo zakrawasz, jakbyś go naprędce i od biedy jeno zmałpował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była szczytem kobiecości, jej szczytem i zarazem otchła nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom publiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co musisz? — Tam chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z teczkami pod pachą, rozmawiali o przeczytanych książ kach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten był znacznie wyższy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ten głos?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ślepo! — upewnił Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się czubi, ten się lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaszedł tedy do starego sklepikarza na Starym mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szkło się łatwo tłucze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Był to jeden z najtęższych w okolicy „szczurów wodnych”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co też tym kobietom do głowy przychodzi — rzekł mąż pani Emilii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest serdecznym przyjacielem nas obojga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na horyzoncie widniał budynek, którego wcześniej tam nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez namysłu schowałem kukłę do wewnętrznej kieszeni żakietu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest gładki, okrągły, ubiera się pięknie i nie ma żadnych trosk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamieniona w leśne echo, w wojska śpiew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno w żadnym razie zmuszać ani upoważniać do wykonywania jakiegokolwiek zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimno go owionęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczerwienił się, bo uważał, że powiedział to nie potrzebnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest znowu nieznane miasto i obcy zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pozwól, mamo, to jest mój kolega.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, za naszych czasów, chowaliśmy się wśród skał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba poszli grać w piłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądał jak zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakiś uduszony rybak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznają świat w dużej części poprzez mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rycz, bo cię zatłukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna burza stoi na zachodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gotów zażądać od chłopców słowa honoru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale twój tato musi mieć kupę pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre pnie złociły się wypukle, niby oszklone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rano mycie, wieczorem mycie, przed jedzeniem mycie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tępym, automatycznym krokiem wywlokłem się z mieszkania…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złota nam brakło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiaków dwóch znałem, a Żegnajty ani jednego — przypomniał sobie nagle jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto urywki tego, co jej odpowiadano z pląsających łodzi rybackich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam wywołałem swój los, utajoną swą myśl wypisałem bezwiednie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze reakcje są oczywiste i nie wynikają tylko z tego, że boimy się zmian.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem to włączyć, ale było już włączone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuściliśmy nasz cienisty przytułek i niebawem znaleźliśmy się na łuku mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich szczególniej czasach przyjaciele wzajem na siebie uskarżać się nie mogli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie, nie powiesz mi o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pański bank raczej nie stoi frontem do klienta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie zobaczyłem jak na dłoni cały klasztor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja pozostanę tutaj; będę oczekiwał twego powrotu tu w tym fotelu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzięła polnego świerszcza i na piersiach skryła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej możecie wrócić do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A widzę wyraźnie, jakby wczoraj dopiero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za rozpaczliwa posucha bieli!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20811892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem grupki schodzą się w mieszkaniach, ale bardzo wcześnie wszystko idzie spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak sądzicie, czy mu życzę dobrze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę wyrazić swój zdecydowany sprzeciw wobec takich stwierdzeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejski Fundusz Rolny na rzecz Rozwoju Obszarów Wiejskich to szansa dla regionów zapóźnionych historycznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę obecną Parlament wycofał się z tej decyzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że było to naszym obowiązkiem, ale niewątpliwie minuta ciszy nie wystarczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że to zupełnie niedopuszczalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprytne są te kobietki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio całą naszą uwagę pochłaniały powszechne powstania w Afryce Północnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze dyrektywy w sprawie jakości powietrza przewidują w tym kontekście znaczące restrykcje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukałem Katza, nie mogłem go dopatrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojazdy elektryczne kompensują tę nieregularność dzięki własnym szczególnym cechom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę tu między innymi o sprawie euroobligacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno nam dokonywać jakichkolwiek osądów politycznych czy ekonomicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"kobieta nie może decydować o własnym ciele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski z podziwem przypatrywał się zarumienionej twarzy i błyszczącym oczom panny Izabeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tych chwilach nietrudno o pewną refleksję historyczną i symboliczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Libia okazuje pełną gotowość do pogłębienia stosunków z Unią Europejską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo doceniamy pozytywną reakcję na nasz komunikat, która znalazła odzwierciedlenie w przedstawionym dzisiaj sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy niektóre elektrownie naprawdę zostaną zamknięte lub zmodernizowane?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było rady...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.964,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że jednolity rynek, wolny przepływ towarów i usług to pełna konkurencyjność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie majętność też waćpan utraciłeś, ale sławę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę podziękować wszystkim mówcom za cenny wkład w dyskusję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tura pytań z udziałem przewodniczącego Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Działania skierowane przeciwko importerom dopuszczającym się oszustw należy podjąć szybko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nikt nie może temu zaprzeczyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blanka wszystko widziała i słyszała; ojciec zastał ją omdlałą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę pozwolić, że na koniec wypowiem się w kilku słowach w kwestii przejrzystości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam więc nadzieję, że w tym roku nastąpi postęp, najpóźniej po sprawozdaniu o postępach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę jest to najbardziej znaczący element\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przedmiotowej dyrektywie znacznie zwiększyliśmy prawa konsumentów i użytkowników przestrzeni elektronicznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowe motto Unii Europejskiej mogłoby brzmieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za przedstawienie tych ważnych punktów widzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie działamy w charakterze koordynatorów i to, co robimy, nie jest wiążące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rolnicy borykają się z problemami finansowymi i brakiem dochodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed progiem wisiał krużganek, otoczony żelazną balustradą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest nadzieja, że sprawy wkrótce ruszą z miejsca w tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szuman ścisnął go za rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy społeczeństwo szwajcarskie jest przeciwne wznoszeniu minaretów, to decyzja ta jest akceptowana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To naprawdę szokujące, że coś takiego dzieje się dosłownie na naszych oczach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.044,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieciństwo oraz młodość spędziłem w sąsiedztwie komunistycznej dyktatury, Związku Radzieckiego, gdzie panował wszechobecny strach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może pani zadać tylko jedno pytanie dodatkowe i to wszystko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu chcę wspomnieć o osobach doświadczonych tą sytuacją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy sprawić, aby to była dla nas wspólna sprawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy już, że prawdopodobnie najbardziej ucierpią na tym najbardziej bezbronne grupy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj szli ścieżką w głąb krzów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widział kto podobne zgorszenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwzględniono również inne produkty przemysłowe, takie jak etanol\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałam za przyjęciem omawianego sprawozdania z trzech głównych powodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym większe znaczenie ma podjęcie leczenia na jak najwcześniejszym etapie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy również wysłać jasny sygnał do azjatyckich gospodarek wschodzących\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Interesy konsumentów ponadto często nie są uwzględniane w wystarczający sposób przez samych usługodawców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest gdzieś w tym ironia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłoby to stanowić punkt wyjścia dla kłopotów w całych gałęziach gospodarki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę i nie będę się angażować w krajowe spory polityczne między partiami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś takiego nie mogłoby się wydarzyć w żadnym innym parlamencie na świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"aby zagwarantować poszanowanie podstawowych praw Irańczyków, jak i innych narodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjęcie go w jutrzejszym głosowaniu umożliwi naszym obu instytucjom uruchomić wspólny rejestr w czerwcu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy znaczne doświadczenie w tak skomplikowanych procesach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jesteśmy organem dyplomatycznym - jesteśmy politycznym organem parlamentarnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłoby to w pełnie zgodne z moim sprawozdaniem na temat udzielania pozwoleń na pestycydy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten sektor niewątpliwie potrzebuje reform\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie potrzebujemy również większej wrażliwości społecznej i współpracy ze strony polityków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg ci da żonę po sercu kochaną i zacną, jako sam jesteś zacny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żałuję bardzo, że wybory w Rosji nie odbyły się bez ingerencji władz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego powodu obszary górskie otrzymują konkretne wsparcie w ramach wspólnej polityki rolnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przewodniczącemu Barroso brak wizji i odwagi politycznej, a to nie jest dobre dla Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co ten drugi jemu odpowiada?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przypadku małych i średnich przedsiębiorstw stosowanie standardów siódmego programu ramowego nie jest racjonalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam osobiście złożyłem odnośną poprawkę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bierzemy na siebie dotkliwy ciężar, który obciąży nas w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy jednak, że naprawa gospodarcza nie może być bezbolesna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja, w której rolnicy płacą podatek, a finansiści nie, jest nie do przyjęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W lesie, którego brzegiem postępował, chwiała się wilgoć wiosenna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie były konkluzje z ostatniego posiedzenia Rady Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, że będzie pani ściśle monitorować system, jak to pani obiecała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestionuję nazywanie wyniku kupażowania różnych win \\\"winem różowym\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodatkowo mamy teraz również wysoką przedstawiciel, która będzie pełnić dwie funkcje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcielibyśmy zatem przyjęcia sprawozdania przed końcem roku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy jej zmienić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyne spotkanie na jakie im zezwolono zostało przerwane, ponieważ matka mówiła po bułgarsku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No dobrze, można jeszcze dorzucić do tego trochę węgierskiego gulaszu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebne są dwie rzeczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce oznajmiono zbliżenie się królewskiej pary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że po raz ostatni państwa członkowskie muszą się zbierać w tym celu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja w Jemenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oczywiście nie jest stanowisko Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39618880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie znalazła się w nim żadna wyraźna wzmianka o podziale obciążeń?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko mnie powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak nie, to on jeden.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Setki komunikatorów obejmują cały nasz świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechby choć zaczekali do jutra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Która godzina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi ani połowy takiej przy jemności, jak z P.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Och! — zawołaliśmy jednogłośnie i umilkliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjęła list z jego zaciśniętej pięści i natychmiast posłała po lekarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozglądam się ciekawie po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trawie wrzało od owadów, jak w wonnym ukropie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno, że takie rzeczy tylko na osobności się gada — stwierdził z nagłym przekonaniem jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za przypuszczenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle z jego włosów zaczęły się sypać iskry aż na podłogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno mi powiedzieć: — Powieście się, ja chcę żyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Seniora — odparłem, tonąc oczyma w jej oczach — jestem panią oczarowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było już zupełnie ciemno, gdy zbliżaliśmy się do budynków stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie wasza dziewka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że od dziecka uczyłem się angielskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cynamonki w Kofikadzie to prawdziwy hit, zapraszam na nie wszystkich znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby się wstydziły, że powiedzą nie tak, jak trzeba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaskini było widno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi i weszła matka Emila, mówiąc: — Jak ładnie grasz dzisiaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość i łaska spływały z pałacu chana, zamienionego w świątynię szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się z nimi stanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kara boska, kara boska…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu, przed nim!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ma mowy o zjadaniu we właściwym znaczeniu! — odparł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona milczała uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś idzie dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarna kobieta zniknęła bez śladu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubiła chodzić do kina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już się tak nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie chcę nic słyszeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama nie wiem, co piszę, taka jestem ostatnio roztrzęsiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zewnątrz trzeba być w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lśniła się od zgrzebnej, zrudziałej na słońcu czystości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż takiego zaszło między wami? — zapytałem, nie zdradzając swych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliża się do szafy, gdzie wiszą suknie i płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo całej baczności nie spostrzegłem powrotu nieznajomego myśliwca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo pies też lubi towarzystwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Marcinku, trzeba na lekcji uważać — upomina pani łagodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polała się krew z ust moich, przeto odchodzę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamówiłam w sklepie internetowym chleb, ryż, kaszę, dżem wiśniowy i sok jabłkowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwiejnym krokiem zagłębiłem się pomiędzy zaułki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Wiesz, to jest ten inteligentny kawaler, który miał ochotę, opowiadałam ci, pocałować mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaletą bycia twoim sąsiadem jest to, że mam do dyspozycji dwie kuchnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Adam wypróbował wszystkie pozy, opisane od czasów starokreteńskich do Magnusa Hirschfelda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znać od dawna już nikt nie używał tej ścieżki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matematyka to mój ulubiony przedmiot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapadanie się miękkie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pauzie bawiono się w zabawę, podczas której kawalerowie wybierali sobie damy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc by tańczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lipcowe słońce przypiekało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak mimo woli, pod wpływem zapewne dawnych upodobań, liznął dolną wargę językiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wszelki wypadek wziąłem z sobą broń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Allach mnie ukarał, żem go wyzwał i kusił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Kasia przestawała piszczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o to…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby się miało grzęznąć coraz głębiej, choćby się wiedziało, że koniec będzie zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil tego już nie słyszał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, już nie powiem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zwariowałaś”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie zwyczajne „nie”, ani patetyczne, ani ciche, i tym „nie” przywiązała go do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przebudziłem się… — powtórzył z namysłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko zdaje mi się, nosił pan do niedawna jeszcze inny mundur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Foka na plaży — pejzaż morski zupełnie realistyczny, słoneczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczuwał niezrozumiały niepokój i wiedział, że jutro albo pojutrze zrozumie go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazwisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawał na przystankach tramwajowych i pomagał wychodzić panom z siwymi brodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochał Indian, detektywów, włamywaczy i psy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic dziwnego; jest pan wychowankiem miasta…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut potem znów pozostali sami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi też opadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął rozwiązywać mały woreczek ze skóry renifera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko z trudem uratowaliśmy córkę, której groziło poważne niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona popatrzyła na jego twarz i przestraszyła się: była tak zmieniona, upiorna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż „strach na wróble” jeszcze nie wstał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni ponoć nie uważali tej kobiety za dobrą opiekunkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się teraz Filip cieszył, że puścił się tymi śladami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzmożone uczucia metafizycznego nienasycenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tata! — woła dziewczynka, biegnie do Maciusia; rączki wyciągnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za pozwoleniem — wstrzymałem go gestem — nie miałem zamiaru częstować cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to było dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj, czy zdołasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często przerywam wizje, aby zapisywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zaczął śmiać się wreszcie z naszego zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zastanawiał się przez chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i tam prześladowały mnie cierpienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On przełknął ślinę i zaczął się bać trochę, bać pytania, które zada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden ciężarek, Watsonie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrzebuję go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biedak nie miał odwagi podzielić się ze szwagierkami wesołą nowiną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kup marchewkę, pieczarki i mięso.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to takiego? — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim się zabawimy, zaczekaj do rana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyłka w tym wypadku jest niemożliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, kochanku! — odparła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pruli spokojną gładź, a Marek wciąż postękiwał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina jedenasta dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala weszła do pokoju z bukietem kwiatów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słuch ma nieszczególny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, rozumiem doskonale…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz mieć w domu grata, kup sobie Seata albo Fiata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wnosiłam z pewnych jego słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadeusz po mistrzowsku rozpoczął minetę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21156868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzięki pewnym wypadkom wzrósł wielokrotnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Posłuchaj, dobry panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podziękowała uradowana i usłuchała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie będą myśleć o ratowaniu dwojga białych dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, nie! — żachnęła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Po coście mnie wyciągnęli? — jęczał przybysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy mógłbym zbadać puls?”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Homoseksualizm, transseksualizm, biseksualizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziewiętnasta czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złoczyńcy kościół okradli? — pytał opat zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oczywiście, wierzę na słowo! — zapewniłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, tak, to bardzo niebezpieczny gość, nie ulega wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stój! — krzyknął chłopak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdrętwiałe rączki puściły jabłuszko, jabłuszko stoczyło się do wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziewiąta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jako lekarz zwracam uwagę, że takie rozdrażnienie szkodzi panu bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta trzecia zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważał to raczej za życzenie, niż za propozycję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostosowanie listy funkcjonalności do roli operatora systemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ma — dokończyła ona i zaczęła się śmiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rok przestępny ma długość trzysta sześćdziesiąt sześć dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam daleko, daleko, pod samym murem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostawił na miejscu cuchnące zwierzę i nie zanosił go w podarunku Nel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie się znały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo obaj są głupimi stworzeniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był głęboko zainteresowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Swojego czasu dużo podróżował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkim czworgu zmroziło krew w żyłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwukrotnie chcesz złamać słowo, które dałeś umierającej żonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest oburzające, po prostu skandal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczby: dziesięć, jedenaście, dwanaście, trzynaście, czternaście, piętnaście, szesnaście, siedemnaście, osiemnaście, dziewiętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba koniecznie zdjąć tego latawca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pięć razy też się spuścił, aż się w końcu znużył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Członek honorowy Polskiego Towarzystwa Akustycznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziewiętnasta piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina czwarta czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta druga trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukradkiem przyjrzał się otoczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy sądzisz, że zgodziłaby się opuszczać cię w tym stanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie należy tak mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21157806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22498759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz się wszystko skończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szanuje się wolność i pluralizm mediów\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzecia grupa ofiar milczy, ponieważ o ofiarach tych nigdy się nie wspomina\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie, obecny klimat polityczny w większości państw członkowskich nam nie pomoże\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wpływ na tę sytuację ma także kryzys gospodarczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy skończyć z tą sprzecznością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem minimum, jakie możemy i powinniśmy zrobić to zwiększenie wydajności funduszu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przekonany, że będzie to w przyszłym roku jeden z najważniejszych tematów dla Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dopuśćmy do wyniszczenia szlachetnego, bohaterskiego ludu, który jest przyjazny Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brakuje nam otwartej debaty i wspólnej zmiany zamiarów, na którą pozwala demokracja amerykańska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mięsa, dla skór, dla rozmaitych potrzeb gospodarczych zabijamy miliardy zwierząt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akty zastraszania miejscowej ludności i zagranicznych obserwatorów nie mogą mieć miejsca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Decyzja o zakończeniu transferów do Włoch stwarza realny problem w dostępie do procedur azylowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy to się uda\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę sformułować wnioski i przedstawić je Radzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27246696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywistość mówi sama za siebie, lecz nie zawsze chcemy jej słuchać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zróbmy tak: niech każdy doprowadzi do porządku fabrykę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa zbladła, widział ją, siedziała w pierwszej ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko należy chronić przed wszelkiego rodzaju zaniedbaniem, okrucieństwem i wyzyskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobieństwo często jest nieintuicyjne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, ale nie z jednej strony tylko, jak na tych jabłonkach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre pnie złociły się wypukle, niby oszklone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadę w sprawie urzędowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam dla was trzy rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był tak mały, że poręcz fotela sięgała dużo wyżej niż jego głowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby wiedzieć jaka kultura tutaj była, jaka gwara była.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że twoje życie tutaj będzie tak samo szczęśliwe jak moje życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko upływały Maciusiowi godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnęła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toteż nie zrozumiałem ani słówka z tego, co mi mówiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatoczyłem się tylko jak pijany i poszedłem dalej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przewidziane są zniżki dla studentów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaczęliśmy zstępować ze schodów, śpiewając Bohaterów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas kolacji, w sali jadalnej, było cicho, bo jedzono kurczęta; to wymagało skupienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W wolnym czasie uwielbiam chodzić z przyjaciółmi na spacery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil stał za dużą palmą i oglądał księcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja także — nalegał dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy mówiła: „nie bawię się” albo: „nie potrzebuję”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odeszli ci wszyscy, którzy zaledwie tydzień temu słuchali moich wierszy i dziwnych przygód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawezwany lekarz oświadczył się za natychmiastową operacją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś, daleko, na moczarach klekotał bocian…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież one chyba nie robią tego tylko dla forsy? Jesteś bał wan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracowałem nadgodziny, ze względu na goniące mnie terminy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie z gumowymi wężami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem gasi świecę, otwiera okno i wygląda na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już idę! — odpowiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz mieć sen zdrowy, panie naczelniku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie był dobry znak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie, że jej koleżanki opowiadały mu o jej pretensjach aktorskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę wielki gmach z czerwonej cegły, zwrócony do mnie kantem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprzedziłem go, by rozświetlać drogę latarką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki przybiegł pośpiesznie, jakby się bał karygodnego w danym razie opóźnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tarcza herbowa wrosła w węża i rozlała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja go słyszałem bardzo dawno, tak dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest chodzenie po ostrzu brzytwy, fantastycznie wąska via media.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil obmacał wszystkie krzesła, na których wierzchu siedziała skóra, a w środku mieszkały sprężyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały film swoją scenerią idealnie wpisuje się w nurt ekspresjonistyczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła chwila ponownego wyczekiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrapał się na okno i zajrzał do środka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mieli zresztą ani kąta, ani stanowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno kłamał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprzytomny jak bela….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny motyw dla malarza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu się pożywię — szepnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Braciszek się zatrzymał, patrzy, co z tego będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zycie przechodzi nam ponad głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil miał trzech duchowych ojców i bibliotekę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak nakazuje prawo puszczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda to na kieszonkowe złodziejstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich tam, zdaje się, mieszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czytałem to przez całą noc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Moje sumienie nic mi nie wyrzuca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli przodem do wnętrza koła, na złość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nią nie jest — wie prawie zawsze, co by ją mogło uczynić szczęśliwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniej więcej o jedenastej wieczorem Emil przynosił ciąg dalszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przyszła już moja paczka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest gryzoniem, ale gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ot, co wymyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj zgodnym krokiem ruszyli w jednaką zawsze drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko na proch starte, na biały, sypki, chrzęszczący pod stopą miał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mógłbyś zagrać? Zagrał go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był mile zdziwiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niby nic się nie zmieniło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Bartek coraz gwałtowniej, coraz silniej tęsknił za głosem ludzkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo ja to źle zrobiłem, albo ona jest nieco dziwna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki zręczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to proroctwo się sprawdziło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie odbiegajmy od tematu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniały w proporcjach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za skromność!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej towarzysze za jej przykładem zerwali po tataraku i gryząc wilgotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znają, nieszczęśni, tamtego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczuł niby zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to nie wygląda na paradoks?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak mówię, że przyjdę, to przyjdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marek często chodził na piesze wędrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Połów był przedziwny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju Janka kasztan wsadzał głowę przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy nie będziemy przyjaciółmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, od jutra, od jutra — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był pierwszy dzień przedwiośnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy jeszcze nie panowała taka wesołość w dziecinnym pokoju Dużej Rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu zmiana ról wytrąciła cię z równowagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zaraz na drugi dzień było nowe przedstawienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20771877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak — przypominam sobie… złotą czarę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ja się zaraz sprowadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ruchem ręki wskazuję ruiny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My pragniemy pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma co się namyślać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W celu zdobycia dalszych wskazówek zachęcam do kontaktu telefonicznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umiał zatrzymywać moczu i zanim zdołano cośkolwiek zrobić, miał mokre majtki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po jałmużnę idę! — odparł zuchwale kulawiec i z powikłanym wysiłkiem powstał z ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, który z danych mi do wyboru domów wariatów bardziej mi odpowiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc byłem aresztowany!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścili nas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowym głosem przemówiła natura; odezwało się serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jaru! — zawtórował jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Metoda moja jest czysto psychologiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudziła się dopiero na wołanie matki i wielki głośny śmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieodpowiedni ubiór był powodem przemarznięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że jestem cholerykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotowałem Ci niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płynęli od latarni do latarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W chwilkę po wypowiedzeniu tych słów odłożył motykę i powstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nim stała dama, bardzo gniewna, bardzo zirytowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze burzliwe czasy wymagają ofiarności i męstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę cię mieć wyłącznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas! — powtórzył jednoręki i poprawił torbę na plecach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co myśleć, czy zdrowa, czy się co złego nie stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś kiedyś potem tych dwoje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiłowanie do muzyki wyssałam z mlekiem matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil stał za palmą i oglądał księcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak to podobno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy lepiej, inni gorzej, ale wciąż - gramy wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba stąd odjeżdżać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to chciej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosłem się i wyciągnąłem rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, są silni awanturnicy, którzy szukają zaczepki ze słabszym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak — dorzucił sennie — zapłacę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myślę, że to będzie możliwe, gdy przestanę cię ko chać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kucharka mi się skarży, że wciąż jej coś ginie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego z przodu idzie dwóch, a z tyłu czterech?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam nową muszlę klozetową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąży do szczęścia i czasem jest szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak można sprzeciwiać się pani?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem też od lat dziecięcych, że ludzi tych zjednywać sobie trzeba podarkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dotrzymała słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzęta ryją prymitywne kretowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nie ma w głowie człowieczków, ale czy nie wszystko jedno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżała nad rzeką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodzimy w gęsty kolor turkusowy, kałamarnica o bladoniebieskich i bladozielonych światłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy zaczynają po południu, po pierwszym obfitszym jedzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma w tym nic dziwnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie porwałem! — odrzekł z namaszczeniem — Sama wyrosła na mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Listy będę pisał i przez gołębie wysyłał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przecież feministą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to koń młynarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo panienkę przepraszam i proszę przestać płakać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno uwierzyć, że ktoś tam mieszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił na wszelki wypadek czekać podczas wszystkich pauz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pisząc o moich osobistych przeżyciach nie mogę pominąć siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani wierzy w te bajeczki z „duchami”?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? — Bo muszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba zajrzę po drodze do księgarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwiejąc się, poszedł szerokim korytarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jakiś instynkt ostrzegł Bartka, że grozi mu niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoczył pod okno chałupy i nadstawił wielkich uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ramach programu rozwoju bibliotek zakwalifikowaliśmy się do tego projektu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracała do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się tak, aby to mogło na wszelki wypadek wszystko oznaczać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotowuje mi na ten dzień jakąś nową niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął się śmiać histerycznie, Janek zdziwił się, a Pola zbladła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem i mechanicznie obracałem w palcach jakiś przedmiot leżący na stole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Leżymy jeszcze na dnie morza? — Ja tak, a ty nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Filip nie miał innego wyboru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A brzuszek mu pęcznieje…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znałeś go? — spytał jednoręki upiora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Diabli was tu wezmą co do nogi, jak nas zgubicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U wszystkich coś szwankuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im za to płacą, niech się grzebią w gównie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dowierzam cudzoziemcom, zarówno żywym jak i umarłym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ja będę udawała, że ty nie płaczesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja zawsze tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę już przyszłe losy mego dzieła…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądam się co rano w lustrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20777723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego ty wszystko psujesz? Obejmujesz samo życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciał widocznie tą wargą przytrzymać w czas sypkie i rozrzutne okruszyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierś była jędrna i młoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż z tym dzieckiem, adoptowanym przez Rosjan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile chodzi o Emila — nie wstydziła się niczego więcej; ani mówić, ani czynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy czterej spoglądaliśmy ku niemu serdecznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zauważył, że dochodzi siódma, godzina spotkania z Jankiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie była nieświadoma tego, na co się naraża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20783362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy człowiek powinien korzystać ze wszystkich praw i swobód wymienionych w deklaracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo gorliwych poszukiwań nigdzie nie można go było wytropić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o oznaczeniu odpowiednich elementów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszył ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyciągnął rękę ku mej papierośnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jest miła i dość ładna kokotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wycofujące się niemieckie oddziały prawdopodobnie planowały podpalenie budynku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam tylko na rozkaz, bym mogła zabrać tacę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trudno: nie jestem tak delikatny jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam ja jechać nie mogę, widzicie, bo był taki wypadek…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże mam wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymali się za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tej reguły nie warto już opisywać, tak jest znana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jest tam co kupić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pamiętam kiedy ostatni raz widziałem policjanta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wiem wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kolega po zawodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba iść do klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wstrząsnęła złocistą grzywą i schyliwszy głowę na bok, kolejno spojrzała na wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy punkt tamy znajdował się nie wyżej siedemnastu stóp nad poziomem gruntu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pies szczeknął, Maciuś wyrwał zakrwawioną rękę i schował do kieszeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł miał wstać już trzy drzemki temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładzie się na łóżko i pyta półserio, ostrożnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest śmierć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to godzina przedwieczorna, milcząca, nieruchoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja, choć też nienawykły, całego zająca, patrząc na owe mdłości, schrupałem do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapraszam pana do tablicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmierć nastąpiła prawdopodobnie niedawno, bo trup nie zdradzał jeszcze śladów rozkładu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ilość plastiku którą produkujemy jest zatrważająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikłe światło rozjaśniło izbę: nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pracowity jak pszczoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bój się wora, dziewczyco! Już nie powrócisz do niego! — pocieszył ją jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas potopu, pogasły gwiazdy na niebie i znikły światła na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczuł strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rewolucja huczała rozpętana i zwycięska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądam w niej trochę po staroświecku, lecz że tak sobie życzyłeś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrodziła się ciekawość poznania, z kim się właściwie miało do czynienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak przy lądowaniu samolotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda wielka, że nie udało mu się odnaleźć zaginionego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Moje sumienie nic mi nie wyrzuca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla takiej frajdy nie trzeba było iść tak daleko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak chcę i muszę, to nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z lepszych thrillerów jakie widziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy nim jest klęcznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Jak gwiazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak najbliżej, jak najbliżej koło ust…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Która godzina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego się nie bawisz, Maciusiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiedzieli sobie kilka dowcipów, kilka plotek, nieco ciekawostek naukowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno widzą jak ja — pola wiecznego lodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To było nieuniknione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedź pan — powiedział, ale sanitariusz nie odjeżdżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda w Krakowie jest dzisiaj całkiem ładna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robiła w tej chwili Hela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna noga już jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzał na wskazany napis.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymał go za górny węzeł jak za czuprynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stefania czytała na głos wolno i uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili furtka już była otwarta na oścież.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadziliśmy je za uzdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bona lubi wychodzić, wtedy przychodzi tutaj Marta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapłaci pan za to karę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Istnieje przepaść pomiędzy ich życiem a tym, co wiedzą o życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie, ile dokładnie czasu potrzebuje na dotarcie swoim tempem na uczelnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20650998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robi pan same gwiazdy, pointy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo miłe sąsiedztwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego na ten punkt zwracam największą uwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś odbywa się bieg na złamanie karku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzenie Ani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie, gdzie mieszkają lisy, wydry, borsuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrasta ze mnie powoli, jak roślina, żywię go, napycham go sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem kupić cukier zwykły czy trzcinowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziedziczka pokiwała znacząco głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten warunek nie jest już teraz dla Kamy nieodzowny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie bywają nasze noce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszysz nareszcie autentycznych ludzi w tym kraju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że Nowak przepędził popołudnie na gorzkich rozmyślaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ucieknie! — pocieszał siebie samego jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie, zdaje się być dla niej wrogo usposobionym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ta mnie drapie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Najbliższa zginęła od bolszewików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy szoferzy znali ją już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to bóg wojny, zjawiający się powtórnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy robiły się niebieskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tylko możliwym jest, by letarg trwał tak długo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20856247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złapały mrówkę i wciągnęły w piasek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20856248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chcę wyśmiewać się z dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20856249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyli po sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20856250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wskutek czego inżynierowie, koledzy ojca, nazywali go dzieckiem pustyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20856251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapisz Anii wszystko, dom, pieniądze, powozy i posiadłość rolną…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były nastawione ku północnemu zachodowi, gdzie jeszcze niebo jaśniało dość pogodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadają, że odznaczyłem się w pewnej bitwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to trudne do przetworzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Andrzej uścisnął mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za skromność!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle zaczęła mówić, szybko i gorączkowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest w tej nieszczęśliwej coś niepokojącego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś powinnam mieć miesiączkę i nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo tak chciałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazywał moc niezliczoną nowych kiełków, wychylających się przez czarną glebę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy uśmiechnął się dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczesny, jesienny zmrok zalegał ulice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budynek mieścił się w niejakiej odległości od miasta nad wielkim stawem otoczonym palmami kokosowymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam jej zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz — ty sam zginiesz, a ja razem z tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej jednak niepokoiła go ewentualna zmiana konduktorów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola złapała Emila za rękę: — Coś ci muszę powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tego nie mogą powiedzieć niektóre tzw. „filary”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie o czymś głęboko się zamyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo spóźnionej godziny miasto tętniło pełnią życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apetyt rośnie w miarę jedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz boli, że kradną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stasiek chodził na demonstracje, ale wracał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Doskonale! — powiedziałem, zwracając się do kozaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mam co robić — ciągnęła dalej Mary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wybuchu śmiechu zaci nało się coś w niej: zegar, który przestał nagle chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkaliśmy w chłopskiej chałupie, był jeszcze taki słaby, że trudno mu było samemu chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas rozmowy usłyszałem w sąsiednim pokoju lekkie kroki, szelest szat kobiecych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co tam słychać u sąsiadów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokładnie wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jesteś? Przecież masz ładne włosy, zwłaszcza gdy je rozrzuca wiatr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robiła w tej chwili Hela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto naraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, młynarz przeżył bez wątpienia bardzo ciężki okres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za osobliwa choroba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przychodził zwykle o pięć minut wcześniej i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o to…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siłą się wziąć nie dam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustawodawstwo i inne środki stworzą mu wszelkie możliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kolega po zawodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję! — odkrzyknął oddalając się wybrzeżem ku miastu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś się stało mojej matce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma powodu do obaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak sobie pościelesz, tak się wyśpisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to tak ohydne, że czym prędzej zapaliłem lampę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz się przygotować na daleką drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda wielka, że nie udało mu się odnaleźć zaginionego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież mi się wargi pokurczą od niechęci! — tłumaczyła się żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie stało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się śmieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam wczoraj kilka bułek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku próbował sobie przypomnieć, jak wygląda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak skrzyżował dłonie na żołędnych wzorach zbryzganej słońcem kamizeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Manna po niemiecku, a Manna tak swobodnie, jak Emil po polsku S.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu stanął na miejscu, opuścił ramię prawe i znieruchomiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie podszedł pod okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W weekend majowy pojechałem w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żydzi zamieszkujący lub zatrudnieni w tych stronach tworzyli tak zwane getto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ta wyspa jest za blisko lądu, gdzie mieszkają Murzyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oboje mieli tę samą śmiertelną ranę, koło lewej pachy nad sercem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co dobre, szybko się kończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Markowi, jako najstarszemu, dostało się największe wymyślanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy to nie za słodkie, jak na wino?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie wyrzuty sumienia, a taka tylko natrętna myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się tak męczyć do pierwszej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tylko możliwym jest, by letarg trwał tak długo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była godzina szósta po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdarzenie, które miało miejsce rok temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20667725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? — Bo muszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20882479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Beza i tort czekoladowy. Torcik wedlowski. Mniam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20882480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie nadchodzi lekarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20882481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział dobrze, że nie zdoła mówić z żoną poufnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20882482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak się zdaje, jest czym chwycić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20882483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"warczeć i bacznie obserwować intruza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20882484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"rozwiązywać mokasyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20882485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Jakże możemy cofać się dziś, kiedy wszystko jest już gotowe?”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20882486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dognana wilczyca przysunęła się natychmiast do przywódcy i pobiegła u jego boku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20882487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz zaczynasz powoli rozumieć już sens tego wszystkiego, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20882488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie zajęczał lekko i spuścił się w... spodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20919022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu nie dla człowieka także?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20919023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant Wilson zebrał wszystkie szczegóły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20919024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uniwersytet, politechnika to szkoły wyższe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20919025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pewnym czasie Gebhr i Idrys, pogodzeni już z sobą, porozciągali na ziemi opończe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20919026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I czuję ja chłód i wiem na pewno już, że to jest twoja mama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20919027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiam się jednak, że chodzi o jakieś przestępstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20919028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była wzmianka, że zginął od wystrzału w głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20919029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, że i chłopcy nieraz dokuczą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20919030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bał się, że nad ranem, po burzy, zrobi się chłodno, jak bywało poprzednich nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20919031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz na mnie, Emilko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jeśli ona nie wsiądzie po drodze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Diabli was tu wezmą co do nogi, jak nas zgubicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W porządku, dezaktywowałem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tędy droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobieta uśmiecha się i patrzy na mnie w szczególny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten uśmiechnął się blado i zmarszczył czoło, jakby coś sobie przypominając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo na morzu szaruga…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gniję pomału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mądry Polak po szkodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona myśli: — Wieś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od kilku lat korzystanie z cmentarza było zabronione ze względu na podtopienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczam, że morderca spełniał akt w stanie na pół przytomnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się jednak, że nie wszystkie osobniki podległy tej klątwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie jestem? — usłyszałem pytanie, rzucone między marmurowe trzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za ten tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie od razu postanowiliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O wpół do pierwszej zaczynała coś wiedzieć i kładła się spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie ulęknę się ciebie, o smoku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytrzymaj mu nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tego właśnie chciałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spójrz w oczy moje lśniące!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąb, lecz odmieniony nie do poznania! — usprawiedliwiał się prawdomówny Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to zresztą przystań na drwiny i wypoczynek na opak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz rozpoczęte zdanie zamarło mi na ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przegrał parę pięknych koni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dolewaj oliwy do ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teorie i plany rozpadają się i czezną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał przy mikroskopie, na biurku leżał stos otwartych książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego pan nie kupił na stacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę, że jak zawsze przygotowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Darowanemu koniowi nie zagląda się w zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był sam; nikt nie przerywał sennego dumania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkańcy przyzwyczaili się już do ścisku, złego dojazdu do cmentarza oraz korków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy ani przedtem, ani potem nie widziałem jej tak rozrzewnionej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu powiedziałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą sprawia wrażenie gentlemana w całym tego słowa znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku pracować mi zbrzydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś patetyczny, mój piękny małżonku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże drogi, jak to czas płynie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała: — Jesteś komediant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc zachodzi tu pewne rozszczepienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Władca świata” znikł nagle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawy jej zaczynają przybierać formy bardziej określone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłuchałem pełen sprzecznych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była szczytem kobiecości, jej szczytem i zarazem otchła nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mam go jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzi, że wraca za trzy miesiące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co znaczą argumenty wobec „nie sprawiło mi przyjemności”? Poczuł, że jest całkiem bezradny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy tu tylu prowokatorów i szpiegów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrzekłem się jej dobrowolnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczuł, że ktoś wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zewnątrz trzeba być w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z punktu widzenia nawyków codziennych wyglądał niedorzecznie, jak przesadnie wielki zbieg okoliczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli ktoś jest zawsze wesoły, a raz smutny, najbardziej żal wtedy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pumeks jest tu niczym — wygładza powierzchownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daremny trud, drzwi są szczelnie zasłonięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję! — odkrzyknął oddalając się wybrzeżem ku miastu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu tych czterech dni odeszła przedostatnia fala moich czytelników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieśni poety były na ustach wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj, czy zdołasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewien mądry człowiek o chrystianizmie: „Stal można złamać, guma jest niezwal- czona”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O co chodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się tego nie robi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałaś tego gościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ma mowy o zjadaniu we właściwym znaczeniu! — odparł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże to nagłe zamyślenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dźwięk tego imienia, szept tego imienia, jego zapach…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil tego już nie słyszał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczemu on robi błędy, jak nas uczy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę ci coś pokazać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu pożegnali się, umówiła się z nim na jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schował rewolwer do kieszeni i chwycił pałkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyciągnął się wygodnie na składanym łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazwisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mu biło mocno, coraz mocniej, jeszcze mocniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmawialiśmy z nim dosyć długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzęta ryją prymitywne kretowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką odpowiedź przywieźli gońcy? — zapytałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umówiłem się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bilet wręczę panu dopiero później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliła się łaskawie pocałować, patrząc na latarnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic panienka nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo pies też lubi towarzystwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu oczywiście nie wystarczyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprzód nie czułem, ale teraz, kiedy siedzę spokojnie i mam zmartwienie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co myśleć, czy zdrowa, czy się co złego nie stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już chcę, mimo tego, że uważam to wszystko za rozpustę umysłową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płynęli od latarni do latarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczynania tego reżysera są obserwowane od dłuższego czasu przez krytyków filmowych oraz opinię publiczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora źrenice miałem rozszerzone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali towarzysze stanęli mu po bokach gwoli przecięcia możliwej ucieczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczeli obaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rodzina Halszki z pietyzmem usiłowała podtrzymać jego pierwotny charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłącz światło w dużym pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące turbin nerwowych, gdy ktoś już jest chory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on to robi z umysłu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzena zatrzymała się kilka metrów wcześniej i patrzyła w dal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I szybko zbiegłem po schodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo być nadal chłopcem na posyłki — i czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich kucharka Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, panie — oznajmił major uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto rano wstaje, temu Pan Bóg daje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, żeś mądry nad swe lata: tedy posłuchaj moich słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam, pamiętam, posądzałem o złośliwość Pana Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewien astrolog… z miasta… którego nazwa wyszła mi z pamięci…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idę do domu, możesz mnie odprowadzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był barszcz zdrowy, zawiesisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawym tylko, co wiadomo — spytał kulawiec i splunął w stronę jednorękiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwie usiadł, ledwo pani weszła, nowe nieszczęście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I śpiewać się nie wstydzi, i pierwsza powiedziała, że będzie tańczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parę osób otoczyło przestraszoną kobietę, pytając o powód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Abraham zrodził Izaaka, Izaak zrodził Jakuba, to jest po dobne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani śladu bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochanie, wróciłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trawie wrzało od owadów, jak w wonnym ukropie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede mną płot jakiejś prywatnej posesji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy ocknął się z zamyślenia i spojrzał nań przytomnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie pod ciśnieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I dlatego spóźniłeś się wtedy? Janek patrzył niebieskimi, niewinnymi oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha! — rzekła Marta z radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś ciekawie patrzy przez okno samochodu na swoją stolicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ogrodzie mieli jacuzzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba znów zacząć; ale na złość jeszcze lepszą buduję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to i dobrze, że tam nie pojechaliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak była mała, to nie dostrzegałam tych cech, które teraz widzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W komplecie z tym multimedialnym zestawem komputerowym dostanie Pani głośniczki i kamerę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem: — Przepraszam cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkimi ulicami, zaułkami i placami sunęły barwne tłumy ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem o tym i nie do was mówię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadzwoń na sto dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość — łzy — i modlitwę młodą, dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może wytrzyma wicher trującego jadu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wszelka „twórczość” nie pochodzi z tych źródeł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chuda twarz chorego skurczyła się w bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąży do szczęścia i czasem jest szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mało w tym było pozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdzie do haremu jako małżonka monarchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjący i umarły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno drugiemu pomaga znakomicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale słuchali o sobie plotek z praw dziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyźni krążyli koło prostytutek, jak tokujące gołębie; śmieszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zegarka nie nakręcisz, to stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro pójdziemy w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kocham już inną; mam narzeczoną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzieś w pobliżu przejechał w tej chwili baron…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I gimnazjum jest coraz bliżej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Czy widzisz te krowy tam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozglądam się ciekawie po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na pewno myślał o tym — odrzekł Hal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"a raczej nic nie czuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ćwicz dalej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczęliśmy się cofać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy byś został, gdybym… gdybym zrobiła się lepsza?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wódka była bez smaku, jak woda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo pod tym względem kokaina jest jeszcze większą złudą niż alkohol.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie, które nawet w inkubatorze nie miałyby szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tylko tyle możemy zrobić w zamian za nową broń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wie Maciuś, dokąd idzie, co niesie w koszyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasyciwszy oczy widokiem własnej krasy, zaczęła z powrotem ubierać się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cynamonki w Kofikadzie to prawdziwy hit, zapraszam na nie wszystkich znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam nową muszlę klozetową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest takie proste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marek często chodził na piesze wędrówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurczowo zacisnął dłoń na kolbie rewolweru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A czego ty chcesz? — Ja nie wiem, mnie się nudzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, do jutra!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siedzę na dnie i czekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliża się do szafy, gdzie wiszą suknie i płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej nie zlezę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwolę na to! — wrzasnął Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ptaszek odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaskini było widno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest nie do zniesienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te rozmowy, urwane w środku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo panienkę przepraszam i proszę przestać płakać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąb? — zaśmiała się nagle dziwożona i napełniła wnętrze wora klaśnięciem drobnych dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ja zrozumiem, to będę musiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na morzu zaskoczyła ich taka sobie burza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynalazł dla mnie obalony przez burzę olbrzymi cedr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyżarła — wyznał z westchnieniem jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno się nie czułem równie znakomicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest plan miasta, panie rotmistrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy znajdziesz się pan na tym placu, spostrzeżesz w rogu katedrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy więc obaj przed tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to narożny budynek, skąd mogliśmy mieć widok we wszystkich kierunkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klęska była ogólną i przekraczała zakres ludzkiej wiedzy i sił ludzkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktór zakręcił się na pięcie i z miną obrażonej godności wyszedł z apteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za wszystkie skarby świata nie zgodziłbym się powtórnie przeżyć takich kilku godzin!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiodła do tego tylko jedna droga i tę wybrałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Tulonie socjaliści wszczęli rozruchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to nie dowód jeśli zniknął artykuł i cała teczka Surretta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysłano mnie, abym się dowiedział, co się z panem stało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz mi w oczy, zobacz, że nie kłamię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam zaczyna się ulica Toledańska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat w letargu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oparłem się o mur i zacząłem się zastanawiać, co mi dalej czynić należy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Deski musiały zaskrzypieć, gdyż usłyszałem lekki okrzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za każdym jego zastosowaniem umierałaś, właściwie mówiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszak toby musiało wyjść zaraz na jaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce moje przez ciebie zostało złamane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągnie się długim pasem wzdłuż wybrzeża i krawędzi szeroko omywają zielone, słone, fale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś jest w tym człowieku odpychającego, coś ze wstrętnego płazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie panuje chaos“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Belinda“ już dawno ciekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc pan tu już wisi od dwóch dni?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten oto nasz egipski przyjaciel z pewnością pochodził z rasy szlachetnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie, pan daremnie celuje do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie stało się nic podobnego; jakiegoś więźnia wprowadzono spokojnie do przyległej celi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22457350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez drogę zamieniliśmy zaledwie kilka nieznaczących uwag o piękności krajobrazu i mieszkańcach okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam przyszedł mu z pomocą pewien młody oficer bawarski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odgłos ucichł na chwile, poczem odezwał się ponownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pobladł i mówił z takiem przekonaniem, że musiała mu wierzyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiem prawem znajdujecie się tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotujcie się do drogi, bo ruszymy wieczornym dyliżansem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bwana Kubwa, wody! Staś patrzał na niego szklanym wzrokiem i milczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po twarzach obu mężczyzn ściekał pot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona sobie siedziała spokojnie… jakby nic!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minęło od tego czasu lat wiele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firanki czerwone, które powinny były w niem się odbijać, znikły zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmierć mego brata nie rozkrwawiła jej zanadto serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiał to być fachowy i sumienny pracownik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz jego czerwona połyskiwała nad serwetą białą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła się z godnością i zmierzyła mię dziwnem spojrzeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22459095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w tej chwili niejako wcieleniem psiego przerażenia: drżał cały i żałośnie skowyczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hałas wzmagał się ciągle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy w okolicy ani jednej życzliwej duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym odpocząć trochę, zanim ruszę dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat zdawał się zbyt pięknym, aby być zeń tak bezlitośnie i bezwzględnie wygnanym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwólcie mi, że opowiadać będę tak, jak się stawało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popchnął drzwi i otwarł je.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiana ta może być dodatnia, może być ujemna, może nie mieć żadnego znaczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatrzymałem się i ukryłem w cieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mistrz spostrzegł, że zaczyna tracić szanse do zwycięstwa i wpadł we wściekłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem na drzwi i spostrzegłem, że klucz tkwił z wewnątrz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Że popełniał on zbrodnię jedyną w swoim rodzaju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poddadzą się, póki jeden choćby potrafi ruszyć palcem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie doktór dopiero powrócił, bo jeszcze stał powóz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przewidywaliśmy wcale nowych, zdumiewających wypadków, jakie miały nastąpić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była więc godzina druga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pojmuję, jak można spać w takich chwilach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zechcesz mię pan przedstawić pani i tej młodej damie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to, co panu już ustnie opowiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż, kiedy ma wspanialej rozwinięte bicepsy, niż fałdy i zwoje mózgowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stoliku syczała paląca się maszynka naftowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuchały z niej kłęby pary, jak z okna pralni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grymas ten uderzał na twarzach tych wszystkich, którzy umarli od trucizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziennikarz spojrzał nań ze zdziwieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, że pańskie godzenie się czy nie godzenie się, nie ma najmniejszego znaczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całe miasto musi płonąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwałem się i spojrzałem dokoła siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku jednak panowały pomiędzy nami stosunki oziębłe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem zegar uderzył dwa razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykry swąd spalonych kości i włosów rozchodził się w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żądał, aby mi nie udzielać przytułku, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To bardzo piękny okaz, nie chciałbym go utracić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok okropny, przerażający!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze swoją tłustą, złą twarzą przypominał wielkiego pająka, snującego zatrutą siatkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W chwilę potem rozległ się straszliwy huk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22462581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaiste, że takiemu człowiekowi nie należało powierzać przyszłości młodej niewinnej dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawałoby się, że po to, by wtrącać się przed samymi wyborami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani przewodnicząca, pani urzędująca przewodnicząca Rady, panie i panowie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli dodamy kolejny program, w całym tym obszarze nie uda się już zaprowadzić ładu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogólnie popieram wezwanie do większej przejrzystości oraz zaangażowania Parlamentu Europejskiego i parlamentów narodowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani przewodnicząca, szanowni posłowie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"społeczeństwo hinduskie trzeba było zniszczyć żeby wywołać jutrzenkę globalnej rewolucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Junta zapowiedziała oczywiście nowe wybory\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedstawiony kompromis upraszcza jednak w pewnym stopniu ten przesadnie zbiurokratyzowany system\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja także chciałabym podziękować posłance sprawozdawczyni i podkreślić wagę tego dokumentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kraju takim jak Zimbabwe w Afryce problem dotyczy także zarządzania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, muszę wprowadzić gorzki akcent\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak, Panie i Panowie, za te wątpliwości odpowiada właśnie kryzys\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma to również znaczenie dla Europy - pomyślmy na przykład o Białorusi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak zasadniczo w pełni się z Panią zgadzam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że taki połączony wniosek rozpatrujemy po raz ostatni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałam zdecydowanie za przyjęciem tego tekstu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z uwagi na nieobecność wielu posłów musieliśmy zerwać naszą umowę z Radą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspólna polityka energetyczna stanowi dziś jedno z najpoważniejszych wyzwań Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogłaby rozważyć przyjęcie innych sposobów podejścia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Regularne ćwiczenia fizyczne nie oznaczają, że trzeba ćwiczyć w każdej wolnej minucie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pewnością jednak warto podjąć tę próbę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta interwencja sprzed dwóch tygodni była bezwzględnie konieczna, ponieważ Unia Europejska wykazywała niezdecydowaną postawę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest Pan częścią Europy i może Pan zrobić więcej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że Parlament poprze te wnioski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zaradzi temu zakładanie ideologicznych klapek na oczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz możemy być pewni, że łatwo dostępne tanie pieniądze nie prowadzą do stabilnego rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem Panu podziękować za te informacje, ale moje pytanie dotyczy nieco innej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, musimy zagwarantować obywatelom maksymalne poziomy bezpieczeństwa i ochrony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwaga została tutaj skierowana na dostosowanie odpowiednich dyrektyw - i jest to zrozumiałe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieszy mnie podpisanie tego porozumienia i jego pomyślna realizacja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz tę dyskusję otworzył pan szeroko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27419973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dorzucacie elastyczność, podczas gdy jest to tylko euromowa i oznacza \\\"brak zabezpieczenia\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu uważam, że realizacja tego projektu wymaga wsparcia Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odgrywa on zatem doniosłą rolę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy wysłać mocny sygnał poparcia siłom opowiadającym się za reformami i postępem w Macedonii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zachęcać, pobudzać, chronić i nagradzać twórczość i innowacyjność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zaangażować Stany Zjednoczone i Indie, to będzie już połowa sukcesu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego musimy tę poprawkę odrzucić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dysponujemy jednak na szczeblu europejskim odpowiednią liczbą instrumentów dla jego osiągnięcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieszanie ludzi w Iranie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak wzywam do dbałości o skontrolowanie także obecnie wdrażanego prawodawstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezpieczeństwa na Morzu zapewnia również wsparcie techniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieco konsekwencji dobrze by zrobiło Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sprawozdaniu podkreślono, że zawarcie umowy o wolnym handlu jest jednym z priorytetów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto przypomnieć o tragicznej sytuacji populacji śledzia na zachodnim Bałtyku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oficjalnych statystykach dotyczących przestępczości występuje nieproporcjonalnie dużo imigrantów spoza krajów zachodnich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś zaszło nieporozumienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracając do sprawozdania, stoimy przed paradoksem dotyczącym europejskiej przestrzeni powietrznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również ta kwestia została szczegółowo opisana w rezolucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szczególności małe i średnie przedsiębiorstwa są zagrożone trudnościami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna się także deportować ludzi z Austrii, Belgii, Węgier i Francji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje końcowe przesłanie kieruję wprost do banków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O jednym już tu wspomniano\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech mi będzie zatem wolno życzyć pani wszelkich sukcesów w pracy i bon courage\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym wprowadzenia skutecznego, ogólnoeuropejskiego mechanizmu, który umożliwi uproszczenie systemu płatności bezpośrednich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego wynika, że program polityczny praktycznie nigdy nie powinien obciążać polityki handlowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rosjanie to dumny naród z wielkimi tradycjami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na spotkaniu Rady z ministrami spraw zagranicznych i obrony dokonano dużych postępów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosowaniem przez państwo, któremu przysługuje dane prawo, własnego prawa rządzi wyraźna logika\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Książęta mazowieccy Janusz i Ziemowit wiedli chorągwie dwudziestą pierwszą, drugą i trzecią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"MasterCard i Visa, pod kątem zasad konkurencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówimy o dzieciach, najbardziej drogocennym zasobie, który powinniśmy chronić na Haiti\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, że tak, ponieważ jestem przekonany, iż publiczna i polityczna debata powinny być pouczające\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kandydat może objąć urząd, podobnie jak wiceprzewodniczący, dopiero po uzyskaniu akceptacji Parlamentu Europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rosnące koszty sprzętu, który spełnia wymogi bezpieczeństwa, powodują zwiększenie kwoty niezbędnych inwestycji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to również wcale nie musi prowadzić do deficytu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały system wydaje się jednak wysoce skomplikowany i zwiększy ilość papierkowej roboty organów celnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wykazały to liczne badania, jest to znaczna przeszkoda we wprowadzaniu rynku wewnętrznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że ten eksperyment wszystkim przypadnie do gustu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apeluję o jak najszybsze podjęcie konkretnych kroków w celu zaprzestania tych praktyk\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze poruszano tę kwestię na każdym spośród licznych szczytów, w których uczestniczyłam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę jednak powiedzieć, że przedmiotowa kwestia powinna była zostać poruszona w kontekście ogólniejszych ram\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oburzone są także przedstawicielstwa Organizacji Narodów Zjednoczonych obecne na miejscu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lotnictwo musi pokryć swoje koszty ochrony środowiska i dlatego wniosek ten jest dobry\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzięki traktatowi lizbońskiemu w przyszłości będziemy silniejsi i będziemy w stanie lepiej działać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że to jest drugi element\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób możemy dać producentom możliwość dowiedzenia się bardziej szczegółowo, co kupują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osłabił swobodę polityczną, praworządność, niezawisłość sądów, wolność mediów i organizacji pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przypadku Europejskiej Agencji Leków stwierdzono problemy z zarządzaniem procedurami udzielania zamówień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadmierna eksploatacja gleby wymagająca spalania węgla powoduje znaczne ciśnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że nie jest to pozbawione znaczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Władza musi być odpowiedzialna przed społeczeństwem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie na świecie przepływają strumienie uchodźców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie podejście zapewni prywatnym podmiotom zdrowe środowisko gospodarcze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak mamy problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego moje przesłanie jest następujące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im mniejszy jest produkt krajowy brutto regionu, tym większą pomoc musimy mu zapewnić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak wiemy, że mniejszość romska jest największą i najbiedniejszą międzynarodową mniejszością etniczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umowy tego typu są często zdecydowanie mniej korzystne dla krajów rozwijających się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy rynki finansowe rzeczywiście potrzebują większej liczby regulacji prawnych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak różnice między systemami prawnymi państw członkowskich stwarzają bariery dla stanowienia europejskiego prawodawstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27420627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można to osiągnąć także poprzez zapewnienie rolnikom lepszego dostępu do usług Internetu szerokopasmowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A potem psa i krowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może podać wody?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę tak powiedzieć, bo to nie jest prawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyjął watę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na usta wybiegł uśmiech zadowolenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednym słowem gówno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od zawsze jeździłem na nartach, ale może w tym roku spróbuję na snowboardzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwi się otworzyły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ogrodzie mieli jacuzzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po skończeniu nauki nie mogłem wytrzymać w domu, a jednocześnie nieznośny był mi gość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz znajdziemy pani telefon, proszę się nie martwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blada jak płótno obsunęła się bez pamięci w moje ramiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja boję nawet ruszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana; wziąłem rzecz zbyt osobiście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kukułka przez sen kukała w głębinie leśnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszym elementem kształtującym człowieka jest genetyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już nie mogę niczego zmyślać na jawie — rzekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za dużo to niezdrowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zależało jej na tym, aby była czysto ubrana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kraju, gdzie nie było Ewy, duch unosił się nad wodami i niepokojem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy znacie tekst pieśni Schuberta „Der Todt und das Madchen”? Jest dziwnie dwuznaczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz w górze, raz w dole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzisiaj mamy być tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz przejdziemy do ustaleń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było nieoczekiwane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedzialność ta spada przede wszystkim na rodziców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciebie już nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil — bo wstydził się za Janka; Janek — bo wiedział, co myśli Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą kto wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On powiada, że cię sprzątnie ze świata nożem lub trucizną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co to panu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, młodzi wieśniacy, nie umieliśmy jeszcze drwić sobie z wszystkiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech rozniesie to wszystko mnie też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiłem! — przypomniał z wyrzutem w głosie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on nie może, dlatego że ja go nie kocham.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączanie siedmiu przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pójdźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przychodził zwykle o pięć minut wcześniej i czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki spoważniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na całe życie dość mam tej jednej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym momencie zauważył, jak Ewa rusza wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mówią o skrzydłach dla ludzkości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezwład i zniechęcenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzał na wskazany napis.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt drażniące, zbyt mocne było jego spoglądanie prosto w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj, aż on wróci na spoczynek… a potem: jeden celny strzał!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznawaliśmy ich po głosie, dzięki czemu mogliśmy sprawdzić ich liczbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie nam dobrze z sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pyta, nie błądzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze się poskarży, że sam wziąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale straszne było przebudzenie z upojeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, ale co tu gadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przy całej klasie, zamiast kaligrafii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Drugie danie tu ci przyniosą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie nie czuje się na siłach do otwartej walki ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paluszek i główka to szkolna wymówka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to tak ohydne, że czym prędzej zapaliłem lampę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzył się w kolano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leje jak z cebra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój mąż — dokończyła z dziwnym, nie znanym mi dotychczas uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Andrzej uścisnął mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko wam mogą wejść w drogę insi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu się przynajmniej zdawało…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli, powoli, myślisz, opanujesz ją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprawdzie nie tak intensywnie, jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szepty zapełniły mały park.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielkie radości i wielkie smutki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszka się i już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda wielka, że nie udało mu się odnaleźć zaginionego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni napadają, a drudzy kryją się i uciekają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po ich właściwym brzęku znać było, iż bronią zaskarbionych w dębie miodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze mną, dziewczyco, nie rób żadnych ceregieli — rzekł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak szczebiotała, a ja z niepojętym zachwytem spoglądałem na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośród wszystkich dni i nocy, ta jedna noc stała się najwyższym ziszczeniem mego bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możecie nas tu zamknąć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko należy przypisać prądowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, znów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natychmiast zauważyła zmieniony wygląd Filipa, co sprawiło jej widoczną przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech Bóg ma pana w swej opiece.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymać: godzinę, dwie, choćby trzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do stołu i — nie patrząc na pole operacyjne — ujął delikatnie jelita.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto mi zabroni wejść? — odparł chłopak stanowczym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zobaczył go, jak spał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi, syn krawca — dziewięcioro małych dzieci — bieda wielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynalazł dla mnie obalony przez burzę olbrzymi cedr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim odepchnął je na chybił trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry, wszyscy umrzemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie słyszał pan dotychczas o nim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponowne wizje miniaturowych twarzyczek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz cóż nas to wszystko obchodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natomiast my jesteśmy inteligentnymi czytelnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz jestem już u siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustrzeliliby go niezwłocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A u żadnej z lalek nie spotkałam takiego spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien sobie dobrze poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obok inna tarcza z lwem rozkraczonym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy zerwali się z miejsc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gra świąteczna muzyka, mamy świeczki, jedzenie i fajnych ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu, przed nim!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kara boska, kara boska…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelkie nazwy będą fałszywe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą twarze obu po zajściu metamorfozy były zupełnie różne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z daleka zabłysła latarka prosto w oczy i zgasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem poczuł, że coś się niedostrzegalnie zmieniło w nim albo poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chciał pozwolić mówić na siebie „ty”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem w nędzy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili: — Ja wiem, co teraz będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mam go jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głupio się stało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reprodukcja cyfrowa wykonana przez fundację Nowoczesna Polska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz iść do kina na „Hotel du Nord”? — Nic nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może autor uznał, że nie ma potrzeby zagłębiać się w temat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasyciwszy oczy widokiem własnej krasy, zaczęła z powrotem ubierać się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unikam wszelkich poprawek i przeróbek! — odpowiedział pośpiesznie i niespokojnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawe, co z tego wyniknie!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, przestrzegałem cię… ja z krwi twojej i kości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejrzał je dokładnie, odkładając te, które stępiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli natknąłeś się na opisane stworzenie - będę wdzięczny za kontakt!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rotunda ją prześladuje!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Udzielam głosu młodemu królowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokój! — wołał z uniesieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie nie pożywię się przy nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo przytrzaśniesz komuś palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy jej powiedział: — Chcę spotkać się z tobą, — odpowiedziała: — Dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W klatce go posadzić i na rynku wystawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, ciężko mi się myśli w tej temperaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem gotowy do pomocy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego dnia nie wytrzyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem ile.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spodziewałam się tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety rzeczy nie do zacytowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem jeszcze wówczas dębem, przykutym do miejsca i do własnego milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodki, sierpniowy zachód całował ich szczyty…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to duży, tłusty samiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jemu pewnie też serce mocno ze strachu biło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłuchał pokorny jak baranek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyobrażam sobie, jaką musiałem mieć minę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I że mógł siedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam o jakimś horrorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się jednak, że nie wszystkie osobniki podległy tej klątwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, panie — oznajmił major uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął ją pod rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To proszę cię, powiedz mi, że się przeprosiłaś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20780999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie oddałbym za nie wszystkie ani jednej z naszych nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłaby wymrzeć w trochę piękniejszych i potężniejszych formach — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najgroźniejszym jest strach przed czymś nieuchwytnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem to przy innych mężczyznach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jakże wydaje się prawdziwe!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Klęknę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak urośniecie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi w ogóle żadnej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O wpół do pierwszej zaczynała coś wiedzieć i kładła się spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytałam go, który, czy ten Emil? Nie odpowiedział i poszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U ich stóp walczą czarne głowonogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz najbardziej zdumiał go wyraz twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może instynktem kobiety wyczuła przy nim bliskość anioła śmierci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krew na książkach i papierach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, mówiąc o życiu, obejmuję teorię życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy zrobiło mu się bardzo sucho w ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocham cię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu daliśmy odmowną, ale też i uprzejmą odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się lubi nauczyciela, to nawet najmniejsza uwaga boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy być praktycznym; jestem pozytywistą, mój panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiesz mię, jeden z drugim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los padł na Michała, prostodusznego i kochającego młodzież entuzjastę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wbrew zakazowi usiadłem na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała zmysł orientacyjny i wyczucie miejsc nieznanych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie przez ciekawość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy ujrzałem jej oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy tu w tym pokoju, gdzie teraz stukot maszyny nasuwa skojarzenia ostatniej jazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc spuściłem milcząco głowę i słuchałem dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero na końcu tego rozdziału będzie mowa o szlachetności Michała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po mału pokochał swoją lubieżność, włożoną w Klarę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip nie miał nawet czasu zamachnąć się pałką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co ty się dziś nie obrażasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była parna, księżycowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wyście to przysłali? — powtórzył staruszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kuj żelazo póki gorące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jak już tam wejdziesz, to wychodzisz spłukany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jaka ładna muszelka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczycielki były jej mniej lub więcej obojętne, stary profesor łaciny był „słodki”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszno ci w torbie? — spytał ze współczuciem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nim pan przyjechał, ja zawsze wiedziałam, z którego miasta są goście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20781139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabory, Druga Wojna Światowa i powstania to często poruszane wśród Polaków tematy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26957471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem ze rezolucją Parlamentu Europejskiego zatwierdzającą nominację Algirdasa Šemety na członka Komisji Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26957474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kapitał europejski jest często przyciągany za granicę brakiem przepisów ochrony środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26957475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chodzi o programy i treści polityczne, nadal nie ma właściwie z czego wybierać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26957478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi eksporterzy samochodów mają zdecydowanie najmocniejszą pozycję na rynku koreańskim, wykazując najwyższe tempo wzrostu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26957481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lobbing w instytucjach Unii Europejskiej jest problemem złożonym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32799651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest możliwe, łącznie z finansowym wsparciem z Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32799652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyn tych jest wiele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32799653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego uważam, że powinniśmy iść krok po kroku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32799654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy tutaj świadkami ich czystej rządzy władzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32799655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest całkowicie niezrównoważone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32799681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na piśmie - Celem pierwszej wizyty zagranicznej nowego premiera Tunezji była Unia Europejska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32799682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie to też żaden argument\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32799683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy nakarmić ubogich, zwłaszcza w czasie obecnego kryzysu gospodarczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32799684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znaczenie tych zmian jest jednakże względne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32799685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak dysponujemy również szeregiem pozytywnych przykładów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32806093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy mamy świadomość, jak ważnym i zarazem trudnym partnerem handlowym pozostaje Rosja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32806097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak często bywa, jesteśmy największym donatorem pomocy humanitarnej w Sri Lance\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32806098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to tematem wielu debat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32806099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że należy go postrzegać pozytywnie i taki powinien być także wynik głosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32806100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże jestem do państwa dyspozycji, aby kontynuować dyskusję na ten temat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32818805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie obejmuje politykę antymonopolową i politykę kontroli pomocy państwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32818806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proces ratyfikacji traktatu wreszcie dobiegł końca, dzięki podpisowi prezydenta Republiki Czeskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32818807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Producenci opon są dotknięci równie poważnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32818808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże od samego początku, władze próbowały zamknąć biuro Centrum\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32818809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kraje, które jeszcze nie rozpoczęły ratyfikacji zostały zachęcone do kontynuacji procesu ratyfikacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32831765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Wielkiej Brytanii za trzy miesiące odbędą się wybory powszechne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32831766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa promuje tolerancję, dlatego nie chcemy głosicieli nienawiści, potępiających inne religie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32831767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznaczanie pochodzenia produktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32831768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można by jeszcze długo wymieniać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32831769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję też wszystkim za wykonaną wspólnie pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32864251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym nawiązać do pewnych kwestii, o których już tutaj mówiono\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32864287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament Europejski poproszono, aby wyraził opinię na temat poszczególnych części tego dokumentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32864288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak już powiedziałam, mówimy tutaj o naszym chlebie powszednim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32864289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadal martwimy się o prawa człowieka i wolność mediów w Azerbejdżanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32864290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze środkami powinna iść pomoc logistyczna, zabezpieczająca sprawne ich wykorzystanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32881433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się także, że Gruzja szybko pokonała kryzys gospodarczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32881434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy przyjęty przepis jest efektem kompromisu oraz ochrony różnych interesów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32881435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile już razy żądaliśmy, żeby rząd lub inni podjęli działania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32881436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to najistotniejsze kwestie, do których panie i panowie posłowie wnieśli ważne uwagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32881437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak oczywiście nie jest to jedyny punkt naszego programu prac\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32937995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście na sieci bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32937996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Międzynarodowa polityka w zakresie klimatu po szczycie w Kopenhadze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32937998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej mówiąc, stawiając takie żądanie jesteśmy wierni postanowieniom traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32937999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podziękować urzędującemu panu przewodniczącemu, przewodniczącemu Komisji i moim kolegom za ich dotychczasowy wkład\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32938001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zostać - i zostanie - poprawiona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33049144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważnym sygnałem jest zdecydowane poparcie Parlamentu dla chorwackiego procesu akcesyjnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33049145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to więc zatem ogromny problem na terenie całej Wspólnoty Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33049146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnym punktem posiedzenia jest debata w sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33049147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ dopłata środowiskowa pomogła w sprzedaży większej liczby ekologicznie czystych samochodów niż powodujących zanieczyszczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33049148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że sugeruje się, że ten środek skonstruowany jest w oparciu o solidarność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33125545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdecydowanie sprzeciwiam się liberalizacji rynku usług pocztowych z trzech zasadniczych powodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33125546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym niemniej, aby osiągnąć porozumienie, potrzebowaliśmy kompromisu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33125547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejski Rzecznik Praw Obywatelskich musi bardziej skupić się na lepszej komunikacji zewnętrznej z obywatelami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33125548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istniejącym prawodawstwie występują nieprawidłowości i problemy z transpozycją przepisów do prawa krajowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33125549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcą tylko sprzedawać swoje towary\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33194729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co roku dokonuje się podobny rytuał w sprawie budżetu rolnictwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33194730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że z tego punktu widzenia istnieje szerokie porozumienie między instytucjami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33194731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzi mi tutaj o rozpoczęcie przygotowań do stworzenia wspólnych europejskich ram dla Morza Czarnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33194733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy czas naprawdę, aby ta Izba uporządkowała swoje priorytety\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34355945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kompromisowe prawodawstwo, które sporządziliśmy, satysfakcjonuje wszystkich legalnych użytkowników broni palnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34355946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie obserwujemy dalsze rozprzestrzenianie się kryzysu finansowego, który obecnie dotyka również dużych konglomeratów finansowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34355947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto opłata za przejazd może znacząco ograniczyć popyt na transport drogowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34355948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę też gorąco podziękować przedstawicielom prezydencji belgijskiej, którzy byli naszymi partnerami w negocjacjach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34355949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W razie wykrycia sfałszowanego produktu leczniczego można teraz wysłać ostrzeżenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34356041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich liczba jest dość znaczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34356042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy będziemy mogli mówić o równej konkurencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34356043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym zdaniem przynajmniej częściowo jest to warunek wstępny, którego powinniśmy się trzymać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34356044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europę - tę matkę narodów - łączy kultura chrześcijaństwa na jej zachodzie i wschodzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_34356045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To grudniowe oświadczenie brzmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35639832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy ołowiowy dekret przybliża upadek Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35639833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na piśmie - Handel środkami spożywczymi zajmuje bardzo ważne miejsce na rynku wewnętrznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35639834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to absolutnie konieczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35639835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tej chwili nawet dręczy mnie niespokojność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35639836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrafiliśmy uporządkować sprawę substancji niebezpiecznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35747297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogą państwo również przeczytać o prawie do zakładania funduszy dla osób fizycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35747298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"on mnie natychmiast zrozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35747300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tu nie chodzi jedynie o nazwę, którą przybrała sama koalicja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35747301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to z pewnością najważniejszy element tego planu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35747302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.612,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie przewodniczący, pani wiceprzewodnicząca, pani komisarz, szanowni posłowie i posłanki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36530066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałam za przyjęciem sprawozdania, ponieważ przejrzystość instytucji politycznych to warunek wstępny ich legitymacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36530067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środki te powinny zostać przeznaczone lub zwrócone tam skąd pochodzą, a mianowicie podatnikom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36530068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fakt ten również naszym zdaniem stwarza możliwość ostatecznego rozwiązania drogą polityczną kwestii kurdyjskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36530069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym problemem jest to, że nasze działania nie są skuteczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36530070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie otrzymaliśmy jeszcze potwierdzenia, nie mówiąc już o odpowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36715445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejna sprawa dotyczy priorytetów finansowych - tu pierwsze pytanie brzmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36715446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomoc rozwojowa i likwidacja ubóstwa to niezwykle istotne potrzeby, zasługujące na moje pełne poparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36715447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy jednak dodać, że badanie powinno było pójść o wiele dalej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36715448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc prościej, jest to kluczowy sektor dla Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36715449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"stwierdzenie, że europejska spółka prywatna w rzeczywistości funkcjonuje w kontekście transgranicznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36810422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy zauważyć, że historia kolei europejskich przesądziła już o wyborze między dwoma systemami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36810424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł zasnąć nad morzem, bo wyszedłszy z lasu, zaraz ruszył w drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36810426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pakiet jest także przykładem solidarności w Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36810427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo przyszło nam czekać na nową Komisję Europejską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_36810428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się w Unii Europejskiej o kryzysie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26357265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z niedawnego orzecznictwa wynika, że tak nie jest\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26357266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze względu na pilność wprowadzenia tych rozwiązań popieram przyjęcie wniosku bez poprawek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26357361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadamy się natomiast za interwencją humanitarną, zapewnieniem sprzętu, ludzi i pieniędzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26357370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy powiedzieć z całą pewnością, że każda ich część została zaprojektowana bez zarzutu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26357378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że jest oczywiste iż nie stworzyli celowo złego systemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26357379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oprócz tego opóźnienia na skutek korków powodują znaczące straty ekonomiczne w sektorze transportu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26357385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że jest to podstawowa metoda\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26357386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę różnorodnej Europy, w której każdy obywatel uzyskuje ochronę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26357387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepotrzebne regulacje zajmują wiele czasu i dużo kosztują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26357393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"należy zwracać większą uwagę na sytuację, w szczególności w Republice Czeskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26357394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, mówię jeszcze raz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy bowiem zapominać, iż Stany Zjednoczone są naszym największym partnerem handlowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odniosą one jednak rezultatu, jeśli nie nastąpi wzrost\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz częściej mówi się o ewentualnym podziale Kosowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament Europejski wielokrotnie zajmował się kwestią budowy demokracji w Gruzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W stu procentach opowiadamy się za konkurencyjnymi stosunkami między publicznymi i prywatnymi podmiotami nadawczymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości nie wykorzystuje się efektywnie całych dużych obszarów krajobrazu rolniczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewnienie większego bezpieczeństwa produktów jest obowiązkiem zarówno rządów, jak i przedsiębiorstw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konkurencyjności europejskiej nie towarzyszy i nie będzie towarzyszyć pętanie europejskiego przemysłu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy będziemy mogli omawiać tą sprawę dalej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to globalne wyzwanie wymagające podjęcia wspólnej odpowiedzialności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeprowadzone reformy i rozwój sytuacji w Republice Mołdowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba się zgodzić ze stanowiskiem Trybunału, że ta interpretacja jest wadliwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele można również zyskać dzięki większej współpracy między portami a poszczególnymi państwami członkowskimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym zakresie, wybór pomiędzy współpracą wielostronną i dwustronną jest bardzo trudny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Portugalia i Włochy również doświadczą tych strajków w przyszłym miesiącu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyniąc to, wypełnimy znaczącą lukę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy rozumiemy, że takiej krytyki nie przetrwałoby żadne przedsiębiorstwo prywatne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym prosić wszystkich o powstanie i uczczenie pamięci zmarłych minutą ciszy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżbyśmy nie mogli po prostu sporządzić jednego, jasno sformułowanego, zwykłego sprawozdania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyną rozsądną rzeczą jest wdrożenie programu kastracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie leży więc to ani w interesie rządu Turcji, ani jej narodu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym musimy dokonać wyboru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedstawiliśmy sprawozdanie stwierdzające, że w rejonach zalewowych nie należy budować nowych domów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak powiedziała pani komisarz, jest to ważne osiągnięcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nie ma konsumpcji, załamuje się również produkcja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, że uwolnienie Szalita pomogłoby ogólnie w procesie pokojowym na Bliskim Wschodzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"praw i obowiązków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te kraje mają na ogół niezwykle wrażliwe polityki w tych obszarach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26365983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widać to zwłaszcza w krajach trzecich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiem więcej - koszty społeczne osłabienia tego sektora mają znaczenie absolutnie fundamentalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada i Komisja zgadzają się, że strategia lizbońska przynosi wyniki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem za odrzuceniem sprawozdania, ponieważ jest to kolejns próba wprowadzenia tylnymi drzwiami kwestii aborcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże w przypadku Izraela ograniczamy się do oświadczeń i bezowocnych dyskusji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że handel ludźmi jest największą plagą nękającą ludzkość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Setki tysięcy ludzi demonstrują na ulicach, powiewając sztandarami z hasłem \\\"Domagamy się prawdy\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem jednak zaniepokojona faktem, że obywatele ci być może nie są wystarczająco poinformowani\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy z nich jeszcze trwa, inaczej mówiąc jest to kryzys finansowy i jego konsekwencje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy współzależni pod każdym względem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kluczowe znaczenie, obok efektywności energetycznej, mają także środki oszczędności energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obie grupy, jak państwo wiedzą, odgrywają kluczową rolę w procesie integracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Swobodny przepływ osób w ramach strefy Schengen jest niewątpliwie pozytywną europejską wartością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26366301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była one naprawdę bardzo pomocna dla Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26370824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie chce utraty naszych wysokich standardów higieny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26370843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co pan przed chwilą powiedział, jest nieprawidłowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26370867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy podstaw do tego, by niszczyć kraje tylko dlatego, że nie lubimy dyktatorów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26370939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się, że okresowy przegląd postępów w realizacji celów paktu przyniesie wymierne korzyści\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26370952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas będziemy oczekiwać na dalszą dyskusję z Parlamentem w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26370972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest jednak Unia przyjaciół - przyjaciół i równorzędnych partnerów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26370980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Politycy i obywatele muszą reagować na problemy świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26371005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za odpowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26371020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam do pana komisarza bardzo konkretne pytanie dotyczące autobusów szkolnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26371041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praktyczne wdrożenie tego systemu wymaga stworzenia europejskiego modelu rozwiązywania sporów konsumenckich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym powiedzieć jeszcze parę słów na temat wymiaru społecznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi powód jest równie ważny jak pierwszy i dotyczy wszystkich Państwa bezpośrednio\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego głosowałem za przyjęciem przedmiotowego dokumentu w sesji plenarnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowanie nie powinno oznaczać zamknięcia tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy również lepszych warunków dla decentralizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, iż po typowym w takich przypadkach trybie proceduralnym następuje dialog\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczę na to, że w tej Izbie takie ono właśnie będzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja wyglądała inaczej przed wejściem w życie traktatu lizbońskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja Przemysłu, Badań Naukowych i Energii odpowiada za badania, energię i rozwój społeczeństwa informacyjnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich celem będą lepiej wyważone kryteria kwalifikowalności, kosztu kontroli i jakości wydatków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozwiązania nie mogą płynąć z terenu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy rzecz jasna jak najszybszego zatwierdzenia nowego traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc polityka Ameryki jest polityką Izraela, a my, Europejczycy, mamy podążać za przywódcą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sprawa najważniejsza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyobrażam sobie misję rozpoznawczą wysłaną z Marsa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"w porządku, Parlament apelował do Komisji o ponowny przegląd jej projektów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy poziom inwestycji jest wyższy w Hiszpanii?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to zwłaszcza przypadków związanych z danymi osobowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następny po nim traktat lizboński stanowi wyraz politycznego kompromisu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd mój głos, który wynika z mojego przekonania o konieczności poszanowania zasady pomocniczości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żadną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że wdrożone zostanie to, co zostało obiecane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad Europą gromadzą się ostatnio czarne chmury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przekonany, że dzięki obopólnej gotowości do rozmów osiągniemy porozumienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że nie jest to konsens o najniższym wspólnym mianowniku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26376987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedź jest taka, że macie tam interesy gospodarcze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26377000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj chcielibyśmy w Parlamencie Europejskim głośno i wyraźnie sprzeciwić się ślepej przemocy terroryzmu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26377002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem przyjmuję, że wynik głosowania w Komisji wyraźnie odzwierciedla nasze stanowisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26377015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sposobu rewitalizacji tej misji i jej możliwego przedłużenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26377022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wygląda krótkie podsumowanie treści przedmiotowego sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26377029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już czas podjąć stosowne działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26377033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie, klimat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kogo pan szuka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet własne wojsko ciebie nie lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płynęli od latarni do latarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, Leo, mam wielką ochotę przytoczyć tu jeden wykład, ale boję się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to poniekąd ludzie i tak, i tak zgubieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapanowała ulica, robotnicy naftowi i fabryczni, czeladź sklepowa i domowa, marynarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mnie zaś nie wydaje się to niezwykłym u osobnika tego pokroju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważałem to podniecenie za zdenerwowanie wskutek oczekiwania mających nadejść wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówili bezładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja twoich pieniędzy nie potrzebuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem: — Przepraszam cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś wie co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ci na imię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie trzeba mi było pozwalać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok reszta! — krzyknął Podlasiak, podniecony otrzymanym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko spojrzała na duży, wahadłowy zegar nad sofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna być kimś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie moge powiedzieć, że nie mam na nich ochoty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę myślałem, że to twój kolega z pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zróbmy lepiej tak: niech każdy rzuci pięć razy do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadał pomału, gdy nagle odczuł nienawiść wobec poko jówki Józi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie wtedy pociąg, zwolniwszy biegu, wjechał w las.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłeś wyjść na przerwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego tylko pożądał: wichru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zamiast zniechęcić, jeszcze bardziej rozpala się w Maciusiu niecierpliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie kobiety: jeden świat dla mężczyzn, drugi dla siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent z objawami grypy trafił dzisiaj do naszej przychodni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się cieszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyła, jakie to na nim robi wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to trwało może kwadrans: nie całując się, dotykali się nawzajem wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — teraz kontakt częściowo osłabiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze jesteś taki, jak ja chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy seniora ma gości? — zapytałem go niechętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc przekonam się naocznie; wyjdę i przypatrzę mu się dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdę mówiąc, nic nie myślałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem usnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście wiatru nie było, mróz zatem nie dokuczał zbytnio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłop szanuje zdrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba mnie na to nie stać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama jest ciągle inną; niby ta sama, a jednak inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsza sesja przed nim, wsparcie mu się przyda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaraz nie możesz mieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On to szponami wyciska pękające wrzody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale, nie, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wiesz, że zmieniłaś się? — Wiem o tym dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego pan nie kupił na stacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mogę: tak mnie coś ściskało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropny uścisk nie zelżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Została tylko opancerzona powierzchnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z konwencjonalno-fizjologicznego punktu widzenia to on mię miał pewną ilość razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puk, puk! — pukało dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam określonego tytułu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mama z ciocią rozmawiały i nic nie widzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie otworzył oczu i udawał, że drzemie w dalszym ciągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiarkował od razu! — rzekł do Podlasiaka, wskazując ramieniem przyjaciela i chełpiąc się jego zgadliwością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastrojem będzie rodzaj miłości, który nie daje żadnych objawów somatycznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No niechby sobie, ale lubi wyśmiewać — i buntuje na dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj, po długich, długich latach porzuciła ową ziemię lśniącą życiem i słońcem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy bardzo bolą cię ręce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już wiem, co zrobię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowód ten był odwróceniem jednego z dowodów istnienia Boga św.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę się połapać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za mało się znamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"But się rozpada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona klęka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawił po sobie wspomnienia jak najcieplejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiłem to z niemałą dozą ostrożności, z długim wahaniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest coś całkiem innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akcent słów brzmiał trochę obco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W pogoni za dziewczakiem odbił się zbytnio od ziemi i odleciał bezpowrotnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadspodziewanie okazuje się, że tkwi w Kościele sama geneza państwowości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekali jeszcze przez pewien czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiano ją przenieść do innej szkoły, bo w starej szkole „śmierdzi, śmierdzi”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawość to pierwszy stopień do piekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wymiany: ty wciągany przeze mnie, ja przez ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starość nie radość, młodość nie wieczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem taniec słoni… a teraz, już po mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkim krokiem pośpieszyła do pokoju męża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamilknął na chwilę pan Ryszard i uśmiechnął się smutno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech no by go spytał o paszport ten przechodzący patrol…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy zobaczyłem ją po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogą się oderwać od biopodłoża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weźcie pod uwagę ilość popularyzujących dzieł w Niemczech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już od lat kilku w lesie przebywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trybuny widziane z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważał, że to są formy przymusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż może mieć wspólnego z człowiekiem wolny naród wilków?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba jeszcze głośniej, i pani się rozgniewała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była wstawka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jest pan wzorowym narzeczonym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram usłyszał wołanie, nie przystanął jednak, tylko przyspieszył jeszcze bieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opracował zasady i zbiory idei, które ja dzisiaj noszę w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym przy stosunku zachowuje się też dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie! Oto moment, na który czekaliście!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21219421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A co to byli za ludzie, ci czterej… panowie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21219422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani tymczasem prześpi się trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21219423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I trochę betelu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21219425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tiramisu kontra bigos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21219427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nim zdobył się na odpowiedź, łodzie przybiły do brzegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23827623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26990734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym celu także nasi sąsiedzi muszą wprowadzić reformy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26990735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz kogo możemy obwiniać za brak postępu w zakresie architektury nadzoru?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26990738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwa państwa, stanowiące jedną trzecią światowej populacji, podpisują porozumienie o współpracy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26990741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy zdać sobie z tego sprawę, raz i na zawsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26990746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U Win Tin jest najstarszym więźniem sumienia w Birmie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26990885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"będzie ono również zawierało koncepcje naszego dalszego postępowania w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26990888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojechałem również do Egiptu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta część jest dla nas bardzo ważna również z politycznego punktu widzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauką jest tylko to, co pasuje do koncepcji politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym, aby Komisja temu również się przyjrzała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to uzupełnienie wprowadzonych już przez państwa bałtyckie środków walki z zanieczyszczeniami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jestem całkowicie przekonany o pani dozgonnym zaangażowaniu na rzecz przestrzegania zasady równości reprezentantów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedzą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z przyjemnością poparłem przedmiotowe sprawozdanie w trakcie głosowania nad jego przyjęciem w Parlamencie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to spowodować problemy związane z poprawkami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to jednoznaczne przesłanie Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech te pół miliarda także dostanie referendum\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"kto i w jaki sposób może przywrócić zaufanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koniec końców nic z tego nie wyszło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żąda papieru z pieczęcią, żeby wiedzieć wreszcie, co chcą z nim zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skomplikowana sytuacja w Iraku wymaga przejrzystej i pełnej zaangażowania polityki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety nie stało się tak w przypadku Stanów Zjednoczonych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie się z nim w tej kwestii nie zgadzam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoro więc wiedział o tym personel, przyjmuję, że wie również pani przewodnicząca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę przede wszystkim o przesiedleniach uchodźców z państw trzecich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejnym elementem zwiększenia skuteczności tej agencji jest współpraca międzynarodowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.252,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególnym problemem dotyczącym odpadów promieniotwórczych jest ogromna skala czasowa zagrożenia, jakie powodują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym nie dziwi moje poparcie dla obecnej podstawy polityki spójności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed Egiptem decydujące miesiące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałam okazję zobaczyć zaskakującą pracowitość taniej siły roboczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to tak naprawdę jedyny sposób na zakończenie drugiego etapu tworzenia rynku wewnętrznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę musimy przyjrzeć się tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament ten wykazuje się w tej kwestii rażącą hipokryzją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie niech mi będzie wolno zacytować Jeana Monneta, który powiedział\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Państwa członkowskie nie mogą traktować tego systemu tylko jako dodatkowego dochodu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Związana jest z dyskryminacją płciową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oceniając w tym kontekście propozycję Komisji, zwracam uwagę na dwa niebezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie jest tendencyjne!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strategii tej towarzyszy strategia rozwoju regionalnego dla Azji Środkowej Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby z tego powodu najważniejsze dzisiaj jest udrożnienie tego działu budżetu Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosła pani również kwestię naszego wyboru zdecentralizowanych ram zbierania danych mówiąc\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza to tworzenie niesprawiedliwych warunków konkurencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zdrowia naszego społeczeństwa, a szczególnie młodzieży\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to całkiem nowa dyrektywa, która odnosi się też do młodych ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie na światowej scenie pojawili się silni nowi gracze ekonomiczni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy kompletnie zamrozić rozmowy akcesyjne z Turcją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezbędne są fundusze badawcze na zmniejszenie ilości odpadów i zwiększenie bezpieczeństwa instalacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego typu praktyki jeszcze bardziej kompromitują obecne władze w Teheranie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo wszystko, dziękuję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie skutki zmian klimatycznych są poważniejsze i bardziej odczuwalne niż kiedykolwiek wcześniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas, by zacząć działać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem za rozporządzeniem w sprawie oznakowania opon pod kątem efektywności paliwowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mojej opinii rozwiązanie prawne nie zostanie znalezione przed końcem tego okresu legislacyjnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wszystkie nasze problemy dobiegły końca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podwójne standardy stosuje się też do zbrodni wojennych i odszkodowań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"niezależną agencją zajmującą się zwalczaniem nadużyć finansowych, która wzbudza zazdrość innych międzynarodowych organizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowa tura negocjacji przed nami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktat lizboński ponownie sprawił, że Europa jest gotowa na nową erę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.404,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy będziemy rozmawiać o niezawodności tej polityki, będziemy bronić długich okresów planowania funduszy strukturalnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowi ona, że ziemia jest integralną częścią polityki dotyczącej klimatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.9,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze podpisanie horyzontalnej umowy o lotnictwie cywilnym i umowy o bezpieczeństwie lotniczym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kryzys finansowy jasno pokazał, że struktura rynków finansowych Unii Europejskiej musi ulec zmianie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze potępiałam wszelkie łamanie praw człowieka, gdziekolwiek by do niego nie dochodziło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli nie, to jakie wnioski zamierza pani wyciągnąć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwróciłem już na to uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejmy nadzieję, że Europa w końcu odkryje solidarność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie rzecz dotyczy również swobód obywatelskich, w tym wolności religijnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem bardzo zadowolona z tego, co powiedziała pani komisarz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może mogłoby to także posłużyć jako lekcja w regionie Morza Czarnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy więc do czynienia z dwiema sprawami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proces wzajemnej oceny przewidziany w dyrektywie usługowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26991937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mojej opinii byłoby to wyjątkowo niewydolne działanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gratuluję prezydentowi Tajwanu Ma Ying-jeou udanej polityki zbliżenia między Pekinem a Tajpej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zadanie należy wypełnić, i zrobić to dobrze, razem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to poziomy cen, zmiany dostawców, skargi, bezpieczeństwo i satysfakcja konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każde państwo członkowskie działa na swoją rękę i uruchamia krajowe środki pomocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejdę teraz do ostatniego pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie jak pan, chciałbym uniknąć powtórki ubiegłorocznego kryzysu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjęto zasady funkcjonowania rodzin zastępczych, stworzono bezpieczne domy, zbudowano przedszkola i żłobki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety pomoc udzielana stoczniom polskim nie została przeznaczona na inwestycje i potrzebną restrukturyzację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepis ten wyraźnie osłabia prawo oskarżonego do uczciwego procesu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogromną zaletą tego sprawozdania jest analiza zagadnienia z punktu widzenia rolników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osiągnięto jednak wystarczający kompromis\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowisko Europejczyków musi być jasne, jednoznaczne i niezwykle mocne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja również podzielam zdanie, że musimy myśleć o rybołówstwie i strategii w tym zakresie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26992769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życzeniem naszej grupy jest to, by pańska kadencja opierała się na tych wartościach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27535116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.532,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy utworzyć niezależną komisję w celu zbadania przemocy popełnionej po rozpoczęciu konfliktu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27535117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ochrony konsumentów przed spamem, oprogramowaniem szpiegującym i złośliwym oprogramowaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27535119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie próbujmy jednak teraz toczyć dalszych debat instytucjonalnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27535121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osiągnięcie tego celu jest konieczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27535124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też przepisy prawa międzynarodowego są w tym wypadku jedynym właściwym rozwiązaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolno wyłaniał się z jego piersi dziki bas o specjalnie hebrajskim akcencie gardłowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę milczeliśmy obaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to mi na co się przyda, gdy tam wejdę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytem żył ubogo jak żebrak na poddaszu, którego okno wyglądało na podwórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, jak jeden więzień po drugim, przeciągał się, jęcząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko uczucie osobliwego, lodowatego szkieletu we mnie, trwało dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten stężały, wyszczerzony uśmiech znam już niemal cały wiek ludzki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to mały człowieczek ze szpakowatą ostrą bródką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta daremna gotowość do skoku wszystkich mych zmysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktoraty zdał z odznaczeniem: to się rozumie samo przez się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapanowała dłuższa przerwa, podczas której radca policyjny zdawał się coś z wysiłkiem kombinować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, twarz Rozyny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Biedny?“ zawołałem przerażony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oj, żebym ja ci paru rzeczy nie wypomniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałem, że umrę z bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłszy tam jednak nic smacznego, odleciała dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozdarłem kołnierzyk; myślałem, że się uduszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda z pokrzywdzonych rodzin nabywała taką figurką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze gwałtowne trzeszczenie, które się przeraziło samo siebie i gwałtownie się przerwało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to był strach, co mnie opanował przed możliwością, że mnie ktoś zobaczy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie była to książka, co przemawiała do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby pan był roztropny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Niech pani prosi swego ojca o pomoc“ powiedziałem bezradny z trwogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Zwak miał coś opowiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwny niepokój wewnętrzny wzrastał we mnie i doprowadzał mnie do rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem przy warsztacie i wyjąłem obcążki i rylce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Imię Martyna nie pochodzi od Marty, tylko jest żeńską formą imienia Marcin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ryknąłem, do czegóż to się ośmielasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według kalendarza świąt nietypowych, pierwszy stycznia to dzień kaca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwól, niechaj rzeczy płyną same przez się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może mam mu ją odnieść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak nie, to nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niby ktoś, co się musi trzymać za poręcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego, co męcząco zarabiał udzielaniem lekcji, musiał jeszcze utrzymywać chorą matkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wróciłem, zauważyłem, że był zaczerwieniony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czemuż Pan mówi to tak poważnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hrabina jest niewinna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem odwrócić wzroku od jej wpół-otwartych ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę cię ocalić, Atanazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz jemu tym razem się nie spieszyło, wziął krzesełko i usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To suchotnik: gorączka śmierci mózg jego trawi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ją zaciekawi widok zwalonego mostu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiedziałem im swoją wędrówkę wśród mgły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem turkot kół powozu na bruku i wściekły galop podków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Gdzie serce z czerwonego kamienia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Gdy pan teraz wróci, to zobaczysz, że on ją natychmiast weźmie i schowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zgoda“ powiedział, gdy skończyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"interes pański na tym polega.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz on mi odmówił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to czworokątna płyta z kółkiem do podnoszenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz rezultat był inny, zupełnie inny, niż przypuszczałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej jasne włosy rozpostarły się przed moim wzrokiem, jak złoty welon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem go przycisnąć do muru: „Pan myśli o damie, która niedawno tutaj zajeżdżała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeczuwałem; on znajdzie dla niej radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"odpowiedział Zwak i wzruszył ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on wiedział, co się teraz stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem twardo i czekałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radca policyjny z nienawiści zszarzał na obliczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy pan to rozumie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja chcę tylko dojść do swych pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu głuchoniemy wyszedł z zadowoloną miną i ruszył precz z tandeciarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewidzialne nici wyciągały mnie na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułem to lecz nie mogłem się zobaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem nagle przerywa ciszę dziki wrzask.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczułem w jego mowie jakieś ukryte znaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to odzież zniszczona z grubego ciemnego, sukna o staromodnym dziwnym kroju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybyśmy wyszli na ulicę, to po kilku krokach zmoklibyśmy do suchej nitki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Talmudzie stoi: „Zanim Bóg stworzył świat, postawił zwierciadło przed istotami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Naturalnie z podziękowaniem nie przyjąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może guzik metalowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw zapalić światło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda mi cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tylko tak mówię.“ Przeszedłem się po pokoju, aby się uspokoić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22999984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście: wewnątrz w pracowni szmer, jak gdyby ktoś wysuwał szufladę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze jako młodzieniec, nic nie znał poza nauką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem się do nich docisnąć, ale mnie odsunięto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się wtedy stanie z jej listami w moim pokoju?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstrzymałem nawet oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Później, gdy badanie ponawiano, spoglądano w okno z pewnej odległości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle podniósłszy rękę natrafiłem na pustą przestrzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę jeszcze dzisiaj jego pogrzeb przed sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo prosta, nazbyt prostą rzeczą byłoby w takim razie zbawienie świata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A idźże idźże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traciły grunt pod nogami, jak mówiły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„To panią trapi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było już więcej miejsca we mnie na nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak kręcę się w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak krzyk nurtowało we mnie to imię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbym panu najdokładniej odrysować wszystką grę jego twarzy przy każdem mojem słowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkich ludzi kurować jedną łyżką jest jedynie przywilejem lekarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko jakby zdrętwiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to dla mnie cios.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sięgnął do kieszeni, wyjął jakąś książkę i długo przewracał w niej kartki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiejsi badacze twierdzą, że posługiwał się latarnią magiczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Teraz jednak chodźmy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nic, tylko ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale może pani ma niekiedy troski, które mógł bym usunąć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jak pan to może przypuszczać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są one zdolne wytworzyć spójność i solidarność na wielką skalę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjęliśmy w Kolegium dyrektywę w sprawie energii odnawialnej, która pośrednio wspiera racjonalizację zużycia energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawyki żywieniowe są bardzo złe, a Wspólnota Europejska nie może tego zmienić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popieramy wprowadzenia nowych dopłat związanych z wielkością produkcji w pierwszym filarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżąca przed nami propozycja oczywiście poprzedza wchodzący w życie traktat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serbowie, Chorwaci i Bośniacy będą musieli znaleźć własną drogę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już się nią zajmowano\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcą ich nasi międzynarodowi partnerzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.468,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem głęboko przekonany, że budżet Parlamentu Europejskiego powinien być w sposób istotny zwiększony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego te sprawy trzeba wziąć pod uwagę w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu występujące nierówności są ogromne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.252,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozostaje nam nic innego, jak poprzeć intencje, jakie przyświecały autorce przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rejestry przedsiębiorstw stanowią ważny element szeregu projektów, których celem jest ograniczenie obciążenia statystycznego przedsiębiorstw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejdę teraz do zagadnienia migracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyskusja na temat tego nowego instrumentu toczyła się wczoraj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem jednak pewien, że istnieją również inne opcje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostałe punkty uznaję za korzystne i dlatego głosowałem za\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyż to od nich zależeć będzie w dużej mierze przyszłość Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryzyko systemowe staje się widoczne dopiero później, gdy kryzys już wybuchł\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Celem irańskiej polityki zagranicznej jest zdobycie dominującej pozycji regionalnej na Bliskim Wschodzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Unia Europejska jest zdecydowana sprzeciwić się komercjalizacji istot żywych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko dzięki tego rodzaju prawom będziemy mogli skutecznie walczyć z brakiem równouprawnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy poziom zatrudnienia miała Dania, a najniższy Polska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jak powiedziałam, rozważamy możliwości skorzystania z tymczasowego mechanizmu ochrony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej rządzimy w naszym kraju!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim byli beneficjenci i co rzeczywiście zrobili w kwestii ekologicznego programu ożywienia gospodarczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykorzystajmy ten czas na jego ponowne rozważenie i odrzućmy je za miesiąc\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagłosowałem za przyjęciem przedmiotowej rezolucji, dlatego chciałbym dołączyć do grona zwolenników omawianych środków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejska solidarność okazywana jest z trudem i oszczędnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przedmiotowym sprawozdaniu przedstawiono rosnącą potęgę Chin w zakresie handlu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie cały region idzie naprzód\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zwiększyć przejrzystość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mógłby pan, panie przewodniczący, rzucić nieco światła na te wiadomości?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to fundamentalna polityka sprawiedliwości, która musi być stosowana na szczeblu światowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przepływu kapitału, dóbr, usług i osób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże podejście Komisji do kwestii polskich stoczni zaprzecza tym deklaracjom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak Grupa Socjalistów i Demokratów z przyjemnością udzieli temu kompromisowi swojego poparcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem wywieramy pewien wpływ, a celem konferencji w Kopenhadze jest ograniczenie go\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co więcej, proponuje się, by Trybunał wypełniał wspomniane zadanie przewidziane w traktacie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy dzisiaj wyrazić wyraźne żądanie przerwania ognia, lecz to nie wystarczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem, kluczowe będą szczególnie sprawy granic i podziału zasobów ropy naftowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grupa Ataka głosuje za odrzuceniem sprawozdania z postępów Turcji, ponieważ nie dostrzegamy żadnych postępów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.892,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyna droga naprzód polega na poszukiwaniu nowych rodzajów produkcji drogą badań, rozwoju i innowacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś myślał, że się boję albo mi się znudziło, więc mówię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa powinna pójść swoją własną drogą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Adekwatne i bezpieczne systemy emerytalne są równoznaczne z długoterminową umową międzypokoleniową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni to właśnie porwali Maciusia i pod obcem nazwiskiem osadzili w najcięższem więzieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec chcę zwrócić się do tych, którzy protestują przeciwko nieproporcjonalnemu działaniu Izraela\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej dziedzinie można zdziałać bardzo wiele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktat ten wejdzie w życie tylko wtedy, gdy zostanie ratyfikowany przez wszystkie państwa członkowskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez ostatnie dziesięć lat jej działalność była ściśle powiązana z posiedzeniami plenarnymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsze oznaki są już widoczne w niektórych regionach strefy euro\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, ratowanie Opla pozostaje we wspólnym interesie całej Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35918912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugim celem pozostaje ochrona praw podstawowych, stanowiących fundament Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydano fortunę, a rzeczywisty cel tego systemu nie został osiągnięty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, co możemy zrobić, aby lepiej zapobiegać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy na własne oczy przekonaliśmy się, jakie są tego skutki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam małą propozycję dla pana oraz dla wszystkich przewodniczących, którzy przewodniczą w trakcie głosowań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.82,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę go zapewnić, że budżet Rzecznika Praw Obywatelskich został zatwierdzony przez Radę bez zmian\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.756,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo to wyrażam wątpliwość co do skuteczności i uczciwości dobrowolnego systemu rejestracji lobbystów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Judym drgnął i krzywe spojrzenie cisnął w natręta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walczyliście przeciw etykietowaniu potomstwa, co stanowiło minimalny wspólny mianownik z Radą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dysponujemy już tą strategią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.396,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy w tym celu europejskiego programu ramowego, aby zapewnić harmonizację między państwami członkowskimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.188,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na początku chciałbym podziękować krajowi piastującemu prezydencję, Portugalii, za doskonałą i przejrzystą współpracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieodłączny problem polega na tym, że model ten nie uwzględnia zasobów ani zanieczyszczenia środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"naruszeń przestrzeni powietrznej oraz incydentów na Morzu Egejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym nie popierają środków prowadzących do niepotrzebnego zwiększania kosztów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto tak twierdzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równie znamienne jest to, że posłowie z brytyjskiej Partii Pracy wstrzymali się od głosu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestia jądrowa nadal stanowi problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W dzisiejszych czasach pracownicy są zdani na częste i ryzykowne zmiany zawodowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że byłoby to oszukiwaniem konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zarządzanie sytuacjami kryzysowymi poprzez solidarność i odpowiedzialność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te negatywne skutki budzą szczególny niepokój w moim kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na projekt zalecenia spojrzałem również pod kątem moich zainteresowań geopolitycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem okazuje się, że pojawiają się tam tendencje bardzo niepokojące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, iż to się dzieje teraz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdajemy sobie sprawę ze znaczenia gromadzenia odpowiednich danych statystycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liberalizacja, konkurencja i rozdzielenie własności nie doprowadzą automatycznie do obniżenia cen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wezwała państwa członkowskie do ratyfikacji i wdrażania konwencji, ale bez większego rezultatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczność międzynarodowa osiągnęła w Cancun pewien postęp\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słusznie podkreślacie państwo ten aspekt - a uczyniło to dzisiejszego wieczoru kilkoro z państwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy wziąć z niej przykład - wysłać Rosji jasny i zdecydowany komunikat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ci, którzy są jej zwolennikami, powinni przedstawić uzasadnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym prosić, aby zdał sobie sprawę, że w kilku pozycjach tak się nie stanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że była to bardzo istotna debata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35919940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie, panie przewodniczący, chciałabym podziękować sprawozdawcom pomocniczym i innym kolegom za wspaniałą współpracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35920143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zażądaliśmy jednak w naszych wyjaśnieniach, by Komisja doprecyzowała niektóre szczegóły\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35920144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieją praktyczne argumenty przemawiające za wielojęzycznością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35920145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zawsze jest on im przyjazny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35920146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugiej stronie jest jakaś organizacja terrorystyczna, właściwie nie wiadomo kto\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35920147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzeba odpowiedniej regulacji w handlu w ujęciu światowym jest niezmiernie ważna w okresie globalizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35920211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie sądzę, aby stwierdzenie, iż nic nie robiliśmy, było sprawiedliwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35920212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzrost dobrobytu Unii Europejskiej i jej wpływu na arenie międzynarodowej to wielkie osiągnięcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35920214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie jest szkodliwe, a jego skutki są przewrotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35920215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"budzą u nich odrazę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35920216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wielu silników napędzanych ropą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie powinien był mi uciec!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dłonie przedtem ściśnięte w pięść rozwarły się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam, panowie, byłem tego zdania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daję panu na to słowo honoru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy się pobrać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym roku nie odbył się pokaz sztucznych ogni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dumą i radością zapłonęło mi serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dognaliśmy na odległość strzału do naszych straży przednich, zanim zaprzestali ścigania mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Indyk myślał o niedzieli, a w sobotę łeb mu ścieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bronił się, jak dziki kot, ale co zdziałać mógł swą krótką bronią?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle podniósłszy głowę rzucił wzrokiem dokoła siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy obierze po pięć garstek, no i będzie z bani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech jeszcze raz tego nie usłyszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22910982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz robić tylko to, co ci każę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz już czas, abyśmy ułożyli nasz plan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Plecak cię zbyt nie obciąża?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam jestem „bratem“ i znam ich działalność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To samo czyni człowiek, czołgający się po ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś blady, jak płótno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jużeś pan naraził na szwank całą naszą wyprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak to dobranoc? Jest siódma rano!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję już, jak ono mnie ogarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"iż zbliża się chwila ucieczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim razie muszę je sobie sam zabrać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pendolino dojadę tam w niecałe dwie godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego mam panu oddać moje ubranie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według mapy obliczyłem sobie odległość do szczytu góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest jeszcze coś co pana intryguje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy indziej wyjaśniono, że dostał się \\\"prawdopodobnie\\\" do niemieckiej czy austriackiej niewoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd możemy przejść prosto na drugą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepszy wróbel w garści, niż gołąb na dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słyszałem nic i nic nie widziałem, ale wiem doskonale co to było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pański rudowłosy koncept był nowy i efektowny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy to puścić w tle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaiste, to była freudowska pomyłka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko wypracowałem sobie plan wyprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez nowego dekodera nie pominiesz reklam w telewizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sto ataków nieznanej tropikalnej choroby, dyskrasia, dyzynteria, dyspepsia, dysuria, dysforia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd wziąłeś plakietkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewam się, że w przeciągu godziny sprawa się skończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz pan, pańska głowa jest jeszcze za twarda dla najlepszej pięści w Bristolu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę znaleźć pomysł na nazwę dla mojej firmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pułkownikowi towarzyszył jakiś kulas w czarnym ubiorze, w białym krawacie i białych mankietach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Własny rozum powinien panu powiedzieć, że nie pozostawało mi nic innego do roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za hańba dla nas mieć takich sprzymierzeńców!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął i zaczął się uważnie przysłuchiwać memu opowiadaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiał teraz ilość i jakość błędów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatrzymałem się i ukryłem w cieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest, gra jego była warta stawki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przestań tak ostro skręcać, aż żygać mi się chce!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gadasz głupoty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego wyświetlacz ma niską gęstość pikseli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byłem wtedy online.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O której godzinie jutro przyjedziesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zbrodnię jego nie można było znaleźć określenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki ten maluch przybiegł i coś zwinął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynajmę to mieszkanie za ustaloną kwotę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cesarz patrzył jednak przed siebie tak martwo, jakby zobaczył jakiegoś upiora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochodzi z szyszaków, przyłbic i z pancerzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"spytał Sherlock Holmes.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odparłem ten cios i odciąłem mu pół pióra od jego hełmu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co do wieku, byli ode mnie starsi, ale pod każdym innym względem młodsi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"rzekł surowo, to w istocie jest bardzo ważna rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale obawiam się, iż takie rzeczy przekraczają zdolności huzara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekali na ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci Anglicy są wspaniałomyślnymi przeciwnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie siorb, bo to niekulturalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie z tchórzostwa, lecz dla idei!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że musi powracać do więzienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spadł na ziemię, łamiąc z trzaskiem kilka gałęzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile czasu będzie trwać wycieczka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam spostrzegłem też i stos drzewa, który miałem okupić tak drogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A po kiego ci mój numer telefonu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tem wszystkiem pozyskanie wolnego miejsca nie wydawało się tak bardzo łatwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tak patrzyłem, przedstawił się moim oczom widok, który mnie wprawił w zdumienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz marszałkowi, że uczyniłem wszystko, co było w mej mocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędzej prędzej na wroga...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja i mój sztab jemy śniadanie w mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zaraz spojrzał na mnie stary prezydent, jak tygrys na swój łup.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyświadcz mi pan teraz małą usługę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie nadeszła godzina wyruszenia w drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zepsuł mi się zasilacz od laptopa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszyłem więc tylko ramionami i nie odpowiedziałem nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczerze mówiąc, Twitter jest dla mnie zbyt... wciągający.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najważniejszy w samochodzie nie jest silnik tylko karoseria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Groza położenia wytrzeźwiła go od razu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasłużyli sobie na dzielnego dowódcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto ona, może ją pan sam przeczyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trybunał was uwolni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas na przemoc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było zatem wszystko, co zyskałem po tylu trudach i tak ciężkiej pracy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak po prostu wymyśliłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głos mi się złamał i zamilczałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam teraz na to pomysłu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten przynajmniej poślubił i to jest zawsze pociecha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje mi się, iż gdyby był jeszcze minutę stał w milczeniu, straciłbym zmysły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na rozsądnych i dzielnych ludziach wcale mi zbywa... Urwał nagle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22911200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeniec chce uciekać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośród wszystkich dni i nocy, ta jedna noc stała się najwyższym ziszczeniem mego bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz przypomniał sobie i zapragnął mieć blisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki jest twój ulubiony film?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się tak męczyć do pierwszej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na szyszce i wsłuchał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Coo? W jaki sposób wiedziałaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarzyczka jego nabrała dziwnego wyrazu — począł poruszać ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest w tej nieszczęśliwej coś niepokojącego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał o wspaniałych lokomotywach, które odjeżdżają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mimo wszystko nie trzeba mi było pozwolić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hubert jak zwykle palnął jakiś suchar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozdrów Pana swego, jak na cię przystało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Metoda moja jest czysto psychologiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co teraz będzie? Janek uśmiechnął się i odpowiedział: — Nic się nie zmieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O tych podziemiach chodziły po mieście tylko głuche wieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku niby nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Burza toczy się nad nami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błagać ją o co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy mówię, że czary, to czary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz to nowe fale ciemności opadały na nich, jak czarny śnieg; wolno prószyła ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju ciekawie obejrzał bratanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo w usta, albo tak cię przyciśnie, że żebra bolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyźni krążyli koło prostytutek, jak tokujące gołębie; śmieszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów, Tereso, w dziewczynę się zmień!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór niespokojnie wzdrygnął się na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie te środki wypróbował autor osobiście ze znakomitym skutkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale sama wtedy nie spała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to sprzyjać jedynie pracy mechanicznej, nie wymagającej twórczego wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyła nauczycielka, ale myśli, że się przyzwyczają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obojętne, czy mówi do jednego słuchacza, czy do stu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli tak i nie myśleli o niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I płacz ograniczał się do skurczów przełyku i tchawicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jedyny dla ciebie ratunek — powtórzył z naciskiem — Jedyny, powtarzam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zbytkuj! — pogroził jej palcem na nosie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszło pół roty wojska, otoczyło dwór i zabudowania i zrewidowano wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko z trudem uratowaliśmy córkę, której groziło poważne niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno tu ma się coś takiego robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotował się kretyn do tej nocy bohaterskiej jak toreador.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzwonił długo, bardzo długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mam co robić — ciągnęła dalej Mary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie wasza dziewka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę stąd iść — powiedziała Ewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szedł powoli, niby chmura jesienna, a potem usiadł na tronie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzęta tłumaczą sobie owo prawo inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc jeszcze bardziej je to zachęciło i jeszcze więcej zaczęły dawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był pani ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka trocha mi nie wystarcza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc by tańczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby się wstydziły, że powiedzą nie tak, jak trzeba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powitał ich śmiech: wszyscy byli trochę podchmieleni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przejdę przez ogród i popatrzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, wszystko jedno!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrazy te przeszyły Cezarego do szpiku kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekka nieobecność samego siebie w świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powiem, bo nie chcę, żeby mieli przykrości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdy nie kochamy, doznajemy spokoju i możemy grzać się w słońcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o to…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idziemy jutro pograć w kosza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dla niego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię do ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gadaj teraz, gdzie się dziewka ukrywa? — zagadnął Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten drugi pojechał na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzą o tym ci, którzy zaczęli go choćby z lekka nadużywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic dziwnego; jest pan wychowankiem miasta…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani dietetyk kazała mi ograniczać spożywanie alkoholu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni ponoć nie uważali tej kobiety za dobrą opiekunkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota myślał, że to skrzep, i próbował operować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cudowna celowość natury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś kiedyś potem tych dwoje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby się miało grzęznąć coraz głębiej, choćby się wiedziało, że koniec będzie zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to są skutki alkoholu, rzec by można, dodatnie, ale chwilowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I siedzę na dnie i czekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za pozwoleniem — wstrzymałem go gestem — nie miałem zamiaru częstować cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie domyślam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W uszach dzwoniła wciąż na alarm krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem przed willą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjechał Seweryn i wydano ją bez gadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedno z podstawowych dzieł starszego okultyzmu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie takiej fizycznej ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zaczął śmiać się wreszcie z naszego zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła chwila ogólnego, nie wyłączając wora, milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym tle nastąpił ogromny rozwój rękodzieła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pałac Branickich jest zabytkiem wartym obejrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem trochę znużona przechadzką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko było po dawnemu zwyczajne, codzienne i przeciętne…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjawy stają się coraz bardziej nieprzyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy zerwali się z miejsc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczyła jego wywrócone oczy i połyskujące białka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę już przyszłe losy mego dzieła…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem tyłek całowała i jadła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rzeczywiście — odpowiedziała — spotkaliśmy ją oboje niedawno na ulicy w porze wieczornej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie zwyczajne „nie”, ani patetyczne, ani ciche, i tym „nie” przywiązała go do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ma co martwić się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzi go ze wszystkimi szczegółami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, już nie powiem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lśniła się od zgrzebnej, zrudziałej na słońcu czystości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20651971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiał sprzątnąć i dostał od nas niezłe wymyślanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aresztowano dwóch sprawców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśl europejska dała nam długą historię znaczenia symboli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak państwo wiedzą, ramowa dyrektywa wodna proponuje podejście łączące kontrole emisji z normami jakości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwólcie mi to powiedzieć - i mówię to do wyborców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tak niepewnych czasach należy przede wszystkim zachować ostrożność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, powszechne prawo do opieki zdrowotnej cały czas bardzo odbiega od rzeczywistości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że wówczas przeważył nasz punkt widzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważamy, że decyzje dotyczące polityki leśnej powinny być nadal podejmowane przez państwa członkowskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"chłoście przeciwni są również malezyjscy prawnicy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zgodne \\\"nie\\\" wobec amunicji kasetowej w Europie i na całym świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pan widzi, mamy przed sobą długą drogę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Druga to przestrzeganie reguł dyscypliny budżetowej i należyte zarządzanie finansami ustanowione w porozumieniu międzyinstytucjonalnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właśnie jest zarzut osobisty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lizbona była nieporozumieniem i Irlandczycy wiedzieli czemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krytykowano ją za jej politykę w Chinach prowadzoną przez lata i kwestionującą wspomniane motto\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeglądy budżetowe są zawsze przydatne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Została uwzględniona w pierwszym z głosowań podzielonych i została odrzucona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy dwadzieścia jeden lat później musimy przedstawiać tak bezbarwne sformułowania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie oznacza to jednak, że musimy zaniechać zorganizowanej regulacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbowaliśmy to naprawić w biurze składania dokumentów i zostało to poprawione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na świecie panuje dziś dziwna sytuacja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"patrz protokół z posiedzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O tym nie wolno jednak mówić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie przewodniczący, szanowni posłowie do Parlamentu Europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czynnika demograficznego i czynnika religijnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze działania muszą być mądre i skuteczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej okazał pan godne odnotowania zainteresowanie moim okręgiem wyborczym, czyli Irlandią Północną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy afrykańscy przywódcy wyraźnie przedstawili problemy powodowane przez niektóre metody, których tak zażarcie bronimy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biorąc pod uwagę wyżej wymienione aspekty, popieram to sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja koordynowała również współpracę w zakresie transpozycji, w celu uniknięcia niewłaściwej transpozycji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim chcę podkreślić nową politykę wprowadzania kultury na warunkach określonych w komunikacie Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem jednogłośne stanowisko Unii w rozmowach z Rosją leży w interesie obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To główna cecha projektu programu sztokholmskiego autorstwa prezydencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy dyskryminować jakiejś choroby, tak samo jak nie możemy dyskryminować jakiegoś kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwólcie, że zakończę kilkoma prostymi słowami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drogie Koleżanki, Drodzy Koledzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wypadek gdyby wystąpiły problemy ze słyszalnością lub łącznością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie ekstradycja została sprowadzona do czysto biurokratycznej formalności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też głosowaliśmy za jego odrzuceniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To również jest nasz sukces\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Celem dyrektywy jest także lepsza ochrona inwestorów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brytyjscy konserwatyści nie zaakceptują tych nieprawidłowości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poważną barierę stanowią ogromne koszty, z jakimi wiąże się handel transgraniczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy chcemy dać ombudsmana też nielegalnym imigrantom?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysięczne dzięki i gratulacje za wynik referendum\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako Europejczycy powinniśmy zadbać, byśmy nie narażali się na takie oskarżenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdawca Niels Busk kładzie silny nacisk na potrzebę monitoringu i kontroli przestrzegania przepisów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27390778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wniosek ten został poparty większością głosów w Komisji Gospodarczej i Monetarnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proces akcesyjny musi jednakże uwzględniać niektóre fakty historyczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Projekt unijny jest oczywiście projektem unikalnym, wielokrotnie to podkreślaliśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"produkty pochodzące ze szczepionych zwierząt nie powinny być dyskryminowane na rynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy wyciągnąć wnioski z popełnionych błędów, aby uniknąć ich w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że poparcie przedmiotowego sprawozdania wyraźną większością głosów ma niezwykle istotne znaczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwolę sobie skorzystać z okazji i pogratulować pięciu państwom członkowskim, które już tego dokonały\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasady w tej kwestii są zupełnie jasne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mają one szczególne znaczenie w sektorze produkcyjnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowi ona przypadkową mieszaninę różnych zaleceń i wniosków o ustanowienie prawodawstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie, wczoraj przedstawiła je ona Parlamentowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto po otrzymaniu wyników badań i dochodzeń, będziemy mogli pomyśleć o przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę stwierdzić, że sytuacja w dziedzinie telekomunikacji bywa czasami zupełnie nie do przyjęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, o czym mówił przed chwilą szanowny poseł, to nie jest demokracja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy T potrzebują więcej pieniędzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest tak, że są państwa członkowskie, które nie zrobiły nic, zupełnie nic\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Termin \\\"gospodarka niskowęglowa\\\" jest obecnie przedstawiany jako kompromisowa formuła Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspólnie możemy wiele osiągnąć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to niestety stały fragment politycznej rzeczywistości w tych dwóch krajach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, musi zostać opracowany plan gospodarki odpadami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Andrew Symeou utrzymuje, że nie ma absolutnie nic wspólnego z zarzucanym mu przestępstwem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego, co pan powiedział wnoszę, że niewiele pan myśli o tych sprawach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że takie postępowanie jest całkowicie nie do zaakceptowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to ambitna strategia, ale mam do niej kilka uwag\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hiszpański klub piłkarski Real Madryt ma flagę i hymn\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest faktem historycznym, że regiony te były dawniej jedną z jednostek regionu Karpat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.964,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To objaw wspólnych, demokratycznych i proeuropejskich przekonań, które żywi przeważająca większość tego Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nie chciałam, aby takie spotkanie odbyło się od razu w sprawie Pakistanu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gospodarki są wzajemnie powiązane i konsekwencje zarządzania gospodarką działają w obie strony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto będzie je przechowywał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27391391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze byłoby, aby Unia miała osobę odpowiedzialną za tę właśnie stronę, czyli za dialog\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27395929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.532,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego podkreślam swoje zaangażowanie na rzecz utworzenia rzeczywiście autonomicznej europejskiej polityki bezpieczeństwa i obrony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27395930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykorzystywanie dzieci, w tym seksualne, jest jedną z najpoważniejszych bolączek społecznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27395934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spadają ceny, jakie uzyskują rolnicy za swoje produkty, ale nie te, które płacą konsumenci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27395936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wiele sposobów umożliwiających lepsze radzenie sobie z tym problemem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27395986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym Komisja może poprzeć przedmiotowy kompromis\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27395988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kryzys nie może także być okazją do wprowadzania nowych, nadmiernie obciążających regulacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27395989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że niektóre polskie rządy popełniły wiele błędów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27395991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stabilizuje rynki, zachęca do długofalowego inwestowania i zapewnia identyfikowalność potrzebną do kontroli poszczególnych transakcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27395993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robią dziś Amerykanie i inne główne mocarstwa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysłuchałem również ostatnich dwóch oświadczeń Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy pamiętać, że co tydzień na świecie jest wiele tego rodzaju bardzo przygnębiających przypadków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przekonana, że ta instytucja jest bardzo potrzebna Unii Europejskiej i jej państwom członkowskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego w żadnym razie nie można uznać za swobodę wyrażania poglądów!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament zdecydował się podnieść stawkę, traktując wszystkie instrumenty jako jeden pakiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie te dyrektywy zawierają mechanizmy odwoławcze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu nie będziemy w stanie bez niej przetrwać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli mogę, chciałabym w pełni wykorzystać teraz czas przeznaczony na przemowę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotychczasowa strategia Banku Światowego w dziedzinie energii nie przyniosła wymiernych efektów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem nie ma sensu oszukiwać tutaj ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielu z Państwa mówiło, jak bardzo bezbronna jest ta grupa pracowników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W myśl tego założenia Komisja prowadzi swoje działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27396058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawy francuskich polityków dotyczące ich gospodarki i miejsc pracy w stoczniach są zrozumiałe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym czasie czytał już książki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc czemuż się ich obawiać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkradała się jak kot tylnym wejściem, aby nie mówiono do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bawię się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zacząć od samego mojego wyboru książki na nasze zajęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak śmiesznie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i pokój był przesycony zapachem kasztana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I on to zrobił bez prezerwatywy, zresztą mam już miesiączkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wtedy byłem nieszczęśliwy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są, zdaje się, w jednym wie ku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie broniła, milcząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bartek odszedł ze swymi wilkami — wybrał się na polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakimże to sposobem sześćdziesiąt i pięć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To trup — oświadczyłem po chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby tak było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiosłował powoli, z odpoczynkami, żeby się nie zmęczyć tak bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytali je najczęściej na spotkaniach, rzadziej w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęły się nad nimi zbierać czarne chmury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostałem właśnie Twojego maila dotyczącego naszego wyjazdu służbowego do Paryża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu obraz zaczyna wirować, już znikł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak biegły dni szczęśliwe, niezmącone niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy utkwione w powałę, twarz azjatycka, bez wyrazu, nieludzka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec nieznacznie poprawił się na swym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośliznąłeś się, więc wolniej, ostrożniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy możemy od razu przejść do konkretnych ustaleń?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Meduzy nie bieskie i różowe kołysały się jak kwiaty o grubych i miękkich koronach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy mówił o widmowej twarzy, oczy Hanny rozszerzyły się przerażeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyli pamięta pani moment wprowadzania gimnazjów już z perspektywy nauczyciela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co nas obu może łączyć ze sobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tekst opracowany na podstawie: Antoni Lange, W czwartym wymiarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście zabieg nie był mi obcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I w dodatku, temu brak ręki, a owemu nogi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem położył ołówek i papier przed sobą, co nie było jego zwyczajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakończywszy zwycięsko czwartą z rzędu partię, pożegnałem się i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smok nie był poplecznikiem świętego stanu małżeńskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem czują się zapomniane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieka przed tym duszącym dymem, wciąż kichając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włazić w skórę innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiał pan czytać, jak polują na foki, na morsy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żłopią coś w ranach tej czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał mnóstwo wszelakich książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazywają go Przyjacielem całego świata, a zowią go także Przyjacielem gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy na dobre zamilkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak przeważnie widziałem je leżące w łóżkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam na ciebie dość długo, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent z objawami grypy trafił dzisiaj do naszej przychodni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ty wyjdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj, po długich, długich latach porzuciła ową ziemię lśniącą życiem i słońcem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Opłatek cudzysłowu” należy wziąć w cudzysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ty piłeś wódkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cel uświęca środki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zabijają go na wiele sprytnych sposobów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj Paweł zatrzymał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie publiczne musi być organiczne lub mechaniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W latarniach, które były wmurowane do bram domów, syczały kaganki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W zaczarowanym pałacu, jeśli już chcesz koniecznie wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to nawet ładnie z naszej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba siedzieć całą noc z otwartymi oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widzisz, mnie tak potrzebny scyzoryk, a tobie na nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z jakiego? — Nie gniewaj się, że będę przykry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się wygada, bo go tęsknota jak cholera trapi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co właściwie stanęło na przeszkodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przekona się pan o tym wkrótce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przecież feministą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę pani w czymś pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę się dalej bawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie widzę związku z naszą rozmową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często okazuje się, że jest zbyt zrównoważony i zrobiony za logicznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawdopodobnie będzie najlepsze określenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze było przed kolacją i nudził się, i przykrzyło mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skończone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masaż jest relaksujący i zarazem leczniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy świeciły jasno, cisza była niezmierzona…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwoje Narcyzów między sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Winien jestem w ten czy inny sposób poświęcić swe życie dla ojczyzny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy ona uszła jeszcze kilka kroków, z uśmiechem zawróciła i znalazła go, bez szukania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I doskonale tłumaczy sny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jest dla ciebie w życiu najważniejsze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co zobaczył, poza śmiesznością jej pozycji, było dziwne i poniosło go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce zaszło, zmierzch padł na rzekę i światła zaczęły się ukazywać wzdłuż brzegu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się, wydając jakieś rozkazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie przyjemnie się wypróbować albo pokazać, że się nie boję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręgosłup moralny nie pozwoliłby ani pani, ani mnie robić wspólnie interesów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ja panu coś powiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna być kimś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król odbywa dalekie wycieczki łodzią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi z kolei kulawiec zauważył wszystko, co się stało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję dookoła siebie złe, wrogie mi wiry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A przysięga uroczysta, to nic? — zapytała pantera, pokazując zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwariowany chodził za psami na ulicy, całował je i lizał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba wycierpieć i coś stracić, żeby zyskać więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pocałuję nikogo! — odrzekła dziwożona ze stanowczością, potrząsając worem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz już prawo jazdy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama niech nie udaje świętej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chory pokpiwa sobie z lekarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebracy leżeli w słoneczne dni na trotuarze i spali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko zachowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakie to piękne, seniora — rzekłem w zamyśleniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo może pan stać, jeśli tak jest wygodniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stało się to, co się nie zawsze i nie każdemu przytrafia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesunąłem się obok katedry i wszedłem w ulicę, którą mi opisano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po polach szedł chrapliwy, złowrogi, przytłumiony odgłos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktór, widząc, że słowa jego odniosły pożądany skutek, jął go teraz pocieszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biedaczysko zwalił się ciężko, jak kłoda, z czoła trysnęła rubinowa nitka...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Że popełniał on zbrodnię jedyną w swoim rodzaju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdziwa to dla nas nowina mieć gości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęśliwym trafem miałem w kieszeni dwa spore kawałki maślanego placka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drgnąłem i posłałem w bok prędkie spojrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaśmiała się, rada z dowcipu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czerwone języki strzelały wysoko w górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To już po raz drugi narobił mi takiego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona drwi z nas obu, przyjacielu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawiera mądrość, jakiej nikt jeszcze nie poznał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głowicy osadzony był zapalnik wtłoczeniowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne musiał to być umówiony sygnał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw z panem, panie majorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było już ratunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie robił komentarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z ust złodzieja wybiegły jakieś gniewne słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpił potem jakiś jęk i wszystko ucichło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg jeden wie tylko, co działo się przez pierwsze kilka minut!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj sierżant się zatrzymał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On tymczasem ujmował czarny worek i zarzucił na ramię swój płaszcz granatowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadanie moje jest skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz oto świat zmartwychwstał i życie znów kwitło na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On ma wygląd zwierzęcy i charakter musi mieć zwierzęcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale kołysała się bez przerwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeroko wyginał łokcie i co chwila podnosił do oczu perspektywę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wszystko potoczy się dawnym trybem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepodobna było jednak dosięgnąć tych szczytów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był blady, jak ściana, ale trzymał się dzielnie wobec otaczających go zbójów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągnęli za sobą swoje młotki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było jednak żadnej rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prysnęła gdzieś jego myśliwską ambicja i zajęła go tylko jedna myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nocy ubiegłej miałem z nim zdarzenie nadzwyczajne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie doktór dopiero powrócił, bo jeszcze stał powóz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W około szarzały niezliczone sylwetki śpiących towarzyszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem przyszła mi myśl do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był więcej, niż średniego wzrostu, wysoki, smukły, ale nadzwyczajnie chudy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale o tem mogli się dowiedzieć tylko od niego samego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy się pobrać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co przeraziło go tak bardzo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy bezsprzecznie, najoczywiściej ożyli!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grymas ten uderzał na twarzach tych wszystkich, którzy umarli od trucizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak istnieją, i nie są bez znaczenia, nawet u naszego młodego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszej chwili sądziłem, iż jestem ugodzony kulą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opisywał przebieg owej sprawy z najdrobniejszymi niemal szczegółami i znów zaczynał od początku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mam począć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie żałował wyrazów i teraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiwnął mi głową i oddalił się, kulejąc mocno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nawet nie zrozumiesz mię pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włosy posiada brunatne z odcieniem kasztanowatym, przechodzącym niemal w złoty u końców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy może być cel piękniejszy, niż dobro ludzkości?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klęczeli nad nią i przyglądali się jej uważnie przy świetle latarki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najgorszy chwast współczesnej cywilizacji, rozkosz plotkarzy i hańba ludzi, mających poczucie własnej godności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy będę posiadał już dość siły, aby zapisać to wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pobladł i mówił z takiem przekonaniem, że musiała mu wierzyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem wykryć, kto był tym nieszczęśliwym towarzyszem mojej niedoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umieściłem wczoraj tę amebę pod mikroskopem, którego szkiełka zalepiłem hermetycznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiem wam to ściśle według prawdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radzę wam, abyście poszli za moim przykładem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak rażąc i kopiąc, posuwali go ku drzwiom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22257999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzecz miała miejsce w poniedziałek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to jakby sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piękna pani spogląda na niego wzrokiem błagalnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpocznę sobie z tydzień po ukończeniu pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko stanęło mi w jednej chwili przed oczyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie podniosła się na mnie żadna ręka, aby mnie aresztować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy jeszcze nie widziałem oczu, tak pełnych życia intensywnego, mocnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałem zawsze, iż dotąd jeszcze nie przebaczyła mi dawnego traktowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chory, ranny, czy nie żyje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem wiedzieć, kto się znajduje w środku, ale musiałem się odważyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan i pani byliby tu jak niemowlęta w powijakach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy zamykałem dziennik generała, zaczynało już świtać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysoki młodzieniec nachyla się i stara odsunąć ją od niego...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyzna, stojący obok niej, pochyla się ku dołowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to za radość, kiedy pan stanie u celu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to pogodne poddanie, które łączy w sobie wiedzę i religię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To budynek klubowy, jeśli się nie mylę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minęło znowu kilkanaście minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzej studenci wydali jednogłośny okrzyk radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy młodzieńca błyszczały gniewem, irytacja wzdymała jego policzki o oliwkowej cerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zagrała trąbka i oznajmiła zaprzestanie ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzrok jego złagodniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dajny to także pieśni ludyczne, wyrażające radość z uciech życia doczesnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22258051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gruncie rzeczy byliśmy szczerymi przyjaciółmi i żywiliśmy dla siebie wzajem głębokie uznanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym zbiegł cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na osobności, tylko na osobności!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doszedł wkrótce do palisady, otaczającej cały domek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sen pełen majaków, zmagań i widm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrodziła się ciekawość poznania, z kim się właściwie miało do czynienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak kamień w wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbował wszystkiego, co mu strzeliło do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pół czaszki oddziela się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Połów był przedziwny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył drzwi, szedł wolno w piżamie wzdłuż korytarza, wykładanego zielonym linoleum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym posyłali do siebie Józię, młodą pokojówkę Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba będzie samej wyjechać na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aha, jeszcze jej stosunek do morza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podwiezie mnie pan pod moje mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem nie do rozwiązania…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dziwią już liczne komentarze na temat jej najnowszego dzieła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił, machając dłonią, kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ile lat kończysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona krzyknęła: — Jakie ładne suknie! — i podeszła do wystawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz przede wszystkim postawię ci jeden zasadniczy warunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warczała jak pies, któremu zabierają kość; kością była jej zupełna samotność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było stanąć w „ogonku” i poczekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leje jak z cebra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wezwał Andrzeja do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po pokoju i udaję, że nie wiem, o co chodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lubisz kogoś? — Ale skąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż ja teraz zrobię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No dobrze już, dobrze — odparła, podając mu rękę na pożegnanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziwne: muszka mogła fruwać, a człowiek nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rewolucja huczała rozpętana i zwycięska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem jasno Jego istnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz muszę stać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idziemy jutro pograć w kosza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W porządku, aktywowałem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil jest jak dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest znowu nieznane miasto i obcy zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I on niewiele więcej wie o tobie, aniżeli ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocham ciebie, jak nigdy nie kochałam nikogo…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym kapitanem i gospodarzem był dyrektor różnych towarzystw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Mój chłopcze, mama obiecała mi dzisiaj, że pojadę sama na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drgnął jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech i łopot serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc poszedłem na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nerwie i mózgu i serce świata!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A on mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustawodawstwo i inne środki stworzą mu wszelkie możliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil mówi, że to wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Księża za granicą nie chodzą już w takich spódnicach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli, powoli, myślisz, opanujesz ją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Głowę zawracasz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może pod wpływem skruchy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała otwory w tej walizce, żeby się nie udusiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszła w towarzystwie koleżanek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani wierzy we wróżby?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona oznajmiła gestem, że chciałaby także coś robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka takich pisemnych relacji udało się już zebrać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mu się wyśmiewać z ciebie, a sam pójdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę uszanować i moją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale dlaczego musiało być właśnie wtedy? — Nie martwisz się, że było wtedy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słuchasz mnie w ogóle?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, dziecko, dziecko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego tu szukasz? — zapytałem ostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nią nie jest — wie prawie zawsze, co by ją mogło uczynić szczęśliwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciekam z siebie powoli, zostaje miękka skorupa, zdeformowany kształt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybór masz wolny… — szepnął głosem drżącym i spuściwszy głowę, znieruchomiał od wstydu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzenie Ani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Manna po niemiecku, a Manna tak swobodnie, jak Emil po polsku S.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wstydź się, ja też nie bardzo umiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie dość dziwne powtórzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ty, kobieta do głębi, nie jesteś sentymentalna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam tylko na rozkaz, bym mogła zabrać tacę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki kamień, który ma zastąpić kotwicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umiarkowanie postawiona kwestia skazana jest z góry na zagładę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sama ci odradza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodowany ciekawością poszedłem za nią, zachowując dyskretny dystans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy uśmiechnął się dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdyby chłopiec — byłoby śmiesznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wybuchu śmiechu zaci nało się coś w niej: zegar, który przestał nagle chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem długo jak wryty, nie mogąc uczynić kroku naprzód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię spać przy otwartym oknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z półotwartych ust wychylał się język długi, wąski, czarny jak węgiel…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy to nie za słodkie, jak na wino?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co wy rozumiecie w polityce?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajmiemy godzinę i spotkamy się w jadalni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pamiętam kiedy ostatni raz widziałem policjanta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedna z nich jest znacznie krótsza od drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gra świąteczna muzyka, mamy świeczki, jedzenie i fajnych ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z trwogą podawano sobie wiadomość o stopniu ich gwałtowności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnęła, aby jak najprędzej ją zrozumiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś się stało mojej matce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucać im przeznaczenia, których treścią byłby czysty przypadek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim — znikły wszelkie towary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ciemno i nie zapalił światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz sługa nie dała zbić się z tropu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, na upór nie ma lekarstwa, może was inni przekonają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pamiętam — odparł, biorąc skwapliwie do ręki woskowy odlew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie kroki czyjeś zbliżyły się do drzwi biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjący i umarły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I potem dziesiątki wejść i wyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt by ode mnie nie przepisywał przykładów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ruszył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do domu było jeszcze daleko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie zaprzeczam ich istnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich szczególniej czasach przyjaciele wzajem na siebie uskarżać się nie mogli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem, że nasza załoga była przygotowana na podobne zajście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem obróciłam się do ściany i chciałam spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł miał wstać już trzy drzemki temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Królu, proszę o turniej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobieta rozejrzała się nerwowo i zmrużyła oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna być ciekawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są stłoczone i nie mają tla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o to…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytywana o to, odpowiadała wymijająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki idiotyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Bez kartki meldunkowej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pamiątkę, dziewulinko? — spytał domyślnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój Boże, jak wąska jest via media.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem mieć wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjęła list z jego zaciśniętej pięści i natychmiast posłała po lekarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powoli, stary, tylko aby nie za prędko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasadę tę stosuje się zarówno w stosunku do dziecka, jak i do jego rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ciągle się myj i myj! — krzyczy ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nic nie mówisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panno Zofio, dzisiaj mnie znowu wezmą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrapał się na okno i zajrzał do środka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gruncie rzeczy zadowolona jestem z tego, co zaszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę i nic nie rozu miem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A może zauważyłeś coś niezwykłego w czasie snu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20709111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tędy droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wiem wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak usunął jego dłoń natrętną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wchodzi się dwa razy do tej samej rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec jęczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł jej niczym zastąpić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy w szkole jest ci przyjemnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz, teraz, wszystko to wydawało mi się dzieciństwem i marnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda w Krakowie jest dzisiaj całkiem ładna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwila ciszy takiej, że słychać było chrzęst badyla, który się uginał pod ciężarem jaszczurki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali powinni się usunąć… — ciągnął dalej Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im za to płacą, niech się grzebią w gównie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardziej wierzę naukowcom niż politykom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktuję cię jak dziewczynkę, bo nią trochę jesteś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Spij, smarkaczu! Zobaczył, że zasypia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znowu najechałeś na mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że nie jesteś już normalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciszkiem do niej, ciszkiem, żeby nie uciekła! — ostrzegł półgłosem kulawiec, badawczo obzierając dziuplę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawia się pejzaż górski, wulkaniczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze się składa, że niczyja! — pochwycił kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstydziłam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauka ta jest bezpłatna i obowiązkowa, przynajmniej w zakresie szkoły podstawowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polała się krew z ust moich, przeto odchodzę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janek przyszedł pewnego razu z miną, która oznaczała „coś się stało”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci i ryby głosu nie mają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To stało się ideałem mego życia i przysiągłem sobie zostać co najmniej sekretarzem sądu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się opierał o ciebie i o ścianę i podejdę do okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwaliła mnie pani, że dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to i dobrze, że tam nie pojechaliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Rynku będzie można odwiedzić stragany z najróżniejszymi wyrobami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc ich tam chyba nie zostawisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym być jakimś takim dzikim kotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że rozmowa półsłówkami, którą prowadzili, rozmowa półtonami, była grą wysokiej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, ale co tu gadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do Moskwy! — powtórzyła, wszystko mieszcząc w tym słowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc by tańczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Karolina uroczyście przysięgła podnosząc dwa palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Galeria organizuje wystawy indywidualne i zbiorowe artystów polskich i zagranicznych oraz wystawy problemowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz uśmiech zgubił go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc przeminęła, burza ukoiła się, woda odpłynęła powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę mi tylko nieprzyjemnie, że zaczynamy nasze wycieczki od tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja, choć też nienawykły, całego zająca, patrząc na owe mdłości, schrupałem do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do nauki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech Bóg ma pana w swej opiece.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oczu jej najbardziej mi właśnie potrzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał o wspaniałych lokomotywach, które odjeżdżają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W komplecie z tym multimedialnym zestawem komputerowym dostanie Pani głośniczki i kamerę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepszy wróbel w garści niż gołąb na dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszła ze szkoły o jedenastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała skala uczuć, od najsubtelniejszych do najpotworniejszych, ale jakże dziko spotęgowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto garść szczegółów zebranych przeze mnie u sąsiadów i znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiłaby teraz wszystko, czego by chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zejdę jeszcze na dół, mam kilka rzeczy do zrobienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno! — odparł z westchnieniem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy z jednoczesnym pośpiechem ruszyli z miejsca i dobieżawszy do strumienia, przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I stanął nagle, tak, jak musi stawać serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Naturalnie, jak w ogóle przy każdym choćby tylko częściowym rozszczepieniu jaźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybrał jedno i zamienił z krzesłem ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się z nimi stanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten drugi pojechał na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czapki nie można znaleźć i w bek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wasze królewskie mości, jeszcze nie koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tegoż dnia Tybetańczycy opuścili klasztor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Balon chodził za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec trawę palcami poczesał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze wstępnego szkicu wnioskuję, że ten komputer będzie wyglądał jak tarka do sera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczuwał niezrozumiały niepokój i wiedział, że jutro albo pojutrze zrozumie go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz przede wszystkim postawię ci jeden zasadniczy warunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20747777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno oko tak zbielało, że aż zgasło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co cię nie zabije, to cię wzmocni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to rzeczy zupełnie niewspółmierne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz mi, jakie spotkania miałam na dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa zbladła, widział ją, siedziała w pierwszej ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok z nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praca, spokój, zadowolenie wewnętrzne, wesołość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znamienne połączenie wizerunków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwarantuje to chyba dobroć tego opisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyjmij ode mnie sześć pensów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ani porównania z ospałą, gęstą i cuchnącą wodą kanałów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te wiersze miałem kiedyś czytać ludziom, którzy wierzyli w przetrwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem i nie jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jeśli woli, niech się w torbie prześpi i sił dla nas nabierze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pamiątkę — potwierdziła dziwożona, spuszczając oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba obmyślić dokładnie, w co się przebierze, co weźmie na drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zaroślach rozległ się trzask gałęzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy pójść na samotny spacer, aby mieć wszystkie atuty w ręku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisnąłeś — miękko uderzyła i rozpadła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem Rembrandt celowo tak to namalował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upiór! — poprawił go niewczesny kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, placki kartoflane!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wtedy byłem nieszczęśliwy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak ona go tuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tobie zawdzięczam wszystko, bo moja młodość, moje życie jest twoim dziełem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To tylko jedno, co śpiewał poeta, było prawdą czystą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc baron miał poniekąd rację, przychodząc do ciebie ze słowem przebaczenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo krótka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, nie miał żadnej broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekam, aż obrazy podniosą się przede mną, jak przed zaklinaczem wężę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast odpowiedzi Andrzej przybliżył mi do oczu kukłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz posępnie słodką pochyliła ku ziemi, w palcach przesuwała korale różańca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drodzy państwo, pozwólcie, że już zacznę wykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kładziemy się… jest nas sto lub jeszcze więcej… i tworzymy czworobok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była Ela, o jasnych włosach i oczach, w piżamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie wyłączyłem ten przełącznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sam wiem, czy mam się modlić, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprzytomny jak bela….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piotr został przy drzwiach, ukłonił się i z nieufnością oglądał starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja też tak myślę — powiedziała Pola.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem w tej łodzi nie niesiony gestem bohaterstwa, ale wtrącony bez woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłócą się starsze z młodszymi, chłopcy z dziewczynkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, co lubię najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie z gumowymi wężami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jutrzejszym kolokwium będzie pięć pytań otwartych i test wielokrotnego wyboru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaska pańska na pstrym koniu jeździ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nie jest ważne, kto ma rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pani, i Łatek, i matka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil podszedł do Adama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kropka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ot, co wymyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni muszą tak pisać, inni mogą tego sposobu nie używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem się usunąć, a on o walizkę zawadził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżyniera przeszło mrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę! — odparła dość krzykliwie dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest kierowca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się czubi, ten się lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym tkwi największe niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwinął lewą rękę w trąbkę i podstawił pod oko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli po obu stronach balonu i pocałowali się ponad nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest we mnie — i ja we wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Należało wcześniej pomyśleć o tym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale która rzecz istniejąca nie jest sprzeczna sama w sobie? — Może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chęć snu bez wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo jednak nie wracał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Synu, nie czołgaj się po podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byliśmy nigdy w życiu tacy bogaci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale skąd znów ta ranga i mundur naczelnika?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdumiewało go jej wyrafinowanie erotyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jest to wspaniałe dzieło o którym mówiłaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przygotowania skończone — rzekł, wstępując w obręb koła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puść mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem szedł dalej, potem znów zaczynało się wszystko od początku, potem otworzono drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przeszło dwa lata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chciałbym mieć paniczów w swej kompanii! — westchnął sierżant z głębi duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oni używają redakcyjnego „my” — zaznaczył naraz Nowak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładę się znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Męczą ich tylko hemoroidy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była ciemna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnim razem był to chyba październik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj zgodnym krokiem ruszyli w jednaką zawsze drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówisz dobrze po francusku, więc możesz pomagać w nauce młodszym dziewczynkom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała komiczne wargi, górną wysuniętą nad dolną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chwała Bogu — zawołał jeden z panów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Absolutnie nie chciała, aby „on sobie coś myślał”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma nikogo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dawali listom nagłówków, aby nie używać pewnych słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże się wtedy Sebastian pienił ze złości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad płonącym ogniem stała pochylona sylwetka jakiegoś mężczyzny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, ale co tu gadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był pierwszy dzień przedwiośnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmrok już zapadał, gdy mijano jakiś ładny pałacyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzyłam, że razem z nim opuszczę wyspę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodziny naszej siostry świętowaliśmy całą rodziną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem; może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pójdziesz się bawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram klęczał, odwrócony do nich plecami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszych wierszy nie można było pochwycić uchem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem Paweł wykładał o nie istniejących stworzeniach, fąflach, których istotą jest — udowadniał — nicość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przeszkadzaj mu, nie przeszkadzaj! — zaszeptał skwapliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy był ślub?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na mnie? No, to odprowadź mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, placki kartoflane!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz rozmawiał najpierw z matką, a Emil siedział w poczekalni i miał tremę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł się i pocałował ją w usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty wobec rozwagi zawsze byłeś w opozycji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z konwencjonalno-fizjologicznego punktu widzenia to on mię miał pewną ilość razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy można mieć pytania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A i te były za duże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja myślę, że czterdzieści dwie — rozległ się cienki głosik spoza burty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiamy przynależeć dodatkowo do jakiejś mniejszej grupy kulturowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była za piękna, by nie przyznać jej racji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmawiają o tym, o owym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt by ode mnie nie przepisywał przykładów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to dowód oczywisty! — zgodzili się jednomyślnie słuchacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak zapominasz, to cała nauka z kary idzie w las.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili wszedł Filip zupełnie tak, jakby wchodził po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam własne lepsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mocno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odgłosy te i szmery nie uszły uwagi zaczajonych nasłuchiwaczy niedomówień leśnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo ja to źle zrobiłem, albo ona jest nieco dziwna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak to nie wie pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy umilkli, lecz po chwili rozmowa potoczyła się dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na gwiazdkę postanowiłem sobie sprawić smartwatcha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto skierował okręt ku niegościnnym wybrzeżom Alaski?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Synu, nie czołgaj się po podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja mamusia zawsze mówi, że dzieci powinny się ubierać skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że umiem niektóre rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd płyniemy? — rzuciłem odruchowo pytanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda: nie lubiłem Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się, że prawdziwe rozumienie wiedzy jest wtedy, gdy umie się ją przekazywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz jednak siedział nieruchomo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodziny naszej siostry świętowaliśmy całą rodziną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można jej było powierzać najtrudniejsze zlecenia i posyłki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko upływały Maciusiowi godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż z tym dzieckiem, adoptowanym przez Rosjan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I właśnie w tym widzę najpiękniejszy motyw tej historii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oświadczam: Ja — się — na tym — nie — znam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z naszych nikt nie był zabity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy nie będziemy przyjaciółmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor zdjął płaszcz i rozpiął parę guzików przy obcisłej urzędowej bluzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biednemu zawsze wiatr w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno w żadnym razie zmuszać ani upoważniać do wykonywania jakiegokolwiek zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zależało jej na tym, aby była czysto ubrana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym szedł po niej, woda sięgała mi do kolan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu przestał dlatego, że Emil przestał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może wpadniemy do mojej siostry na spaghetti?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że dzieje ludzkości coraz to bardziej przypominają historię ucznia czarnoksięskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje jeden tylko skuteczny sposób wojowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostęp ze wszystkich stron odcięty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś mi mówi, że próżno się niepokoicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu zmiana ról wytrąciła cię z równowagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział mi jej równy, głęboki oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla dwu ludzi znalazło się jeszcze miejsce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Latem dojeżdżam rowerem, a zimą autobusem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu trzeba tyle czekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż ja teraz zrobię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnio dużo myślałem nad własnym stanem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnajta — odpowiedział kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę tylko, ale zrobiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostaje coraz mniej możliwości, szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noel przerwał kłopotliwe milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ono uprawnione do tego, by zdrowo rosło i rozwijało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest prześwietna sprawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz w jaki sposób skorzystasz ze wskazówki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielkie radości i wielkie smutki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gówno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się trochę zmęczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze współczuciem spojrzał na zabrakowanego Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może, że po drodze wypadnie nam się bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piekielna nuda tego obrazu przeraża mnie dotąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo spóźnionej godziny miasto tętniło pełnią życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ich dwóch: prawy — kulawiec, a lewy — jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszka się i już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęka i drze się w strzępy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, byłem zaślepiony i nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy szoferzy znali ją już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem na twoje rozkazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie bywają nasze noce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, wzgórza już opustoszały, a Ludek Górski wywędrował z tych okolic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo i władze państwowe powinny otaczać szczególną opieką dzieci niemające rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stara historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jeszcze jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki kamień, który ma zastąpić kotwicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im za to płacą, niech się grzebią w gównie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie tylko wartości naszej firmy, ale i nasze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na skinienie stryja wyszedł ponownie, zostawiając ich samych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była od niego o dwa lata starsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby dziecko mniej czuło, miało inną skórę niż oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali do siebie listy, począwszy od trzeciego miesiąca znajomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to są skutki alkoholu, rzec by można, dodatnie, ale chwilowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz i ja zauważyłem zmiany u niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma nic wspólnego pomiędzy wolnymi ludami puszczy, a tą bandą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś już można powiedzieć, że poniekąd są uzasadnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł się jak wykolejeniec…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z półotwartych ust wychylał się język długi, wąski, czarny jak węgiel…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my, niestety, nie możemy czuwać nad nim w owych chwilach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rodzina Halszki z pietyzmem usiłowała podtrzymać jego pierwotny charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idź do szóstego oddziału i zobacz, czy tam jest globus.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożałujecie tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu wszyscy w śmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia ołówkową spódnicę i zaczesuje ciemne włosy za ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądali wspaniale w czerwonym mroku sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy… nikogo poza tym nie wyratowano?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy zaczynają po południu, po pierwszym obfitszym jedzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla jakiejś tam przyczyny nie rozpoczynaliśmy partii domina\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniejsza o to!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinnaś zobaczyć ich łazienkę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz kolana ośmioletniej dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różne rodzaje ciemności, poprze- rzynane błyskawicami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dofinansowano ze środków Ministra Kultury i Dziedzictwa Narodowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymać nie można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiesz, co czytasz, i nie wiesz, co się dzieje w kinie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U ich stóp walczą czarne głowonogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczuł, że ktoś wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po mału pokochał swoją lubieżność, włożoną w Klarę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastanawialiśmy się czy to mają być wystawy stałe, czy zmienne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja bym chciał, żeby wszyscy pamiętali…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyć to jest prawie zawsze „żyć”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisze się, oczywiście, rachunki, wykazy, a owszem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jak już tam wejdziesz, to wychodzisz spłukany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na razie nie widzę żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witkiewicz nazywa to napięciem kierunkowym w malarstwie, można domyślić się ładnych ud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi pan tylko zgłosić dopłatę konduktorowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile chodzi o Emila — nie wstydziła się niczego więcej; ani mówić, ani czynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieczka prędzej czy później musi się wykryć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc tu spoczywa…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może choć w części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W dziecinnym głosie brzmiał zawód i powątpiewanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wojownik musi być śmiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, zamiast tych głupich żartów, przyślijcie mi ją tutaj na noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodatkowo, przypuszczam, że jest zwierzęciem jadowitym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcemy cię wziąć na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jaru! — zawtórował jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Która godzina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa zaczęła się śmiać, niehisterycznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on nie może, dlatego że ja go nie kocham.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fredek umiał się dobrze bawić, ale był godny pogardy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owego ranka było coś tajemniczego w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc spuściłem milcząco głowę i słuchałem dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza twa należy do nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzi, że wraca za trzy miesiące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przegrał parę pięknych koni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spodziewałam się tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko niech mnie pan na tej stacji nie pozdrawia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pieśni poety były na ustach wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Potrzebuję nareszcie umyć się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znałeś go? — spytał jednoręki upiora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przeważa się obojętnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie od razu postanowiliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatkała mu usta ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, już nie powiem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeroko otwartymi oczami patrzała prosto w słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanął przed tronem i zanucił pieśń ku chwale króla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warszawa jest pięknym miastem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęła się też walka o suknie i pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ten film odniesie sukces?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż to za nowy figiel?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zatrzymuje się na stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na każde pytanie jedno tylko powtarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno widzę się z uśmiechem na twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natknąłem się na wariata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem i mam nadzieję, że medytacja coś pomoże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla chcącego nic trudnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ani to, ani tamto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zróbmy lepiej tak: niech każdy rzuci pięć razy do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często byłem tak zmęczony, że w ubraniu zasypiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maria, popróbuj i ty; ja też spróbuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może weź parę dni urlopu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocaliłeś mi życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mowa jest srebrem, a milczenie złotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, co za rozkosz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli znowu — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarł czoło, zmienił senną pozycję i spojrzał przytomnie po wagonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi sprawia przykrość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział, że drzwi nie będą zamknięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil poprosił o dwa fartuchy i powiedział do Ewy: — Mogłabyś zostać siostrą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był mały pięcioletni Jano i jego świat magii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak długo nie wracają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A pamiątki szanują nie tylko królowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawda, że się chce wymiotować? Emil poruszył głową w nieokreślonym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadawała mnóstwo pytań, a niebieskie jej oczy pełne były zamyślenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już wiem, co zrobię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko schowało głowę w ramionach osłupiałego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona myśli: — Wieś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jemu — swoją fotografię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem szukać posady, opuścić szkołę lekarską.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co kraj, to obyczaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się masz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On „żyje” z nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatelefonowałem do niego pierwszy raz od wyjazdu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą — kiedyś nie było też alkoholu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co znaczy ogień, błyskający z pośród tamtych sosen?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodów przecież nigdy nie braknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas najwyższy uporządkować papiery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jeśli ona nie wsiądzie po drodze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło między nami milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będzie za późno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26528417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, chciałbym zwrócić się z apelem do Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26528418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego powodu stworzenie departamentu budowy pokoju ma sens\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26528419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja partia jest partią, która działa w interesie Holandii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26528420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym, aby wniosek zawierał dalej idące zapisy w tym obszarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26528421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilę temu rozmawiałem z jednym z organizatorów i zapytałem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26528472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podsumowując, wiele udało się osiągnąć w dziedzinie zarządzania aktywami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26528473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To tragiczny bilans!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26528474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I muszę przyznać, że właśnie to powoduje dziś moje największe rozczarowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26528475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeska prezydencja będzie zatem czuwać nad sprawnym przebiegiem prac w nadchodzących miesiącach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26528476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę powiedzieć, że czas pozbyć się obsesji i przestać kopać pod sobą dołki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usuwamy obecnie ostrą kategorię toksyczności pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawienie się nowych kanałów komunikacji i alternatywnych sieci stanowi zagrożenie dla dawnego porządku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa potrzebuje Wspólnej Polityki Rolnej, która zapewni rozwój, a nie stagnację europejskiego rolnictwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy w kraju utrzyma się pokój czy też pogrąży się on w kolejnej wojnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczestniczyliśmy już w tej debacie we wrześniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieją już wielostronne organizacje, takie jak Organizacja Narodów Zjednoczonych, dla tego rodzaju dialogu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy to mówimy, kolejny nieletni, Soleimanian, stoi w obliczu rychłej egzekucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byliśmy częścią specjalnej delegacji w tym kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym dodać ze swojej strony, że jest to szczególnie prawdziwe w przypadku hodowców owiec\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są nim wolne wybory na Białorusi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczyniliśmy postępy w dziedzinie zarządzania gospodarczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewątpliwie badania i rozwój są bardzo ważne dla programu Galileo i innych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim muszę wyznać, że występuję z podwójnie tendencyjnego punktu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stwierdziliśmy, że informacje naukowe nie zawsze wskazywały nam właściwy kierunek poprzez jednoznaczne ustalenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy skoncentrować się na obywatelach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani przewodnicząca, panie komisarzu, panie i panowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gospodarka Białorusi jest na kolanach, a Rosja już dłużej nie może jej asekurować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strefa euro musi dawać przykład społecznej gospodarki rynkowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielka Brytania jest wśród krajów, które przestrzegają przepisów, ale cierpią z tego powodu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dla mnie bardzo ważne, aby komisarz zrozumiał, dlaczego tego chcemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego wyrażamy nasze głębokie zadowolenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim pragnę pogratulować naszym dwóm sprawozdawczyniom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brakuje nowych źródeł\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26593741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popieram suwerenność żywnościową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przedmiotowym sprawozdaniu przeceniono znaczenie energii jądrowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wywołuje to również międzyinstytucjonalną nieufność i ta sytuacja wzbudza w nas wszystkich niepokój\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sprawozdaniu poparto europejski okres oceny, europejski mechanizm stabilności i pakt euro plus\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może przyjmą Państwo pakiet mimo tego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po dziesięciu latach nadszedł czas, aby spojrzeć na aspekty, które nie zdały egzaminu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie trudno jest mówić o partnerstwie, gdy państwa członkowskie są tak nieufne wobec niej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagadnienia dotyczące bezpieczeństwa lotnictwa, ochrony środowiska i praw własności nadal pozostają nierozwiązane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka traktowania obu stron na równych zasadach nie pomaga\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nie tylko naukowo nieuzasadnione, ale również nieetyczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Węgierska konstytucja jest jedyną europejską konstytucją przewidującą szczególne postanowienia i pomoc dla osób niepełnosprawnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.396,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omawiana dyrektywa stanowi ważną deklarację świadczącą o tym, że taka jest nasza intencja działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pozostałe państwa członkowskie Unii Europejskiej powinny uważać na co wyrażają zgodę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinien to być istotny wkład w poprawę jakości powietrza, zwłaszcza w centrach miast\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że sprawozdawca także zgodzi się z tym wnioskiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy również zagwarantować dysydentom politycznym bezpieczeństwo i swobodę poruszania się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witamy w Absurdystanie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, Panie i Panowie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te propozycje należy odrzucić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To naprawdę ambitny program\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znamy już wyzwania - omówiono je dokładnie w tej debacie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kraje wytwarzają ją po możliwie najniższych kosztach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym przypadku nie wystarczy schować się wyłącznie za prawnymi argumentami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę więc udzielić w imieniu Komisji pełnego poparcia dla tego kompromisowego rozwiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy damy radę dojść do jakiejś zasady dla konsumentów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27185275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co minutę z powodu głodu umiera dwoje dzieci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest, aby od tej pory fundusz solidarności był prawdziwym europejskim instrumentem ochrony obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy przeoczyć tego aspektu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeka nas jednak jeszcze daleka droga\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żadne unijne pieniądze nie są przeznaczane na jakiekolwiek projekty, które szkodziłyby środowisku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprowadzanie nowych produktów do obrotu jest długim i zawsze kosztownym procesem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie szczególnie istotne wydaje się osiągnięcie wyraźnego postępu, zwłaszcza w walce z wylesianiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy chronić gospodarkę przed upadkiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro będziemy głosowali też nad istotną regulacją, która umożliwi Komisji dalsze działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"porozumienia wiążącego w skali międzynarodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie Romano Marii La Russy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie to podejście sprawiło, że zdecydowano o przekształceniu wiedeńskiego Obserwatorium w Agencję Praw Podstawowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję panu komisarzowi Barrotowi za poruszenie tego tematu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi przedsiębiorcy pracują prawdopodobnie w najtrudniejszych warunkach, ponieważ są osaczeni przez nadmiar biurokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy uzależnić zbliżenie stosunków od realizacji zobowiązań reżimu w zakresie zmiany zwyczajów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy aspekt dotyczy dwustronnych porozumień w dziedzinie energetyki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie jednak kraje te odczuwają szkodliwe skutki sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zachodnim świecie jesteśmy uzależnieni od jedzenia mięsa i jest to ogromne marnotrawstwo zasobów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podjęte ostateczne decyzje odzwierciedlają strategię omawianą i przyjętą przez państwa członkowskie Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska nie radzi sobie z nielegalną imigracją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27187456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez wątpienia należy stworzyć jasne podstawy prawne walki z wszelkimi formami przemocy wobec kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyliśmy również, że systemy opieki zdrowotnej w państwach członkowskich nie zmieniły się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jeden z aspektów związanych z gwarancjami proceduralnymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuje się wielce zakłopotany, ponieważ chciałem wziąć udział w tej dyskusji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dość biurokratyczne podejście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejskie działania służące zwalczaniu ubóstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sprawozdaniu jest też wiele dobrych wniosków, które jednak zostały już przyjęte\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie sugeruję, aby podczas dzisiejszej popołudniowej debaty wywierano presję na czeskich senatorów lub Irlandczyków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Homo sapiens do tej pory spowodował poważną degradację środowiska, którego sam jest najważniejszym elementem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszą usłyszeć, że uważamy ich za partnerów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Data ratyfikacji konwencji leży w gestii posłów do czeskiego parlamentu i czeskich senatorów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję sprawozdawczyni za wykonaną pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sprawozdanie więcej niż zasługuje na nasze poparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta sytuacja wykracza poza Irlandię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznaczałoby to konieczność jeszcze większego zmniejszenia wielkości poszczególnych reprezentacji krajowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to pierwszy krok w stronę prawdziwej polityki jakości w odniesieniu do produktów rolnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, ze względu na równą reprezentację, udzielę głosu panu komisarzowi Andorowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprzednie rozszerzenia przyniosły korzyści zarówno Unii, jak i państwom członkowskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości, opodatkowanie w postaci akcyzy jest sprawą delikatną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie, musimy go chronić, wzmacniać i rozwijać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwadzieścia dziewięć osób straciło życie, a setki odniosło rany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę byłoby szkoda, gdyby tak się stało, dlatego zawarliśmy kompromis\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fakt nieosiągnięcia celu nie jest niczym nowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem też, co pan poseł chciałby w ten sposób osiągnąć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inicjatywa \\\"Proces barceloński\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27205655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy jesteśmy zgodni, że instrument ten powinien być praktyczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25353644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest to wiele, ale zawsze coś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25353645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwi się zamyka, to nie Afryka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25353646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maryś go znała dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25353647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ulega wątpliwości, że przedmioty, znalezione w kredensie, należą do tej epoki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25353648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ale co się z panem dzisiaj dzieje, panie Pernat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25356855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochmistrzyni założyła ręce i zbliżyła się do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25356856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie jest wymysłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25356857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dokuczaj ty Stefanowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25356858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie może, lecz strasznie chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25356859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różowiała niewinnie, jak kwiatek wśród kłosów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiałem: „Moi przodkowie będą strzegli tych ziaren?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiałem dłuższy czas siedzieć tak w odrętwieniu, że się niemal o mnie zatrwożyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tą trwogą można było wytłumaczyć jego zdenerwowanie i kłamstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdobny w dwa wielkie jaja, jak dwa jabłka w sadzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewygodny to tron dla mojej królowej, ale najlepszy, jakim rozporządza twój kochanek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była mu za to wdzięczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staruszka matka topniała jak wosk pod wpływem tego miłego obejścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rusz no cztery litery i chodź mi pomóc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem zupełnie zdecydowany, nie dopuścić żadnego oporu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dodatek jednak przemilczając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolega w czarnym wytłumaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy skończyłem jedenaście czy dwanaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O fajnie, prąd wysiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz bądź spokojny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z wielką uwagą przyglądała się, jak ja rylcem pogłębiałem formę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwałem się na równe nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęła go ponownie żądza wódki i kazał mi stanąć przed szynkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc jedni wzięli na się cierpienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszka, gdzie żaden żywy człowiek mieszkać nie może: przy murze pod ostatnią latarnią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłumy mieszczan wysłuchały go, lecz nikt jakoś nie kwapił się, ażeby zdobyć nagrodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina trzecia dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak dotąd niezbyt mu zależało na tym, aby nam kadzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na takich projektach i rozmowach zeszedł uszczęśliwionym dzieciom obiad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz co, chyba zostawiłam słuchawki w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po ciężkiej pracy odlał nowy dzwon i znów zaniesiono go przed pałac cesarski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25362782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego lub więcej może pokaleczyłem, ale czy nie postąpilibyście tak samo, panowie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25362783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zapewne jaki wielki magnat zagraniczny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25362785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z życia codziennego celebryty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25362786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drżał ze wzruszenia i składał błagalnie ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25362787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz jednak pogłoski zostały potwierdzone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25362842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, to było, ale bardzo dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25362843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwarłszy usta, wytrzeszczyły w górę oczy i jęły się naradzać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25362844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczegóż teraz zdradziłeś tajemnicę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25362845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysoki młodzieniec trzymał kobietę w ramionach swoich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25362846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aboż natura jest piękną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak nie wygląda rojenie senne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widać się wstydzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ej no, wystraszylaś kiciusia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotarli wreszcie, spuszczono drabinkę, podróżni weszli na pokład...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dopiero zdaje ci się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wypadki szybko po sobie następują... jak się też skończy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W dwa tysiące szóstym roku Yamba Asha wyjechał do Szwecji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bierze go i idzie przez bramę główną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę panów, nie zrozumcie mnie fałszywie, co do mego zamiaru na tym punkcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zaczął śmiać się wreszcie z naszego zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niczego bardziej nie pragnę, jak, żeby kobieta, którą kocham została moją żoną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na dworcu kolei wiedeńskiej złapał nas doktor Szuman.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młody student chociaż świeżo przybyły do Oxfordu nie był już nowicjuszem w medycynie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nigdy mi się nic nie śni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech pan dotknie tych wielkich kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiedz twej pani, by tu przyszła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy słyszysz, że mój tatuś nie żyje?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to moim jedynym ratunkiem, gdyż teraz znajdowałem się u celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyłożyłem do niego ogień i położyłem się na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewna ilość próżnych beczek leżała jeszcze przed gospodą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten odwrót nie był taki łatwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozostawało nic innego, jak czekać na przejście burzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywiązaliśmy konie i siedliśmy przy dużym odłamie skały naprzeciw siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiłem do niej to, co mi chwila przyniosła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25363153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tak też jest we Wrocławiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płynęła gdzieś ze, spowitej w sinawe mgły, dali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy nie pamiętasz, jak brat jego w kościele obchodził się z nim niegodziwie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czesała się dla przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chodziło nam wcale o zabezpieczenie się od eteru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabicie człowieka stanowiło dla nich coś tak pospolitego, jak zabicie owcy dla rzeźnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim razie czas na rewanż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była pewna czternastoipółletnia smarkula, która nazy wała się Ala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale poza tem czarnem głębokiem okiem drzemała głębia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy przyszedłem do siebie, udałem się natychmiast w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan nosił zawsze złotą obrączkę ślubną na małym palcu lewej ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieje się to już od dziesięciu lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło o sińca z rąk Anastazji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski zbliżył się do powozu hrabiny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z jakiegoś nieznanego zresztą powodu serce jej nagle bić ustało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy istotnie była to ta sama kobieta, którą kiedyś spotkałem w katedrze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odpowiedział ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Złe zrośnięcie się nogi spowodowało zgubne skutki w ciągu jego następnych sukcesów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak spojrzę na wiatrak, to już dostaję zawrotu głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego letniego wieczoru, straszne zamieszanie zapanowało na rynku stołecznego grodu Warszawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25370401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blanka rzuciła się w jego objęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25374738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smok Wawelski zionął ogniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25374739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale między wami nie ma ducha... Duch w was gnije...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25374741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie dowody, jakich świadków miałem na swoją obronę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25374742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to jakby sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25374744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś mnie tknęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26595960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"kontrola Parlamentu Europejskiego nad tą kwestią będzie szczególnie nieugięta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26595961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my w dalszym ciągu znajdujemy się w tym samym miejscu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26595962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam straciłem wszystkie sery, które chciałem przywieźć, ponieważ były tartinable!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26595963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieprawdą jest, że jest to zupełna porażka i że nie widać żadnej poprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26595964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to banki zagraniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26596009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak nie może być\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26596010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawa odbija się różnym echem w poszczególnych krajach europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26596011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czynnik ekonomiczny nie powinien stanowić uzasadnienia dla powszechnego stosowania tej trucizny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26596012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym dynamicznym miejscu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26596013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spośród tych negatywnych aspektów wyróżniają się dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31983467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprawdę, brak między nami ludzi, którzy na wszystko potrafią znaleźć sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31983468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym poruszyć pewną kwestię regulaminową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31983469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pełną świadomością i bez hipokryzji powinniśmy chyba zadać sobie kilka pytań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31983470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dane Eurostatu potwierdzają pozytywny trend\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31983471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielu posłów podniosło kwestię partycypacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto unieruchomieni pasażerowie nie znają tak naprawdę swoich praw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości sytuacja praw człowieka uległa poważnemu pogorszeniu i musimy na to zareagować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszukiwania te zakończyły się sukcesem między innymi dzięki solidarności Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście debatę tę śledziło z zainteresowaniem bardzo wiele osób, włączając przemysł i organizacje pozarządowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspomniał pan o odszkodowaniach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pełni popieram dążenie Parlamentu do stworzenia jednej metodologii obliczania optymalnych kosztowo poziomów wymagań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję więc wszystkim wam za ten wkład w funkcjonowanie skomplikowanej maszynerii udzielania absolutorium\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W treści rezolucji nie pominięto kontrowersyjnych zagadnień, dlatego też zagłosowałem za jej przyjęciem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koncepcja ta stała się tak popularna, że wybierając temat musimy dokonywać wyważonego wyboru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem to zależy od dwu kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdawca wspomniał o nich, a pan komisarz poczynił pewne zobowiązanie w tym zakresie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jedyny sposób, aby wystarczająco szybko ograniczyć emisje i osiągnąć zadowalający rezultat w Kopenhadze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest oskarżony o akty terroryzmu, w których straciły życie dziesiątki ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie wiara\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tej perspektywy propozycja Komisji dotycząca zarządzania przepływami imigracyjnymi wydaje się niezrozumiała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale debata jest bardzo istotna, aczkolwiek niewystarczająca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście jesteśmy zaniepokojeni brakiem zaufania konsumentów do wewnętrznego rynku usług\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie chodzi o obniżanie standardów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprawdzie rozmowa wasza zasmuciła mnie głęboko, lecz zarazem stała się pożyteczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bez regulacji nie uda nam się zbudować przekonania, że zmiana będzie miała trwały skutek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejska polityka rolna musi być sprawiedliwsza i bardziej sprzyjać środowisku naturalnemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak już powiedziałem, spór ma obecnie charakter czysto akademicki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie w tej dyrektywie należy połączyć urlop ojcowski z macierzyńskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sinus kąta prostego wynosi jeden.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy jej tak szybko, jak to możliwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym złożyć oświadczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"po pierwsze część dotyczącą międzynarodowych środków na rzecz poprawy, to jest redukcji emisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszym krokiem musi być zwolnienie wszystkich więźniów politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem dla szesnastu krajów strefy euro polega na tym, kto pociąga za budżetowe sznurki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracownicy mogliby na tym bardziej skorzystać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To tylko jeden sektor przemysłu, ale spowodował, że ucierpiała cała gospodarka światowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postrzegam to raczej jako proces ewolucyjny niż rewolucyjny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich dotyczy konkurencyjności, o której mowa w wielu różnych miejscach sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co więcej, powstaje linia strategiczna, która niemal w całości skupia się na państwach członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadano dwa, różne pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotne jest to, jak będą stosowane postanowienia traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedzi udzielę po włosku, gdyż wiem, że zna pani biegle mój język ojczysty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak podstawowa zasada jest ta sama i te przepisy działają naprawdę dobrze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy też pewności odnośnie tego, o jakich środkach obrony handlowej mówi sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety wyraźnie dowiodły tego zdarzenia, które uruchomiły cały ten proces\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie z tym mamy tu do czynienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Warszawie tylko została garść łuczników i on, dla straży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pozwoliło mu zrzucić pęta i rozwijać się w godny podziwu sposób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja również powinna wziąć sobie do serca przesłanie, że chcemy tutaj przywrócić przejrzystość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli Komisja dokona przeglądu swojej doktryny, tym lepiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie porusza ważną kwestię znalezienia równowagi pomiędzy bezpieczeństwem a podstawowymi wolnościami w Internecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czwarte, z zadowoleniem należy przyjąć wydawanie zezwoleń dla stoczni demontażowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to konkretny nowy środek w rządowym pakiecie inicjatyw na rzecz wzmocnienia sektora biznesu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem jest ono bardzo dobre i potrzebne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwrot nakładów przychodzi w innym czasie, kiedy jest się stroną proszącą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Strasburgu nadal toczą się prace remontowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zdumiewające, zdaje się, że taka jest również konkluzja Rady w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Projekt ten zapewni obywatelom nadzwyczajny dostęp do informacji i kultury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przypadku przemysłu samochodowego mamy do czynienia z sektorem, który jest rzeczywiście konkurencyjny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj, dzięki \\\"tak\\\" czeskiego Senatu, zrobiliśmy ogromny krok naprzód\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedź brzmi \\\"nie\\\", ponieważ nie mamy żadnych oznak ani informacji, które na to wskazują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska powinna zatem wypracować odpowiednią strategię dla wspierania procesu integracji regionalnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem tak - podejmijmy wyraźne zobowiązanie do wprowadzenia europejskiego podatku od transakcji finansowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejmy nadzieję, że tym razem wyciągniemy lepsze wnioski, niż w czasie poprzednich kryzysów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzi mi o wody Zatoki Triesteńskiej i jej duże zaplecze miejskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O to w tym wszystkim chodzi i o tym będziemy odpowiednio debatować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza to oczywiście, że japoński przemysł samochodowy będzie również musiał przestrzegać tych przepisów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przypadku niej w siedmiu państwach obiecano przeprowadzenie krajowego referendum\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy istnieje powód do działania na szczeblu europejskim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta myśl przejmowała go rozpaczą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego trzeba zagwarantować lepszą ochronę danych osobowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem niezwykle krytycznie nastawiony do tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy możemy być pewni, iż łóżeczka dziecięce dostępne na rynku europejskim są bezpieczne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawiera ono również wyczerpującą analizę piractwa w odniesieniu do treści cyfrowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony, nie możemy ignorować wkładu rolnictwa w możliwość redukcji emisji dwutlenku węgla\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie sądzę, aby ministrowie finansów byli upoważnieni do zniknięcia z tymi pieniędzmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział pan, całkiem słusznie, że mamy szczególny rodzaj odpowiedzialności wobec Izraela\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rolnictwo, zwłaszcza w nowych państwach członkowskich, słabnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym wspólnym zadaniem jest dowiedzenie, że cele te można osiągnąć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przewidywał ją regulamin węgierskiego parlamentu, ale zlikwidowano ją na wniosek partii Fidesz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Protestujemy przeciwko eliminowaniu oponentów politycznych na Ukrainie przy pomocy systemu sądowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zapomniano o was\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy ustanawiać prawa w oderwaniu od rzeczywistości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze zadanie polega na stworzeniu i realizacji polityki, która umożliwi rolnikom produkcję żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekuję przejrzystości w tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości jest to jeden rozmiar, który na nikogo nie pasuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Iraku, Afganistanie, Bałkanach i Libii, a także innych krajach znajdujących się na tej liście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy tylko lepiej poinformowane, zasobne grupy społeczne, czy wszyscy potrzebujący\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tak rozumiem demokrację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja ta uległa pogorszeniu po zaangażowaniu Międzynarodowego Funduszu Walutowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejnym krokiem będzie szczegółowe określenie sposobu organizacji nadzoru na szczeblu europejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam połączoną debatę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzrost liczby zgłoszonych przypadków został spowodowany wprowadzeniem nowych technologii komunikacyjnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zainteresowaniem oczekuję dzisiejszej dyskusji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę mi wybaczyć, ale muszę zakłócić tę cudowną jednomyślność, jaka panuje w tej Izbie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymaga ona określenia priorytetów na przyszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale przecież dotychczas mamy dalej obowiązujący pakt stabilizacji i wzrostu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O problemach tych wiemy od dwóch dekad\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie znaki są jasne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to bowiem praktyki wyzwalające najniższe instynkty i powodujące brutalizację życia społecznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wielki znak zapytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"prawo do godziwych warunków życia dla wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla wielu przedsiębiorstw finansowanie stanowi największą przeszkodę w rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to konkretnie oznacza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_31985937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płatnicy netto - jak Niemcy i inne kraje - zdają się o tym zapominać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37100648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płynęły im wśród mroków nocnych dni i noce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37100650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukraina jest dla nas bardzo ważnym krajem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37100652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich latach kwestie godności kobiet i ich życiowego powołania przybrały inne wymiary\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37100654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy uwolnić potencjał wzrostowy jednolitego rynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37100655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prezydent, wbrew temu, co myślą sceptycy, naprawdę myśli, to co obiecał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37101038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie jest wartościowe i odnosi się do wielu obaw podzielanych przez wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37101040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy więcej kanibalizmu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37101044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja Europejska musi reagować na te wyzwania przyjmując podobne \\\"strategie makroregionalne\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37101046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Protokół wykonawczy do konwencji alpejskiej w zakresie transportu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37101048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja nie może lekceważyć tego faktu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37101194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrzeba żadnego usprawiedliwienia dla bezpieczeństwa ruchu lotniczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37101196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I piorunami bili czarnych, więc czarni nie mogli nic robić, musieli się słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37101198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wspomnieć jeszcze o trzech innych punktach, obejmujących\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37101201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że również i w tym obszarze Parlament i Rada wkrótce osiągną kompromis\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37101204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.18,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podstawą wykorzystania tego funduszu jest logiczne uzasadnienie energetycznego aspektu europejskiego planu naprawy gospodarczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości jest wprost przeciwnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, aspekty te nie podlegały odrębnemu głosowaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Media mogłyby odnieść korzyści z takich działań, prawdopodobnie poprzez rozpowszechnianie takich informacji wśród nieletnich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko w wymiarze gospodarczym, ale i kulturalnym i politycznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez długi czas region Pacyfiku był kopciuszkiem w zakresie zamorskich inicjatyw rozwojowych Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie prosiłam o więcej czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem powiedzieć, że w sprawach klęsk żywiołowych mamy dwa działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest poniżające\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastanówmy się teraz, a może innym razem, nad kwestią zasobów własnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podpisanie i wdrożenie porozumienia dotyczącego postępu społecznego i zatrudnienia byłoby dowodem woli politycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie stanowisko Komisji Europejskiej przedstawię na posiedzeniu Rady Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przespał i przeczekał on dekady presji na innowację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właśnie te warunki dały impet naszej dzisiejszej debacie, służąc także za przewodnik\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dojdziemy do celu tyko wówczas, gdy wszyscy - kobiety i mężczyźni - będziemy współpracować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37240836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłam przekonana, że usiłuje on zbudować wzajemne zrozumienie pomiędzy grupami wyznaniowymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję Komisji!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym omówić kwestie związane z Chinami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fiasko politycznego projektu zwanego Unią Europejską wywołał konkretny czynnik\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sprawie porządku dziennego, niektórzy z nas czekają tu od godz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda sprawa została oceniona na podstawie dowodów przedstawionych przez poszczególne państwa członkowskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy jednakże nadal pracować nad rozwiązaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda mi to na polityczną kontrolę redakcyjną treści umieszczanych w Internecie - nowym medium\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej wyłącznym celem nie jest tylko włączenie tych ludzi w główny nurt życia społecznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pełne wykonanie postanowień tej konstytucji wymagać będzie dalszych wysiłków i determinacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragniemy wypełnić naszą powinność wobec wyborców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy państwa członkowskie zaangażują się w uszczegółowienie zasad zarządzania gospodarczego również w tym zakresie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"działanie głównie w imię interesów własnego kraju nie pomaga żadnemu z państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu zasługuje on na naszą szczególną uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy naprawdę nie mogliśmy od razu zadziałać inaczej, aby uniknąć zaistniałej sytuacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam się rodzą kwieciste pomarańcze, pod cieniem których pogadanka tak jest miłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybory te będą jednakże przeprowadzone w oparciu o niedemokratyczne zasady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspominano o wysiłkach prezydencji portugalskiej na rzecz zniesienia kary śmierci i wprowadzenia moratorium\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To kraj zasobny w bogactwa naturalne, ale również kraj, który ma najgorsze wskaźniki społeczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy zadbać o większą konkurencyjność i wyższą jakość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zaangażowaniem podchodzimy do relacji z krajami położonymi wokół południowego wybrzeża Morza Śródziemnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważamy, że współpraca przebiegała całkiem sprawnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do polityki spójności należy przenieść część zadań z drugiego filaru wspólnej polityki rolnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej byłoby, gdyby uzasadnienie podawano w odpowiedzi na skargę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zatem spojrzeć na ten problem na poziomie znacznie bardziej praktycznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma pan jednak słuszność poruszając tę sprawę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym jej w związku z tym pogratulować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę tylko dodać nieco do tego, co już zostało powiedziane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie przesłanie kryło się za naszymi niedawnymi propozycjami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może są też inne przyczyny anomalii pogodowych i susz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po raz czwarty w ciągu kilku ostatnich miesięcy rozmawiamy o tej samej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy wprowadzić w życie wspólne zobowiązania dotyczące spraw ludzi młodych i zatrudnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym celu wymienia wiele środków, które należy podjąć na różnych szczeblach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z jego ostatnią uwagą - w wersji, jaką usłyszałam w tłumaczeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie jest bardzo ambitne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starsi pracownicy powinni zyskać większe możliwości udziału w rynku pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nasz tupet nie ma granic?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Propozycja ta pozostaje i powinno nadal pozostawać aktualna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie ona kolejnym sprawdzianem dla przywódców europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie, jak słusznie państwo wskazują, Unia na rzecz Regionu Morza Śródziemnego musi zostać uzupełniona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też rozmawialiśmy dzisiaj o rewizji strategii lizbońskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego chciałbym wyrazić moją wdzięczność dla państwa za zrozumienie i konsekwentne poparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy prezydencja słoweńska chce trzymać się tych słów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często jesteśmy chętni okazywać solidarność z różnymi grupami ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Likwidując ten system, znajdziemy rozwiązanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"premier Brown uczynił więcej niż pan\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko rozwijają się w regionie handel i transport, jednak na rynku energii panuje stagnacja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również, zwracając się Fiony Hall, nie jestem pewny, czy Newcastle rywalizuje bezpośrednio z Londynem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O jakie interesy panu chodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wierzysz temu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostałem dwa srebrne medale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak bardzo się cieszę z tego sprawozdania i popieram je\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miałam niestety żadnych informacji z konsultacji, które mogłyby nam pomóc w naszej pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jednak nie koniec\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tak może być?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"uzmysłowiliśmy to sobie w trakcie debaty nad pakietem klimatyczno-energetycznym Parlamentu, jeżeli nie wcześniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzięki działaniom pana, panie pośle, i Parlamentu będziemy mogli prowadzić najskuteczniejsze negocjacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie jest wynikiem współpracy pomiędzy członkami tej Izby\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez wszystkie strony zielonej księgi przewija się jeden motyw \\\"niech ludzie starsi pracują\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas media lewicowo-liberalne donosiły, że Jobbik jest partią ekstremistyczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawa Muhammeda Tahera Thabeta Samouma została podjęta na nowo w zeszłym tygodniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pytanie, na które musimy sobie odpowiedzieć, brzmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście większość z nich nie wybuchła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym, bardzo krótko, wyrazić moje podziękowania za tę debatę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem o tym bardzo dobrze, bo sam jestem prawnikiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że w sobotni wieczór wszyscy byliśmy ogromnie zszokowani wydarzeniami w Irlandii Północnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panu przewodniczącemu Barroso chciałem podziękować za przedstawienie punktu widzenia Komisji Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Historia sprawiła, że wiele z naszych krajów stało się krajami wieloetnicznymi, w tym Gruzja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podróbki stanowią poważny problem dla handlu w sieci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, socjaliści, uważamy to za bardzo ważne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie przewodniczący, pani wysoka przedstawiciel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Współpracujmy, aby dowieść, że jesteśmy godni tego zaufania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stara się odwieść ajatollahów od ich jądrowych ambicji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę podziękować sprawozdawcom za ich znakomitą pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie pragnę przypomnieć, że Fundusz Dostosowania do Globalizacji został utworzony stosunkowo niedawno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37832305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po raz pierwszy wykorzystana zostanie uproszczona procedura wprowadzania zmian\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27114274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie to zrobiliśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27114275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie krytykuję, ale czy w Izbie można wywieszać flagę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27114276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wypadki, zatłoczenie dróg, zanieczyszczenie powietrza, zmiany klimatu oraz hałas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27114277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma żadnej alternatywy dla pokojowej drogi Dalajlamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27114278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ wiele państw członkowskich uznało, że ta propozycja zbyt przypomina euroobligacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27114317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Silni będziemy jedynie, jeżeli nie pozwolimy się podzielić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27114318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to wyczerpująca odpowiedź\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27114319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W podobnej sytuacji znajduje się stocznia gdyńska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27114320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie one są istotne i nie możemy ignorować żadnej z nich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27114321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Także kryzys jest globalny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27175850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mołdawia zmaga się z bardzo poważnymi trudnościami gospodarczymi wywołanymi światowym kryzysem finansowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27175854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy przygotować dodatkowe regulacje prawne w zakresie bezpieczeństwa, skutecznego reagowania oraz zapobiegania katastrofom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27175855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Państwa członkowskie muszą przeprowadzić kompleksowy przegląd swojego stanowiska w sprawie energii jądrowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27175856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prosiliśmy wtedy i prosimy również teraz, by te informacje zostały przynajmniej sprawdzone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27175857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim pragnę pogratulować doskonałych sprawozdań wszystkim sprawozdawcom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27175917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nie ma wątpliwości, że wiele aspektów tego sprawozdania jest prawdziwych i istotnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27175919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę zwrócić uwagę, że rozczarowująca i niepokojąca jest decyzja Trybunału Konstytucyjnego w Korei Południowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27175920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa dowiodła, że zdolna jest prowadzić godną, solidną i otwartą politykę imigracyjną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27175921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym niemniej, odpowiem jej bezpośrednio\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27175922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przełowienie to bezdyskusyjny fakt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27369868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znają państwo ten formularz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27369872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu musimy wypracować całkowicie odmienne spojrzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27369874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale najtrudniejsze zagadnienia to przyszłość opt-outu i podejście do dyżuru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27369875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To z kolei wiąże się również z przestrzeganiem norm produkcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27369889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadam się za racjonalnym kompromisem w sprawie nowych eurowiniet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27369890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na obronę zagranicznej obecności militarnej w Afganistanie przedstawiane są dwa argumenty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27369892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre przeszkody biurokratyczne jednak wciąż pozostają, na przykład w obszarze przepływów pieniężnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27369893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to szczególnie ważne w przypadkach, gdy produkty są uznawane za \\\"naturalne\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to lekcja, którą musimy przekazać dziś młodym ludziom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, należy przeanalizować harmonogram\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"konserwatywną rewolucję ludową!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczona ustawa nie jest sprzeczna z żadną międzynarodową normą w obszarze praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może Dzień przeciw Karze Śmierci proponowany przez prezydencję belgijską jest krokiem w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielokrotnie polscy stoczniowcy prosili Komisję o decyzje ratujące ich zakłady pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ celem zarządzania jest dobra wydajność, manager nie powinien niepotrzebnie ograniczać pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pacyfistycznym ujęciu niszczenie czołgów to rzecz pozytywna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście wszystko jest na swoim miejscu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wstępie chciałbym wyrazić wdzięczność to, jak konstruktywnie byliśmy w stanie ze sobą współpracować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też bardzo żałuję, że w naszym Parlamencie traktujemy tę kwestię z takim lekceważeniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma możliwości sporządzenia zamkniętej i wyłącznej listy jej działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już samo to rozwiąże problemy Jemenu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje także wiele gatunków, które nie zostały jeszcze odkryte i opisane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na razie nie zamierzamy wnosić naszego wkładu finansowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Druga prowadzi do harmonizacji podatkowej, kresu budżetów narodowych i federalnego superpaństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak naprawdę w tym momencie cytuję ekspertów ze Szwecji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, że w Rosji nie przestrzega się praw obywatelskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy, że nie jest to tylko kwestia miliona podpisów pod daną inicjatywą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak osiągnąć spójność i ujednolicić politykę strukturalną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma potrzeby tworzenia dyrektywy ramowej w sprawie ochrony gleby\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym państwa poprosić o jedną prostą rzecz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właśnie duch traktatu i istota historii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robimy, by rozwiązać ten podstawowy problem, stanowiący sedno naszej całej debaty?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedną z form dyskryminacji jest łamanie praw reprodukcyjnych kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto punkty będące przedmiotem dzisiejszej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbym wyrazić zgodę na odniesienie do dyskryminacji wielorakiej w obszarach objętych projektem przedmiotowej dyrektywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie ci zostają ekstremistami, ponieważ nie mają nic do stracenia i czują się upokorzeni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A co z działaniem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę w jej słuszność i uważam, że powinniśmy podążać w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ważna wartość dodana i dodatkowy wymóg\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez ostatnie tygodnie i miesiące wysłuchaliśmy wiele wypowiedzi na temat zmiany klimatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co my, jako Unia Europejska, możemy zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie pan, na czym polega współpraca z Parlamentem Europejskim w wielu różnorodnych sytuacjach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się nie stało z przyczyny, którą państwu opisałem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to dobra, a właściwie świetna dyrektywa, która ma na celu ochronę artystów wykonawców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym podnieść kilka punktów w tej szerokiej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo odrzucenia lepszego wariantu podjęta dzisiaj decyzja to krok naprzód\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie musimy przyjąć zasadnicze środki na rzecz ochrony środowiska i wykonalnego ekonomicznie rozwoju rolnictwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najprawdopodobniej wkrótce zostaną w Iranie straceni kolejni nieletni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym celu potrzebne jest natychmiastowe zawieszenie broni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejną kwestią jest rola tych komitetów nadzoru w stosunku do roli Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bośnia i Hercegowina oraz Serbia rozważają złożenie wniosku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejska solidarność szwankuje - zarówno wobec nowych państw członkowskich jak i Grecji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugą słabością przedstawionej koncepcji jest brak konsekwencji w podejściu do praw obywateli europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaniem Komisji Przemysłu zastosowanie muszą mieć w tym miejscu standardy międzynarodowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudne dostosowania, które musi przeprowadzić, będą oczywiście wiązały się z koniecznością poniesienia pewnych kosztów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszyło mnie to, co jego matka powiedziała wczoraj, w Dniu Matki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Solidarność ma zatem ograniczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można tego jednak powiedzieć o całej Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nadszedł czas, by przerwać proces akcesyjny Turcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym wspomnieć o dwóch lub trzech powodach mojej decyzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27370434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani przewodnicząca! \\\"Piękna harmonia powstaje, gdy słowa i czyny idą ze sobą w parze\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jeden z głównych wymogów transformacji demokratycznych w Tunezji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże zdecydowanie popieram ten pakiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najważniejszą kwestią jest jednak ogólne podejście do inicjatywy obywatelskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Później metodologia ta zostanie ostatecznie przedstawiona tej Izbie i Radzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Swoboda przemieszczania powinna dotyczyć nie tylko mieszkańców Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy gotowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrześniowe wybory są szeroko postrzegane jako kamień milowy na drodze ku przyszłości tego kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż wiem, że nie jest to miejsce do załatwiania prywatnych spraw, chciałem powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozporządzenie wykonawcze wiąże się z dotrzymaniem pewnych terminów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dowód podwójnej moralności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś wybudowałby, że tak powiem, drogę zapewniającą połączenie sieci z lotniskiem w Monachium\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym jednak powiedzieć również parę słów na temat tortur\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też uważam, że mają państwo rację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy przestrzegać rozsądnych zasad i realizować rozsądną politykę w obszarze ekonomi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że uda nam się przekonać do tego większość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególnie rażące moim zdaniem jest to zjawisko wśród kadry kierowniczej średniego i wyższego szczebla\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem dzisiaj za przyjęciem omawianego sprawozdania, dotyczącego norm emisji z nowych lekkich pojazdów dostawczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konieczne jest jednak nie tylko przeprowadzenie oceny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potwierdziło się to ponownie przez reakcję na uprawnioną decyzję Rosji o zawieszeniu dostaw gazu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wykorzystywanie jest wspierane nawet przez zasoby wspólnotowe - czyli z pieniędzy obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To również stwarza ryzyko pojawienia się państw A i B\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omówiłem w nim szereg obaw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie musimy jej wymuszać uchwalaniem przepisów prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę podziękować wszystkim za ciepłe przyjęcie tej inicjatywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27400522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inicjatywa obywatelska stanowi bardzo wyraźny priorytet prezydencji Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem na twoje rozkazy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, młodzi wieśniacy, nie umieliśmy jeszcze drwić sobie z wszystkiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle zaczęła mówić, szybko i gorączkowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szczotka jest na dole w izbie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha — odrzekł po chwili — o to chodzi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę teraz sobie o tym myślał, dopóki nie wrócisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto mi zabroni wejść? — odparł chłopak stanowczym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie, gdzie mieszkają lisy, wydry, borsuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładziono mu na czoło monetę: zawsze poznawał, którą stroną leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem podszedł jakiś typ w dżokejce: — Państwo tu względem czego? — Względem niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ćma dookoła lampy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mężczyźni krążyli koło prostytutek, jak tokujące gołębie; śmieszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jaki może mieć ona związek ze śp. mężem seniory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pchał go sanitariusz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak to nie wie pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całą pewnością zarządzono za nami pościg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lubię ten szum, Jerzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcieliśmy go najpierw obudzić, żebyśmy mogli porozmawiać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym wdzięczny za informację, w jakich godzinach planowany jest lot w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na twarzy jej zjawił się wyraz przestrachu i rozczarowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno tu ma się coś takiego robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdź tam szybko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie luty podkuj buty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie o czymś głęboko się zamyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mów hop, póki nie przeskoczysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzisiaj mamy być tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas potopu, pogasły gwiazdy na niebie i znikły światła na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przygoda w Lyonie zaciążyła fatalnie na całym jej życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I bawią się w zabijanie czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunęła się stała przy nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całował ją długo, podczas gdy ona patrzyła na niego uważnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc mi powiedz to słowo jedyne: czy kochasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ja będę udawała, że ty nie płaczesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedaleko od Cytadeli do Muranowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daj mi odejść, daj mi odejść — prosiła go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy się jutro na przeglądzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama leżała na łóżku i nie odrywała oczu od zakratowanego okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I już cały drętwieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam do powiedzenia o tej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech rozniesie to wszystko mnie też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wy kończony, dopasowany i martwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto garść szczegółów zebranych przeze mnie u sąsiadów i znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla takiej frajdy nie trzeba było iść tak daleko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawia się pejzaż górski, wulkaniczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna ma dwadzieścia cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam, pamiętam, posądzałem o złośliwość Pana Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś mi mówi, że próżno się niepokoicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ano, to żegnam! — ozwał się Billy — Nie przepadam wcale za nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak najbliżej, jak najbliżej koło ust…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawniej my brali od kamizelki…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak usunął jego dłoń natrętną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwieram z łomotem tylne drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Umiem obchodzić się z bronią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała historia zaczęła się niewinnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadła, otworzyła oczy i popatrzyła na niego po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Horyzont miłości wypogodził się i nastało złote, nagrzane słońcem południe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W uszach dzwoniła wciąż na alarm krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wstydź się, ja też nie bardzo umiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzięki ci! — wtórowały mrówki chórem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To najpiękniejsza rzecz w całych Włoszech\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tylko tyle możemy zrobić w zamian za nową broń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden plus, że można z nim iść do kawiarni i pogadać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżyc wchodził pomału, jak aktor na scenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W weekend majowy pojechałem w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przełykać ślinę i zapatrzył się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie doskonałe, obfite pastwiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Galeria organizuje wystawy indywidualne i zbiorowe artystów polskich i zagranicznych oraz wystawy problemowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz teraz włożyła strój zgoła odmienny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedź pan — powiedział, ale sanitariusz nie odjeżdżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mówią o skrzydłach dla ludzkości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw trzeba będzie powiedzieć mamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ja się zaraz sprowadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pomysł trzeba było odłożyć, bo zdawał maturę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy razy na dzień byłem świadkiem ceremoniału ablucji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś ze mną na rybackim bacie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwie usiadł, ledwo pani weszła, nowe nieszczęście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara zaśmiała się przyjaźnie i położyła rękę na jej ramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobra i cierpliwa mama traci wreszcie cierpliwość i daje córeczce klapsa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koło drugiej nad ranem wyczerpana usnęła mi na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej spokojny, obojętny głos mówił: — De, przepraszam, że rękę źle trzymam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pumeks jest tu niczym — wygładza powierzchownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni usiłowali prowadzić z nią rozmowy i udawało im się czasem objąć ją wpół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W trawie wrzało od owadów, jak w wonnym ukropie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A za oknem coraz wyższe słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzwonił długo, bardzo długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jadła, chudła z dnia na dzień, a nie sypiała wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, do jutra!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkał tam Alinkę, córkę znanego logistyka, przyjaciela ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie jest podobny innym: nigdy nie widziałem takiego jak on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój brat mówi, że mnie mianowali na harcmistrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodatkowo, przypuszczam, że jest zwierzęciem jadowitym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od momentu powstania gimnazjum zdobyliśmy także wiele doświadczeń pracując z młodzieżą gimnazjalną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pewnie dorośli tak samo myślą, że dzieci nic nie wiedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co ja się z nim w ogólę zadaję?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To się tylko tak mówi: „czytam”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łażę wzdłuż bulwarów, ale nie pomaga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jemu pewnie też serce mocno ze strachu biło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wpuszczono mnie do wnętrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli znowu — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie było mnie cały dzień w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krew na książkach i papierach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20622234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pokroić wędlinę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24396700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to grzech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24396701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero o wiorstę za miastem, w południowej stronie, leżała grupa wzgórz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24396702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naród u nas mówi tym samym językiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24396703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nimi, wzdychając, zabierał się i Oberman do opuszczenia sklepu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24396704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Smok Wawelski zionął ogniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc chcesz koniecznie rozpoczynać bójkę na nowo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wnet odpędził to nieusprawiedliwione podejrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Informujemy jednocześnie, iż uruchomiliśmy wszelkie niezbędne procedury mające na celu zapewnienie bezpieczeństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas zwykle zajmujące rozmowy, wspomnienia miłosne, przyszłe zamiary małżonków, były rozbierane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedł na schodki, wiodące do trybuny sędziów i oglądał się na wszystkie strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wiesz, kim on jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bierz ją sobie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chce mnie kupić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałam, że był zaambarasowany!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"świnie mogą żyć tak jak wy, ale nie ludzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynym usprawiedliwieniem dzieł nieużytecznych jest wywołana nimi potęga zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiż zeń prostaczek w szarej sukience.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24422968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba rozumiem o co ci chodziło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24423003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż, dawniej, trzy czwarte małżeństw z miłości zawiązywało się przez taniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24423004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubisz śpiewać, zostań śpiewakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24423005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy w Paryżu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24423006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj upiekła go mama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24423007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"proszę zawinąć go w papierek...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi Handlowcy pozostają do Państwa dyspozycji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale trudno; nie można zawsze żyć jak w klasztorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inkasent rzucił mu się do nóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okazało się, że nikogo tam nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.412,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„To trzymajże język za zębami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mi się, że w Warszawie jest ciaśniej i że wszyscy są odurzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była ciepła, niebo czyste; nie pamiętam, ażebym kiedykolwiek widział więcej gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rób już sekretu, że ja kupiłem kamienicę Łęckich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie moje pieniądze!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na własną odpowiedzialność wnika się poza kształt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„No, mieszka właśnie tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i taka żoneczka niewiele zostawiłaby mu chwil wolnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twoja rada jest roztropną i usłucham jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spieszę się bo niedługo czas pójść do szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkaliśmy na Starem Mieście z ciotką, która urzędnikom prała i łatała bieliznę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił, że musi nauczycielce dopomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale niech żałuje Rossi, że jej nie widział!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pysznie gra ten facet i muszę zobaczyć go drugi raz...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela w milczeniu ucałowała ręce ciotki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego dnia bardzo rzadko widywałem się z naszą pryncypałową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zewnątrz dał się słyszeć hałas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24455431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Izabela potrząsnęła głową, jakby chcąc odpędzić przykre myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24786828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na skrzydła uderzyły dwa inne, bratnie pułki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24786829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klacz idzie jak woda!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24786830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet „Woltyżer“ nie mógł wytrzymać porównania z tym wspaniałym ogierem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24786831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie wiem; jednakże na wszelki wypadek, chcę być przygotowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24786832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na łóżku młoda dziewczyna spała albo leżała pozornie martwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24786833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I musi być tak, jak chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24786834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej zapewnili mnie, że mają zwyczaj tylko na konie patrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24786835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czuję, iż ją zobaczę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24786836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zdołasz mieć taką stałość, wyznaj, czy czujesz się dość silną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24786837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsza rzecz, jaka wyprowadziła nas z równowagi, było to ogłoszenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24930944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radia słucham, a co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24930945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zarumieniła się, usłyszawszy moje nazwisko...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24930946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Typ jakiego jeszcze nigdy nie widziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24930947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przebaczał im i puszczał je na wolność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25128170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstała pewnie lewą nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25128171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz dużo czasu już minęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25128172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek i zwierz poczęli się szarpać i szamotać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25128173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za szczególne stworzenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25128175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blanka była jak na torturach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież go mogę spotkać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż po całym drzewie spływała woda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogrodnik oblewa je płynem dezynfekcyjnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta trzecia czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.412,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jak się stąd wydostać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gubernator podskoczył na krześle, lecz w tejże chwili pomyślał, że to było niepodobnem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Resztę zarobiłeś sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My w każdym razie tego nie doczekamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała pani: „porywczy”, nie: „złośnik”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżając się do farmy, zdziwił się na widok dwóch koni, przywiązanych do kraty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zakazane jest przesyłanie listów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.412,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam dobrze całą rodzinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lejek z czarnej skóry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwukrotnie chcesz złamać słowo, które dałeś umierającej żonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mruknął coś i potrząsnął swoją wielką głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł drżącą rękę szklankę i wychylił ją, zanim zdobył się na odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieprzytomny prawie utkwiłem wzrok na jakiejś malowanej postaci mnicha w sąsiedniej kaplicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pytał Zwak i nieufnie spojrzał na muzyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zbrodnię jego nie można było znaleźć określenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mijał dzień po dniu, cicho i spokojnie, nadszedł ostateczny termin, oznaczony przez wojewodzica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten, który wczoraj uchodził za szarlatana, jutro uznany zostanie za profesora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tam chcesz, ważne, żeby działało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie tam na górze, dowiedziałem się o tem u tych draniów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżem przemarzył czas?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zaś do wódki, będziecie dostawać oznaczoną porcję, ale nie więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.412,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co ja też przeniosłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęście, że nieszpory już skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie wbiegł do komnaty stęskniony królewicz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25560156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim ten nowy fakt wykazał mi, iż myliłem się najzupełniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament ma jednak dobrą pamięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spieszy się Maciuś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często do siebie telefonujemy i trzy razy jedliśmy razem lunch w Pałacu Elizejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak umowa o wolnym handlu przyniesie również istotne korzyści europejskim eksporterom produktów przemysłowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli do tego dojdzie, to w ten sposób pomożemy tylko terrorystom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To całkowicie błędne przekonanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wreszcie, opiekunowie pracują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy będziemy ponosić konsekwencje budowy i eksploatacji tego rurociągu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy zatem wiążącego celu w obszarze efektywności energetycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zasadzie z zadowoleniem przyjmuję umowę w sprawie wolnego handlu z Koreą Południową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowaliśmy przeciwko przyjęciu przedmiotowego sprawozdania z trzech zasadniczych powodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że to jest główna przyczyna potraktowania jej w tak nieludzki sposób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz odpowiedź Maćka i pod tym względem sprawiła mu zawód zupełny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_37632653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem bezpieczeństwa żywności nie należy poświęcać z racji ograniczeń budżetowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś w ten deseń — uśmiechnął się zjadliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był mały pięcioletni Jano i jego świat magii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu chyba znowu rozbijamy się o nieuchwytność zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już dwie szyby w tym roku stłukli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem mag ginie w tym wypadku zatruty własnym jadem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucała się w oczy od razu oryginalna kompozycja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nic sobie wtedy z niego nie robiłam, ale byłam zadowolona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akcent słów brzmiał trochę obco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten granitowy wykwit gruntu był zagadką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do aktywacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To też nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeszcze szarpną, pchną, uderzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tego nie odpuszczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pierwszy tydzień zapisywał Maciuś, ile dni jest w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy na dobre zamilkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno wyrzucać zużytych baterii do zwykłych śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I w dodatku, temu brak ręki, a owemu nogi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mój kochanku, mój mężu najdroższy! — usłyszałem przerywany szlochaniem jej szept.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż zamierzył się Felek na majstra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę się dalej bawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy na tarasie i oglądaliśmy seriale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tak była czarna, że prawie niebieska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy mówił o widmowej twarzy, oczy Hanny rozszerzyły się przerażeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gniję pomału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby się chciało trochę przesadzać, można by powiedzieć, że jego zdania mogą zabijać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A źle ci u nas?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ten tam — to twój ojciec?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja chcę zaraz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wy nie znacie miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co właściwie stanęło na przeszkodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram usłyszał wołanie, nie przystanął jednak, tylko przyspieszył jeszcze bieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech wypije szklankę wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można jej było powierzać najtrudniejsze zlecenia i posyłki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i przestałem się pytać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A muszą się ukrywać, bo im nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była doskonale piękna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbliższy tydzień upłynął niemal cały na przygotowaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam inne rzeczy: naukę, pisanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmowa była tak chaotyczna, że nic nie można było zrozumieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby kózka nie skakała, to by nóżki nie złamał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezczelność tego człowieka, który pozwalał się znieważać bezkarnie bez powodu, rozbrajała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie zamierzałam tego powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłażą robaki różowe, nieprzyzwoite i rosną dalej, jak trawa do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, przyznaj się — nastawał wodząc ustami po jej cudnej szyi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znam ja te wasze gorączki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic się nie stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie łamcie przysiąg wobec niewinnej dziewulinki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tamten jest trójdzielny — odpowiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ona — ona mnie kochała — i byłem szczęśliwy, bez miary szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym wiedziała, nie lękałabym się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ja nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona nie znosiła dotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasia wyszła na podwórko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie — rzekł prawie surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— My nic nie wiemy — mówią dozorcy więzienni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodził z kąta w kąt i coś tam mruczał pod nosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tobie się podobał ten głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy, kiedy ty ze Stanisławem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co zobaczył, poza śmiesznością jej pozycji, było dziwne i poniosło go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak przeważnie widziałem je leżące w łóżkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do fortepianu dziwnie miękko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wiele przebaczyć możemy, jeżeli widzimy: dobroć i szczerość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do widzenia! — odparł, podnosząc ku ustom jej rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wydajesz mi się przerażona tym wszystkim, moje biedne dziecko! — odezwała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, zwariowałaś? W tej chwili pożałował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tobie je składam w ofierze, o piękny, połyskujący płomieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczam, że sztuczne, zrobione z jakiejś masy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokończę jeden poziom i idę spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała oczy zamknięte już nie tak kurczowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, gdybym nawet mógł znów się zamienić, wolałbym jeszcze spróbować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaciągnąłem się wraz z innymi i wyprawiono mnie do hacjendy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta wyjął z szafy swe rękopisy i rozrzucił po podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak pani przeczytała w mamusi oczach, że śpiąca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko się odczepili, bo bardzo byli zajęci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko schowało głowę w ramionach osłupiałego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby tak było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czym szli zgodnie i umownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tutaj nic się nie zmieniło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzi do mnie wtedy, gdy w domu są awantury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Waga po prostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się pan nie zapomina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie przyjemnie się wypróbować albo pokazać, że się nie boję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło w pokoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprost nie mógł tego pojąć, ale czuł, że już wszystko skończone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez te dwa lata mnie tu w tych stronach nie było…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten człowiek wciąż jeszcze stoi na korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mowa jest srebrem, a milczenie złotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym tkwi gra polityczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo! — pocieszył go Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc czemuż się ich obawiać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz mógł dokładnie spojrzeć jej w dotąd półmrokiem nocy zakrytą twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to jest najwyraźniej w świecie obmierzła twarz konduktora!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo i władze państwowe powinny ułatwić korzystanie z tego prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale biada temu, kto by je próbował ruszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet z godziny na godzinę! — odpowiedział Hugon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba to schować i odprowadzić bawoły! — powiedział — Pomóżcie mi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mądry Polak po szkodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co myślisz o tym, aby Połę wziąć na kolację? Ojciec lubi ładne dziewczęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zresztą, jeżeli nie wierzysz, popatrz sama spoza firanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napastnicy, pobici i odparci, uciekli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Panie skrzydlaty, uważaj na przeciąg!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzą jej kochankowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W operacyjnej paliło się niebiesko-białe światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20795639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Największą część dnia pochłaniało polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Widzę to, widzę to” — powtarzałem sobie w myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zechce ze mną zatańczyć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fredek zwisał jak worek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja babcia zaczęła mi wysyłać memy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brak silnych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda szepce, krzyczy, mówi co innego, i mieszają się ich głosy, jak gwar tłumu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nie sprawiało mu to przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Węże w pustynnych źródłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co innego jest fikcja w powieści, a co innego rzeczywistość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze delegat podpisał w księdze więziennej pokwitowanie, że odebrał Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwa zemsta kochanki dosięgła mnie w samo serce…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom publiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Obrączka więc uwarunkowała wizję nieboszczyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy, kiedy ty ze Stanisławem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądał ją więc i myślał: — To ją powinno trochę przynajmniej denerwować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłby przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A teraz powiedz hasło ptaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zaroślach rozległ się trzask gałęzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak wypuścił z ręki jej dłoń drobną i niemal dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama nie wiem, co piszę, taka jestem ostatnio roztrzęsiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bachory pisiały na jezdnię; były wyblakłe, złośliwe i mądre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdawała sobie sprawy z tego, jak długo spała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale poza tym nie była wstydliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten człowiek wciąż jeszcze stoi na korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jasnowłosy był jak ty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włazimy do pokoju przez okienko z łazienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa podeszła, jak lunatyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mefisto idzie cudownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary głupiec byłby żył zdrowo do tej pory, gdybym był trzeźwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto się czubi, ten się lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie wyjrzałem i zobaczyłem swego brunatnego sąsiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem nalewał wody do wanny i robił okręty z papieru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, ale nie z jednej strony tylko, jak na tych jabłonkach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wszystko złoto, co się świeci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myję zęby po każdym posiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przemknął mu wargami tuż koło ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre pnie złociły się wypukle, niby oszklone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Premier spotkał się dzisiaj z prezydentem za zamkniętymi drzwiami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza Fauna — to sen o śnie, sen posępny i niespokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się językiem broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące kierunków, dziesięć tysięcy niepotrzebnych ruchów, kroków i chwytów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekund kilka — jak wiek długich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożegnali się i Emil wrócił nad rzekę i wrócił do Sokra tesa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat pełen jest larw i masek zrodzonych w ten sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz jednak siedział nieruchomo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Doskonale! — powiedziałem, zwracając się do kozaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak tu mało zieleni! — rzekłem tonem skargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te trzy książki czytał na zmianę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola, która to usłyszała: — Idę też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazały dorosłym chodzić do szkoły, same wszystko zepsuły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł jej niczym zastąpić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko na tematy teoretyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami czujemy przecie, więc po co zaraz robić awantury?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teresa transportowała tirem do tartaku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil mówi, że to wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, nie mogę tego teraz zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko, wezwij karetkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nie ma w głowie człowieczków, ale czy nie wszystko jedno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest w tej nieszczęśliwej coś niepokojącego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona należy do niego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest pełne możliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy trochę zaczekać, aż któraś podpłynie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy mówię, że czary, to czary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkańcy przyzwyczaili się już do ścisku, złego dojazdu do cmentarza oraz korków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trąciła mnie wachlarzem w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś ze mną na rybackim bacie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powtórz jeszcze raz — prosił Krzysiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogą się oderwać od biopodłoża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jej nogi były czerwone aż do kolan, wyżej białe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co? — W klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niskich brzegach stała mgła, ścieląca się ku morzu coraz cieńszą warstwą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nicość jest nieskończonością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy nie umrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dlaczego właściwie pan mi to wszystko przypomina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby chciało mnie ostrzec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Był to jeden z najtęższych w okolicy „szczurów wodnych”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tępym, automatycznym krokiem wywlokłem się z mieszkania…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pewien czas udawali, że nic nie czują.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ naturalnie, że mi zależy, nawet bardzo, bardzo zależy — zapewnił gorąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie z gumowymi wężami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym przy stosunku zachowuje się też dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłaniałabym się bardziej do tego, żeby na tym, co jest, stworzyć coś lepszego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wymienione przeze mnie ruchy są więc fikcją?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki potwierdzająco kiwnął dłonią, lecz słowem się nadal nie ozwał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem stawia na przemian — raz duży, raz mały krok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzież mieli szukać spotkania z bogami, z dobrymi i złymi duchami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to dowód oczywisty! — zgodzili się jednomyślnie słuchacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co też tym kobietom do głowy przychodzi — rzekł mąż pani Emilii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiwat, niech żyje protokół!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie czekając na deser, zszedł wolno ze schodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A bo dziś jest pierwszy śnieg, a wy nie uważacie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On to szponami wyciska pękające wrzody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszła mimo jak symbol cierpienia i śmieszności splecionych w tragiczny węzeł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ten głos?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej życie biegło ostrymi, gwałtownymi skrętami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był czas, kiedy mówiono o ich małżeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzekam, że nie ruszę się z tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazała im narysować w domu obrazki do tej baśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O mój Boże, za cóż takich łask zaznałam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A miałeś jakiś wybór?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie chciał „uciekać”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20637679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była doskonale piękna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś położył jej dłoń na czole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwunasta trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno ci płakać! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże inaczej wyglądał teraz mój pokój!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja zabiorę się z bratem, a ty odbierz mamę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za trumną szedł mąż i dziewczę zapłakane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Dwie ścieżki biegną w dal obok siebie: droga życia i droga śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Gdzie serce z czerwonego kamienia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idziesz ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak się stało, moi panowie, że straciłem ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten człowiek zaniesie wasze rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świeży wiatr powiewa od rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pisałem cały tydzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z książkami jest inaczej, niż mi się zdawało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego on chce od niego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszą moją czynnością było porozumienie się z moim sąsiadem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stacji nie mogłem znaleźć powozu i dlatego spóźniłem się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł ciało do góry, wrzucił do trumny i nakrył wiekiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Iskry się sypały z czerwonych szklanych lamp.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu czytałem na drzwiach porcelanową tabliczkę z nazwiskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głębi duszy miał nadzieję, iż pisma tego nie podadzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciałem cię obrazić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polowanie przelatywało obok mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo nie może zasnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułem, jak cała krew spływa mi się w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co najpierw przynieść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak tyś się o tym dowiedziała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszej chwili chciała po prostu wygnać precz przyjaciółkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina czwarta czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem znowu moją nieznajomą: mieszka w jednym z domów na tarasie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okazało się, że padł jeden koń i kilkunastu pagazich zostało w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiech ten dość szeroki odsłonił brak kilku zębów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może powiecie, że byłem równie zły, jak i wy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby mi pan powiedział, co pana tak przeraża, wiedziałbym, jak należy postąpić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To twarda sztuka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokolenia te żyły w ustawicznej wojnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręcił i wkręcał się wszędzie, wyrastał, gdzie nie posiali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi tedy i milczy, Tadeusz pomału\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic zaś innego nie pozostawało, jak wejść do pałacu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strasznie się przeziębiłem i od tygodnia siedzę w zamknięciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy już tysiące razy nie udawało mi się coś cudownego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdobywał się na uderzenia tak słabe, że były one dla Mistrza nieszkodliwe zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy Ania już śpi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc mów, kto mordował mych żołnierzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walczyli za ojczyznę, lecz byli pokonani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapamiętaj to sobie raz na zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem… ale może byłoby najlepiej… nie, to na pewno głupie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I waszych Szkotów spotykałem kilkakrotnie przy robocie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że nie zechcesz ustanawiać całego królestwa żab za moim nieszczęsnym kołnierzem?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez podręcznego plecaka, nie dałby rady tego dokonać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie daj, Boże, dostać się w jego ręce!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod koniec wieczerzy kobieta usługująca podała wino.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery promile i jeszcze po wódę sięgasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"po prostu zatkany jak zlew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za każdym jego zastosowaniem umierałaś, właściwie mówiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął rozmyślać nad tym, co powie, gdy Ania przyjdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakże będziesz chodziła z taką strzechą na głowie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pan widzi świat roślinny ocalał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz wiem, że tak nie jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po krótkiem przesłuchaniu u inspektora, będącego na służbie oddano go na wspólną salę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko obrzydliwy patos działa na takie psie nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj wieczorem o godzinie dwudziestej, odbędzie się zebranie klasowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeważnie jednak były one zamieszkałe przez niezawisłe pokolenia Arabo-Murzynów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minęli jedną chałupę z ogródkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy pan gotów jest przysiądz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W brzuszku burczało głośno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko kiedy wszakże zdarzyło się, żebym miał przewyżkę, ale jakoś radziłem sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzcie na te ślady, krew ciekła po ścianie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ukryta głęboko wśród złocistych włosów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy przygotowania już poczyniono, na scenie zjawiła się nowa posłać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżyc błyszczał na niebie, oświecając wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czeka ich ładna praca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Stefan Gerard rozpaczał z tego powodu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Śni ci się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie włościan rosyjskich inną zgoła potoczyło się koleją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzepkowa poczęła się po izbie rozglądać i gospodarować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na to mistrz zmarszczył brwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w domu i nie wyjeżdżał wczoraj do żadnego chorego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam tylko te kwiatki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu człapanie pantofli!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłeś wtenczas jeszcze mały i może nic o tym nie słyszałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czy ty myślisz, że nie ma nic między Ewą i Jankiem? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25878861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I niemasz nadziei na odzyskanie straconej pamięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wkrótce się dowiesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądał o dziesięć lat młodziej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale uprzedzam cię, że moje skrzydła już rosną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie trzeba było odłożyć pytania i wyjaśnienia do dni następnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem inni wyciągali na pokład jakiegoś siwego mężczyznę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze wsi do wsi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg uderza, czyż można umknąć przed jego ciosem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie miała się położyć już spać, kiedy uwagę jej zwróciło gwałtowne dzwonienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale młynarz stracił odwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze, jeszcze trochę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakołysał się tłum i pędem począł uciekać, kryjąc się po bramach i mieszkaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogły więc z głodu zemrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A to dopiero awantura!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł na to generał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja co wieczór będę przypływać do ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekam w Miller Hill.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilę staliśmy nieruchomo i nasłuchiwaliśmy nad otworem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wycieńczony; na rękach i nogach całą skórę miał zdrapaną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25879406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech Smoka i wycie zwierząt ścigały ją czas długi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25928011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po miesiącach negocjacji osiągnięto ostatecznie porozumienie w tej kluczowej dla konsumentów europejskich, sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25928012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co powoduje występowanie takich oporów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25928013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak już wcześniej wspomniano, premierzy Wielkiej Brytanii, Francji i Niemiec wydali odrębne oświadczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25928014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Szwecji pewien pastor był ścigany sądownie za cytowanie Biblii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25928015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W imieniu Rady pragnę panu życzyć wszystkiego dobrego w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak dojść na dworzec kolejowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co posiadasz, do mnie teraz należy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytulona do niego Nel dygotała tak, jakby już chwycił ją pierwszy atak febry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Dzięki Bogu, cień ten nigdy nie padnie na ciebie“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Murzyni, słuchając jego słów, powtarzali co chwila jedni drugim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor spojrzał zdziwiony i trochę zgorszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie nie rozumieli już całkiem, jakim sposobem mały Polak tego dokonał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może u panny Smoczek, co wciąż palec ssie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nel ośmieliła się stopniowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A oto w tysiące serc idzie tyle cichych szeptów — wspomnień, tęsknoty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak myślała? Łechtaczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyobraź sobie, co Ania uczyniła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wyjaśniał Tadeusz te sprawy powoli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas stał nieruchomo jak ocean podczas ciszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę się położyć spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I począł gładzić się po piersiach powtarzając z widoczną rozkoszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nel dyszała, jak ptak, więc Staś oddał jej gumową flaszkę i krzyknąwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie płacz, dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, widzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To może jakąś taką bieliznę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tu poczuł, że nie ma sił iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo może mnie kto z ziemią zabierze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelkie wydatki ponosił rząd egipski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wylazło szydło z worka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak spo tykamy się, mogłabyś przynajmniej nie ciągnąć za sobą tego stworzenia, Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapętlił się w swoich tłumaczeniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od skoczył od fortepianu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszli na działkę, dowiadywali się o niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całe szczęście, bo na pewno byłoby nowe obrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co noc obchodził dom dokoła, gdyż bał się ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poproś najbliższych znajomych, by wzięli udział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U największych rycerzy chuj się baby boi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał o tym w gazecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnęła się do niego po raz pierwszy od chwili porwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśleli zapewne wszyscy, że to jedna ze służebnych wraca, spełniwszy polecenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiał i czuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie byłoby to dziwnie… na Boga! — burknął czeladnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdumienie, gniew i ból toczyły walkę w jej sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świeca paliła się na stole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina czternasta dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież to licho małe jak igła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pójdę i przyniosę tytoń oraz zapałki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Głupia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gruby jak ręka w kiści, twardy jak ze stali\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrywieczór Państwu. Komisarz Pacholski Komenda Główna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak długo cię nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słoń zaś cofnął w tył swoje bajeczne uszy, zwijając i rozwijając na przemian trąbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wierzę ci, Marku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się w milczeniu do swoich kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komary tańczyły i świergotały jak pisklęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym, czego ślepy kutas nie zobaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Także w innych izbach niejedno nadawało się do zmiany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"oddał mi poważne usługi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo odbija się od talerza i razi mnie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój stary jest fanatykiem wędkarstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna na Morzu Południowochińskim to kwestia czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego chcesz, mały?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oj, pęknę ze śmiechu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przez to okno? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pocieszał się, że do jutra Kasia zapomni o swoim gnieździe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do naszego domu jest też wejście od tyłu, od podwórka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja Turka zastąpię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21174994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak tak mówią, to opinia zobowiązuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to było jakby w strasznym śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara odjęła ręce od twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I na wierzchu pierścionek odpustowy z czerwonym oczkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Surowość kroju, która była równocześnie perwersją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zamówić pizzę z ananasem na ulicę Rolniczą dwanaście, mieszkania czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? — pyta mama, która była bardzo dobra i bardzo cierpliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przyjmiesz ją na powrót w swój dom?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty uwiodłaś go dla satysfakcji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc zdołała otworzyć drzwi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dojedziemy tylko do Nilu, a Nilem do El-Wasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na gazie to się gotuje, a nie jeździ?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Druga wojna światowa rozpoczęła się pierwszego września tysiąc dziewięćset trzydziestego dziewiątego roku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie na dworzec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przekonałem się, iż popełniłaś wielką omyłkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał też na puszkę z ładunkami leżącą między nim a Chamisem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Babcia zapaliła świecę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina piąta dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obyczajnie nazywać trzeba - przyrodzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to jeden z tych dramatycznych momentów, dla których żył mój przyjaciel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z tobą tak zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przypominam sobie nic podobnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ze Staszkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta spóźniona przestroga zdawała się ani przerażać, ani martwić Marylę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili jednak ogólne wzburzenie nastąpiło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zjadł dwie porcje lodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"weszli do parku, w którym grała orkiestra, blady zdrojowy park.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego dnia przysiadł sobie wiatr na wysokim drzewie w parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Później Janek przeprowadzi się do tego narożnego pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może dlatego zostały zesłane, żeby mnie wypróbować!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prohibicja umożliwiła powstanie zorganizowanej przestępczości w Stanach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Położyła swoją rękę na jego ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu? — zapytała Sara z ciekawością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piechtami kawał świata zdreptawszy, poznali skąpy nadmiar zabrakowanych i niczyich przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mamo — krzywi się nosek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał uważnie i aż podskoczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki daszek przy wejściu do pałacu, taką bramę w murze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całując pożądliwie od wewnętrznej strony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybył do wioski, rozbił w niej swój namiot i zamierzał zapolować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musicie panowie wiedzieć jeszcze jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziemia była stratowana, w zagłębieniach całe kałuże krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego właśnie przyszło mi na myśl, że ktoś go ściga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojechał w świat szukać lepszej gospody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21175173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad miarę wina piłem wczoraj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu — było ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie wyrzuty sumienia, a taka tylko natrętna myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To co, do zobaczenia za miesiąc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czytałem to przez całą noc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była stanowczo za ładna i za dobrze deklamowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni tu będą za chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła przez zęby, bo trzymała między nimi szpilki do włosów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brat zaprosił mnie na absolutorium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś dawał się strącać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zebrali się na tajną naradę bez króla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno było sobie wyobrazić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulokowali panią w okropnej dziurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zależało jej na tym, aby była czysto ubrana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tego śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jadę na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na podłodze też nie leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przestań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiło na mnie wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu trzeba tyle czekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadę w sprawie urzędowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to sprytnie obmyślane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę jutro, chcę dziś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz przejdziemy do ustaleń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jest jakiś wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, od jutra, od jutra — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale czy można było tak zaraz, od razu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Źle — mówi pani nauczycielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelkie nazwy będą fałszywe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleżanki mi opowiadały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę sobie w świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie zmieniła świat cały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na razie nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie twoje rzemiosło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za bajeczne okładki!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od czego zaczniemy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ten głos?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie znam tego pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, że jest przyjemny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał może czterdzieści lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była druga w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil czuł, że się dusi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej możecie wrócić do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Omijam ją z daleka…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko dziś nie ma na to czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta jest prawie napisana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadka ta zupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wyszedł z sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie jest to zgodne z prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałam do południa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego się śmiejesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęły się dziać dziwne rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie udało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to jej tajemnica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się stało, wiesz sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki śmieszny chłopak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zabolało go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż ty mówisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiem ci wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pan mi wierzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina druga czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie martw się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina jedenasta piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To pewno serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę pójść i obejrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniej więcej piąta po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z życia codziennego celebryty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwunasta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20896980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina druga trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wola wasza jest świętą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona wszystko gotuje dla ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” To powiedział Nietzsche i to wystarczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba się tego nauczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie musisz mnie odprowadzać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mięśnie wyczerpały się szybko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogadajmy sobie o czymś wesołym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiał lekki wiatr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ile mam psów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęła go radość!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt mnie nie zatrzyma!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudził się w obcej izbie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oni wracają!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry, kochany słoniu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czesała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak potrafiłabyś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już kapią gwiazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, gdybyście wiedzieli!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajrzał do kieszeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto mnie zastąpi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może urok?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście dom był blisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie nic sztucznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Któż był autorem tego pomysłu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo zachowała się i teraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy tym głodny był ogromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liza skinęła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oprócz mnie nikt tam nie wchodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się nareszcie śmiał!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż to może szkodzić, że dziś pojadę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20898672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zlała ich aż po włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22995912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezsilny znów upadłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22995913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż wiedziałem, że wola mi odmówi, pragnąłem jednak teraz spróbować przemówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22995914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzyłem prędko i zamknąłem drzwi za sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22995916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mruczenie kota jest odprężające.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22995917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdarzenie to wymaga pewnych objaśnień i uzupełnień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem sobie uświadomić, czym go kiedykolwiek zauważył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jeszcze miałem do zrobienia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak szły lata za latami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zwak, nie opowiesz nam nic więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się jednak, że nigdy mu tego nie powiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale cokolwiek bądź musiałem odpowiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niech cię szlag trafi i krew nagła zaleje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Droga w parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczenie nie zgadzało się z temi domysłami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieustannie musiałem myśleć o Rozynie, jak ta nago we fraku tańcowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak kropelki łez żałoby dźwięki te zapadały w omdleniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyraziście ujrzałem znowu to wszystko przed sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostali wkrótce umarli, i myślę że ona ich wszystkich przedwcześnie powiodła do grobu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to czworokątna płyta z kółkiem do podnoszenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pieniądze ma się rozumieć, przyjąłem.“ Zakręciło mi się w głowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak, tak, to był jego chód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słyszał mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W usta, czoło, oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Piszę do Pana ten list w niesłychanym pośpiechu i najwyższej trwodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy twarz tego człowieka nie ma dziwnego podobieństwa z moją?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starałem się go naprawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem dwuznaczność, ukrytą w jego słowach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były to drzwi spuszczane dające światłu przejście przez szpary!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie było by to gorzej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet pragnienie dalszych poszukiwań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznałem obcą twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie udaje mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże to prawdziwe!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle tylko była pod ręką!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udzielone mi były uświadomienia najrzadszego rodzaju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prezentuj broń!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pan tego nie zna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili spytał mnie muzyk, czy nie chcę się trącić szklankami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co to ma znaczyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżem przemarzył czas?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzywszy drzwi spostrzegłem, że w pokoju był zmrok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udowodniłbym to nawet, gdyby Rozyna była podobną do tandeciarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiłem do niej to, co mi chwila przyniosła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wargi podniósł do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ramiona rozpostarł, co znaczyło, że nie wypuszcza nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż on rozumiał pod tą „lalką woskową“?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nakreślić plan dla studenta, co czynić potem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet można wejść przez drzwi tajemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stać, jesteście otoczeni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może mam pana uczyć po niemiecku?“ przerwał mi ordynarnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie mogę mówić nic więcej, niż to com powiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem w ręku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to coś niewidzialnego, coś grobowego, lecz nie rozumiałem co to jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Angelina plotła tak, jak wodospad, ja zaś byłem oczarowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Tylko po części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyśliłem się, że ona już nie myśli, aby co kolwiek ukrywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym domu wesoły śmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułem, jak ją dzika trwoga opanowuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokój zniknął mi w oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż miałem wejść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko z tyłu głowy wyczuwałem jeszcze zimne ślady ich dotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obłąkany z miłości zatopiłem usta w jej dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłosierni golarze zadają zgniłe rany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wisiało na sznurku jedwabnym, I błyszczało w jutrzni porannej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tam za bardzo nie narzekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakieś uspokojenie zapanowało we mnie, żem się nie poddał żadnym nowym pokusom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogłuszony, pół uchem nadsłuchiwałem, co mi plótł zadyszany od wzburzenia Zwak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzydziestego czerwca można świętować dzień rozwalania zabawek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W dole pieniła się rzeka, pełna nienawiści ku fundamentom mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nic zupełnie nie mogłem sobie wyobrazić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co za obrona konieczna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, że w duchu ogląda jakiś obraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem potem nad rzeką, oparty o żelazną poręcz i spoglądałem w szumiące fale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może sama powie teraz rozstrzygające słowo i ja będę mógł wszystko jej wyznać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieruchomo nabrzmiałem okiem spoglądał na bramę przeciwległego domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22996999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżeć w mokrej ziemi i mieć w sobie niestrawione gnijące jedzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znana Panu dama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykładami niewulgarnych wyzwisk są wyrazy przybłęda, oblech, pokraka, karakan i łajza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnąłem rękę do krzesła obok mego łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak nie, to nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotnie, tak, to prawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź się uspokój, dobra?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydzielał się z niej zapach pleśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z czego on mógł żyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zawsze to samo imię Rozyna; zawsze jedna jest zmartwychwstaniem drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieustannie czułem na piersi, że list przy sobie niosę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwałem się; gdzie jestem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to niepodobieństwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z uśmiechem kiwnął głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłoż to zupełnie niemożliwe, abym z dnia na dzień stał się sławnym człowiekiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręce na plecach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani chwili nie tracić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Książe podał urzędnikowi kartę wizytową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale już w czasie liczenia zauważyłem coś szczególnego; karty były jak z lodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzkie serce szukało u mnie pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko na małą chwileczkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja tylko chcę spytać o której wracasz z roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno z tem zaprawdę walczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów zagasiłem świecę i w ubraniu rzuciłem się na łóżko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem twarz obcą, bez zarostu, o wystających kościach policzkowych i spoglądałem ukośnymi oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie postaram się o sznur i nie powieszę się na nim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W nadmiarze serdeczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Kura do rosołu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo woli cofnąłem rękę, którą przy jego wejściu wyciągnąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Żyję niby w błogosławieństwie sennem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie całe przystało by szukać wzajemnej odpowiedniości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby mi czas płynął prędzej, wziąłem ze stosu książek starożytną grę w taroka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech pan mi wierzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"szybko odpowiedział Prokop, jakby chciał usprawiedliwić swe milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to on wymyślił, uroił sobie, wyśnił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22997687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"spytała, nie spodziewając się podstępu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze mu się działo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan to wszystko może wiedzieć? — zapytał szczerze zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu chyba znowu rozbijamy się o nieuchwytność zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz rozmawiał najpierw z matką, a Emil siedział w poczekalni i miał tremę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanalizowałem drogą alchemiczną wodę przepojoną fluidami tej kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ot, co wymyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara z wolna zaczęła uspokajać się w płaczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz ode mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich tam, zdaje się, mieszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie, jak gdyby jakiś czarodziej wdawał się w tę sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął nóź kuchenny i podszedł do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te jej dziwne cechy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby iść tak… żeby iść tak… i wciąż iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było staczać ustawiczne walki z wrogimi szczepami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się na to, że jesteśmy pokraczni — rzekł tymczasem zatrwożony nieco Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem położył się i patrzył uporczywie w sufit, przez który było widać gwiazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś spojrzał smutnemu królowi prosto w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś szarpnął mnie silnie za rękaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to nie wygląda na paradoks?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócił do pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje mi się, przywiązujesz zbyt wielką wagę do tego krążka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niby nic się nie zmieniło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie lubię przesądnych mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puść mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam, żeby pisać i opracować w formie pisemnej relacje tych osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę się jeszcze ogolić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka była przerażona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie wstał i nie spojrzawszy na mnie więcej, wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinął mi głową i skierował się ku drzwiom mieszkania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę głosić nowych zasad moralnych ani też obalać porządku społecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że rozmowa półsłówkami, którą prowadzili, rozmowa półtonami, była grą wysokiej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, ale na drodze do wolności stało siedem dzikich bestii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu tych czterech dni odeszła przedostatnia fala moich czytelników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem gasi świecę, otwiera okno i wygląda na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zaraz na drugi dzień było nowe przedstawienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w życiu bardzo zajęty kobietami i zagadnieniem przemiany gatunków bakterii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytam i nudzę się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fryzjer jest czynny od poniedziałku do piątku w godzinach od ósmej do osiemnastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twój ojciec zaprosił mnie na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spaceruję po lesie, z duszą na ramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko mi się pomieszało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego go lubię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie, niesie koszyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ciebie nam było żal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjechał Seweryn i wydano ją bez gadania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby ktoś zapytał mnie, czy jestem patriotą lokalnym, odpowiedziałbym, że tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielkie radości i wielkie smutki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A łydka? — pytałem niecierpliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz przyniósł fotografie porn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On powiada, że cię sprzątnie ze świata nożem lub trucizną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za zagadkowy splot wydarzeń!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile lat miała najstarsza osoba na świecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed samą wieczerzą wrócili do obozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapałka zgasła właśnie, gdy stanęli na najniższym piętrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się, szli na przełaj przez las, który huczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo ja to źle zrobiłem, albo ona jest nieco dziwna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czytaj od trzeciego wiersza z góry!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkość działania nie była cechą natury młynarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona przebiegła obok niego, myśląc, że zajęty bójką nic nie widzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała katar pęcherza, zmarzła na ławce w parku i chciało jej się bardzo siusiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę — odparł po chwili, podając mu cygaro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie unoś się — przemówił miękko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, nie, mnie to dobrze robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz ostrożność nie zawadzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sięgnął ręką po piersi, które począł pieszczotliwie gładzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy powiedziałem coś zabawnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbowałeś restartować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U jednego zobaczyła erekcję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wróćmy się do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegli żwawo poprzez gąszczary i przesmyki leśne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośród wszystkich dni i nocy, ta jedna noc stała się najwyższym ziszczeniem mego bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaskawie przyjął ich spojrzenia i wyprostował się uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam do powiedzenia o tej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Twoja mamusia powiedziała, że nie będzie cię więcej biła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwila ciszy takiej, że słychać było chrzęst badyla, który się uginał pod ciężarem jaszczurki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś patetyczny, mój piękny małżonku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łagodnie ująłem go za ramiona i posadziłem w fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego z przodu idzie dwóch, a z tyłu czterech?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc on się koło mnie położył i leżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rodzina Halszki z pietyzmem usiłowała podtrzymać jego pierwotny charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinał jej suknię, która była łatwa do rozpinania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze znajdywałem przyjemność w czytaniu dwuznacznych wierszy i jednoznacznych kpin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli łagodnie i lekko pijani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydał cichy syk, ujął jej dłoń, pociągnął ją w dół i upadła na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogut myślał o niedzieli, a w sobotę łeb mu ucięli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co roku tu jestem i zawsze mi mało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pracuję nad alternatywnym planem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wyobrażam sobie tego inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu się tak wpatrujesz we mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałam go, jak miałam sześć lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam nową muszlę klozetową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nic nie rozumiał, każdy czekał jutra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodziły koło niego kobiety i, jak komety, ciągnęły za sobą smugi zapachów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy są kolejne wybory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziewczynko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chyba jakieś nowe stanowisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi ale nie mogę ci w tym pomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię: bywałem, gdyż niekiedy zdawało mi się, że Nicość zwyciężyła Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy to nie za słodkie, jak na wino?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to baw się dalej, baw się pojęciami, jak kulkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko spojrzę na dziecko, zaraz wiem, co ono warte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze ci tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczyna być ciekawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Męczące uczucie niedokończenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze myślałem z przeszkodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozbawieni oparcia, nie opuścili nawet swych miejsc dotychczasowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrafię panu tego dokładnie powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niespodzianka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym głosuję za odrzuceniem tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obowiązek Rady polega na udzielaniu odpowiedzi na nasze pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Afrykańska określiła go mianem nielegalnego przewrotu i odrzuca nowy rząd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to główne przesłanie w podejściu Parlamentu do reformowania perspektywy finansowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Separacja i rozwód to zawsze trudne kwestie, obejmujące cały szereg skutków prawnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprę i zagłosuję na to sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młody rycerz zapłonął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pewnym sensie miał rację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadzi to nas do pytania o model rozwoju, jaki zamierzamy propagować w skali światowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś się więc wydarzyło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytyczne te można więc uwzględnić we wnioskach Komisji, które następnie przedkłada się Radzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tak według Pana wygląda kultura?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprzez takie wyjaśnienie, mamy czytelną poprawkę nadającą się do przyjęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten górnik jest wcale nie głupi, raczej mądry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie, więcej Europy w obszarze energii oznacza większe inwestycje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy jednak lepiej uwzględnić różnice międzyregionalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosyć już Europy niepewnej, co robić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwolę sobie jeszcze na dwie uwagi końcowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezultaty działalności prezydencji szwedzkiej są naprawdę pozytywne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy apelować o zachowanie spokoju w tej sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że znów mówi się w Unii Europejskiej o paleniu tytoniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem kraje o wyższym poziomie inwestycji badawczo-rozwojowych są oczywiście bardziej rozwinięte i odwrotnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to pierwsza niesprawiedliwość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym Unia musi przygotować się do prawdziwej zmiany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.124,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A co z nami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W niniejszej poprawce wzywamy do wprowadzenia środowiskowych i społecznych standardów w odniesieniu do biopaliw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W stronę Krochmalnej...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człek był brodaty, w sile wieku, pleczysty, prawie ogromny, ale wychudły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Supersieć jest narzędziem postrzeganym jako magiczne rozwiązanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli Maciuś otrzyma królestwo, dzieci będą się buntowały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam do niej urazy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezwykle ważne jest, aby różnice przestały się powiększać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to dla nas teraz i w przyszłości podstawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wniosek przewiduje zmianę sposobu, w jaki dane będą gromadzone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to zatem oznacza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.604,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada przyjęła serię środków dotyczących energii podczas ostatniego posiedzenia Rady Europejskiej w marcu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdecydowanie popieramy stanowisko wysokiego przedstawiciela\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Turcja to oczywiście temat budzący emocje i jest to całkiem zrozumiałe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"rozwiązanie sytuacji kryzysowej polega na przywróceniu Unii statusu podmiotu globalnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był przemoczony do suchej nitki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apeluję o przyjęcie ich postulatu utworzenia kategorii regionów przejściowych, umożliwiającego spowolnienie wycofywania pomocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony, musimy zapewnić monitorowanie dostawców energii oraz stworzenie prawdziwej konkurencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zrobić wszystko, co w naszej mocy, by osiągnąć równouprawnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trudna kwestia, wymagająca wyważonego rozpatrzenia wszystkich interesów, nie tylko interesów pracodawców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, zagłosuję za rezolucją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem ministrem obrony Łotwy przez pięć i pół roku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praw Podstawowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli ze mną, dopytywali się, com za jedna, czego żądam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skutkuje to tylko większym oderwaniem od rzeczywistości, większą biurokracją i konsternacją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W niektórych przypadkach potrzebny jest im okresowy kredyt obrotowy i przejściowa pomoc\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mając to na uwadze, przedmiotowy problem trzeba rozwiązać na szczeblu europejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za numer w hotelu nie płaci chyba od roku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydatki związane z budową i odbudową można kontrolować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sektor energetyczny stoi wobec wyzwania etycznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze opodatkowanie wchodzi w zakres suwerenności krajowej każdego państwa członkowskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedawno odbiorcami takiej pomocy byli nasi koledzy w północno-wschodniej Rumunii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spowoduje to problemy w handlu zwierzętami i ich przemieszczaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę pogratulować sprawozdawcy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem na rynku istnieje ogromna luka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To tyle tytułem korekty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawanie pieniędzy z własnej kieszeni to akt szczodrości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ma czytać fantastyczne książki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawda, że polityka realizowana w odpowiedzi na kryzys zaczyna przynosić rezultaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktór przymknął drzwi i bezmyślnie usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugą kluczową kwestią są zmiany klimatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już samo nawet myślenie męczyło go, prawie bolało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyskutowaliśmy już nad tym dziś rano\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponownie podkreślamy centralną rolę kultury dla integracji europejskiej oraz dla wizerunku międzynarodowego Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wypełnijmy tę przypadkową lukę wyraźnym zapisem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na takie właśnie wnioski Komisji czekamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna dotyczy adekwatności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę zacząć od gratulacji dla komisarza, przedstawicieli Rady, kontrsprawozdawców, a zwłaszcza dla sprawozdawcy Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z jednej strony chcę docenić pani zrozumienie dla historycznego i moralnego wymiaru tych stoczni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym to wyraźnie podkreślić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu chcemy dodać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz przypatrzyła mu się z uwagą i wyszła wzruszając ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu wzywam do zmiany strategii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo doceniamy również uwagę, jaką obecny Parlament poświęcił sytuacji w Bośni i Hercegowinie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaką presję wywarliśmy na Tajlandię, aby ścigała mordercę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna z nich rosła na samym brzegu zawaliska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewczyna ze wsi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże nie wystarczy zredukować emisje gazów cieplarnianych, aby zlikwidować skutki zmian klimatycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie, pragnę podziękować wszystkim sprawozdawcom za wytrwałą i bardzo kompetentną pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy do nich moja ojczyzna, Irlandia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niczego mi nie brakuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oznacza stosowanie podwójnych standardów, co nie przystoi ani strefie euro, ani Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzmy na stan rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił pan o Europie zasad\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden symbol, jeden wniosek - w tym właśnie kierunku powinniśmy wszyscy razem pracować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na razie mniej niż połowa państw przedkłada je, stosując bardzo zróżnicowaną metodologię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bardzo wrażliwe środowisko morskie, narażone na różnego rodzaju wpływy środowiskowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, dlatego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę ustanowienia rynku wewnętrznego broni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szanujemy wybór priorytetów dokonany przez prezydenta Obamę i jego nową administrację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za zgodą pozostałych grup chcemy złożyć wyjaśnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie nasze pytania w tym zakresie dotyczyły głównie projektów politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie macie prawa siać niepotrzebnej destrukcji ani śmierci wśród niewinnej ludności cywilnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta nowa sytuacja powoduje dwa problemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech pan z łaski swej policzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy powiedzieć, że słyszeliśmy już wszystko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według naocznego świadka powstały nowe grupy lokalne usiłujące przejąć władzę w regionach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezwykle ważne jest zapewnienie ochrony naszych obserwatorów do niedzieli i później\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaka jutro będzie pogoda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podchodzę do tego problemu nie jako ktoś, kto wcześniej wyznawał poglądy antyeuropejskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zdaje Pan sobie sprawę, że będzie jeszcze z tuzin takich spraw?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobne ograniczenia stosuje się w celu skutecznego wdrażania trzeciej dyrektywy o praniu pieniędzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ale żył w odrętwieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Historia ukarze tych, którzy nie wypełnią swoich obowiązków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę widział z pod bezwładnych, ciężkich, obwisłych powiek jej twarz bolesną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym zadaniem jest więc zapewnić wysoką jakość początkowego kształcenia zawodowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39331292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto paradoksem jest to, że wiele przedstawionych przez Radę danych dotyczyło poprzedniego okresu rozliczeniowo-budżetowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagłosowałam za przyjęciem przedmiotowej rezolucji legislacyjnej, ponieważ wszystkie przedstawione środki pomagają zwalczać oszustwa podatkowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ach, jak tu pięknie!“ zawołał nareszcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeto, jeżeli do drogi się skłonię, Lękam się, by to nie było szaleństwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym podziękować wszystkim przedmówcom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już chyba nigdy nie będę się z chłopakami ganiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety postępują tak albo inaczej z miłości do mężczyzn, nigdy z miłości do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzęta ryją prymitywne kretowiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ograniczała się przynajmniej do zamkniętego pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to koń młynarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączanie tego przełącznika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomnij no sobie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ziemi poniewierały się resztki potłuczonych naczyń, kawałki żelaza i szkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan jedzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem tego samego zdania! — zgodził się muł — Widocznie mamy wspólne upodobania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba zajrzę po drodze do księgarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrobię to dla was, jeszcze raz pójdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama powiedziała: — Dobrze — ani jednego słowa uwagi, i zatelefonowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodki, sierpniowy zachód całował ich szczyty…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nachyliłem się i pocałowałem, a on oczy przymrużył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął się śmiać histerycznie, Janek zdziwił się, a Pola zbladła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może autor uznał, że nie ma potrzeby zagłębiać się w temat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli przez miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudziła się dopiero na wołanie matki i wielki głośny śmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niewidziane dawał się odczuwać kulisty i odległy pośpiech nadchodzącego spoza ziemi słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hubert jak zwykle palnął jakiś suchar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama wlepiła weń spojrzenie zionące gniewem i nienawiścią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto przed oglądaniem filmu nie czytać, o czym jest film.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyleczył pana człowiek bez doktorskiego dyplomu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak głęboko wpadł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładny był dziewczak — rzekł wreszcie kulawiec i spojrzał na przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najmniejszą zmianę pozycji pamiętał dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko szybowiec Witka wciąż spada, bo Witek nie umie rzucać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Palą tu zawsze lampę bez potrzeby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś kiedyś potem tych dwoje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że gdy ją straci, umrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będą go szukali, może już szukają cichaczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest miasto kręcące się, beikocące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Codziennie niemal przypomina o tym, wysyłając mi na spotkanie Rotundę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona napisała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My pragniemy pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jaka pani dobra — szepnąłem, przyciskając ku ustom jej rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie żałuję trudu; wyniki przeszły moje oczekiwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozbawieni oparcia, nie opuścili nawet swych miejsc dotychczasowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiesz, co czytasz, i nie wiesz, co się dzieje w kinie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem: Alaska… potem wilki, względnie psy… i sanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak długo nie wracają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uciekł twarzą, jakby przestraszony, i w ruchu tym była kokieteria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nazywali tego przyjaźnią, nie nazywali tego wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz w takim razie skąd się tu wzięła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak szczebiotała, a ja z niepojętym zachwytem spoglądałem na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto jak się te nieprzytomne marzenia ziściły w nieprzytomnym losie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się w niepokoju ulicami, które odpoczywają, jest rzeczą dobrą, prawie religijną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykułem wszystkie pytania na blachę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie była nieświadoma tego, na co się naraża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty się mylisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona popatrzyła na jego twarz i przestraszyła się: była tak zmieniona, upiorna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego dnia nie wytrzyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na szyszce i wsłuchał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przeląkł się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie domyślam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisze się, oczywiście, rachunki, wykazy, a owszem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż pojaśniało od sztandarów i chorągwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Leżymy jeszcze na dnie morza? — Ja tak, a ty nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecie pies też boskie stworzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sklepach z ubraniami bywam rzadko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara zaśmiała się przyjaźnie i położyła rękę na jej ramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaproponował, abyśmy spróbowali naśladować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedyś oprócz podstawówki i liceum było jeszcze gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jest córką ekonoma i kocha naczelnika stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewnego wieczora… — poddałem mu, ułatwiając wyznania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To znów zależy od okoliczności, które go wywołały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz się zdobyć na cierpliwość, Jerzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W dziecinnym głosie brzmiał zawód i powątpiewanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam, o jutrzni we mgłach, odpływają małe statki rybackie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za przypuszczenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Opowiedz mi o swej rodzinie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nie urągaj!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzeba wyrzeczenia się — tylko za tę cenę można pokonać to wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwał i oczyma wzniesionymi ku sklepieniu śledził ruch dymów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czym bardziej jestem w skórze innych, tym wyżej wznosi się moje „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuśćmy, że wsiadłem w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapadło na chwilę milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przełykać ślinę i zapatrzył się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona z radosnym i dzikim krzykiem uchodziła w głąb lasu — wolna, wyśmiewna, niedościgła…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko upływały Maciusiowi godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz kolana ośmioletniej dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój pies notorycznie mi ucieka goniąc zwierzynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadła, otworzyła oczy i popatrzyła na niego po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że jest martwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to wcale nie bolało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grasz z nami w gry planszowe w niedzielę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie ściany były pokryte literalnie od posadzki po strop książkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witkiewicz nazywa to napięciem kierunkowym w malarstwie, można domyślić się ładnych ud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu zawdzięczam takie zainteresowanie się moją osobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20753975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasyciwszy oczy widokiem własnej krasy, zaczęła z powrotem ubierać się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieodpowiedni ubiór był powodem przemarznięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mnie! — szepnął jednoręki, który dotąd trwał w zupełnym milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie tkniesz dziewczycy, bo nie z twego chlewu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nauczycieli musiał dla bezpieczeństwa budynku mieszkać w pobliżu szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadaj, a ja zagotuję wodę na herbatę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apollo, chcąc objąć Daphne — objął krzew laurowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znałeś go? — spytał jednoręki upiora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymał go za górny węzeł jak za czuprynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U ich stóp walczą czarne głowonogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po knajpach robił znajomości i podejmował się różnych niebezpiecznych spraw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był piękny w swej barwie, rozległości, ciszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest ważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym pójść na studia plastyczne i zostać sławną malarką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośród wszystkich dni i nocy, ta jedna noc stała się najwyższym ziszczeniem mego bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł spojrzał na zegarek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to chciej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ścianie mojej łodzi piszę wiersze-dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostry szum maszyny do strzyżenia trawników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu właśnie Emil przestał pisać i popatrzył na rzekę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czekoladowe? Skinęła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć przyćmiona długo oczekiwanymi konkurentami, może budzić emocje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20754092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urósł potężnie w siłę, odkąd nam uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebo od samego rana już pokrywały chmury, a około dziesiątej zaczął padać silny deszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż miałem mu powiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyśl rozumnie i spokojnie o tym wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko mnie powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz daleka, obca, tak obca, że nie wolno mi na nią patrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to przy innej ulicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś ma złość do naszej panienki i rzucił uroki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A cóż mnie obchodzi logika natury…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Możesz chcieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie używałabym takiego określenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż by to zliczył!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli i zagrali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co kraj, to obyczaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bójcie się śmierci!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili zdjął słuchawki z uszu i był zdziwiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodzimy w gęsty kolor turkusowy, kałamarnica o bladoniebieskich i bladozielonych światłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale burza nadeszła: gromadziła się wiekami i naraz wybuchła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykułem wszystkie pytania na blachę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszliwe są, śmieszliwe! — powtórzył bez potrzeby i spojrzał na Podlasiaka z przesadną stanowczością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego zdania są napięte jak łuki, jak pupa młodej dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda na to, że nic nie pasuje do Twojego zapytania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem ryk, a potem nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie jestem? — usłyszałem pytanie, rzucone między marmurowe trzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie pocieszającym objawem jest to, że użyto podstępu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą sprawia wrażenie gentlemana w całym tego słowa znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi bracia sofiści, którzy byli daleko na Wschodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za dowód mogą służyć gojące się ponad standardowy czas rany zadane jej ząbkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby umiał pan czytać w cudzych duszach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam ci do powiedzenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś takiego trza było teraz zawołać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent z objawami grypy trafił dzisiaj do naszej przychodni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leczenie: atropina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz się zdobyć na cierpliwość, Jerzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział wolno: - Możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż nie pięknie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takim będzie mój koniec…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej to też zatyka od dech, że nie można żyć wielu żywotami naraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, czas wracać — przyznała zamyślona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co znaczy ogień, błyskający z pośród tamtych sosen?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz ustąpił mu z drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się kręcił, ten garbus, dookoła mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmianę ekspozycji mamy w czerwcu, więc na pół roku można obejrzeć dwie wystawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak go lubią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co słychać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy w życiu nie widziałem ani tego dziecka, ani jego matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede mną płot jakiejś prywatnej posesji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta śpiewał, król nasłuchiwał, a wszyscy obecni głośno objawiali swój zachwyt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ścigałeś nieprzyjaciół jak Czarniecki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ich włosach rosną wodorosty, w granatowej, połyskującej wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mów, czego żądasz, a wszystko damy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkim krokiem pośpieszyła do pokoju męża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatkała mu usta ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie bój się, nic ci nie zrobię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkali się na korytarzu, Krystyna uśmiechnęła się, przedstawiła go narzeczonemu i powiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem wielkim przeciwnikiem rozwydrzenia sportowego, które się w ostatnich latach rozwinęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz na swoją obronę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ty? — zaśmiała się przekupka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi spaść w nocy lub rano, żeby nie zdążyli uprzątnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwiaty jesienne rychło przemijają…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wypadek na Katowickiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczam, że sztuczne, zrobione z jakiejś masy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest truizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W każdym razie spróbuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że od najbliższego nowiu zacznie tutaj polować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano wchodzi do kuchni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już dwie szyby w tym roku stłukli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jak gdybyśmy się zupełnie nie znali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzą jej kochankowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład, opowiadasz coś albo czytasz, albo piszesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Półhalucynacje, które były zmieszane z drzewami w parku, z bawiącymi się dziećmi, z ulicami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie poczułem do niego obrzydzenie, że tylko splunąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj wyjaśniono sprawę w oka mgnieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwałem przekupniowi potok pochwał na rzecz towaru i zapytałem o cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety w moim wieku są coraz starsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest coś całkiem innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygnać go z granic państwa i nigdy nie puścić z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest dziewka, którą miałem przed chwilą tu, na kolanach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz czytałem tę książkę, ale będę czytał jeszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pomyliłeś się, bratku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil miał o trzy lata młodszego brata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszłość jest przeszłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak my się zawsze wszystkiego wstydzimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że nie jesteś już normalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weźcie pod uwagę ilość popularyzujących dzieł w Niemczech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewnego wieczora… — poddałem mu, ułatwiając wyznania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim prosto, przy tym szczerze, no i co najważniejsza — przyjaźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na podwórko już nie wychodzę, tylko czekam, żeby się pauza skończyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te osoby potrzebują rozmowy, nie wywiadu czy przesłuchania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama jest ciągle inną; niby ta sama, a jednak inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka boska siła tworząca coś z niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu mówił: — Mamo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjęła ją zgroza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważał, że to są formy przymusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym celu należy zapewnić szczególną ochronę zarówno dziecku, jak i matce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę łokieć z przyczepioną tarczą herbową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały myślał, że to z powodu niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie stało się chyba nic złego? — szepnęła Hanna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy te bezwiednie stroniły od przepychu zdziwienia, jak od niedostępnych bram zamkniętego pałacu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesyceni gwarem i krzykiem zeszliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki on śmieszny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmowę przerwało wejście konduktora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadał pomału, gdy nagle odczuł nienawiść wobec poko jówki Józi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście ostatnio trochę więcej czasu spędzałem w pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja będę musiał powiedzieć: „Mama umarła”, chyba tak? Co? Ona milczała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowo daję, przynajmniej dobrze, żem ciebie spotkał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bardzo! — pocieszył go Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- I od mojego przyjazdu nie odgadujesz więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama niech nie udaje świętej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poranek był jasny, majowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz przystąpimy do rozerwania łańcucha z Moniką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A na drugi dzień miał już Maciuś cały plan złożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem, że się dasz złapać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20801399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może zawrócę, a może nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20801400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem i na drugim posterunku także wszystko było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20801401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ja panu coś powiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20801402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… — chrząknąłem — mieliście się zejść na moście Św. Floriana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20801403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z otwartego okna było słychać radio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego muszę rozumieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz cóż mnie one obchodzić mogą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyjął watę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z podniesioną do strzału bronią wszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadł, pił, spał i pracował od świtu do nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym się poinformować, czy można ją jeszcze zapisać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po skończeniu nauki nie mogłem wytrzymać w domu, a jednocześnie nieznośny był mi gość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej po południu zapaliłem bez wielkiej przyjemności pierwszego papierosa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmyślałem nad tym, że społeczeństwo ludzkie to jedna ogromna sieć pomyłek i głupstw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, musiało być ludziom wtedy gorąco!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak… nie wiesz o tym nawet…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wdrapał się na okno i zajrzał do środka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to godzina przedwieczorna, milcząca, nieruchoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po wirtuozowsku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego na ten punkt zwracam największą uwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytam i nudzę się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip spał nadal, snem niespokojnym, pełnym marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to dowód oczywisty! — zgodzili się jednomyślnie słuchacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem wtedy do siebie: „Każda chwila jest godna Szekspira”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienawidzę tego obłudnego frazesu, tego żargonu impotencji…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała komiczne wargi, górną wysuniętą nad dolną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może podać wody?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem nim też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedzcie sami na zdrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś podobnego jest możliwym? — wyszeptał przecierając drżącą dłonią czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O zgrozo, zamilkła na wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil mówi, że to wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie kroki czyjeś zbliżyły się do drzwi biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiało rzec można, że w rewolucji francuskiej Pan się odrodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20630700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy Andrzeja nagle ożywiły się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podwiezie mnie pan pod moje mieszkanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiesz, co mówię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może byś do szkoły nie poszedł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnajta — odpowiedział kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił: — Takie to porządki, że wszystko leży ułożone i niczego nie można znaleźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiło na mnie wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz Andrzej nie dowierzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego pan jeszcze chce ode mnie? — zagadnął znów niechętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z drugiej strony… hm… co się tyczy twojego odejścia stąd…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O ile się nie mylę, jesteśmy starzy znajomi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna jaskółka wiosny nie czyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fortuna kołem się toczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawiązała sobie na ręku niebieską tasiemkę dla pamięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedłem na ścieżkę ogrodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Janek go pocałował w szyję, a raczej musnął ją delikatnie wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na osobności, tylko na osobności!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pani ma wyjątkowe stanowisko, wyjątkowe przywileje na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy ciebie nie cierpią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej teraz nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączyłem dziesięć przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co u ciebie słychać, to znaczy — co czytasz? — „Złotego osła” i „Ars amatoria”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ich nie słyszała naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gram pierwszy temat zupełnie po pijacku, zupełnie zataczając się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie mógł tam trafić, bo ja nic nie robiłam, aby mu ułatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mnie i tak całej nie posiadasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna będzie wielka, a może i nie tak bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ciemno i nie zapalił światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadaje mi niemal fizyczny ból.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegł za nimi również hałas kawiarni, lecz oni byli poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bałam się zawsze, że przyjdą na mnie takie ciężkie chwile…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niby nic się nie zmieniło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polata, jak one, na skrzydłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary głupiec byłby żył zdrowo do tej pory, gdybym był trzeźwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak trwoga, to do Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie masz plany na dziś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment ten uwiecznił rzeźbiarz w marmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy spostrzegł wystającą z wewnętrznej kieszeni jego żakietu fotografię Stachy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz najlepiej zrobisz, jak pójdziesz do łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świeże, ścięte przymrozkiem powietrze orzeźwiło mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę wiedzieć to, czego nie mogę wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odeszli ci wszyscy, którzy zaledwie tydzień temu słuchali moich wierszy i dziwnych przygód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ileś pisał, Hannibalu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, ale nie z jednej strony tylko, jak na tych jabłonkach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda to na kieszonkowe złodziejstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to w prostej linii dziad Seweryna Baryki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mówiąc już o rozkoszy, którą mi to daje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozsunęli się nieco, ustąpili i Cezary znalazł wolne miejsce na ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego go lubię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba udajesz, moja kochana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz znajdziemy pani telefon, proszę się nie martwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze mu się działo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem czy lepszy jest żel czy pianka do golenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okresy, kiedy się leży na samym dnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzę tu jak człowiek do człowieka w chwili wyjątkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki przybiegł pośpiesznie, jakby się bał karygodnego w danym razie opóźnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo ja to źle zrobiłem, albo ona jest nieco dziwna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było ich dwóch: prawy — kulawiec, a lewy — jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś przed nami powinno majaczyć takie światełko, do którego zmierzamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Absolutnie nie chciała, aby „on sobie coś myślał”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby iść tak… żeby iść tak… i wciąż iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy, kiedy ja przyjechałem, to było? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to proroctwo się sprawdziło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często używa się wyrażenia „żyje” w innym znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się załamuje, pryska, rozwiewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocham ciebie, jak nigdy nie kochałam nikogo…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walkę jednak stoczył on sam jeden, o własnych siłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona ma to okresowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg, który go wiózł, wyjechał wczoraj nad ranem z Paryża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała dużo koleżanek, nie miała przyjaciółek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnęła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w niedzielę, jak lunatyczka, poszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zając pokręcił się po podwórzu, ale psy z obu stron zachodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna nie będzie trwała długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaczęła je bić po tyłku i biła je długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puść mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie wyjrzałem i zobaczyłem swego brunatnego sąsiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymałem je spokojnie przez chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez pracy nie ma kołaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywarłem ustami do jej ręki na długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje słuchawki przestały działać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sześćdziesiąt i cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za typy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wyspach Polinezji istnieje piękna legenda o pochodzeniu śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał bladą twarz satyra ze spiczastymi uszami, i wąskie ceglaste usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nas jest zamknięty we własnej nocy, sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich tam, zdaje się, mieszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brat zaprosił mnie na absolutorium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20648892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz powrócę jeszcze kiedyś w chwały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem też od lat dziecięcych, że ludzi tych zjednywać sobie trzeba podarkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Król popełnił wobec ciebie niesprawiedliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoba Cezarego zatracała się i niemal rozpływała w łagodnej, powłóczystej chmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto naraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rotunda ją prześladuje!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem obróciłam się do ściany i chciałam spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu powiedział do niej: — Istnieje jeszcze rzecz, którą zataiłem przed tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może autor uznał, że nie ma potrzeby zagłębiać się w temat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas kolacji: — Hm, prawda, pytasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby się wstydziły, że powiedzą nie tak, jak trzeba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego nie pisali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i powiedział, że nie chce widzieć tego kretyna, dyrektora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem w swoim kącie i lekcje odrabiam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mruknął: — No, to co? Wtedy ona też poczerwieniała i przestała mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodzimy w gęsty kolor turkusowy, kałamarnica o bladoniebieskich i bladozielonych światłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, puść już, puść!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem smutno: — Ja wcale nie mam własnej duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracała do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka ciągłe jadła tyłek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomniał sobie dwa nazwiska: Ludwig Klages i Theodor Lessing.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się ironicznie zakrwawionym pyskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczemu on robi błędy, jak nas uczy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc prawdopodobnie zamieszka w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budynek mieścił się w niejakiej odległości od miasta nad wielkim stawem otoczonym palmami kokosowymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw trzeba będzie powiedzieć mamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza zawisła między wodą a niebem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten warunek nie jest już teraz dla Kamy nieodzowny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pumeks jest tu niczym — wygładza powierzchownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero na końcu tego rozdziału będzie mowa o szlachetności Michała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pompuje się wodę, robi się studnie podziemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyszło do tego niespodziewanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przyjemnie Maciusiowi, choć nie wie dlaczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawiało im przyjemność ryzyko, że zostaną zobaczeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szafach leżą tablice gliniane z asyryjskimi hieroglifami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to Zuzia nie przychodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apollo, chcąc objąć Daphne — objął krzew laurowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic nie szkodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to koń młynarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągłe szycie, cięcie, mierzenie i znowu szycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Powiesz mi podczas śniadania, czy mamusia ci pozwoliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawdopodobnie będzie najlepsze określenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas nam w drogę! — rzekł nagle kulawiec i zajął zwykłe po prawej stronie stanowisko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Samo się bawi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niewidziane dawał się odczuwać kulisty i odległy pośpiech nadchodzącego spoza ziemi słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem ludzie siedzieli przed bramami domów, a pary leżały nad rzeką, na wyłysiałych łączkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem wtedy jak nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pchał go sanitariusz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapadło na chwilę milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na krótką chwilę zapanowała między nami kłopotliwa cisza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grupki na podwórzu zmieniają się w karawany śmiertelnie przerażonych zwierząt czujących pożar kniei.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myślę, że to będzie możliwe, gdy przestanę cię ko chać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to są wszystko dzieciństwa, najdroższa — uspokajałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten drugi pojechał na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wróćmy się do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba zajrzę po drodze do księgarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś tak długo siedział?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy… nikogo poza tym nie wyratowano?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał, podszedł do okna i zobaczył niebieską mgłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za osobliwa choroba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi też opadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba lodówka nam się popsuła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze się składa, że niczyja! — pochwycił kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podchodzi do niego właśnie ten rysownik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie skazano go na wygnanie do wschodniej Syberii, na Kamczatkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powoli, stary, tylko aby nie za prędko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytuje mnie, co robi w tej chwili dr Tadeusz Sokołowski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chodzi o to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie domyślam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem — odpowiedział Podlasiak i z dumnym poczuciem rozbudzonej niejasno nadziei spojrzał na wyrwany kędzior.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki on spokojny! — snuł dalsze ogniwo myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chyba jakieś nowe stanowisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę ci coś pokazać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Woda jaśniała spokojnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Całuj! — ryknął dominując nad rechotem wyznawców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba nie pozostaną długo na lądzie, jak sądzisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale pan tutaj u nas zostanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę wiedzieć, ile? Dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy przygotowuję się do wykładu to bardzo niewiele mogę wykorzystać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem razem z nimi przeglądać ten tomik jako pamiętnik szczęśliwie przebytego koszmarnego okresu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc jak możesz żyć z nim pod jednym dachem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejrzał je dokładnie, odkładając te, które stępiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witkiewicz nazywa to napięciem kierunkowym w malarstwie, można domyślić się ładnych ud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokładnie wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę tylko hałas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty się mylisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ścianie mojej łodzi piszę wiersze-dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To mi nie pomaga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ma co martwić się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kiedy mówię, że czary, to czary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Winien jestem w ten czy inny sposób poświęcić swe życie dla ojczyzny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdź tam szybko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądali wspaniale w czerwonym mroku sypialni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to chciej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I szybko zbiegłem po schodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek nawet się wyspać nie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może drży wskutek zimna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech no jasny pan skosztuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykra to była przygoda z pomylonym panem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby uniknąć zatorów drogowych, Rada Miasta wprowadziła również dodatkowe, bezpłatne przejazdy autobusowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię bardzo obserwować go w godzinach porannych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, zbliża się czas, by pomyśleć o powrocie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbym powiedzieć, czego, ale mi się nie chce myśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczynania tego reżysera są obserwowane od dłuższego czasu przez krytyków filmowych oraz opinię publiczną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiłowanie do muzyki wyssałam z mlekiem matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc tu spoczywa…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani musiała długo stać, tylko nie wiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiła chwila ogólnego, nie wyłączając wora, milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdę do nich!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zużyliśmy osiemdziesiąt naboi, rozdzieliliśmy po połowie moją miesięczną rację żywności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najgroźniejszym jest strach przed czymś nieuchwytnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na nowo się odnajdywali — matka i syn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, ale on mieszka tam z jedną panienką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje ruch kolejowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zaczął się śmiać histerycznie, Janek zdziwił się, a Pola zbladła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idź do szóstego oddziału i zobacz, czy tam jest globus.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy coś podobnego jest możliwym? — wyszeptał przecierając drżącą dłonią czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się lubi nauczyciela, to nawet najmniejsza uwaga boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo Jankę, co nosi krótkie suknie, albo Helę, co nie nosi stanika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20689760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pisząc o moich osobistych przeżyciach nie mogę pominąć siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzięła książkę i zaczęła czytać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przeciwnym razie staniemy w obliczu swoistego kryzysu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Innymi słowy Komisja Prawna jest wysłuchiwana na początku, w środku i na końcu postępowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgromadzenia te, początkowo obejmujące grupę najbliższych przyjaciół gospodarza, literalnie wciągały ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety muszę wytknąć kilka błędów w tym tekście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni czują, że coś tu \\\"nie gra\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Same środki odstraszające nie wystarczą, by zredukować przestępczość i przestępczość zorganizowaną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę to powtarzać w nieskończoność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym potrzebujemy nowych środków zaradczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie istnieje idealne prawodawstwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem takie argumenty i w moim kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38566999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez zadowolonych i zabezpieczonych konsumentów nie osiągniemy dobrze prosperującego rynku wewnętrznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nogi idą, niby spuchnięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udowodnił pan, że na trudne pytania nie ma łatwych odpowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młodzi rolnicy znajdują się w najlepszej sytuacji, aby odpowiedzieć na nowe wyzwania w rolnictwie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki system wspomoże prewencję, wykrywanie i eliminację naruszeń zarówno prawa wspólnotowego, jak i krajowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z ogromnym zadowoleniem przyjmuję przystąpienie do najbardziej fundamentalnego europejskiego dokumentu dotyczącego praw człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę również pominąć kwestii, do których ja również mam pewne zastrzeżenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, że nasz rząd, a zwłaszcza nasi obywatele, zaprezentowali się dobrze międzynarodowej opinii publicznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę również zapytać panią komisarz, czy mogłaby być trochę bardziej konkretna w tym temacie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale problemem są skutki ewentualnego wypadku, zwykle bardzo dotkliwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym raz jeszcze pogratulować panu pańskiego wyboru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Propozycja ta spotkała się z poparciem rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas, by definitywnie usunąć wszystkie głęboko zakorzenione przyczyny ubóstwa na Haiti\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak możemy za sprawą tego funduszu uporać się z coraz drastyczniejszymi sytuacjami wyjątkowymi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy dotrzymać obietnic, które składamy dzisiaj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to sprawa niezmiernie ważna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podsumować przedstawiając jedną uwagą końcową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracowaliśmy niejako w tandemie , z którego to faktu wynika moja pierwsza uwaga\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię do jej pustego krzesła, ale chcę to mimo wszystko powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie ma prawa zanieczyszczać naszej wspólnej gleby i wody pitnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aktualnie tekst ma następujące brzmienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Także my, Unia Europejska, robimy wciąż za mało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Została pani zatem jedna minuta na zakończenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pracodawców należy zachęcać do organizowania kształcenia i szkoleń dla swoich pracowników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest wykonalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwalczanie terroryzmu nie może stać się usprawiedliwieniem dla uniwersalnego systemu zbierania danych osobowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też nie może pani mówić, że nikt nic pani nie sugerował\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że będzie tak robić nadal\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie uważam, by można ją nazwać \\\"bezpieczną\\\" większością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu nie można pominąć energii jądrowej jako technologii niskoemisyjnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy także szanować efektywne agencje międzynarodowe, które działają niezależnie na rzecz ochrony praw podstawowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co w takiej sytuacji z Pandorą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy nadzieję, że cała społeczność międzynarodowa wesprze starania Unii Europejskiej w tym zakresie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Solidaryzujemy się z klasą pracującą i wszystkimi robotnikami tureckimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popiera się szybką organizację Europejskiej Służby Działań Zewnętrznych o kompetencjach cywilnych i wojskowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aaa, pochwycił na gorącym uczynku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo żałuję, że tym dwóm instytucjom nie udało się wypracować wspólnego stanowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pókim żywa nie będzie tego długo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę Komisję o poparcie nas w tym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zabezpieczenia społecznego współpracujących małżonków i uznanych partnerów życiowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Misją naszej prezydencji jest zatem pełnienie roli siły napędowej toczących się procesów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Bliskim Wschodzie nie uczyniono postępu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mało to u nich zamków?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwotna kompromisowa rezolucja nie była moim zdaniem całkowicie wyważona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa pożałuje wcześniej czy później tej wysoce ryzykownej strategii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy innowacyjnego podejścia politycznego, aby się nimi zająć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest jeden z pozytywnych aspektów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada chciałaby zwalczać produkcję maku, z którego produkuje się opium\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równość kobiet i mężczyzn jest jedną z wartości i celów Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było jednak lepiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.54,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie organizacje zajmujące się zwalczaniem chorób jednoznacznie zalecają wprowadzenie programów rozdawania owoców w szkołach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podjadł sobie smacznie i ruszył dalej z mocnym postanowieniem unikania podobnego towarzystwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nie wierzymy, że tak się stanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doceniam wszystkie wysiłki i plan działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc się ucieszył, że Maciuś nie żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38567079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Padły dwa szczegółowe pytania, na które pokrótce odpowiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego dobrze byłoby, gdybyśmy przystali na propozycję skierowania przez Prezydium noty protestacyjnej do Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedstawił pan ambitny program ich przezwyciężenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najważniejsze jest przestrzeganie prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Procesowi tworzenia Służby Działań Zewnętrznych daję kredyt zaufania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto konkretne odpowiedzi na konkretne pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy czekać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to sprzeczne ze wszystkimi ostatnio przyjętymi stanowiskami i musi pozostać wyjątkiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, szwedzcy socjaldemokraci, gorąco popieramy podatek od transakcji na szczeblu globalnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy w Rumunii powiedzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umieściłem kreatywność obok edukacji i innowacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też głosowaliśmy za odrzuceniem wniosku dotyczącego statutu unijnych asystentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym zacząć od szczególnych podziękowań dla p\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38568294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co też trzeba zrozumieć, jako że wymaga to zmiany świadomości społecznej, która następuje powoli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kropił na prawo i na lewo, wolno wznosząc rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie dlatego głosowałem za przyjęciem przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z przesłaniem tego hasła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni się odczepią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczciwe poszukiwanie rzeczy, które nas łączą, jest również poszukiwaniem przez nas środka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas pozwala mi poruszyć tylko jedną sprawę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napotkaliśmy dwie trudności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy powiedzieć głośno, co zdecydowanie nie jest względne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż nie mam jasnego obrazu sytuacji leków generycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże to dalece nie wystarczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też pragnę, by wziął Pan to sobie do serca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł wreszcie długo oczekiwany dzień i mamy prezydenta Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szczególności małe i średnie przedsiębiorstwa potrzebują łatwiejszego dostępu do kredytów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu nasz model jest wyjątkowy w kontekście europejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tekst jest całkowicie zgodny z zasadą pomocniczości, jest też sprawiedliwy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czym głównie koncentrują się te teksty?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Martwią mnie te dane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie należy patrzeć w ten sposób na tę sytuację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyrektywa w sprawie nielegalnej imigracji stanowi niemożliwy do rozwiązania dylemat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wołają królowie jeden przez drugiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszą się państwo po prostu pogodzić z tym faktem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczne pruskie, mówiące litewską mową narody, starte już były z oblicza ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja odrzekłem im, że gdyś mnie w jeństwo brał, byłeś wolny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inni przypominają kontrowersyjne przemówienie w Parlamencie prezydenta Klausa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy koncentrować się na ludziach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre państwa członkowskie już są liderami w tej dziedzinie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego moja grupa będzie jednomyślnie głosować za przyjęciem tego pakietu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Państwa członkowskie nie są usatysfakcjonowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"by to stanowczo wyrzec, trzeba było być czarownikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To budżet skąpy, praktycznie identyczny z propozycją Komisji Europejskiej i przyjęty w kontekście oszczędności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nie możemy zapominać o integracji kobiet, które stanowią niewidoczną stronę świata rybołówstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem w swoim życiu wielu uchodźców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Referendum chce zdecydowana większość Brytyjczyków, w tym większość osób popierających obecny rząd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to silny, zjednoczony głos Unii Europejskiej popierający prawa Irańczyków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawarcie sojuszu gospodarczego ma zatem zasadnicze znaczenie dla obydwu stron\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznaczać to będzie wygraną dla gospodarki oraz zdobycie przychylności obywateli Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też koniecznie należy przeanalizować przyczyny problemów, które miały miejsce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego głosowaliśmy za przyjęciem tych wniosków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszą rzeczą, którą moim zdaniem musimy zrobić, jest nawiązanie dialogu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa musi również przyjąć na siebie rolę lidera w zakresie technologii przyjaznych dla środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38569290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przymierze Cywilizacji jest jednym z najważniejszych narzędzi, jakie wykorzystujemy w tej pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21655246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezwykłe zjawiska, których byłem świadkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21655247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21655248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kapitan podszedł do okna i wyjrzał na dziedziniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21655249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary weteran posiada męskość, krew zimną i jest ostrożny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak spo tykamy się, mogłabyś przynajmniej nie ciągnąć za sobą tego stworzenia, Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego zahamowana fantazja ruszyła naprzód, jak koń rusza z kopyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według jego zapatrywania świadczyła o tem niezbicie krwawa plama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Groźnie zaciśnięte pięści podniosły się ku górze...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli i to jej się nie powiedzie, wpada w gniew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale polecono mi widzieć się z panem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób szukam wyjaśnienia, rozumie pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie rozebrałem się i poszedłem spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed bramami ustawili się robotnicy i ich żony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W strasznym niepokoju oczekiwaliśmy fatalnego dnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie nacisnęli na oczy kapelusze i podnieśli kołnierze, aby nie pokazywać twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umarła w tydzień po tem, jak dowiedzieliśmy się o jego śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże chętnie dałbym ci coś, co lepsze o wiele od złota!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadł, aż krzesło stęknęło, i oczyma począł sieroty musztrować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziesz tak spała spokojnie, jak w Port-Saidzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idę poharatać w gałę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Socrealizm, modernizm, realizm, surrealizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak nie płakał, to beczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero o świcie wrócił z rekonesansu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21694612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę bardzo przyjemny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Student zadawał razy coraz częstsze, natomiast Mistrz bił mocniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten ostatni zdołał jednak szepnąć kilka słów więźniowi, zanim się pożegnali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta policyjna książeczka działa skuteczniej niż broń i przejmuje lękiem nawet londyńskich dorożkarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze zdumieniem oglądały wspaniałe urządzenie i przecudny krzew rozmarynowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ty musisz zawsze gdzieś stać i wypatrywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwycił twardą dłoń młodzieńca i uścisnął ją serdecznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybywszy do Wólki znalazł swego starego rejenta w łóżku, chorego...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedziałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyjmij mi grzebień z kieszeni płaszcza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zegarmistrz światła, karmelkowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie pocałował go w oba policzki...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem inni wyciągali na pokład jakiegoś siwego mężczyznę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekał na niego swego rodzaju tercet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaszła w nim jakaś nieuchwytna zmiana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś położył jej dłoń na czole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twój ojciec jednak pozostał nieubłagany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spędzi pan wolny dzień wśród polnych kwiatów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśli tej jeszcze się nie wyzbyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciężko to żyć w takiej atmosferze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak będzie lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie trzy kamienie młyńskie wyłączono.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapalił wszystkie dziesięć świec w kandelabrze, stojącym pośrodku stołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Talmud, holokaust i Tora. Trudne wyrazy związane z Żydami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczymy do czego ono nas zaprowadzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mieście ulice i place powstawały jakby pod wpływem zaklęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze, jeśli chcesz, podam ci powody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz uchwycił ją za rękę i przytrzymał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po krótkiem przesłuchaniu u inspektora, będącego na służbie oddano go na wspólną salę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, jak się nazywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego chcesz jeszcze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiano, że na horyzoncie pojawia się nowe słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Spisałem wczoraj testament.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przestraszyliśmy się bardzo i postanowiliśmy prosić pana, abyś go zbadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chce obudzić małżonka, lecz Tadeusz chrapie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przejdźmy się lepiej trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może się nauczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pewnością tak by powiedziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało się, jakby wieczór wstydził się jego milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego prawa jeszcze nie korzystałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczarowany stał król przed nią, nie mogąc wymówić ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O nikogo nie byłam zazdrosna, ale o nią jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włościanie utrzymywali, że to komsomolcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że nadchodzi moja żona, pobiegłem zatem do drzwi i zatrzymałem ją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł odwrócić od niej oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc osioł stał w słońcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet puls dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowy, lśniący cylinder stał za nim na podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina trzynasta czterdzieści pięć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Izrael, Palestyna, Iran, Arabia Saudyjska, Jemen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"kontrola dostępu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotnie, ujrzałem generała; prawdopodobnie zobaczył nas, lub usłyszał nasze głosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta rozmowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"białe robaki są najlepsze, bo są białe i najlepsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjemnie jest go brać do ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pobiegł za staruszką i znów pchnął jej kilka szyszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwól mi czuwać… dobrze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce stało jeszcze dość wysoko, ale przetoczyło się już na stronę jeziora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiesz, że ja nie wiem, co on robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprzednio nie chciało im się w głowie pomieścić, by dzieci mogły same przebyć puszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"baczyli wolną ławkę, jedyną wolną, jakby na nich czekała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tym razem tylko potrząsnęła głową przecząco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech runie ulewa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Boga kocham... przedziwnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I chociaż nie wprawiona, wcale się nie dławi...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miałem dotąd czasu obejrzeć tego pokoju, ale, jeśli pozwolicie, uczynię to teraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama w mieszkaniu w biustonoszu i w majtkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił w tej chwili zbadać, czy doktór posiada istotnie skłonności filantropijne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszycie moje wołanie i wpadniecie do środka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podkomorzy zaś wałem kutasa nazywa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ciało było zbyt ładne, aby było prawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech Smoka i wycie zwierząt ścigały ją czas długi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy wszystko o Mistrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maryś w domu państwa łowczych rozkwitała jak różyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak widzisz? — Przychodzi taki biały duch i się nachyla nade mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie wścibiacie nos swój, chociaż was o to nikt nie prosi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy nareszcie podniósł się na nogi, hrabia ponownie ciągnął go do fotela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"malinowy posmak, smacznego acz drogiego deseru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą w tej chwili nie mogłem ani mędrkować ani modlić się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział teraz co znaczyli ci goście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stu oczekujących górników stało bez ruchu i bez sił, sparaliżowani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina ósma dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie, tacy jak ty, przydadzą się nam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo takich żartów się nie robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Liza? — Wyślę ją do koleżanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostała tylko mila, jedna tylko mila, panie kapitanie, ażeby dotrzeć do miejsca bezpiecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie miała się położyć już spać, kiedy uwagę jej zwróciło gwałtowne dzwonienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dźwięk ten był niezmiernie blisko, nie potrafiłbym jednak powiedzieć skąd dochodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jurek Owsiak robi dobrą robotę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedłem do łóżka, nachyliłem się nad chorym, i wziąłem go za rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktór nic nie podejrzewał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Początek, to znaczy scena koło krat, była słabsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez czas jakiś posuwali się południowym brzegiem jeziora po płaszczyźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21695741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może doznali krzywdy i nie umieją sobie inaczej poradzić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27928725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy też zapewnić konkurencyjność w tych dziedzinach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27928727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem, że Rada musi odbyć formalne spotkanie z Komitetem Stałych Przedstawicieli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27928729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc, mając środki działania, myślę, że musimy znaleźć sposób ich wykorzystania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27928730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety muszę przyznać, że trzy z państw członkowskich nie zrobiły nic w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22241831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22241833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22241835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22241837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22241839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22241851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22241852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22241853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22241854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22241855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Niemoc, skuwająca dotychczas moje członki, opuściła mię natychmiast po jego wyjściu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przestawałem stukać coraz głośniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktór zakręcił się na pięcie i z miną obrażonej godności wyszedł z apteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sąd może się odbyć i bez mojej obecności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nie omieszkały i mnie trochę nadwyrężyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłopiec schwycił topór i jednem uderzeniem rozłupał kowadło, wbijając w nie brodę starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet teraz, gdy o nich wspominam, zimny dreszcz mię przejmuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez dobre pół godziny siedzieliśmy bez słowa, urzeczeni tym strasznym widokiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było więcej, niż śmiałem odgadywać w najposępniejszych i najgłębszych chwilach bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tak łatwo jednak schwytać mnie, panowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzicie i wytrzeszczacie na mnie oczy, jak stado wystraszonych wieprzów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy błyszczą cudownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takim to wykrzyknikiem witał każdy wstrząsający obraz śmierci, który przedstawiał się naszym oczom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku jednak panowały pomiędzy nami stosunki oziębłe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wicher rzuciłem się na niego i ugodziłem bagnetem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22256878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Tulonie socjaliści wszczęli rozruchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22260743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myślałem, że do tego stopnia jestem osłabiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22260744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazałem mu moją depeszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22260745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszej chwili sądziłem, iż jestem ugodzony kulą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22260746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to bowiem zapomni się z czasem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22260747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na dźwięk tych wyrazów o mało oczy nie wyszły mi z orbit.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22261623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo na ciemnobłękitnych fałdach wiecznie szumiącego morza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22261633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę niech pan sam powie, czy to jest ta sławna, stara gościnność?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22261638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęśliwym trafem miałem w kieszeni dwa spore kawałki maślanego placka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22261643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zażyję jakiś środek uspakajający nerwy, lub też spróbuję leczyć się metodą elektryzacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22261670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za głupstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22261673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla Francuza i żołnierza odpowiedź nie mogła być trudna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22261676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozbili go w proch w oka mgnieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22261680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko stało się tak nagle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22261682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje Francja!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, już nie powiem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce jego wpiły się w moje ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc zawróciłam natychmiast, bo chciałam się dowiedzieć o co wam właściwie chodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie z ciężkiem westchnieniem poszedłem ku domowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzniósł ręce w górę, palce mu zadrgały, i zaraz zacisnęły się kurczowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem przyniosę panu kilka notatek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciły się w oswobodzoną przestrzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym to wiedział, nie potrzebowałbym was, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowuż popadliśmy w milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie pojmuję doskonale, że miałem sen, który został tutaj opisany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz wybrać nieodwołalnie, raz na zawsze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż nie uczyniłem szalonego kroku, aby ci jej dowieść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na święta Bożego Narodzenia miał do nas przyjechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inni grali dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa jej ścięły mi krew w żyłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łyknij porządnie z butelki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy prosiliśmy was może, abyście przybyli do Wenecji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilami wybuchały oklaski i śmiechy, niekiedy złorzeczenia, przekleństwa i groźby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinął mi głową i skierował się ku drzwiom mieszkania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22275081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy chyba raz w życiu odważyła się ostrzej odpowiedzieć ojcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22437829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprostu wyciągnęła rękę i zerwała mię jak kwiat, którym zapragnęła się przystroić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22437832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko jednak dostrzegłem w niej i dobre strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22437834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież ma pełen worek złota!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22437836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już minuta minęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22437837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przyszedł pan tutaj chyba jedynie przypadkowo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22437853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz może mi pomożecie ulokować cylindry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22437854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystka krew ściekła mi do serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22437855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tysiąc dziewięcset siedemdziesiątym roku wieżowiec zaprojektował łódzki architekt Aleksander Zwierko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22437856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeciego czerwca i my otrzymaliśmy rozkaz wymarszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22437857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tem miejscu znajduje się wielkie drzewo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opisywał przebieg owej sprawy z najdrobniejszymi niemal szczegółami i znów zaczynał od początku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobną depeszę otrzymałem z Paryża, gdzie wypadki nie rozwinęły się jeszcze tak gwałtownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponoś zapasów na lata starczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takich chwilach moja naturalna odwaga i zuchwałość przychodzą mi zawsze w pomoc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była więc godzina druga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tuż pod nami czerniły się wierzchołki, stojących długim sznurem, nieruchomych automobili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wszyscy wywiną się tak małym kosztem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmarli leżą masami na ulicach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to moim jedynym ratunkiem, gdyż teraz znajdowałem się u celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy może być cel piękniejszy, niż dobro ludzkości?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu zapanowało milczenie, które przerwał ostry dzwonek telefonu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiemy jeszcze kto pan jesteś, skąd przybywasz i czem byłeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siły mnie opuszczają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza charakteryzował go duży nos orli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przyczynach zdenerwowania leży niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Absolutnie i zupełnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas powiem otwarcie, co wiem i co, zdaniem mojem, należy uczynić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszy pan jeszcze o mnie, gdyby panu przyszła ochota powrócić do starych sztuczek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale obawy okazały się na szczęście płonne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno sobie wyobrazić krajobraz spokojniejszy, cichszy i bardziej spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Hiszpanii jeszcze nauczyłem się wierzyć w Przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z godzinę spędziłem przed zwierciadłem, ale bez żadnego wyniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan cierpi na artystyczną eiacuiatio praecox.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu usłyszałem jęk, teraz już najwyraźniej nad moją głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dały się słyszeć okrzyki, oklaski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowozaciężni, mieszczanie, dzierżawcy wiejscy, może nawet nie umiejący obchodzić się z bronią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg stworzył zwierzę pociągowe, konia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor ruszył razem z niemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22453950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To „coś“ przeskoczyło przez mur, jak kot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odgadywałem to po złych, posępnych błyskach oczu i po kurczowem zaciskaniu palców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może kto nie wierzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawiera mądrość, jakiej nikt jeszcze nie poznał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej sprzyjająca sprawie, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tych słowach wstał i począł się ubierać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tem przemówieniu nastąpiło głębokie milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głębi domu wszczął się ruch, zamknęły się gdzieś z trzaskiem drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobnie przez owe trzy dni nie spał wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obcy stanęli razem w cieniu budynku, gdzie się mieściły maszyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to nie bardzo zachęcający wstęp.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyłapali jednak mój list i zadali mi takie straszne tortury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hiszpan spostrzegł go pod drzewem i strzelił do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stare zwierciadło stanowi obecnie dla mnie barometr, wykazujący ciśnienie mózgu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic dziwnego, całą tę przestrzeń przebył pędem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Organista zaś wziął chłopca z sobą i pokazał mu jak trzeba dzwonić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do czego chcesz je wykorzystać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz pan, czemu nie powiadomiliście mię o wszystkiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta trzecia trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22489942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Będziesz robiła wszystko, co ci każą — brzmiała odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym jej mógł przynajmniej pomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak szły lata za latami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mgnieniu oka przedstawiłem sobie wszelkie możliwości: to może być tylko jej mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również i to nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Chcę sam nosić ten zegarek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem się na krzesełko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siłą zmusiłem się do myślenia, co mam aby znów wrócić do swego mieszkania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczułem to po tętnie jej krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostali wkrótce umarli, i myślę że ona ich wszystkich przedwcześnie powiodła do grobu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniecenie w jakim się znajdowałem cały czas, nie dawało mi tego odczuć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może w ciągu dnia wpadnie przez szpary w kamieniach jakikolwiek pobłysk światła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"szybko odpowiedział Prokop, jakby chciał usprawiedliwić swe milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żaden nie mówił słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No już bez przesady, aż taka głupia to ona nie jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pani może pomyśleć coś takiego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęście jednego krótkiego popołudnia uczyniło mnie obcym na zawsze dla mej siedziby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W następnej chwili rygiel odskoczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było by szaleństwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby dochodził dotąd szyb z jakiejś piwnicy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"spytała, nie spodziewając się podstępu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszałem jakieś chrzęsty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kroki przechodzących przez ulicę rozwiały to wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Punkt błyszczący, jak oko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie ryzykując nic!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem sobie przypomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzyłem prędko i zamknąłem drzwi za sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytem żył ubogo jak żebrak na poddaszu, którego okno wyglądało na podwórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieruchomo nabrzmiałem okiem spoglądał na bramę przeciwległego domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem dwuznaczność, ukrytą w jego słowach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy pan sądzi, że człowiek byłby w stanie to znieść?“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko pobiegłem za róg do bramy i zerwałem ze siebie spleśniały łachman.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muzyka grała jeszcze, ale ciszej, nie dowierzała już sama sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym chciał za sobą zamknąć szklane drzwi, ktoś mi wyjął klamkę z ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zapytałem, nic nie rozumiejąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Srebrne skrzyneczki z relikwiami leżały we śnie wiekuistym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa, które mówił Zwak, przewiały jakoś ponad moją świadomością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli, zupełnie powoli, tak jak on, gdy wchodził do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce jego mechanicznie głaskały pilnik leżący na stole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy syknął jak szatan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrócił się, otworzył okno i wyrzucił głowę na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pomagało bieganie dokoła, stukanie nogami, ani uderzenie rękami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nakreślić plan dla studenta, co czynić potem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewien człowiek, chcąc zajrzeć do środka, spuścił się z dachu na linie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwak woła kelnerkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem to jej i zrozumiała mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uroczyste obrazy dokoła wypłynęły w trzeźwej jasności, światło nagle mi się jawiło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co on mógł oznaczać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kopnąłem je lekko: jakiś karton błysnął w promieniach księżyca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne, że zmuszałem się do śmiechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ją zaciekawi widok zwalonego mostu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jak gdyby mogło być coś wspanialszego na ziemi, niż stracić grunt pod nogami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale cokolwiek bądź musiałem odpowiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałem do późnej godziny, bez snów, nieprzytomnie, jak martwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inny obok, wyższy ponad inne, jak ogromny kieł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie udawało mu się to bynajmniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słyszał mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego patrzy się pan we mnie taki zdumiony?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zszedłem na dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili spytał mnie muzyk, czy nie chcę się trącić szklankami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wie pan już, mistrzu Pernat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepodobna, aby tandeciarz na dole głosy te mógł słyszeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów: „Panie Pernat!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwak otulił mnie siłą w palto i zawołał: „Mistrzu Pernat!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To tajanie śniegu kapiącego z dachów!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem w zupełnej ciemności i macałem ją powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto ci pozwolił grzebać w moim telefonie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiałem, co chciał przez to powiedzieć i przyjąłem, jak gdybym się przesłyszał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przysunęła się jeszcze mocniej i przytuliła się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten sam wyraz i ten sam owal twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy przedtem załatwić sprawy bieżące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ani myśleć!“ Poszliśmy na policję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włożyłem kapelusz i przeszedłszy korytarz, zszedłem po schodach na dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest w ogóle ulica, która się tak nazywa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie mogę umrzeć, nie mogę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak nie, to nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z trzech domów można się dostać niepostrzeżenie do pracowni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz chociaż bardzo się trudziłem, opar pozostawał nieruchomy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jechać na spacer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na co pan czeka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie pani, że ja się o panią bardzo troszczę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten stężały, wyszczerzony uśmiech znam już niemal cały wiek ludzki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukałem jakiegoś ciężkiego przedmiotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałem, że umrę z bólu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pilnik!“ usłyszałem szept w swej głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pieniądze ma się rozumieć, przyjąłem.“ Zakręciło mi się w głowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Angelina plotła tak, jak wodospad, ja zaś byłem oczarowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie posiadając się z zachwytu, biegałem bezmyślnie po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Prześwietlając oko promieniami elektryczności, którą przy tem stosował, umyślnie sprawiał choremu ból niesłychany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dręczył mnie całą noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostrzegła mój uśmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelką formę, którą spostrzegasz, myślisz okiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzydziestego czerwca można świętować dzień rozwalania zabawek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakrztusił się kilka razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co on mógł tam zobaczyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle podniósłszy rękę natrafiłem na pustą przestrzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to takie nadzwyczajne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąłem książkę ze stołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co to ma znaczyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególnie, jeżeli chodziło o zniknięcie bez śladu córek w wieku ślubnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem mu to w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za księżna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Tylko po części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie czegoś oczekiwał, gdyż z uwagą wsłuchiwał się w korytarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze zdziwienia o mało nie upadłem z krzesła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda z pokrzywdzonych rodzin nabywała taką figurką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po dwie pary prycz z siennikami przy ścianach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Lecz niech pan nie myśli, że rozgoryczył mnie tak smutny los.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Padłem na fotel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolano moje trafiło na blaszany kubeł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jeżeli to panią zbyt nie zmęczy, czy mógłbym się razem z nią cieszyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wyciągnąłem rękę, mogłem dosięgnąć dachów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby jednak w końcu przyszła śmierć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szyje się wydłużają i do tańczącej pary przyłącza się druga, jeszcze osobliwsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja to mówię, gdyż bywałam tam często jako dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę jeszcze dzisiaj jego pogrzeb przed sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co on myślał, mówiąc te słowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciche naturalne zadowolenie, jakiego się doznaje po długiej wędrówce, napełniało moją duszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zapytałem ją szeptem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę milczeliśmy obaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwól, niechaj rzeczy płyną same przez się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co też panu do głowy przychodzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszło mi przez myśl, że to mąż Angeliny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem na swobodnem łóżku i czekałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23357607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie odważają się wykonać choćby najdelikatniejszego ruchu“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że wszyscy musimy sprostać swoim obowiązkom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można więc karać przewoźników za czynniki zewnętrzne, na które nie mają oni wpływu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja obiecała przygotowanie nowej normy i mam nadzieję, że dotrzyma słowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, odnowienie naszego programu społecznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy natychmiast zatrzymać wyścig zbrojeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pytanie brzmi, jak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zalecenie jest jasne i popieram je\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym tu podjąć się obrony dwóch idei, które są bliskie mojemu sercu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to ma sens, jeśli beneficjenci mają dostęp do informacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska nie ma żadnej władzy na obszarze edukacji i zdrowia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednym z nich będzie rola Unii Europejskiej w świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to wyraźnie widoczne w nowych państwach członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę podziękować Johannesowi Bloklandowi za znakomitą współpracę w trakcie całego procesu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli zostaną one zatwierdzone, wrócimy do punktu wyjścia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tamtego czasu nic się nie wydarzyło, oprócz obietnic i górnolotnych wypowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże w trakcie Konferencji Przewodniczących zaapelowaliśmy o rozdzielenie dwóch rzeczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja gospodarczo-społeczna w Europie wciąż stwarza olbrzymie wyzwania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągła konkurencja w branży doprowadziła do powstania szerszej oferty lotów i obniżenia ich cen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje przesłanie brzmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiany klimatu a znaczenie rolników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godność ludzka nie będzie nic warta w Ugandzie, jeśli taka ustawa zostanie przyjęta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie przewodniczący, wypowiadam się w imieniu Komisji Gospodarczej i Monetarnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To niestety jawna promocja dyskryminacji kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesłanie Parlamentu Europejskiego jest jasne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoimy przed poważnym wyzwaniem związanym z zapobieganiem i zwalczaniem terroryzmu i przestępczości zorganizowanej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc całkiem szczerze, przysłuchuję się tej debacie z mieszanymi uczuciami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Radzie Europejskiej dokonaliśmy istotnego postępu w zakresie wzmocnienia nadzoru finansowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po likwidacji reaktorów jądrowych zdolności wytwórcze Bułgarii zmieniły się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popieram również tymczasowe stosowanie umowy przed jej wejściem w życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32755721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domagamy się międzynarodowej umowy dotyczącej emisji z transportu lotniczego i morskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdzie skutki zmian klimatu nie są tak dotkliwie odczuwalne jak w regionie Arktyki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że jest to bardzo ważny punkt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Współpraca pomiędzy państwami członkowskimi w kwestii energetyki zawsze była dość skomplikowana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To one alarmowały w sprawie przepełnionych składowisk\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"to co mamy teraz stanowi zupełne przeciwieństwo tego, co było kiedyś\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W imieniu nas wszystkich, nalegam na pozytywną odpowiedź w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwracając samochód, musiałem ponownie zatankować do pełna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka zatrudnienia ma ogromne znaczenie, ale nigdy nie zdoła dotrzeć do wszystkich segmentów społeczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też czyniliśmy podczas ostatnich szczytów, w których uczestniczyłam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pytają mnie bezustannie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto, przyczyną niepokoju są narastające napięcia między różnymi grupami etnicznymi w tym kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie tego typu rzeczy są w planach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście przewidujemy, że Parlament będzie otrzymywać sprawozdania z postępów we wdrażaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie te kwestie podjęte są w sprawozdaniach w rozsądny i wyważony sposób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Gospodarcza i Walutowa ma dziesięć lat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym podkreślić jeszcze jedno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejmy nadzieję, że te środki pieniężne zostaną wykorzystane na pokrycie tych kosztów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie zmierzyliśmy się też z problemem oszustwa, wprowadzania pozostałych krajów w błąd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy w związku z tym bardzo szczęśliwi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podkreślono w nim chęć współpracy z nami w zakresie osiągnięcia międzynarodowego porozumienia w Kopenhadze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotnie są to zagadnienia warte starań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestie, którymi musimy się zająć są niezwykle trudne i złożone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska będzie teraz sprawniejsza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.124,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popieram sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałam za przyjęciem przedmiotowego sprawozdania w sprawie rybołówstwa i ustanowienia przejściowych środków technicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można rozdzielić demokracji, praw człowieka i solidarności, nawet w tym wschodzącym azjatyckim państwie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego dokładnie chce Unia Europejska?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tam, gdzie nie ma konkurencji, są one drogie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie, wolontariat musi cieszyć się należnym uznaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wpadłem na żadne dobre wyjaśnienie dlaczego ten problem miałby dalej istnieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka imigracyjna musi oznaczać integrację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak pewne wyzwania pozostają i trzeba będzie stawić im czoła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówić przecie może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktat uznaje zasady samorządu lokalnego i spójności terytorialnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doskonale zdaję sobie sprawę z historycznego znaczenia Kosowa dla narodu serbskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta debata była bardzo interesujący i większość wypowiedzi była wspierająca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toteż należy pogratulować zarządowi decyzji o zapoczątkowaniu działań zmierzających do opracowania takiego programu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tyle pytań nie ma odpowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę zawsze rygorystycznie, stanowczo i we właściwy sposób przestrzegać tej zasady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę się przenieść myślą w przeszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytyczne w sprawie polityki zatrudnienia państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy zamiar zająć się tymi kwestiami na spotkaniu w przyszłym tygodniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie tego nie wolno i państwu też\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytam pana raz jeszcze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko, co mogę powiedzieć w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja zna przypadek Manuela Rosalesa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze wszystkich tych rzeczy należy się cieszyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodzę z założenia, że bezpieczeństwo pasażerów w sektorze lotnictwa to sprawa najwyższej wagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Polsce przed wejściem do Unii wyroby te obłożone były niższą stawką, stawką uprzywilejowaną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak nasi wyborcy także coraz bardziej odczuwają wzrost cen żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyjeż tam jęki wołają o pomstę do Boga?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym świetle widzę znaczenie tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego należy rozgraniczać działania takie jak to, którym dziś się zajmujemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałam za przyjęciem sprawozdania w sprawie inicjatywy obywatelskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy zatem polityki rolnej, która zapewniłaby skuteczne reagowanie na nadmierną zmienność cenową i spekulację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj właśnie leży sprzeczność w pana oświadczeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tu potrzebna jest silna wola.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta rezolucja jest pierwszym krokiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przepis na jeszcze większe bezrobocie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to czwarte porozumienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego popieram ulepszenia, które proponuje sprawozdawczyni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nastają tam na jego szyję?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"kto będzie decydował, czy ludzie, organizacje lub partie dopuszczają się szkodliwego narodowego egoizmu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmieniają się modele inwestowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za preferencje seksualne ludziom grozi tam nawet więzienie lub egzekucja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje wsparcie dla programu \\\"Mobilna młodzież\\\" nie wymaga tłumaczenia i wynika z zasad\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy ciężko pracować, by to się udało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy być siłą aktywną i stanowczą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym przypomnieć Izbie, że poszanowanie prawa jest ważniejsze niż prawo samo w sobie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka decyzja nie zapadła, nie ma również żadnej możliwości, aby została podjęta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem wdzięczny za to poparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właśnie usłyszeliśmy w tej debacie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby zdradzały ambicje, aby stać się państwem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednolita wspólna organizacja rynku spisuje się naprawdę dobrze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to zapewnia on użytkownikom Internetu środki prawne służące ich obronie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej sferze podejście oparte jedynie na rynku wewnętrznym do nikąd nas nie zaprowadzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalsza debata w grupie roboczej nie przyniosła zmiany tego stanowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"układy o stowarzyszeniu już mają bardzo szeroki i dogłębny charakter\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to działanie ze wszech miar pożądane i powinno być przedmiotem powszechnej zachęty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dyskryminacji odnoszącej się do paszportów Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawka została wycofana i nie musi być poddawana pod głosowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy znużeni rozszerzeniami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec co się tyczy kwestii jądrowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W odniesieniu do związków osób tej samej płci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłuży ono omówieniu sposobów zwiększenia wskaźników urodzeń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest członkiem, ponieważ uczyniła wszystko - naprawdę wszystko - aby nim zostać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo dużo się mówi, ale nic się nie robi w tej dziedzinie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy dokonać oceny dodatkowych badań i koniecznego rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W odniesieniu do Byłej Jugosłowiańskiej Republiki Macedonii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa musi podjąć działania już teraz i nie może czekać na resztę świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W dniu dzisiejszym odbyło się głosowanie nad rezolucją w sprawie podwyżek cen żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy bliskie związki z Islandią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też głosowałam za przyjęciem tego znakomitego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"energia odnawialna, zmiany klimatyczne oraz technologie informacyjne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktat nie przewiduje ustanowienia stałego mechanizmu stabilności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32756981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli nie możemy tego zapewnić, to nieuczciwością jest wymagać ich przestrzegania od naszych rolników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26955505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zero, zupełnie nic!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26955506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przeszłości zapominano o tym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26955508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zwrócić uwagę na problem poszerzania się kręgu państw uznawanych za niestabilne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26955509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co zamierzamy osiągnąć za sprawą przedmiotowej dyrektyw?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26955511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.9,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym szczególnie podkreślić znaczenie propozycji Komisji, aby poprawić strukturę wybierania produktów w ramach programu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konieczne jest dokonanie następującego spostrzeżenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to stanowić szansę, ale może też okazać się słabością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy czasu do stracenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy jednak odpowiedzieć na przynajmniej jedno pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem w stanie jej czytać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postępujemy zgodnie z uczciwą i demokratyczną procedurą parlamentarną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy pozwolić, by widmo protekcjonizmu raz jeszcze zasiało spustoszenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak państwu wiadomo, stosunek do stosowania kary śmierci na świecie jest wciąż bardzo różny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze pragnę podziękować sprawozdawczyni za ten wspaniały kompromis\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy wspólnej polityki zagranicznej i bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pełni popieram pańskie zdanie, uznające konieczność kontynuowania procesu ratyfikacyjnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tematy poruszone w opracowaniach mają duże znaczenie praktyczne i wymagają dalszych szybkich działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za głos, panie przewodniczący, pani komisarz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To bardzo ważne, a ja chciałbym dodać jeszcze jedno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz chciałbym odnieść się do spraw, względem których wiele nas dzieli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż - być może - trzeba się przyjrzeć biurokracji, to nie możemy rozluźnić kontroli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony zapewnia szczególnie dobrą ochronę konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wobec tej sytuacji nie wystarczy żądanie przejrzystości ani demaskowanie oligopoli w dystrybucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczyniłem to z pewnym wahaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Braghetto\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podejmowane działania wydają się bardzo skuteczne w przypadku legalnego handlu mięsem i produktami mięsnymi\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.892,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wręcz przeciwnie, skupienie uwagi na środkach wojskowych uniemożliwia faktyczne rozwiązywanie występujących konfliktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrafimy zapanować nad tym kryzysem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podsumowując, pozwolę sobie podkreślić, że wszystko, czego chcemy, to\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porozumienie osiągnięte w tym zakresie przez Parlament jest ambitne, a jednocześnie wykonalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszeliśmy o trudnościach, z jakimi trzeba się było zmierzyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Innymi słowy Parlament chce wyraźnych i bardzo konkretnych celów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrzegaliśmy przed następstwami liberalizacji międzynarodowego handlu rolnymi środkami spożywczymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi, że Parlament odrzucił dzisiaj tę możliwość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26956728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym, korzystając z tej nowej zasady przejrzystości, wprowadziliśmy pięć podstawowych wymagań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem zadowolony, iż pan komisarz wymienił dziewięć spośród osiemnastu poprawek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebny jest czas, a sprawa Abyei z całą pewnością tu nie pomogła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynoszą one skutek, o czym wiem z cotygodniowych sprawozdań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te ostatnie powinny odgrywać aktywną rolę w doborze i mianowaniu instytucji powierniczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podałoby to też w wątpliwość wiarygodność naszej polityki w zakresie kolejnictwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy zdecydowani na kontynuację naszej współpracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.532,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niekontrolowane ładowanie pieniędzy w dziurę bez dna bez dodatkowych środków może być niebezpieczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisję na przykład tworzą takie rodziny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie zainteresowane strony mogą odczuć korzyści właściwie zorganizowanej migracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26958888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielu moich rumuńskich wyborców również podziela ten punkt widzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie są lepsze przykłady terroryzmu niż komunizm w Rosji, Europie Wschodniej i Azji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.188,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co więcej, w kontekście pomocniczości, obywatele nadal powinni mieć możliwość \\\"eksportowania\\\" wszystkich systemów emerytalnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy dobrego porozumienia i chcemy, by zostało zawarte jak najszybciej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na mocy obecnie obowiązujących przepisów prawa taki transfer jest zabroniony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba to zrobić szybko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykładem tego jest Darfur\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak należało uczynić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak więc udzielamy im pomocy technicznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brakuje jednak całej reszty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro będę głosować nad pakietem legislacyjnym dotyczącym europejskiego zarządzania gospodarczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.172,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynikiem tych działań jest ogromne, często nieodwracalne ograniczenie różnorodności biologicznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nową okolicznością była rosyjska ofensywa w Gruzji, sygnalizująca odnowienie ambicji imperialnych Kremla\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doświadczyłem takiej chwili, gdy miałem możliwość przeczytać projekt rezolucji w sprawie Ukrainy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska i Stany Zjednoczone bardzo gruntownie analizowały tę sprawę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To moje jedyne życzenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja chce jutro przyjąć projekt dyrektywy w sprawie transgranicznych usług medycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.396,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego musi zostać zawarta umowa między władzami Republiki Mołdowy i Międzynarodowym Funduszem Walutowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawodawstwo regulujące handel głębinowymi zasobami rybnymi wymaga szczegółowego przeglądu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę, aby wszystkie aspekty naszych rozmów i dyskusji były powiązane z interesami naszych wyborców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.092,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy działań skoordynowanych na szczeblu światowym i to zostało potwierdzone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co my możemy w tej sytuacji zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem jednak skłonna wraz z moim kolegą posłem negocjować z panią ten proces\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapomnijmy o całej politycznej retoryce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26959992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chyba najmniej martwi strażników wolnej i niczym niezakłóconej konkurencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26960083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak dzieje się na przykład w Portugalii, gdzie mogę to obserwować bezpośrednio\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26960084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże takie skomplikowane i delikatne problemy praktycznie nie mogą być rozwiązane na poziomie wspólnotowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26960085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym wyjaśnić, dlaczego głosowaliśmy za przyjęciem Aktu o jednolitym rynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26960086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podać Państwu uwagi wstępne przed naszym posiedzeniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26960087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tworzy to także warunki dla wzmocnienia legitymizacji nasze Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26960178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pełna demokracja nie pojawia się nagle\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26960179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.684,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczyt w Sztokholmie stwarza okazję do pokazania naszym państwom członkowskim, że potrafimy się zjednoczyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26960180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mija dzisiaj dokładnie sześć miesięcy od dnia wyborów do parlamentu federalnego w Belgii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26960181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kawał dobrej roboty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_26960182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety nawet dzisiaj utrzymują się liczne nierówności między kobietami a mężczyznami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obszarem przemysłowym, małych i średnich przedsiębiorstw oraz usług, katalizatorem eksportu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ofiary są po obu stronach, a największą ofiarą jest naród kaszmirski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynym słusznym sposobem realizacji polityki spójności jest zastosowanie narzędzi wdrażania strategii lizbońskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Premierzy zignorowali wyniki dwóch referendów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak dotąd wszystko w porządku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już uszli dużo drogi, Maciuś raz wraz przystaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A póki co, to wszystko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pana kraju mocno dawały znać o sobie tendencje opozycyjne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W relacjach samą Rosję nowym paradygmatem jest tak zwane partnerstwo na rzecz modernizacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oparciu o poczynione postępy Komisja zaproponowała ustalenie daty rozpoczęcia negocjacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka dni temu uczestniczyłam w dużej konferencji, która odbywała się pod Rzymem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przed kryzysem Islandia była jednym z najbogatszych państw w przeliczeniu na jednego mieszkańca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy też wynika to z procedury współdecydowania lub czegoś innego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dominacja ta nie istnieje w przypadku konkurujących producentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym niemniej uważam, że praca, którą wykonaliśmy daje powody do optymizmu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omawiane sprawozdanie zawiera jednak wzmiankę o wdrożeniu traktatu lizbońskiego, któremu jesteśmy zdecydowanie przeciwni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy zgadzamy się, że następstwa tego procesu dla środowiska będą poważne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest jeszcze kilka innych charakterystycznych punktów, które szczególnie chcę podkreślić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kontrolowana demokracja idzie w parze z kontrolowanym wymiarem sprawiedliwości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Propagowanie zrównoważonego transportu jest kluczowym elementem wspólnej polityki transportowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedstawia państwu wnioski legislacyjne i budżetowe, czego ja nie czynię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcą się upewnić, że serio podchodzimy do przeciwdziałania zmianom klimatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krytycznej ocenie podlegają w szczególności dwie dziedziny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam jednak dość dobre zdanie o Irlandii i poziomie inwestycji w tym kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W moim kraju stosowano obowiązkowy sześciomiesięczny okres kwarantanny zwierząt domowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie może być żadnych skandali ani oszustw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś musimy doskonalić zawartość Europeany, przy jednoczesnym zagwarantowaniu poszanowania dla własności intelektualnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo na tej stacji boi się Maciuś bilet kupować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27003853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprowadzają swoje produkty na europejski rynek po cenach, które są nieopłacalne dla producentów europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna z posłanek wspomniała, że w jej kraju pewien bank już zbankrutował\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie czas teraz na strach i niepewne działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ofiarami tej europejskiej anarchii prawnej są często małe, niewinne dzieci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez wątpienia jest to ich wielkie osiągnięcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otuchy dodaje mi jednak bardzo praktyczne podejście do problemów ze strony pani komisarz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to dzisiaj wyzwanie dla Rady i dla Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, Kosowo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego teoria została podważona z powodu wielu rewolucji rolniczych, które zmieniły nasze społeczeństwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Supermarkety, zakłady przetwórstwa i konsumenci muszą oczywiście wypełniać swoje zobowiązania w tym zakresie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrażanie tak pozytywnych uczuć jest raczej wyjątkiem niż regułą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawki te będą również przedmiotem debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym prosić reprezentantów grup politycznych o wypowiedzi w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunki dyplomatyczne pomiędzy Demokratyczną Republiką Konga i Rwandą zostały odbudowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.244,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym sposobem nowe państwa członkowskie wspierają i wzmacniają sektory usług zdrowotnych swoich bogatszych sąsiadów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie zamieszki zdarzają się jeszcze częściej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego pytanie brzmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie mamy procedurę pytań z sali, tak więc procedura niebieskiej kartki jest niedozwolona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się widząc, że rząd litewski tak zdecydowanie zareagował w odpowiedzi na to ujawnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W produkcji rolnej można uwzględnić te dwa elementy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_27033497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chodzi o książki i produkty kultury, sytuacja przedstawia się gorzej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Babunia nigdy w życiu nie chorowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O, placki kartoflane!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiano ją przenieść do innej szkoły, bo w starej szkole „śmierdzi, śmierdzi”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, nie chciałam, może, może, żebyś ty się zajmował brudną robotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zatrzymał się, padł na kolana i oczy oburącz zasłonił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wzięto nas za małżeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała zmęczonym głosem: — Muszę jeszcze powtórzyć łacinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piotr został przy drzwiach, ukłonił się i z nieufnością oglądał starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zeszłym roku Jarmark cieszył się olbrzymią popularnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu obraz zaczyna wirować, już znikł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co działo się dotąd, odbywało się jakby przed jakąś kurtyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To honor walczącego proletariatu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło o białego ogiera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci idą do sklepu i kupują gotowe masło, nie widziały nigdy jak ono powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że on nie bardzo pragnie, bym żył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu mówił: — Mamo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre pnie złociły się wypukle, niby oszklone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec końcem kija zmacał pogięty jak fala kark zwiniętej w kłębek dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szablon mimo woli spojrzał na jego walizki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapal światło w pokoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyli pamięta pani moment wprowadzania gimnazjów już z perspektywy nauczyciela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ten głos?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak trzeba, tak być powinno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Deformacje rzeczywistości przy wpatrywaniu się w ciemnym pokoju bardzo znaczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden cukierek zjadła, a drugi mnie kazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponury, pełen nie spodziewanych blasków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie jest to zgodne z prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była w dalszym ciągu bardzo grzeczna, bardzo dziecinna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem, choroba naszej babuni była to nowa młodość, nowe życie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą lepiej się myśli w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby wiedziała, że umrze, to cię nie przeprosi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wymienione przeze mnie ruchy są więc fikcją?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja jestem jeszcze tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gotów zażądać od chłopców słowa honoru!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaciągnąłem się wraz z innymi i wyprawiono mnie do hacjendy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trupy leżą na drodze, która mnie od nich dzieli, jak progi kolejowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wiesz, czyje te paznokcie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sposób w jaki Ania opowiada o malowaniu zaintrygował nawet mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, już nie kochałem siostry Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoła była dużo lepiej zbudowana jak jej lekki domek letni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem wtedy do siebie: „Każda chwila jest godna Szekspira”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był u celu podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w rozpaczy i zdawało mu się, że spadnie na ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przemknął mu wargami tuż koło ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypominał pilota, który dla marynarza jest wcieleniem tego, co zasługuje na najwyższe zaufanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspomniałem, że nagle na szybie żywą muchę dostrzegłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie idzie jakaś pani z chłopczykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Do widzenia w sobotę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak struchlał i zbladł, jak przyłapany na gorącym uczynku winowajca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała filozofia religijna katolicyzmu i cała cywilizacja łacińska oparte są na personalizmie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tępym, automatycznym krokiem wywlokłem się z mieszkania…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób osłaniali się wzajemnie tarczami noszonymi na lewym przedramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A miałeś jakiś wybór?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między innymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostawało tylko ciało, jako jedyny środek wyrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczała chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do domu i na dziedziniec osady zaczęły zalatywać kule.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co z nich będzie? — spytała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczny zakręt przed tobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd się pan teraz wybiera? — zagadnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na horyzoncie widniał budynek, którego wcześniej tam nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie jak we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może jest pan moim rodakiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on cię kocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest we mnie — i ja we wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze znużenia i z ciągłego napięcia nerwów dostałem ataku nerwowej febry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jesteś chory.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahała się, zakołysała na miejscu, nie mogąc iść dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko wszakże zamieszka taka się zdarzała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile minut dziennie powinienem trenować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na moim koniu po pocztę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest serdecznym przyjacielem nas obojga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniały w proporcjach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze reakcje są oczywiste i nie wynikają tylko z tego, że boimy się zmian.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczepić ją podczas pauzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyżbym zostawił tam, w tej diabelskiej lepiance?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A karmiąc swe dziecię, matka czuje się szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ano, kichnął dwa razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest kierowca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie dostrzegam w tym, com powiedział, nic niegrzecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W taką pogodę nawet pies z kulawą nogą nie chciałby wyjść na dwór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienaturalne podniecenie wzrasta do południa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak ze wzrastającą dumą spojrzał na obydwu przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie wicher — przykrość, dla niego — uciecha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogień w klasztorze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była mało ubrana: trup.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że ma głowę zanurzoną we krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze ścian sączyła się strużkami woda i wsiąkała w grunt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utajone drga we mnie wszystko, co było, i wszystko, co będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Źle się stało — szepnął powstając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli razem na łóżku i oparli głowy o ścianę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiamy się, że kapitał, który włożyliśmy w ten projekt może być zmarnowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był mile zdziwiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mało panu jeszcze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz dochodzenia spełzły na niczym: sprawcy mordu nie wykryto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było ostatnie nasze zajście w granicach Rosji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamieniona w leśne echo, w wojska śpiew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej wieczorem, po deszczu, kiedy czujesz to, co się dzieje w zamkniętych domach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuściliśmy nasz cienisty przytułek i niebawem znaleźliśmy się na łuku mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech sprawdza! — zaprzeczył odważnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za obraz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten hałas mnie męczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza Fauna — to sen o śnie, sen posępny i niespokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez dna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się i zawrócił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już strasznie znudzili mi się ci mężczyźni z forsą i szykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej jest przestać palić od samego rana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś przemył i przewiązał ranę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiem, ale szeptem i każdemu na osobności…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla ciebie tylko ryzykuję tę podróż na północ, do twego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam was! — krzyknął Archibald.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec i jednoręki usunęli się na ubocze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc przeprowadzono chłopców z więzienia tu, do domu sierot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdzie do haremu jako małżonka monarchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jakiś uduszony rybak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oblicza z dwóch stron mej głowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram, mając do pomocy swoje dzikie bestie, był pewny zwycięstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobra i cierpliwa mama traci wreszcie cierpliwość i daje córeczce klapsa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale przestał, bo po co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłanie było nadspodziewanie wygodne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Psia krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żałuję, że sam nie wpadłem na tę myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożegnali się i Emil wrócił nad rzekę i wrócił do Sokra tesa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była ciemna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż o tym myślicie, panie kolego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że umiem niektóre rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to znany, sławny nawet, śpioch czwartej dywizji ciężkiej artylerii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ta kobieta znała tak dokładnie pewne szczegóły z mego życia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil czuł, że się dusi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie wiadomo, czym jest naprawdę: parą, wodą czy lodem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak by wyglądało, lecz to sprawy nie wyjaśnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz wszystko ma swój koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy zdawał się nie zwracać nań najmniejszej uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje mi się, że nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżynier drżał z niecierpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co to?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję i przepraszam za przerwanie toku rozmyślań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim na śmierć zapomniał o konieczności małej pogadanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — to on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toteż musi opustoszeć, a wówczas nikt nam nie będzie przeszkadzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znaczy, nigdy nie oddam mu się już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się tłumaczył, pani i tak nie uwierzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy seniora ma gości? — zapytałem go niechętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Troje zaczerwienili się z całkiem różnych powodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brak silnych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zerwał się z posłania i gorączkowo zaczął szukać zapałek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda: nie lubiłem Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na torebce, którą przyciska do boku, widać kolorową nalepkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten uścisk symbolizował o wiele więcej niż tylko wzajemną ochronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama niech nie udaje świętej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociągnął nosem, węsząc jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pary z ust nie puszczę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest potrzebne dla uczynienia mnie nieżywym, abym się zmieścił do jakichś tam książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec wziął jednego za uszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest we mnie — i ja we wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie znajdę jakieś fajne knajpki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam was! — krzyknął Archibald.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palto krzywo zapięte!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mnie i tak całej nie posiadasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej chwili nie mogłem skupić uwagi na żadnym zajęciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewna, że się nie pomyliłam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano zostaje sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego spotkania można było coś niecoś skorzystać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żaden nie wpadł w sidła, żaden ran ciężkich nie odniósł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Instytucja oświatowa i organizacja pozarządowa posiadająca status organizacji pożytku publicznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mnie odrywa od smutnych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam oczy przy zapalonej lampie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, już nie kochałem siostry Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, będziemy spali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przemknął mu wargami tuż koło ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co nas obu może łączyć ze sobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się jak ryba w wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zostawało tylko ciało, jako jedyny środek wyrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwierzę, któremu utkwiła strzała w grzbiecie; tarza się, biega, ryczy, pluje, krew zalewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystkie Podlasiaki tak wyglądają, jakby zbytecznej na karku gęby co prędzej pozbyć się chcieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz sen nie spływał na powieki od jego pieśni monotonnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toruj drogę jako młodszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodź — zawołał do Ewy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20807841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczach rosły niebieskawe jodły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto głęboką ciszę nocną rozdarł nagle kwik koński, straszny, przeraźliwy, pełen bólu, trwogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"boli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko rzeka Jussef wiąże, rzekłbyś, niebieskim sznurkiem tę okolicę z doliną Nilu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjemnie jest go brać do ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się — domyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Cóż myślisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powrócę do domu męża mego! — odparła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bill krzyknął ze zdziwienia. Oto wszystko, co pozostało po Spankerze. Kij, który miał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mijała, opadając, meduzy, które wyglądały jak kwiaty o mięsistych płatkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet puls dobry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W polu nad stawkiem bawiło się kilkoro dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakoś trza radzić, ale jak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś trafiło go w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie wzeszedł księżyc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W grubej garści trzymając jakiś przedmiot wielki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy ona spoważniała: — Ach, tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzajcie no! Już kąsa bestia! - krzyczał ktoś w tłumie. Parsknęły tłumione śmiechy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Och, ja nieszczęśliwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cukrownia, walcownia stali, przemysł wydobywczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chce obudzić małżonka, lecz Tadeusz chrapie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci spierają się o byle co.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zeskoczył z konia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po powrocie męża, wraz z sędzią zmieniła się także sprawiedliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten zaś niewielki wiecheć ludzie określają\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upłynęło niezawodnie sporo czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podejrzewał, że Anglia życzy sobie w duszy, by Mahdi odebrał Sudan Egiptowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby nie chora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kontinuum czasoprzestrzenne - czasoprzestrzeń - wymyślił Einstein.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- To Smain jest dobry?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po długich miesiącach podróży, przybyli do jeziora, leżącego na południe od Abisynii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie kołata nic, ucichło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie różnią się od zwyczajnych, które sprzedają w sklepach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20867251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mnóstwo mięsa, mnóstwo mięsa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie pozrzucali z głów ładunki, ale tym razem nie pokładli się odrazu na ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie? W pierwszej chwili nie zrozumiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara poznała przybyłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed lustrem, na siedząco, albo na stojaka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie trzeba sprowadzać Amerykan z zewnątrz, kiedy się ich ma w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” — On już stanowczo mówi za dużo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo ja widzę co nocy twoją mamę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obchód weselny miał się odbyć późnym wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I był już teraz spokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwudziesta trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poruszył głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez strzegące cór swoich sędziwe matrony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak jest, Jakubie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja bardzo ją lubię… a tobie jak ona się podoba?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy weszli, przekonali się naocznie, że ciało znikło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadł na swój szybowiec i złapał dudka za nóżki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem nieszczęśliwa… więc niech nikt do mnie się nie wtrąca!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli wałem oddzielającym wody jeziora Menzaleh od kanału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wślizgnął się do tego pokoju, ponieważ nie widział innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Naszą córkę jakby kto odmienił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uczyniłeś to już, i w ogromnej nawet mierze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Tak mniej więcej jak stąd do Sycylii - objaśnił pan Tarkowski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Omdurman inaczej przedstawił się dzieciom niż Chartum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błagał mnie, abym nie wchodziła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Swojego czasu dużo podróżował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Że mi też to wcześniej na myśl nie przyszło! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20973984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skrzydła piechoty osłaniała kawaleria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy pokonani, mój dobry Watsonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak została nawiedzona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsłaniając cycuszki, pępuszek i picę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obliczenia symboliczne i rachunki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rusza się, oczy zamknięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrosły z niego bardzo nieprzyjemne węże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nolana szanuję za Batmana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po ukończeniu dziennych prac najmilszym dla nich odpoczynkiem była rozmowa o dzieciach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwunasta czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek ten był kiedyś piętnowany podobnie, jak piętnuje się bydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie znam lepszego sposobu na rozpoczęcie dnia jak czarna, smolista i słodka kawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieli się miłością i obowiązkami z ludźmi podobnymi do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszli pewnego razu o godz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze, czyli nie chcecie się przyznać po dobroci...To błąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20974072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak go błagała, tak powtarzała, patrząc mu w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedł dwie ulice — znów to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On załatwił na mnie szybko swoje sprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże „grupa pięciu” przycichła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I popatrzyła na mnie wyzywająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oczywiście, prawda co do joty — potakiwał Ole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko drgało w tym szczególnym rytmie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to tylko gra przed tym drugim i sobą zarazem, komedia nieunikniona i podniecająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ona powiedziała do niego: — Twoje wargi wyglądają jak pół owoce, pół zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak jest zima i lato, dzień i noc, sen i czuwanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widna noc, rozjaśniona świeżo spadłym śniegiem, ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo przygotowania do podpalenia gmach nie został zniszczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szkołach powinni uczyć o podatkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokoło chodzą uważnie strażniczki cienia — prostytutki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedaleko od Cytadeli do Muranowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosiliśmy go na lunch w pobliskiej knajpie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spoglądał w milczeniu i niepewnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— E, nie bardzo…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż na stację wtoczył się pociąg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzena zatrzymała się kilka metrów wcześniej i patrzyła w dal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby iść tak… żeby iść tak… i wciąż iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda to na kieszonkowe złodziejstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu odbywały się te rozmowy, ta wiedza historyczna, wspomnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale może wojna, która nadchodzi, przyniesie tu jakieś zmiany na lepsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co się bawisz jeszcze? — W kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez okno leje się woda i kapie na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los smutny odniósł walne zwycięstwo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ile lat kończysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przykra misja — objaśnił po chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiała i ona, że niestety ich sytuacja znacznie się pogorszyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obojętne, czy mówi do jednego słuchacza, czy do stu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej z nich było dwóch żołnierzy, w drugiej — trzech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma dymu bez ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nadzwyczaj dziwny list.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jużci, że wiadomo… — przerwał mu jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takiej sytuacji są one kluczowe do zrozumienia całej sprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko powinno otrzymać takie wychowanie, które podnosi jego kulturę ogólną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Istnieje przepaść pomiędzy ich życiem a tym, co wiedzą o życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię — dodałem łagodniej — nie mówmy teraz o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec wręczył mu dziwożonę, a sam skocznie pomknął do Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalszy pościg był bezcelowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mówiła jakimś językiem Filipowi zupełnie nie znanym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod żadnym pozorem nie trzeba przez kilka dni przyjmować wieczornych zaproszeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między dwoma miastami wyrósł kamienny mur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię: bywałem, gdyż niekiedy zdawało mi się, że Nicość zwyciężyła Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z jakiego to przytułku wypuszczono tego jegomościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem o tym i wierzę ci na słowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem, że nasza załoga była przygotowana na podobne zajście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale sama wtedy nie spała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I szybko zbiegłem po schodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie zaczęło się od grania, bo u mnie w pokoju jest rozklekotane pianino.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno było pewne: jeżeli nie złapią Maciusia, już się nie uspokoi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znowu najechałeś na mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczesny, jesienny zmrok zalegał ulice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty mnie do tego zmusiłaś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wasza królewska mość raczy się pakować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawcie się dobrze, pantoflarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę myślałem, że to twój kolega z pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my tylko na skargę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo spytać, a trudno odpowiedzieć! — rzekł jednoręki i pokiwał głową bezradnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz się przygotować na daleką drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozglądam się ciekawie po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieża była z kamieni, u dołu szeroka, wyżej coraz węższa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmierć nastąpiła prawdopodobnie niedawno, bo trup nie zdradzał jeszcze śladów rozkładu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz poszedł do pokoju, ale zostawił otworem drzwi do sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrzebowała wyrazów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem następuje uzasadnienie, jak zwykle przekonujące, ale nieprawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz boli, że kradną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szaleństwo wyzierało z jego pałających, szeroko rozwartych, nieruchomych oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się, że w pewnym momencie nie będziesz wiedziała, gdzie się znajdujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budynek mieścił się w niejakiej odległości od miasta nad wielkim stawem otoczonym palmami kokosowymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci i ryby głosu nie mają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ten dzień zapasy były skończone i zebrani rozeszli się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomnij no sobie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Impotent dlatego nie może, ponieważ boi się, że nie będzie mógł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz poczekaj tu na mnie chwilkę, drogi przyjacielu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudziła się dopiero na wołanie matki i wielki głośny śmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest twój ojciec?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę mi tylko nieprzyjemnie, że zaczynamy nasze wycieczki od tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwrócił głowę, bo słońce świeciło mu w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie rosło, aż się w końcu zazieleni…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oni ponoć nie uważali tej kobiety za dobrą opiekunkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu powiedział do niej: — Istnieje jeszcze rzecz, którą zataiłem przed tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali powinni się usunąć… — ciągnął dalej Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żelazne wrota blokowały im przejście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było mu coraz gorzej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to poniekąd ludzie i tak, i tak zgubieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wrzeszczał na próżno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu oczywiście nie wystarczyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cygaro żarzyło się powoli, rozpylając po przedziale obłoczki sinawego dymu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjął strzelbę z ramienia i podał jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nazywali nigdy po imieniu tego, co było między nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli nastawione zegarki dokładnie na tę samą godzinę i byli bardzo punktualni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różowy i żłobkowaty korzeń zabarwił się w słońcu soczystym połyskiem eterycznie wonnej błony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdowali się we własnym oszołomieniu: ty i ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno zapomniana teoria Jamesa-Langego a miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tak była czarna, że prawie niebieska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś już można powiedzieć, że poniekąd są uzasadnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Otóż to właśnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przemawiał z reguły tylko wtedy, gdy zachodziła bezwzględna konieczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znałeś go? — spytał jednoręki upiora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po jałmużnę idę! — odparł zuchwale kulawiec i z powikłanym wysiłkiem powstał z ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie podszedł pod okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się przez sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zazdrosny, że nie wie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że jest martwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawdopodobnie będzie najlepsze określenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem, by się obejrzeć za siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał mu do powiedzenia tysiące rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadanie swoje objaśniła rysunkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tejże chwili stanął nad powierzchnią wysoki słup wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i podnieśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczeństwo zbliżało się szybko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciemności czuł się jak w dużej wodzie i bał się zanurzyć w sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze raz nas obejrzyj, dziewulinko płochliwa! — szepnął nieśmiało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czym marzysz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie martw się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłaby wymrzeć w trochę piękniejszych i potężniejszych formach — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odtrącam rękami natrętny pstrokaty łeb, bronię ciała mego od jej dotknięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja też zrobię świnkę! — zawołał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła, mimo że nie zależało jej na nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz ze mną dalej gadać, to zachowuj się przyzwoicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy staniemy u celu, obudzisz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil stał za palmą i oglądał księcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem pomału ściągnął rękawiczkę i wyszedł, chwiejąc się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo woli rodziło się podejrzenie, czy puchar nie zawiera trucizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jemu pewnie też serce mocno ze strachu biło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20611524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można by tu zrobić dygresję do psychologii całości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki i kulawiec ze czcią na ów sęk teraz spojrzeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chory pokpiwa sobie z lekarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy typ ma swoje dwa nieomal przeciwne bieguny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem okiem na wstążkę napisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kącie stało składane łóżko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dwanaście, nauczyła się gwizdać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piękny i młodzieńczy, jak ten letni poranek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to, jak we własnym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on umie pieścić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziła namiętnie do kina i nazajutrz miewała takie stany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwienie odmalowało się na twarzy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim na śmierć zapomniał o konieczności małej pogadanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurz osiadał na nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym chciała być dla ciebie taką serdeczną przyjaciółką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20770410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłum powstał z miejsc z okrzykiem: „Niech żyje król!”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dziesięć i pół, zaonanizowała na śmierć psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Źle — mówi pani nauczycielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szablon mimo woli spojrzał na jego walizki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc chyba śniłem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20772848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na mnie? No, to odprowadź mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogą się oderwać od biopodłoża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po pokoju i udaję, że nie wiem, o co chodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam, żeby pisać i opracować w formie pisemnej relacje tych osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się odwlecze to nie uciecze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zrobił w ścianie dziurę gwoździem na znak tego zdarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chodzenie na spacer było jeszcze nudniejsze niż siedzenie w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiarkował od razu! — rzekł do Podlasiaka, wskazując ramieniem przyjaciela i chełpiąc się jego zgadliwością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sklepach z ubraniami bywam rzadko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba użył pan tego wyrażenia w znaczeniu przenośnym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo tak tu czekacie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ledwo wyszedł, wyskoczyłem z łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę zawiązać listy w ceratę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dominującą religią w Polsce jest katolicyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chodzi o to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauka ta jest bezpłatna i obowiązkowa, przynajmniej w zakresie szkoły podstawowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda dzisiaj będzie mroźna i wietrzna, należy się ciepło ubrać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałaś tego gościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłuchałem pełen sprzecznych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś patetyczny, mój piękny małżonku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery dni temu budowałem schron z całym systemem sznurków zamykających prymitywne klapy i zasłony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewnego wieczora… — poddałem mu, ułatwiając wyznania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jednym jego policzku zjawił się wypiek nierówny i smużysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas kolacji: — Hm, prawda, pytasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodziły koło niego kobiety i, jak komety, ciągnęły za sobą smugi zapachów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastanawialiśmy się czy to mają być wystawy stałe, czy zmienne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wyobrażam sobie tego inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbym powiedzieć, czego, ale mi się nie chce myśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I powiedział: — Mała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecie pies też boskie stworzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja to zapomnę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcemy cię wziąć na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A pamiątki szanują nie tylko królowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ był gruntownie pijany, więc nie mógł uciekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krążę uparcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie skazano go na wygnanie do wschodniej Syberii, na Kamczatkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cichutko podkradł się do dziewczynki i rzucił jej pierścionek na sukienkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do nieba go zaniosło! — odparł kulawiec, palcem niebo wskazując.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzec można, iż zanieistnieli w sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zależą? Tyle możliwych żywotów, tyle różnorodnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli znowu — donikąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecku należy dać wszelkie możliwości do zabaw i rozrywek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby serce moje było złotem, wyszłoby świetne z tej próby ogniowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie tutaj, — w tył od tamtego folwarku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co? — Teraz ćwiczę mazurek Chopina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak to, więc tak dużo tu czegoś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerka co chwilę na elegancki zegarek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łódź leży stosunkowo niedaleko Warszawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nie przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem uspokoiłem się trochę i spróbowałem rzecz rozważyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze się składa, że niczyja! — pochwycił kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po deszczu na ulice i chodniki wychodzą ślimaki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nikotyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chowali go, chronili, by nie wpadł we wrogie ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20778430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz siną pręgę na twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc tu spoczywa…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała mokre włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla chcącego nic trudnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz tamten jakby nie słysząc naciskał już sprężynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nie w chwili samego gimnastykowania się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowie się pan po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozłożymy ognisko za namiotem, tego wilki się boją! — uspokoili mnie Mongołowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo Jankę, co nosi krótkie suknie, albo Helę, co nie nosi stanika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A kiedy ją będę widział? — Za kilka dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To się tylko tak mówi: „czytam”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak była mała, to nie dostrzegałam tych cech, które teraz widzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawda, że się chce wymiotować? Emil poruszył głową w nieokreślonym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechże matka ma rozum!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Poeto mój, przyszłam do ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20779784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie ich powiedziało mi wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak, ciepłotą poranka zagrzany, przeciągnął się i ziewnął w samo słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczęliśmy się cofać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wolałabym wstrzymać się od wróżby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok pociągów, które przejeżdżały z hukiem przez most, wywoływał w niej strach i niepokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej we wszechświecie lubię dżem porzeczkowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa, patrząc na pantofle, zupełnie serio: — Zobaczysz, one się jeszcze zrobią ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem ani Podlasiak, ani jednoręki nie powitali nowej obietnicy radosnymi okrzykami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa zaczęła się śmiać, niehisterycznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przy mojej pomocy wyszła na marmurowy cokół nabrzeża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiłaby teraz wszystko, czego by chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zuchwała wariatka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem jak woda, która przylega do ścian naczynia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąb, lecz odmieniony nie do poznania! — usprawiedliwiał się prawdomówny Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nim stał długi, długi szereg mrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobieta uśmiecha się i patrzy na mnie w szczególny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na górach spokojnie żerowały stada reniferów i jaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co się dzieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz istota przejawu pozostaje ta sama: zła, występna i tajemnicza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bolała go głowa i oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego zdania są napięte jak łuki, jak pupa młodej dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uparł się i powiedział, że nie chce widzieć tego kretyna, dyrektora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koło drugiej nad ranem wyczerpana usnęła mi na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To są rady banalne dla zupełnych już prymitywów golenia się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, Leo, mam wielką ochotę przytoczyć tu jeden wykład, ale boję się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia ołówkową spódnicę i zaczesuje ciemne włosy za ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatelefonował do Alinki, ale nie było jej w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to zresztą przystań na drwiny i wypoczynek na opak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się zmieszał i powiedział: - Mogą być na wszelki wypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, cóż, zrozumiałeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieję wszędzie i nigdzie, zawsze i nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z jej życia zaczy nało rozwijać się dzieło sztuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie bój się, nic ci nie zrobię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyją naturalnie i — być może — lepiej od mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W torbie, przerzuconej przez plecy, ma zapasy na cały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja się wobec niej czuję skrępowany i nieśmiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko spojrzała na duży, wahadłowy zegar nad sofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu to nie było ważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20786546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Andrzej ani drgnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20929565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umył twarz i ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20929566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było jednak żadnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20929567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbudowany jest z prekambryjskich gnejsów, wznosi się piramidalnie ponad płaskowyżem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20929568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadała pani ćwiczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20929569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozległ się gwizdek sędziego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20929953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, tak, drogi mój!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20929954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby tu był Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20929955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co ukryta głęboko wśród złocistych włosów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20929956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tem leży nasz ratunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20929957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, grzmi, burza nadciąga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słaby i zniszczony organizm nie wytrzymał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mi prawie zamarło w piersiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takich chwilach moja naturalna odwaga i zuchwałość przychodzą mi zawsze w pomoc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejrzałem się i podniosłem skrwawiony pałasz w górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście, nie opuściłbym sprawy pana za nic w świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoliłem sobie nareszcie zakaszlać lekko, aby mu przypomnieć, iż jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gigabajt pamięci to sporo na same zdjęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie usłyszałem dzwonka telefonu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cicho być, nagrywam podcast.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U stóp tych wzgórz rozścielał się las.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tak też jest we Wrocławiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał na mnie przez ramię i wydał rozpaczliwy okrzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tem ciężkiem strapieniu idzie do Piotra z prośbą o radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli pan go opuści, postrada pan całe stanowisko na zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jutro mam zaplanowane kolokwium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak to dobranoc? Jest siódma rano!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoro się wlezie między wilki, trzeba też razem z niemi wyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płomienie zasyczały, obejmując swym palącym uściskiem te suche, czarne szczątki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wobec faktów historycznej wagi życie jednostki staje się drobnostką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zdarza mi się ich nosić pod prysznicem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie jakimś katem, zbójem, mordercą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież ma pełen worek złota!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie należało przypuszczać, iż wtargnie tędy, gdzie będziemy się najmniej spodziewać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co było począć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowódca chce pana zaraz zobaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego się wszystko zaczęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odpowiedzieli nic, ale spojrzeli na mnie badawczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie była dla mnie kryjówka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ukłonił się nam trzem i spokojnie odszedł pod opieką detektywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaiste, to była freudowska pomyłka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile mogę rozumieć, Ligę założył amerykański milioner Ezechiasz Hopkins, który był oryginałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całe miasto musi płonąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego mi było już za wiele, panowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy powrócę z życiem, do mego wieńca wawrzynowego przybędzie znowu jeden listek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doszło do wycieku na platformie wiertniczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wylogowałem się i szybko wyłączyłem komputer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Własny rozum powinien panu powiedzieć, że nie pozostawało mi nic innego do roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wszystko, co przeszedłem, wyniszczyło mię moralnie i fizycznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozbyłem się mych wrogów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zepsuł mi się zasilacz od laptopa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pociąg służbowy nie zatrzymuje się na stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwałem się i spojrzałem dokoła siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proch znajduje się w pokoju przeoryszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym roku nie odbył się pokaz sztucznych ogni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W doskonałem jestem dziś usposobieniu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muzyka dla moich uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi pan wiedzieć, że w żyłach moich płynie królewska krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał na sobie obszerny, szary płaszcz i wielki kaptur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzielnego żołnierza lubił zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz jego nagle spoważniała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastanawiałem się nad rozsądną odpowiedzią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczerze mówiąc, Twitter jest dla mnie zbyt... wciągający.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurier dostarczy paczkę dopiero wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dług publiczny przekroczył bilion złotych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy miałabyś ochotę na wyjście do teatru?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszyj mi pan serce, przyjacielu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęśliwym trafem miałem w kieszeni dwa spore kawałki maślanego placka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj znajdę z pewnością wszystko, czego mi potrzeba będzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadziwiłem cię stukaniem o bruk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie bierz narkotyków, bo cię zmiotą z planszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz na to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko tacy ludzie mogą zwyciężyć Przyrodę i patrzeć w oczy prawdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiał teraz ilość i jakość błędów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewniam pana, iż będzie pan dla nas bardzo mile widzianym gościem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Docelowo tramwaje będą zawracać za tym skrzyżowaniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stalking jest przestępstwem zagrożonym karą więzienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczę się animować w starym stylu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem i spostrzegłem wysokiego, brodatego mężczyznę w niebieskim, podobnym do uniformu kubraku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedziałem co robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech i tak będzie, ale po co was nudzę tem wszystkiem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tę myśl byłbym się śmiał z zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma pan rodzinę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co było jasnem dla każdego, potwierdzić, nie było przecież naruszeniem żadnej tajemnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy duchy ich wyszły z ciała i mogły się porozumiewać z sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten odwrót nie był taki łatwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy może znajdował się w takiem samem niebezpiecznem położeniu, jak ja?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno silne pchnięcie, i trzymałem ją w ręku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co z niego za głuptas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kliknij w guzik aby zacząć pobieranie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W maju jak w gaju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to przecież podczas zabójczej pogody, gdy musieliśmy uciekać przed Nelsonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam spostrzegłem też i stos drzewa, który miałem okupić tak drogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Załóż kołnierzyk, przecież nie chcesz się przeziębić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cierpiała nie mogąc dać sobie rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twój syn niemoże stać w szeregu ciemiężycieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie lubię rozwodzić się nad moją przeszłością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A weź się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszliśmy przez polankę i wprost do pnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale obawiam się, iż takie rzeczy przekraczają zdolności huzara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce drugi batalion zaściełał zbocze, niby krwawe maki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy mu się niespodzianie ożywiły, na policzki wystąpiły ciemne, ceglaste plamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkajmy się na bulwarach nadwiślańskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dwie armaty stanęły twarz w twarz w straszliwej, niczem niezmąconej ciszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikomu nie powiem, ale wolałbym, moją małą Ewę widzieć w grobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim razie muszę je sobie sam zabrać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu zapanowało milczenie, które przerwał ostry dzwonek telefonu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałem, co na to odpowiedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem na drzwi i spostrzegłem, że klucz tkwił z wewnątrz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było teraz widzieć, jak skoczył z krzesła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mi rosło na myśl o czynie, który mnie czekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto tu wołał o pomoc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Służbę pełniliśmy na zmianę, dzień po dniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynajmę to mieszkanie za ustaloną kwotę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy będzie pan mógł objąć swoje nowe obowiązki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie wygląda profesjonalnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrazy w każdym języku z czasem zmieniają znaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przodzie nic nie znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byłem wtedy online.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"widzę tu przynajmniej coś podobnego w zapiskach, które sobie poczyniliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedziela wieczór i humor popsuty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przewrócił się quadem na rżysku i poharatał sobie dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes siedział na krześle poważnie zainteresowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możecie sobie panowie wyobrazić, że widok ten nie bardzo mnie rozweselił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwrócony był do mnie profilem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowozaciężni, mieszczanie, dzierżawcy wiejscy, może nawet nie umiejący obchodzić się z bronią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw była to tylko iskierka migocąca na kamiennej posadzce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrestartuj router.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takim to wykrzyknikiem witał każdy wstrząsający obraz śmierci, który przedstawiał się naszym oczom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie trzeba mi było tego dwa razy powtarzać, to też wybiegłem czem prędzej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkiego najlepszego, niech ci setka kiedyś stuknie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnąłem korek z butelki, i musiałem teraz wypić wino.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza jego runie w przepaść!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stało się to na oczach całej naszej, zdumionej nieprawdopodobnem zuchwalstwem brygady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabawy - zresztą niewinne - łazęgostwo i urwisostwo, pochłonęły go jak jakiś żywioł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego wyświetlacz ma niską gęstość pikseli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przetarg zostanie dziś rozstrzygnięty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dałem mniszkom znak, aby się udały za mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie powinien był mi uciec!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dochodzą do mnie powiadomienia z komunikatora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa jego wprawiły mnie w drżenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22919970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy pana jeszcze uratować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wywołać go może zbytnie nasilenie myśli lub nadzwyczajne napięcie uczuciowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w czarnoksiężników, w krasnoludki i wróżki wierzą tylko dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Padał deszcz, gdy wyszli ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiedzieli sobie kilka dowcipów, kilka plotek, nieco ciekawostek naukowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łzy napełniły oczy słuchaczy, a mury budynku zadrżały od okrzyków zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahali się chwilę i potem poszli dalej, zostawiając głębokie ślady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I stanął nagle, tak, jak musi stawać serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los czyli nie przychodzi ku nam mimo naszej woli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nacisnęło mu coś lekko oddech i serce, zęby zaczęły mu szczękać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznają świat w dużej części poprzez mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę się jeszcze ogolić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, dziecko, dziecko…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie, mój synku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie były nogi żywej dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynie łatwość kombinacji znanych elementów daje niedoświadczonemu pijakowi to złudzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na brzuch, tę najbardziej zaniedbaną część ciała, kładzie Müller największą wagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okej, jaka jest pogoda dzisiaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuściła włosy gwałtownie, tak że zakryły jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama wlepiła weń spojrzenie zionące gniewem i nienawiścią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stefania czytała na głos wolno i uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym wdzięczny za informację, w jakich godzinach planowany jest lot w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolę zadać standardowe pytania, a potem po prostu słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj czytała po raz pierwszy Rimbauda „Statek pijany” i Verlai- ne’a „Pieśń jesienną”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jest miła i dość ładna kokotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co roku tu jestem i zawsze mi mało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś przed nami powinno majaczyć takie światełko, do którego zmierzamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem, nic nie wiem — powtórzył parę razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy chodzili uśmiechnięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lubię ten szum, Jerzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mniej jest wiadomym, że monogamia stanowi podstawę własności osobistej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak widzicie, trzyma się ściśle prawdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli i ławka była jeszcze ciepła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto mi zabroni wejść? — odparł chłopak stanowczym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdyby chłopiec — byłoby śmiesznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiecie, co jest najsmutniejsze w tej całej sytuacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za szybą ciągnęły się rzędy regałów z książkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem jej zaraz o tobie, ale wybuchnęła tylko śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda wielka, że nie udało mu się odnaleźć zaginionego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład ten «Rocznik psychologiczny» i rozprawa Szumana o peyotlu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci mają swoje troski i smutki, ci swoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest w tej nieszczęśliwej coś niepokojącego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna będzie wielka, a może i nie tak bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem pociąg ruszył w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale czy książki mówią prawdę? — marszcząc brew zapytał pan Ryszard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Eee, pod wodę trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zmieniłem zamiar i jadę do stacji końcowej na tej linii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz przejdziemy do ustaleń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz poszedł do pokoju, ale zostawił otworem drzwi do sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięć ulatuje i ludziom chyba nie zależy, żeby pamiętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tymczasem wiedzą już królowie, dokąd zajechał samochód z Maciusiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzielni są wasi chłopcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęka i drze się w strzępy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robi pan same gwiazdy, pointy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Istnieje przepaść pomiędzy ich życiem a tym, co wiedzą o życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzisiaj mamy być tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wieczne napięcie pomiędzy tymi drogami: obłąkanie — normalność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem tylko stwierdzić prawdziwość swoich domysłów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wielki kamień, który ma zastąpić kotwicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja też tak myślę — powiedziała Pola.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umiarkowanie postawiona kwestia skazana jest z góry na zagładę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polata, jak one, na skrzydłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeśli nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Autor: Jan Baptysta Porta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle był uczciwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli przerzuca swoją przeszłość, swoje rozmowy z dziećmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki z błyskawiczną szybkością poprawił torbę, sposobiąc ją do zamierzonego celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między dwoma miastami wyrósł kamienny mur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałem… ale i to jeszcze nastąpi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczyła jego wywrócone oczy i połyskujące białka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To było nieuniknione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widzę, Saro, że wodzisz oczyma po klasie, zamiast patrzeć w książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem z zapalniczką?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uszczelniliśmy je gałęziami, umocowawszy kamieniami i przysypawszy grubą warstwą śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty nie masz tak prawa mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gruncie rzeczy zadowolona jestem z tego, co zaszło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pałac Branickich jest zabytkiem wartym obejrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz ci coś szepnę, jeno się nachyl, boś za wysoki — odparła dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogląd na istoty żywe: witalizm z pewnymi zastrze żeniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tańczyli, wprawdzie na palcach, po cichutku, lecz do upadłego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciemność i morze gotują się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo być nadal chłopcem na posyłki — i czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech patrzy — powtórzył jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widział jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym być jakimś takim dzikim kotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy postanowił zaatakować go wprost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do gardła można mu zajrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież mi się wargi pokurczą od niechęci! — tłumaczyła się żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapewne jedziecie zwiedzić skarbiec królewski? — zapytała nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł miał wstać już trzy drzemki temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hugon również na takie rzeczy nie zważał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, panie — oznajmił major uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? — Bo muszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę wielki gmach z czerwonej cegły, zwrócony do mnie kantem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z sonatą B-mol męczę się potwornie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem trochę znużona przechadzką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz teraz włożyła strój zgoła odmienny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic nie szkodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola złapała Emila za rękę: — Coś ci muszę powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli tak i nie myśleli o niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach, tak — mówił swobodnie, jak gdyby nigdy nic — awansowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Popatrz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki idiotyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozstawione daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszedłem na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myślałem, że dzieci są dobre, tylko nieszczęśliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich kucharka Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyny poszły zobaczyć zachód słońca, a ja zostałem z małym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ucieknie! — pocieszał siebie samego jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą sprawia wrażenie gentlemana w całym tego słowa znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W porządku, aktywowałem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały napad pracy, choroba lenistwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żreć, ile wlezie, i spać, choćby co chwila — nic to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd płyniemy? — zapytałem, ślizgając się spojrzeniem po rozlewisku wód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekają panią w niedalekiej przyszłości zawody i niepowodzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kulawych nam nie trzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się, że od dziecka uczyłem się angielskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszym elementem kształtującym człowieka jest genetyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, młynarz przeżył bez wątpienia bardzo ciężki okres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że rozmowa półsłówkami, którą prowadzili, rozmowa półtonami, była grą wysokiej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są stłoczone i nie mają tla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie pomykali tymi chodnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo spytać, a trudno odpowiedzieć! — rzekł jednoręki i pokiwał głową bezradnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj pozostali powinni się usunąć… — ciągnął dalej Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozorną lub prawdziwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotowuje mi na ten dzień jakąś nową niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolumny po jakie dwa tysiące metrów na tle szarego nieba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rok urodzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie potrafię panu tego dokładnie powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnął go nudny zawrót głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tędy droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku niby nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzej towarzysze przykucnęli wokół niego, jak wokół ogniska dla bezpośredniej rozgrzewki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doznał wrażenia, że wrasta w kanapę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem położył ołówek i papier przed sobą, co nie było jego zwyczajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnik zbladł jak płótno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W nocy miał sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem, otoczony zewsząd ludźmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy odpowiem, że wolę ustrój B, ze względu na moją książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I czuję tak samo wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje bilet ulgowy, a ile normalny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet kierownik, cała szkoła robi się od razu świąteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięte są bramy domów i zgaszone światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje kolej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Jak one wyglądają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ufaj też pięknej jasnowłosej osobie, która chwilowo zdołała cię opętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy z uczuciem niewypowiedzianej trwogi i zdumienia „poznałem” moją narzeczoną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z otwartego okna było słychać radio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, przez długie lata byłem nieobliczalnie smutną ofiarą nieustannej i niestrudzonej wstydliwości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrób listę zakupów bo znowu o czymś zapomnimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta wyjął z szafy swe rękopisy i rozrzucił po podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Wierusz wrócił?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja pozostanę tutaj; będę oczekiwał twego powrotu tu w tym fotelu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za robota!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem już było miasteczko i kawiarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy deszcz minął, poszli po raz pierwszy do Emila do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako niekompetentny w sprawach chorób płuc, dałem je do obejrzenia docentowi F.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla siebie odciął również spory kawałek, który pożarł na surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam mowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zabijają go na wiele sprytnych sposobów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wieczora obrazi się jeszcze dziesięć razy albo i więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też istota organiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawił po sobie wspomnienia jak najcieplejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skąd ten głos?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyna wstała, żeby dorobić herbaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaraz nie możesz mieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy mogę dowiedzieć się bliższych szczegółów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętam obawy z tym związane, ale i doświadczenie zebrane przy tworzeniu gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwa zemsta kochanki dosięgła mnie w samo serce…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pi, pi — pokaźna liczba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwała się z miejsca i nachyliła nad Cezarym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba ten niebieskooki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze skarbca królewskiego wypłacić mu sto tysięcy dukatów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brak silnych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oblicze stare, przeorane siecią fałd i zagłębień, jakby dwoiło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej duchy śmierci zemszczą się na wodzu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieka przed tym duszącym dymem, wciąż kichając.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle się od razu dowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje mi się, że szkoda mu było na to czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawały się zielonym i spadzistym znijściem do nieskończenie dalekich i na opak wybujałych przeciwświatów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeżywam całe tygodnie w ciągu kilku minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po kwadransie była wyleczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy zdawał się nie zwracać nań najmniejszej uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszajcie do boju! — zawołał — i nie powracajcie bez zwycięstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie widzę związku z naszą rozmową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziało mi wściekłe ujadanie czterech ogromnych psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tatarakiem go, widać, przegryzała… — domyślił się kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc czy ja mogę się o coś zapytać? — Możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukałem odpowiednich produktów oznaczonych etykietami, ale ich nie znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj zaczerwienili się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wymienione przeze mnie ruchy są więc fikcją?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na moim koniu po pocztę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła stamtąd na nas stęchlizna i zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie publiczne musi być organiczne lub mechaniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom publiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedne człowieczki mówią tak, drugie inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież oddzielają ściany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Kiedy?” „W niedzielę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamieniona w leśne echo, w wojska śpiew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łódź nasza bardzo ucierpiała — odrzekł Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może on… może on właśnie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak trzaskasz drzwiami?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróć się zaraz, to sama sprawdzę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto rozprysnęło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było mi gorąco jak cholera, ale koniec końców usnęłam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodzi mi o partie górne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, to dowód oczywisty! — zgodzili się jednomyślnie słuchacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pianista dlatego nie może grać, bo zdaje sobie sprawę, że może nie móc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Królu, proszę o turniej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil podszedł do Adama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdź ze mną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odgłosy te i szmery nie uszły uwagi zaczajonych nasłuchiwaczy niedomówień leśnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze ścian sączyła się strużkami woda i wsiąkała w grunt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad nią — „jechać”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Bartek coraz gwałtowniej, coraz silniej tęsknił za głosem ludzkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech mnie ten wóz wiezie, gdzie chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej ojciec miał tam sklep.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jej małej twarzyczce nikt by się nie spodziewał takiego spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimne światło poranka przebija się przez mgłę spowijającą miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła: — Niepotrzebnie mówisz, że mnie lubisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbował wszystkiego, co mu strzeliło do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sześćdziesiąt i cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W drzwiach stała Ela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał bladą twarz satyra ze spiczastymi uszami, i wąskie ceglaste usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuć im coś w łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dębowy… — szepnął porozumiewawczo do jednorękiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzeba wyrzeczenia się — tylko za tę cenę można pokonać to wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przychodzę tu jak człowiek do człowieka w chwili wyjątkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród zamieszania, które wywołała swym nietaktownym finałem, wymknęła się z domu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo ma trwać to spotkanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę głosić nowych zasad moralnych ani też obalać porządku społecznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z ciekawością bezosobową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech no by go spytał o paszport ten przechodzący patrol…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił, machając dłonią, kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt! — odrzekła jego małżonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O zgrozo, zamilkła na wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgromadzenie Ogólne proklamuje niniejszą Deklarację praw dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był pierwszy dzień przedwiośnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnajta — odpowiedział kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaskawie przyjął ich spojrzenia i wyprostował się uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę — odparł po chwili, podając mu cygaro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy tym codzienna praktyka wyrabia sprawność w tym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co dobre, szybko się kończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tu sama gospodyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś przed nami powinno majaczyć takie światełko, do którego zmierzamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego tu szukasz? — zapytałem ostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedł do łazienki i mył się zbyt długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc przeminęła, burza ukoiła się, woda odpłynęła powoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Na zwiady”, powiedział pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpoczęła — zaczerpnęła powietrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I powstałem z ławki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słuchasz mnie w ogóle?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O nie! — rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma nic wspólnego pomiędzy wolnymi ludami puszczy, a tą bandą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc to prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szereg komnat, które zmieniają się w cyrk podziemny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już nie mogę niczego zmyślać na jawie — rzekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś, daleko, na moczarach klekotał bocian…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jajko mądrzejsze od kury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty jesteś Narcyzem, ja też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał uczucie niesmaku, niemal wstrętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno nie jadłem czegoś tak smacznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech tylko jeden drugiemu wręcza ją ostrożnie, żeby nie uciekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby wiedzieć jaka kultura tutaj była, jaka gwara była.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc mi powiedz to słowo jedyne: czy kochasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzenie, że w Polsce rządzi burżuazja, nie jest prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w czarnoksiężników, w krasnoludki i wróżki wierzą tylko dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20629272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na leżaku i zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem gotów oddać je za życie Halszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, że nigdy nie orientowałem się w trasach linii lotniczych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprosił mnie do siebie jeszcze tegoż wieczora na „skromną kolację”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i pokój był przesycony zapachem kasztana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olaf Anderson odsunął zaporę u drzwi i otworzył je.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chęć snu bez wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa nie miała trzech duchowych ojców ani biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz powędrował powoli za nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na kogo idzie, to idzie, a trafi w sam carat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Otóż to właśnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wygodnie — jestem mały, jak wygodnie — tom duży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za myśli, co za koncepty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się spełnią przeznaczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam inne rzeczy: naukę, pisanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona musi być inna od innych lalek — mówiła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już drugi raz uderzyłem małym palcem o framugę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjść musisz po chleby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbuję zajść z jednej strony, z drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mów, czego żądasz, a wszystko damy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwałem przekupniowi potok pochwał na rzecz towaru i zapytałem o cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co myślisz o tym, aby Połę wziąć na kolację? Ojciec lubi ładne dziewczęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są, zdaje się, w jednym wie ku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chłopcami mało rozmawia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas najwyższy uporządkować papiery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ma pan rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W każdym razie coś pokrewnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli obok siebie, nie mówiąc wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka osób rzuciło się nawet w pogoń za zbiegłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do drzwi i wyjrzał na pole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” To wszystko leżało w niej, jak kłębek nici — splątane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś w ten deseń — uśmiechnął się zjadliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety o zbyt grubych nogach w kostce wyglądają na plaży całkiem dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego dobrze robi mężczyzna, gdy jej przypina odłamki świata do uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom publiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Stój pan — szepnął Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zatrzymuje się na stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem — odpowiedział pan i wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż i wpadliśmy w sedno sprawy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja widzę, że on będzie siedział do drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu spotkał Anię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe lalki nie zamykają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A wiesz, dlaczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I będziesz sam chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te osoby potrzebują rozmowy, nie wywiadu czy przesłuchania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był wypadek na Katowickiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziła namiętnie do kina i nazajutrz miewała takie stany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zestawienie: twórczość — perła, wywołuje mdłości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wie całe miasto, że Maciuś odzyskał przytomność, że jest nadzieja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mama niech nie udaje świętej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja myślę, że czterdzieści dwie — rozległ się cienki głosik spoza burty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie dobrzy! — jęknął przerażony Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło między nami milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda: nie lubiłem Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak pani przeczytała w mamusi oczach, że śpiąca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu nie miałam z kim pojechać kajakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypominał pilota, który dla marynarza jest wcieleniem tego, co zasługuje na najwyższe zaufanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc co jest w naczyniu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem, otoczony zewsząd ludźmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę koło niego, jak pies dookoła suki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubrana była w prostą suknię dorastającej smarkuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów powraca ta mała, nudna męka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był szybki, ale na pewno przemyślany i rozsądny wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś patetyczny, mój piękny małżonku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tamten jest trójdzielny — odpowiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze delegat podpisał w księdze więziennej pokwitowanie, że odebrał Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina była spokoju pełna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie łudź się, nie wezmą cię z sobą — rzekł Nowak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jest! — zawołał po czasie z triumfem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam na ciebie dość długo, siostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś dobra pogoda na połów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak ze wzrastającą dumą spojrzał na obydwu przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naczelnik ma dalekie, niebieskie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy krytyk jest postacią niezwykłą i odmienną od wszystkich śmiertelników?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwa zemsta kochanki dosięgła mnie w samo serce…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa będzie z koleżankami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta jej wyrzucały słowa ciemne dla mnie i niezrozumiałe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc łatwo się domyślić, dlaczego właśnie jego wybrano, żeby odprowadził Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pewien czas udawali, że nic nie czują.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko, co działo się dotąd, odbywało się jakby przed jakąś kurtyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed oczyma jadących zaczęły rozwijać się pierwsze akordy gór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie kupuj mu tyle zabawek, ma ich już dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A miałeś jakiś wybór?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, już nie kochałem siostry Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W postaci kolejarza zaszła w tej chwili zagadkowa metamorfoza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże nimfy umiały otumanić Fauna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiedziałem, że nie potrafisz! — rzekł Kowalski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo leżało takie kółeczko, od zegarka czy czego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego, co przyszedł z portu Churchill i którego wilki zagryzły?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten granitowy wykwit gruntu był zagadką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam do trzydziestego roku życia nie piłem prawie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zechce ze mną zatańczyć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł się i pocałował ją w usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po takim obiedzie chyba podziękuję za deser.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem Rembrandt celowo tak to namalował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotykam ją czasami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejka, panie łaskawy, wielka rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie znajdę jakieś fajne knajpki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad płonącym ogniem stała pochylona sylwetka jakiegoś mężczyzny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec był posiadaczem torby kusej i płytkiej, ale upchanej dostatnio i pękatej jak kobza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toruj drogę jako młodszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłby może zasnął, gdyby nie powtórne zjawienie się starego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dziesięć i pół, zaonanizowała na śmierć psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamieniona w leśne echo, w wojska śpiew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę sobie wyrobić nowy paszport.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał jeszcze chwilkę, ściskając nerwowo pałkę w dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja go słyszałem bardzo dawno, tak dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepadłem i ja i moja rodzina!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On je zapalił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co innego jest fikcja w powieści, a co innego rzeczywistość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie jak we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej barwy świąt udało nam się zachować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze ścian sączyła się strużkami woda i wsiąkała w grunt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nicości wszystko powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oszalałe w swej zawziętości pszczoły nie ominęły zbliżonej do nich lewicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego było za wiele.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu zmiana ról wytrąciła cię z równowagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy zawibrował telefon wszyscy zamilkli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas mi na Bródno, czas…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbyś spróbować naprawić mi komputer?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubiłem wygarnąć po nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolka robiła właśnie kluski na stolnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to znany, sławny nawet, śpioch czwartej dywizji ciężkiej artylerii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było też dużo rzeczy do jedzenia, jakbyśmy mieli przez tydzień nie wychodzić z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pół czaszki oddziela się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzyma się za tę cienką nić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja również będę mieć go na oku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec nieznacznie poprawił się na swym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienaturalne podniecenie wzrasta do południa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masaż jest relaksujący i zarazem leczniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem tego samego zdania! — zgodził się muł — Widocznie mamy wspólne upodobania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał w półmroku, bo bał się ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwienie odmalowało się na twarzy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu się bałaś? — Dlatego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest kierowca?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszę! — zawołał Krzysiek zarumieniony z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Drobnostka, kochany panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sam wiem, czy mam się modlić, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pytanie tylko, jakimi metodami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uściskał ich serdecznie i powrócili do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"autorka pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak dlaczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy przykład\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że ostatecznie jest to jeden ze sposobów na odwilż w istniejącej sytuacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę podziękować wszystkim szanownym posłom za ich wkład, szczególnie kontrsprawozdawcom za doskonałą współpracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym ponownie zapytać o naszą słynną elektrownię atomową w Ignalinie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogo staramy się chronić, nakładając ograniczone zobowiązania na sektor motoryzacyjny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewna, że Komisja wróci do tego tematu później\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z przyjemnością wysłuchuję tej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zostało wiele czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego chcemy torować drogę w innym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Projekt e-sprawiedliwości będzie służył obywatelom i wzmocni naszą demokrację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero wtedy nasze kraje będą wystarczająco mocne, aby oferować pracę także obcokrajowcom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości istnieje ryzyko, że organizacje pozarządowe nie będą w stanie wypełniać swoich misji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też ta kwestia istotnie wymaga bardzo starannej i drobiazgowej analizy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobieta ma więcej wrażliwości na cierpienie innych ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie postawy należy demaskować i zdecydowanie potępiać również na forum Parlamentu Europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zeszłym roku Komisja przedłożyła pierwsze sprawozdanie w sprawie wdrożenia ramowej dyrektywy wodnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odniosę się tylko do jednego z waszych czterech priorytetów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Struktura cenowa odzwierciedla powiązania między tymi cenami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Międzynarodowy kryzys żywnościowy miał dramatyczne konsekwencje dla milionów Afgańczyków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że jest nas tutaj tak mało przy takiej debacie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinna też usunąć uchybienia w planowaniu zatrudnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo przepraszam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieustanną próbą zniszczenia mego dobrego imienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma na co czekać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"obecnie naszym priorytetem jest zapewnienie pracy naszym obywatelom!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowa dyrektywa została przygotowana specjalnie na potrzeby zamówień publicznych w dziedzinach obronności i bezpieczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzi tu o ogólny interes wszystkich Europejczyków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rolnicy często zarzucają działalność z powodu zbyt niskich dochodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możliwe że to, czego należy unikać, jest równie ważne jak to, co należy robić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z białymi się teraz wcale nie widuję, bo jest wielka wojna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polska podejmuje takie kroki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla nas, Włochów, budzi to wspomnienie powszechnie znanego włoskiego przypadku Cassa del Mezzogiorno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W systemie demokratycznym partie stanowią wyraz pluralizmu i są podstawowymi instrumentami politycznego uczestnictwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rosja, pod hasłem walki z terroryzmem, wymordowała już ponad połowę narodu czeczeńskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że powinniśmy się przygotować na powojenny porządek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rządy nie sprawdzają się jeśli chodzi o przyjmowanie uchodźców i opiekę nad nimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skutkiem czego dotknięte nią kobiety mają ograniczoną możliwość uczestniczenia w życiu społecznym i zawodowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy to chwalić i zachęcać do dalszego pogłębiania współpracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.836,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błąd!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"na piśmie - Umowa nie jest idealna, ale faktycznie oznacza ważne postępy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to pierwsze zadanie nowej Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy również skonsultować z ekspertami instrumenty prewencyjne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynym rozwiązaniem jest jego odrzucenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kryteria jakościowe przyznawania kredytów emisji w ramach mechanizmu czystego rozwoju zostaną obostrzone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie trzeba dodawać, że w procesie kontrolowania możemy uwzględnić to, co należy uwzględnić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wyrazem solidarności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele razy udało nam się uniknąć kryzysów żywnościowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemożliwe jest udzielenie głosu większej liczbie posłów niż ci, którzy mieli już tę możliwość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie ukazuje również, że wśród zatrudnionych jest wiele osób ubogich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym coś wyjaśnić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ufam, że nic podobnego nigdy nie zdarzy się w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, rzecz jasna, współzależność o wielu aspektach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dla mocy Bożej nie ma dalekości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem królowę angielską.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, że przyniesie to korzyści obu stronom, jak również całej wspólnocie międzynarodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję również sprawozdawcom za wykonaną pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego należy koniecznie zaprzestać wszelkich interwencji ze strony krajów sąsiadujących i innych państw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Występują naciski na obniżkę cen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serbii Południowej od tamtej pory ulega poprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec, jeżeli chodzi o tabele korelacji, Komisja popiera stanowisko Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasza społeczna gospodarka rynkowa musi mieć pewne stałe punkty, tak aby wykorzystywać przyszłe możliwości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mowa tu o bezbronnych i często porzuconych dzieciach, które czasami tracimy z oczu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mówimy o małym czy wyizolowanym zjawisku, ale o migracjach narodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musielibyśmy również zadać pytanie na temat korzyści płynących z takiego podejścia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma zatem żadnej gwarancji, że płatność zostanie dokonana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewniłaby ona także pewien poziom bezpieczeństwa producentom w kategoriach stosowanych kryteriów rozdziału\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pomoc ta wspiera trwały rozwój na Haiti?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma to poważne uzasadnienie, gdyż ułatwi jego resocjalizację po wyjściu z więzienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właśnie pytanie nas wszystkich nurtuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemożliwe jest reagowanie na nowe zobowiązania wynikające z traktatów, jeśli budżet jest zasadniczo zamrożony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wystarcza nie podpisywać umów o łowiskach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jego działania wskrzesiły wewnętrzny konflikt etniczny, lawinę, którą może być trudno zatrzymać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artyści i dzieła, które tworzą, definiują naszą jakość życia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co stało się dziś podczas głosowania na sesji plenarnej jest godne ubolewania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, chciałbym zwrócić Państwa uwagę na parlamenty narodowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zadowoleniem witam jednak niedawną odwilż we wzajemnych stosunkach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można jednak pozwolić, by koncepcja elastyczności zagrażała zdrowiu i bezpieczeństwu pracowników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A przecież czas to jedyne, czego nam brakuje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby osiągnąć wyznaczony cel, musimy podjąć dużo więcej działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego zagłosowałam za przyjęciem przedmiotowego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcemy natomiast, aby pracownicy sami o tym decydowali\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli chcemy zmienić zasadę, nie ma problemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wprowadzenia inicjatywy obywatelskiej na szczeblu Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, technologie te nie są powszechnie stosowane w pojazdach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje jasne powiązanie pomiędzy tym sprawozdaniem a pakietem telekomunikacyjnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął mnie pod rękę i prowadzi przez tylne drzwi sklepu do sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczekuję, że zostanie dokonana poniższa ocena\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugim wyzwaniem jest walka z ubóstwem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak wciąż raz za razem występują problemy, szczególnie w rejonach przygranicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze, iż Parlament Europejski analizuje kwestie lobbingu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezpieczeństwo energetyczne jest z pewnością jednym z kluczowych aspektów tej strategii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Absolutnie zgadzam się z każdym działaniem prowadzonym w celu zwalczania nadużyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jak im to uświadomić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Macie odpowiednie środki, by badać tę sprawę, działać i egzekwować prawo - wykorzystajcie je\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieją jednak polityczne rozwiązania w kwestii tych kryzysów, ale te wymagają zmiany polityki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy zatem w racjonalny sposób wykorzystać Fundusz Spójności dla wspierania rozbudowy infrastruktury zwłaszcza transportowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, Europejczycy, musimy pomóc w umacnianiu demokracji i praw człowieka na rzecz narodu tybetańskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście możemy mówić o praktykach dzikiego zachodu dominujących rynki finansowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fidel Castro i jego oligarchowie zdradzili ideały kubańskiej rewolucji już dawno temu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochrona delikatnych ekosystemów jest skomplikowana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie przewodniczący i panie urzędujący przewodniczący\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał rację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem znaczenie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To powoduje zachwianie równowagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można tego niestety powiedzieć o sprawozdaniu sporządzonym przez Parlament\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno z naszych pytań także się na tym skupia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropne nieszczęścia zwaliły się na biedną moję głowę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piractwo staje się ogólnoświatowym zagrożeniem dla żeglugi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak można dyskutować na temat współpracy transgranicznej, gdy nie to stanowi problem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę zatem zarejestrować mój głos \\\"za\\\" we wszystkich głosowaniach i poprosić technika?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu roku dostrzeżemy faktyczne wyniki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę krótko skomentować elementy, które wychwyciłam we wcześniejszych wystąpieniach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walczymy razem z obywatelami Europy o pokój i sprawiedliwość społeczną oraz przeciwko związkom imperialistycznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogłoszę podjęcie przez nas środków mających na celu obniżenie poziomu hałasu w transporcie kolejowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak z ciekawości, dlaczego zawsze siada Pani obok Rady?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejmy nadzieję, że nie zostanie on zakłócony przez wulkan ani cokolwiek czy kogokolwiek innego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stało się więc jasne, że musimy coś z tym zrobić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pełni szanuję wynik irlandzkiego referendum\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem również, że musimy wzmocnić nasze wsparcie dla społeczeństwa obywatelskiego i dla kontaktów międzyludzkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym sądzę, że Rada przyjmie swoje poprawki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy będziemy mieć te przepisy w dziedzinie nielegalnego wyrębu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja i Rada\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprzedni mówca wspomniał już o jednej sprawie dotyczącej Kosowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogodniejsze niebo jaśniało nad okolicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naiwnością byłoby wierzyć, że możemy robić, co chcemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38655624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielu ludzi też tak myślało\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38662108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda jest taka, że kobiety nie mogą robić wszystkiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38662109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chee Soon Juan nie jest zbrodniarzem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38662110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam wrażenie, że opinie obywateli Europy coraz bardziej rozchodzą się z opiniami elit politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38662111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym, aby w niektórych dziedzinach całego projektu osiągnięto większy postęp\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38662112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego potrzebuje przedsiębiorstwo aby stworzyć kartel?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38662240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym zagłosowałem za odrzuceniem tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38662241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koncepcja dotycząca e-sprawiedliwości stwarza takie możliwości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38662242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Państwowe fundusze majątkowe działają u nas już od dłuższego czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38662243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"właśnie uruchomiliśmy Euronest kilka dni temu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_38662244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta sytuacja jest nie do przyjęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże to nagłe zamyślenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś idzie do kancelarii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem w swoim kącie i lekcje odrabiam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najgroźniejszym jest strach przed czymś nieuchwytnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiesz mię, jeden z drugim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi ale nie mogę ci w tym pomóc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jedyny dla ciebie ratunek — powtórzył z naciskiem — Jedyny, powtarzam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja bym chciał, żeby wszyscy pamiętali…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara zaśmiała się przyjaźnie i położyła rękę na jej ramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie używałabym takiego określenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On przemawiał do siebie: — Emil, uspokój się, głaskam cię po włosach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadeszła ciemność bezwładu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa, patrząc na pantofle, zupełnie serio: — Zobaczysz, one się jeszcze zrobią ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty się mylisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I że mógł siedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak szczebiotała, a ja z niepojętym zachwytem spoglądałem na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawał na przystankach tramwajowych i pomagał wychodzić panom z siwymi brodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może bylibyśmy szczęśliwsi — kto wie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wilka się nie nadaję, nie ten charakter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo włada szczęściem wszystkich, nędzą się rozczula.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzę więc w kącie na łóżku, jak osaczony kot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem w klasie, gdzie są okna, wiedziałem, że tylko do dzwonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież takie były miękkie, jedwabiste, taki miały żywy połysk!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszno! — pochwyciła pośpiesznie dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Woda jaśniała spokojnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chyba jakieś nowe stanowisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi, syn krawca — dziewięcioro małych dzieci — bieda wielka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to było dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chodzi o to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo kaptur i czepiec to prawie to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Malutka jest, paluszki ma malutkie i tak strasznie mało rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja zawsze tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomnij no sobie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamten nie zwracał na to żadnej uwagi, zatopiony w obserwacji krajobrazu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On: — Co „nigdy więcej”? Tego nie zobaczysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nie przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy znalazł się u siebie, położył się natychmiast na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja myślę — potra fisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabić go, czy co? Spytam małego k.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz więcej gorąca napływało mu do twarzy i zasłaniało oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rutyna, panie inspektorze, rutyna zawodowca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był sam; nikt nie przerywał sennego dumania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na razie nie widzę żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy jeszcze można bez wysiłku zawrócić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy byś został, gdybym… gdybym zrobiła się lepsza?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, kobiety, jakie wy głupie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ona jest tu zawsze, w dokładnie określonym miejscu, w dołku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nareszcie pozostawi nas w spokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temperamenty: spala się w każdym zdaniu, napisanym czy wypowiedzianym, i odradza się w następnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosłem się z sofy i zbliżyłem ku niemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zależą? Tyle możliwych żywotów, tyle różnorodnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednym kącie siedziała grupa znajomych, rozprawiających głośno, z ożywieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu pożegnali się, umówiła się z nim na jutro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął ją pod rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czym bardziej jestem w skórze innych, tym wyżej wznosi się moje „ja”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnie mnie będą jeszcze prześladować, ale mój naczelnik mnie obroni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie chcesz, żeby Sara była twoją mamusią?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może weź parę dni urlopu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz tamten jakby nie słysząc naciskał już sprężynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłuchał pokorny jak baranek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak powinien wyglądać świat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że jestem cholerykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona się denerwuje widać, w sposób specyficzny, i zamknęła oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko oglądał na nowo, jakby dawno nie widziane, jakby na nowo odkrył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nas nosi w sobie ziarno zła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj twórcy odebrali nagrody z rąk prezydenta miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po mału pokochał swoją lubieżność, włożoną w Klarę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A czego ty chcesz? — Ja nie wiem, mnie się nudzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem mieć wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może autor uznał, że nie ma potrzeby zagłębiać się w temat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunął ją miękko, aby rozciągnąć tę chwilę jak gumę i głaskał ustami własne ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie trzymacie mopa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza że tak długo mówił Emilowi prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem ludzie siedzieli przed bramami domów, a pary leżały nad rzeką, na wyłysiałych łączkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczuwał niezrozumiały niepokój i wiedział, że jutro albo pojutrze zrozumie go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknął oczy ze wstydu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym coraz częstsze były szantaże kolorowych ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz poczekaj tu na mnie chwilkę, drogi przyjacielu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na nowo się odnajdywali — matka i syn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jak już tam wejdziesz, to wychodzisz spłukany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Załatwiłam bez pana wiedzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc aż cały miesiąc leżałem w malignie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie ulega wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę stąd iść — powiedziała Ewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudził mnie śpiew ptaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona z radosnym i dzikim krzykiem uchodziła w głąb lasu — wolna, wyśmiewna, niedościgła…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie tak, jak ze snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie plotkować na całą szkołę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nauczycieli musiał dla bezpieczeństwa budynku mieszkać w pobliżu szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona napisała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, przestrzegałem cię… ja z krwi twojej i kości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu on był jak przyrząd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta ze wszystkich praw w niniejszej Deklaracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha! — rzekła Marta z radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nim ją zabiorą, to Ewa ma za swoje jaki miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszycie, jak wołają „hura” w pracowniach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem wielkim przeciwnikiem rozwydrzenia sportowego, które się w ostatnich latach rozwinęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie nie pożywię się przy nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zaraz, zaraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam się potem dziwisz i wstydzisz, i żałujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, zamiast tych głupich żartów, przyślijcie mi ją tutaj na noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym tle nastąpił ogromny rozwój rękodzieła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachmurzyła się dumnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę nawet dużo pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zaspokoiła ona mej ciekawości — owszem, podnieciła ją tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerwał i oczyma wzniesionymi ku sklepieniu śledził ruch dymów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie chciał wierzyć, ale uwierzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko niech mnie pan na tej stacji nie pozdrawia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ćwicz dalej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyloty rynien — potwory z otwartymi paszczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykładam mu dziesięć razy dziennie, jak się ma zachowywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z jej życia zaczy nało rozwijać się dzieło sztuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi w ogóle żadnej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta zamknął oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz pendrive'a, którego ci dałem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu to nie było ważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja mówię o czymś zupełnie innym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo bym pragnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród funkcjonariuszy stacyjnych podobno nastrój dla władz nader nieprzychylny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaleca się udzielanie pomocy finansowej, państwowej lub innej, wielodzietnym rodzinom na utrzymanie dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzałem przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedział, że drzwi nie będą zamknięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy mieć grube nieprzyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A nawet skończona z pointą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ci zależało na tych studiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A pamiątki szanują nie tylko królowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięta doskonale: kiedyś przeziębił się — przyszło zapalenie płuc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na początek muszę zadać pytanie - skąd się pani o mnie dowiedziała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to są wszystko dzieciństwa, najdroższa — uspokajałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj jem na kolację sałatkę jarzynową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już się gdzieś podziała jego liberia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ściętych białkach zagrało poranne słońce okrutnym uśmiechem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, ale on mieszka tam z jedną panienką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkim krokiem pośpieszyła do pokoju męża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno, spróbuję jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie niemal i ja straciłem resztki świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła? — spytał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za wykończenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A teraz poślij no kogo, by mi kupił materiału na turban.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, musiało być ludziom wtedy gorąco!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku próbował sobie przypomnieć, jak wygląda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieco chorobliwie dokładne mycie genitaliów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdarzenie, które miało miejsce rok temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbiór przedstawiał wartość paru miliardów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawahała się, zakołysała na miejscu, nie mogąc iść dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak to nie wie pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stołu nie było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do gardła można mu zajrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jesteś? Przecież masz ładne włosy, zwłaszcza gdy je rozrzuca wiatr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie ma porównania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce jego wpiły się w moje ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ja będę udawała, że ty nie płaczesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przystani onej nie masz rekina…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość dużo czytałem w tej materii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możecie nas tu zamknąć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie jesteś głodna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedne duże, że dwóch może się wozić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest miasto kręcące się, beikocące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymać: godzinę, dwie, choćby trzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała otwory w tej walizce, żeby się nie udusiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otępienie urwało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na twarzy jej zjawił się wyraz przestrachu i rozczarowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty nie jesteś moją matką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawcie się dobrze, pantoflarze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tego nie mogą powiedzieć niektóre tzw. „filary”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedaleko od Cytadeli do Muranowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma dymu bez ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ważne jest by często nawadniać organizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłeś wyjść na przerwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śnieg padał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to baw się dalej, baw się pojęciami, jak kulkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję ci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli przerzuca swoją przeszłość, swoje rozmowy z dziećmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ciągle się myj i myj! — krzyczy ze złością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem o tym i wierzę ci na słowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz poszedł do pokoju, ale zostawił otworem drzwi do sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy inwestować więcej w szkolnictwo i edukację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jaru, ludzie dobrzy, do jaru! — zawołał z zapałem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka ciągłe jadła tyłek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem jednakże, czy mógł czytać dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostrożnie podszedł pod okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak usunął jego dłoń natrętną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil powiedział do Janka: — Chodźmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko są uczonymi albo wielkimi artystami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rzeczywiście — przyznał towarzysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tymczasem wiedzą już królowie, dokąd zajechał samochód z Maciusiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Umiem obchodzić się z bronią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby było inaczej, nie okazałby pan tej chwalebnej przezorności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz, teraz, wszystko to wydawało mi się dzieciństwem i marnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A my, niestety, nie możemy czuwać nad nim w owych chwilach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie tak, jak ze snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała historia zaczęła się niewinnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem o tym i nie do was mówię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytaj moje przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza zawisła między wodą a niebem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprawdzie nie tak intensywnie, jak ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podbiegał do tego, kogo się bał, aby już szybko był z tym koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Filologia na usługach astronomii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mówi pan do mnie rzeczy tak dziwne i tak mnie obchodzące…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby dziecko mniej czuło, miało inną skórę niż oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem w towarzystwie czterech równie zachwyconych tą sytuacją osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To już mój trzeci grill z rzędu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem i mam nadzieję, że medytacja coś pomoże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedź pan — powiedział, ale sanitariusz nie odjeżdżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłącz światło w dużym pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetnie, a nade wszystko zgrabnie siedziała na koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tej reguły nie warto już opisywać, tak jest znana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę poznać się, wiedzieć z góry jakie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich kucharka Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden plus, że można z nim iść do kawiarni i pogadać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta jeźdźców rozproszyła się w różne strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda i pożytek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pojedziemy dalej gondolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że mam to dobrze, proszę bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przespałeś bez mała całą dobę, młody smyku — brzmiało powitanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawym tylko, co wiadomo — spytał kulawiec i splunął w stronę jednorękiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt wszakże nie słuchał już jego rady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nazywali tego przyjaźnią, nie nazywali tego wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem poczuł, że coś się niedostrzegalnie zmieniło w nim albo poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo w usta, albo tak cię przyciśnie, że żebra bolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponowne wizje miniaturowych twarzyczek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba, że tego nie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu powiedziałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dominującą religią w Polsce jest katolicyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łaskawa pani czegoś się przelękła, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydał cichy syk, ujął jej dłoń, pociągnął ją w dół i upadła na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właśnie chcę ci wstydu narobić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mimo wszystko zrobiłabyś tak, jakbyś chciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz dopiero przekonał się, że początkowo szli oboje w złym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżała nad rzeką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapewne jedziecie zwiedzić skarbiec królewski? — zapytała nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety stosunki meksykańskie utrudniają bardzo dostanie prawdziwego preparatu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjący i umarły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I kolega Adama, Stach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mu się wyśmiewać z ciebie, a sam pójdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nikotyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym się tam znalazł, postać jakaś nadbiegła od strony przeciwnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pomieszczeniu rozległ się lekki pomruk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem i mechanicznie obracałem w palcach jakiś przedmiot leżący na stole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Burza toczy się nad nami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyżarła — wyznał z westchnieniem jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno było pewne: jeżeli nie złapią Maciusia, już się nie uspokoi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grosz do grosza, a będzie kokosza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chodźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Istnieje przepaść pomiędzy ich życiem a tym, co wiedzą o życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jesteś patetyczny, mój piękny małżonku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jednym jego policzku zjawił się wypiek nierówny i smużysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem Emil zeszedł bardzo blady i uśmiechnął się: — Moja mama umarła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie odczuwam na razie żadnego strachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego dnia nie wytrzyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cynamonki w Kofikadzie to prawdziwy hit, zapraszam na nie wszystkich znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały świat się zbroi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy trochę zaczekać, aż któraś podpłynie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego piekła ręka i był zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszło pół roty wojska, otoczyło dwór i zabudowania i zrewidowano wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec w twarz mu wprawnie, jak koniowi w zęby, zajrzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzec można, iż zanieistnieli w sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pompuje się wodę, robi się studnie podziemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłodno tu jakoś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może wytrzyma wicher trującego jadu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie miała zapewne nic do powiedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzyły nań wary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam różne dziewczęta, ale nie spotykam ich prawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, nie znał słów pieśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I potem dziesiątki wejść i wyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz to nowe fale ciemności opadały na nich, jak czarny śnieg; wolno prószyła ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale żeby ośmielić się nocą wchodzić do mego domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zejdę jeszcze na dół, mam kilka rzeczy do zrobienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wie Maciuś, dokąd idzie, co niesie w koszyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrasta ze mnie powoli, jak roślina, żywię go, napycham go sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyłem na jego ruchy osłupiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Moje sumienie nic mi nie wyrzuca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktuję cię jak dziewczynkę, bo nią trochę jesteś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pod dotknięciem różdżki czarodziejskiej przeistoczyła się jej postać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biednemu zawsze wiatr w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola musiała nim potrząsać, zanim oprzytomniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęły się nad nimi zbierać czarne chmury.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wyobrażam sobie tego inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, ta to się będzie złościć, jak mnie zobaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkanie Pawła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zupełnie nierzeczywista.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powiem, bo nie chcę, żeby mieli przykrości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja twojego starego bardzo lubię, i to jest w swoim rodzaju morowy typ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20603702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Troje zaczerwienili się z całkiem różnych powodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jednak nawet za królestwo niebieskie nie oddałbym jednej chwili pełnej świadomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz jednak siedział nieruchomo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda w Krakowie jest dzisiaj całkiem ładna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chciałbym z tobą trochę pogawędzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łakomym ruchem zgarnął leżące pieniądze i prędko wsunął do kieszeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo ładnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ileś pisał, Hannibalu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeżywam całe tygodnie w ciągu kilku minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt drogo to można okupić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec torbę swoją poklepał pieszczotliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okej, jaka jest pogoda dzisiaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszony, z opuszczoną nisko głową wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powłóczy się, wygłodzi — i wraca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże mu było na imię? — spytał ciekawie jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże „grupa pięciu” przycichła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi mały ołtarzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ala zrobiła sarenkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem, że ojciec mój okazuje zawsze ogromny szacunek urzędnikom sądowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali je w domu i przynosili na spotkania, pisali je nawet czasem na spotkaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę! — odparła dość krzykliwie dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Główna stacja jest koło pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolę zadać standardowe pytania, a potem po prostu słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem czy lepszy jest żel czy pianka do golenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie, jak gdyby jakiś czarodziej wdawał się w tę sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zero szacunku dla wykształconego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawiązała sobie na ręku niebieską tasiemkę dla pamięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie mogą liczyć na pewną dyskrecję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaskawy pan kpi sobie ze mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest miasto kręcące się, beikocące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te jej dziwne cechy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To jest granica powiatu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał szeroko otwarte oczy i usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywarłem ustami do jej ręki na długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go przykre uczucie osamotnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O parę kroków przed nami zalśniła brylantowymi blaskami laguna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze mu się działo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak zamilkł i palcem potarł sęk nad prawym okiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oczywiście, prawda co do joty — potakiwał Ole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech tylko jeden drugiemu wręcza ją ostrożnie, żeby nie uciekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale przynajmniej ta pociecha, że nie spotkałam się z diabłami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widna noc, rozjaśniona świeżo spadłym śniegiem, ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle był uczciwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noel przerwał kłopotliwe milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo na pewno mi go wziąć nie pozwolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich tam, zdaje się, mieszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znam mechanizm ten dokładnie na sobie samym — oczywiście w miniaturze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam, żeby pisać i opracować w formie pisemnej relacje tych osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była Ela, o jasnych włosach i oczach, w piżamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem posłyszałem za sobą szmer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dokąd płyniemy? — rzuciłem odruchowo pytanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to się często zdarza?…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę marnie zdechnąć w mej ciemnej norze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc ja na nowo się urodziłam, na nowo życie rozpoczynam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy przewidziane są zniżki dla studentów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem, pisałem, robiłem różne rzeczy, ale ciężaru z serca zrzucić nie mogłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nią nie jest — wie prawie zawsze, co by ją mogło uczynić szczęśliwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nigdy nie wiadomo, co jest potrzebne, a co zbyteczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temperamenty: spala się w każdym zdaniu, napisanym czy wypowiedzianym, i odradza się w następnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo przytrzaśniesz komuś palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem! — rzekł z zachwytem, czując, że otucha wstępuje mu do duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, więc nie będę się wypowiadać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza zawisła między wodą a niebem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudził się i spojrzał przytomnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym dojść do tego, by móc sobie pozwolić tym zakończyć koncert.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, musiało być ludziom wtedy gorąco!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak widzicie, trzyma się ściśle prawdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno tu ma się coś takiego robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie szkodzi, zaraz je uspokoję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz niedługo trwały chwile ukojenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różowe koła ze światła i krwi toczyły się jak baletnice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Akurat musiał mi stanąć na drodze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrodziła się ciekawość poznania, z kim się właściwie miało do czynienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje słuchawki przestały działać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały świat się zbroi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały film swoją scenerią idealnie wpisuje się w nurt ekspresjonistyczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy raz jestem na żaglówce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem głową o ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uważaj pan na przeciąg — powtórzył uparcie — można czasem kark skręcić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym wiedziała, nie lękałabym się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam cię, ale koperta jest zaklejona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzę, kto weselszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech i kaszel są w pierwszych dniach wykluczone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było też dużo rzeczy do jedzenia, jakbyśmy mieli przez tydzień nie wychodzić z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuściła włosy gwałtownie, tak że zakryły jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż ja teraz zrobię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obojętne, czy mówi do jednego słuchacza, czy do stu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunęła się stała przy nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kanapa, jeśli nie skakać, przetrwa dziesiątki lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W treści Fauna była północ dusz greckich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, młynarz przeżył bez wątpienia bardzo ciężki okres.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mimo wszystko zrobiłabyś tak, jakbyś chciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie — syknął niechętnie pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz Andrzej nie dowierzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyła nauczycielka, ale myśli, że się przyzwyczają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócił do pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z sonatą B-mol męczę się potwornie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc padał śnieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie bywają nasze noce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie stało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daremny trud, drzwi są szczelnie zasłonięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiesz, co mówię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, nie, mnie to dobrze robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to baw się dalej, baw się pojęciami, jak kulkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak myślicie, czy on mnie pamięta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil jest jak dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z jakiego to przytułku wypuszczono tego jegomościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajrzałem przez wybitą szybę w głąb trzeciej izby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na leśnej, na polanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno było pewne: jeżeli nie złapią Maciusia, już się nie uspokoi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odnajdywała go wszędzie i ciągle, ze zwierzęcą, jasno widzącą pewnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszył ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może o dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdarzenie, które miało miejsce rok temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest śmierć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiedz mi, jakimi środkami osiągacie takie cuda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba, że tego nie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedł do łazienki i mył się zbyt długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, ta to się będzie złościć, jak mnie zobaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty mniej, niż Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże to nagłe zamyślenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On: — Co „nigdy więcej”? Tego nie zobaczysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam wczoraj kilka bułek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Czy widzisz te krowy tam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem pociąg ruszył w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo to licho przecież nie je, nie pije, tylko wyśmiewaniem żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedzą o tym ci, którzy zaczęli go choćby z lekka nadużywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, do jutra!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są stłoczone i nie mają tla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby było inaczej, nie okazałby pan tej chwalebnej przezorności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli będę mógł, to ja się też będę starał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdobyłam tu rzecz stokroć cenniejszą dla mnie od złota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wycofujące się niemieckie oddziały prawdopodobnie planowały podpalenie budynku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jest tam co kupić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem nim też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te rozmowy, urwane w środku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosłem się i wyciągnąłem rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziane z bliska, zakrywały połowę mostu kolejowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór niespokojnie wzdrygnął się na trawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz: gdzie powiesiłeś, tam wisi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy jestem bardzo zdenerwowana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może w ogóle mnie nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jednoręki zapewne w imieniu ślepca pięścią pogroził wszystkim rzeczonym przechodniom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pauzie bawiono się w zabawę, podczas której kawalerowie wybierali sobie damy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Henek stoi w korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po paru dniach rana zagoiła się, nie pozostawiając śladu blizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj lat sześćdziesiąt — jutro dwadzieścia, nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepyszna broń! — pochwalił ze szczerym uznaniem rywal, biorąc pistolet do ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki i kulawiec ze czcią na ów sęk teraz spojrzeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczynił jeszcze jedną próbę, która, wiedział o tym, mogła tylko zaszkodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia ołówkową spódnicę i zaczesuje ciemne włosy za ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zuchwała wariatka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za złudzenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama leżała wciąż w głębokim uśpieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy chyba raz w życiu odważyła się ostrzej odpowiedzieć ojcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to mi się podoba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem, otoczony zewsząd ludźmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach… widzę obłok… sunie ku księżycowi….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie bójcie się śmierci!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem na nią z wdzięcznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczynać wszystko sprawiedliwie, z Boga i z siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może przypomniały jej się lata miłości i szczęścia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z góry obiecuję spełnić wszystko co do joty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie zamierzałam tego powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewielu chyba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko schowało głowę w ramionach osłupiałego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobieństwo często jest nieintuicyjne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I kulawiec zaśmiał się ochryple stłumionym śmiechem, który podkreślił udatność i pożywność smakowitego zdarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toń wodna migotała spoza nich, jak spoza sztachet chwiejnych i nieustalonych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się jest czynnością rytualną, prastarą, jak miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby być zdrowym powinieneś jeść więcej owoców i warzyw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie żal go wam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja jestem sentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie inne maszynki, które wypróbowałem, są wobec niego niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pana dane będą przetwarzane w celu realizacji wybranych usług cyfrowych dostępnych w serwisie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nic nie poradzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siadał pomału, gdy nagle odczuł nienawiść wobec poko jówki Józi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pamiątkę — potwierdziła dziwożona, spuszczając oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Damian zauważył, że biegnie sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu właśnie tkwi istota symbolu i jedna z zasadniczych zagadek bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiany zaszły również na nowej części cmentarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pszczoły nie chcą mieszkać koło domu, gdzie panuje nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyjmij ode mnie sześć pensów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Co robi twój papa? - zapytał, bo lubił go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdjął strzelbę z ramienia i podał jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym celu należy zapewnić szczególną ochronę zarówno dziecku, jak i matce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę łokieć z przyczepioną tarczą herbową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20636013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pierwszy tydzień zapisywał Maciuś, ile dni jest w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie wybrał się na polowanie, pozostawiając swym więźniom żywność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dziwne: muszka mogła fruwać, a człowiek nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jej małej twarzyczce nikt by się nie spodziewał takiego spojrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic innego nie zdążył powiedzieć na odlotnem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiększenie jest olbrzymie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głowie huczało mi nieznośnie, gardło ściskały niewidzialne kleszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bona zaprowadziła go do łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli i ławka była jeszcze ciepła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę teraz sobie o tym myślał, dopóki nie wrócisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajomy jest wiatr, woń zgniłych ryb, wodorostów i muszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mrówka myśli, że to wysoka góra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w stadium jednej ze swych słynnych „ucieczek”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała ranę w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiło na mnie wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytaliśmy o redaktora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noel przerwał kłopotliwe milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie odbiegajmy od tematu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil był tak mały, że poręcz fotela sięgała dużo wyżej niż jego głowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z dalszych wizji przypominam sobie niewyraźnie jakiś jakby rajski ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym wstąpiłem do różnych politycznych i społecznych zrzeszeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma nikogo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdował tylko swoje ręce i swoje nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szkołach powinni uczyć o podatkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie ma porównania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy trochę zaczekać, aż któraś podpłynie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chciał pozwolić mówić na siebie „ty”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co roku tu jestem i zawsze mi mało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"już niech będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pa Janek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto przechodziło z rąk do rąk przez wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogień natychmiast zaczął szybko posuwać się wzdłuż kanału pomiędzy klocami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widział jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całował ją długo, podczas gdy ona patrzyła na niego uważnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ok, włączam to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę cię — dodałem łagodniej — nie mówmy teraz o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spaceruję po lesie, z duszą na ramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I on niewiele więcej wie o tobie, aniżeli ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A potem psa i krowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Karolina uroczyście przysięgła podnosząc dwa palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana; wziąłem rzecz zbyt osobiście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę być inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to niepojęty cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmieniłaś opony w samochodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20649960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zero szacunku dla wykształconego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rwały naprzód konie, lekko bujała się kareta na gumowych obręczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytyczne mówiły, że raz ogłoszone pogotowie bojowe nie powinno być odwołane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem bardzo zmęczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykułem wszystkie pytania na blachę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba to schować i odprowadzić bawoły! — powiedział — Pomóżcie mi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porzuciłem uniwersytet i zacząłem rozglądać się za płatną posadą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdźmy z naszym problemem pomiędzy lud prymitywny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zbyt nieśmiała, aby nie pojechać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Damy sobie radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, jakby ich w ogóle nie słyszała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co pan powie o tej mogile?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent z objawami grypy trafił dzisiaj do naszej przychodni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I może zabrzmi to pompatycznie, ale stwierdziłem, że chcę podjąć się wyzwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak głęboko weszła w swój trans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie są bardzo sceptyczni na ten temat i poniekąd mają rację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oficer stał na ulicy i wymyślał komuś ostatnimi słowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temu człowiekowi została tylko Biblia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20655492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cel uświęca środki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gotowi są wasi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to coś ważnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy dni się szykowali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oni wkrótce zaczną nas szukać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak schodzi mi noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo krótka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Usiądźmy tam na ławce w alei cyprysów — zaproponowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu zostaje tylko jedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz tak, aby nie zauważył tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rozmowach z Cezarym wskazywał palcem na kilka „cudów”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko ani słowa, rozumiesz, bo tajemnica służbowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejka, panie łaskawy, wielka rzecz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na razie jednak musiałem czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę nawet dużo pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimy w Polsce są trudne dla obywateli gdyż jest ciemno i zimno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc może z uduszenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukałem odpowiednich produktów oznaczonych etykietami, ale ich nie znalazłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież powiedziałeś, że nie chcesz tam iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak trzeba, tak być powinno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie oglądam telewizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprzytomny jak bela….\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten uścisk symbolizował o wiele więcej niż tylko wzajemną ochronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w obecnej chwili był w stanie jakby zbliżonym do transu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zboczu góry, wrzeźbiony w skałę, stał pensjonat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- A czy ktoś jeszcze wiem o tym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej jest przestać palić od samego rana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Panie! — protestował inspektor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mocno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz wszystko ma swój koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo jednak nie wracał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On nie robił z tego tajem nicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może by spróbować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięcie w sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to ja mu to muszę powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nie płakał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była ciemna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocaliłeś mi życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20661256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz smutek ten „nie do mnie należał”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35819490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspólnota międzynarodowa w niewielkim stopniu wzięła to pod uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35819525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteście lokomotywą świata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35819600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to wciąż zmarnowana regulacja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35819643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc to, pani baronesso, spoglądam w pani kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35819716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważamy, że ważne jest stworzenie całościowego prawodawstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35820417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekam na państwa propozycje i zalecenia w tej konkretnej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35820477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadawanie takich pytań jest dopuszczalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35820483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani przewodnicząca, panie i panowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35820613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt o tym nie wie lepiej niż Polska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35820633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym się skupić na jednej szczegółowej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35820773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szali jest zbyt wiele pieniędzy i miejsc pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35820790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko powraca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35820875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaproponowano wprowadzenie następujących zmian\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35820886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inicjatywy te trzeba niezwłocznie wdrożyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35820891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każde posiedzenie Rady Europejskiej jest inne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35821508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zadać panu komisarzowi pytanie dodatkowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35823439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam nic przeciwko ekologicznym zamówieniom, jeżeli ma to sens\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczymy, że Komisja Europejska to zrobi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"te dwa cele nie wykluczają się wzajemnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W najbliższej przyszłości musi stać się to zasadą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umożliwi to podejmowanie decyzji socjalnych przy dokonywaniu zakupów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komitologia to jeden z kluczowych środków zarządzania tym procesem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy także otrzymać bardziej profesjonalny plan kampanii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz oczekuję od Komisji Europejskiej podjęcia działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak odpoczniesz na bezludnej wyspie, wrócisz do nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynika on głównie z trzech czynników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszłe doświadczenia wskazują, że byłby to straszny błąd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To stwarza obiecujące perspektywy i fundament do dalszych działań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję panie komisarzu i czekam na pana propozycję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inna kwestia, czy jest to efektywne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35824982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezwzględna większość to nie to samo, co państwo prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, jeśli chodzi o dysproporcje między Północą a Południem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego milczycie w tej kwestii?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba zatem wyraźnie powiedzieć pewne rzeczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje pytanie jest jednak takie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jednak nie jest kluczowa kwestia w przypadku Meksyku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżna powstała drżąc cała z oburzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rada jest świadoma skali niezbędnych środków finansowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to istotna różnica\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy umożliwić większą elastyczność gospodarczą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto ważne kroki stanowią także\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałoby się powiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego głosowałem za odrzuceniem umowy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, umowa o handlu i współpracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To, co nastąpiło później, jest już mniej budujące\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie jest pani stanowisko w tej sprawie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można zgłaszać wiele krytycznych uwag pod naszym adresem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fiasko dyrektywy o czasie pracy było nieuniknione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postawa Rady była po prostu niezrozumiała\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli postawią na karierę, trzeba im w tym pomóc, by miały równe szanse\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Składa się ona z trzech głównych elementów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja z zadowoleniem przyjmuje wniosek pana posła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35825954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wypadek na Węgrzech jest też przykładem solidarności europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podziękować panu i pana współpracownikom za cierpliwość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równość popłaca!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ważne jest, aby Komisja zbadała teraz tę kwestię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwolą państwo, że przypomnę dwa podstawowe elementy tej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z punktami, które poruszyła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też spójność wymaga pewnej dozy koherencji wyborów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś czeski senat przyjął traktat lizboński\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla ludzi, którzy nie szanują demokratycznych wartości, nie ma miejsca w przyzwoitym społeczeństwie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka sytuacja nie może powtarzać się w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałam za przyjęciem tego tekstu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaka jest więc sytuacja?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problemy wystąpiły, ale Komisja trzyma rękę na pulsie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzcie, Miłościwi Państwo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Komisja zdaje sobie sprawę z tej sytuacji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to regionów, miasteczek i wsi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze gospodarki są zbyt współzależne, by było to możliwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jak to się stało z południową Osetią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cele są dobrze znane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35826987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Celem jest wysłanie jednoznacznego sygnału Chinom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie oszukuję tu sama siebie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę ponownie powiedzieć mi, jak mówi się \\\"za\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potępiamy wszelkie rodzaje przemocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem za jego przyjęciem i uważam je za doskonałe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze sprawozdanie odnosi się do starych czasów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli pozwoli pan, chciałbym poruszyć trzy kwestie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rzeczywistości chodzi o ratowanie twarzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Renegocjacja ustaleń protokołu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój wniosek jest następujący\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynik pokrywa się z tym przedstawionym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też głosowałam za przyjęciem tego sprawozdania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym niemniej coś trzeba zrobić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzywam więc nas wszystkich do wspólnego działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego, co widzimy, konsumpcja powróci na dawny poziom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35827700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co mogą wtedy myśleć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35828795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubolewam nad wynikami niniejszego głosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po raz kolejny powtarzam, iż podstawą mojej wypowiedzi są sprawozdania naukowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boją się mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przedmiotowym programie szczególną uwagę poświęca się sprawie równości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojazdy te są szczególnie przystosowane do jazdy w mieście\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To będą debaty krajowe, prowadzone w państwach członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyznajemy im ich prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolej nie jest dla nas rozwiązaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko w ten sposób osiągniemy postęp\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie powinniśmy być nieco bardziej powściągliwi w tej kwestii?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pytanie brzmi, czy idą one we właściwym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.412,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inna refleksja\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja w Iranie ciągle się pogarsza\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę że jest to istotne dla obydwu stron\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I choć omawiany dokument nie jest idealny, to stanowi krok w dobrą stronę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to wspaniałe osiągnięcie dla Unii Europejskiej i wspaniałe osiągnięcie dla nas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budżetu nie wystarczy zaprogramować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dla psa kiełbasa, nie dla kota sperka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczytam Państwu to wystąpienie w jego imieniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według służb i naszej oceny, ta druga poprawka odpada\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Banki, otrzymujące depozyty, muszą je zgłosić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego właśnie zaplanowaliśmy to spotkanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35829985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo wszystko ich stan nadal jest bardzo zły\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy być również odważni i zmierzyć się z rzeczywistością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłowie zadawali pytania dotyczące widoczności i koordynacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pół roku temu przedstawialiśmy tutaj prezydencję belgijską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzywamy do przywrócenia tego porządku na Madagaskarze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milenijne cele rozwoju muszą zostać zrealizowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obszary wodne pokrywają większą część naszego globu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwolę sobie zilustrować wyzwania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko nowa technologia umożliwi nam utrzymanie naszego sposobu życia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie rozwiązanie nie sprawdziło się dotychczas i nie sprawdzi się w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zasadzie Parlament Europejski zaakceptował to podejście, ale wprowadził trzy istotne zmiany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy także przestrzegać ogólnych zasad unijnego prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak więc strategia jest prosta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Którą drogę należy obrać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sankcje nie mogą być skierowane przeciw niewłaściwym osobom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie powinna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35830777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tę listę mógłbym ciągnąć długo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całą pewnością przywróciłoby to równowagę w populacjach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to źródło dostaw gazu rosyjskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj przyjęliśmy rezolucję w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był więcej niż wielkim, był dobrym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.052,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zaczekajmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to naruszenie niezawisłości posła do tego Parlamentu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do zasad tych należą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak rzeczywista tragedią jest to\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze projekty Unii Europejskiej zostały zablokowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymaga on zatem pilnej naprawy przed rozszerzeniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasuwa się pytanie - kto traci najwięcej na sankcjach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do tego potrzebujemy pieniędzy, które muszą być właściwie i sprawiedliwie rozdzielane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepsze wdrożenie leży w interesie nas wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wydaje mi się, by tak było\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ceną za takie spekulacje jest podział Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prześladowania i zastraszanie - nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa przeżywa kryzys\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środowisko polityczne zmieniło się drastycznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejdźmy jednak od odkryć do działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero gdy doszli do przyszłości, stali się smutnymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35859929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogólnie rzecz biorąc zalecenie to jest znakomite\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególne były oczy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po takim przeżyciu dostaję zawsze ataku histerycznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie wyłączyłem ten przełącznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba przestanę jej słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiesz, co czytasz, i nie wiesz, co się dzieje w kinie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc byłam u niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do strumienia, ludzie dobrzy, do strumienia! — wrzasnął uradowany nową obietnicą Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego tatko miał tam warsztat w narożnym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak urośniecie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt inny nie wpadłby na taki pomysł!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoba Cezarego zatracała się i niemal rozpływała w łagodnej, powłóczystej chmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jaka pani dobra — szepnąłem, przyciskając ku ustom jej rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast tego wrzasnęłam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatelefonował do Alinki, ale nie było jej w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się zmieszał i powiedział: - Mogą być na wszelki wypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem na płocie przycupnęła wrona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pamiątka rodzinna — objaśniał zadowolony z pochwał właściciel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No co? — Jeśli ja wyjdę, to nie zbijesz mnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, zbliża się czas, by pomyśleć o powrocie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To najpiękniejsza rzecz w całych Włoszech\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie! — parsknął Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co mi dasz? Tamten odpowiada na serio i poważnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ty, Stefan!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cześć! Jak mogę Ci pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak mu powiedziałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy zrobiło mu się bardzo sucho w ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z kim bądź, ale zaraz i za wszelką cenę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest takie proste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Istotnie niemiła historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc i dorosły czuje się sierotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnie wyglądasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znałeś go? — spytał jednoręki upiora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczam, że sztuczne, zrobione z jakiejś masy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamilknął na chwilę pan Ryszard i uśmiechnął się smutno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wcale nie wiedziałem, że mam serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy zaczęła powstawać przepaść między nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie Bartek używał ich do okrywania się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mogę do niego przychodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Morze i niebo w oddali spajały się z sobą bez śladu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rozumiesz, Jerzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udawały mu się czasem cięte odpowiedzi, ponieważ dużo czytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem na nartach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie wchodzili i wychodzili i Emil myślał o Krystynie, o zdarzeniu przy śniadaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się w niepokoju ulicami, które odpoczywają, jest rzeczą dobrą, prawie religijną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będą go szukali, może już szukają cichaczem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był piękny w swej barwie, rozległości, ciszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzecim przepisem, który muszę podać, jest płukanie pewnego mojego znajomego dentysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakaś młoda matka wżerała się w policzki swego rocz nego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja twoich pieniędzy nie potrzebuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niebezpieczeństwo zbliżało się szybko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy wiesz, że zmieniłaś się? — Wiem o tym dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spróbuj, czy zdołasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przy mojej pomocy wyszła na marmurowy cokół nabrzeża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znalazłem nic do włączenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłuchałem pełen sprzecznych uczuć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczycielki były jej mniej lub więcej obojętne, stary profesor łaciny był „słodki”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On ze swoimi mizernymi orgaźmikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz kazał mi zmieniać pozycję, żeby nie zrobił się zakrzep\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zresztą, jeżeli nie wierzysz, popatrz sama spoza firanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero teraz rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapamiętał rozbawiony wyraz oczu ojca, gdy docierał do nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To co mam zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy typ ma swoje dwa nieomal przeciwne bieguny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś ma złość do naszej panienki i rzucił uroki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spała nigdy skurczona, nigdy na boku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puk, puk! — pukało dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy przebiegł go dreszczyk, jak mała mysz, wzdłuż kręgosłupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłop szanuje zdrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nazywali nigdy po imieniu tego, co było między nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem na jednej z ławek i utonąłem w zadumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci przy kartach zaczynają się podniecać i krzyczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokończę jeden poziom i idę spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i podnieśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko z trudem uratowaliśmy córkę, której groziło poważne niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20634986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę się połapać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chęci pieszczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszli do niej i poczuli obaj ostry za pach, jaki wydziela podniecona kobieta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odeszła, cofając się wolno, tyłem, jak teatralny paź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytała: — Idziesz też do miasta? — Czekam na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś takiego trza było teraz zawołać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten solidny, wyzuty zupełnie z wyobraźni pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mu na chwilę zacisnęło oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie bój się, nic ci nie zrobię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważał, że to są formy przymusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona jest córką ekonoma i kocha naczelnika stacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent miał już otworzony brzuch, w którym było widać tylko żółto- -białą masę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest dziewka, którą miałem przed chwilą tu, na kolanach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiś stół, ława, dwa zydle i łóżko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opanowała nas zaduma i byliśmy zdolni tylko do spokojnego patrzenia przed siebie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomóc ci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeptać będę! — uprzedziła go z uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedziała: „Dobrze”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ona — ona mnie kochała — i byłem szczęśliwy, bez miary szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak minęła w milczeniu długa chwila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzył ją w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc pieniędzy nie przyjęła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc wbijam okrągłym, niewygodnym i uderzyłem się w palec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak — teraz kontakt częściowo osłabiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- W jej oczach ukazały się wesołe błyski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadrżała w posadach góra, struchleli ludzie i zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby serce moje było złotem, wyszłoby świetne z tej próby ogniowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec wziął jednego za uszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyją naturalnie i — być może — lepiej od mężczyzn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka robi mu okłady i ciepłą kąpiel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie sprawdza się ona!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim się zdecyduję, dam ci jedną dobrą radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezczelność tego człowieka, który pozwalał się znieważać bezkarnie bez powodu, rozbrajała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozluźnia skurcz naczyń, zmniejsza ciśnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie daj mi znormalnieć, bo to jest śmierć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesyceni gwarem i krzykiem zeszliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różne rodzaje ciemności, poprze- rzynane błyskawicami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobi się awantura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłaby wymrzeć w trochę piękniejszych i potężniejszych formach — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ano, kichnął dwa razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leniwie i z nerwowym drżeniem wyłażę z ciepłego łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź zadzwoń po Łysego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki głową uparcie pokręcił, zaprzeczając z góry wszelkim domniemaniom łatwowiernego Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marysia skinęła rzęsami, tak jakby kto inny skinął głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siada na moim łóżku i siedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę nosić okulary które mają aż dziesięć dioptrii dla prawego oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do harmonijnego rozwoju swej osobowości dziecko potrzebuje miłości i zrozumienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechaj będzie wielkim wezyrem i niech zarządza moim królestwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więcej nie wiemy nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapanowała ulica, robotnicy naftowi i fabryczni, czeladź sklepowa i domowa, marynarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem okiem na wstążkę napisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nami rozwinęła się wspaniała panorama portu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był poza tym w najwyższym stopniu wstrętny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król sam oniemiał z podziwu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech pan lepiej to czyta, bo są czyste przynajmniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To się zdarzało bardzo rzadko, i dlatego była niespokojna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jednak słyszeli, jak nadchodziła bona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, jakby ich w ogóle nie słyszała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwiazdy pływały jak lilie na wodzie i drgały lekko; niebo było jak jezioro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyła, jakie to na nim robi wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ma innej rady, jak powiedzieć? — Nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy był ślub?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość bym jej zrobił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy psuję go, i nagle zaczyna się w nim coś poruszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet z godziny na godzinę! — odpowiedział Hugon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę go zachować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy być praktycznym; jestem pozytywistą, mój panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofając się, zostawiliśmy trzech zabitych przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posprzątałem dom i odkurzyłem podłogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci wszystkiego dokładnie wyłuszczyć gdyż oczekują mnie towarzysze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20635423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja będę musiał powiedzieć: „Mama umarła”, chyba tak? Co? Ona milczała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tylko tyle możemy zrobić w zamian za nową broń\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest pełne możliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy taki piękny dzień!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postaram się rzecz tę wyjaśnić nieco później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czterdzieści dni i czterdzieści nocy siedziałem w niej zamknięty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten starzec jeszcze śpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy był królem, robił to, co mu te właśnie człowieczki mówiły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawym tylko, co wiadomo — spytał kulawiec i splunął w stronę jednorękiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinał jej suknię, która była łatwa do rozpinania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł miał wstać już trzy drzemki temu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, sarna wróci chyba do leśniczówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę cię mieć wyłącznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć przyćmiona długo oczekiwanymi konkurentami, może budzić emocje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A na rachunki przyszedł pan inspektor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadłem, że Podlasiak! — pochełpił się jednoręki, zwracając się do kulawca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem pewny, że kłamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunęła się stała przy nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo tak chciałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak ćma dookoła lampy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marysia skinęła rzęsami, tak jakby kto inny skinął głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi otworzyła stara kucharka, którą nazywał Me duzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle mam ci do powiedzenia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ty piłeś wódkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy kwiaty do uczty! — rzekła patetycznie, zdejmując wianuszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieubłagana wola kierowała mnie w stronę Parkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz prawo zachować milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem szukać posady, opuścić szkołę lekarską.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może i słyszałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że słyszy szmer w okolicy pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popołudniowe cienie z wolna gromadziły się pomiędzy drzewami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli, powoli, myślisz, opanujesz ją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podeszła do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale łazienki trzeba też umieć używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Karolina uroczyście przysięgła podnosząc dwa palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkaliśmy w chłopskiej chałupie, był jeszcze taki słaby, że trudno mu było samemu chodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nadzwyczaj dziwny list.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj, że niezależnie od tego kim byłeś, zawsze możesz się zmienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodziłeś z domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo gorliwych poszukiwań nigdzie nie można go było wytropić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem głową o ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczuł strach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie stało się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie zaprzeczam ich istnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pracowity jak pszczoła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z sonatą B-mol męczę się potwornie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obojętne, czy mówi do jednego słuchacza, czy do stu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nikotyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz ładną skórę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba znów zacząć; ale na złość jeszcze lepszą buduję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tędy droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę! — odparła z dąsem dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabrali tron, zabrali koronę, a teraz chcieli i mnie zrabować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uciekł twarzą, jakby przestraszony, i w ruchu tym była kokieteria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdź tam szybko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszka się i już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiwnął jej głową, uśmiechnął się i poszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała jej siła w tym, że przechodzi, że mija.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie luty podkuj buty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nade wszystko, o ile pali, powinien jednocześnie absolutnie przestać palić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może dzisiaj zjemy pizzę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Szczotka jest na dole w izbie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja, choć też nienawykły, całego zająca, patrząc na owe mdłości, schrupałem do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy razem udali się do izby opata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I nie zbadałeś wcale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrzył, jak się macacie, i brandzlował się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szkołach powinni uczyć o podatkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straciłem władzę zmieniania przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz poszedł do pokoju, ale zostawił otworem drzwi do sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd tu tyle ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie składa się z samych niedziel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam, pamiętam, posądzałem o złośliwość Pana Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybieraj, póki czas! — zawołał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję! — odkrzyknął oddalając się wybrzeżem ku miastu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci mają swoje troski i smutki, ci swoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama ułożę porządek naszych wędrówek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, nie znał słów pieśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłam na ulicy kotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było ostatnie nasze zajście w granicach Rosji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy zerwali się z miejsc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda dzisiaj będzie mroźna i wietrzna, należy się ciepło ubrać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20641874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przełykać ślinę i zapatrzył się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widzieli, jak ją powstrzymać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej sprawdź to w słowniku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodził z kąta w kąt i coś tam mruczał pod nosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy można mieć pytania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegł za nimi również hałas kawiarni, lecz oni byli poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję dookoła siebie złe, wrogie mi wiry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego lata zacznę uczyć się grać na gitarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś dobra pogoda na połów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj jeszcze, daj mi dokończyć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał może czterdzieści lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczęta mają wargi zimne i mokre i oczy wyblakłe, jak na starych fotografiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O wpół do drugiej nad ranem posłyszałem nagle szum wody, nadchodziła fala powodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W co chcesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niczyja — odparł hardo Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale są świetnie wycelowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za tymi światłami skręć w lewo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ryby pływały, wystawiając nad wodę płetwy, widocznie rozkoszując się ciepłem słonecznym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczynać wszystko sprawiedliwie, z Boga i z siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój ojciec oszczędził to na czas, gdy się obudziliśmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20652207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam na ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak zwykle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy myśleli, że jestem szalony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem i nie jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo panienkę przepraszam i proszę przestać płakać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20670955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero później ocenił, że to było bezczelnie sprytne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął ją pod rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może choć w części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie porwałem! — odrzekł z namaszczeniem — Sama wyrosła na mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak to wyglądało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przechodzimy w gęsty kolor turkusowy, kałamarnica o bladoniebieskich i bladozielonych światłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może bylibyśmy szczęśliwsi — kto wie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odsunął ją miękko, aby rozciągnąć tę chwilę jak gumę i głaskał ustami własne ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I pewnie dorośli tak samo myślą, że dzieci nic nie wiedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oparcie dla pleców było z czerwonego aksamitu i otoczone złotą lamą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20672913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wie ona lepiej od nas, co czynić na oczach ludzkich, a co na stronie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pełnia winy może być tylko tam, gdzie istnieje premedytacja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co niczyje, to i nasze być może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Burza toczy się nad nami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała historia zaczęła się niewinnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było przyjemnie niekonsekwentne, bo postanowił się stąd wyprowadzić ze względu na małą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że nie przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak skrzyżował dłonie na żołędnych wzorach zbryzganej słońcem kamizeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stasiek gadał wciąż z całą surowością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie tak, jak ze snem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zginęliby oboje, bez żadnej pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawił się na poduszkach, wyciągnął nogi przed siebie i zapalił cygaro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stosunek z nim nie sprawia mi ani połowy takiej przy jemności, jak z P.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U nas tak nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozorną lub prawdziwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce jego wpiły się w moje ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temu człowiekowi została tylko Biblia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu po pieniądze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… tak by wyglądało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak myślicie, czy on mnie pamięta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz się przygotować na daleką drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukali innej planety\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odnajdywała go wszędzie i ciągle, ze zwierzęcą, jasno widzącą pewnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On: — Co „nigdy więcej”? Tego nie zobaczysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Plaże nad Bałtykiem latem są pełne Polaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze nie, mój synku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelkie nazwy będą fałszywe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujął go pod ramię i potrząsnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20686240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież ty mieszkasz we „Florydzie”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oblałbym go wrzącą oliwą — powiedział Zbigniew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam na ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gadaj teraz, gdzie się dziewka ukrywa? — zagadnął Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli, a Darek wyciągnął z kieszeni niezgrabne zawiniątko w brązowym papierze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasyciwszy oczy widokiem własnej krasy, zaczęła z powrotem ubierać się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż dziś, prawie mimo woli, wiedziony jakimś tajemnym przeczuciem spróbowałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyt drogo to można okupić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazała im narysować w domu obrazki do tej baśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widna noc, rozjaśniona świeżo spadłym śniegiem, ciepło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję dookoła siebie złe, wrogie mi wiry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy naprawdę jestem nieśmiertelna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy zaczęli przeskakiwać przez płot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do domu i na dziedziniec osady zaczęły zalatywać kule.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil przemknął mu wargami tuż koło ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu się pożywię — szepnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Popatrzył na Emila z wielkim zdziwieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chory zmarł jeszcze przed jego przybyciem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Węże w pustynnych źródłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet z godziny na godzinę! — odpowiedział Hugon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była ciemna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewne dlatego organizatorzy postawili na jeszcze większą promocję wydarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest potrzebne dla uczynienia mnie nieżywym, abym się zmieścił do jakichś tam książek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź szczotkę i mydło i wyszoruj ręce jak należy — mówi mama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na gwiazdkę postanowiłem sobie sprawić smartwatcha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle głupstwo ich zajmie, ale tylko na krótko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palto krzywo zapięte!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym był na środku tamy, nadbiegła druga fala powodzi i rozstrzaskała się o belkowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytał dużo; szybko, często powierzchownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po zamknięciu pogadanki zbliżył się do mnie pierwszy i przedstawił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oblicza z dwóch stron mej głowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc między nami, o ile to oczywiście odpowiada twym planom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miejcie oczy dookoła głowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tłumaczyłam ci już sto razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdejmuje mokrą sukienkę i kładzie do miednicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pański bank raczej nie stoi frontem do klienta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie chcę, żebyś był.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, czego nam brak! — zawołał, uderzając się dłonią w czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy rozpoczyna się życie z kapitału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20647833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ty wobec rozwagi zawsze byłeś w opozycji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uśmiecha się raz jeszcze i znika w głębi mieszkania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponury, pełen nie spodziewanych blasków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Faunie, mów, czego się żalisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie znalazłem teraz już nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W porządku, dezaktywowałem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oboje nie chcieliśmy czasu marnować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś znowu szedł, więc Cezary ociężale powrócił do swej łopaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz tamten jakby nie słysząc naciskał już sprężynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A pies oparł się łapami o poręcz i głowa mu podskakiwała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że dał się nabrać, że wygłupia się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20716999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To przecież dawno miniona przeszłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy dni się szykowali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Detale na ten temat później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile razy przychodziłem do niej, matka jej głaskała mnie po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie strzelam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U niej widocznie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oko widziało zawsze jej ciąg dalszy, zatracając w próżni niepochwytną resztę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli nabierze łaskawy pan rozmachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastanawialiśmy się czy to mają być wystawy stałe, czy zmienne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to poza goleniem się największy wysiłek z tych codziennych, programowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liza zaśmiała się szyderczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A przysięga uroczysta, to nic? — zapytała pantera, pokazując zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy tu tylu prowokatorów i szpiegów…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę zapadło między nami milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na przykład ten «Rocznik psychologiczny» i rozprawa Szumana o peyotlu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi sprawia przykrość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa zaczęła się śmiać, niehisterycznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z teczkami pod pachą, rozmawiali o przeczytanych książ kach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym przy stosunku zachowuje się też dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piekło w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znają, nieszczęśni, tamtego…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród grupy pasażerów u stopnia wagonu powstało zamieszanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to było?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do widzenia, panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedł na salę operacyjną bez słowa, jakby jeszcze spał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fryzjer jest czynny od poniedziałku do piątku w godzinach od ósmej do osiemnastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podbiegał do tego, kogo się bał, aby już szybko był z tym koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na wpół obłąkany ze strachu Jano budzi Marysię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było staczać ustawiczne walki z wrogimi szczepami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż to nie charakterystyczne, że trupie głowy są zawsze uśmiechnięte?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pójdziesz się bawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta umiejętność nie jest jeszcze gotowa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponowiłem próbę na przedramieniu z tym samym rezultatem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozstawione daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20739340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna nie będzie trwała długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu stoi nasz domek, tu płotek — i zaraz jego rudera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"program telewizyjny jest bardzo nudny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pan mi wierzy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było ani tchnienia wiatru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła długo w tym sensie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce, jak zły duch, niszczyło żywym ogniem zeschłą ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci spierają się o byle co.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był zupełnie pewien, że po jej przejściu wrócą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była pewna czternastoipółletnia smarkula, która nazy wała się Ala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego przenikliwe oczy przechodziły szybko od twarzy do twarzy, z wyrazem zapytania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach! Zosiu, ach Zosieńko, jak mi niewygodnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno byli pobrani i mieli dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Możemy jechać? — zapytał Idrys.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dziewiętnasta zero zero.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słaba błyskawica rozświetliła przestrzeń popod listowiem drzew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I niedługo poczekamy na to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarzą w twarz z sobą: lustro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale weź go na język, a od razu stoi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21292720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrazu nie pokazywała się nikomu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ją kocham i jestem tak bardzo szczęśliwa, że będę tu mieszkała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie uczyniłam ci żadnej krzywdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak zawsze; więcej, niż sądzili, i nie tam, gdzie myśleli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz na to jeszcze dość czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jaki sposób?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A mój szkielet?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona sobie siedziała spokojnie… jakby nic!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie chcę zajmować się więcej tą sprawą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale to mnie dużo kosztowało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczpospolita Polska. Polska Ludowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możesz się obrócić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę spalić szyfrowaną wiadomość, która obecnie nie może mieć dla pana żadnej wartości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli zasnę, nie zbudzę się już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś nie wahał się ani chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tradycje, podania, legendy i mitologie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłoby to wcale stosowne zakończenie! — odrzekłem z naciskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"brzydko zbudowany i chudy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odprowadzę cię do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O młodości i wychowaniu Oliwera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam starałem się tę sprawę wyświetlić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął też do ręki cycuś, a zaraz i drugi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lub też konno na chuju, na boku, na raka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pozwól mi trochę pomyśleć i pogadać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiedz twej pani, by tu przyszła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawcowi ten świat zdawał się — stromy i niedoskoczony, a jednorękiemu — niepochwytny i uboczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczom ich ukazał się las... Las krzyży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój wuj zwariował z tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My nie jesteśmy ani braćmi, ani siostrami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem na Władka, bo Władek przyczepił jej rzep do sukienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zostanę zjedzony przez twojego papę i ty też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Będziesz robiła wszystko, co ci każą — brzmiała odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawa ręka trupa wychylała się z ubrania, obnażona aż po łokieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jął rozbierać żoneczkę, sposobić posłanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest ciekawe w tym wypadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stała w korytarzu i wejść nie mogła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto, co mnie spotkało! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze się przekonacie, że ludzkość pokona zaraza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że stało się coś straszliwego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sprawa natchnienia, nie roboty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina druga dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy była kradzież?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tamta historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dorosła, aby to zrozumieć, jak należy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21313815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądzę, że od świtu wszyscy policjanci w obrębie czternastu mil wypatrują przemoczonego przechodnia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu zawdzięczam takie zainteresowanie się moją osobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawno zapomniana teoria Jamesa-Langego a miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmierć nastąpiła prawdopodobnie niedawno, bo trup nie zdradzał jeszcze śladów rozkładu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20642957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiem coś, co mam do powiedzenia — obiecała tajemniczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejrzał je dokładnie, odkładając te, które stępiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płynęli od latarni do latarni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miód jest słodki i zdrowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I już nie zobaczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy sam na sam — rzekł Podlasiak, do głębi wzruszony swym obecnym stanowiskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciepły wiatr gwizdał między jodłami, które chwiały się i trzeszczały w ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tylko to aby pieniądze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obławę potem robili na nas w całej okolicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyślam się, że dokładny plan wyjazdu dostanę jeszcze przed końcem tygodnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochylone są ku ziemi te kształty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale na cóż tyle zachodów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy i tak czasu sporo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzewa, krzewy i trawa służące za jedyne schronienie też nie ułatwiają przetrwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radio grało z daleka na pełnym głośniku łzawy szlagier, ohydnie sentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip spał nadal, snem niespokojnym, pełnym marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komu w drogę, temu czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc byłam u niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci wszystkiego dokładnie wyłuszczyć gdyż oczekują mnie towarzysze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby się miało grzęznąć coraz głębiej, choćby się wiedziało, że koniec będzie zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Metoda moja jest czysto psychologiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O ile się nie mylę, przeszedł pan dwukrotnie operację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy wiedzieli, że rabuś, a nikt mu nie mógł dowieść niczego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy znalazł się u siebie, położył się natychmiast na tapczanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jemu pewnie też serce mocno ze strachu biło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Setki komunikatorów obejmują cały nasz świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może drży wskutek zimna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała mokre włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziane z bliska, zakrywały połowę mostu kolejowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brat zaprosił mnie na absolutorium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje ruch kolejowy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem ludzie siedzieli przed bramami domów, a pary leżały nad rzeką, na wyłysiałych łączkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stało się to, co się nie zawsze i nie każdemu przytrafia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Marzeniem moim byłoby to samo, nad czym pracowali alchemicy: — eliksir młodości!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może nareszcie pozostawi nas w spokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy są kolejne wybory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niech i tak będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, mieć dach nad głową jest rzeczą bardzo przyjemną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Diabli was tu wezmą co do nogi, jak nas zgubicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie tutaj — rzekł pan — chodźcie ze mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz w nogi, nie czeka nas tu nic dobrego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko w najbliższej przegrodzie coś się poruszyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby serce moje było złotem, wyszłoby świetne z tej próby ogniowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz dopiero przekonał się, że początkowo szli oboje w złym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem tylko o tym dziwnym człowieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądają jak dołki i rowki, powstałe od nakłucia szpilką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaproponował, abyśmy spróbowali naśladować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo włada szczęściem wszystkich, nędzą się rozczula.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara spostrzegła, że było ich sześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego właśnie tam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten drugi pojechał na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dofinansowano ze środków Ministra Kultury i Dziedzictwa Narodowego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ścianie mojej łodzi piszę wiersze-dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja zawsze tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan jedzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoczył pod okno chałupy i nadstawił wielkich uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z jakiego to przytułku wypuszczono tego jegomościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ci powiedzieć coś złego, jak tamtej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy z nas nigdy ich nie stracili\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On pytał: — Jak szłaś tak przez miasto, dziewczynko? Ona milczała, rozpinała płaszcz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karykaturalne typy męskie w kostiumach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A za oknem coraz wyższe słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatelefonował do Alinki, ale nie było jej w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gondola docierała do molo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z punktu widzenia nawyków codziennych wyglądał niedorzecznie, jak przesadnie wielki zbieg okoliczności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc tylko dziewką służebną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem, jak ręka Andrzeja wpija mi się kurczowo w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zatem: Alaska… potem wilki, względnie psy… i sanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś jest dzień wagarowicza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewna „deformacja przestrzenna” przy otwartych oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I że mógł siedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko oglądał na nowo, jakby dawno nie widziane, jakby na nowo odkrył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy przygotowuję się do wykładu to bardzo niewiele mogę wykorzystać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szedł powoli, niby chmura jesienna, a potem usiadł na tronie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprzód nie czułem, ale teraz, kiedy siedzę spokojnie i mam zmartwienie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie mówi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszli do bardzo ciemnego parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie słońce zsunęło się nisko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowie się pan po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz, ile w nim papierów i rupieci! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się jednak, że nie wszystkie osobniki podległy tej klątwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musisz mi pomagać, Jur — obiecałeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie wasza dziewka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jaka ładna muszelka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, co za rozkosz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszył ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zejdę jeszcze na dół, mam kilka rzeczy do zrobienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil stał za palmą i oglądał księcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda ręki! — odpowiedziała z woru dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W postać geniusza ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, moja droga, tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze na miejsce jednego powieszonego stawało do walki dziesięciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotowałem Ci niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zaczął śmiać się wreszcie z naszego zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekają panią w niedalekiej przyszłości zawody i niepowodzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec w twarz mu wprawnie, jak koniowi w zęby, zajrzał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więc byłem aresztowany!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla chcącego nic trudnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cudna kobieta! — pomyślałem, przestępując próg sali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgoda! — zawołał z ponownym wybuchem radości Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płacząc i rycząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawda wyjdzie zawsze na jaw!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż takiego zaszło między wami? — zapytałem, nie zdradzając swych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wróćmy się do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłodno tu jakoś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było mu coraz gorzej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy nim jest klęcznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temat zadania szkolnego: „Opisać wycieczkę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naczynie cię chyba samo nie weźmie za rękę i nie zaprowadzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak chcę i muszę, to nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie skazano go na wygnanie do wschodniej Syberii, na Kamczatkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na pewno myślał o tym — odrzekł Hal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona popatrzyła na jego twarz i przestraszyła się: była tak zmieniona, upiorna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A nie zaśpiewasz nam na pożegnanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwieram z łomotem tylne drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz kolana ośmioletniej dziewczynki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieszczęścia chodzą parami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba przestanę jej słuchać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znałeś go? — spytał jednoręki upiora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aleś ty pierwszy trafił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Uważaj na nogę, Tomasz! — krzyknął Dan z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywidziało ci się, Stacha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A kiedy ją będę widział? — Za kilka dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz spróbuję je sparaliżować choć w części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego ty wszystko psujesz? Obejmujesz samo życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Henek stoi w korytarzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie, ile dokładnie czasu potrzebuje na dotarcie swoim tempem na uczelnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Służę panu — odpowiedział grzecznie, strzepując popiół z cygara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to chciej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On miał amerykański akcent, a Anna miała australijski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Listy będę pisał i przez gołębie wysyłał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego neurologowi było nieco trudno pogłaskać go po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O wpół do pierwszej zaczynała coś wiedzieć i kładła się spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery dni temu budowałem schron z całym systemem sznurków zamykających prymitywne klapy i zasłony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak powinien wyglądać świat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był sam; nikt nie przerywał sennego dumania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Opowiedz im całą historię, mości Ryszardzie — wtrącił się Puk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli się uda, będę od razu najsławniejszym adwokatem na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż Ewa odkleiła ten list wieczorem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak jest, wtedy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogląd na istoty żywe: witalizm z pewnymi zastrze żeniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stasiek gadał wciąż z całą surowością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20643622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc spuściłem milcząco głowę i słuchałem dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wezwał Andrzeja do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znamienne połączenie wizerunków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I cóż, że ze Szkocji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale był jeden robotnik stary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie publiczne musi być organiczne lub mechaniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idioto! Idioto! Sprać ją i pójść sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddałby, oddał na pewno, bo chciałby pozostać uczciwym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet kierownik, cała szkoła robi się od razu świąteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę pana, tylko na parę godzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczytano jego los.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak nic nie czuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda szepce, krzyczy, mówi co innego, i mieszają się ich głosy, jak gwar tłumu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już dostępny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pszczoły nie chcą mieszkać koło domu, gdzie panuje nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary jest uroczy i komiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto urywki tego, co jej odpowiadano z pląsających łodzi rybackich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście, ceny mogą być dla niektórych zbyt wysokie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli dla siebie dziwną sympatię i szacunek — z daleka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz ją tylko widziałem, raz jeden jedyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otarli się o siebie milczą co policzkami i Emil poczuł bardzo lekki zapach perfum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No mam nadzieję, że jest w dobrym humorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nagromadzaj przeszkód! — ostrzegł ją zawczasu kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odprowadził ją do drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest we mnie — i ja we wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy bowiem warunek jednorękiemu, a drugi kulawcowi by nie odpowiadał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mongołowie uczynili to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłuchaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy pójść na samotny spacer, aby mieć wszystkie atuty w ręku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana — proszę o bilet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dom publiczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Roboty chyba nie brak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech Jej Wysokość wraca do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic takiego nie mówiłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie sprawdza się ona!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym, zamykam drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On doznał wrażenia, że stopy jego puszczają korzonki, że jest wrośnięty w ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wsiedliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A chleba nie wyżarła? — spytał znowu kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał mi głęboko w twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedząc o zmroku nad stawem i słuchając, jak powiew wiatru wzdycha żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli spóźni ci się autobus, to ewentualnie mogę cię podwieźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Spuchnięcie czasu” dochodzi do niemożliwych rozmiarów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc kto nie chce, żebym chodził do szkoły, niech podniesie rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na każde pytanie jedno tylko powtarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęła się nienormalnie szorować, i to jej zostało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w domu sierot różne były dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała oczy zamknięte już nie tak kurczowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20722915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem już było miasteczko i kawiarnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wjechaliśmy w czeluść wodną pomiędzy Wyspą św. Heleny a Ogrodami Publicznymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy na tarasie i oglądaliśmy seriale?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie po trafię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muzyka i śpiew nieustanny, uczty i igrzyska zapełniały jego życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do drzwi i wyjrzał na pole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja go słyszałem bardzo dawno, tak dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież oddzielają ściany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łódź nasza bardzo ucierpiała — odrzekł Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje kolej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty się mylisz, Andrzeju!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrób listę zakupów bo znowu o czymś zapomnimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli zaczną dokazywać, nie poniosę wspólnej odpowiedzialności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po kwadransie była wyleczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłukli i pieścili ją oboje na przemian; na złość sobie, nawzajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W rozmowach z Cezarym wskazywał palcem na kilka „cudów”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja sam do trzydziestego roku życia nie piłem prawie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724858.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, bo jakże?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na nim skupiłaś swą uwagę, gdy wchodziłem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdziemy tam z samego rana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jej nogi były czerwone aż do kolan, wyżej białe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naczelnik ma dalekie, niebieskie oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu nagle — już zapomniałeś nawet —- i nagle znalazłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapalił małą lampkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mefisto idzie cudownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsze partie co śmielszych przechodzą przez murek i wsiąkają w miasto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20724881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krystyna zostaje tu na całe życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A więcej nie wiemy nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto pani powiedział? — szepnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję i przepraszam za przerwanie toku rozmyślań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to, jak we własnym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myję zęby po każdym posiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz dochodzenia spełzły na niczym: sprawcy mordu nie wykryto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadę dzisiaj do kina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dałem wam naukę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz wszystko ma swój koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na mnie? No, to odprowadź mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli czerwone uszy i byli nie bardzo przytomni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż, sprzeciwia się pan stanowczo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręki mu jednej brak, więc milczy dla tymczasowej niepoznaki — wytłumaczył złośliwie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zerwał się z posłania i gorączkowo zaczął szukać zapałek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest Kim, a tam są oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pielgrzym ukląkł przy kracie, bijąc się w piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucił się na łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc co jest w naczyniu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale któż to wykona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co tu się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeszcze mam zrobić cztery zadania matematyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym czasie czytał już książki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyliśmy ją kołem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to za medalion? — zapytała nagle, sięgając ręką ku mej szyi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy miała lat dziesięć i pół, zaonanizowała na śmierć psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się dzieje z naszą literaturą i teatrem — to skandal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały myślał, że to z powodu niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ty piłeś wódkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O mój Boże, za cóż takich łask zaznałam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten redaktor jest stronniczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobieństwo często jest nieintuicyjne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmuś się! — pisnął kulawiec i pięścią powahał w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tulił głowę do jej kolan w pokorze uwielbienia…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten sok mógłby zaszkodzić pannie Karolinie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś goni po przedpokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To „wnętrzności” boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej strony przychodzi refleksja, żeśmy się jednak trochę zagalopowali!!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na razie nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon dzwonił długo, bardzo długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeżywam całe tygodnie w ciągu kilku minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na torebce, którą przyciska do boku, widać kolorową nalepkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Premier spotkał się dzisiaj z prezydentem za zamkniętymi drzwiami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto ma wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co? — W klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego lata zacznę uczyć się grać na gitarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba obmyślić dokładnie, w co się przebierze, co weźmie na drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz to bardziej oddalali się od śródmieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utajone drga we mnie wszystko, co było, i wszystko, co będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochałem cię jak syna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęło mi się przewracać w głowie, patrzyłem poza nią, za okno, miałem półotwarte usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwienie odmalowało się na twarzy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad rzeką włóczyli się ludzie, suszący siebie na słońcu, jak pieluchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyrzekam, że nie ruszę się z tego miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie można z tobą mówić po ludzku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec zawczasu nachylił się ku dziwożonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy te sposoby rozumowania odróżnić od dedukcji naukowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwielbiał tę pozycję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo to nie moje — odparła Marta z godnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idealna pogoda na rower!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolka robiła właśnie kluski na stolnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do Marysi: — Profesora chyba nie ma w Sylwestra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co do mnie mówisz? — pyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam prawo się dowiedzieć, czy potrafi mnie pan wynagrodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak stało się i nic na świecie faktu nie odmieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc czy ja mogę się o coś zapytać? — Możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie! Oto moment, na który czekaliście!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka była przerażona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjrzał, czy wysoko: czy można wyskoczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj razem dostąpimy wyzwolenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znała aż za dużo historyjek z małymi dziewczynkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Muszę się przekonać, kto to taki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę dzisiaj kupić karmę dla kota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20725190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz mieszkam w nim ja i to niech ci wystarczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kapitan brutalnie zaklął po niemiecku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą takie momenty przeżywał dość rzadko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądał na człowieka, przejętego śmiertelnym strachem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim razie sprawa mogła mieć następujący przebieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dodać muszę, że ślicznem była zwierzęciem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie kapitanie, pan ma okrwawione oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezwykłe zjawiska, których byłem świadkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To takie naturalne i zrozumiałe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak minął tydzień, drugi, trzeci, wreszcie minął miesiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Im prędzej skończymy, tym lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Psy zaledwie były spuszczone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź pan, tę gazetę i przeczytaj sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapaśnicy zostali zważeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co pan sobie życzy, prosimy o wolny wybór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młody człowiek w milczeniu podał mi niewielki pakiet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pięć minut później staliśmy już w zatoce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzi teraz o zwycięstwo i o pieniądze, których mu tak bardzo brak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktór nic nie podejrzewał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej już tak zrobię, jak mi Piotr radził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię prawdziwie i wcale się nie boję, że pan sprawdzi moje słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były to uderzenia, które otrzymał Mistrz z rąk studenta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedząc na górze, pan nic nie słyszy, co się dzieje na dole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz miał zupełnie zeszpeconą przez złego dozorcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co pewien czas padało z ust sędziego: „proszę się rozejść“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powóz szybko pomknął aleją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to lejek z czarnej skóry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże długo mam jeszcze cierpieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybyś pan nam odmówił, to sprawa pańska przyjmie inny obrót.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prusacy wdarli się do sieni, wyłożonej kamienną posadzką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie górowała nad nim młodość i zdrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że byli to kupcy, udający się do Europy za interesami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejmował go przygnębiający smutek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli przecież także własne instrumenta miernicze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze będzie, jeżeli zwyciężę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie w tym czasie wydarzył się ten zabawny wypadek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kabul został ostatecznie wzięty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to w tym czasie, kiedy niemieckie hordy zalewały Francję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obie ręce miał podniesione do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle Mistrz opuścił gwałtownie ręce i chwycił się za nogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myśl, że będę mówił o tobie źle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robotnicy dążyli zewsząd tłumnie na miejsce walki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale przegrać z braku męstwa?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłum był tak poruszony tą sceną, że nie mógł już krzyczeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawi się zawsze o oznaczonej przez pana godzinie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21643999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na samą myśl o swem położeniu zbladł, jak kreda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że nie zaryzykuję ani nie stracę jednego pensa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szermierze spotkali się znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan widział jakieś straszydło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się pan nie powstrzyma, to zapewniam, że będzie źle... Ha!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruszyliśmy w pochód naprzeciw karawany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale znawcy boksu trzymali po stronie Mistrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród publiczności rozległy się znowu oklaski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan zna zapewne altanę w moim ogrodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie ojciec mój jest bardziej, niż kiedykolwiek zaniepokojony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do miłego widzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary marynarz roześmiał się głośno i poszedł dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem wrócę do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O trzech cudzoziemcach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobne spędzanie czasu odnawia ludzkiego ducha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiadomość tę przyniósł nam jego kolega, oficer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał naprzeciwko swego rywala, chwiejąc się nieznacznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale akurat w tym czasie przyłapał ich patrol ułanów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mistrz wykonał ruch do uderzenia z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieszczęście zapewne już się stało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemiec pokręcił głową odmownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie postaramy się uczynić wszystko możliwe, by nie dopuścić do skandalu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hrabia napełnił dwie szklanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetne wiadomości z forpoczt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był podobny do nauczyciela, strofującego chłopców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bogaty student wysunął się naprzód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robotnik westchnął, jęknął nieludzkim głosem i siadł na podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okazało się jednak, że nie potrzebowałem prosić o uwolnienie mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że ma złamany kark.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na trawie obok niego leżał duży kawał chleba, w ręce trzymał składany nóż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie jezioro to dało początek oddzielnym potokom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle opromieniła go myśl o stu funtach nagrody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz Mistrza była zła, lecz męska i świadczyła o sile.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mistrz jest ślepy na lewe oko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to w ponury, posępny zimowy wieczór około godziny szóstej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz pojmował już wyraźnie, gdzie się znajduje i co ma robić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doktorze, na miłość Boską, ratuj mnie, bo naprawdę dostanę pomieszania zmysłów!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opatrzność czuwa nad nami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprzeciwko mojego ten chłopak zgaśnie, jak świeca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644269.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzowie mieli pewność, że mistrz zwycięży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644270.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówią, że od piwa nie da się oderwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjedzie pan wówczas w najburzliwszą noc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastąpiło piętnaste starcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą było to do przewidzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo inaczej gniew bogów spadnie na was“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tych indusów?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłop wzruszył ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem wypocznij pan na kanapie, mnie zaś oddaj papiery swego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21644790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby tylko udało mu się zmęczyć przeciwnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie są znani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stało się to w końcu września.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejęła mnie zgroza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie oto uprzejme zdania wymieniali między sobą współzawodnicy, sportsmeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak w tych warunkach odbywa się wymiar sprawiedliwości łatwo sobie wyobrazić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takiej śmiałości nie można puścić bezkarnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz będzie miał nauczkę, aby z pięściami nie włazić każdemu w paradę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z okien i drzwi robotniczych domków powiewały białe chusteczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikomu jednak nie radziłbym wejść w naszą rodzinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzi pan ten dom?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie było tu dwóch ludzi, jeden z lampą, drugi ze świecą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten człowiek powinien dać wam wina i mięsa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy możesz mi coś o niem powiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc, ciągnę dalej swą opowieść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba to niemożliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma pan nerwy ogromnie rozstrojone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rywale obrzucali się wzajemnie ostrymi kamieniami, podobnymi do brył węgla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan nie powinien się z nią ożenić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno uderzenie wystarczało, aby go zwalić z nóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju rozległ się odgłos silnego uderzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrzeba cię tutaj, nie potrzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tego czasu nie pojawił się on już nigdy w Warszawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, to niewdzięczny gruboskóry lud!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Na czele oddziału artylerzystów rzuciłem się naprzód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Generał był zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczają, że pan nie może ścierać się z Mistrzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciskając się przez tłum, próbował przejść na platformę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłum jednak zawiódł się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W inny sposób zrobić tego nie mogę, ponieważ nie znam nazwiska uczciwego majora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na rogu ulicy był maleńki sklepik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stracę nawet i ten zarobek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W nagrodę za dotrzymanie słowa może pan osiągnąć najwyższe szczęście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wówczas natarł na swego przeciwnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego chcesz jeszcze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyłem, że otwór w ścianie zabito deskami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz jednak czas mi już pożegnać panów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastosowania praktycznego nie mogą przecież mieć wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te kamienie podłogi są poprostu zadziwiające.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to student czuł się nieswojo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed gankiem oczekiwał na nich już parokonny powóz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On z największą przyjemnością przyjmie pana na praktykę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młodzi Mormoni patrzyli na niego w osłupieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, psy wyły, poprostu wyły ze zgrozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po środku stołu znajdowała się jakaś rzecz, przykryta płótnem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabijcie mnie, jeśli chcecie, ale ja nic nie wiem, nic powiedzieć nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem obcym w tem mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwię się jej i panu się dziwię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale otóż mamy i Mistrza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sędzia rozglądał się naokoło, twarz miał zadowoloną, oczy roześmiane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynym wyjściem zamiana jego osoby na pańską.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejrzałem się dokoła, myśląc, skąd mógł pochodzić ten dziwny głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieporozumienie kochanków przerwało zjawienie się nowej osoby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pułkownik zaś wziął sierżanta i podszedł na palcach do oświetlonego okienka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybuch tegoż będzie straszliwym dla komunistycznych władców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"We dworze nie wesoło było, pusto... i niedostatnio...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan pozwoli, że zapytam o godność?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było zwolnić biegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21653918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbardziej sprzyjająca sprawie, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz o północy nie daruję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pagórku stał żółty dom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żałuję, że sam nie wpadłem na tę myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zeszłoroczna zbiórka poszła naprawdę kiepsko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to ja mu to muszę powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła pani, że to przede wszystkim osoby starsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem przestaje się nawet za tym tęsknić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mam iść do kancelarii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna jaskółka wiosny nie czyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wejdzie do haremu jako małżonka monarchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to trudne do przetworzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten hałas mnie męczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza Fauna — to sen o śnie, sen posępny i niespokojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona ma to okresowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie twoje rzemiosło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kamień węgielny organizacji państwowej mieści się w znoszeniu msty rodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pielgrzym ukląkł przy kracie, bijąc się w piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem gasi świecę, otwiera okno i wygląda na ulicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś jak pięknie kwitną wiśnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się na to, że jesteśmy pokraczni — rzekł tymczasem zatrwożony nieco Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko na tematy teoretyczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chwała Bogu — zawołał jeden z panów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki przybiegł pośpiesznie, jakby się bał karygodnego w danym razie opóźnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedłem na ścieżkę ogrodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stała, odziana w szlafroczek, z rękami założonymi na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20628914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było po deszczu, parowała rozmokła ziemia, w parku ławki już wysychały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest bardzo słaby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadłem, że Podlasiak! — pochełpił się jednoręki, zwracając się do kulawca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł się i pocałował ją w usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdź ze mną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko paru obrazki narysowało i położyliśmy na stoliku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kropka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej towarzysze za jej przykładem zerwali po tataraku i gryząc wilgotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej nozdrza drgały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz mógł dokładnie spojrzeć jej w dotąd półmrokiem nocy zakrytą twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak ze wzrastającą dumą spojrzał na obydwu przyjaciół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Troje zaczerwienili się z całkiem różnych powodów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toruj drogę jako młodszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była wstawka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20660053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała szeroko otwarte oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, a teraz, panienko, czas wstawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy tylko to aby pieniądze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na początek muszę zadać pytanie - skąd się pani o mnie dowiedziała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobieta uśmiecha się i patrzy na mnie w szczególny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krew na książkach i papierach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy taki piękny dzień!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stół Emila: maszyna do pisania, bałagan, papiery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z jej życia zaczy nało rozwijać się dzieło sztuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu właśnie Emil przestał pisać i popatrzył na rzekę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się w niepokoju ulicami, które odpoczywają, jest rzeczą dobrą, prawie religijną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrała się też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hańba okrywa was, Rosjan, a wy tego nie możecie zrozumieć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczyciel nigdy nie powie, czy lubi, ale się to czuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oblicze stare, przeorane siecią fałd i zagłębień, jakby dwoiło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież one chyba nie robią tego tylko dla forsy? Jesteś bał wan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słyszę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Termin dla mnie niezupełnie jasny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie wstał i nie spojrzawszy na mnie więcej, wyszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz sen nie spływał na powieki od jego pieśni monotonnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż na stację wtoczył się pociąg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zebrali się na tajną naradę bez króla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko ani słowa, rozumiesz, bo tajemnica służbowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno w żadnym razie zmuszać ani upoważniać do wykonywania jakiegokolwiek zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment był tragiczny; wszyscy oczekiwali katastrofy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łódź nasza bardzo ucierpiała — odrzekł Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę sobie wyrobić nowy paszport.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścił powoli swoje przezroczyste oczy i jego usta stały się jeszcze bardziej wąskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To licho małe jak igła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa zbladła, widział ją, siedziała w pierwszej ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poranek był jasny, majowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę by pomieszkać między Eskimosami, między Murzynami albo Indianami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko wszakże zamieszka taka się zdarzała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była stanowczo za ładna i za dobrze deklamowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądał ją więc i myślał: — To ją powinno trochę przynajmniej denerwować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko pomyślę, że masz przyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwko niemu kierowali wszystkie te straszliwe historie i swój śmiech bezlitosny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U mnie będzie pan całkowicie bezpieczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była też bardzo ciekawa, co z tego wyniknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszano ciche kwilenie jak gdyby zranionego zwierzątka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad płonącym ogniem stała pochylona sylwetka jakiegoś mężczyzny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była ciemna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz rację; w chwili gdy usłyszałam dźwięk jego głosu, złudzenie prysło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już dostępny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zależy od nastawienia z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak śmiesznie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to lekkomyślne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc co jest w naczyniu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, nie chciałam, może, może, żebyś ty się zajmował brudną robotą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pęd, panie kochany, pęd i ruch!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo szybkości przemian widzę to z mikroskopijną dokładnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już wyłączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest serdecznym przyjacielem nas obojga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrwali protokół młodego króla — podpisali, że tak właśnie dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedne człowieczki mówią tak, drugie inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już strasznie znudzili mi się ci mężczyźni z forsą i szykiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyła więc w półśnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież powiedziałeś, że nie chcesz tam iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej możecie wrócić do domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszał jej mruczenie bulgocące cicho w gardle, jak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— tak Go zaklinał i prosił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwykle początkujący palacze nie palą rano, oszczędzając najlepsze godziny dnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odpowiadała czas dłuższy, utkwiwszy przerażone oczy w drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym może jej szczególny urok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reszta jest prawie napisana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ona mówiła do niego: — Opowiem ci jak to było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szum chodził wierzchem lasu, nie przenikając do głębi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam nadzieję, że połowa uczestników odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczyli się na ganku, gdzie cuchnęło, ale oni nie zauważali tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego zwykle obieram samotny przedział i płacę za to gruby napiwek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może by spróbować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre pnie złociły się wypukle, niby oszklone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zależało jej na tym, aby była czysto ubrana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą więc uwagę skierowałem na konia, widocznie tracącego resztki sił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zbliżyło się znowu do pytona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie umieli mu na to odpowiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680543.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak wypuścił z ręki jej dłoń drobną i niemal dziecinną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gram pierwszy temat zupełnie po pijacku, zupełnie zataczając się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie znajdę jakieś fajne knajpki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest we mnie — i ja we wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mocno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pański bank raczej nie stoi frontem do klienta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z kim? — Sam albo z Fredkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła, patrząc w ziemię, i wydawała się bardzo zasmucona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu się pożywię — szepnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam pana — proszę o bilet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy zawibrował telefon wszyscy zamilkli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc łatwo się domyślić, dlaczego właśnie jego wybrano, żeby odprowadził Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna noga już jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wspominała o nich ani razu w ciągu krótkiej, upalnej nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mają twarzy, wyżarła je ciemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staliśmy oboje na tym maleńkim skrawku ziemi, a wokół nas, wszystko pokryła woda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w niedzielę, jak lunatyczka, poszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nie sprawiało mu to przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi krzemień szurnął przez całe biurko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zielony poblask trawy ślepił na chwilę zaskoczone nagłą widownią źrenice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat pełen jest larw i masek zrodzonych w ten sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwą musiała być siła, która przeszła przez ten łachman człowieczy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem trzeba wiedzieć kiedy się przebranżowić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Haczyk od okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Namyślam się, czy miejsce wybuchu jest na Ukrainie czy na Pomorzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To komiczne, że mama miała siedemnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie zbliżają się środkiem ulicy trzy cienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tej chętce poznałem od razu, że Podlasiak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko w jaki sposób? O mało nie wpadli pod taksówkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Teraz mieszkam w nim ja i to niech ci wystarczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20680580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było mi gorąco jak cholera, ale koniec końców usnęłam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21138117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan cierpi na artystyczną eiacuiatio praecox.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21138118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiś nieznajomy staruszek w wielkiej pelerynie i ciemnych okularach na nosie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21138119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I powód nie mógł być błahy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21138120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tędy, panowie, jeśli łaska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21138123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nel zasnęła zaraz po posiłku i spała przez kilka godzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy odpowiem, że wolę ustrój B, ze względu na moją książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet własne wojsko ciebie nie lubi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko, mówię ci, albo nie uratuje go już żadna siła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście im wiek późniejszy, tym bardziej charakter komórek jest inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało się, że rzeczywistości nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I słusznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostawił po sobie wspomnienia jak najcieplejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście trzeba na to woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, gdybym nawet mógł znów się zamienić, wolałbym jeszcze spróbować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20644946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stali we troje, ale tylko Emil patrzył na trupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pomyliłeś się, bratku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Never more.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przeleciał przez mur! — zawołała Maria, śledząca lot ptaszka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takich jak ty nie dręczy demon ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te ciastka są wyborne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciała rozstaju, ma rozstaj! Niech gada! — gorącował się kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rwały naprzód konie, lekko bujała się kareta na gumowych obręczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczycielka jeszcze nie słyszała, ale my słyszymy — od pierwszego nieśmiałego razu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech się wygada, bo go tęsknota jak cholera trapi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza mną zapadły głucho w zamek ciężkie, dębowe drzwi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po przerwie: — To, co ostatnio powiedziałem, jest też prawdą, ale nie tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już od lat kilku w lesie przebywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł, że jest rozpięty w oczekiwaniu, jak motyl pomiędzy szpilkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czemu się tak wpatrujesz we mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teresa transportowała tirem do tartaku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Eee, już znamy, już wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie poczułem do niego obrzydzenie, że tylko splunąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiam się, że tego nie zrozumiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On to szponami wyciska pękające wrzody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że niedawno do nas dołączył, ale wydaje mi się, że naprawdę ma potencjał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale pisząc o moich osobistych przeżyciach nie mogę pominąć siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patelnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazik na starość przestał myśleć samodzielnie i zajął się polityką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez oka mgnienie zdawał się upajać zdobytą nagle wiedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chyba zewsząd, bo i leśna jest, i ruczajna, i górska, i wszelaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomiędzy oboma brzegami rozpiął się łuk mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz zasnął na przyrodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozorną lub prawdziwą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co ty się dziś nie obrażasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem taniec słoni… a teraz, już po mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie publiczne musi być organiczne lub mechaniczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żartować nie lubił! — dodał kulawiec, z uznaniem pokręcając głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem się spodziewać, by wiecznie na mnie czekać miała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem, że to zależy od kategorii, ale powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę być spokojnym — zapewnił tamten badając wylot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz o tym i wiesz też, że ona cię kocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarł czoło, zmienił senną pozycję i spojrzał przytomnie po wagonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy myśli tu nas trzymać cały rok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ani to, ani tamto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to jest najwyraźniej w świecie obmierzła twarz konduktora!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jest pan wzorowym narzeczonym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W atelier zapadło głuche milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie Bartek używał ich do okrywania się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz słuszność, Kamo — przyznałem biorąc ją za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem ubrała się też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz na tym nie koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może przypomniały jej się lata miłości i szczęścia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz Podlasiaka rozjaśniła się nagłym pomysłem i poszerzyła z radości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz częściej zatrzymywał się, bezradnie i z przerażeniem oglądając się wokoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba jeszcze głośniej, i pani się rozgniewała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu chyba znowu rozbijamy się o nieuchwytność zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posprzątałem dom i odkurzyłem podłogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa nie miała trzech duchowych ojców ani biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz smutek ten „nie do mnie należał”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden chłopak wiedział, gdzie się pali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chęć snu bez wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabory, Druga Wojna Światowa i powstania to często poruszane wśród Polaków tematy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I złączyli się w długim, przeciągłym pocałunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiany zaszły również na nowej części cmentarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomóc ci?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech no pani pozwoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego włóczysz się koło tego domu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna odchodzi do Emila, który ma osiemnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż ludzie wysiadają przed zamkiem, z miasta, z Pragi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz posępnie słodką pochyliła ku ziemi, w palcach przesuwała korale różańca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Otóż to właśnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybkim krokiem pośpieszyła do pokoju męża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały myślał, że to z powodu niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy mieć grube nieprzyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie muszę im w tym pomagać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Spuchnięcie czasu” dochodzi do niemożliwych rozmiarów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli spóźni ci się autobus, to ewentualnie mogę cię podwieźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze zdziwieniem zauważyła, że w jej domu mieszka dwóch starszych chłopców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzisz — tłumaczył, zatrzymując się przede mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiesz, że to niemożliwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dymy drgnęły, zakołysały się, skłębiły…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A zatem myśl pani przeniosła się na mnie — wyciągnąłem wniosek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Którędy do ratusza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wydajesz mi się przerażona tym wszystkim, moje biedne dziecko! — odezwała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem gotów oddać je za życie Halszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciej był tego pewien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę pani w czymś pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu była granica panowania Amora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy przebiegł go dreszczyk, jak mała mysz, wzdłuż kręgosłupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy chyba raz w życiu odważyła się ostrzej odpowiedzieć ojcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent z objawami grypy trafił dzisiaj do naszej przychodni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj Paweł zatrzymał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I w dodatku, temu brak ręki, a owemu nogi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całkiem innego powodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co tobie, Stasiu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz na swoją obronę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kogoś ty się udał? — rzekł z niesmakiem po dość mitrężnym namyśle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja jeszcze śnię!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dozorca uderzył batem w ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz, teraz mu wbiję igłę do serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wystąpienie Rosjan oburzyło władze chińskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo kaptur i czepiec to prawie to samo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu właśnie tkwi istota symbolu i jedna z zasadniczych zagadek bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może zawrócę, a może nie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stacji, jak zwykle, czekał już mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazuję ci ciągle moje słabe i bezbronne strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mimo wszystko nie trzeba mi było pozwolić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybieraj, póki czas! — zawołał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu zaświtał przed nami wylot sieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę go zachować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po paru dniach rana zagoiła się, nie pozostawiając śladu blizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedł szybko przez Verne’a i Maya do powieści kryminalnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co właściwie stanęło na przeszkodzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesyceni gwarem i krzykiem zeszliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz wyczuwał jeszcze pocieszający uścisk dłoni proboszcza, widział jego zasmucone spojrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto pieczęć — dar mojego ducha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama leżała wciąż w głębokim uśpieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale cierpliwie, żeby nie bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schowali się na centralnej poczcie, w dużej hali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośliznąłeś się, więc wolniej, ostrożniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś takiego trza było teraz zawołać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza nakrywa ją, jak dzwon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetny to orszak widzów, świetny, zaprawdę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropne rzeczy, ale raz trzeba powiedzieć je otwarcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie ma być: „rąk”, napisane: „rak”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecku należy dać wszelkie możliwości do zabaw i rozrywek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pamiątkę — potwierdziła dziwożona, spuszczając oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nasi klienci dowiedzą się, że współpracujemy z takimi ludźmi, mogą wyniknąć kłopoty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic z wykorzystywania sposobności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy na dobre zamilkła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś wie co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak Emil komicznie się zachowywał, gdy mu powiedziałam o łące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On ze swoimi mizernymi orgaźmikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ naturalnie, że mi zależy, nawet bardzo, bardzo zależy — zapewnił gorąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała rozbitą głowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary musiał przyznać, że jest sens w tych wywodach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bachor wrzeszczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej to też zatyka od dech, że nie można żyć wielu żywotami naraz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście są choroby, na które nie ma ratunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był mały pięcioletni Jano i jego świat magii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pewniejsze niż stary jeleń!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawane w tym celu ustawy powinny mieć na względzie przede wszystkim dobro dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20645999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucił się na łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzej towarzysze przykucnęli wokół niego, jak wokół ogniska dla bezpośredniej rozgrzewki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym kończyło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Waga po prostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadrżała w posadach góra, struchleli ludzie i zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak śmiesznie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20646025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi sprawia przykrość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maksimum osiągnąłem jako uczeń ósmej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inżynier drżał z niecierpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Był to jeden z najtęższych w okolicy „szczurów wodnych”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma wśród nas prawa i sprawiedliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618294.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tłukli i pieścili ją oboje na przemian; na złość sobie, nawzajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ubrana była w prostą suknię dorastającej smarkuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nie płakał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co tu się stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona musi być inna od innych lalek — mówiła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej nozdrza drgały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tam ładna ślizgawka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan naczelnik — podkreślił z przekąsem — żartuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Naturalnie, że zapłaci — odpowiedział tymczasem ojciec nie znoszącym wątpliwości tonem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skorzystaj z tego, jeżeli ci życie miłe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynajmniej barwy świąt udało nam się zachować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże nimfy umiały otumanić Fauna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budził ją każdy ruch chłopca, jego chrapanie albo mowa przez sen.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz wszystko ma swój koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda: nie lubiłem Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wsiedliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drodzy państwo, pozwólcie, że już zacznę wykład.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618484.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez namysłu schowałem kukłę do wewnętrznej kieszeni żakietu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy można mieć pytania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem z drzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też zaręczał, że jej chorej matce nie zabraknie niczego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatkiem sił rozwahał ułomną nogę i niby potwornym taranem uderzał nią w przeciwnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta ze szczególnej ochrony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wesela się zagoi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawezwany lekarz oświadczył się za natychmiastową operacją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wszystko ucichło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nagłym oburzeniem kopnęła wór, tuż obok na trawie poległy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem w tej łodzi nie niesiony gestem bohaterstwa, ale wtrącony bez woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że twoje życie tutaj będzie tak samo szczęśliwe jak moje życie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na razie jednak musiałem czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę go wpierw wystawić i obliczyć cenę wraz z karą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród grupy pasażerów u stopnia wagonu powstało zamieszanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Począł zapadać wczesny, zimowy wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zerwał się z posłania i gorączkowo zaczął szukać zapałek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobieństwo często jest nieintuicyjne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamigotała przed oczami latarka krasnoludka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż na stację wtoczył się pociąg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięcie w sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na fotelu, ona usiadła na poręczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie ty go chyba nie kochasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to ja mu to muszę powiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc łatwo się domyślić, dlaczego właśnie jego wybrano, żeby odprowadził Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie jest to zgodne z prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie spieszyło mi się do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z jakiego to przytułku wypuszczono tego jegomościa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki miły — podobny do doktora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie, które nawet w inkubatorze nie miałyby szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto rano wstaje, temu Pan Bóg daje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Eter to kłamca, i to na krótką metę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Człek i wygodę ma, i rozkurczenie wszelakie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo całej baczności nie spostrzegłem powrotu nieznajomego myśliwca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł na szyszce i wsłuchał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miłość i łaska spływały z pałacu chana, zamienionego w świątynię szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa, patrząc na pantofle, zupełnie serio: — Zobaczysz, one się jeszcze zrobią ładniejsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak można sprzeciwiać się pani?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choć przyćmiona długo oczekiwanymi konkurentami, może budzić emocje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie było mnie cały dzień w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas śniadania zobaczył, że narzeczony Krystyny jest dziobaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma w tym nic dziwnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwiejnym krokiem zagłębiłem się pomiędzy zaułki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie brzmi dobrze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewien astrolog… z miasta… którego nazwa wyszła mi z pamięci…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z przeciwnej strony, zza rzeki, nadchodził wolnym krokiem jakiś mężczyzna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Absolutnie nie chciała, aby „on sobie coś myślał”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niechże jasny pan jedzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś nie żałuje, że uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym się zbliżył, aby zbadać jej puls, poznałem straszliwą prawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z zapadniętej głęboko twarzy sterczały kości policzkowe ostro, niemiłosiernie, wyzywająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, wzgórza już opustoszały, a Ludek Górski wywędrował z tych okolic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie zapytał, Ewa nie powiedziała mu nic o wyniku oględzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustrzeliliby go niezwłocznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ano, to żegnam! — ozwał się Billy — Nie przepadam wcale za nimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyły go nieprzeniknione ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Trzeba stąd odjeżdżać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem kłótnie, przypominające sceny małżeńskie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już chcę, mimo tego, że uważam to wszystko za rozpustę umysłową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz czas w piątek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grupki na podwórzu zmieniają się w karawany śmiertelnie przerażonych zwierząt czujących pożar kniei.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633647.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młoda dziewczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazłam na ulicy kotka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę uratować tę odrobinę ziarna, jaka jeszcze pozostała pomiędzy kamieniami młyńskimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnęło go niezdecydowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle zauważył, że dochodzi siódma, godzina spotkania z Jankiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nie w chwili samego gimnastykowania się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem dojmujący chłód wilgoci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Napatrzysz się jeszcze niejednego, zanim odbędziesz całą przeprawę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu tak długo nie wracają?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestia wprawy i nawyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co ja się z nim w ogólę zadaję?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepszy wróbel w garści niż gołąb na dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za osobliwa choroba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż i wpadliśmy w sedno sprawy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie skazano go na wygnanie do wschodniej Syberii, na Kamczatkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że jest martwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zaproponował, abyśmy spróbowali naśladować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzech! — odpowiedział kulawiec, ukazując bez potrzeby zresztą trzy palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Metoda moja jest czysto psychologiczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jaka ładna muszelka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieszkańcy przyzwyczaili się już do ścisku, złego dojazdu do cmentarza oraz korków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A Filip nie miał innego wyboru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieodpowiedni ubiór był powodem przemarznięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię bardzo obserwować go w godzinach porannych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego ty wszystko psujesz? Obejmujesz samo życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633750.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan jedzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakaś wyższa moc splata coraz zwarciej dotychczas rozbieżne tory naszych losów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Diabli was tu wezmą co do nogi, jak nas zgubicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dać mu za żonę najpiękniejszą pannę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przeląkł się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy uczułem, że drży cała i słania mi się w uścisku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W parę minut później pożegnaliśmy się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak — dorzucił sennie — zapłacę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cisza zawisła między wodą a niebem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temat zadania szkolnego: „Opisać wycieczkę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam nową muszlę klozetową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Palą tu zawsze lampę bez potrzeby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zupełnie przypomina kształtem kłącza małego człowieczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego właśnie tam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała mokre włosy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak mimo woli, pod wpływem zapewne dawnych upodobań, liznął dolną wargę językiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem tylko o tym dziwnym człowieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle ryknął jej tuż nad samym uchem sygnał parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tatarak wkrótce zjedzono do szczętu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karykaturalne typy męskie w kostiumach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tak była czarna, że prawie niebieska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz mnie przekląć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była godzina szósta po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani musiała długo stać, tylko nie wiedziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba lodówka nam się popsuła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozbawieni oparcia, nie opuścili nawet swych miejsc dotychczasowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa jest chora na głód świata, ty jesteś chory na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby się wstydziły, że powiedzą nie tak, jak trzeba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz siną pręgę na twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzecz rozciąga się na długie lata — odpowiedział z mocniejszym rumieńcem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnemu we wszystkim ładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Już jem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mógł wysunąć się na łóżko i wpaść w ręce męża?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki on spokojny! — snuł dalsze ogniwo myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy i tak czasu sporo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co teraz będzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla zaprzestania palenia trzeba wybrać odpowiednią chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, kobiety, jakie wy głupie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic panienka nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod prysznicem wpadają mi do głowy najlepsze pomysły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszedł Felek brudny i obdarty, chudy i nieszczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To proszę cię, powiedz mi, że się przeprosiłaś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łódź leży stosunkowo niedaleko Warszawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego oczy wpadają powoli do wnętrza czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z prawdziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrwał dwie kartki z zeszytu i pisał: „Postanawiam dużo o sobie wiedzieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcesz ze mną dalej gadać, to zachowuj się przyzwoicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się jednak, że nie wszystkie osobniki podległy tej klątwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20633833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcieć i nie móc albo nie chcieć i musieć, albo jedno i drugie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie są nasze obrazy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesunąłem się obok katedry i wszedłem w ulicę, którą mi opisano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Goście, dziennikarze i żebracy nie są mile widziani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muzyka płynęła ciągle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego nie pozostaliście we Francji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starszy poszturchiwał go ciągle i szeptał coś groźnym głosem, krzywiąc się przytem szkaradnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspinałem się powoli z gałęzi na gałąź, aż wreszcie doszedłem prawie do wierzchołka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pańskie piekielne sztuczki zawiodły tym razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam panu jednak coś ważnego do powiedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wypadkiem tylko te oba morderstwa zostały udaremnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale kołysała się bez przerwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka minut temu wstecz sarkofag ten był próżny, na co medyk mógł przysiąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem zatem więźniem w tym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmierć mego brata nie rozkrwawiła jej zanadto serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do grobu nie zapomnę tej straszliwej chwili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem tylko, że go się spodziewają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił jeszcze, kiedy zaszło znów coś niezwykłego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyobraź ją sobie zmywaną deszczem, paloną słońcem, smaganą wiatrem przez te długie wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwna jednak rzecz zdarzyła się nocy ubiegłej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W naszym spisie znajdują się przed nim jeszcze dwa nazwiska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z gościńca skręcił na samotną, mało uczęszczaną ścieżkę, wiodącą do domu jego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie podniosła się na mnie żadna ręka, aby mnie aresztować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzeli po sobie zdumieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet pod pierwszem wrażeniem nic nie widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprostował się dumnie, złożył ukłon i rękę zabawnym ruchem przycisnął do serca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwię się, że panu to nie przeszkadza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie o tem każdy mężczyzna i każda kobieta w tej dolinie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy sprowadzi ją powrót trucizny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem dał się słyszeć plusk wioseł i wrzask.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prosimy przygotować bilet odbioru bagażu do okazania przy opuszczaniu terminala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to długa jazda z Berlina do Pirenejów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najgorszy chwast współczesnej cywilizacji, rozkosz plotkarzy i hańba ludzi, mających poczucie własnej godności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem jeszcze na dole jakieś szamotanie się i kilka przekleństw, wyrzeczonych po francusku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok był potężny i często wstaje w mych wspomnieniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komnata, do której wpadłem, była wspaniale oświetlona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy duchy ich wyszły z ciała i mogły się porozumiewać z sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910419.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z czasem przywykł do tego i przestał się tą rzeczą denerwować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podałem mu ją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiwnął mi głową i oddalił się, kulejąc mocno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zaraz temu zaradzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czym piszesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądał o dziesięć lat młodziej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręczę, że Pan Bóg nie będzie się gniewał, chociaż to dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Galopem przypadł ku nam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem słuchać ich nawet od najdawniejszego przyjaciela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I waszych Szkotów spotykałem kilkakrotnie przy robocie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwoli pan, że mu w cztery oczy rzeknę małe słówko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje życie nie znajduje się przynajmniej w niebezpieczeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie, przezywają go za oczami...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Morduj się, zanim się wygrzebiesz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale trzeba się spieszyć, prawnicy bowiem żądają wyników pracy mojej przed rozpoczęciem procesu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógłbyś przestać płakać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zażyję jakiś środek uspakajający nerwy, lub też spróbuję leczyć się metodą elektryzacji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Połączyłem się z towarzyszem i razem wyszliśmy przed bramę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się tam, do cholery, dzieje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedłem za nim, nie mówiąc ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo on przecież żeniąc się z moją siostrą, miał wejść do naszej rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał tuż przy baszcie, szczelnie przyciśnięty do szarego muru i poruszał gorączkowo ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ilu postawilibyście ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co tchu kopnęliśmy się na dół i jęliśmy gorączkowo formować szeregi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po polach szedł chrapliwy, złowrogi, przytłumiony odgłos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co chcesz przez to powiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boże, co za nieprzyzwoite zachowanie się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To rzecz jedyna na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten wymarły Londyn działa mi na nerwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż pułkownik na to?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale jeżeli to nie był pies, to któż to był?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego zachowanie się świadczyło o ostrożności i podejrzeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróćmy jednak do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielkie, pełne kłosy zaczynały właśnie żółknąć, przepyszne żyta sięgały ramienia średniego wzrostu mężczyzny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, to niedorzeczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż dotąd byłem wzorem oficera dla każdego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minęło jeszcze kilka sekund i zaczerniały ramiona, tułów, wreszcie kolana obcego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takiego oblężenia jeszcze nie było w świecie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mierzył z uwagą, i rozglądał się po każdym strzale, wybierał samych starszych, oficerów...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął padać deszcz drobny, przenikliwy, chłodny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież przejścia tych ostatnich dni powinny były czegoś cię nauczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie z ciężkiem westchnieniem poszedłem ku domowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc trzeba ich szanować i czcią otaczać, póki żyją, modlić się do zmarłych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zerwawszy się na równe nogi, ujrzałem na progu jakiegoś człowieka we wschodniem ubraniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to była tylko chwilowa przerwa w grozie srożącej się burzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było widać nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznałem go w mgnieniu oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce jednak, dzięki łaskawemu prawu Natury, zmęczone nerwy przestały reagować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci nie mogą przejść obojętnie koło przystojnej kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo to cieszy mnie to, iż się smucisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tuż pod nami czerniły się wierzchołki, stojących długim sznurem, nieruchomych automobili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inne, niewyraźne postacie ruszają się i gestykulują gwałtownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21910823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesunąłem ją przez otwór, i pomogłem jej doprowadzić znowu deski do porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zdarzenie pozostawiło niemiłe wspomnienie w umyśle młodego medyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieokreślone, fantastyczne podejrzenie ukształtowało się nagle jako coś prawie pewnego i groźnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze dusze nie znajdują się w swych właściwych ciałach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naraz głos Adriatyku ustał i cichym szeptem zaszemrała fala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem dwa podobne, jeden ofiarowałem niegdyś pewnej młodziutkiej Litwince.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przeznaczenie zsyła mi ciebie dziś rano.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To budynek klubowy, jeśli się nie mylę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po kilkunastu minutach, stanęliśmy nad złowrogą przepaścią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Amerykanin uśmiechnął się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysze moi spojrzeli na mnie ze zdumieniem; zakryłem twarz dłońmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze trudy dobiegły oto do ostatecznego końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tutaj nic się nie zmieniło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko stanęło mi w jednej chwili przed oczyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego dnia wieczorem, Estera wyszła odwiedzić chorego dzierżawcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest plan miasta, panie rotmistrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to wąska, pusta uliczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szydercza twarz Oliviera spoważniała i stała się prawie ponurą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy jego upadły na lancę porzuconą przy zwłokach jakiegoś Francuza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cicho stanąłem opodal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unikałem towarzyszy, żadnej z gier nie umiałem oddać się z dawnym zapałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak myślisz, Jerzy, czy nie powinniśmy się modlić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyłącz się do nas!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Garstka szaleńców na wymarłym świecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce przekonaliśmy się, że węch naszego przewodnika nie zawiódł nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klęska była ogólną i przekraczała zakres ludzkiej wiedzy i sił ludzkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolano pewnie ma się lepiej, myślę, że wkrótce wrócisz pan do ukochanego pułku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybiła moja ostatnia godzina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąłbym także twoje kości ucha, jeżeli ich sam nie będziesz potrzebował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakoś wkrótce po jej przyjeździe, spotkałem starego, wychodzącego z naszego folwarku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dały się słyszeć okrzyki, oklaski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I piętnaście lat później jestem największym umysłem dwudziestego pierwszego wieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa moje zrozumiecie lepiej, zanim niewiele jeszcze dni upłynie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilami wybuchały oklaski i śmiechy, niekiedy złorzeczenia, przekleństwa i groźby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie stało się nic podobnego; jakiegoś więźnia wprowadzono spokojnie do przyległej celi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko po moim trupie mogli się dostać do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa jej ścięły mi krew w żyłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto wyrok, który usłyszałem z miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy tak mówiłem, podniosłem rękę do góry i wskazałem przed siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas tej sprawy z obrazami spotkałem ją po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zaś słuchałem niestworzonych bredni z zapartym prawie oddechem, cały w pobożnem skupieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukała mnie, gdy odbiegłem, wyszperała w najdoskonalszej kryjówce, wykrzykiwała wtedy z radością: „Ach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po twarzach obu mężczyzn ściekał pot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie oderwę się od pracy i czekać będę na to uspokojenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Willa ta oddaloną była o kilkadziesiąt metrów od wybrzeża rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu poza barykadą znajdowała się nasza straż przednia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To coś znaczy, moi panowie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idź stąd, pókiś cały!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowczo było to coś niezwykłego i natychmiast postanowiłem wyświetlić podejrzaną sprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też koniecznie trzeba mierzyć w głowę, albo w konia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomysł pański jest świetny, milordzie, ja sam zawiozę was wszystkich do Londynu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dałem żadnej odpowiedzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu zapanowało milczenie, które przerwał ostry dzwonek telefonu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem przygotowany na zwalenie całego gmachu, zanimby jej dotknęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech pan to przeczyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrodzony instynkt odezwał się we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstrętną jest sama myśl, że ona ma stać się własnością tego bydlaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokoleniu naszemu niezwykłe przeznaczenie musi przypaść w udziale, skoro jesteśmy świadkami takich wypadków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słyszałem nic, ale wiedziałem, że krzyczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21933733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas, jaki nam pozostaje do życia, możemy obliczyć co do minuty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz znajdziemy pani telefon, proszę się nie martwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bał się jej, mimo że była naprawdę grzeczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na gwiazdkę postanowiłem sobie sprawić smartwatcha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócił do pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał minę wesołą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to? — zawołał, wskazując na trawę o kilka kroków od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jakże mi brak tu zieleni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płakał od ósmego roku życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los smutny odniósł walne zwycięstwo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy ciebie nie cierpią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem kupić cukier zwykły czy trzcinowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dorośli, i dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przygotowania skończone — rzekł, wstępując w obręb koła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyzywał wszędzie na turniej królewskich pieśniarzy i zawsze odnosił zwycięstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem jej zaraz o tobie, ale wybuchnęła tylko śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże mu było na imię? — spytał ciekawie jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyleczył pana człowiek bez doktorskiego dyplomu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostęp ze wszystkich stron odcięty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre pnie złociły się wypukle, niby oszklone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan się myli w tym wypadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednym słowem gówno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Alkohol był jedną z przyczyn kolizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowił iść do niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blada jak płótno obsunęła się bez pamięci w moje ramiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fryzjer jest czynny od poniedziałku do piątku w godzinach od ósmej do osiemnastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec torbę swoją poklepał pieszczotliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno tylko niepokoi Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdawało mi się, że nad strumieniem wszystko się wyjaśni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz powrócę jeszcze kiedyś w chwały dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie, niesie koszyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiem! — rzekł z zachwytem, czując, że otucha wstępuje mu do duszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagłe jego przyjście na świat nie wywarło na nich głębszego wrażenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy powitaniu wyczytałem w jej oczach utajoną obawę i niepewność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chciałbym z tobą trochę pogawędzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się pożegnać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożar nie jest nawet zabawą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem tegoż wieczora dostałem zaproszenie na występ w prywatnym mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wstrząsnęła złocistą grzywą i schyliwszy głowę na bok, kolejno spojrzała na wszystkich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Latem dojeżdżam rowerem, a zimą autobusem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, gdy już wszystko wiadomo… — zaczął uroczyście Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki z błyskawiczną szybkością poprawił torbę, sposobiąc ją do zamierzonego celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeka, kiedy zaczną znów rozpytywać, kim jest i skąd przybył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo wysoko ubezpieczony!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby ktoś zapytał mnie, czy jestem patriotą lokalnym, odpowiedziałbym, że tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może dzisiaj zjemy pizzę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie kroki czyjeś zbliżyły się do drzwi biblioteki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, tak — tym dziwniejsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc między nami, o ile to oczywiście odpowiada twym planom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie potrafiłem sobie sam ze sobą poradzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed samą wieczerzą wrócili do obozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król usiłował znaczącymi spojrzeniami zachęcić swego poetę do ostatniego wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karolina chodziła rankiem po tych alejach i odnalazła ślady kopyt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo ładnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na leśnej, na polanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze na miejsce jednego powieszonego stawało do walki dziesięciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystko trzeba po kolei powiedzieć…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże mogę to wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem pociąg ruszył w dalszą drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może i słyszałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po skończeniu nauki nie mogłem wytrzymać w domu, a jednocześnie nieznośny był mi gość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między dwoma miastami wyrósł kamienny mur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zasadę tę stosuje się zarówno w stosunku do dziecka, jak i do jego rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Najbliższa zginęła od bolszewików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łaskawie przyjął ich spojrzenia i wyprostował się uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ta wyspa jest za blisko lądu, gdzie mieszkają Murzyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę myślałem, że to twój kolega z pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno skończyć, gdy się zaczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oczach jej czytałem, iż zapomniała, że tu jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o oznaczeniu odpowiednich elementów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybyliśmy za wcześnie i musieliśmy czekać w kolejce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrócił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre z nich, pierzchając w rozsypkę, szukały piwnicznego schronu po jarach i krzewach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedna jaskółka wiosny nie czyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo nie rozmawiałyśmy, a tylko tyle masz do powiedzenia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni napadają, a drudzy kryją się i uciekają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apetyt rośnie w miarę jedzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy zerwali się z miejsc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy znacie tekst pieśni Schuberta „Der Todt und das Madchen”? Jest dziwnie dwuznaczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy uzyskała pani odpowiednie informacje o celu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna ma dwadzieścia cztery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na morzu zaskoczyła ich taka sobie burza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Manna po niemiecku, a Manna tak swobodnie, jak Emil po polsku S.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy nim jest klęcznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się śmieją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak obojętny jest na pozór list Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozglądam się ciekawie po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanadto może szkoła pędzi, jakby kto poganiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łaskawa pani czegoś się przelękła, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jeszcze nie dowód!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie pomykali tymi chodnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Setki komunikatorów obejmują cały nasz świat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to sprytnie obmyślane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miód jest słodki i zdrowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno było pewne: jeżeli nie złapią Maciusia, już się nie uspokoi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapach bije spod podłogi, bo to jest szczytowa ściana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam jej zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boisz się, że w pewnym momencie nie będziesz wiedziała, gdzie się znajdujesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś kiedy prywatny wagon?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę ci poza tym donieść, że za miesiąc wychodzi moja epidemiologia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko mnie powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazwisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apollo, chcąc objąć Daphne — objął krzew laurowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co potem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olsztyn to nie tylko jeziora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pamiętam kiedy ostatni raz widziałem policjanta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A cóż mamy zrobić? — odezwał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiarkował od razu! — rzekł do Podlasiaka, wskazując ramieniem przyjaciela i chełpiąc się jego zgadliwością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech nie ginę bez zasługi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym się różni genialność życia od genial- ności twórczości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Woda jaśniała spokojnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jestem w tej chwili nastrojony towarzysko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak byłoby najciekawiej, najlepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pompuje się wodę, robi się studnie podziemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie smoki i całe Indie stąd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie pod ciśnieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak szczebiotała, a ja z niepojętym zachwytem spoglądałem na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepszy wróbel w garści niż gołąb na dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Marcinku, trzeba na lekcji uważać — upomina pani łagodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech Bóg ma pana w swej opiece.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"” Emil: — Nosisz dzisiaj wstrętne pantofle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardziej wierzę naukowcom niż politykom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałeś kiedyś tego człowieka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co on sobie o niej pomyśli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różne rodzaje ciemności, poprze- rzynane błyskawicami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wcisnąwszy mi w rękę bilet wizytowy, przepadła w półmroku zarania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz iść do kina na „Hotel du Nord”? — Nic nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za osobliwa choroba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie, które nawet w inkubatorze nie miałyby szans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bona lubi wychodzić, wtedy przychodzi tutaj Marta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to nawet rzecz przynosząca dochód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero później ocenił, że to było bezczelnie sprytne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ci też nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdopodobnie przez owe trzy dni nie spał wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To chodzenie na spacer było jeszcze nudniejsze niż siedzenie w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pola musiała nim potrząsać, zanim oprzytomniał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przebudziłem się… — powtórzył z namysłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdziło się to na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przygotował się kretyn do tej nocy bohaterskiej jak toreador.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię do ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szafach leżą tablice gliniane z asyryjskimi hieroglifami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie można z tobą mówić po ludzku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę jeść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest jej kuzynem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do jaru! — zawtórował jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, wszystko jedno!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postanowili iść do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie był na pogrzebie i nie pokazał się trzy dni w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z chłopaków znalazł naszą przyczepę, a raczej jej szczątki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie śmiała się teraz wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tego spotkania, po którym nie mogła już od niego odejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Czy widzisz te krowy tam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mama miała dzwonić, jako koleżanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Król popełnił wobec ciebie niesprawiedliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem szczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrzekłem się jej dobrowolnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy się tak dalej spotykać jak dotychczas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co myśleć, czy zdrowa, czy się co złego nie stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął rozwiązywać mały woreczek ze skóry renifera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale gdyby się tak mogło wciąż mi wydawać… niechby tak było!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taki daszek przy wejściu do pałacu, taką bramę w murze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I oto rozpaliła się ta okropna wojna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczył, że Józia jest ubrana do wyjścia, ale siedzi na stołku i płacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20820335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczciwy stary zuch!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja widzę, że on będzie siedział do drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po całym mieście i wypożyczam do niej płyty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego przecież trzeba załatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pierwszy tydzień zapisywał Maciuś, ile dni jest w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciała rozstaju, ma rozstaj! Niech gada! — gorącował się kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszła mimo jak symbol cierpienia i śmieszności splecionych w tragiczny węzeł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil połykał ciągle ślinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój pies dostaje smakołyki za robienie sztuczek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nie ma sensu przekonywać, tłumaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął przylepiać się do niej, zdrabniać jej imię, nazwy części ciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się jest czynnością rytualną, prastarą, jak miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A do tego to piekielne wprost wykończenie wykonania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ty umiesz zawsze uspokoić mnie, Jur!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Świetnie sobie poradził, nieprawdaż!? — pytałem z dziecinną radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, od jutra, od jutra — trudno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę zostawiać tylko cyfr dla statystyki, chcę przyszłą historię wzbogacić w dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to rzeczy zupełnie niewspółmierne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dziwię się wcale, że wywołuje taki popłoch wśród dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zatem podać mi rękę i sprowadzić do gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muzyka i gramofon z dołu psują powagę wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Odprowadzę cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejmujesz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma to, jak we własnym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kościół nie identyfikuje się z żadną specjalną formą rządów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał może czterdzieści lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gasiła światło, rozbierała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie jest lewica, jest prawica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy chyba raz w życiu odważyła się ostrzej odpowiedzieć ojcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziemniaki i jajka w zupełności wystarczą, nic innego w diecie nie potrzebuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się pan woźny nie zgodzi, to niech sam go wyrzuci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, panie Andersen!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łódź nasza bardzo ucierpiała — odrzekł Dan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddałby, oddał na pewno, bo chciałby pozostać uczciwym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznali się w konserwatorium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruchome masy gadów porcelanowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego to miałoby u niej wywołać objawy chorobliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he! — zarechotało coś w drugim kącie przedziału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodził z kąta w kąt i coś tam mruczał pod nosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec przemilczał, coraz zapalczywiej oddając się namysłom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment był tragiczny; wszyscy oczekiwali katastrofy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciąża byłaby dla Stelli prawdziwą katastrofą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie ulęknę się ciebie, o smoku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasztan zaczął z wolna wydzielać swój nocny zapach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzysiek i Aga dołączyli do reszty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak trzeba, tak być powinno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617991.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili wszedł Filip zupełnie tak, jakby wchodził po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała szeroko otwarte oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby się chciało trochę przesadzać, można by powiedzieć, że jego zdania mogą zabijać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż mnie i tak całej nie posiadasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Depesza pewno gdzieś tu leży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co do mnie mówisz? — pyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim zawahał się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie miarodajnym jest tylko ruch parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo i władze państwowe powinny otaczać szczególną opieką dzieci niemające rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy to nie za słodkie, jak na wino?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, jeśli przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś spojrzał smutnemu królowi prosto w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał, podszedł do okna i zobaczył niebieską mgłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem, że nasza załoga była przygotowana na podobne zajście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej nie zlezę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były nastawione ku północnemu zachodowi, gdzie jeszcze niebo jaśniało dość pogodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież wiesz, że nie będziesz jej czytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeśli nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem swą pracę i zauważyłem niebawem, że zbliżający się egzamin to sprawa pilna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zdziwiło mnie, że pierwszy raz płacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieczorem wrzód pękł sam bez przecinania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pałac Branickich jest zabytkiem wartym obejrzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20631999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu potrzebna gimnastyka, musztra, one mogą być dobre albo złe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma dziwny rytm ta piosenka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotnie Klementyna była królową balu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil zobaczył go, jak spał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nieważne, czyja będę o tym wiedziała, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak zamilkł i palcem potarł sęk nad prawym okiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Daremny trud, drzwi są szczelnie zasłonięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiwnął jej głową, uśmiechnął się i poszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mimo wszystko zrobiłabyś tak, jakbyś chciała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno skończyć, gdy się zaczyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i Wojtek nic a nic nie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjący i umarły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pamiętam kiedy ostatni raz widziałem policjanta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mruknął: — No, to co? Wtedy ona też poczerwieniała i przestała mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam się nachylić? — spytał pokornie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro pójdziemy w góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżyc wchodził pomału, jak aktor na scenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak przy lądowaniu samolotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju ciekawie obejrzał bratanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiedz, Felek, dlaczego taki jesteś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o to…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uszczelniliśmy je gałęziami, umocowawszy kamieniami i przysypawszy grubą warstwą śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pisali do siebie listy, począwszy od trzeciego miesiąca znajomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może o dwunastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to podczas obiadu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może i słyszałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem: — Przepraszam cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pamiętam — odparł, biorąc skwapliwie do ręki woskowy odlew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dawano byle jaką cenę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tej reguły nie warto już opisywać, tak jest znana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dla niego nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem opowiadał jej, jak i co myśli o świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ilość plastiku którą produkujemy jest zatrważająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwie zaczęło się od grania, bo u mnie w pokoju jest rozklekotane pianino.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gondola odbijała od brzegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto garść szczegółów zebranych przeze mnie u sąsiadów i znajomych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja boję nawet ruszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajrzałem przez wybitą szybę w głąb trzeciej izby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całą noc ich tam chyba nie zostawisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę opowiedzieć, jak do tego doszło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął poruszać się niespokojnie na łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyła nas atmosfera hali targowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sekretarz wyjął notatnik i ołówek z kieszeni surduta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam cię, ale koperta jest zaklejona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W co chcesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam ochotę iść z jakimś gówniarzem na wodę sodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech patrzy — powtórzył jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robiła w tej chwili Hela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona była uparta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo to licho przecież nie je, nie pije, tylko wyśmiewaniem żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daremne byłoby usiłowanie spać w noc taką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów, Tereso, w dziewczynę się zmień!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodziło tylko o zobaczenie tego, co jest na dnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do gardła można mu zajrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągał ramiona, mruczał, prychał, wyginał kręgosłup jak łuk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed chwilą żona, teraz mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy mu się marsz pogrzebowy, był to bowiem wojownik nieustraszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widziałeś kiedy prywatny wagon?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwnie ruch się wzmaga na namacalnie ciemnym podwórzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za drzwiami matka krzyczaia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzeba wyrzeczenia się — tylko za tę cenę można pokonać to wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co niczyje, to i nasze być może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie mogę: tak mnie coś ściskało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on to robi z umysłu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Jak gwiazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panno Zofio, dzisiaj mnie znowu wezmą!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazywają go Przyjacielem całego świata, a zowią go także Przyjacielem gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pauza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tata! — woła dziewczynka, biegnie do Maciusia; rączki wyciągnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widział jej twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad Wisłą standardowo tłumy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci i ryby głosu nie mają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z literatury rosyjskiej uznawał tylko Dostojewskiego i Babla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I potem dziesiątki wejść i wyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tobie się podobał ten głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dominującą religią w Polsce jest katolicyzm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, znów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kara boska, kara boska…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urósł potężnie w siłę, odkąd nam uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz się ścigać z tramwajem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrasta ze mnie powoli, jak roślina, żywię go, napycham go sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, a teraz, panienko, czas wstawać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To stało się ideałem mego życia i przysiągłem sobie zostać co najmniej sekretarzem sądu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I znów wywołuje, kto jest, kogo nie ma, kto się spóźnił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do nauki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem w nędzy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuł się jak wykolejeniec…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą twarze obu po zajściu metamorfozy były zupełnie różne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie o czymś głęboko się zamyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to są skutki alkoholu, rzec by można, dodatnie, ale chwilowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli ktoś jest zawsze wesoły, a raz smutny, najbardziej żal wtedy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwieram z łomotem tylne drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z daleka zabłysła latarka prosto w oczy i zgasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem jednakże, czy mógł czytać dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O tych podziemiach chodziły po mieście tylko głuche wieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20632539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponowne wizje miniaturowych twarzyczek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokój ten był zupełnie taki sam, jakim go widział poprzednim razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powieki rycerza drgnęły, uczucie litości musnęło jego serce na jedno okamgnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy wyjechał nagle do Europy, upewniłem się, że tak było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko już w porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili jednak wróciła mu przytomność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gazetom sowieckim zabroniono pisać o tem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili zaczął piać kogut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to fraszka, bo i polityk może być zakochany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby błyskawica zapaliła się w nim i zgasła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porozmawiali obydwaj przez chwilę, poczem skinęli obydwaj głowami i spojrzeli w moją stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, ale tutaj wszystko już przygotowane?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinęła głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I, jakby odgadła myśl Staszka, dodała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Do dzielnicy żydowskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jest chyba ciężko umierać, kiedy się nie umiera samemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Większość z pomiędzy nas ma go już powyżej uszu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konie potykały się co chwila, nogi im wpadały w nory królików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może zmiany atmosferyczne tak wpłynęły na ich światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strząsnął na świeżą zieleń złociste kropelki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liza nagrodziła tę lojalną manifestację łaskawym skinieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle podniósłszy rękę natrafiłem na pustą przestrzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dosłowna prawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przekonałeś ją pan, że to hołota?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka miła muszelka, taka jedyna na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mi zaufasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A z twarzy też nie wyglądała na żebraczkę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu ruch jakiś wszczął się na rynku i przerwał jej mowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skoczyłem, jak opętany, zrzuciłem płaszcz i poskoczyłem co sił za mordercą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zrażają pana stosy przeszkód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okrywała ją szata obszerna i biała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"żyj długo, sprawiedliwy panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor spojrzał zdziwiony i trochę zgorszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawa ma się tak, że o świtaniu ptaszek przyleci do swego gniazdka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz gra rozpoczęła się na dobre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto występowały liczne formy mieszane pomiędzy głównymi typami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tam za bardzo nie narzekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ania pewnie o tym zapomniała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy krok do odzyskania wolności był zrobiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim się rok skończy, bylibyście sierżantem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja patrzę tylko na to wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się teraz czujesz, kiedy dostałeś pierwszy dyplom?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez ciebie szumi mi w uszach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Masz tu ten twój kapelusz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olbrzymie, chwiejące się kraty, zielonkawe, odlegle światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odźwierny grubym palcem wskazuje na planie miasta Pragi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwie dziewczyny przechadzały się przed jego domem, czekając na kogoś albo nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toteż Marek dzwonił co sił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinąłem mu na znak, iż może się zdać na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Początkowo był katedrą Bytomskiego Seminarium Nauczycielskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łukasz nie miał pojęcia, co się właściwie stało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tylko było mu trochę przykro, że Starski siedzi obok Izabeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest bardzo przystojny i byłby z niego dzielny żołnierz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żem się tej nocy spuścił równo sześć razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlatego też nie zwracałem uwagi na jej kaprysy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj detektywi potrząsnęli głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może kiszkę kaszaną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może pan jeszcze coś o nim wie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż to znaczy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W stosunku do młodych ludzi nie można popierać podobnych kaprysów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze się przekonacie, że ludzkość pokona zaraza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cierpi na tym braku sił fachowych produkcja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina trzynasta dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649592.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Chartum leży tam, gdzie Nil Biały i Niebieski schodzą się i tworzą jedną rzekę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Woda w imbryku zaśmiała się i z sykiem wyskoczyła na blachę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okazało się, że był to dach namiotu, który uderzenie wichru przyniosło aż tutaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jutro mam zaplanowane kolokwium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gigabajt pamięci to sporo na same zdjęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możesz pan pozostać w ukryciu i zdać się na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649602.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Teraz weźmiemy się do nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wydobył księgi, umaczał pióro i, nibyto, zaczął rachować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozłożył list i czytał: „Panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie chcieli mnie tak łatwo wypuścić, ci eleganccy myśliwi na lisy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osłupiałem i przystanąłem na chwilę, nie wiedząc, co począć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po długiej podróży zauważyłem nareszcie, iż przybiliśmy do lądu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W białym płaszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przekonany, że się zgodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wyślesz drugiej depeszy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Plecak cię zbyt nie obciąża?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nel oparła główkę o kolana starej Dinah i usnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś pogoda przynajmniej piękna i nie będzie tak, jak wczoraj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dajny to także pieśni ludyczne, wyrażające radość z uciech życia doczesnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko kiedy w życiu, panowie, znajdowałem się w tak brzydkiem położeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na honor, to coś mi powiedział dotąd, bardzo mnie ubawiło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aha, szuflada odsunięta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie był tu panem i rządził wszystkimi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.628,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże mi przyjemnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pasterz i zaklęta dziewica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodzony w Egipcie, mówił po arabsku jak Arab.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle wstał i zadzwonił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze swym mężem, czy płakać, czy pod ziemię schować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojsko konetabla niespodziewanie stanęło pod Rzymem, i przypuściło szturm do wałów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczerze mówiąc, Twitter jest dla mnie zbyt... wciągający.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle uczyniła się straszliwa cisza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, za nic!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zostać przy niej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyrok wykonano w stosownym czasie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chce rzucić te okolicę, gdzie strach przed tymi ludźmi czyni nasze życie przykrem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To bezinteresowne wyznanie, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Początek jest nawet niezwykle wesoły!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wycieczki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otwórz oczy, otwórz bodaj na chwilę oczy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ci się podoba?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowieka, który w każdej ręce trzyma wiadro wody, nie pytają, czego chce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za widok!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serca Francuzów targała rozpacz i oburzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj wieczór zaznałem jednak rzadkiej uciechy, jaką jest samotność wśród tłumu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stu oczekujących górników stało bez ruchu i bez sił, sparaliżowani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puścili się pędem wśród ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uradowana zbiegła do morza i wyciągnęła ku nim ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapomnij o tym. On jest poza wyobrażeniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc to wyjął z kieszeni centymetr i dużą okrągłą lupę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minuta ma sześćdziesiąt sekund.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmuszony bowiem będę przeciwstawić się pewnym powszechnie uznanym pojęciom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan cierpi na artystyczną eiacuiatio praecox.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Drogi panie Holmes“, pisze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce drętwego kurczu dotykały znów mego gardła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem zapukał ktoś do drzwi werandy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba pół kilo zdołasz unieść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Masz ci los!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Synu mój, nigdy już nie zobaczymy twojego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wyskoczywszy z ukrycia, rozpoczęliśmy straszliwą rzeź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona wybuchała głoś nym śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ode mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pocieszyło go to i owo, a nade wszystko perspektywa swobody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W osobnej kolumnie, złożonej w ostatniej chwili, przeczytał: „Napad na Redakcję Gońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zapłaciłbym i to dobrze“, rzekł „gdybym dowiedział się czegoś odpowiedniego dla redaktora“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiększone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj poznałem go natychmiast.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do wielu z nich wjechałem jako zwycięzca na czele ośmiuset mych dzielnych jeźdźców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba nam znaleźć łączący ich łańcuch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pewnym czasie Gebhr i Idrys, pogodzeni już z sobą, porozciągali na ziemi opończe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stara się o nią ktoś inny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mimo wszystko to jest trochę niebezpieczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinała powoli, prawie pedantycznie szlafrok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daj mi kącik w twym domu i weź za swoją niewolnicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko przegrywa dolara i idzie spać do sionki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem sprawdzają się pańskie przepowiednie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmieszany śpiewa szeptem sam sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gromkie okrzyki powitały ten wspaniały pochód; radość tłumu przeszła granice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez drogę pomknęło z ogromnym hałasem czteroosobowe lando, zaprzężone w czwórkę koni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co do pistoletu, będzie na ciebie czekał, o ile się nie mylę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłączył znowu piąte koło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twoje przerażenie i wyobraźnia dopełniły reszty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrz na mnie, Emilko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wy cały czas tylko internet i smartfony!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie spotkał nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalsze wypadki dowiodły znów, że wnioskowałem słusznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż strach pomyśleć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie trzeba mi było tego dwa razy powtarzać, to też wybiegłem czem prędzej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciemności otulały zwolna długi, ponury dom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż nie słuszne tedy, że pragnę go zobaczyć raz jeszcze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale odpowiedź na twoje zabójcze pytanie nie jest tak prosta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, więc zgoda, pani zostanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim razie sprawa mogła mieć następujący przebieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ni wśród całej rozlicznej szlachty zaściankowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Suche, nieustające mamrotanie jakiegoś tygrysa gazet w mojem sąsiedztwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było śladów walki, nie miała też ofiara broni, którą mogłaby zranić napastnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet psy przestały ujadać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak widzimy dobrze dnia użył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A mama? — Mama jest u wariatów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu poczęstował go cygarem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musisz mi go pokazać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chowa się w bukiecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25649865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozdrawiam wszystkich z okazji dzisiejszego święta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem w tej łodzi nie niesiony gestem bohaterstwa, ale wtrącony bez woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szkołach powinni uczyć o podatkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włączyłem dziesięć przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z lepszych thrillerów jakie widziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam, żeby pisać i opracować w formie pisemnej relacje tych osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedź pan — powiedział, ale sanitariusz nie odjeżdżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urodziłam dwójkę dzieci, ale wraz z mężem chcielibyśmy mieć trójkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma nikogo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pójdźmy już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miarę zbliżania się nocy wzrastała zaciekłość huraganu i rosła siła deszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na leśnej, na polanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— One są jak Bernard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla dwojga przyjaciół wyglądał z bohaterska po zbójecku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Idź po mamę! Była ogromna, biała, ciepło buchało od niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To naprawdę było przyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co to panu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Temperamenty: spala się w każdym zdaniu, napisanym czy wypowiedzianym, i odradza się w następnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co on sobie o niej pomyśli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał, podszedł do okna i zobaczył niebieską mgłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo gorliwych poszukiwań nigdzie nie można go było wytropić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zacząć od samego mojego wyboru książki na nasze zajęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwudziestego dziewiątego czerwca imieniny obchodzą Piotr i Paweł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po wrzaskach i płaczu mocno jej się spało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem: pies, który dużo szczeka, nie gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie jest lewica, jest prawica.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po paru dniach rana zagoiła się, nie pozostawiając śladu blizny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekł tylko jeden żołnierz, dwóch leżało z przestrzelonymi głowami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedząc o zmroku nad stawem i słuchając, jak powiew wiatru wzdycha żałośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obrażała się dziesięć razy na dzień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem, otoczony zewsząd ludźmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znamienne połączenie wizerunków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem przy sobie ucznia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakby człowiek miał cztery ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żebym miał pieniądze, tobym mu mleka kupił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam określonego tytułu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obaj odetchnęli głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Którędy do ratusza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I czuję tak samo wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była własność cudza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gwarantuje to chyba dobroć tego opisu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci powitały go radośnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pomyliłeś się, bratku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok reszta! — krzyknął Podlasiak, podniecony otrzymanym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałoby mi się gadać o ich życiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często okazuje się, że jest zbyt zrównoważony i zrobiony za logicznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Próbowałaś kiedyś malować wewnętrzną stronę skrzydełek nosowych? — Jesteś matoł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ulicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stawię się w słowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20797797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wiedzie te hordy ku krwawemu dziełu zbrodni, zemsty lub kary?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20818254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dawniej byłam uczennicą… nawet szczególnie wyróżnianą… ale teraz…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20818255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znaczy to bynajmniej, że chirurg się mylił. Całe życie operował wątłe ludzkie istoty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20818256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wyganiasz? — zawołała, nie mogąc się powstrzymać dłużej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20818257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezrozumiała twoja mowa, bracie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20818258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy maślanka jest lepsza od kefiru?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837296.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak osioł usłyszał: „stój!”, to od razu ruszył z miejsca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śliwa nad stawem wyglądała jak kleks atramentowy na takimże tle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bateria rozładowała się w mgnieniu oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sama nie wiem — odpowiedziała Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten młody człowiek jest nie mniej od ciebie pogrążony w rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina dwunasta piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sfrunął wiatr z drzewa i bawi się z chłopcami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Głupstwo, mój drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież mi obiecałaś…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Henry zaśmiał się zuchwale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucho prezesa. To było dosyć śmieszne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te luki to błędy i omyłki ludzkie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektórzy chodzili niespokojnie między pakunkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był zupełnie pewien, że po jej przejściu wrócą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczął wpychać... daremnie, chociaż ruszał zadem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Byłoby to wcale stosowne zakończenie! — odrzekłem z naciskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo mu dobrze w tej narożnej kamienicy w rynku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za to uczeni w piśmie, penis - określają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kieł podszedł dość prędko, ale nie porywczo. Nieśmiały był i jakby obserwujący sam siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty jesteś nerwowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od chwili, gdy ich ślubna przywiozła kareta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daj Bóg pogodę, przed zachodem słońca staniemy na miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś zatrzymał sie w jednej chwili, gdyż istotnie za pelikanami było widać purpurowe kwiaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszała pierwsze głosy ptaków w gęstwie bambusu otaczającej odległe domy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmietniki, dużo kotów, przemknął szczur.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dojedziemy tylko do Nilu, a Nilem do El-Wasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Rząd egipski nie zabrał tam nikomu wolności - rzekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cienkie nóżki grzęzły w piachu, ledwo je mógł wyciągnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jajach się pogłaskał, spojrzał na żoneczkę:\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pragnęłabyś, aby wszystko tutaj w młynie pozostało po dawnemu, prawda, Lizo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie poślemy tego szala na wystawę paryską!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jezus Nazareński chodził po falach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przezywać tu od myszek tego rozbójnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli w Dawson otworzysz buzię, każę cię wyrzucić z miasta. Zrozumiane?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kobieta nie musi się długo uczyć tych rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od powiedziała bardzo wolno, jąkając się: — Widzisz, ty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rząd egipski i Anglicy ją taili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otóż tego to chuja chciał Tadeusz Zosi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nie dostaniesz kawy - oświadczył Henry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał uważnie i aż podskoczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I trochę betelu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod koniec obiadu Staś jął wypytywać, dlaczego rząd egipski zabrał wszystkie kraje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podał jej ostudzoną, bez cukru, albowiem słodycze zwiększają pragnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ja myślę, Henry... - zaczął Bill.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20837374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I na dowód tej przyjaźni Biały Kieł weźmie żywy udział w pogrzebie roześmiał się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352603.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cztery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sześć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"siedem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Firefox\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeden\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dziewięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"trzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"osiem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"pięć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zero\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysoki młodzieniec trzymał kobietę w ramionach swoich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odzyskałem tymczasem już moją zwykłą odwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakżebym chciał tego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wszystko potoczy się dawnym trybem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pogardą śmierci oczekiwałem teraz, co nastąpi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim razie nie zważajcie na to, com mógł mówić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po długiej podróży zauważyłem nareszcie, iż przybiliśmy do lądu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszałem i ja jakieś zmieszane głosy przed oknami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc prawdopodobnie zamieszka w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemuż ten sam proces nie miałby się powtórzyć po raz drugi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprowokowali mnie do tego, gdyż chcieli sobie ze mnie zażartować!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bardzo proste i bardzo użyteczne, ale ludzie mało się tem posługują.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Praca moja dobiega końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesień już się kończyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sierżant zaczął śmiać się wreszcie z naszego zachwytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko oczy zarysowywały się całkiem dobitnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąłbym także twoje kości ucha, jeżeli ich sam nie będziesz potrzebował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie koniec na szczęście!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Niemoc, skuwająca dotychczas moje członki, opuściła mię natychmiast po jego wyjściu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"w takim razie niech się twe życzenie spełni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj poznałem go natychmiast.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczby, zestawione przeze mnie, znajdują się w rękach adwokata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na karku czułem jego gorący oddech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarze zwrócone mieli ku nam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotnie opanowałem się, czułem, że potrafię rozpoznać i powściągnąć chorobliwe odruchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artykuł zaciekawił niezmiernie cały świat naukowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ściągnęła brwi mocno, lecz nie odpowiedziała ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochłonąwszy trochę, unieśliśmy zemdlonego i położyli wygodnie na ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minęło znowu kilkanaście minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wolne żarty, drogi panie!— zaprzeczył nieznajomy z uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę, aby pan poświadczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widział nic, oprócz tych dwojga ramion ściskających gwałtownie jego szyję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozbiorę biedaka tymczasem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle w ciemnościach zabłysło światło; reflektor sygnału morskiego zalał jasnem światłem całą zatokę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przestałem i zacząłem nadsłuchiwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął kapelusz i szybko wyszedł z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Człowiek ten pochował trzy żony i uczestniczył w dwunastu walnych bitwach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za pozwoleniem waszem, zacni panowie, przystąpimy do zapowiedzianego doświadczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mniejsza o to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Minuty za minutami upływały długie, niby wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat drogo opłacił tą naukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"więc to dlatego pan zachowywał się tak dziwnie w sygnałowej wieży!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie należało przypuszczać, iż wtargnie tędy, gdzie będziemy się najmniej spodziewać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widok okropny, przerażający!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak uczyniłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniosłem do góry habit i wdrapałem się na drzewo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powstanę z krzesła, dopóki nie skończę ostatniej księgi, nie zestawię liczb ostatnich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzucam myśl, uważając, że uznawanie jej lub przeczenie w obecnych warunkach byłoby bezcelowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez długą chwilę było cicho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na własne oczy widziałem jak wyleciała z pokoju niczem oparzona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22352857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili wdarliśmy się na szczyt wzgórza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A buteleczka od razu bęc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech no pani pozwoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy psuję go, i nagle zaczyna się w nim coś poruszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Największą część dnia pochłaniało polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem jak woda, która przylega do ścian naczynia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz jeszcze zamroczyły się oczy kalifa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem na portalach poświęconych kinematografii film otrzymał dość słabe oceny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki i kulawiec ze czcią na ów sęk teraz spojrzeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety w moim wieku są coraz starsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadał szeroko o jej piersiach w swoich wykładach na Universite Perverse.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedł szybko przez Verne’a i Maya do powieści kryminalnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Detale na ten temat później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równocześnie zabrzmiała trąbka i pociąg ruszył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobi się awantura.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nieokreślone, ale pewne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W oczach naszych sosna skonała…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze było przed kolacją i nudził się, i przykrzyło mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675989.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„My nimi jesteśmy” — brzmiała nasza odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I od tego czasu ludzie przestali się odradzać i zaczęli umierać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ojciec zawołał go i powiedział: — Wiesz Emil, będziesz miał brata albo siostrę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to jaka mistyfikacja?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten moment operacyjny zaszedł znacznie wcześniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20675999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzysiek i Aga dołączyli do reszty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegł za nimi również hałas kawiarni, lecz oni byli poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie żal go wam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wierzę w nią ani trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On przyszedł po ten nóż!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem znów będzie zdrowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem w krzakach, tuż obok, niesamowity pisk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co to jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałaś moich skarpetek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę zostawiać tylko cyfr dla statystyki, chcę przyszłą historię wzbogacić w dokumenty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pocałuję nikogo! — odrzekła dziwożona ze stanowczością, potrząsając worem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miała piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem mag ginie w tym wypadku zatruty własnym jadem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem opadł i zaczął się tlić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest truizm.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy zostawszy twoją żoną, nie przestałabym cię kochać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie konduktorzy zauważyli brak jednego z kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy dni się szykowali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu nikt nie ma racji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem położył ołówek i papier przed sobą, co nie było jego zwyczajem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie znalazłem teraz już nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie oddałbym za nie wszystkie ani jednej z naszych nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli Twoja dawna szkoła została zlikwidowana, możesz uzyskać zaświadczenie o przebiegu nauczania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje mi się, że to wszystkie pytania, które mam na ten moment.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieję wszędzie i nigdzie, zawsze i nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wcale nie! — parsknął Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włazić w skórę innych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A dozorca uderzył batem w ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczyłbyś, jakby cię ona przepraszała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszajcie do boju! — zawołał — i nie powracajcie bez zwycięstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sumie to nie wiem na ile to naprawdę Google.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale kołysała się bez przerwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziewczynko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ był gruntownie pijany, więc nie mógł uciekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W każdym razie coś pokrewnego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nam? Jakim — nam? — wycedził przez zęby kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Horoskopy wcale nie zachęcające — odezwał się ktoś z przeciwnej strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja widzę, że on będzie siedział do drugiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan uległ zapewne pomyłce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz smutek ten „nie do mnie należał”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli wszyscy, wszyscy, wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A źle ci u nas?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba siedzieć całą noc z otwartymi oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ten tam — to twój ojciec?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poproszę pana dowód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bawię się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O mój Boże, za cóż takich łask zaznałam?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej radosnym kiwnięciem głowy stwierdzili w milczeniu obecność w dębie dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewielu chyba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy rozpoczyna się życie z kapitału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli pani będzie w towarzystwie przez cały czas trwania podróży…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na stacji, jak zwykle, czekał już mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taniec — to kręcenie się w kółko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytałam go, który, czy ten Emil? Nie odpowiedział i poszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z nagłym oburzeniem kopnęła wór, tuż obok na trawie poległy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mi sprawia przykrość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pacjent miał już otworzony brzuch, w którym było widać tylko żółto- -białą masę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nas nosi w sobie ziarno zła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za złudzenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chęci pieszczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz przyniósł fotografie porn.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz powędrował powoli za nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakaś młoda matka wżerała się w policzki swego rocz nego dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkie inne maszynki, które wypróbowałem, są wobec niego niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie broniła, milcząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po całym mieście i wypożyczam do niej płyty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I cóż jest wyższego ponad słowo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazuję ci ciągle moje słabe i bezbronne strony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam nic przeciwko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim zawahał się na chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko się odczepili, bo bardzo byli zajęci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimna woda była codziennym potwier dzeniem jej „chcę”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie sprawdza się ona!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno wyrzucać zużytych baterii do zwykłych śmieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy jej powiedział: — Chcę spotkać się z tobą, — odpowiedziała: — Dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już drugi raz uderzyłem małym palcem o framugę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zatem podać mi rękę i sprowadzić do gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz częściej zatrzymywał się, bezradnie i z przerażeniem oglądając się wokoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak mówił zdrobniale: dziewulinka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kącie stało składane łóżko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż zamierzył się Felek na majstra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokornie panu profesorowi dziękuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liza zaśmiała się szyderczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bywaj, chłopcy, tu do mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem listy, listy, listy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak wyglądasz? — spytała dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądam za firankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boisz się siebie samej? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaciągnąłem się wraz z innymi i wyprawiono mnie do hacjendy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już dwie szyby w tym roku stłukli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Spuchnięcie czasu” dochodzi do niemożliwych rozmiarów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To są stosy papierów i nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O tych podziemiach chodziły po mieście tylko głuche wieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Damy sobie radę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powtórz jeszcze raz — prosił Krzysiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nic, no nic — zagadnął żwawo tamten.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak potarł dłonią miejsce pozbawione kędziora i rzucił na zabrakowanego kulawca spojrzenie pełne politowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już je widzę, o, już je mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale z nim sypiasz, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Panie skrzydlaty, uważaj na przeciąg!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadza się pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy naznaczyła mu pierwszą schadzkę w… pociągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego przecież trzeba załatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pal ich licho! — odparł koń — Muszę znaleźć tego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pierwszym miejscu „święta trójca”: Tomasz Mann, Celine, Montherlant.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki rozejrzał się naokół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan to wie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale będzie wiedzieć i myślę, że osiągnie to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A i te były za duże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów powraca ta mała, nudna męka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tadek ma rower, to i ja chcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybieraj, póki czas! — zawołał kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A przysięga uroczysta, to nic? — zapytała pantera, pokazując zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mi tam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczęła się nienormalnie szorować, i to jej zostało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nami rozwinęła się wspaniała panorama portu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi spaść w nocy lub rano, żeby nie zdążyli uprzątnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W gęstwinie bielały ściany kaplic i małych zabudowań mongolskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli dla siebie dziwną sympatię i szacunek — z daleka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście są choroby, na które nie ma ratunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nic nie poradzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona wzruszyła ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodził z kąta w kąt i coś tam mruczał pod nosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znając ciebie, na pewno zrobiłeś wszystko w porządku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę nosić okulary które mają aż dziesięć dioptrii dla prawego oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wściekł się, czy co? Emil powoli wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałam, że jest brzyki i niegrzeczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystkie Podlasiaki tak wyglądają, jakby zbytecznej na karku gęby co prędzej pozbyć się chcieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i pokój był przesycony zapachem kasztana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez te dwa lata mnie tu w tych stronach nie było…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy chyba raz w życiu odważyła się ostrzej odpowiedzieć ojcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wprost nie mógł tego pojąć, ale czuł, że już wszystko skończone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepyszna broń! — pochwalił ze szczerym uznaniem rywal, biorąc pistolet do ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaczynać wszystko sprawiedliwie, z Boga i z siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wiele przebaczyć możemy, jeżeli widzimy: dobroć i szczerość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale biada temu, kto by je próbował ruszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się i ujrzałem Rotundę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś znowu szedł, więc Cezary ociężale powrócił do swej łopaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszliwe są, śmieszliwe! — powtórzył bez potrzeby i spojrzał na Podlasiaka z przesadną stanowczością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadrżała w posadach góra, struchleli ludzie i zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto pieczęć — dar mojego ducha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak biegły dni szczęśliwe, niezmącone niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20676335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zaiste smutny jest ten świat aż do śmierci”…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to zabrzmieć żałośnie, ale to mnie uspokaja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mamy czasu cze kać na wyniki laboratoryjnej socjologii czy ekonomii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak obojętny jest na pozór list Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogół kobiet, jeśli chodzi o miłość, jest przerażająco niesentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypomnij no sobie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw trzeba będzie powiedzieć mamie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety postępują tak albo inaczej z miłości do mężczyzn, nigdy z miłości do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko mnie powiedz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś tak długo siedział?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mały usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto przed oglądaniem filmu nie czytać, o czym jest film.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie pomykali tymi chodnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znać od dawna już nikt nie używał tej ścieżki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy jej powiedział: — Chcę spotkać się z tobą, — odpowiedziała: — Dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przyszło do tego niespodziewanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I moja miłość do ciebie wplątana w to także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem, jak ręka Andrzeja wpija mi się kurczowo w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja jestem sentymentalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdy cię z torby na świat wynurzym, poznasz mnie po głosie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Właśnie, że nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil miał o trzy lata młodszego brata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, jakże się jasnemu panu wędrowało w powietrzu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd rozkoszne złudzenie nowości, iluzja czegoś jeszcze nie doznanego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczyłbyś, jakby cię ona przepraszała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień jej na horyzoncie pańskiego życia już zaświtał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie oczekuje od ciebie milczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U niej widocznie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy kwiaty do uczty! — rzekła patetycznie, zdejmując wianuszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ścigałeś nieprzyjaciół jak Czarniecki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Między ogródkami działkowymi biegnie wąska ścieżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ty, Stefan!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żartować nie lubił! — dodał kulawiec, z uznaniem pokręcając głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze było przed kolacją i nudził się, i przykrzyło mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A buteleczka od razu bęc!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piekło w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem — odparł bezradnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można tego wypluć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rwały naprzód konie, lekko bujała się kareta na gumowych obręczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby był sam, to by mu się nudziło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę mieć spokój i wygodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon dzwonił długo, bardzo długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwrócił głowę, bo słońce świeciło mu w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poproszę pana dowód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To tylko fason jej bucików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzał mi głęboko w twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła — odparł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi otworzyła stara kucharka, którą nazywał Me duzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesyceni gwarem i krzykiem zeszliśmy do łodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Największą część dnia pochłaniało polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I w dodatku, temu brak ręki, a owemu nogi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, cóż, idziemy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uznałem, iż stanowisko to właśnie mi odpowiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przejdźmy do ruchów ubocznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Onanizowałam się na próbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym gwiazdę z nieba i szybkę z okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłaby trzecia skrobanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palto miał rzeczywiście krzywo zapięte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą gówno, czy jest sprzeczna, czy nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wszystko złoto, co się świeci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zamiast zniechęcić, jeszcze bardziej rozpala się w Maciusiu niecierpliwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Znam ja te wasze gorączki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Honor za honor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była przyzwyczajona do ukrywania się nawet wtedy, gdy była sama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Świetnie sobie poradził, nieprawdaż!? — pytałem z dziecinną radością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie warto się tedy sprzeczać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzięła polnego świerszcza i na piersiach skryła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż mi zabroni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No tak, teraz pójdę, minęła już dziesiąta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pauza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tu właśnie tkwi istota symbolu i jedna z zasadniczych zagadek bytu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przystanęli, aby się odsapać i uporządkować bezład uwięzłych w gardle oddechów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włóczenie się jest czynnością rytualną, prastarą, jak miasta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duża, trójkątna głowa, biała czupryna w nieładzie, brązo we, błyszczące oczy, wąskie usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otworzył oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toruj drogę jako młodszy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej radosnym kiwnięciem głowy stwierdzili w milczeniu obecność w dębie dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, dobrotliwy nasz panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce znów żeglowaliśmy gondolą po lagunie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokojówka pomyliła się i zapomniała dać ojcu jedyne miękkie krzesło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mi tam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reprodukcja cyfrowa wykonana przez Bibliotekę Narodową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Aha — domyślił się wreszcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz zarosła już prawie zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie chciał „uciekać”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknięte są bramy domów i zgaszone światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ojciec nieraz mi wyjaśniał wszystko, a ja wam to zaraz powtórzę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem i nie jestem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głupie smarkate.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała filozofia religijna katolicyzmu i cała cywilizacja łacińska oparte są na personalizmie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porzuciłem uniwersytet i zacząłem rozglądać się za płatną posadą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiwat, niech żyje protokół!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ależ to jest najwyraźniej w świecie obmierzła twarz konduktora!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wezwał Andrzeja do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie powinna na mnie czekać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okropne rzeczy, ale raz trzeba powiedzieć je otwarcie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli człowiek nie czyta książek, nie może być świadomym i rozumującym obywatelem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy dostrzegacie ten podwójny odblask?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy deszcz minął, poszli po raz pierwszy do Emila do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skończone!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obejmujesz mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Coś w ten deseń — uśmiechnął się zjadliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechta! — dorzucił znowu kulawiec i znowu machnął ręką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdę mówiąc, nic nie myślałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz wyczuwał jeszcze pocieszający uścisk dłoni proboszcza, widział jego zasmucone spojrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili: — Kochasz mnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mamo, czy odchodzisz? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Proszę pana, tylko na parę godzin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pary z ust nie puszczę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20617825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie jest godło na tej chorągwi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często okazuje się, że jest zbyt zrównoważony i zrobiony za logicznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Instytucja oświatowa i organizacja pozarządowa posiadająca status organizacji pożytku publicznego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten moment, kiedy ona powiedziała: — To w parku nie sprawiło mi przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już je widzę, o, już je mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świetny to orszak widzów, świetny, zaprawdę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby się chciało trochę przesadzać, można by powiedzieć, że jego zdania mogą zabijać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłoniła głowę na znak zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wsadził głowę między jego liście, i to mu przyniosło ulgę, bo męczył się bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto wie, czy zostawszy twoją żoną, nie przestałabym cię kochać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie cierpię czarnych rzeczy — zawołała Maria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil obmacał wszystkie krzesła, na których wierzchu siedziała skóra, a w środku mieszkały sprężyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałaś jaru, masz jar — rzekł kulawiec, podejrzliwie i ukosem poglądając na dziwożonę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo i władze państwowe powinny otaczać szczególną opieką dzieci niemające rodziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz mamy dosyć zabawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrób listę zakupów bo znowu o czymś zapomnimy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ujęty hojnymi napiwkami, ułatwiał kochankom schadzki w iście mistrzowski sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrzył, jak się macacie, i brandzlował się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schizofreniczne rozszczepienie graniczące chwilami z lekkim bzikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Ty wierzysz we wszystko co przeczytasz w internecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam tu i tu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam nadzieję, że połowa uczestników odpadnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak dokładnie opisywałeś, jak lubisz kiszkę kaszaną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kłamię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w obecnej chwili był w stanie jakby zbliżonym do transu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto jest twoja myśl o śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to coś ważnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał jeszcze chwilkę, ściskając nerwowo pałkę w dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W takim razie — odpowiedział cicho — poniósłbym porażkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Panie! — protestował inspektor.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kształtowała swoją przyszłość, która była zwinięta w niej, jak sprężyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie wyłączyłem ten przełącznik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy czterej spoglądaliśmy ku niemu serdecznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil — bo wstydził się za Janka; Janek — bo wiedział, co myśli Emil.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatkiem sił rozwahał ułomną nogę i niby potwornym taranem uderzał nią w przeciwnika.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko zależy od nastawienia z góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże nimfy umiały otumanić Fauna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sama nie wiem, co piszę, taka jestem ostatnio roztrzęsiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618473.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto tu był?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas dłużył się okropnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem przy niej, pojąc oczy harmonią jej ruchów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko korzysta z dobrodziejstw ubezpieczeń społecznych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego przecież trzeba załatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko należy chronić przed wszelkiego rodzaju zaniedbaniem, okrucieństwem i wyzyskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogłem mu się doskonale przyjrzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc nie chcesz obiecać, że mu nie będziesz dokuczał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaszedł tedy do starego sklepikarza na Starym mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20618515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejne zajęcie z jakimś boskim pierwiastkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz niedługo trwały chwile ukojenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy wiedzieli, że rabuś, a nikt mu nie mógł dowieść niczego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Panie skrzydlaty, uważaj na przeciąg!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dajcie mi Maciusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nieprawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi krzemień szurnął przez całe biurko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idealna pogoda na rower!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z literatury rosyjskiej uznawał tylko Dostojewskiego i Babla.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciebie już nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Abraham zrodził Izaaka, Izaak zrodził Jakuba, to jest po dobne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpinał jej bluzkę, a ona pozwalała na to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Idę do domu, możesz mnie odprowadzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tak ino z wielkiej przyjaźni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę! — odparła z dąsem dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co teraz będzie? Janek uśmiechnął się i odpowiedział: — Nic się nie zmieni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milczenie pod ciśnieniem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję — odparł, pokrywając zdumienie wymuszonym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krzyczała, płakała, nie dawała się uczesać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje wysłanie przelewu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do strumienia! — pochwycił jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekałam na ciebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak i jednoręki nic nie odrzekli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgoda! — zawołał z ponownym wybuchem radości Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20775963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Olbrzymia, „bezimienna paszcza”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstydziłam się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu dzieci z domu wybiegły do ogródka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zużyliśmy osiemdziesiąt naboi, rozdzieliliśmy po połowie moją miesięczną rację żywności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20776201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się opierał o ciebie i o ścianę i podejdę do okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mając lat siedem czuł już, jak należy postępować z lekarzami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nie w chwili samego gimnastykowania się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic panienka nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziąłem teczkę, uporządkowałem papiery i poszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale pan tutaj u nas zostanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas! — powtórzył jednoręki i poprawił torbę na plecach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz siną pręgę na twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyja to transkrypcja? — To właściwie wcale nie jest transkrypcja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwłaszcza jej epilog nad ranem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli spóźni ci się autobus, to ewentualnie mogę cię podwieźć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy psuję go, i nagle zaczyna się w nim coś poruszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego oczy wpadają powoli do wnętrza czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciej był tego pewien.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara spostrzegła, że było ich sześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schowali się na centralnej poczcie, w dużej hali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie trzeba mi było pozwalać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albatrosy nie wrzeszczą, i to nie jest ładne wyrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale będzie wiedzieć i myślę, że osiągnie to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby był sam, to by mu się nudziło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liza zaśmiała się szyderczo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem na nią z wdzięcznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skończył i pokój był przesycony zapachem kasztana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dolewaj oliwy do ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są, zdaje się, w jednym wie ku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przemawiał z reguły tylko wtedy, gdy zachodziła bezwzględna konieczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20794113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ty tu? — zapytał mistrz zdumiony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tak była czarna, że prawie niebieska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem wtedy jak nieprzytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieszliwe są, śmieszliwe! — zauważył pośpiesznie kulawiec i palcem ostrzegawczo pogroził w powietrzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak gdyby obawiało się, że mogę zapomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wessała Emila kompletnie i bez żadnego trudu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki on śmieszny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej z tych ścian przez otwór sączyło się światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Śmiech i groza — szczególne połączenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mnie jest wszystko jedno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jasnowłosy był jak ty!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był u celu podróży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie chciał „uciekać”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za co by cię mieli zabijać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20796612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była za piękna, by nie przyznać jej racji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś trzymał przed sobą Nel, Kali jechał z Meą na drugim koniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem go z jakąś rudą dziewczyną na koncercie Hoffmana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina ósma trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uciekaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwudziesty pierwszy wiek przyniósł wielkie zmiany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"i gdzie są te wszystkie piękne dziewczyny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyje Czerwona Maska!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszał pierwsze wiersze, tętniące, sprężyste, napinające się jak łuki, jak grzbiet biegnącego konia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Ach, gdybym miał strzelbę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to szczyt moich pragnień ziemskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Około wpół do szóstej i koniec nienaturalnie pięknego lata: księżyce, słońca, księżyce, słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ją kocham i jestem tak bardzo szczęśliwa, że będę tu mieszkała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A tu nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mańkutem nie mańkutem, ale jakie tam się znajdują litery?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym był kobietą, to puszczałbym się bardzo i męczyłbym takich mężczyzn, jak ja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co noc obchodził dom dokoła, gdyż bał się ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś mam ochotę walnąć się na łóżko i nie podnosić nawet jednej powieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powieki rycerza drgnęły, uczucie litości musnęło jego serce na jedno okamgnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybycie ich zbudziło Stasia, który się poprzednio był zdrzemnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale skorzystam z tej wiedzy w życiu przyszłym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fundamentalizm, snobizm i syrop klonowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego Mozilla Firefox to najlepsza przeglądarka internetowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko groziło zgubą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem oczyma duszy leżącą na podłodze postać z roztrzaskaną głową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Donald, zadumany, kiedy się drzwi za nią zamknęły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy jest w domu? — Nie, ale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pójdziemy do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze jest romans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okazało się, że padł jeden koń i kilkunastu pagazich zostało w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Padli na kolana u stóp mogiły i uderzyli czołem o ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Antoś, ty dokąd?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950923.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"» Albo udajesz, albo cię to nie obchodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina siódma dwadzieścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jak co, ale elektrownia Opole jest super ubezpieczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociaż w podróży się wspomagajmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rycerz Konrad powstał od stołu i skinął ręką na gospodarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Holmes przyniósł z sieni sukienne pantofle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina szósta trzydzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powtarzam ci, że słyszałem na własne uszy, że umarła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem na Władka, bo Władek przyczepił jej rzep do sukienki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Małgosiu, pożycz mi stalówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dreszcz mnie przeniknął, a pastor zbladł jak ściana, tak, tak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wnosiłam z jego odmowy opowiedzenia mi czegoś z pobytu w Ameryce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej piaski z pustyń, leżących po obu jego brzegach, zasypałyby go w ciągu roku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płócienne ściany nie dawały już żadnego schronienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedtem mówiłam: «Proszę cię, jeszcze nie, teraz nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszli na działkę, dowiadywali się o niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starsi panowie poczęli jednak rozmawiać o Mahdim i o powstaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoi tedy i milczy, Tadeusz pomału\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli wiesz, co to znaczy... Lecz Zosiu kochana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wyczytałem w oczach jego podejrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknęła i ani myśli wrócić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzył na gościa z bezmyślnym uśmiechem na ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś z nami możesz spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szarpane wichrem płócienne ściany oblewały ich ze wszystkich stron wodą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Co sądzicie o moich zeznaniach?“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajrzał mu za kołnierz i nie znalazł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na nic im się nie zdały zapałki i lampy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszej chwili chciała po prostu wygnać precz przyjaciółkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina druga piętnaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwyczajnie wzywa się eksperta ze stolicy, kiedy ślad jest już zupełnie zatarty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, tak, dużo roboty… jesteś pracowitym dzieckiem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po twarzy kolegi wnoszę, że pan jest tutaj tym liderem intelektualnym w tym tandemie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszedł ze swojego pokoju, nie słyszałam kiedy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadaję pytania, które uważam za potrzebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950986.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spokojnie w dalszym ciągu kończyła swą robotę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widziałem jeszcze tego serialu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20950988.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest, on się uśmiechnął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włochy to państwo na południu Europy oraz dzielnica Warszawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest godzina piąta czterdzieści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co to jest, na miłość boską? — Dziecko jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jutro będzie bardzo zimno, minus dwadzieścia siedem stopni Celsjusza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wsuwa się pod kołnierz marynarskiego ubranka i zasypia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdrowa policja powinna wyławiać zdrowych złoczyńców spośród zdrowych gapiów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, proszę cię, nie umieraj już drugi raz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzyj tylko, jak mnie urządziłeś! — dodała, spoglądając po sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Starałam się być nią zawsze — odpowiedziała cichym głosem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciał o niem ze mną mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ucztowały tak długo, że Stasia porwała w końcu złość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jak widzisz? — Przychodzi taki biały duch i się nachyla nade mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym rozczarowany, gdyby to nie była kolumna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie psuj połowu, tato! — mruknął Jan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po cóż od niego uciekasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świeca, która była świeżo założona, spaliła się zaledwie na pół cala.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I życie spokojnie mu płynie bez krzywdy ludzkiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sztuczna inteligencja, uczenie maszynowe, sieci neuronowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz nie spostrzegłem u niej nawet śladu przygnębienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20951083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten fotograf jest garbus.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co w nich jest? — zapytała ostro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilę poleżał cicho i odpoczął trochę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do dziury myszko, do dziury\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biedronka, Lidl i Żabka to sieci sklepów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ogóle nie myślał o niczym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żonę na bok odrzucił niby sprzęt zużyty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Staś pomyślał, że w wąwozie czekałaby ich śmierć niechybna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daj mi kącik w twym domu i weź za swoją niewolnicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wygłupialiśmy się razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż to mała rzecz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani go drażni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zero tak napisane, że wygląda jak sześć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kobieta nie musi się długo uczyć tych rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jednej stronie pagórki piaszczyste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jestem już księżniczką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz wracajcie do domu, bo zimno na dworze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Baby chujem nie straszcie, bo się go nie zlęknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Księżyc wydostał się z pod ziemi i jął nasycać światłem ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona zaś spytała: — A jeśli ty dostaniesz febry?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim razie zajmie się wami brutalny oprawca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwzorowanie struktury organizacyjnej Firmy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech pierwej na niewidziane przyrzecze, że nie odmówi jednego choćby pocałunku! — zaniepokoił się kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Część rzeczy zostawimy, bo teraz mamy wszystkiego dwa konie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_21206392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomacał ręką siennik i wydał okrzyk zdumienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił dziadek do obrazu, a obraz doń ani razu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znaczy to wcale, żeby Cezarek był złym synem, a jego matka niedołężną ciapą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała dzielnica żydowska poruszona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykładami niewulgarnych wyzwisk są wyrazy przybłęda, oblech, pokraka, karakan i łajza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Dlaczegóż mam z więzienia uciekać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem twardo i czekałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie daremnie, gdyż wkrótce potem władza zakazała siejącego zgorszenie handlu posążkami Babińskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzcie, co miałem; as treflowy i walet treflowy, dama karowa i walet karowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam Netflixa, jestem na to za biedna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiemy jeszcze kto pan jesteś, skąd przybywasz i czem byłeś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ta twarz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Członkowie przyjdą w mundurach i zarzucą miotły na ramiona o samej dziesiątej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież to samo pchnięcie, które mnie zraniło, zabiło także i mojego konia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnąłem ręce do góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ku mojemu zdumieniu spostrzegłem, iż moje przybycie było oczekiwane z przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak przynajmniej mówili niektórzy mądrzy ludzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego jestem sierotą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Głupiec jestem, głupiec!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatrzymać się nie mogę: Kamień jest gładki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą sen mój, co prawda, był sobie wcale zabawny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oto było to, czego mi było potrzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapomnisz ty o tamtej, jeno zobaczysz moją Jagienkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co sądzisz o nowych hulajnogach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi Maciuś przeczytać wszystkie na świecie książki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkajmy się na bulwarach nadwiślańskich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani jednej chmurki nie było na niebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co chowasz za sobą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każda z pokrzywdzonych rodzin nabywała taką figurką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mateczki swej nigdy oko w oko nie widziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy rudowłosa Rozyna była jego córką czy siostrzenicą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od kiedy on jest taki wypicowany?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tam było na Mazurach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepsza sieć, bo nie rani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasetka stała również nietknięta na swojem miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cesarz zabronił mi jednak myśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Proszę, niech pan opowiada dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem nagle przerywa ciszę dziki wrzask.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starzec probował dawać jej znaki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skok i siedziałem w siodle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odtrąciłem go jednak i z płaszczem pod pachą zniknąłem w ciemnościach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu nie walisz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie moje pieniądze!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem potem nad rzeką, oparty o żelazną poręcz i spoglądałem w szumiące fale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczy się fotografować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bierz ją sobie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"po nim odziedziczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesłuchanie trwało dziwnie długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dobrze, jeszcze raz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Martwiłem się, że jestem mały, chciałem pokazać, że mały też potrafi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno ma rude włosy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ten zamiast iść, zbliżył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś powołany sam przez siebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włącz światła w całym domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż pan powiesz na tego konia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Występuje wyłącznie na półkuli północnej, głównie w jej północnych regionach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, czy skończyłem jedenaście czy dwanaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z największą ostrożnością udałem się w kierunku, z którego mnie głos dochodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przytem żył ubogo jak żebrak na poddaszu, którego okno wyglądało na podwórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem się do nich docisnąć, ale mnie odsunięto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał nawet przed chwilą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wokulski ukłonił się paniom, zauważywszy, z rozkosznem zdziwieniem, rumieniec na twarzy panny Izabeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw z panem, panie majorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odwracaj oblicza Twego odemnie: któregokolwiek dnia wzywać Cię będę, prędko wysłuchaj mię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to ruch świetny, na pierwszy rzut oka olśniewał swym blaskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prezesowa siadła na fotelu; obecni poczęli zajmować miejsca przy stole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczem znów się położył na bilard i w dalszym ciągu drzemał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak cicho i dobrze płynąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co do króla, ten śmiał się szczerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet w przybliżeniu nie był podobny do tego, co widziałem we śnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120661.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie odjechał jeszcze dziesięciu kroków, kiedy ten ladaco Jerzy, odezwał się: Joasiu, widziałaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25120662.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czwartej miała być kolumna gotowa do szturmu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"i cóżeś ty zrobiła?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ryknąłem, do czegóż to się ośmielasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest ona w najwyższym stopniu interesująca i niezwykła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzwony zaśpiewały z wież kościelnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymałem się w jej pobliżu i szedłem za jej biegiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze jedno spojrzenie w ciemną noc; nic się nie poruszało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej jasne włosy rozpostarły się przed moim wzrokiem, jak złoty welon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pańska zapłata to trzynaście tysięcy czterysta pięćdziesiąt siedem dolarów i osiemnaście centów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Daję panu na dziś urlop.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz chodź ty, Małgosiu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz myśli, które go zniechęcają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kopnąłem je lekko: jakiś karton błysnął w promieniach księżyca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedz lepiej prawdę... Przyznaj się, że ci było przyjemnie pisać o mnie...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bije dalej: cztery, pięć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jeszcze w obecności „tej”, która zasługuje, aby jej aniołowie śpiewali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, nie, tylko nie to!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki to ładny pokój!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkiego najlepszego, niech ci setka kiedyś stuknie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przestań tak ostro skręcać, aż żygać mi się chce!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za kogo pan mnie ma?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powstanę z krzesła, dopóki nie skończę ostatniej księgi, nie zestawię liczb ostatnich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś jakby krzyknął i uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kilometrów przejechałeś na rowerze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Angelina chciała się zerwać, zatrzymałem ją siłą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobliwy jego charakter składał się z dwóch natur, które naprzemian się objawiały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, który już tyle przebyłem w mem życiu, przebędę jeszcze i to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ależ musiałem przecie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakrztusił się kilka razy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie, ciemność była lepszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów długo myślałem, jak się myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.036,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy indziej wyjaśniono, że dostał się \\\"prawdopodobnie\\\" do niemieckiej czy austriackiej niewoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można znów puścić ryby do wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwoje młodych ludzi zostało sam na sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy zechcesz mię pan przedstawić pani i tej młodej damie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usta jej dotykały twarzy chłopca, który się wstawił, jak żądała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Suzin westchnął, zmarszczył brwi i znowu wypił szampana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad wieczorem posłał służącego do sklepu po Obermana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakładajcie piżamy, już noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiałeś sam zauważyć, jak one były wytarte, pomięte i poplamione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A po kiego ci mój numer telefonu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Katedra przedstawiała szczególny widok: zmieniona była w szpital, przytułek i magazyn prowiantowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jużeś pan naraził na szwank całą naszą wyprawę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochający cię i pełen głębokiego szacunku, kuzyn Krzeszowski“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje mi się, że widziałem czarnego człowieka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122292.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i cóż!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122293.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócę z pomocą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122295.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinął na mnie, abym milczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Służbę pełniliśmy na zmianę, dzień po dniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego, co męcząco zarabiał udzielaniem lekcji, musiał jeszcze utrzymywać chorą matkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wnet odpędził to nieusprawiedliwione podejrzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja nie mogę umrzeć, nie mogę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż przestraszony kanarek zatrzepotał się w klatce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czyż król chce nam go odebrać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego mam panu oddać moje ubranie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wie pan już, mistrzu Pernat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śnieżysty zabójczy mróz zaległ nagle pokój.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeznaczona aby być rozkoszą dla wszystkich, napotkała człowieka, dla którego szczęściem się stała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniałe to było zwierzę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chce się pan założyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak przyjemnie siedzieć na kamieniu nad samą przepaścią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U wejścia stała warta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W następnej chwili rygiel odskoczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułem, jak ją dzika trwoga opanowuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich podniósł latarkę do twarzy nieszczęśliwego, poczem obydwaj wybuchnęli szatańskim śmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym choć jeszcze raz mógł mu rękę uścisnąć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśl i język są dla artysty narzędziami sztuki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to mały człowieczek ze szpakowatą ostrą bródką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochmistrzyni zapukała; odźwierny natychmiast otworzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godny jej, choć nie równy pochodzeniem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie masz Danuśki, nie masz i ślubowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpacz nieszczęsnej kobiety przechodziła wszelkie granice.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie narzekał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dziwiłem się już niczemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty jesteś tu gospodarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak upływały dnie Blanki w głowie posągu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sięgnął do kieszeni, wyjął jakąś książkę i długo przewracał w niej kartki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wydostałem się na dwór, byłbym ze zdumienia głośno krzyknął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raczej panu opowiem, co się stało w czasie pańskiej nieobecności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się zgadza, no to dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystka krew spłynęła mi do serca...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rób już sekretu, że ja kupiłem kamienicę Łęckich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25122404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj znajdę z pewnością wszystko, czego mi potrzeba będzie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże chętnie byłbym poczekał, aby przyjąć życzenia tych wspaniałomyślnych przeciwników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Ignacy uczuł się głęboko obrażonym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szliśmy wciąż ku rogatkom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko udałem się w drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastanów się więc, póki czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam dobry przepis na pomidorową, zaraz ci pokażę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowiedziałem się coś o nim przedtem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciusiowi krew uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radziwiłł złożył mu obie ręce na głowie i znów nastała chwila milczenia...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to był strach, co mnie opanował przed możliwością, że mnie ktoś zobaczy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może pan nie wierzy, że Golem straszy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc w Zbyszku na myśl, że przytomność wraca chorej, zadrżało z radości serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu ten ostry wyraz dokoła ust i zimny błysk jego oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile dałaś za ten łańcuszek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co miałbym uciekać z więzienia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem: dobrotliwa była to ręka, która zasunęła rygle przed moją pamięcią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie najlepsze to selfie, wszystko jest rozmyte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25124981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.532,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To numer... „Jedyny rozumny... jedyny kupiec... jedyny, który może dogadać się z Ochockim?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Telefon zadzwonił znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619947.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ona była uparta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja w ten sposób nie myślałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W taką pogodę nawet pies z kulawą nogą nie chciałby wyjść na dwór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20619954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los czyli nie przychodzi ku nam mimo naszej woli?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A łydka? — pytałem niecierpliwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jesteś? Przecież masz ładne włosy, zwłaszcza gdy je rozrzuca wiatr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I one pewnie pierwsze odpadną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król usiłował znaczącymi spojrzeniami zachęcić swego poetę do ostatniego wysiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był pani ogród.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągłe szycie, cięcie, mierzenie i znowu szycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie należy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę wyjść! — krzyczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, że jest przyjemny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620315.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu ona powiedziała do niego: — Twoje wargi wyglądają jak pół owoce, pół zwierzęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siłą się wziąć nie dam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc poszedłem na górę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymał go za górny węzeł jak za czuprynę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś dotknął lekko mego ramienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno drugiemu pomaga znakomicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istotnie Klementyna była królową balu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego większość kobiet, które mają mało przyjaciół, jest niemożliwie ograniczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ruchome masy gadów porcelanowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej się żyje w chałupie gajowego, a inaczej w młynie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz przede wszystkim postawię ci jeden zasadniczy warunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jużci, że wiadomo… — przerwał mu jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może, że po drodze wypadnie nam się bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwiony sanitariusz stanął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym szedł po niej, woda sięgała mi do kolan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto rano wstaje, temu Pan Bóg daje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czekałam na ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A może zauważyłeś coś niezwykłego w czasie snu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie słyszał pan dotychczas o nim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Męczące uczucie niedokończenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ja boję nawet ruszyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie ma porównania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyżby coś podobnego było możliwym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy punkt tamy znajdował się nie wyżej siedemnastu stóp nad poziomem gruntu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak obojętny jest na pozór list Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym momencie zauważył, jak Ewa rusza wargami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A czy to możliwe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział krótki, urwany śmiech kobiety.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu przestał dlatego, że Emil przestał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tropiła go jak pies, chodziła za nim jak lunatyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie mogę tak powiedzieć, bo to nie jest prawda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze jesteś taki, jak ja chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biednemu zawsze wiatr w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednego dnia przyszedł policjant z wielkim niebieskim papierem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy przez sień do izby na prawo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On też był pierwszym i ostatnim rektorem Uniwersytetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640248.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przy całej klasie, zamiast kaligrafii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idzie, niesie koszyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc — panno Klementyno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20640251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśli przechodziły koło niego, jak duchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No co? — Jeśli ja wyjdę, to nie zbijesz mnie? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobiety postępują tak albo inaczej z miłości do mężczyzn, nigdy z miłości do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech dusza powraca do ciała!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęście, że byl park, przez który ona musiała przejść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawiało jej to dużą przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic nie widziała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle ryknął jej tuż nad samym uchem sygnał parowozu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, co za rozkosz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawda, że się chce wymiotować? Emil poruszył głową w nieokreślonym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uspokojony nieco tą oczywistością, zaczął się rozbierać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja już nic nie chcę — nic nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak powinien wyglądać świat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My tutaj byliśmy i jesteśmy na tym punkcie ułomni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgasił lampę i położył się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia skrzydełka, łebkiem śmiesznie kręci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy być praktycznym; jestem pozytywistą, mój panie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Paweł spojrzał na zegarek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdzie wasza dziewka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy ona jest tu może u pana, w tym domu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pomogę pamięci — ciągnąłem, poprawiając się na krześle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różne rodzaje ciemności, poprze- rzynane błyskawicami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest pełne możliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Owszem — odpowiedział pan i wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dusza twa należy do nas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą, mieć dach nad głową jest rzeczą bardzo przyjemną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym wdzięczny za informację, w jakich godzinach planowany jest lot w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślałam o jakimś horrorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szeroko otwartymi oczami patrzała prosto w słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A jeśli ona nie wsiądzie po drodze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza mną zapadły głucho w zamek ciężkie, dębowe drzwi…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrobię to dla was, jeszcze raz pójdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbym powiedzieć, czego, ale mi się nie chce myśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673228.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy człowiek powinien korzystać ze wszystkich praw i swobód wymienionych w deklaracji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się jednak, że nie wszystkie osobniki podległy tej klątwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszedł Felek brudny i obdarty, chudy i nieszczęśliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żelazne wrota blokowały im przejście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy widział kto wronie gniazdo na głowie dziewczynki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Klęknę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była już na linii moich schodów i widocznie chciała tu wylądować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, mówiąc o życiu, obejmuję teorię życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cud stał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nawet zgadłem, bo ktoś zastukał, ale cicho i tylko raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kobieta uśmiecha się i patrzy na mnie w szczególny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673276.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy zrobiło mu się bardzo sucho w ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam, o jutrzni we mgłach, odpływają małe statki rybackie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech żyje rajfurstwo, pośrednictwo do nierządu itd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosyć nudzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagroda przyznawana jest jedynie za tytuły przetłumaczone na język polski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumiesz mię, jeden z drugim?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choćby się miało grzęznąć coraz głębiej, choćby się wiedziało, że koniec będzie zły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chwilą przyjścia na świat dziecko ma prawo do nazwiska i obywatelstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubiła chodzić do kina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścili nas\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pozwól, chcę go obejrzeć dokładniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673317.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byliśmy w udawaniu naprawdę dobrzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo, bardzo źle…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc może postawić pałki tym, którzy myśleli o lekcji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pewnego wieczora… — poddałem mu, ułatwiając wyznania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często byłem tak zmęczony, że w ubraniu zasypiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po co ja się z nim w ogólę zadaję?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673333.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz najbardziej zdumiał go wyraz twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673334.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była tylko w koszuli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy sam na sam — rzekł Podlasiak, do głębi wzruszony swym obecnym stanowiskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę prosić o powtórzenie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale dziewczęta go znają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bawiła go ta gra w ciuciubabkę z nie przeczuwającym nic przeciwnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili furtka już była otwarta na oścież.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykułem wszystkie pytania na blachę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, są silni awanturnicy, którzy szukają zaczepki ze słabszym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozejrzałem się po blacie, który miał zastępować wigilijny stół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał mu do powiedzenia tysiące rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Młynarz ustąpił mu z drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reprodukcja cyfrowa wykonana przez fundację Nowoczesna Polska.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie myślałem nawet, czy są naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była parna, księżycowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwiaty jesienne rychło przemijają…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kraju, gdzie nie było Ewy, duch unosił się nad wodami i niepokojem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyobrażam sobie, jaką musiałem mieć minę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła, mimo że nie zależało jej na nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej duże piersi podnosiły się i opadały, podnosiły się i opadały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fredek umiał się dobrze bawić, ale był godny pogardy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mądry Polak po szkodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wrzeszczał na próżno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precz z ubraniami na wyrost.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pyskuj! — zawołał z powziętą z góry na wszelki przypadek urazą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem się spodziewać, by wiecznie na mnie czekać miała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pokoju nie było nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy można tą ścierką, to wytrę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu mówił: — Mamo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie nie pożywię się przy nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tylko że ja znacznie ciężej od was!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Nim pan przyjechał, ja zawsze wiedziałam, z którego miasta są goście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierś była jędrna i młoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Grupki na podwórzu zmieniają się w karawany śmiertelnie przerażonych zwierząt czujących pożar kniei.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apollo, chcąc objąć Daphne — objął krzew laurowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673458.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy przenieśli wzrok na jego rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wraca i mówi: — To był telefon z kliniki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero teraz rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja sama wyszłam i udałam się do domu swego mistrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A cóż mnie obchodzi logika natury…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A zakotłowało się w głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jeszcze szarpną, pchną, uderzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to zabrzmieć żałośnie, ale to mnie uspokaja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wolałabym wstrzymać się od wróżby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już chyba nigdy nie będę się z chłopakami ganiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasyciwszy oczy widokiem własnej krasy, zaczęła z powrotem ubierać się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spuść do połowy masztu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyć to jest prawie zawsze „żyć”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest nikotyna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę opowiedzieć, jak do tego doszło\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mało kto dzisiaj to robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc przeprowadzono chłopców z więzienia tu, do domu sierot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W każdym razie spróbuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na niewidziane dawał się odczuwać kulisty i odległy pośpiech nadchodzącego spoza ziemi słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotąd jeszcze, po rocznej przerwie, było w tym śmiechu coś poobiedniego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wasze cmentarze muszą mieć wygląd zupełnie odmienny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to zresztą przystań na drwiny i wypoczynek na opak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20673582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Obrączka więc uwarunkowała wizję nieboszczyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem doskonałą sposobność przyjrzenia mu się dokładnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cóż to ja słyszę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiem prawem znajdujecie się tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz tylko idzie o to, w jaki sposób rozpocząć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz otworzyły się drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy moja szarfa dobrze leży?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezsilny znów upadłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłem tę piosenkę i mogę ją odtwarzać gdzie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albo się pomyliłeś, albo jesteś pomylony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja wracam natychmiast do mego pułku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz się wszystko skończy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171075.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komputery to dla mnie czarna magia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pani może pomyśleć coś takiego!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nas troje?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastukałem do bramy: nikt nie otwierał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się, że Poznaniacy są pazerni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A od kiedy ty laptopa masz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co do Katarzyny i ucznia zajętego rysowaniem, ci tworzyli między sobą najwyraźniejszy kontrast.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem odwrócić wzroku od jej wpół-otwartych ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nich prawie na wysokość człowieka nad poprzednim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzyszu, służyłem Francji dobrze, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy kocham rodziców czy nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to czworokątna płyta z kółkiem do podnoszenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy w Paryżu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo dobrze był zasadzony i podzielony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie też najbardziej tego pragnęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Sądzę, że z pewnych oznak mogę taki wniosek wyprowadzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc chcesz koniecznie rozpoczynać bójkę na nowo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi pan wiedzieć, że w żyłach moich płynie królewska krew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toż nie prześpią już tej sprawy, jak niegdyś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzekłszy to, pokazała małego, szarego ptaszka wśród liści drzewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była pierwsza kwadra i księżyc świecił jasno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosyć biedy, że jestem dziewczyną, kiedy lubię męskie zabawy, zajęcia i sposób życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjęcia dostaw oraz wysyłki zamówień realizowane są na bieżąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nikt nie zdecyduje się na próbę?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"daj mi buzi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W środku zdania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Systematycznie szedłem wstecz przez moje życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, ale rozum, panie Wokulski, przychodzi kobietom dopiero około trzydziestego roku...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale kilkudziesięciu, kilkuset takich, jak ty i ja...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozna miasta swojego państwa, wszystkie prawa i paragrafy, pozna życie królów, uczonych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście: wewnątrz w pracowni szmer, jak gdyby ktoś wysuwał szufladę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale może pani ma niekiedy troski, które mógł bym usunąć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwolę sobie zapytać, czy nic nie zwróciło waszej uwagi w czasie podróży?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spełnię twoje życzenie, ale sama sobie gwałtem wpędzasz żądło do serca!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na dole napisał: „Mój pamiętnik na wyspie bezludnej Białego Szatana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy pana jeszcze uratować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułem, jak gdybym cały świat utracił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle, poznawszy mnie, zatrzymał konia, tak, poznawszy mnie... dobrze widziałam to poruszenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"spytała, nie spodziewając się podstępu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiał się chytrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171161.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przystąpił do okna i podniesionym głosem krzyknął, że wolne miejsce jest zajęte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171162.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy słyszałaś Blanko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gęsty dym zaczął się unosić z kominka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W loży tej siedziała hrabina, pan Łęcki i panna Izabela.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobił pojednawczy wyraz twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Boże... Wiem, że miał prawo...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę mógł za pana się tem zająć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż za głupiec ze mnie, cóż za głupiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ksenofobia szerzy się wśród rodaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171171.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rysowanie łusek rybich w ten sposób przez delikatne ukłucie jest właściwe Chinom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171172.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest poczciwy mąż, delikatny, wygodny, dumny ze swej żony i niezazdrosny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171173.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, taki mądry, taki łysy!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cesarz patrzył jednak przed siebie tak martwo, jakby zobaczył jakiegoś upiora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy, gdym, popełnił zabójstwo, sprawa miała się na odwrót.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171182.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mi się to wszystko przyśniło?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"co mi to za ród!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepszy wróbel w garści, niż kanarek na dachu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno mają naprawić latarnię, bo gdyby dziś płynął okręt, latarnia mu bardzo potrzebna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędzej, prędzej, ręka mię świerzbi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówię ci, będzie sztos!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Morze wyrzuca na brzeg statek „Belinda“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A co by było gdyby?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wolałbym zobaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Banany są smaczne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mi się, że w Warszawie jest ciaśniej i że wszyscy są odurzeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzyła na mnie niepewnie; widocznie nie rozumiała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż by mi to wszystko śniło się tylko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie sprzeciwiaj mu się pan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo krew na razie jeszcze mi się nie zmęczyła nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inni grali dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co kto zrobi, jeszcze nie wiadomo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzyszył im tłum rodziców i krewnych z głośnym płaczem i lamentem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I do mnie także zawitało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"panie Julianie, któż tak mówi?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na nowo cisza, tłum przysłuchuje się bez oddechu, co się dalej stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umywam swoje ręce w niewinności.“ Z trwogą probowałem czytać w jego twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już od dwóch dni staram się o danie mu umówionego sygnału.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obruszył się nerwowo: „Przecież to rzecz uboczna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak obiadek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem mu je podać, gdy nagle przed bramą usłyszałem szczęk broni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezadługo przemknęli obok mego okna i zniknęli mi z oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągnij pan dalej to nadzwyczaj interesujące opowiadanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już mam tego dosyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie mogliśmy tej sprawy inaczej załatwić, jak tylko z bronią w ręku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwiłem się, że niebo jest pełne ciągnących ptaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ono wisi na wstążce jedwabnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu będziemy mieszkać sami, tu będą biura, tutaj służba.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niedziela wieczór i humor popsuty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"powróćcie do waszych niebios, gdyż piękność ziemianki zwyciężyła was!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyszło mi przez myśl, że to mąż Angeliny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co mnie ich krzyk obchodził?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upewniłem go, że dzieje znam bardzo mało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie zamknął notes i schował go do kieszeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi i on wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171260.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwrócili się od Pomarańczarni z powrotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po tych słowach zapadło milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale Oberman spojrzał na niego wilczem okiem i wyszedł, milcząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo z Wokulskim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łzy mi stanęły w oczach, gdy ujrzałem, że osiągnąłem podziw tylu dzielnych ludzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed dwoma dniami wszystko już było gotowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poślizgnąłem się i mało co nie spadłem ze skały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszelka sztuka jest zarazem kształtem i symbolem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez minutę, albo dłużej, sterczała ręka z podłogi, poruszając palcami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawa pańska jest nadzwyczaj niezwykła i przyjemnie mi będzie się nią zająć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy jego matka śmiało już zawiązała znajomość z przybyłymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171283.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co z niego za głuptas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171284.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili miałem dla niej w sercu tylko gorycz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puls mój wykazywał dziesięć uderzeń ponad normę i ciągle się wzmagał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogarnij się, bo wyglądasz normalnie jak hobbit!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król dotrzymał słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tobie śnić o ładnych dziewczętach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171290.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, jak obsługiwać imadło, racja?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjąłem list i wręczyłem go damie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171297.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale to były tylko drobnostki i dziewczęta zapewniały matkę, że próba idzie doskonale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęście jednego krótkiego popołudnia uczyniło mnie obcym na zawsze dla mej siedziby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymałem tak jeszcze trzy godziny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat zdawał się zbyt pięknym, aby być zeń tak bezlitośnie i bezwzględnie wygnanym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W istocie poznał Hermana przez okienko będące w małej szopie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Belu, podaj mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O czem rozprawiali tak wesoło, nie mogłem zrozumieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zniszczona, ale bardzo pańska fizjonomia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale ja wolę dalej...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„To będzie Babiński“?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest widać przeznaczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnej nocy około godziny dwunastej stałem przed głównym namiotem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem przed sobą dziesięć mil równiny, zanim dostanę się do łańcucha gór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"kiedy pędzi na koniu i w sercu swojem niemi gardzi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś czyta płynnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sorki, nie korzystam z Facebooka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świadczyły o tych godzinach, spędzonych na kopaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najszczególniejsze miasto, jakie kiedykolwiek widziałem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest bardzo przystojny i byłby z niego dzielny żołnierz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udziel mu pan wszelkiej informacji, której od pana zażąda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo nie mogłem słowa wymówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gubiła się w plątaninie swych obowiązków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiała wiedzieć o wszystkim, przewidywać, zapobiegać, rozkazywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj skoczyli do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego jestem sierotą?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Długo, bardzo długo musiałem szukać, zanim znalazłem drugi stopień, poczem wdrapywałem się dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jagiełło przyjechał do Krakowa w ciężkiej rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodząc, machinalnie wziąłem rusznicę na ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak oni się cieszyli!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On ma wygląd zwierzęcy i charakter musi mieć zwierzęcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leon począł biegać po pokoju i trząść rękoma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubię taką rozmowę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale przed upływem pół roku mogę go panu odstąpić na korzystnych warunkach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można znów puścić ryby do wody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spostrzegł niebezpieczeństwo i zrzucił z siebie mundur, ja zrzuciłem dołman.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważył mię także i krzyknął czym nie ranny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobra, może jest ze mnie skarżypyta, ale zasady to zasady.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co myśli i co zamierza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacznie czytać: będzie wiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie oczekiwałbym odpowiedzi dzisiaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Niech pan będzie spokojny, to jest nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Noc była ciepła, niebo czyste; nie pamiętam, ażebym kiedykolwiek widział więcej gwiazd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz chodź, odprowadź mnie do zamku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nazywa się Stanisław Wokulski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podłoga była czysta i białym piaskiem posypana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według mapy obliczyłem sobie odległość do szczytu góry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Roześmiałem się gorzko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem, że dawniej czytałem i co mi z tego przyszło?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25171377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spadnie pan do Jeleniego Jaru i połamie pan kark i wszystkie kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba to zobaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nikt nie wie, że to byłem ja!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szara istota znikła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takim pana nigdy jeszcze nie widziałam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę niech pan weźmie kapelusz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani chwili nie tracić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jak pan to może przypuszczać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palce jego mechanicznie głaskały pilnik leżący na stole.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ależ to nie do wytrzymania“ zawołałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno zdawało mi się okropniejsze niż drugie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko udałem się w drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale poza tem czarnem głębokiem okiem drzemała głębia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chwilę milczeliśmy i oddawaliśmy się naszym myślom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pełen zniecierpliwienia chodziłem tam i z powrotem po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem go przycisnąć do muru: „Pan myśli o damie, która niedawno tutaj zajeżdżała?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wpierw spróbować rozkoszy: ujrzeć jak dochodzi do przejrzystości to, co jest nie wypowiedziane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość mi już gorąco w mojej własnej skórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zgoda“ powiedział, gdy skończyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja chcę tylko dojść do swych pieniędzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to mi na co się przyda, gdy tam wejdę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wychodzi na jedno.“ „Pan go chce zamordować!“ krzyknąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak, tak, to był jego chód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz pogłoska ta długo utrzymać się nie mogła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona chce tajemnicę sama wyjaśnić, zanim tandeciarz ją zdradzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według kalendarza świąt nietypowych, pierwszy stycznia to dzień kaca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale już w czasie liczenia zauważyłem coś szczególnego; karty były jak z lodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy wyciągnąłem rękę, mogłem dosięgnąć dachów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cuda muszą ten stan poprzedzać, tak sobie zawsze myślę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był on jak natchnienie, któremu nie można było się oprzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starczy, starczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie daremnie, gdyż wkrótce potem władza zakazała siejącego zgorszenie handlu posążkami Babińskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiego koloru były jego włosy, broda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„W mieście mówiono, że umarł na paraliż mózgu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzy dni, cztery dni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Gdzie mamy schować te listy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godny jej, choć nie równy pochodzeniem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciągnąłem rękę do krzesła obok mego łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czego pan tutaj szuka?“ chciałem krzyczeć, lecz człowiek ten uprzedził mnie: „Pernat!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przysunęła się jeszcze mocniej i przytuliła się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ale co się z panem dzisiaj dzieje, panie Pernat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"skądże panu to przyszło do głowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Niech pan będzie spokojny, to jest nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było najlepsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy wiecie coś o Golemie, Zwak?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kelnerka natychmiast podniosła się i obrażona porzuciła izbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie mnie nie widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367468.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spadaj, bo jak ci walnę...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerzuciłem karty: tak to był on!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czyż, aby ją widzieć, muszę siedzieć na łące?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23367471.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gładkie mury ogrodowe na lewo i na prawo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie było między nimi najmniejszego podobieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żadnych mebli prócz dwóch krzeseł, stołu i komody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie miałem prawa do szczęścia?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chociażby wiedzieć jak był ubrany?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam połowa pochylonego domu z zapadającym się frontem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zjawiło się nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowa płynęły z niewidzialnych ust, stawały się żywe i zbliżały się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała ta ohyda krew mi z żył wysysała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyśliłem się, że ona już nie myśli, aby co kolwiek ukrywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z rozpuszczonymi włosami, blada jak ściana, z zarzuconym na nagich plecach złotogłowiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie pani, że ja się o panią bardzo troszczę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słychać niby uderzenie ręki o rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstrzymywany uśmiech zadrgał nagle w kątach jego ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów zagasiłem świecę i w ubraniu rzuciłem się na łóżko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili radca policyjny zrzucił maskę: wyszczerzył zęby i wykręcał oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaśmiał się chytrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdybym miała o tem wątpić, wpadłabym w bezdenną przepaść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozdarłem kołnierzyk; myślałem, że się uduszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istoty widziały w niem duchowe cierpienia bytu i rozkosze, jakie z nich wynikają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sceny wydają mi się fantastyczne jak pod działaniem opium.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym chciał za sobą zamknąć szklane drzwi, ktoś mi wyjął klamkę z ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech mi pan, przerwie, mistrzu Pernat, gdy będę znów zbyt popędliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znana Panu dama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyraziście ujrzałem znowu to wszystko przed sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Imię Martyna nie pochodzi od Marty, tylko jest żeńską formą imienia Marcin.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obłąkany z miłości zatopiłem usta w jej dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372601.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siłą zmusiłem się do myślenia, co mam aby znów wrócić do swego mieszkania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem wyprostowany w środku pokoju i spoglądałem na wejście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja matka powiedziała, że to brylant i musiałam mu naturalnie zaraz go odnieść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372606.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla niej, tylko dla niej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23372607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Oczekiwanie na cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szyje się wydłużają i do tańczącej pary przyłącza się druga, jeszcze osobliwsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz rezultat był inny, zupełnie inny, niż przypuszczałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż miałem wejść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprężyny moich czynów i myśli spoczywają w innym zapomnianym bycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulica była biała od śniegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje się, że wielu ludzi mi się kłaniało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem nagle przerywa ciszę dziki wrzask.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie był w stanie nic zobaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem pojąć, że kiedyś działała na mnie jak upiór!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjąłem je ze skrzyni, w kasetce będą pewniej schowane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„I srebrne zwierciadło, gdyby miało czucie, odczuwało by wielki ból w chwili polerowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile dałaś za ten łańcuszek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróciła raz jeszcze i znów mnie całowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimny popiół leżał w piecu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byłem też bynajmniej zdziwiony, gdyż tego właśnie oczekiwałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznałem obcą twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie to wszystko co my między sobą gadamy, jest to przecież takie głupstwo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie była to książka, co przemawiała do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"panie Pernat!“ Obejrzałem się dokoła, do góry: Nikogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W piętnastym roku życia urodziła dziecko i odtąd już się nie pokazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieustannie musiałem myśleć o Rozynie, jak ta nago we fraku tańcowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy ów stwór runął bez życia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błogosławiona to chwila!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy trzeba koniecznie mieć przed sobą twarz, aby uchwycić podobieństwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wróble o zmokłem upierzeniu siedziały nieruchomo na rynnach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja tam za bardzo nie narzekam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nie, jeszcze nie; wyjechał“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy pan gotów jest przysiądz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23607867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie czegoś oczekiwał, gdyż z uwagą wsłuchiwał się w korytarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często ludzie mdleli, płakali, krzyczeli, w rozpaczy rzucali się na ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostali wkrótce umarli, i myślę że ona ich wszystkich przedwcześnie powiodła do grobu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"tam on jest!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuć było zbudzoną ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak chłodno i tak specyficznie surowo nie mówił jeszcze nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwny niepokój wewnętrzny wzrastał we mnie i doprowadzał mnie do rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612663.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak zupełnie inną była Angelina, niż dotychczas w mojej wyobraźni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jechać na spacer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Białe mankiety, świecące pierścienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widzę jeszcze dzisiaj jego pogrzeb przed sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Radość mego serca dawała mi pewność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Angelina plotła tak, jak wodospad, ja zaś byłem oczarowany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to jest opuszczona boczna wieżyczka greckiego kościoła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokój zniknął mi w oczach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz też kiedy iść z nami do tego szynku, mistrzu Pernat!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612672.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne, jak ten starzec był do nich podobny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiałem dłuższy czas siedzieć tak w odrętwieniu, że się niemal o mnie zatrwożyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja to mówię, gdyż bywałam tam często jako dziecko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ja nie śnię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle usłyszałem tuż obok przeraźliwy krzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coś ty za jeden?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłyszałem jakieś chrzęsty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"interes pański na tym polega.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim zdołałem ująć tę wizję, mnich na nowo stał się mnichem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czemuż Pan mówi to tak poważnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pełne zaduchu powietrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to takie nadzwyczajne?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I co, łyso?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale musisz mi powiedzieć wszystko o hrabinie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I zawsze ta sama twarz, i nigdy innych rysów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże to prawdziwe!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczenie nie zgadzało się z temi domysłami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy obcy nie był czasem gołobrody i czy nie miał oczu skośnych, zezowatych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żaden nie mówił słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to niepodobieństwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23612694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotykałem wokoło sam siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiędły zapach wosku i kadzidła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ręczę, że mu się to wszystko tylko śniło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ja się cieszę, że szczepienia na grypę nie są obowiązkowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był tandeciarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toż nieraz mi pan życzliwie podawał rękę pomocną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co bądź, zanim wpadnę w obłąkanie“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Drogi i szanowny mistrzu Pernat!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zwak, nie opowiesz nam nic więcej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jej znów przyszło na myśl, aby tutaj zajeżdżać tak jawnie?“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc go znacie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już się bałam, że pana nie zastanę w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzikie obrzydzenie do życia zaciska mi gardło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mi się, że z sufitu pada słaby, zaledwie dostrzegalny promień światła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23636857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A niech cię szlag trafi i krew nagła zaleje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprowadziłem ją do fotelu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pani ma choćby najmniejsze zaufanie do mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oprócz tego będę ci płacił za wszystkie dzieła, które dla mnie wykonasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem dwuznaczność, ukrytą w jego słowach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pulsa moje biły za mocno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze gwałtowne trzeszczenie, które się przeraziło samo siebie i gwałtownie się przerwało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomiędzy niemi przejście na szerokość jednego kroku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stać, jesteście otoczeni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przerzuciłem kartkę i moje przypuszczenie się nie sprawdziło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko to on wymyślił, uroił sobie, wyśnił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co się z nią dzieje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nogi dotykały się szerokich, kamiennych stopni, posypanych żwirem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zapewne północ.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszenie mnie ogarnia, gdy o nim pomyślę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23642198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dragoński mundur z szamerunkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywołałem dorożkę, która w oparach wyglądała jak połamany potwór przedpotopowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To też mój kapitał ciągle wzrastający, był w ciągłym ruchu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"byłaby bardzo ładna, gdyby się mogła ubierać z elegancją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"ja lubię skakać i biegać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę potrzebował twojej pomocy dziś w nocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z epidemią koronawirusa informujemy, iż nasza Firma funkcjonuje bez zmian.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posterunki opryszków ustawione były w wąskim wąwozie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem okrążyć całą wyspę, ale za daleko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest bardzo tajemnicza sprawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.676,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Upaliłem już z pięć mil, nie natrafiwszy na najmniejszą nawet przeszkodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My, oficerowie, zamieszkiwaliśmy osobne skrzydło i tworzyliśmy szczególny ludek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostałbym pewnie tańca świętego Wita z radości, że mi to przypadło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na złość będzie Maciuś wesół i już.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971686.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochwalony Jezus Chrystus.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiałem każde słowo z ich rozmowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli się zgadza, no to dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciwem spojrzeniem ogarnęliśmy w mgłach stojące zbocza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karty graficzne są strasznie drogie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Doprawdy, wstydzę się za nasze miasto!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po dwie pary prycz z siennikami przy ścianach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśmy pragnęły poznać ciebie, i od dawna próbowałam doprowadzić to do skutku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakiś mężczyzna siedział koło niej, trzymając rękę na jej czole“.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo tamto jest moje niebo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawołał go więc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koniecznie to zobacz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo dla mnie nie byłoby wyboru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale gdzie ją znaleźć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pan podpisał, że się przyznaje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaraz to panom wyjaśnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"prawda, o bocianach!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby go te mniszki nie odkryły, musiał go Hubert ukryć starannie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz gra rozpoczęła się na dobre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971822.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On Maciuś jest panem swych myśli i rozkazuje i musi mieć silną wolę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Huryski, piękne jak w raju Mahometa, uśmiechają się do ciebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jak dawno posiadł pan ten dar „podróżowania“?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale co rozkaże?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Około jedenastej Ochocki odprowadził Wokulskiego do jego mieszkania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ustaw na cichy, bo ci powiadomienia cały czas przychodzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniosłeś zaszczyt swej sławie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale z niej słodziak!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze stanowiska formy wzorem wszystkich sztuk jest muzyka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wystarczy już tego dobrego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze nie wszystko było stracone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24971890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwątpiłem czy będę mógł ją przetrwać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Fotografia bardzo się wytarła, ale się nie martwię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy się kto w czasie mojej nieobecności wślizgnął i tu ukrył?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niechby siedziała w morzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem otrzymawszy przyrzeczoną nagrodę, udał się dalej, nie oglądając się nawet.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest cieplej i niebo takie ładne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja powiadam, że może przychodzić i jego dziadek również, jeżeli zechce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chaos i tyle“...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda, że Maciuś nie wie dokładnie, co robi minister wojny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z nich zauważył mnie przy blasku lampy, powstał i zawołał na mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była wielka burza na morzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale oczy każdego, nawet cudzoziemca, musiał uderzać ten wzrok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już trochę gram na skrzypcach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest w ogóle ulica, która się tak nazywa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Idę na górę do mego pokoju i zastaję tam Julię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Artysta ma prawo wyrażać wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdarzenie to wymaga pewnych objaśnień i uzupełnień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te trzy osoby posiadają wielkie wpływy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zapytałem, nic nie rozumiejąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dumą i radością zapłonęło mi serce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeniec chce uciekać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezarek wykonał swe postanowienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wczoraj uważałem, jak się zasypia, ale zasnąłem i nie wiem, jak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"czy wzięłyście ładne chusteczki do nosa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szybko dokończyłem herbatę, Irowi nalałem trochę mleka do miseczki i poszedłem do Stacha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szukasz garnca złota czy coś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"albo: chcesz mnie, czy nie chcesz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli wydaję rozkaz, muszę być pewien, że będzie ściśle wykonany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, o gustach się nie dyskutuje, ale sukienka w kwiatki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądźcie też dobrej myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zirytowana hrabina kazała jechać do domu, nie czekając końca wyścigów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakże mi przyjemnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jagiełło przyjechał do Krakowa w ciężkiej rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ale teraz, panie Pernat, przechodzę do prośby, którą panu chce przedstawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i na górze było pięknie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli oni dadzą ognia, Watsonie, to nie wahaj się i pal do nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979257.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.596,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że rosnę, ale nie mogę uwierzyć, że będę duży albo stary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toć go nie mogę gwałtem odebrać rodzicom!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cztery promile i jeszcze po wódę sięgasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trochę pochodzić po pałacu, po parku, po mieście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopóki mąż był w domu, on był osobą - ona cichym i pokornym cieniem osoby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.028,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbudził go okrzyk tłumu, dzwonek i brawo... To odbył się pierwszy wyścig.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błyskawice i taki huk, taki grzmot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nazajutrz po noclegu w Płocku ruszyli do Spychowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979291.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastanów się więc, póki czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stąd możemy przejść prosto na drugą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojtek kupił nowy mikrofon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim ten cokolwiek mógł odpowiedzieć, uścisnąłem mu rękę i zawarłem drzwi za sobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszedłem po niej i ukryłem się wygodnie w sianie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby wiedział, jak mnie bolało jego współczucie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanąłem wyprostowany w środku pokoju i spoglądałem na wejście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały tydzień razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nie długo trzeba ci się będzie postarać o męża!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Pszenica ładnie wygląda, jak rośnie,“ odezwał się Alfred.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979332.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wszystko mi jedno w rezultacie, gdzie osiedli się ten młody człowiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla człowieka honoru, którego los tak okrutnie dotknął, pozostawała jedna tylko droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wie Maciuś, co rozkazać nieposłusznym myślom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.108,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbym panu najdokładniej odrysować wszystką grę jego twarzy przy każdem mojem słowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczęta są ciche i lubią doglądać chorych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszędzie, gdzie był, robił zdjęcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król musi umieć sobie rozkazywać...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979620.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godzinę będzie Maciuś rysował, bo mu to bardzo potrzebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poświęcam tobie i wicehrabiemu te dwie godziny: nie dziękujecie mi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979622.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Słowik wabi samiczkę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmawiali dalej przytłumionym głosem i poznałem, że mówią o mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwa zasmolone czarne biurka z wysoką na metr nasadą stały naprzeciw siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest takie dziwne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż Murat nie zamienił swej czapy huzarskiej na koronę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_24979655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Także zawracanie głowy... Dowcipny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem na swobodnem łóżku i czekałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leżał na piersiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zobaczymy, panno Izabelo: kim ty jesteś i co jesteś warta?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak rycerscy wrogowie postępują między sobą w wojnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego wyświetlacz ma niską gęstość pikseli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastanawiałem się nad rozsądną odpowiedzią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ażeby zabić wszelką myśl.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje mi się, że nawet bohater czasem się przestraszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten potrafi więcej, niż jeść zupę łyżką!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre matki, ciotki, albo ojcowie poprostu przyprowadzają do nas panny na wydaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy można kochać, jeżeli się nie zna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spływały z nieba: pień ukrywał się za ścianą z mgły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnie zbladły mu barwy piór ze wstydu, że nań patrzy tylu dostojników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieźle, jest grochówka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25110399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiano?“ Przestraszony upadł na krzesełko i wyjąkał: „Co jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na honor, nie wiem nawet, gdzie uciec przed temi upałami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111630.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzył na mnie ciągle, przez caluteńką drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111631.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mgnieniu oka z pięciu lew wziąłem trzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczę się animować w starym stylu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak się pan nazywa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111664.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem oczy jej spoczęły długo na mnie zadowolone, że nareszcie mnię znalazły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111665.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumie mnie pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111666.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadko kiedy w życiu, panowie, znajdowałem się w tak brzydkiem położeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111667.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę, błagam pana, skróć cierpienia moje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25111668.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał znowu pół godziny, jak czarny cień w ciemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25119635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chyba mówił, że Android jest dla biedaków?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25119637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skinął przyjaźnie głową i oddalił się sprężystym krokiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25119638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ten zwyczajny kamyczek jest tylko jeden na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25119639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gmach ten należy do Waszej królewskiej mości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25334917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem wdarł się niepowołany i zamordował go.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25334918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jak też tu wszystko ładne i porządne!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25334919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leży Maciuś w szpitalu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25334920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świdrowałem oczyma po wszystkich kątach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25334921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówił, że jest dziennikarzem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie mieli zapadłe oczy i popękane wargi, a na nich zeschnięte grudki krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ty słyszysz, Emilko?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równia szła w bezkresy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykro mi, że musimy przerwać tę miłą rozmowę, ale przyjdziesz jeszcze kiedy, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta wojna domowa, która nastąpiła zaraz po wojnie zagranicznej, jest rzeczą bardzo ciekawą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam to w dupie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"a teraz moi Drodzy, proponuję zrobić przerwę na kawę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hrabia wzruszył ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postąpił więc aż na próg drzwi i wziął za młotek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opuścił knajpę, ale stworzył lokalnego bohatera.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"on wszędzie węszy zdradę i nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wziął też do ręki cycuś, a zaraz i drugi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugiego zaś zapamiętał sobie dobrze pomocnik ogrodowy, którego już miał w garści.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz bądź spokojny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to wielka, bezdenna jama.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ustawajcie jednak w poszukiwaniach, dopóki się nie dowiecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przesuwam się koło jednego okna; spoglądam do środka: tam wszystko jasno oświetlone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponury, długi budynek znajdował się tuż przede mną!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chwilą, gdy wiedziałem, gdzie ich mogę schwytać, byli na mojej łasce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drżenie serca w mej piersi mówiło mi, że nadeszła właśnie chwila rozstrzygająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedł przez wagon, usiadł przy młodym podróżnym i wyciągnął rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz większa ciekawość mię pali!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było bardzo zimno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O zwykłem polowaniu nie było już mowy, tylko czterej myśliwi zostali panami położenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lwy ucztowały nie więcej, jak o dwadzieścia kroków od zeriby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczegóły podam później.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobre serce ma, ale w głowie pstro...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podał jej ostudzoną, bez cukru, albowiem słodycze zwiększają pragnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz postanowiłeś tylko myśleć i nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_25357582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biblioteka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929753.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjmuj bilet, widzę kanara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_22929755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapoznali się i odtąd szli już razem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiemy dobrze, że kluczowe znaczenie mają wysokie standardy moralne, etyka, godność i jasne zasady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele ze zgłaszanych obaw pozostanie zatem problemami, którymi będą się zajmowały władze krajowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właśnie obiecała Komisja pana przewodniczącego Barroso, ale utknęła już na początku drogi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Euro jest historycznym osiągnięciem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem także naprawdę zaskoczony!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że moje obawy okażą się nieuzasadnione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym poprosić Komisję, aby zastanowiła się jak można ustalić ogólnie wiążące kryteria\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W żadnym razie nie wolno kwestionować Schengen\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz musimy wykorzystać ten czas na działania zapobiegawcze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście nie można sprzedać nowej broni bez zniszczenia starej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można to uznać za rzecz absolutnie normalną, ale jak dotąd nie było to normą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z wnioskiem Komisji dotyczącym kodyfikacji obowiązujących tekstów prawnych wraz z dostosowaniami technicznymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"należy stworzyć jeden punkt dostępu do dokumentów przygotowawczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma pan sześć miesięcy na wdrożenie tej zasady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest zrównoważone podejście i nie leży to w interesie ludzi i społeczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod tym względem musimy być bardziej wstrzemięźliwi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564898.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym położyć nacisk na ten ostatni punkt, ponieważ jedno jest pewne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564899.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Magnez i magnes to dwie różne rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starsi obywatele mają specyficzne potrzeby, zaspokojenie których wymaga wprowadzenia gruntownych zmian społecznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znalazła się, czy nie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zatem właściwie wyważyć proporcje między swobodą przedsiębiorczości a interesami stron trzecich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.196,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przed głosowaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym przypadku zapytano mnie, co mogą stracić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja Europejska powinna postawić szczególny nacisk na kampanię edukacyjną i właściwą komunikację z obywatelami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak było w kościele, tak samo na grobach rodziców.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_33564974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Druga kwestia, którą chcę poruszyć brzmi następująco\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jedyny sposób zwalczania przyczyn chorób związanych z otyłością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedynie silne zarządzanie może rozproszyć niechęć i opór wobec walki ze zmianami klimatycznymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostają one niestety niepełne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz czekamy na odpowiedź zainteresowanych przedsiębiorstw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego możemy na tym obszarze oczekiwać od kolejnej Komisji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środki przeznaczane na kulturę są często rozproszone na wiele projektów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiednia struktura budżetu jest także krokiem we właściwym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mając to na uwadze, prezydencja przedstawiła swe wnioski państwom członkowskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma on na celu przyciągnięcie do Europy dobrze wykwalifikowanych studentów zagranicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy władze Pakistanu naprawdę o tym nie wiedziały?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprezentował się pan przed nami ze skromnością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To Amerykanie czerpią obecnie inspirację z modelu europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale my reprezentujemy obywateli i jesteśmy odpowiedzialni za ich reprezentowanie tu, w tym Parlamencie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W minionych latach powinna ona była zrobić o wiele więcej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że postawiono prawidłową diagnozę i zaproponowano prawidłową terapię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebne jest nam podejście europejskie, które umożliwi obywatelom utożsamianie się z Unią Europejską\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.052,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kariery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popełniajcie jednak błędu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"słońca, wody oraz azotu, fosforanów i potażu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże, sytuacja nie zmieni się z dnia na dzień\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy go skonsolidować i zapewnić mu trwały wzrost\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie musi jednak przewidywać jasność i zaangażowanie po obu stronach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcąc mu takowe zapewnić, będę żądać mniej niżeli on sam ofiaruje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowodem takiego zaangażowania jest dzisiejsza wizyta wiceprzewodniczącego Bidena w Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082236.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo pochwalam nadanie tej debacie priorytetowego znaczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się rozsądne, by podjąć działania zmierzające do redukcji odrzutów, aby chronić populację ryb\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082238.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochrona praw człowieka jest jednym z najważniejszych priorytetów stosunków Unii Europejskiej z Kolumbią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowe wieloletnie ramy finansowe są bardzo istotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O to coraz częściej walczą pracownicy w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Armia i oddziały zbrojne pozwoliły sobie na najbardziej sadystyczną formę brutalności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082254.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z podobną wizytą byłem ponad dwa tygodnie temu w Kairze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dokładnie trzy lata temu Parlament Europejski zatwierdził \\\"Synergię czarnomorską\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście będę musiał ograniczyć się do kilku podstawowych komentarzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Społeczeństwo ma prawo do przejrzystości, informacji i dyskusji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nowy podział równoważy liczbę miejsc zgodnie z trendami występującymi w populacjach państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę nie próbować odwracać naszej uwagi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szczególności załamał się kwitnący handel bydłem hodowlanym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brak przejrzystości w odniesieniu do wydatków budżetowych Unii Europejskiej skutkuje często brakiem sprawiedliwości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę publicznie wyrazić nasze obawy i powiedzieć, że nie pozwolimy się szantażować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję, panie urzędujący przewodniczący\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę zwrócić Państwa uwagę na ten projekt, który nie ma nic wspólnego z bezpieczeństwem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym należy postawić szereg innych pytań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lepiej nie mówić nic niż rzec coś błędnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnich kilku dniach przeżyliśmy w naszych życiach bezprecedensowy wstrząs\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet w życiu prywatnym posiadanie dobrych sąsiadów jest dla każdego z nas ogromnym atutem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko w ten sposób możemy zapewnić młodszym pokoleniom pewniejszą przyszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed tygodniem dr Dżalili podkreślał przed tym zgromadzeniem znaczenie godności ludzkiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"że praca jest dźwignią wzrostu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyna tego jest taka, że musimy popierać konkurencyjność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będą potrzebne nowe strategie, najpierw w krótkim terminie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety tę homofobię często prowokują rządy i ich medialne tuby\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy z tym do czynienia dzisiaj w państwie wiodącym Unii Europejskiej, jakim są Niemcy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po raz pierwszy wydajność rosła szybciej niż w Stanach Zjednoczonych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.412,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znacznie go popuściło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za bardzo ważne uważam też wyraźne rozróżnienie między podatkami a opłatami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieje jednak możliwość, byśmy szybko wspólnie ustalili kilka rzeczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość często spotyka się to z niezrozumieniem ze strony naszych partnerów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bułgaria jest krajem chrześcijańskim i nie posiada żadnych dekretów dotyczących przestrzegania muzułmańskich świąt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czym jest rolnictwo w Unii Europejskiej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082445.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z kryzysu nie da się wyjść krajowymi sposobami, chyba że komuś pomyliły się wieki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam wrażenie, że nie przynosimy korzyści firmom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082462.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żałuję, że pakiet energetyczny zyskał dziś tak duże poparcie wśród posłów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co wówczas zrobią ci ludzie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy dawniej Stany Zjednoczone były zadowolone z bliskości sowieckich rakiet na Kubie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy o tej coraz bardziej powiększającej się różnicy rozmawiać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja, której mam zaszczyt przewodniczyć, przyjęła moje sprawozdanie jednomyślnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kara śmierci jest tam wykonywana regularnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umowa zawiera postanowienia dotyczące stopniowego otwarcia rynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082480.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie zresztą Polacy i Niemcy muszą trochę uporządkować te kwestie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apeluję do Komisji, żeby zajęła się ta sprawą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że po każdej sesji negocjacyjnej nasz główny negocjator podaje Państwu najnowsze wiadomości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to również osób przybyłych z Afganistanu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Walii kluczowe znaczenie miało podejście pragmatyczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym wypowiedzieć się w dwóch kwestiach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest bardzo prawdopodobne, że Pana wniosek uzyska niezbędne poparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byliśmy jedyni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy dostrzegamy rosnące zainteresowanie tym regionem i to nie tylko w tym zgromadzeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten konkretny problem nie leży w \\\"stabilności\\\" finansów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam również nadzieję, że udało nam się poprawić nieco sytuację małych i średnich przedsiębiorstw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"bogatsi więcej inwestują w badania i rozwój\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego niezwykle istotne jest przyjęcie konkretnych zobowiązań i określenie realistycznych celów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082604.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym konieczny jest również pewien stopień pragmatyzmu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynik ukraińskich wyborów prezydenckich nie jest ani wypadkiem, ani \\\"błędnym\\\" wyborem ukraińskiego narodu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"musi być bezpłatne, dobrowolne i anonimowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082608.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kryzys, który omawiamy jest jak tsunami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem zaszczyt się z nim spotkać podczas wizyty w Wenezueli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy do czynienia z bardzo dziwną sytuacją w sektorze bankowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobiście opowiadam się za rozszerzeniem pomocy de minimis na określonych warunkach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy też zapewnić im środki finansowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapewniam państwa, że Komisja Europejska w pełni podziela to zaangażowanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma alternatywy dla obiektywych dyskusji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082670.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakazem tym należy również objąć informacje i reklamy rozpowszechniane wśród personelu medycznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Logicznie rzecz biorąc, to samo tyczy się biura Rzecznika Praw Obywatelskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To prawda, że dziś przed Unią Europejską stoją nowe i poważne wyzwania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To daje nam kolejną rzecz do przemyślenia w naszych przyszłych dyskusjach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam zamiar uczynić ten punkt regularnym elementem szczytów Rady Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Codziennie ofiarami tortur padają w tych więzieniach irańscy mężczyźni i irańskie kobiety\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielkich manifestów wolności i rządów prawa, które tworzyły demokracje współczesne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy dobry, a w niektórych przypadkach rewelacyjny, potencjał badawczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech nie obawia się pan obywateli i ich przedstawicieli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równe szanse powinny leżeć u podstaw każdego obszaru przemysłu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082781.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że pytania te dotykają samej istoty tej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę wyraźnie powiedzieć, że tak nie jest i nigdy nie było\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozporządzenie wprowadza również ostrzejsze wymogi w zakresie szczegółowych opisów produktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie rak jest drugą co do częstotliwości przyczyną zgonów i chorób w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masowe protesty miały podobne podłoże, jednak ich implikacje dla sytuacji międzynarodowej są całkowicie różne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przemoc wobec kobiet to nie prywatny problem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiąc to liczba dnia, tysiąc zabitych, aby dać ponurą nauczkę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma pan w tym względzie nasze poparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatecznie znalezienie rozwiązania tego problemu leży w interesie nas wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy dostrzegać wielką kulturę i historię tego kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co więcej, uznaję je za oznakę zaufania z państwa strony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zabił czworo ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy musimy zaangażować się w te wysiłki i jeszcze bardziej je nasilić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z perspektywy przyszłości powinniśmy wziąć pod uwagę trzy kwestie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele już powiedziano o sytuacji kobiet w zeszłym tygodniu w związku z ósmym marca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzrost cen ropy dotyka wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082823.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem niestety nie zawsze mogę udzielić głosu widząc podniesioną niebieską kartkę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godne poparcia wydają się dwie propozycje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Egipt, Rosja i Chiny są dobrymi przykładami \\\"dyskrecji politycznej\\\" i zachowywania \\\"ciszy\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakres tego zjawiska jest kolosalny i nie do opanowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc po tygodniu przyznał się Maciuś jednemu z chłopców, że jest królem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy zdawało się, że wszystko wraca do starego porządku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście również my utrzymaliśmy właściwą równowagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się jednak, że na co dzień kilka jego elementów nie funkcjonuje prawidłowo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chorwacji do struktur paktu północnoatlantyckiego zdecydowanie wzmocniło jej legitymację akcesyjną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Indie odgrywają nową rolę w stosunkach z krajami rozwijającymi się, dysponując \\\"wszystkim oprócz broni\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza to likwidację różnic w obrębie regionów i między regionami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie, w nadchodzących miesiącach nasili się debata na temat polityki spójności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbieranie danych o pasażerach nie może być tylko przydatne - musi być konieczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to więc pomysł dotyczący swego rodzaju wolnego handlu w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak w praktyce niewiele się dzieje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakres działań w zakresie dostarczenia pomocy jest wyjątkowo duży\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwsza nuta niezgody zabrzmiała dziś rano\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na koniec, często pojawia się krytyka, również międzynarodowego wymiaru sprawiedliwości w sprawach karnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"być może stanie się planem, który wpłynie stymulująco na modernizację europejskiego przemysłu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Choroba ta jest ciągłym zagrożeniem i nie możemy usypiać naszej czujności!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego rezygnacja z węgla bez zapewnienia sobie opłacalnej alternatywy byłaby pozbawiona sensu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobrze by było, gdyby wszyscy podeszli do tej odpowiedzialności poważnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zeszłym tygodniu bardzo pilnie słuchałam uwag komisarz odpowiedzialnej za programowanie finansowe i budżet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogliby państwo wspierać także przedszkola?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak czy inaczej, takie jest nasze zdanie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powinniśmy jednak zdecydowanie na tym poprzestawać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przyszłości może to być przeszkodą, która, mam nadzieję, będzie mogła zostać usunięta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To już przeciw takiej żadna broń nie poradzi, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082925.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Innowacje są oczywiście niezmiernie ważne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apele i rezolucje nie pomagają cywilom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_35082930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspólna refleksja jest kluczowa, aby zapewnić pomyślną i stabilną przyszłość kolejnym pokoleniom w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najważniejszym priorytetem uczyniły wyjście z kryzysu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla wielu takich państw rybołówstwo stanowi jedyne źródło dochodów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Państwa członkowskie mają w tym względzie do odegrania istotną rolę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zbudować rodzaj Stanów Zjednoczonych Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gruźlica jest wyraźnym dowodem nierówności dzielących nasz świat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawiązaliśmy stosunki dyplomatyczne z ponad setką krajów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dowodzi tego debata, w samej rzeczy dzisiejsza popołudniowa debata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezmiernie cieszy nas pozytywna reakcja Parlamentu i Rady na ten wniosek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym się odnieść w szczególności do komentarzy dwóch osób\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najważniejsza debata na temat mleka będzie miała miejsce przy okazji oceny funkcjonowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak koniecznym warunkiem tego musi być akcentowanie i aktywne zwalczanie niebezpieczeństwa uzależnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to rewolucja technologiczna i gospodarcza oraz ewolucja społeczno-kulturowa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy lekceważyć bezpośredniego wymiaru wschodniego pod względem gospodarczym, politycznym i energetycznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jednak stoją za nimi konkretne działania, realne projekty?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246494.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, jak pan powiedział słuchajmy siebie i rozmawiajmy ze sobą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogólnie opinia, którą się zajmujemy, jest pozytywna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie pojawiają się trudności?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co możemy z tym zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogą przyjąć obywatelstwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wciąż jednak główną kwestią pozostaje dostęp do rejonów dotkniętych kataklizmem oraz szybka dystrybucja pomocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym polega wartość dodana Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę dzisiaj krytykować lub bronić rządu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbyszko jednak kazał mu milczeć i paskudnego imienia nie wywoływać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbiedniejsza grupa ludzi w Unii Europejskiej to bez wątpienia Romowie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobną procedurę wdrożyliśmy rok i dwa lata temu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście w życiu bywa zupełnie inaczej i matki często pracują poza domem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagłosowałem, podobnie jak znaczna większość w Izbie, za przyjęciem przedmiotowej rezolucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.532,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatrzymano, przesłuchano i znęcano się nad krewnymi Iljasa Timiszewa, prawnika zajmującego się prawami człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem powinniśmy postępować bardzo uważnie, aby nie opóźnić korzyści\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym obszarze należy skrupulatnie przestrzegać zasady pomocniczości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246536.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to w szczególności potrzeby ustanowienia planu zwalczania ewentualnej presji związanej z nielegalną imigracją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma potrzeby wyznaczania dodatkowych wiążących celów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246538.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przeciwnym razie będziemy mieli na sumieniu kolejne przypadki zarażenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wniosek numer dwa brzmi tak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przeciwnym razie miejsca pracy i piękne i unikalne gatunki zostaną utracone na zawsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie jest kwestia turystyki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Według mnie te kluczowe kwestie o podstawowym znaczeniu powinny się opierać na\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"One zawsze tam były i to raczej pogarszało niż polepszało sytuację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to ważne w odniesieniu do przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byliśmy świadkami tragicznych wydarzeń w Madrycie i Londynie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyniła się do otwarcia nowego rozdziału w procesie budowy Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityczne wykręty ostatnich tygodni zaszkodziły nie tylko Grecji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście, brak doświadczenia po stronie autorów projektów może być jedną z przyczyn\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej kwestii stanęła po stronie Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246610.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważamy, że sprawozdanie kieruje nas na właściwą drogę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo istotne jest wdrażanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to reformy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246613.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ocena kraju różni się przecież od oceny spółki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32246614.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktaty nie przyznają Komisji żadnego prawa inicjatywy w dziedzinie ochrony konsularnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32251300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Różnorodność naszych systemów prawnych jest problemem, na który Komisja może zwrócić i zwróci uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32251301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tą ścieżką zamierzamy podążać w naszej polityce przemysłowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32251302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"mając na uwadze, że reformy społeczno-polityczne w Gruzji powinny podwyższyć poziom życia szerszej populacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32251303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zakon nabierał ufności i poczuwał się w mocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32251304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto w sytuacji gdy kary są łagodniejsze wzrosnąć może częstotliwość ataków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32251305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sukcesem przystępujących i dotychczasowych państw członkowskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32251306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pańskie uwagi zostaną przekazane na posiedzenie Prezydium dzisiaj po południu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32251307.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że powinniśmy się nad tym zastanowić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32251308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gospodarczo wiodło nam się lepiej - ale byliśmy biedniejsi w kontekście europejskiej wspólnoty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32251309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez względu na to, o jakim państwie członkowskim mówimy, jest to znaczna większość firm\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dopiero wieczorem ulitował się opat moich łez, i jeszcze mi paciorki podarował...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy, na przykład, stworzyć coś takiego jak stawka zryczałtowana\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nałożono także wymóg zniesienia stanu wyjątkowego, bez żadnych niejasności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To odległość na Księżyc, a obecnie większość chciałaby, żeby pani tam została\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zjednoczonych w oparciu o wspólną europejską kulturę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy nie potraficie państwo dostrzec zagrożenia związanego z tą zwiększającą się przepaścią?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Celem sprawozdania jest ocena osiągnięć Rady, porównanie pokładanych w niej oczekiwań z wykonanymi zadaniami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strategii było wiele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym zwrócić państwa uwagę na fakt, że nasze negocjacje obejmą cztery główne bloki problemowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem wysłaliśmy słuszny przekaz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy też zachować realizm\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Iran ma największą liczbę egzekucji na świecie po Chinach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"dobrym pomysłem są też zachęty dla państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była bardzo interesująca i pouczająca debata\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno odrzucać ich doświadczenia i chęci do dalszej pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym Pana poinformować, że koledzy z lewej strony sali trzymają banery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie zyskało bezpieczną większość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robią tak Stany Zjednoczone i Japonia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"musi stanąć w obronie prześladowanych chrześcijan\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32252117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy całym moim doświadczeniu nie śniłbym o próbach regulacji tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to ostatnie, lecz bynajmniej nie najmniej ważne sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie przeznaczamy miliardy na przeciwdziałanie kryzysowi finansowemu, z którym borykają się nasze banki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego powinniśmy być zadowoleni z porozumienia zawartego w Radzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś rano Rada odpowiedziała za pośrednictwem prezydencji hiszpańskiej na pozostałe pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnie jest chlorowana i jest równie niesmaczna, co droga\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem, obecni tu pan komisarz i minister również nie ponoszą za to odpowiedzialności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zarazem będziemy nadal dążyć do wdrażania nowej polityki wymiaru północnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W szczególnych przypadkach może to prowadzić do oficjalnych oświadczeń i inicjatyw Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę życzyć wszystkim wesołych Świąt Bożego Narodzenia i szczęśliwego Nowego Roku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z każdego takiego incydentu musimy wyciągnąć pewne wnioski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uzgodniliśmy dalsze wzmocnienie współpracy w zakresie zapobiegania oszustwom poprzez ustanowienie mechanizmu wzajemnej pomocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W praktyce tak naprawdę osiągamy efekt odwrotny do zamierzonego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa może z pewnością pełnić w tym względzie rolę koordynatora, ale nie dyktatora\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Traktat lizboński jest pierwszym traktatem poszerzonej Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To sprawozdanie to cały katalog błędów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moratorium nie wystarczy - musimy pójść jeszcze dalej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może nie powinniśmy jednak wprowadzać przepisów regulujących każdy, nawet najmniejszy, szczegół\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym świetle zawarcie umowy o wolnym handlu jest dla nas korzystne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257981.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za czym jesteście i czemu jesteście przeciwni?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32257983.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej kwestii chcę szczególnie podkreślić sprawę zamówień publicznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja cieszę się z dwóch rzeczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli uważacie, że się mylę, dowiedźcie tego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po ponad pół wieku warto zapytać, czy filozofia ojców założycieli jest nadal aktualna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mleko jest jednym z najważniejszych elementów produkcji rolnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A za tym nie możemy się opowiedzieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też uważam, że część wygłoszonych tutaj uwag naprawdę nie była właściwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Logiczne byłoby, gdyby przywódcy Belgii, Francji i innych krajów zrobili to samo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanim przejdziemy do debaty, chciałbym przedstawić parę istotnych uwag wstępnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rejon dotknięty kryzysem został też zablokowany, żeby uniemożliwić dostarczanie tam pomocy międzynarodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasz Parlament składa się z posłów wybranych bezpośrednio przez obywateli Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że pytanie to nie jest łatwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako co do mnie, wolę szczerze mówić, niż taić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to dość istotny wkład\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bądźmy całkowicie szczerzy, jeśli chodzi o kwestie instytucjonalne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi się, że może się to zdarzyć ponownie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na tym tle zgłoszone przez nas poprawki są w sumie bardzo umiarkowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.924,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej debacie chciałbym zwrócić uwagę na dwie kwestie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielkie rozgrywki ligi rugby już wiele lat temu przeszły na system metryczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258067.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Partie polityczne na szczeblu europejskim to nonsens\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258068.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oba nasze Parlamenty utrzymują wspaniałe stosunki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawozdanie to stanowi aktywny początek dodatkowych badań naukowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyślił się, że księżna dowiedziawszy się o jego powrocie, przedsięwzięła stosowne środki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy dużo więcej robić dla młodych ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W moim wystąpieniu zaakcentuję potrzebę utworzenia partnerstwa z Rosją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przerabiamy teraz, jak mawiają niektórzy, \\\"scenariusza pokryzysowego\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Działania te dotyczą również coraz większej liczby obywateli europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te które urodziły się w naszym kraju muszą co najmniej nabyć obywatelstwo naszego kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie z tego powodu Rzecznik wycofał swoją propozycję dostępu do Trybunału Sprawiedliwości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zarówno przedsiębiorstwa, jak i pracownicy zaczynają odczuwać skutki kryzysu finansowego i gospodarczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę nie możemy zrozumieć, jak takie problemy mogą nadal istnieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I jak przystało na lidera wielkiego narodu żeglarzy, zdążył pan na odpływ\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natomiast teraz próbujemy wziąć poprawkę na to, co zdarzyło się zaledwie wczoraj\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prospekt emisyjny papierów wartościowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokazuje to każda z analiz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że nie możemy stosować żadnej taryfy ulgowej w przypadku poławiania wielorybów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy Słowenia starała się o członkostwo w tych dwóch instytucjach, uważaliśmy, że jedna wystarczy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że nie powinniśmy tak postępować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powszechnie wiadomo także, że spółka General Motors i instytucje europejskie łączą szczególne stosunki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa wniosła formalne zastrzeżenie dotyczące tej kwestii, dając nam pole do manewru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Silna i ambitna wspólna polityka rolna wymaga też odpowiedniego budżetu Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znacząca regresja społeczna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiem teraz na pięć połączonych pytań dotyczących tego samego tematu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258179.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę także niekiedy przypominać niektórym rolnikom, że rekompensaty te już zostały udzielone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258180.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak niedługo będziemy musieli rozpatrzyć inną wątpliwą kwestię w tym względzie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Konieczne zatem jest zwiększanie nakładów finansowych celem rozwoju demokratycznych struktur tych państw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym czasie wypadki polityczne podobnież szybko postępowały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej potencjał jest o wiele większy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę także referendum w sprawie naszego traktatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak w ostatnich latach właśnie to rozwiązanie nie sprawdziło się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32258201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też nie mam tu wiele więcej do dodania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261476.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Karta praw podstawowych będzie kluczowym instrumentem w praworządnej Unii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak ma się do tego sprawozdanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niezwykle trudno jest uniknąć nieprawidłowości, ale rzeczą jeszcze ważniejszą jest je stwierdzić i zapobiec\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Apeluję o pełne przestrzeganie praw człowieka w tym regionie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele osób wspiera nas w naszych nieustających staraniach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proces ten jest kontynuacją niedawnych działań dotyczących Serbii, Czarnogóry i Byłej Jugosłowiańskiej Republiki Macedonii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy jednak dokonać rozróżnienia pomiędzy polowaniem a rzezią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W opinii Komisji protekcjonizm nigdy nie jest uzasadnionym sposobem prowadzenia polityki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ograniczenia można wprowadzać wyłącznie po sprawiedliwym i niezależnym procesie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako obywatel Grecji zwraca on uwagę na sprawy, które dotyczą jego regionu i mieszkańców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiemy o tym ministrom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to problem globalny i w innym miejscu należy się nim zająć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Robiąc bilans kryzysu finansowego, musimy upewnić się, że wyciągnęliśmy zeń jakieś wnioski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cieszę się z poparcia dla obowiązkowego powiadamiania o naruszeniu ochrony danych osobowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę pana zapewnić, że wniosek zostanie przez nas rozpatrzony w możliwie najkrótszym czasie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Środowisko jest ważniejsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porozumienie to zasługuje na nasze zdecydowane poparcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"My jesteśmy odpowiedzialni za to, by pamiętać słowa matki Orlando Zapaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równie ważne są kwestie społeczne i etyczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261515.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z powyższym uważamy, że przedmiotowe sprawozdanie jest nie do przyjęcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, bezpieczeństwo jest niepodzielne i dlatego ważne jest zwiększenie odpowiedzialności państwa bandery\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie to jest tu najważniejszą kwestią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodem niepokoju zarówno obywateli Europy, jak i rynków finansowych jest zwątpienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam tylko jedno pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykorzystajmy nasze głosowanie, aby umożliwić zasiadanie do jedzenia z czystym sumieniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261524.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jako fundament potrzebny nam będzie znacznie bardziej precyzyjny tekst\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261525.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip pochwycił rękę Maciusia, ale Maciuś był strasznie silny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ci ludzie po prostu się lenią\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_32261527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jaką wytyczyć strategię\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy kochamy kobiety, jest to dobre.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A na drugi dzień miał już Maciuś cały plan złożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napijesz się czegoś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656961.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż łaskawy pan może jej przeciwstawić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20656962.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama leżała wciąż w głębokim uśpieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz prawo zachować milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657021.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem gotowy do pomocy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dziwożona wskazała palcem ową stronę, gdzie się znajdował niezbędny dla jej namysłów rozstaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy psuję go, i nagle zaczyna się w nim coś poruszać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przymknąłem na chwilę olśnione oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pokornie panu profesorowi dziękuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starość nie radość, młodość nie wieczność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzniosłem tylko okrzyk na cześć naszej skrzydlatej patronki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kocie łby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli wszyscy, wszyscy, wszyscy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamiast „Harcerze podnieśli nosze”, napisane: „Harcerze podnieśli nos”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I doskonale tłumaczy sny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wygląda na to, że nic nie pasuje do Twojego zapytania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wystarczyło, aby się Emil nią zainteresował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Milcząc, pobiegli we wskazanym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewnego razu powiedział do niej: — Istnieje jeszcze rzecz, którą zataiłem przed tobą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie ma innej rady, jak powiedzieć? — Nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kościół nie identyfikuje się z żadną specjalną formą rządów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamąciło się w głowie, mignęło przed oczami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przykazanie mówi: „Czcij ojca”, a nie każdego, że się wcześniej urodził.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A to mi się podoba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A przysięga uroczysta, to nic? — zapytała pantera, pokazując zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykam oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz mógł dokładnie spojrzeć jej w dotąd półmrokiem nocy zakrytą twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie dobrzy! — jęknął przerażony Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to poza goleniem się największy wysiłek z tych codziennych, programowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W jednej z tych ścian przez otwór sączyło się światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ja nie mogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym przy stosunku zachowuje się też dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ej, panie Michale…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie udawał, że ma coś załatwić w gabinecie dyrektora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten element jest już wyłączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki i kulawiec ze czcią na ów sęk teraz spojrzeli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pokarm wchodzi w nas, gdy jemy, i sprawia to nam przyjemność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To ty, Stefan!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na kogo idzie, to idzie, a trafi w sam carat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20657433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dosłownie nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674485.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powróciwszy, poddał się okolicznościom i zapłacił karę oraz zaległy podatek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówi, że go królowie oszukali, że port zabrali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawia ołówkową spódnicę i zaczesuje ciemne włosy za ucho.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekarz oświadczył, że to apopleksja.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko niech mnie pan na tej stacji nie pozdrawia!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odpowiedział wolno: - Możesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ładnie wyglądasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem — odparł bezradnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście zabieg nie był mi obcy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez kilka godzin byłam poza zasięgiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kuj żelazo póki gorące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pożegnanie wręczyła mu swoją gabinetową fotografię, zdjętą przed paru dniami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem dlaczego tak cię to bawi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie pocieszającym objawem jest to, że użyto podstępu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I dlatego właśnie przyjemnie się bawić samemu, bez dorosłych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieliśmy tu w tym pokoju, gdzie teraz stukot maszyny nasuwa skojarzenia ostatniej jazdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może kto dla kawału puścił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uczułem mimowolny dreszcz grozy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedzieli, że będą za pięć minut.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674511.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie ci niemiłe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na górach spokojnie żerowały stada reniferów i jaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od początku widzimy, że z listonoszem coś jest nie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie chciał wierzyć, ale uwierzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było sobie miasteczko nad rzeczką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A gdyby ci było przyjemnie? — To bym była zadowolona, że poszłam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiłaby teraz wszystko, czego by chciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, gdybym nawet mógł znów się zamienić, wolałbym jeszcze spróbować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patelnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę cię mieć wyłącznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poeta śpiewał, król nasłuchiwał, a wszyscy obecni głośno objawiali swój zachwyt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezultaty pewne otrzymuje się tylko indukcją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znała aż za dużo historyjek z małymi dziewczynkami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Los padł na Michała, prostodusznego i kochającego młodzież entuzjastę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To naprawdę było przyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I duch jego unosił się samotny i cierpiał z powodu swojej samotności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czasem udaje mi się pochwycić niektóre wibracje ludzkiej psyche — odpowiedział skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, że ścigałeś nieprzyjaciół jak Czarniecki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce krąży wokół Ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była jedyna rzecz, oprócz Ewy, na którą zwrócił uwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674692.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musi pan tylko zgłosić dopłatę konduktorowi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674693.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ich włosach rosną wodorosty, w granatowej, połyskującej wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674694.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jak łykanie śliny, gdy się chce pić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmiany zaszły również na nowej części cmentarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obawiam się, że tego nie zrozumiałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam uczucie, że tam byłaś w tym ogrodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z jakiego? — Nie gniewaj się, że będę przykry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam są Anka i Rena i one go poznają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już nigdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Płacząc i rycząc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I balon za nimi jak pies.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jano wchodzi do kuchni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dolewaj oliwy do ognia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mnie! — szepnął jednoręki, który dotąd trwał w zupełnym milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biały ogier arabski.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie uciekł Maciuś, nie wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pytanie jest bezzasadne, proszę pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przestań — mówiła ta pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— My nic nie wiemy — mówią dozorcy więzienni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I słusznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bliżej ona drapała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda? Biedny Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem ryk, a potem nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepraszam, już chcę wyjść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674786.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy możemy od razu przejść do konkretnych ustaleń?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem ani Podlasiak, ani jednoręki nie powitali nowej obietnicy radosnymi okrzykami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli jeszcze w ogóle daleko od siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogłem napisać coś więcej, skoro nic więcej nie wiedziałem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja też zrobię świnkę! — zawołał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczegóż nie teraz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pomyliłeś się, bratku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy krok jego wyciśnie krwawy ślad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszałem, że od najbliższego nowiu zacznie tutaj polować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko w najbliższej przegrodzie coś się poruszyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Za co by cię mieli zabijać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Boże, bądź miłościw…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wilki ledwo dyszały; Bartek również gonił ostatkiem sił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz rozpoczęte zdanie zamarło mi na ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Gajowiec — dobrze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec końcem kija zmacał pogięty jak fala kark zwiniętej w kłębek dziwożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oblicze stare, przeorane siecią fałd i zagłębień, jakby dwoiło się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudno! — odparł z westchnieniem Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674819.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobała mu się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem Rembrandt celowo tak to namalował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyżby umiał pan czytać w cudzych duszach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I wcale przez drzwi nie wchodziłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chmury są wyjątkowo piękne przed zachodem słońca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie bój się, nic ci nie zrobię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil miał o trzy lata młodszego brata.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pochylił się nad łóżkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ona musi być inna od innych lalek — mówiła Sara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On się kręcił, ten garbus, dookoła mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzył ją w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie słuchał jej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na czym polega pańskie bogactwo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj wyjaśniono sprawę w oka mgnieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obiecuję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20674854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co jest dla ciebie w życiu najważniejsze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz zasnął na przyrodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko zachowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Na początku jest zdanie: wszystko jest możliwe i wszystko jest prawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A muszą się ukrywać, bo im nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20691808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu to nie było ważne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20702963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W sklepie się woda zapaliła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20702964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz na swoją obronę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20702965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była robota!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20702966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W klatce go posadzić i na rynku wystawić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20702967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozmawiają o tym, o owym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708120.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech i kaszel są w pierwszych dniach wykluczone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Życie składa się z samych niedziel.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem długo jak wryty, nie mogąc uczynić kroku naprzód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708123.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale może wojna, która nadchodzi, przyniesie tu jakieś zmiany na lepsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708124.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gondola odbijała od brzegu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzenie Ani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708126.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inspektor zdjął płaszcz i rozpiął parę guzików przy obcisłej urzędowej bluzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Neurolog zgasił papierosa — Nie chcesz chodzić do szkoły, prawda? — Nie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zapłaci pan za to karę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możecie nas tu zamknąć!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708130.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uwagi te mogą się wydać niektórym nie na czasie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Franciszek był jednym z moich najlepszych kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skontrolował uważnie, czy jest cała otulona i zabezpieczona przed mrozem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byl zgorszony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20708134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynalazł dla mnie obalony przez burzę olbrzymi cedr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To komiczne, że wszedł do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W perspektywie wyłonił się biały kontur cmentarnego muru.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z chęci pieszczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcemy cię wziąć na kolację.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20717018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spotkałem ją raz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest na wypadek, gdyby Nel dostała febry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadanie mi nie wychodzi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało się, że ani na krok nie przybliżyła się do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem co noc ktoś ubywał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słońce wznosiło się coraz wyżej i przypiekało jak przed burzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jednej stronie pagórki piaszczyste.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiatr puszysty okręca się dookoła szyi, jak szal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tak, tak, to bardzo niebezpieczny gość, nie ulega wątpliwości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851065.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O południu, gdy upał czyni się największy, trzeba się było zatrzymać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20851066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aureola przesunęła się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Ach, że ten szlachetny człowiek opuścić musiał nasz padół ziemski!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000237.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuć było zbudzoną ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzdrygałem się na myśl, że muszę znów wracać do swego smutnego domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000241.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastukałem do okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słysząc to, odczuwałem prawie ból i spoglądałem czy prędko będzie koniec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000285.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opanowała mnie wściekłość nieprzytomna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000286.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem schwyciła nagle mą rękę i zaśmiała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000287.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogłem tego dłużej wytrzymać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000288.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Nigdy nie można być siebie pewnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000289.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapłaciłem i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stopniowo wciskały się głębiej w moje ciało, coraz głębiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000344.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Groźbą i siłą znalazł sobie drogę, aż do łoża chorego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000346.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie znam nawet nazwiska mego ojca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„No to, wielkie szczęście dla mnie.“ „Jakto?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan o tem nie może mieć żadnego zdania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kiedy znów nieznajomy przyjdzie, aby ją odebrać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotykałem wokoło sam siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nienawiść, to zbyt słabe wyrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"to słabo powiedziane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dręczył mnie całą noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domyśliłem się, że wzięły mnie za Golema.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak, tak, to był jego chód.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żadna inna droga tam nie dochodziła, oprócz tej którą przyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie podobna wytrzymać tego ciągłego oczekiwania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000439.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Golem pociąga za sobą nieprzewidziane skutki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzęsy rudowłosych są dla mnie tak wstrętne, jak królicze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pulsa moje biły za mocno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjąłem list i wręczyłem go damie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000469.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Wszystko z rozmysłem!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000505.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzwony zaśpiewały z wież kościelnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I przytem jeszcze bukiet czerwonych róż kupić dla Angeliny!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000508.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siad Burek, siad!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000509.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zagryzł wargi i zwrócił się w stronę koźlej twarzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Tylko po części.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W piętnastym roku życia urodziła dziecko i odtąd już się nie pokazała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000532.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś powołany sam przez siebie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czułeś to wyraźnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby mi się zdarzyło to, co panu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000535.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierwej pojedziemy, prawda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawie nic.“ Przerwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000555.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może to jest opuszczona boczna wieżyczka greckiego kościoła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Lecz niech pan nie myśli, że rozgoryczył mnie tak smutny los.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aboż natura jest piękną?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lekkie uczucie zgrozy zakradło się we mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Godziny ostatnich dni upłynęły mi jak na skrzydłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadłem przy warsztacie i wyjąłem obcążki i rylce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na Miłość Boską!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000633.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Sam nie wiem dla czego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaspokoiła ona resztki drzemiących w nim właściwości: żądzę złota i złośliwą rozkosz samoudręczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W sumie masz mikrofon w kamerce, pewnie zadziała, ale nie zalecam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jak gdyby mogło być coś wspanialszego na ziemi, niż stracić grunt pod nogami!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mi się, że śpię, tak opanowała mnie konieczna cisza wewnętrzna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000674.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od wzburzenia niezdolny mówić dalej, podbiegł do okna i zaczął przez nie wyglądać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jest lepiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powóz skręcił w wilgotną łąkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on wiedział, co się teraz stało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko kształt głowy Ibisa egipskiego trwał najdłużej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak, czuję, on ma słuszność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z oddali zbliżał się orszak korybantów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"One to wykonywały ruchy, których nie chciałem i nie zamierzałem wykonywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I niemasz nadziei na odzyskanie straconej pamięci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000717.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli to możliwe, napiłabym się Coli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy pan go zna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mateczki swej nigdy oko w oko nie widziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może był otynkowany na biało, gdyż świecił tak jasno we mgle nocnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koźla twarz ponuro znów się wcisnęła pod pulpit.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy obcy nie był czasem gołobrody i czy nie miał oczu skośnych, zezowatych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nigdy nie udało mi się wyjaśnić przyczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000813.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Białe mankiety, świecące pierścienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę przecie dziecka ustąpić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obłąkany z miłości zatopiłem usta w jej dłoni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezsilny znów upadłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż to na zakończenie mówił mi student o tandeciarzu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jak dzisiaj w nocy nad kartą z taroka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko z tyłu głowy wyczuwałem jeszcze zimne ślady ich dotyku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem w ręku?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za jakie grzechy mnie to spotyka?!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zastukałem do bramy: nikt nie otwierał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest w tem dla mnie coś niewymownie słodkiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było by szaleństwem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozumie mnie pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Krew moja dziwnie się uspokaja w tem królestwie nieruchomości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech mi pan, przerwie, mistrzu Pernat, gdy będę znów zbyt popędliwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem przywlokły nagą kobietę, olbrzymią, jak spiżowy kolos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi i on wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ja nie śnię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nich prawie na wysokość człowieka nad poprzednim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starczy, starczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starałem się wywołać w pamięci jego zjawę, lecz mi się nie udało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co najpierw przynieść?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za księżna?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Włożyłem kapelusz i przeszedłszy korytarz, zszedłem po schodach na dół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23000958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Córka jego miała mnie zawiadomić natychmiast, gdy ojciec powróci z żydowskiego ratusza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pełen zniecierpliwienia chodziłem tam i z powrotem po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególnie, jeżeli chodziło o zniknięcie bez śladu córek w wieku ślubnym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na chwilę ustał szmer głosów w bramie i słychać było tylko syczenie deszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz dużo czasu już minęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieustannie czułem na piersi, że list przy sobie niosę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewidentnie zabrakło im chęci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciła mi się na szyję, śmiała się i przez chwilkę płakała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walczą skrycie przeciwko swoim chuciom bez końca i bez skutku, pełni trwogi nieprzerwanej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"on wszędzie węszy zdradę i nienawiść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagle usłyszałem tuż obok przeraźliwy krzyk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo woli cofnąłem rękę, którą przy jego wejściu wyciągnąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiedziałem o tem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy uraziłam pana?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz pogłoska ta długo utrzymać się nie mogła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001064.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapanowała dłuższa przerwa, podczas której radca policyjny zdawał się coś z wysiłkiem kombinować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Jeżeli to panią zbyt nie zmęczy, czy mógłbym się razem z nią cieszyć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani chwili nie tracić!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem się na podłogę i znów skoczyłem na nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu płaska równa droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba to zobaczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz nie mogę sobie przypomnieć, czyli mówił gdzie mieszka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem mu, że chciałbym wziąć dorożkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrozumiano?“ Przestraszony upadł na krzesełko i wyjąkał: „Co jest?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ogłuszył by ją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie byłem też bynajmniej zdziwiony, gdyż tego właśnie oczekiwałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mógłbym je narysować z zamkniętymi oczyma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tem jest jeszcze coś innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwak woła kelnerkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to, co wypełniało mi nieprzerwanie tyle minionych lat, było złudzeniem?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001239.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zatem, panie Pernat, zechciej mi powiedzieć, co pan tak robi przez cały dzień?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie pozwoliłby tu sobie na najmniejszą choćby nieuczciwość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od zjawiska tego rozchodził się mdły zapach drzewa sandałowego i wilgotnego łupku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001321.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacząłem błądzić sam w stosunku do siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stoję jednak dopiero na początku drogi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może pan chce iść do domu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzałem na zegarek: chwała Bogu wpół do piątej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czyż, aby ją widzieć, muszę siedzieć na łące?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wychodzi na jedno.“ „Pan go chce zamordować!“ krzyknąłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet, gdybym musiał wykrzesać iskry z mych kości, aby się ogrzać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Droga w parku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kawaler mówi znów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to dla mnie okres czasu nieskończony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurz na meblach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musiałem nieruchomo wlepić w nią oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy istotnie była to ta sama kobieta, którą kiedyś spotkałem w katedrze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyglądało to jak szeroka ciemna wolno rozwijająca się wstążka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"We śnie czy na jawie prześladują mnie jego zezowate oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Punkt błyszczący, jak oko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie spojrzałem, złowroga niechęć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Systematycznie szedłem wstecz przez moje życie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale za każdym razem odrzuciłem precz tą decyzję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powietrze, które wdychałem rozrzedziło się i cięło, jak eter.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001496.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Czy znów się odnalazła?“ zapytałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie ja to imię czytałem?..\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ej, oddawaj mi moją czekoladę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001523.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostrzegła mój uśmiech.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla czego ja właściwie żyłem tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To byłoby najmądrzejsze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziałem mu to w oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tak łatwo jest pomagać, jak sądzisz, drogi przyjacielu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami wiecie, jak mało promieni słonecznych pada na ciemne uliczki Pragi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiałem, co chciał przez to powiedzieć i przyjąłem, jak gdybym się przesłyszał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001552.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co myśli i co zamierza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmarznięty chodziłem po pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była napisana językiem hebrajskim, zupełnie dla mnie niezrozumiałym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Oczekiwanie na cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto ci pozwolił grzebać w moim telefonie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy to mi na co się przyda, gdy tam wejdę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale poza tem czarnem głębokiem okiem drzemała głębia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Psalmie Dawida powiedziano: „Tedy rzekłem sam w sobie: teraz zaczynam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był on jak natchnienie, któremu nie można było się oprzeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na policzkach studenta ukazały się okrągłe czerwone plamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001621.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozostali wkrótce umarli, i myślę że ona ich wszystkich przedwcześnie powiodła do grobu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, że jak zostawisz otwartą lodówkę, to wcale się zimniej nie zrobi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od niego zależy postanowić czy za moją radą pójdzie czy nie pójdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również i to nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001648.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kasetka stała również nietknięta na swojem miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001649.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem wpadł mi szczególny pomysł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001669.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twój nieboszczyk ojciec był moim najlepszym przyjacielem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001671.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zapytałem, nic nie rozumiejąc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był człowiek, z którym miałem rozmawiać!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaprzeczę, naturalnie zaprzeczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby się tylko skończyło to straszne oczekiwanie jutra!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strumienie wody spływały z dachów po fasadach domów, jak potoki łez.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż w końcu rabin wybiegł naprzeciw niego i czarodziejską kartkę zniszczył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takim pana nigdy jeszcze nie widziałam!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ani też, dokąd Pan dziś pójdzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23001707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten drab to czysty zbrodniarz.“ W zamyśleniu przeczyła ruchem głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw udał się do probostwa nie bez pewnej trwogi w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co do mnie mówisz? — pyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zdaje się, że się uderzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604348.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oto jest twoja myśl o śmierci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara spełniła rozkaz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewałem się znaleźć odpowiednie elementy z tą etykietą, ale nie udało mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605650.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego go lubię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od tej chwili nie mogłem skupić uwagi na żadnym zajęciu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605673.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tylko spojrzę na dziecko, zaraz wiem, co ono warte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc — panno Klementyno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie przyznałaby się do tego za Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznali się na człowieku: zostałem naczelnikiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606066.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła: — Niepotrzebnie mówisz, że mnie lubisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem Wierusz odprowadzał chorą materię już ku palcom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dorośli nie lubią się sami schylać, bo ich kości bolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Musiał być chyba przyjemny, bo przed samym przebudzeniem uśmiechnęłaś się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo trwało jej osłupienie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O piątej po południu zapaliłem bez wielkiej przyjemności pierwszego papierosa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego? W tej chwili zadzwonił telefon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606313.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwadzieścia, no, powiedzmy trzydzieści tysięcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606314.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogoda w Krakowie jest dzisiaj całkiem ładna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nastrój w wartowni był błędny i niewyraźny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Samotność, wiadomo, jest złym towarzyszem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwienie odmalowało się na twarzy starca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten przełącznik wydaje się być już włączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20606593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skądże mam wiedzieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607605.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymali się za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607607.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto przechodziło z rąk do rąk przez wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607609.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Filip na wpół nieprzytomny od dymu, kicha potężnie i budzi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607611.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła na niego, zawiedziona, że nie sprawił jej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607612.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcieli nawet chwili pogadać z nim cierpliwie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty nie masz tak prawa mówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stacja jest domkiem z małym ogródkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil próbował zmienić temat rozmowy i powiedział, że był na koncercie znanego pianisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam dla was trzy rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20607976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak pod dotknięciem różdżki czarodziejskiej przeistoczyła się jej postać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Powiedz mi, jakimi środkami osiągacie takie cuda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I nagle z jego włosów zaczęły się sypać iskry aż na podłogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Księża za granicą nie chodzą już w takich spódnicach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod żadnym pozorem nie trzeba przez kilka dni przyjmować wieczornych zaproszeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pies szczeknął, Maciuś wyrwał zakrwawioną rękę i schował do kieszeni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie, ile dokładnie czasu potrzebuje na dotarcie swoim tempem na uczelnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem mu się w ramiona na długą, długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A może zauważyłeś coś niezwykłego w czasie snu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po chwili do pokoju weszła jakaś Chinka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pewno, że takie rzeczy tylko na osobności się gada — stwierdził z nagłym przekonaniem jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zawsze myślałem z przeszkodami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczyny poszły zobaczyć zachód słońca, a ja zostałem z małym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobno róże miłości najchętniej przyjmują się na grobach…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjęła list z jego zaciśniętej pięści i natychmiast posłała po lekarza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20608806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sen spełzał powoli z jej oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo pies też lubi towarzystwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hubert jak zwykle palnął jakiś suchar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem jednakże, czy mógł czytać dalej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cofnęła ją łagodnie i znikła w głębi domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie jadła, chudła z dnia na dzień, a nie sypiała wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, muszę iść do swojej roboty — powiedział Filip i poszedł do swojego śledzia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cóż ty takiego wyrabiasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Codziennie niemal przypomina o tym, wysyłając mi na spotkanie Rotundę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ich kucharka Marysia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20609846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zrobił w ścianie dziurę gwoździem na znak tego zdarzenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słabo mi się robi na widok krwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dąży do szczęścia i czasem jest szczęśliwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ucieknie! — pocieszał siebie samego jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale wróćmy się do rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przemoczona do suchej nitki… przeziębiona… i głodna śmiertelnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.08,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy pełnoletni obywatel, który mieszka w Polsce, musi mieć dowód osobisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawe, co z tego wyniknie!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wpuszczono mnie do wnętrza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech sama wedle chęci wargami rozporządza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ot, w piosenkę… żeby mieć cię blisko ust.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610790.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trochę patologiczne, że siedzimy tu razem i udajemy, że to normalne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, sarna wróci chyba do leśniczówki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pojawia się pejzaż górski, wulkaniczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to duży, tłusty samiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20610794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozejrzałem się po blacie, który miał zastępować wigilijny stół.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan uległ zapewne pomyłce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko z trudem uratowaliśmy córkę, której groziło poważne niebezpieczeństwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko, mówię ci, albo nie uratuje go już żadna siła!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeżeli się uda, będę od razu najsławniejszym adwokatem na świecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612169.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę pani w czymś pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kurz osiadał na nich.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla mnie zmieniła świat cały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tępym, automatycznym krokiem wywlokłem się z mieszkania…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zostawił po sobie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdaje mi się, że szkoda mu było na to czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odprowadził ją do drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw zauważyłem kolbę karabinu, ukrytego na łóżku pod stosem poduszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przekona się pan o tym wkrótce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Błyskawice rozrywają chmury o płonących wnętrzach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613029.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A i te były za duże.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzeczywiście, ceny mogą być dla niektórych zbyt wysokie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613031.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w tym może jej szczególny urok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwą musiała być siła, która przeszła przez ten łachman człowieczy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, zwariowałam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613345.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na torebce, którą przyciska do boku, widać kolorową nalepkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613347.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale tego chyba nie myślisz na serio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli wczoraj wieczorem w parku i trzymali się jak zakochani za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadza się pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad wodą bełkocącą stała drewniana ka wiarenka, w której jadał truskawki ze śmietaną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od miasta do miasta!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— O ile się nie mylę, jesteśmy starzy znajomi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znowu zaległo milczenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten hałas mnie męczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecka nie wolno przyjmować do pracy zarobkowej przed osiągnięciem odpowiedniego, minimalnego wieku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wątpiłem, że i ona poznała mnie także.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak tu prześlicznie! — szeptała leniwie, mrużąc oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest we mnie — i ja we wszystkim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten zaś zmierzył Mariana od stóp do głów i zapytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614632.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko powinno zawsze mieć pierwszeństwo do ochrony i pomocy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tam, tam, za biurkiem, w kącie, pod ścianą!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszła w towarzystwie koleżanek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614640.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepraszam, jeśli przeszkadzam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbowałeś restartować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę panu zrobić niespodziankę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez chwilę myślałem, że to twój kolega z pracy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego z przodu idzie dwóch, a z tyłu czterech?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdejmuje mokrą sukienkę i kładzie do miednicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nazywali tego przyjaźnią, nie nazywali tego wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wstał, podszedł do okna i zobaczył niebieską mgłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takiej sytuacji są one kluczowe do zrozumienia całej sprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale żeby ośmielić się nocą wchodzić do mego domu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614840.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lubiła chodzić do kina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byliśmy w udawaniu naprawdę dobrzy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usłyszysz nareszcie autentycznych ludzi w tym kraju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzmożone uczucia metafizycznego nienasycenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo w uśmiechu kobiety czaił się odcień fałszu i okrucieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Oj, kobiety, jakie wy głupie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje wysłanie przelewu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego nie powiesiłeś, tego nie masz — mówi woźny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Zwariowałaś”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Serce mu biło mocno, coraz mocniej, jeszcze mocniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieodpowiedni ubiór był powodem przemarznięcia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardziej wierzę naukowcom niż politykom.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może we śnie widział pan twarz podobną do mojej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obudził mnie śpiew ptaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Patrz, ile w nim papierów i rupieci! — zawołała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieszczęścia chodzą parami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615820.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pożałujecie tego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615825.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadzenie firmy to nie bułka z masłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zrobię to dla was, jeszcze raz pójdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę tracić czasu na przeżywanie tego, co zostało opisane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Listy będę pisał i przez gołębie wysyłał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócili na obiad.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A za oknem coraz wyższe słońce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie — odrzekła dziwożona i wspięła się ku niemu na palcach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ten drugi — to Stanisław Krzemiński.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20615946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zachmurzyła się dumnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616069.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To zuchwała wariatka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciuś ciekawie patrzy przez okno samochodu na swoją stolicę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On miał amerykański akcent, a Anna miała australijski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzi, że wraca za trzy miesiące.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20616083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wór zawahał się przez chwilę, jakby dla namysłu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658687.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przecież sama uparłaś się, że z nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658688.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem znów będzie zdrowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658689.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kim na śmierć zapomniał o konieczności małej pogadanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uznałem, iż stanowisko to właśnie mi odpowiada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658691.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzięła polnego świerszcza i na piersiach skryła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dziwię się wcale, że wywołuje taki popłoch wśród dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emilowi otworzyła stara kucharka, którą nazywał Me duzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogę ci wszystkiego dokładnie wyłuszczyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Damian zauważył, że biegnie sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie jest godło na tej chorągwi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pośliznąłeś się, więc wolniej, ostrożniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— My nic nie wiemy — mówią dozorcy więzienni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Największą część dnia pochłaniało polowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Z najgłębszą wdzięcznością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co myślisz o tym, aby Połę wziąć na kolację? Ojciec lubi ładne dziewczęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz częściej zatrzymywał się, bezradnie i z przerażeniem oglądając się wokoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często okazuje się, że jest zbyt zrównoważony i zrobiony za logicznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybierać się, jak sójka za morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednoręki potwierdzająco kiwnął dłonią, lecz słowem się nadal nie ozwał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym celu należy zapewnić szczególną ochronę zarówno dziecku, jak i matce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale cierpliwie, żeby nie bić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czemu przestałaś mnie kochać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rozumiem i wynoszę się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już drugi raz uderzyłem małym palcem o framugę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w domu sierot różne były dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym w niektórych miejscach akompaniament o tyle tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz posępnie słodką pochyliła ku ziemi, w palcach przesuwała korale różańca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658812.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy deszcz minął, poszli po raz pierwszy do Emila do domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20658814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bo mi nie dałeś znać, że przyjeżdżasz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naszym kapitanem i gospodarzem był dyrektor różnych towarzystw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kazały dorosłym chodzić do szkoły, same wszystko zepsuły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z książkami jest inaczej, niż mi się zdawało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powinno ono być przedmiotem handlu w żadnej formie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla dwu ludzi znalazło się jeszcze miejsce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Policzyłem dni i zrobiło mi się nieswojo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo w uśmiechu kobiety czaił się odcień fałszu i okrucieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773141.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Męczą ich tylko hemoroidy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773142.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym momencie doszedł mnie złowrogi trzask przepalonych belek pułapu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773143.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo ma trwać to spotkanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773144.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc — panno Klementyno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ten dzień zapasy były skończone i zebrani rozeszli się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pierwszy oto przysięgam i pierwszy będę dbał o wypełnienie umówionych warunków!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto pyta, nie błądzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ogrodzie mieli jacuzzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym się poinformować, czy można ją jeszcze zapisać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajomość była zawarta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie rozumiesz, co mówię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nas jest zamknięty we własnej nocy, sam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ślepiec — ten, psiawiara, jurny był i nie w ciemię bity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Masz cudowny głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz Damian nie był ani nieśmiały, ani zawstydzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sen spełzał powoli z jej oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadzwoń na sto dwanaście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapytaliśmy o redaktora.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773220.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak studnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było świństwo, że mu nie kupiono psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te jej dziwne cechy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773223.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I to jest to wspaniałe dzieło o którym mówiłaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773240.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oni przeszli obok niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773242.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmiech ten brzmiał w uszach Filipa niby krwawa obelga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773243.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Brzuszek miał zawsze pękaty jak to ziarnko grochu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyła nas atmosfera hali targowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773245.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzę po pokoju i udaję, że nie wiem, o co chodzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773250.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad nią — „jechać”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773252.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rabusie widocznie zamierzali już odjechać, gdyż byli gotowi do drogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773253.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znowu zwyciężał Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekanie przyprawiało go zawsze o lekki bół brzucha i potrzebę oddania moczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773256.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To samo tutaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773261.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co pani zamówi? — zapytał, gdy przyszedł kelner.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie popsuła — odparł jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem wyjął watę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuję się trochę zmęczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał zbyt wolno i dlatego był szczęśliwy, że umie pisać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773277.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota myślał, że to skrzep, i próbował operować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773278.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Może byś do szkoły nie poszedł?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była zła na niego, zawiedziona, że nie sprawił jej przyjemności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co teraz będzie? — powtórzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za głośno targowali się z babcią o mycie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne to, śmieszne, lecz prawdziwe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodowany ciekawością poszedłem za nią, zachowując dyskretny dystans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oblicza z dwóch stron mej głowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byle był uczciwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773306.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytałem, pisałem, robiłem różne rzeczy, ale ciężaru z serca zrzucić nie mogłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773316.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy, kiedy ja przyjechałem, to było? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773318.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe lalki nie zamykają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773319.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś mi mówi, że próżno się niepokoicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773320.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie tylko wartości naszej firmy, ale i nasze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego na ten punkt zwracam największą uwagę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czyżby coś podobnego było możliwym?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co zrobić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773329.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powoli przerzuca swoją przeszłość, swoje rozmowy z dziećmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773330.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy Teresa — ta prawdziwa — jest w Warszawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773331.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nareszcie zaczęło świtać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773339.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to tylko gra przed tym drugim i sobą zarazem, komedia nieunikniona i podniecająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na żadne wołania, wrzaski nie zwracała uwagi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773341.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie płakał, nie kręcił się, nie przeszkadzał, tylko był bardzo smutny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773342.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem zerwał się jak raniony jeleń, pełen rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773343.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszajcie do boju! — zawołał — i nie powracajcie bez zwycięstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773351.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Namyślam się, czy miejsce wybuchu jest na Ukrainie czy na Pomorzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odmy w prawym płucu doc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa odskoczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773354.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiło na mnie wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród zamieszania, które wywołała swym nietaktownym finałem, wymknęła się z domu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz niedługo trwały chwile ukojenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ciebie nam było żal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To już mój trzeci grill z rzędu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż ja teraz zrobię?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy Andrzeja nagle ożywiły się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz dochodzenia spełzły na niczym: sprawcy mordu nie wykryto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zmieniłem zamiar i jadę do stacji końcowej na tej linii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przywarłem ustami do jej ręki na długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko krowy rodzą cielęta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy tym codzienna praktyka wyrabia sprawność w tym kierunku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieję tylko dzięki innym, których rozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widziałem jasno Jego istnienie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale i Wojtek nic a nic nie rozumie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wojna nie będzie trwała długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To mnie odrywa od smutnych myśli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jużci, że wiadomo… — przerwał mu jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostęp ze wszystkich stron odcięty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dawali listom nagłówków, aby nie używać pewnych słów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma to być kara.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Na zwiady”, powiedział pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie wiem; może.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko się załamuje, pryska, rozwiewa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mama miała dzwonić, jako koleżanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozsunęli się nieco, ustąpili i Cezary znalazł wolne miejsce na ławce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773429.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to w prostej linii dziad Seweryna Baryki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mógł się tak męczyć do pierwszej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę się trochę odmóżdżyć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie jadę na wakacje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poznawaliśmy ich po głosie, dzięki czemu mogliśmy sprawdzić ich liczbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła stamtąd na nas stęchlizna i zaduch.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko głowa ciążyła okropnie, w skroniach pulsowały głośno tętna…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile — myślisz — mogłabym zarabiać jako prostytutka? Żeby zarobić na podróż dokądkolwiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej się żyje w chałupie gajowego, a inaczej w młynie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773457.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przystani onej nie masz rekina…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Problem nie do rozwiązania…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hulaj dusza, piekła nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, nie — upierała się — to on, na pewno on.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymali się za ręce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773467.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedziałem w towarzystwie czterech równie zachwyconych tą sytuacją osób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773477.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z lepszych thrillerów jakie widziałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773478.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczęta mają wargi zimne i mokre i oczy wyblakłe, jak na starych fotografiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773479.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kama musiała je zdobyć w jakiś sprytny sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba było staczać ustawiczne walki z wrogimi szczepami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773482.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dostała rower.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem w tej łodzi nie niesiony gestem bohaterstwa, ale wtrącony bez woli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773489.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez nas nie byłoby wojny…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I z dumą pokazał Pukowi ukończony rysunek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773491.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to pieśń Schuberta „Gratchen an Spinnrade”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę jutro, chcę dziś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773502.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, cóż mi dacie za wyjawienie sekretu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było to sprytnie obmyślane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773504.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że dzieje ludzkości coraz to bardziej przypominają historię ucznia czarnoksięskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773506.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie rycz, bo cię zatłukę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773507.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A potem głową o ławkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak nachylił się ku niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jestem nim też.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się spełnią przeznaczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On zauważył, że ona ma często w palcach skurcz naczyń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To szeroki temat, ale nie tak trudny, jak się rodzicom wydaje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dolina Małej Łąki w Tatrach w zimie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ty myślisz, że między „chcieć” a „nie chcieć” jest jakaś różnica? Żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre z nich, pierzchając w rozsypkę, szukały piwnicznego schronu po jarach i krzewach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto służyć i wyładowywać siłę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma dziwny rytm ta piosenka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez krzyż, znak śmierci widzę szczelinę w kości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że mam to dobrze, proszę bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego muszę rozumieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bram klęczał, odwrócony do nich plecami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiedzieli sobie kilka dowcipów, kilka plotek, nieco ciekawostek naukowych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Latem dojeżdżam rowerem, a zimą autobusem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sama ci odradza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzył mi przenikliwie w oczy i wyczytał resztę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pamiętam — odparł, biorąc skwapliwie do ręki woskowy odlew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na leśnej, na polanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773770.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I już cały drętwieję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drzwi się otworzyły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jedź pan — powiedział, ale sanitariusz nie odjeżdżał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego Jaś się nie nauczy, tego Jan nie będzie umiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupił za dziesięć groszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zanadto może szkoła pędzi, jakby kto poganiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773802.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu odbywały się te rozmowy, ta wiedza historyczna, wspomnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773803.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I w niedzielę, jak lunatyczka, poszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773804.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy znacie tekst pieśni Schuberta „Der Todt und das Madchen”? Jest dziwnie dwuznaczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773805.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciał jechać koleją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773806.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem czy lepszy jest żel czy pianka do golenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cezary już nic nie widział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda i pożytek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W porządku, aktywowałem to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszedł do łazienki i mył się zbyt długo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze jesteś taki, jak ja chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysze mojej wędrówki odeszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwiony sanitariusz stanął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773853.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz, gdy już wszystko wiadomo… — zaczął uroczyście Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773854.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O zgrozo, zamilkła na wieki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773855.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak szczebiotała, a ja z niepojętym zachwytem spoglądałem na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie były nogi żywej dziewczyny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Natomiast my jesteśmy inteligentnymi czytelnikami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był zły obraz, kicz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Witaj, co mogę dla Ciebie zrobić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chodzili do jednego gimnazjum, do różnych oddziałów tej samej klasy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budynek mieścił się w niejakiej odległości od miasta nad wielkim stawem otoczonym palmami kokosowymi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie, nie, mnie to dobrze robi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stał i jesienne słońce świeciło na niego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Bardzo chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leje jak z cebra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I one pewnie pierwsze odpadną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdy nie kochamy, doznajemy spokoju i możemy grzać się w słońcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz? — Ciebie chcę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mów hop, póki nie przeskoczysz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773915.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sądząc, że nie zaśnie, wolał oczekiwać w łóżku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czeka, kiedy zaczną znów rozpytywać, kim jest i skąd przybył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto rano wstaje, temu Pan Bóg daje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myśli przechodziły koło niego, jak duchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drgnął jeszcze raz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20773932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zły jesteś? Przecież masz ładne włosy, zwłaszcza gdy je rozrzuca wiatr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Albatrosy nie wrzeszczą, i to nie jest ładne wyrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mogą się oderwać od biopodłoża.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak to się nazywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem pewna, że się nie pomyliłam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chyba zewsząd, bo i leśna jest, i ruczajna, i górska, i wszelaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tutaj wyjaśniono sprawę w oka mgnieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie są moje marzenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554627.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To naprawdę było przyjemne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554628.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadawała mnóstwo pytań, a niebieskie jej oczy pełne były zamyślenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co go wstrzymało?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554675.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłem bardzo zmęczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weź zadzwoń po Łysego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odwróciłem się i ujrzałem Rotundę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On czekał, jak prawie zwykłe, na Ewę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I chce mi się pisiać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554680.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prędko się odczepili, bo bardzo byli zajęci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gęsiej skórki wywołanej imponującym wstępem nie można filmowi odmówić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, tak — pamiętam — odpowiedział ponuro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzecim przepisem, który muszę podać, jest płukanie pewnego mojego znajomego dentysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ich włosach rosną wodorosty, w granatowej, połyskującej wodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za nim pójdziesz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554701.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nauczycielka jeszcze nie słyszała, ale my słyszymy — od pierwszego nieśmiałego razu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo cię wygnali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do strumienia, ludzie dobrzy, do strumienia! — wrzasnął uradowany nową obietnicą Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przepyszna broń! — pochwalił ze szczerym uznaniem rywal, biorąc pistolet do ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chłop szanuje zdrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wygodnie — jestem mały, jak wygodnie — tom duży.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdawało mu się, że słyszy szmer w okolicy pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja, Leo, mam wielką ochotę przytoczyć tu jeden wykład, ale boję się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieubłagana wola kierowała mnie w stronę Parkowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poleciał wiatr w górę gonić obłoki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maciusiowi krew uderzyła do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zbliżcie się teraz trochę do mnie! — rozkazał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To tylko fason jej bucików.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiadł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie konduktorzy zauważyli brak jednego z kolegów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak potarł dłonią miejsce pozbawione kędziora i rzucił na zabrakowanego kulawca spojrzenie pełne politowania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pozwól mi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554740.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie — rzekł prawie surowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554741.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteś kowalem swojego losu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554742.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzniosłem tylko okrzyk na cześć naszej skrzydlatej patronki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554743.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak mogłem dopuścić do czegoś podobnego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554744.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czarne źrenice, czarne długie rzęsy, oczy spokojne, utkwione we mnie bez drgnienia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczyłbyś, jakby cię ona przepraszała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20554746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzył ją w ramię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20555023.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bachor wrzeszczał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20555024.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ojej, usta otworzył jak wrota.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20555025.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Widocznie zbliżaliśmy się do celu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20555026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Któż może powiedzieć, ile biedny asceta w tych strasznych dniach wycierpiał?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20555027.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ściętych białkach zagrało poranne słońce okrutnym uśmiechem…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20555039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To komiczne, że wszedł do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20555040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybór, wybór! — przedrzeźniała go dziwożona, podrzucając ramionami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20555042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A ona czekała na to, aż się pożegna, i on wiedział o tym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20555045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I po przerwie: — To, co ostatnio powiedziałem, jest też prawdą, ale nie tylko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20555047.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Depesza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad rzeką włóczyli się ludzie, suszący siebie na słońcu, jak pieluchy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarz posępnie słodką pochyliła ku ziemi, w palcach przesuwała korale różańca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciała rozstaju, ma rozstaj! Niech gada! — gorącował się kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc nie ulęknę się ciebie, o smoku!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schudłem cztery kilo!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz na swoją obronę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był już wieczór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ty? — zaśmiała się przekupka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym gwiazdę z nieba i szybkę z okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podlasiak mrugnięcia nie zrozumiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed nami rozwinęła się wspaniała panorama portu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sami sieją waśń między rodzeństwem i dlatego nie może być zgody.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powróciwszy, poddał się okolicznościom i zapłacił karę oraz zaległy podatek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam inne rzeczy: naukę, pisanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę zatem podać mi rękę i sprowadzić do gondoli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558570.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Widziałem, jak mu ręce drżały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiaj, po długich, długich latach porzuciła ową ziemię lśniącą życiem i słońcem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile kosztuje bilet ulgowy, a ile normalny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawane w tym celu ustawy powinny mieć na względzie przede wszystkim dobro dziecka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ach tak, teraz rozumiem — to też rodzaj wróżby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dlaczego włóczysz się koło tego domu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Biegł za nimi również hałas kawiarni, lecz oni byli poza nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558586.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Anna odchodzi do Emila, który ma osiemnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ostatniego zajścia upłynęły trzy tygodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wąski sierp ubywającego księżyca siał słabe światło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziesz miał wolną drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od początku widzimy, że z listonoszem coś jest nie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zostawił po sobie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Raz jeszcze zamroczyły się oczy kalifa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558629.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ojca i od Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558634.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatelefonowałem do niego pierwszy raz od wyjazdu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558656.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oszalałe w swej zawziętości pszczoły nie ominęły zbliżonej do nich lewicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo też — co prawda!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mama z ciocią rozmawiały i nic nie widzą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mamo, czy odchodzisz? — Nie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz zarosła już prawie zupełnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrzucała ruchami nonszalanckimi: królewna rzuca perły w morze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„My nimi jesteśmy” — brzmiała nasza odpowiedź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zadarła ogonek i poleciała na płot.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558703.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Darowanemu koniowi nie zagląda się w zęby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak wtedy byłem nieszczęśliwy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wydajesz mi się przerażona tym wszystkim, moje biedne dziecko! — odezwała się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558706.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu chyba znowu rozbijamy się o nieuchwytność zawodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558707.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie jest dziewka, którą miałem przed chwilą tu, na kolanach?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile razy przychodziłem do niej, matka jej głaskała mnie po głowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Rozumiem i wynoszę się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558710.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten solidny, wyzuty zupełnie z wyobraźni pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czym szli zgodnie i umownie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558712.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobiegli do rozstaju i znów przystanęli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem listy, listy, listy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałem szukać posady, opuścić szkołę lekarską.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558715.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez pierwszy tydzień zapisywał Maciuś, ile dni jest w drodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558716.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętam obawy z tym związane, ale i doświadczenie zebrane przy tworzeniu gimnazjum.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558718.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"U niej widocznie tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558719.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pogadamy z nią na osobności — rzekł kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558720.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, co się dzieje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy odpowiem, że wolę ustrój B, ze względu na moją książkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On przyszedł po ten nóż!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posprzątałem dom i odkurzyłem podłogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Cóż znowu? — zaprzeczyłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co znaczy ogień, błyskający z pośród tamtych sosen?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558726.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kogo pan szuka?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558727.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu przyszedł z miną pokorną, zbyt pokorną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tymczasem na płocie przycupnęła wrona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558729.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę pani w czymś pomóc?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cel uświęca środki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tylko musiałem starać się o własne utrzymanie, ale również zadbać o matkę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomiędzy oboma brzegami rozpiął się łuk mostu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Więc pieniędzy nie przyjęła?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil połykał ciągle ślinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym razem ani Podlasiak, ani jednoręki nie powitali nowej obietnicy radosnymi okrzykami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558766.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Fragment bez końca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558767.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest coś całkiem innego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Król sam oniemiał z podziwu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet z godziny na godzinę! — odpowiedział Hugon.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z całkiem innego powodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wtedy zobaczyłem ją po raz pierwszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Niech pan lepiej to czyta, bo są czyste przynajmniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558779.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patelnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558780.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zacznijmy od monologów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stracił całą ochotę na nią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moim zdaniem Rembrandt celowo tak to namalował.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A na drugi dzień miał już Maciuś cały plan złożony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy kwiaty do uczty! — rzekła patetycznie, zdejmując wianuszek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na bok reszta! — krzyknął Podlasiak, podniecony otrzymanym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszedł szybko przez Verne’a i Maya do powieści kryminalnych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak śmiesznie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Łatwo było się domyśleć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce znów żeglowaliśmy gondolą po lagunie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… i moje wspomnienie jest mętne i jakby zatarte.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żłopią coś w ranach tej czaszki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20558932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawość to pierwszy stopień do piekła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale będzie wiedzieć i myślę, że osiągnie to.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie lubił przymusu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I jaki może mieć ona związek ze śp. mężem seniory?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przegrał parę pięknych koni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamykała się na klucz w małym pokoju, który sobie wywalczyła po wielu awanturach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Każdy musi robić to, co mnie się podoba — rzekł obojętnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559557.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widział nic, gdyż księżyc skrył się poza chmurą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie postanowiłem mu rzecz całą zakomunikować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559559.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam nic przeciwko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy, jak żywi — idzie wszystko, jak było.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział szeptem: — Ludzie z gumowymi wężami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę go zachować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I cóż, że ze Szkocji?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden chłopak wiedział, gdzie się pali.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Onanizowałam się na próbę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559571.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Gajowiec — dobrze!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559572.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odczytano jego los.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559573.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A ty piłeś wódkę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559574.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Weszliśmy do świątyni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem smutny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Półhalucynacje, które były zmieszane z drzewami w parku, z bawiącymi się dziećmi, z ulicami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapanowała ulica, robotnicy naftowi i fabryczni, czeladź sklepowa i domowa, marynarze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czekali jeszcze przez pewien czas.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ej, panie Michale…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559585.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy utkwione w powałę, twarz azjatycka, bez wyrazu, nieludzka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed oczyma jadących zaczęły rozwijać się pierwsze akordy gór.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przystanęli, aby się odsapać i uporządkować bezład uwięzłych w gardle oddechów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Szczur wodny” — to niby rybak, co?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ruszajcie do boju! — zawołał — i nie powracajcie bez zwycięstwa!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20559600.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No mam nadzieję, że jest w dobrym humorze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20560089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pietrek na folwarku… — martwiła się panna Karolina.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20560090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nagi konar drzewa ukazał się niespodzianie tuż za szybą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20560091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spałam do południa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20560092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddałby, oddał na pewno, bo chciałby pozostać uczciwym!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20560093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ten film odniesie sukces?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20560104.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jego przecież trzeba załatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20560105.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wszystko po to, aby nic nie słyszeć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20560106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czytali je najczęściej na spotkaniach, rzadziej w domu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20560107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I może zabrzmi to pompatycznie, ale stwierdziłem, że chcę podjąć się wyzwania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20560108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już od lat kilku w lesie przebywa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20560114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy będę pół bogiem, pół czarnoksiężniczkiem, aby mieszać, lepić i rozpalać ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój pies dostaje smakołyki za robienie sztuczek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil wykładał spokojnie teorię absurdo- logii, jak zwykle — zbyt serio.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale mnie potrzebne.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się pan wystrzega tej brunetki i towarzystwa pijaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20695328.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamiętaj o wzięciu kremu do opalania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701615.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było ostatnie nasze zajście w granicach Rosji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701616.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wierzę w nią ani trochę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701617.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strach przed światłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701618.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupił za dziesięć groszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701619.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W co się bawisz jeszcze? — W kolej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701635.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Burza z wichrem szalała pod samotną chatką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701636.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej rzecz się ma z alkoholem w małych dawkach i nikotyną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701637.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co pani zamówi? — zapytał, gdy przyszedł kelner.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701638.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wśród grupy pasażerów u stopnia wagonu powstało zamieszanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701639.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obraz był skończony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701651.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyś lał o Klarze: z lekka obskurna, o wydatnych piersiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701652.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miałem kupić cukier zwykły czy trzcinowy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701653.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Puść to jeszcze raz!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701654.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nic więcej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ty to rozumiesz, przyjacielu „Mostowy”, i zrobisz, jak ja proszę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701677.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z książkami jest inaczej, niż mi się zdawało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701678.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nigdy żadnej śmierci nie zrozumiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701679.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wszystkie Podlasiaki tak wyglądają, jakby zbytecznej na karku gęby co prędzej pozbyć się chcieli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701695.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usiedli po obu stronach balonu i pocałowali się ponad nim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szli ulicą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie pomyślą, że człowiekowi przykro i boi się, że panią rozgniewają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701698.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stałem, otoczony zewsząd ludźmi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przestań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ludzie dobrzy! — jęknął przerażony Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701736.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak kamień w wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701737.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to tylko gra przed tym drugim i sobą zarazem, komedia nieunikniona i podniecająca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701738.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak tutaj nic się nie zmieniło!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co ja mam z twojego „już niech będzie”? Najpierw robisz głupstwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701745.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał szeroko otwarte oczy i usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701746.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Napijcie się herbaty, jeszcze gorąca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponowiłem próbę na przedramieniu z tym samym rezultatem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcę, żebyś dawał się strącać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamigotała przed oczami latarka krasnoludka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701754.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Były nastawione ku północnemu zachodowi, gdzie jeszcze niebo jaśniało dość pogodnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miał bladą twarz satyra ze spiczastymi uszami, i wąskie ceglaste usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ot, co wymyślił.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Moje sumienie nic mi nie wyrzuca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I między Murzynami miał Maciuś wrogów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podniósł się i pocałował ją w usta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jaka pani dobra — szepnąłem, przyciskając ku ustom jej rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tam, tam, za biurkiem, w kącie, pod ścianą!…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czasem czują się zapomniane.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawdą jest wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701796.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwożona z rozpaczą załamała dłonie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dała mi koc, powiedziała, że się wszystkim zajmie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701798.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było też dużo rzeczy do jedzenia, jakbyśmy mieli przez tydzień nie wychodzić z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy trzej, dotychczas przykucnięci, powstali nagle z ziemi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701800.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym się tam znalazł, postać jakaś nadbiegła od strony przeciwnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś poruszyło się we mnie, niby nieznacznie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oglądał ją więc i myślał: — To ją powinno trochę przynajmniej denerwować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po kwadransie była wyleczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701841.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem czy lepszy jest żel czy pianka do golenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701843.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spodziewałem się znaleźć odpowiednie elementy z tą etykietą, ale nie udało mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowem: pies, który dużo szczeka, nie gryzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ja nie mam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest wieczne napięcie pomiędzy tymi drogami: obłąkanie — normalność.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to znany, sławny nawet, śpioch czwartej dywizji ciężkiej artylerii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to wielką zaletą onego prawa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ano, siadaj, bratku, za mną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jakże mi brak tu zieleni!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I źli są, że nie słuchamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ewa podeszła, jak lunatyczka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo na pewno mi go wziąć nie pozwolą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, tak… nie wiesz o tym nawet…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale on cię kocha.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odbiliśmy od przystani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do mnie z miną czarnoksiężnika, dotknął mi sutki i też strzeliła iskra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyprzedziłem go, by rozświetlać drogę latarką.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedne człowieczki mówią tak, drugie inaczej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten zaś zmierzył Mariana od stóp do głów i zapytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, że jest przyjemny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyjemniej chodzić we dwoje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Ty wierzysz we wszystko co przeczytasz w internecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wrócił do pensjonatu, który nazywał się „Złocień”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mało panu jeszcze?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały ciąg owych daremnie straconych lat jaśniałeś w sercu moim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden rozpalił się prawie do białości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była doskonale piękna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypuszczam, że Nowak przepędził popołudnie na gorzkich rozmyślaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabory, Druga Wojna Światowa i powstania to często poruszane wśród Polaków tematy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No i dzwonek, i tak się skończyło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzała go cały rok: wszystkie pieniądze wydawała na maskotki — same koty, tylko jedna małpa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym posyłali do siebie Józię, młodą pokojówkę Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szła, patrząc w ziemię, i wydawała się bardzo zasmucona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto to jest Bernard? — Bernard to jest nakrapiany pies, który zdechł zeszłe go roku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy z uczuciem niewypowiedzianej trwogi i zdumienia „poznałem” moją narzeczoną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładę się znowu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20701978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I wcisnąwszy mi w rękę bilet wizytowy, przepadła w półmroku zarania.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech kochankowie — ale dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jechaliśmy jeszcze dość długo głębokim wąwozem lub brzegiem rzeki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To tylko jedno, co śpiewał poeta, było prawdą czystą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech żyją cukierki i czekolada.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Palto krzywo zapięte!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703361.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zrobiło na mnie wrażenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703362.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten przełącznik wydaje się być już włączony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703363.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobne stworzenie nie umie stawać dęba i wykonywać skoków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703364.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak — przypominam sobie… złotą czarę…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703365.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem tegoż wieczora dostałem zaproszenie na występ w prywatnym mieszkaniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703366.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zbędę… — odparła, rumieniąc się, dziwożona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703367.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powodowany ciekawością poszedłem za nią, zachowując dyskretny dystans.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703368.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdym szedł po niej, woda sięgała mi do kolan.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703369.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdziwiony sanitariusz stanął.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703370.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki zręczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703371.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był pierwszy dzień przedwiośnia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703372.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż to nie charakterystyczne, że trupie głowy są zawsze uśmiechnięte?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703373.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wysnuł też cały szereg wniosków równie fałszywych, jak samo założenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703374.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co do mnie mówisz? — pyta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703375.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że dzieje ludzkości coraz to bardziej przypominają historię ucznia czarnoksięskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703376.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czuwałem nad babunią przez całą noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703377.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z początku nie mógł tam trafić, bo ja nic nie robiłam, aby mu ułatwić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703378.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam tu i tu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703379.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To był zły obraz, kicz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703380.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żyjący jest umarłym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703381.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co masz za interes?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703382.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To znowu zwyciężał Bóg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem posłyszałem za sobą szmer.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mają po kilkaset metrów długości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę wyjść! — krzyczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703386.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po jakimś czasie ktoś otworzył drzwi przedziału i wszedł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie brak — potwierdził jednoręki, posłusznie biegnąc wzrokiem za dłonią Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył przez okno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czego Jaś się nie nauczy, tego Jan nie będzie umiał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703390.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głowie huczało mi nieznośnie, gardło ściskały niewidzialne kleszcze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na usta wybiegł uśmiech zadowolenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Jeśli mi wolno odgrzebać dawne wspomnienia, łączy nas niejaka znajomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— „Na zwiady”, powiedział pan?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przez cały dzień przewalały się chmury, jakby gotując się do walnej rozprawy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O parę kroków przed nami zalśniła brylantowymi blaskami laguna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odetchnął z pewną ulgą: Darek nie zabrał ze sobą strzelby!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budowla jest jeszcze nieukończona, ale wierni chętnie skorzystali z mszy w nowym miejscu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szaleństwo wyzierało z jego pałających, szeroko rozwartych, nieruchomych oczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703399.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie dościgną pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703400.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Często używa się wyrażenia „żyje” w innym znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703401.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podszedł do niej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703402.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak cię widzą, tak cię piszą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy skończyłaś już robotę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ewa, znów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy mówiła: „nie bawię się” albo: „nie potrzebuję”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziewczęta mają wargi zimne i mokre i oczy wyblakłe, jak na starych fotografiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie minuty przed wschodem słońca to najzimniejszy moment w ciągu doby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co za wykończenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co teraz będzie? — powtórzył.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale coś mi mówi, że próżno się niepokoicie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703412.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Leje jak z cebra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najlepiej wieczorem, po deszczu, kiedy czujesz to, co się dzieje w zamkniętych domach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy ciebie nie cierpią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli to był sen, można było jej wybaczyć te kuchenne maniery.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I mama miała dzwonić, jako koleżanka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są sytuacje w życiu, w których te towarzyskie dodatki winny odpaść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci nie uważają na lekcjach, muszę się ciągle gniewać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703420.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ziarnko do ziarnka, a uzbiera się miarka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703421.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Albo o ile mnie to obchodzi! — rzekł Kim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703422.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale czy książki mówią prawdę? — marszcząc brew zapytał pan Ryszard.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703423.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Naturalnie była woda?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703424.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aha, jeszcze jej stosunek do morza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703425.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A gdy nie kochamy, doznajemy spokoju i możemy grzać się w słońcu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703426.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe wygięte nozdrza odchylały się przy oddechu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703427.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą nie odbiegajmy od tematu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703428.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oddać ją żołnierzom ku zabawie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703430.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Sama ci odradza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703431.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan się myli w tym wypadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703432.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Synu, nie czołgaj się po podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703433.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego większość kobiet, które mają mało przyjaciół, jest niemożliwie ograniczona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703434.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile — myślisz — mogłabym zarabiać jako prostytutka? Żeby zarobić na podróż dokądkolwiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyliśmy ją kołem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłaniałabym się bardziej do tego, żeby na tym, co jest, stworzyć coś lepszego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moje słuchawki przestały działać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz Damian nie był ani nieśmiały, ani zawstydzony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomagał jej zapiąć biustonosz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703441.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podskoczył na jednym korzeniu, na drugim.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703442.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Braciszek się zatrzymał, patrzy, co z tego będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703443.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ciebie nam było żal.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703444.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiłem! — przypomniał z wyrzutem w głosie kulawiec.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703446.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A czy istnieje świat?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703447.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak trwoga, to do Boga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703448.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blada jak płótno obsunęła się bez pamięci w moje ramiona.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nalegaj, Kazik, dłużej, bo się pogniewamy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko na proch starte, na biały, sypki, chrzęszczący pod stopą miał…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie powiedział do niej przez cały czas ani słowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703452.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może wpadniemy do mojej siostry na spaghetti?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak długo ma trwać to spotkanie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I Podlasiak rozwiódł dłonie na znak swej nieodpowiedzialności za własną urodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niektóre z nich, pierzchając w rozsypkę, szukały piwnicznego schronu po jarach i krzewach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20703456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straszliwa zemsta kochanki dosięgła mnie w samo serce…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_23783522.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ostatnie słowa wymówił syczącym szeptem i ze złośliwym uśmiechem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego warto stanowczo go bronić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz więcej problemów współczesnego sportu pozostaje bez odpowiedzi i reakcji prawodawców\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie uciekł Maciuś, nie wiemy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to więc moim zdaniem czwarty blok problemowy naszych negocjacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy konkretnego postępu w ważnych dziedzinach, że przytoczę tu tylko kilka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Da Bóg, przyjdzie znów nasza kolej!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele osiągnęliśmy, ale wciąż długa droga przed nami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wobec tego w ogóle nie obejmie to na przykład Luksemburga, Malty i Cypru\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z drugiej zaś strony moim zdaniem Europa nie powinna propagować przyznawania obywatelstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy farmaceuta może sprawdzić za pomocą skanera, czy produkt jest sfałszowany czy autentyczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę zatem podziękować wszystkim z państwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwolę sobie powiedzieć coś, czego jeszcze nie powiedziano\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ ona nadal nie istnieje, należy poszukać innych sposobów mówienia o energetyce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę o udzielenie mu nagany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bowiem priorytet obecnego budżetu przedstawionego przez Grupę Europejskiej Partii Ludowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309856.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego powinniśmy przestrzegać zaleceń Europejskiego Inspektora Ochrony Danych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309857.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wykorzystanie trombiny oznacza wprowadzenie do obrotu czegoś na kształt prefabrykowanego, sztucznego mięsa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309859.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przestrzeń kosmiczna jest nową granicą naszej Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.268,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dobrze i jesteśmy wdzięczni\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.052,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To wspaniale!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjaśniłem państwu moje rozumienie Regulaminu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozpatrujemy bardzo ważny dokument, który powinien umożliwić reformę europejskiego systemu statystycznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Punkt preambuły K ubolewa nad sytuacją w asyryjskich wioskach na granicy tureckiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podatnicy europejscy wspólnie składają się, a ludzie, którym pomagamy, nie mogą stać się zakładnikami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak problem zmian klimatycznych jest pracą w toku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że to leży w interesie mieszkańców Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzymam kciuki, aby taka konkluzja pojawiła się w trakcie zbliżających się rozmów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani posłanko, co teraz robimy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim chcę się dowiedzieć, czy można potwierdzić istnienie tych baz danych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezwzględnie konieczne jest opracowanie krajowych planów przewidujących środki zapobiegawcze i awaryjne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieją jednak między nimi ważne różnice\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja w Egipcie jest podobna, nawet jeżeli zmienia się ona szybko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te same siły polityczne stanowią poważne przymierze w Radzie, Komisji Europejskiej w Parlamencie Europejskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dysponujemy jednym narzędziem, jakim jest stanowienie prawa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309914.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym, aby moją sugestię odnotowano w protokole\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, ze względu na kryzys gospodarczy i na bolesne interwencje państw członkowskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I na koniec, obawiam się tendencji polegającej na łączeniu imigracji i przestępczości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309935.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"możemy wygrać tę batalię tylko jeżeli będziemy postępować zgodnie z zasadami praworządności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety stopa bezrobocia wśród młodzieży jest duża a nierówności na rynku pracy się utrzymują\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309937.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Opowiadam się również za surowszymi przepisami dotyczącymi sekurytyzacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy może pan wyjaśnić dlaczego?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjaśnię to dokładniej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Globalizacja i handel międzynarodowy są co do zasady zjawiskami pozytywnymi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy więcej ducha wspólnotowego i jestem pewien, że będzie Pan działał w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba przyznać, że nie jest on wcale taki skuteczny, jak się spodziewano\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że poprze je Parlament Europejski i państwa członkowskie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Również osoby starsze są bardziej narażone na ubóstwo niż całe społeczeństwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety tych drugich jest coraz więcej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cała budowa przysiadła i wyglądała jak grzyb rozłożysty, ale zmurszały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynegocjowane porozumienie obejmuje najambitniejsze spośród kiedykolwiek wynegocjowanych z państwem trzecim uregulowań dotyczących barier pozataryfowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309968.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście chcemy rozmawiać z Rosją, tak jak i z Kremlem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.772,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja Prawna również zgłosiła tę uwagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak dotąd nastąpiły jednak słabe rzeczywiste postępy w Parlamencie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.452,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osoby oddające głosy przeciwko europejskiej konstytucji i traktatowi lizbońskiemu przekazują wyraźną informację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.992,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jugosławię zbombardowano gdyż łamane były prawa Kosowian, dlaczego zatem nie postawić przedmiotowej kwestii jasno?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie wytyczamy drogę przekształceń bez stwarzania ryzyka nieuczciwej konkurencji na rynku wewnętrznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem również bardzo wdzięczny za atmosferę, debatę i prawdziwą otwartość w tej kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309979.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie przewodniczący, panie komisarzu, przedstawiciele Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309990.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chętnie przyznaję, jak pan zauważył, że jesteśmy odpowiedzialni jako Europejczycy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309992.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kryzys europejskiej integracji zaostrza kryzys globalny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309993.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie zgadzamy się na pobieranie odcisków palców czternastoletnich dzieci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309994.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas na przyspieszenie - Tworzenie Europy przedsiębiorczości i wzrostu gospodarczego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309995.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przypominam również o potrzebie włączenia ustaleń wyborczych misji obserwacyjnych do krajowych działań następczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309996.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie podejście przyniesie korzyści wszystkim stronom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309997.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zatem we Włoszech doszło do kolejnej tragedii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety do tortur dochodzi na całym świecie i niezmiennie to potępiamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30309999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podziękować Radzie i Komisji za wyjaśnienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wasza Miłość jedzie też także pewnie i dla tego, aby tamtejszych rycerzy pozywać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy, którzy dostąpili zaszczytu zasiadania w tym Parlamencie, muszą zdobywać poparcie swoich rodaków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To są, pani komisarz, dwa główne punkty, których pojawienia się w zielonej księdze oczekuję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I o tym należy pamiętać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy reformach pani komisarz jasne staje się, że dzisiejsze decyzje zabiją wiedzę fachową jutra\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ignorujmy zatem rzeczywistego zapotrzebowania na inwestycje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zrobić wszystko, co w naszej mocy, aby pomóc\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ostatnim miesiącu Izba ta dyskutowała na temat energii elektrycznej i odpowiedniej agencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310033.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczę na stałe wsparcie dla tego przedsięwzięcia ze strony Parlamentu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utrzymuje się ciągła niepewność co do przyszłych losów kraju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli kraje chcą ją opuścić, mają do tego prawo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tym niemniej jest to nowa Rosja i posiada nowy potencjał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt wówczas nie wróżył temu zbytniego sukcesu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pod tym względem się z panią wysoką przedstawiciel zgadzam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdy zobaczyłem, jak Pani wchodzi na salę, pomyślałem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310045.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W Europie dysponujemy ogromnym potencjałem energii odnawialnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310046.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest jeszcze druga bardzo dobra wiadomość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310056.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walka z otyłością musi rozpoczynać się w młodym wieku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klauzula pomostowa ma być podporządkowana wspomnianej przed chwilą większej roli władz krajowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Istnieją jednak inne wyraźne problemy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeszcze przed kryzysem znaczna liczba państw członkowskich borykała się z ciągłym podupadaniem obszarów wiejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak się nie godzi!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310322.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyskusja ta jest fascynująca pod względem etycznym, politycznym, a nawet technicznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego pragnę podkreślić znaczenie rezolucji, która jest omawiana dziś wieczór\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kręciły się między nimi „białe płaszcze“, jako gospodarze i zwierzchnicy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety, na proces negocjacyjny cały czas padają cieniem stosunki sąsiedzkie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310768.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzisiejsze orzeczenie brytyjskiego sądu apelacyjnego udaremniło podjętą przez brytyjski rząd próbę zatuszowania sprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310769.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Za pozwoleniem również wypowiem się w moim języku ojczystym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W dzisiejszych czasach, nikt nie powinien umierać na gruźlicę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310783.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Język tekstu w ogóle prawie nie sugeruje jednolicie surowego egzekwowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posiada on doświadczenie ministerialne, a także doświadczenie w pracy w sektorze prywatnym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przy tej okazji warto wspomnieć także o skandalicznej umowie energetycznej między Szwajcarią a Iranem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310789.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.812,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadmierna ilość pozostałości została stwierdzona nawet w owocach sprzedawanych na terenie Parlamentu Europejskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to bardzo ważny dokument, stanowiący jeden z elementów pakietu środków dotyczących efektywności energetycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłącznie wtedy będziemy mogli realizować skuteczną wspólną politykę imigracyjną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310797.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że robimy bardzo ważną rzecz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310799.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na terenie całej Unii Europejskiej ludzie mają trudności z zapłaceniem swoich rachunków za prąd\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310801.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety istnieje bezpośrednie niebezpieczeństwo wybuchu wojny przeciwko nieposłusznej Gruzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310807.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedział wtedy, że każda wiadomość może przynieść w życiu pożytek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310808.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego moja grupa polityczna naciskała, aby rezolucję przyjąć po debacie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310809.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skorzystaliśmy z każdej szansy zwiększenia efektywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310810.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy ignorować gwałtownego wzrostu liczby witryn internetowych poświęconych pornografii dziecięcej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310811.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kilka tygodni później zapewniła prezydenta Miedwiediewa, że nie widzi powodu do pośpiechu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak nam wszystkim wiadomo, Unia Europejska musi zacisnąć pasa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy więc oprócz litery prawa, zwrócić uwagę na etykę, na przestrzeganie transparentności, na moralność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310829.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bójże się Boga, Zbyszku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310831.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki jest cel agendy na rzecz konkurencyjności, jeśli nie utrzymanie naszej pozycji w świecie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odnośnie do baz danych, zostaną one uwzględnione w przeglądzie dyrektywy dotyczącej bezpieczeństwa produktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, eksperci są zgodni, że rośnie gwałtownie światowy popyt na statki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od razu mogę państwu powiedzieć, że rozwiana została większość moich obaw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"języki są w końcu podstawowym narzędziem integracji kulturowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310851.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy ograniczyć niektóre z barier w obrębie zawodów oraz między zawodami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310852.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że Unia Europejska powinna nalegać na przeprowadzenie dochodzenia wyjaśniającego tę sprawę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kwestia ta pilnie wymaga działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310862.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przynieśli Mu denara\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebujemy wspólnego zaangażowania na rzecz głębokiej zmiany w zakresie zdolności Europy do innowacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy mogę zapytać Komisję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja jest złożona, ale musimy dostrzec zarówno jej pozytywne, jak i negatywne strony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to możliwość dalekosiężna i rozległa, stanowi pole do niemal nieograniczonych interpretacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I te sprawy mają dużą wagę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego cieszymy się, że ustna poprawka do tego punktu została przyjęta\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przekonany, że będą Państwo kontynuować te działania w trakcie kolejnych prezydencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te kwestie uważamy za istotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obywatele Europy tracą cenne minuty, a nawet godziny, podróżując\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z pewnością niechętnie zabieramy się w tym punkcie do rozwiązywania tej sprawy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinniśmy mieć świadomość jeszcze jednego podstawowego faktu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy starać się stawiać czoło takim wydarzeniom, z którymi mamy coraz częściej do czynienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomoże to w realizacji czterech celów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Możemy jednak odwrócić tę tendencję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.124,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ignorować Radę?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez wątpienia musimy zastanowić się, skąd to dzisiejsze opóźnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy czas, aby Parlament Europejski chociaż raz wysłuchał obywateli Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może będę wtedy jedną z nich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310917.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"skoncentrujemy się na umieszczaniu ludzi w łodziach ratowniczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na podkreślenie zasługuje jednak to, że nie wystosowano jeszcze żadnego zaproszenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy jednak zaniechać możliwości dokonania natychmiastowych postępów, jaką daje wniosek w sprawie mikropodmiotów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej to prawda\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego skupienie się na roli sportu w edukacji jest istotne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to maraton, a nie sprint, i jestem pewna końcowego sukcesu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Strategia będzie się koncentrować na takich dziedzinach, jak transport, rozwój gospodarczy i ochrona środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To tylko kwestia czasu i ludzkich zaniedbań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prezydencja słoweńska klasyfikuje kraje z regionu zachodnich Bałkanów według etapów, które osiągnęły\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponieważ ratowanie życia jest jednym z celem przedmiotowej inicjatywy, chciałem wspomnieć o tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.292,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy więc podjąć skuteczne i skoordynowane działania, by te problemy rozwiązać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc krótko, brakuje narzędzi instytucjonalnych charakteryzujących prawdziwą demokrację i dających ludziom głos\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310954.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, czy inaczej w Europie niektóre ważne decyzje podejmowaliśmy raczej sprawnie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten system monitorowania powinien być zaprojektowany w sposób zapobiegający dumpingowi społecznemu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podzielam podobne uwagi, rozterki większości Państwa, którzy dzisiaj zabierali głos\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310974.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.66,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"przynajmniej napomnienie, lecz może jakąś poważniejszą karę przewidzianą w naszym Regulaminie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310975.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo całej litanii problemów, które tutaj zarysowano, szybkie przyjęcie Chorwacji zdaje się przesądzone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310976.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska nie jest uodporniona na takie napięcia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310977.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie mam w tej chwili wystarczającej ilości czasu, aby wnikać w szczegóły\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310978.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.844,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak tu chodzi o coś innego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310980.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.204,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kryzys nie jest zjawiskiem statycznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310982.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie przewodniczący, panie rzeczniku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310984.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sytuacja była wręcz odwrotna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310985.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego nie ma powodu, dla którego miałbym głosować za odrzuceniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30310987.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamieniamy się w petentów i w nowym sprawozdaniu żądania te zamieniają się w prośby\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego pragnę wyjaśnić mój sposób głosowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten cel dziś się przybliża, a ponadto jest zgodny z celami traktatu lizbońskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma tu łatwych rozwiązań\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podziękować urzędującemu panu przewodniczącemu za jego odpowiedź\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Banki centralne, w miarę rozwoju sytuacji, zareagowały szybko, zmniejszając stopy procentowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czas na poważne potraktowanie tematu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.564,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak, ta współpraca będzie się toczyła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311014.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mogę zapewnić każdego, że najmniejszy kontakt z nim to potwierdzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311015.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wzgórza Tara, siedziby arcykrólów i Świętego Patryka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311016.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu musieli rozebrać wozy, ale uczynili to sprawnie i w mgnieniu oka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311035.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosuję za przyjęciem przedmiotowej rezolucji, mimo że jej postanowienia nie są wystarczające\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzę, że są to tematy, które musimy mieć odwagę wyraźnie wyartykułować, wbrew poprawności politycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"zwrócenia szczególnej uwagi na małe i średnie przedsiębiorstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie powinno przynosić korzyści konsumentom i te poglądy zostały odzwierciedlone w moim głosowaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobry przykład stanowi Zatoka Biskajska, Kattegat i Skagerrak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska mierzy się z poważnymi wyzwaniami bezpośrednio przekładającymi się na jej przyszłość\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"unijnym, krajowym, na obszarach miejskich i podmiejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ma ono liczne przyczyny i postępuje w różnych tempach według różnic klimatycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walka z radykalizacją w kierunku przemocy stanowi podstawę polityki antyterrorystycznej Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem przekonana, że możliwe jest osiągnięcie kompromisu na podstawie państwa wstępnych sugestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje mi się, że pierwszy raz bierze pani udział w tej procedurze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po drugie, zawartość sprawozdania cieszy się ogólnie szerokim zrozumieniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.852,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego też należy go odpowiedzialnie zagospodarować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to mąż małego wzrostu, jak pacholę, ale krzepki w sobie i barczysty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30311086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewiele państw przekazało pomoc szybko i skutecznie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604626.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Drugi krzemień szurnął przez całe biurko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604646.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie mam na to czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Padał deszcz, gdy wyszli ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604676.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.008,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeglądam i segreguję wiersze pisane dla tych, których nie ma.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604690.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do odpowiedniego wyżywienia i mieszkania, rozrywek i opieki lekarskiej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604842.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyczyna leży zdaje się w wyczerpaniu nerwowym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604844.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak dokładnie opisywałeś, jak lubisz kiszkę kaszaną.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604845.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ze skarbca królewskiego wypłacić mu sto tysięcy dukatów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604846.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On przychodzi do mnie jak do kurwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z ciekawością bezosobową.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604938.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Prawdziwie, nie mogę sobie przypomnieć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604939.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kogo nie chcą słuchać dorośli, ten idzie do dzieciaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604940.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słodkawogorzki — oświadczyła nagle dziwożona, oblizując zwilgotniałe od tataraku wargi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604941.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale kołysała się bez przerwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20604942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta kobieta jest stokroć piękniejsza i bardziej wyrafinowana, niż przypuszczałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605003.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiem, czego nam brak! — zawołał, uderzając się dłonią w czoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605004.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trybuny widziane z dołu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Porzuciłem uniwersytet i zacząłem rozglądać się za płatną posadą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja ci, Kazik, powiem, jak jestem katolik…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamknął jej usta pocałunkiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605048.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byli oszczędni w gestach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605049.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To nic — pocieszał się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nie tak to łatwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest serdecznym przyjacielem nas obojga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jej ojciec miał tam sklep.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Blisko miesiąc byliśmy w niebie, w niebie cudów i marzeń.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zestawienie: twórczość — perła, wywołuje mdłości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież oddzielają ściany.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary głupiec byłby żył zdrowo do tej pory, gdybym był trzeźwy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605122.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech sprawdza! — zaprzeczył odważnie Podlasiak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605181.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mali symulanci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On mnie nic nie obchodził, ten Otto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kładziemy się… jest nas sto lub jeszcze więcej… i tworzymy czworobok.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605197.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Utajone drga we mnie wszystko, co było, i wszystko, co będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605226.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sam wywołałem swój los, utajoną swą myśl wypisałem bezwiednie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień dobry bardzo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605739.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomyś lał o Klarze: z lekka obskurna, o wydatnych piersiach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605756.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sara z wolna zaczęła uspokajać się w płaczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20605774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jadłeś jakiś podwieczorek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam prawo się dowiedzieć, czy potrafi mnie pan wynagrodzić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Podejdź.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja również będę mieć go na oku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612908.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naturalnie spaliły się też dawno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Gdybym był dziewczyną, tobym na pewno był kurwą — pomyślał, ale zaraz wstał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym miejscu całuje mnie już ósmy chłopak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Siedzieli milcząc, zanurzeni w zapachu kobiety, która stąd odeszła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612948.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzadka ta zupa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jak zapominasz, to cała nauka z kary idzie w las.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20612951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczy obydwu przyjaciół zwróciły się ku niemu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"On doznał wrażenia, że stopy jego puszczają korzonki, że jest wrośnięty w ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613010.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było ostatnie nasze zajście w granicach Rosji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613011.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 10.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw z upiorem pogadam! — zawołała wesoło dziwożona i uśmiechnęła się ukradkiem do Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613012.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Było po deszczu, parowała rozmokła ziemia, w parku ławki już wysychały.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613013.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A teraz najlepiej zrobisz, jak pójdziesz do łóżka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy woda ciebie kąsa? — żartowała z niego Danusia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kto pani powiedział? — szepnęła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613041.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspaniały w proporcjach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613043.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiedziała, co teraz się z nim stanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613044.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był w życiu bardzo zajęty kobietami i zagadnieniem przemiany gatunków bakterii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszę się jeszcze ogolić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613059.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamieniona w leśne echo, w wojska śpiew.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613061.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz o północy nie daruję.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613062.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najpierw udał się do probostwa nie bez pewnej trwogi w sercu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613063.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zimno go owionęło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A do tego to piekielne wprost wykończenie wykonania!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy z nich miał niezmierną ochotę pogadać szczerze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myję zęby po każdym posiłku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Główna stacja jest koło pieca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu jest Kim, a tam są oni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czego chcesz ode mnie?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613145.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiesz, co lubię najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Skłaniałabym się bardziej do tego, żeby na tym, co jest, stworzyć coś lepszego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moja mamusia zawsze mówi, że dzieci powinny się ubierać skromnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Przypuszczenie twoje — rzekł — ma dużo cech prawdopodobieństwa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zamigotała przed oczami latarka krasnoludka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzieś w oddali dudniły tramwaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mają po kilkaset metrów długości.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.368,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dobra i cierpliwa mama traci wreszcie cierpliwość i daje córeczce klapsa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Policzki mu pobladły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urządzała go cały rok: wszystkie pieniądze wydawała na maskotki — same koty, tylko jedna małpa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedni muszą tak pisać, inni mogą tego sposobu nie używać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Synu, nie czołgaj się po podłodze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedyny motyw dla malarza!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613233.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bagno nie zamarzło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613234.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była mało ubrana: trup.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613235.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ich nie słyszała naprawdę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613301.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nie śpisz, to znaczy, że ją znalazłem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil połykał ciągle ślinę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613303.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo powie, jak nad jarem i nad strumieniem! — gardłował kulawiec, podrygując niecałą nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613304.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku próbował sobie przypomnieć, jak wygląda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613305.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żegnajcie! — rozlegało się coraz wyżej i coraz ciszej w promiennych od słońca przestworach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613335.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tysiące kierunków, dziesięć tysięcy niepotrzebnych ruchów, kroków i chwytów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613336.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odbiliśmy od przystani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613337.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzeba wyrzeczenia się — tylko za tę cenę można pokonać to wszystko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613338.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówili o głupstwach, ale on pomyślał, że będzie z nią bardzo trudna historia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613340.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy mówiła: „nie bawię się” albo: „nie potrzebuję”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613356.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Ale zapłaciliśmy za to drogo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613357.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.792,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na jednej jej szali leży góra złota, na drugiej męski członek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613358.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie ty go chyba nie kochasz?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613359.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Myszki nie robią takiego hałasu! — zauważyła Żaneta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613360.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile — myślisz — mogłabym zarabiać jako prostytutka? Żeby zarobić na podróż dokądkolwiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci nie uważają na lekcjach, muszę się ciągle gniewać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuć im coś w łeb.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie Boże itd.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613394.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od ojca i od Janka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twierdzenie, że w Polsce rządzi burżuazja, nie jest prawdą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I teraz stała się rzecz najsmutniejsza.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, jak tu prześlicznie! — szeptała leniwie, mrużąc oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613411.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żeby iść tak… żeby iść tak… i wciąż iść.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bał się jej, mimo że była naprawdę grzeczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może u nich tylko taki już zwyczaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Łaskawa pani czegoś się przelękła, nieprawdaż?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan się myli w tym wypadku.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.656,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była stanowczo za ładna i za dobrze deklamowała.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613464.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.296,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil patrzył na nią i był czerwony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613466.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyliśmy ją kołem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613493.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było świństwo, że mu nie kupiono psa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613495.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mrówka myśli, że to wysoka góra.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Straciłem władzę zmieniania przedmiotów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Umie zachwalać swój towar.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613503.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest przez chwilę naciągnięty jak struna, nim się ją puści, nim wyda dźwięk.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613533.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dalej, ruszaj się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613534.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bez nas nie byłoby wojny…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613537.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła: — Niepotrzebnie mówisz, że mnie lubisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613539.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z naszych nikt nie był zabity.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613540.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śmieje się do mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu tych czterech dni odeszła przedostatnia fala moich czytelników.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poza tym posyłali do siebie Józię, młodą pokojówkę Emila.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613587.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A więc — panno Klementyno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świeże, ścięte przymrozkiem powietrze orzeźwiło mnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.984,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbował wszystkiego, co mu strzeliło do głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613641.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wywołać go może zbytnie nasilenie myśli lub nadzwyczajne napięcie uczuciowe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613642.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I popatrzyła na mnie wyzywająco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613643.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ulokowali panią w okropnej dziurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613644.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mimo wszystko od Janka pachniało lekko jakimś obcym zapachem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613645.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— A co to panu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ona ma to okresowo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to niepojęty cud.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już ja jej to wybiję z głowy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ściany pochylają się nade mną i wyginają, jak widziane przez wodę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz dochodzenia spełzły na niczym: sprawcy mordu nie wykryto.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613696.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo przygotowania do podpalenia gmach nie został zniszczony.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613697.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Nikt! — odrzekła jego małżonka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W miarę zbliżania się nocy wzrastała zaciekłość huraganu i rosła siła deszczu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszyscy ciebie nie cierpią!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Mam dla was trzy rzeczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, to bym zrobiła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613762.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Odszedłem z uczuciem ulgi i wkrótce zasnąłem głęboko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzruszony, z opuszczoną nisko głową wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613764.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc ja ci udowodnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613765.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.728,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Świat pełen jest larw i masek zrodzonych w ten sposób.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613826.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wiem, ale sprawdzę w internecie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613828.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nad płonącym ogniem stała pochylona sylwetka jakiegoś mężczyzny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613830.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki gatunek filmu lubisz najbardziej?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613832.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I między Murzynami miał Maciuś wrogów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613833.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Duszność wisi pod sufitem i kładzie się na piersi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chce mi się z nikim wychodzić ani tańczyć, ani spacerować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób osłaniali się wzajemnie tarczami noszonymi na lewym przedramieniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dzisiaj mamy być tam.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chciał jechać koleją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Doskonale! — powiedziałem, zwracając się do kozaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613916.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stefania czytała na głos wolno i uroczyście.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ty myślisz, że między „chcieć” a „nie chcieć” jest jakaś różnica? Żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Schludnie ubrany pan zapraszał uroczą panią do tańca.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dwaj przyjaciele, milcząc, spojrzeli wzajem po sobie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613924.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Otoczyła nas atmosfera hali targowej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciepło, nie za gorąco.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W mych oczach, oczach małego barbarzyńcy, piękność niewiele znaczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pójdź tam szybko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613959.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Karolina uroczyście przysięgła podnosząc dwa palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20613960.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Byłbym wdzięczny za informację, w jakich godzinach planowany jest lot w tamtą stronę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614005.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej się żyje w chałupie gajowego, a inaczej w młynie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614006.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to tylko niepotrzebne rozdrażnienie skóry i strata czasu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614007.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeden z chłopaków znalazł naszą przyczepę, a raczej jej szczątki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614008.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To jest chodzenie po ostrzu brzytwy, fantastycznie wąska via media.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614009.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rzuciłem mu się w ramiona na długą, długą chwilę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614026.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gotowi są wasi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614028.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiła pani, że to przede wszystkim osoby starsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614030.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Pan naczelnik — podkreślił z przekąsem — żartuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614032.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Patrzę, kto weselszy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614034.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.584,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— On trzyma, a ty zrzuciłeś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614050.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale nie było bardzo przyjemnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Cały film swoją scenerią idealnie wpisuje się w nurt ekspresjonistyczny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Walkę jednak stoczył on sam jeden, o własnych siłach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.496,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— W jaki sposób? — Byłem u lekarza i powiedział, że będę mówił nisko.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mieli piętnaście lat.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614080.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najwyższy punkt tamy znajdował się nie wyżej siedemnastu stóp nad poziomem gruntu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwnie ruch się wzmaga na namacalnie ciemnym podwórzu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— I dotrzymam jej wiernie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20614084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie dobrze będzie wypuścić go ze szkoły.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam ja jechać nie mogę, widzicie, bo był taki wypadek…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcę wyjść! — krzyczę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poczekaj, aż on wróci na spoczynek… a potem: jeden celny strzał!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620042.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nieznajomy uśmiechnął się dziwnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dobrze ci tutaj?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Andrzej uścisnął mi rękę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620057.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kochał Indian, detektywów, włamywaczy i psy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620058.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już jest prawie jasno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620060.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zapomniałem nadmienić.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może pod wpływem skruchy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Owszem, posiada pan duży talent konwersacyjny, zwłaszcza w kierunku parowania pytań.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.808,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, ale co tu gadać?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzień jej na horyzoncie pańskiego życia już zaświtał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"No, dogodził mu, jak się należało!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620106.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mali symulanci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620107.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiększenie jest olbrzymie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620108.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pchał go sanitariusz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620109.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Króliki wymagają przywiązania, ale potrafią dać w zamian wiele szczęścia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620110.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągnęła się samotna i naga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620116.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd pan może wiedzieć o tym wszystkim? — szeptał na pół przytomny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620117.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież wiesz, że nie będziesz jej czytał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620118.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Kulawych nam nie trzeba!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620119.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Towarzysze mojej wędrówki odeszli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620121.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Chcesz mnie zgubić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy to nie za słodkie, jak na wino?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620132.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie dość dziwne powtórzenie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Erupcja wulkanu wywołała bardzo duże zniszczenia.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szkoda.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— He, he, he! — beczał rozbawiony naczelnik.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No i przypuszczam też, dzielny człowiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620137.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I śpiewać się nie wstydzi, i pierwsza powiedziała, że będzie tańczyła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620138.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już pani gotowa?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620139.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie bywają nasze noce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620140.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pasterki nie wiedziały, kto gra i skąd pieśń dolatuje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620156.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma powodu do obaw.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620157.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pamięć ulatuje i ludziom chyba nie zależy, żeby pamiętać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620158.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W każdym razie…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620159.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potarł ręką rozpalone czoło, nowy dreszcz go przeleciał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620160.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy być może?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Omijam ją z daleka…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znajdował tylko swoje ręce i swoje nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620168.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ogrodzie mieli jacuzzi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620170.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prowadziliśmy je za uzdy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zobaczyła jego wywrócone oczy i połyskujące białka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.128,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zmieniłem zamiar i jadę do stacji końcowej na tej linii.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620199.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To rzekłszy, odwróciła się i wybiegła z pokoju.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc chyba dużo czytałaś?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620221.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No dobrze już, dobrze — odparła, podając mu rękę na pożegnanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620222.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I między Murzynami miał Maciuś wrogów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620224.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kładzie się na łóżko i pyta półserio, ostrożnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620225.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"już niech będzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620227.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój współlokator i jego gość grają w karty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620244.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uszczypnął go w udo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620246.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"- Bez.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620247.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Moment ten uwiecznił rzeźbiarz w marmurze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620249.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wcierać lekko na noc.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620251.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wieża była z kamieni, u dołu szeroka, wyżej coraz węższa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620262.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zabić go, czy co? Spytam małego k.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620263.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy nawet byłem zły i nie podobało mi się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma nikogo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620265.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takiej chwili pasiecie się? — zawołał młody muł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obydwaj zrozumieli, że bójka, którą toczyli przed chwilą, stała się już zbyteczna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620393.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ślady nieznajomego wiodły właśnie przez wzgórze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620395.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wara ode mnie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620396.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było przyjemnie niekonsekwentne, bo postanowił się stąd wyprowadzić ze względu na małą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620397.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.216,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak sobie pościelesz, tak się wyśpisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620398.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chce mi się z nikim wychodzić ani tańczyć, ani spacerować.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co robiła w tej chwili Hela?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Lecz w jaki sposób skorzystasz ze wskazówki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620408.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Wtedy, kiedy ja przyjechałem, to było? — Tak.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620409.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale na tym nie koniec; posłuchaj rzeczy prawdziwej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620410.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.936,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na ustach jego ukazał się lekki uśmiech i pozostał.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.232,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czyż to nie charakterystyczne, że trupie głowy są zawsze uśmiechnięte?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydawało mu się, że gdy ją straci, umrze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziecko ma prawo do nauki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcieliśmy go najpierw obudzić, żebyśmy mogli porozmawiać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620418.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawda, że jest przyjemny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620435.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Dziękuję! — odkrzyknął oddalając się wybrzeżem ku miastu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620436.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.352,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przybył tutaj jako zbieg.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620437.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zauważyła nauczycielka, ale myśli, że się przyzwyczają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ucieczka prędzej czy później musi się wykryć.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tobie się podobał ten głos.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620453.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kupiłam wczoraj kilka bułek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620454.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.648,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak samo powie, jak nad jarem i nad strumieniem! — gardłował kulawiec, podrygując niecałą nogą.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620455.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Tutaj wieją dziwne wiatry.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620456.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla takiej frajdy nie trzeba było iść tak daleko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620459.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale słuchali o sobie plotek z praw dziwą przyjemnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620460.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Matka ciągłe jadła tyłek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620461.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wynalazł dla mnie obalony przez burzę olbrzymi cedr.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620463.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nagłe zmiany nastrojów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620465.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten głos nie był im obcy!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Próbowałeś restartować?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtem otworzyły się drzwi i weszła matka Emila, mówiąc: — Jak ładnie grasz dzisiaj.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620488.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci idą do sklepu i kupują gotowe masło, nie widziały nigdy jak ono powstaje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620490.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Więc w piątek?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620492.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była to pieśń Schuberta „Gratchen an Spinnrade”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620510.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Skąd tu tyle ludzi?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620512.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gluten występuje w takich zbożach jak pszenica, żyto czy jęczmień.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620513.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Była godzina szósta po południu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620514.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak było zawsze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620516.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musisz się przygotować na daleką drogę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620526.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.424,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inaczej nie zlezę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620527.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wychodząc, pułkownik zawołał wesoło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ile — myślisz — mogłabym zarabiać jako prostytutka? Żeby zarobić na podróż dokądkolwiek.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz jestem już u siebie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Miasto jest ciemne, zaciemnione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620541.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Hm… tak by wyglądało.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620542.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.928,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Znów wiatr i deszcz prosto w twarz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620544.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.28,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jestem w nędzy…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potem: — Przepraszam cię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Całkiem zapomniał o swojej biedzie i niebezpieczeństwie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620556.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przyniosła potem drugą i trzecią.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620558.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To było skończone.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Która godzina?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Horyzont miłości wypogodził się i nastało złote, nagrzane słońcem południe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620588.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.136,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy ty myślisz, że między „chcieć” a „nie chcieć” jest jakaś różnica? Żadnej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620589.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może chce pani przejść się tamtędy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech patrzy — powtórzył jednoręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak zwykle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyciekam z siebie powoli, zostaje miękka skorupa, zdeformowany kształt.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620623.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.072,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeciągła pieszczota pocałunku, pożegnalne zwarcie się spojrzeń… i wyszedłem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620624.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Autor: Jan Baptysta Porta.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620625.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak najbliżej, jak najbliżej koło ust…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620655.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kulawiec wręczył mu dziwożonę, a sam skocznie pomknął do Podlasiaka.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620657.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tylko kształty przesuwają się wolno, schodzą i rozchodzą w milczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620658.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś powinnam mieć miesiączkę i nic.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620659.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Maszyny porosłe włosami.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620660.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.872,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mówiła jakimś językiem Filipowi zupełnie nie znanym.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620681.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I ptaszek odpowiedział.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620682.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo to licho przecież nie je, nie pije, tylko wyśmiewaniem żyje.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620683.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślał o wspaniałych lokomotywach, które odjeżdżają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620684.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Czy tylko możliwym jest, by letarg trwał tak długo?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620685.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Emil próbował zmienić temat rozmowy i powiedział, że był na koncercie znanego pianisty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620699.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan Kazimierz zamyślił się.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620700.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.944,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie tędy droga.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620702.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że nie jesteś już normalny.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620704.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.832,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzieci i ryby głosu nie mają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620705.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.432,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zosiu, przestań gryźć mamę!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620728.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.712,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A jednak się spóźniliśmy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620730.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Urósł potężnie w siłę, odkąd nam uciekł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.504,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pewno widzą jak ja — pola wiecznego lodu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uśmiechnął się ironicznie zakrwawionym pyskiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620755.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.568,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego muszę rozumieć?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wkrótce pod jedną z arkad mostowych zamajaczyły zwłoki ofiary.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.512,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na pamiątkę, dziewulinko? — spytał domyślnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620761.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panna Karolina uroczyście przysięgła podnosząc dwa palce.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620763.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przymknąłem na chwilę olśnione oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620771.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.144,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Opowiedz mi o swej rodzinie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O coś się złościł.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W łóżku pracować mi zbrzydło.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nerwie i mózgu i serce świata!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.592,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I uciekł twarzą, jakby przestraszony, i w ruchu tym była kokieteria.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620791.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przydałby się tu jakiś wybieg dla psów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620792.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mój Boże, jak wąska jest via media.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620793.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przed chwilą żona, teraz mąż.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620794.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadeszła ciemność bezwładu…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620795.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczęśliwy człowiek pracuje sprawniej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy on to robi z umysłu?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zajrzałem przez wybitą szybę w głąb trzeciej izby.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620821.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to bóg wojny, zjawiający się powtórnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620824.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten idiota lekarz dyżurny myśli, że będę od razu chciał popełnić samobójstwo.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620827.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można tu wyczuć pewne jakby stopniowanie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620847.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie nazywali tego przyjaźnią, nie nazywali tego wcale.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620848.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będę się opierał o ciebie i o ścianę i podejdę do okna.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620849.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.152,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno i drugie z niesłychaną intensy wnością.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620850.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jaki jest twój ulubiony film?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Twarzyczka jego nabrała dziwnego wyrazu — począł poruszać ziemię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620871.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wie, ile dokładnie czasu potrzebuje na dotarcie swoim tempem na uczelnię.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620872.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.952,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale zdziwiło mnie, że pierwszy raz płacze.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620873.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bieganina, szepty, słowo: „uciekł, uciekł”.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620874.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.16,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wytrzymać nie można.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.064,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nigdy ani przedtem, ani potem nie widziałem jej tak rozrzewnionej…\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620902.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.36,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Argumentacja godna stołowej nogi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszał, jak szła po schodach, jak otwierała drzwi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Coraz więcej gorąca napływało mu do twarzy i zasłaniało oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620931.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedno było pewne: jeżeli nie złapią Maciusia, już się nie uspokoi.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620932.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Już wiem wszystko!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620933.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 1.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620934.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jedzcie sami na zdrowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20620936.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— To było nieuniknione.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poprawił się na poduszkach, wyciągnął nogi przed siebie i zapalił cygaro.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.376,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Co za przypuszczenie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.272,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To była najpiękniejsza piosenka, jaką kiedykolwiek słyszałam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.88,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyszła ze szkoły o jedenastej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621088.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może ci powiedzieć coś złego, jak tamtej pani.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621125.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Napastnicy, pobici i odparci, uciekli.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621127.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.664,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak przy lądowaniu samolotu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621128.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciszkiem do niej, ciszkiem, żeby nie uciekła! — ostrzegł półgłosem kulawiec, badawczo obzierając dziuplę.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621129.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zresztą sprawia wrażenie gentlemana w całym tego słowa znaczeniu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20621131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.416,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bo czyż nałogowy palacz ma w ogóle jakąś przyjemność?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590747.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W części okrągłej mieścił się maneż, w prostokątnej stajnie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590748.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie nie ma usprawiedliwienia dla wycofania się z tych celów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590749.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.288,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Usprawnienie dialogu politycznego oraz zwiększenie zaangażowania i koordynacji to niezbędne warunki ożywienia jednolitego rynku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590751.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba działać - pamięć ofiar jest święta!\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590752.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Inne poprawki, które należy wprowadzić do obowiązującego prawodawstwa, dotyczą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590772.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Spojrzyj na dzieci.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590773.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Można przecież uczyć się na błędach z przeszłości zamiast je powtarzać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.744,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stary Gasztowt przetarł oczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy kilka poprawek\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W większości krajów mamy nie tylko partie polityczne, ale także fundacje polityczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590835.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech Pan spojrzy na poziom inwestycji w Indiach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590836.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest rzeczą naturalną, że wydarzeniom rewolucyjnym towarzyszą wielkie emocje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590837.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To kwestia o zasadniczym znaczeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590838.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Udało jej się!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590839.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z własnego doświadczenia wiemy, że mieszkają tam grupy zepchnięte na margines społeczeństwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590860.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja mam zanadto wyedukowaną świadomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590861.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Decyzję podejmuje sędzia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590863.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wirus zaatakuje państwa mające słabą konstytucje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590864.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam nadzieję, że ich podstawowe prawa człowieka, włącznie z prawem do azylu, będą chronione\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39590865.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.192,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to, jak zwrócono na to uwagę, bardzo ważna debata na bardzo ważny temat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592151.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.492,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nie może być rozwiązaniem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niemniej jednak jeszcze więcej trudności nastręcza całkowite wyłączenie usług finansowych z obowiązku dostarczania informacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592153.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W czerwcu wspólny rejestr będzie dostępny za pośrednictwem Internetu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592154.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tej chwili znalezienie lub uwolnienie dodatkowych środków zależy od sojuszu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592155.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aż do tej pory europejska koncepcja opierała się na demokracji przedstawicielskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każdy powinien wiedzieć, że Londyn jest w istocie bardzo zróżnicowanym miastem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592186.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawie nie słychać turkotu dorożek, gdyż dorożki stoją.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Do tego nie należało nigdy dopuścić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592188.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W działaniach tych niewątpliwie ważną rolę będzie odgrywał Parlament Europejski\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592190.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tyle, że dziś nikt nigdy by jej tak nie nazwał\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym podziękować członkom Komisji Rynku Wewnętrznego i Ochrony Konsumentów za poruszenie tych ważnych kwestii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zmian Politycznych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy Komisja poruszyła to zagadnienie a jeżeli tak, jakie działania podejmuje?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"z pewnością nie są one czymś, czego chcemy w łańcuchu żywnościowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592501.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.64,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W początkach wojny wschodniej przejeżdżał przez Warszawę bogaty, moskiewski kupiec, Suzin, przyjaciel Wokulskiego.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592918.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Myślę, że jeszcze da się uratować, przynajmniej na niektórych obszarach, hodowlę tych zwierząt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592919.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciągnęli oni wszyscy do Krakowa.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592920.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Równe prawa są prawami człowieka!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592921.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym odczytać fragment sprawozdania badawczego, sfinansowanego przez Parlament\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39592922.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak jeżeli tylko będziemy chcieli, możemy zmienić obecną sytuację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593097.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zarówno Filip, jak i Olimpias mieli doświadczyć tego dnia wizji.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593099.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.464,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego niestety głosowaliśmy przeciwko jego przyjęciu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam czekać, chybabym przysłał po sukurs.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Denerwuje to wielu ludzi i jak już powiedziano, oprócz alibi nie przyniosło żadnych efektów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie wolno lekceważyć zwalczania terroryzmu, który jest fragmentem przestępczości międzynarodowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593147.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A może firma odpowiedzialna za import?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stanowiło i stanowi stałe wezwanie prezydencji portugalskiej i jesteśmy pewni, iż zostanie ono usłyszane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to coś, co powinniśmy rozważyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem za sprawozdaniem w sprawie przyszłości polityki jakości żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593152.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.304,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrwa to długo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593174.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.1,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam na myśli zasady uniwersalności, prawa do opieki o dobrej jakości, równości i solidarności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593175.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Kiedy nie lubimy krykieta,“ rzekł Adaś.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593176.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten spór staje się akademicki, ponieważ ryby praktycznie zniknęły\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593177.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy zawsze pamiętać o jednej rzeczy, a mianowicie o ich wartości i znaczeniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593178.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.652,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To również wróży dobrą atmosferę na listopadowym posiedzeniu uzgadniającym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593200.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym sprzeciwić się utworzeniu Europejskiej Akademii Dyplomatycznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593201.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.572,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Budżet Unii Europejskiej odzwierciedla jej politykę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593202.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polityka dotycząca opodatkowania zużycia energii także ilustruje moją myśl\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593203.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprzeciwia się to najlepszym, najszlachetniejszym tradycjom jednego z najstarszych ludów na ziemi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39593204.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wybierzcie demokrację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39605998.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.444,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W kwestii integracji regionalnej również wiele da się zrobić w praktyce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39605999.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W wielu państwach pochodzące stamtąd produkty są dokładnie oznaczane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606000.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szczególnie pozytywnym pomysłem są euroobligacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606001.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I śmiejąc się, wybiegł z gabinetu.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606002.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.372,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Postęp dokonuje się, gdy państwa mogą bez problemów reformować swoje instytucje krajowe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606017.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.392,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"jest to próba zniszczenia tybetańskiej kultury i religii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606018.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym znać więcej szczegółów na temat stanowiska Komisji w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606019.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto zablokował ten ruch?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606020.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.58,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym się z państwem skonsultować i przedstawić niebawem konkretne propozycje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606022.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Piętnasta rocznica pekińskiej platformy działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606036.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadzam się z moim przedmówcą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606037.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyrektywa z powodzeniem przeszła próbę czasu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606038.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy także kwestię zbudowania nowych partnerstw pomiędzy przemysłem a środowiskiem akademickim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606039.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas obecnego kryzysu gospodarczego jednym z rozwiązań może być zapewnienie wzrostu produkcji żywności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606040.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedziała Pani to, co chcieliśmy usłyszeć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606051.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I tak programy pomocowe często zawodzą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606052.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym zakresie musimy wypełnić i wypełnimy nasze zobowiązania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606053.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ciekawym, czy jest i moja narzeczona?...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606054.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.308,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aktualna sytuacja polityczna powinna zwrócić naszą uwagę również na usługi energetyczne i komunikacyjne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606055.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zwracam się do pana przewodniczącego, wiceprzewodniczącego Komisji, urzędującego przewodniczącego Rady\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606909.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.184,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wielu z państwa mówiło również o zatrudnieniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606910.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Proszę ją nam opowiedzieć!“ odezwała się Stokrotka, żeby nadać inny obrót rozmowie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606911.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właśnie dlatego wzywam Koleżanki i Kolegów do poparcia przedmiotowego sprawozdania w całości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606912.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele pozostaje do zrobienia, jak to pokazał kryzys polityczny, który trapi to państwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606913.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.724,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspomniano tu natomiast o kilku anomaliach, do których pokrótce chcę się odnieść\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606926.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.736,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy się bardziej postarać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606927.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament Europejski musi dokonać bardziej sprawiedliwego podziału płatności wśród krajów i rolników europejskich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606928.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.672,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale mówimy o wyrokach sądu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606929.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.164,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecie mi nieraz ze sądu dawali do przepisywania, choć nie mam lekkiej ręki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606930.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę bardzo podziękować komisarzowi Barnierowi za udzielone nam informacje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606942.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.632,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę zaznaczyć, że w pełni rozumiem uzasadnienie do każdej poprawki złożonej przez sprawozdawcę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606943.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"sankcje osłabiają społeczeństwo obywatelskie i umacniają prezydenta Ahmadineżada\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606944.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego nie możemy zaniedbać żadnej dziedziny naszej polityki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606945.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednocześnie zmniejszyło się tempo negocjacji w sprawie przystąpienia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606946.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.032,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Immunitet parlamentarny w Polsce\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606949.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla zapewnienia stabilności finansowej decydujące znaczenie mają\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606950.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest jednak bardzo ważne, by znaleźć rozwiązania, które pozwolą utrzymać konkurencyjność europejskiego przemysłu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606951.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kompromis osiągnięty po długich sporach jest jednak lepszy niż nic\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606952.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po raz pierwszy uzgodniliśmy wspólne podejście do komunikacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606953.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.112,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liczę, że to co pan zapowiedział, zostanie zrealizowane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606955.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.544,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zamierza zrobić Komisja i Rada, by uwolnić tych więźniów politycznych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606956.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako doktor medycyny dezaprobuję ingerencję polityki w kwestie zdrowia publicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606957.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jakie będą dalsze kroki?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606958.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ciągu minionych lat powiększyły się nierówności społeczne i ubóstwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606963.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jenom na wozie, bo mnie Niemcy postrzelili.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606964.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję za pana wystąpienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606965.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.552,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przedmiotowe sprawozdanie jest dla Parlamentu Europejskiego niezaprzeczalnym sukcesem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606966.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W przeciwnym razie większość użytecznych zaleceń, które formułujemy w sprawozdaniu, byłoby jedynie martwą literą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606967.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zgadza się, byliśmy uparci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606969.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam w związku z tym dwa pytania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606970.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koleżanki i Koledzy, gratulacje!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606971.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To oczywiste, że nic nie możemy od niego oczekiwać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606972.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.104,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"„Otóż nie będę o niej myślał...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39606973.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I było mu źle.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653708.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wynika ze sprawozdania Komisji, początek tej dyskusji sięga prezydencji portugalskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653709.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podczas Rady Europejskiej z czerwca wyznaczono kurs w kierunku naprawy nadzoru rynku finansowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653711.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.524,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Od początku osobiście popierałem pierwotny wniosek Komisji przewidujący uchylenie wszystkich ośmiu dyrektyw bez kompensacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653713.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co zatem zrobimy za rok?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653714.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziś debatujemy w Parlamencie o okolicznościach jego śmierci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653721.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli mogę, chciałbym odnieść się tylko do paru konkretnych przypadków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653722.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tu gra rolę miłość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653723.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Toczyliśmy już na ten temat debatę i nie chciałbym do niej wracać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653724.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.384,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wracam do domu w rozpaczy.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653725.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Śniegi raptownie spłynęły i ziemia do gruntu odmarzła.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653731.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przede wszystkim pragnę państwu powiedzieć, że w programie sztokholmskim naprawdę uwzględniono los ofiar\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653732.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto hamulce włączają się automatycznie, gdy pociąg nie zatrzyma się na czerwonym świetle\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653733.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podobnie jak fokstrot z naszą ukochaną Europejską Służbą Działań Zewnętrznych, trwało to zbyt długo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653734.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Instrumenty ratunkowe, pomimo poważnych niedociągnięć, były dobre\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653735.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym samym roku ruszył na Indie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653757.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Szwedzka administracja państwowa spełniła oczekiwania wszystkich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653758.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdzie nieszczęście i nadzieje są wspólne, tam ludzie łatwo zabierają znajomość.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653759.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prawo azylu to sposób na \\\"głosowanie nogami\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653760.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.488,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Starzy praktycy zaraz po tem uzbrojeniu poznawali ludzi nieobytych z wojną i niedoświadczonych.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653782.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zarówno pani, jak i my wiemy, że mówiła pani o zadaniu niemal niemożliwym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653784.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak możemy zapewnić, aby kraje rozwijające się posiadały bezpieczne dostawy żywnościowe?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653785.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To samo dotyczy opracowywania nowych leków\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653787.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Następnym punktem posiedzenia jest zielona księga w sprawie pracowników służby zdrowia w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653788.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To kluczowe pytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.012,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poszli ulicą i wkrótce zasiedli przy marmurowym stoliku w pięknej cukierni.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziwne jest zatem, że program przedakcesyjny, program pomocy przedakcesyjnej, jest tak słabo wdrażany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wymaga to jednak zgody odpowiednich państw na nieutrudnianie realizacji takich programów i projektów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przekazała nam pani pozytywną informację i potwierdziła pragnienie działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39653818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.004,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Żywię nadzieję, że teraz naród irlandzki również poprze tę zasadę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666866.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.344,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W związku z tym powinniśmy bardziej skupić się na zapobieganiu i działaniach następczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666867.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zaledwie obydwoje zwrócili swe twarze w stronę wędrowca...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666868.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To więcej wolnego rynku, mniej regulacji, więcej swobody gospodarczej, więcej otwarcia na wolny handel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666869.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nalegam jednak\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666870.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.904,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdecydowana większość państw członkowskich oraz Parlament zgodziły się z tą oceną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666875.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Działania te mogą się wydawać podobne, ale nie są tożsame\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666876.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.932,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to naszych przyjaciół z krajów zachodnionordyckich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666877.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.484,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W końcu!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666878.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.324,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ta większa przejrzystość wspiera również otwartą architekturę Internetu, którą uwydatniamy, której chcemy, której bronimy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666879.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.472,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako Parlament musimy także upewnić się, co do tego, co pan robi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666880.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.804,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wtedy do nas będzie należała decyzja i ewentualne poparcie dla was w tym zakresie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666881.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.884,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Stwórzmy proreformatorskiemu gabinetowi możliwość nieco swobodniejszego politycznego działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666882.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Małe wyjaśnienie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.084,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przekształcenie dyrektywy ma również na celu uczynienie jej skutecznym i elastycznym narzędziem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39666884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czwarte, po dramatycznych wydarzeniach ostatnich dwóch tygodni potrzeba odpowiedzialności i sprawiedliwości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683883.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.264,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie pragnę powiedzieć, że bardzo trudno jest podsumować całą sytuację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683884.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Innymi słowy, te kontrole zadziałały\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.732,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałabym podziękować wszystkim koleżankom i kolegom posłom, którzy się tutaj wypowiadali\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Musimy to zrozumieć również jako prawodawcy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Synod ten nie może zostać zarejestrowany i nie ma podstawy prawnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W konsekwencji tego osłabia w tym zakresie swoje własne przywiązanie do demokracji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Być może teraz jest rok zerowy nowej ery w historii Haiti\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683890.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.132,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcemy Rumunów!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683891.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak wiemy, rozmowy panów Christofiasa i Talata znajdują się w krytycznym stadium\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683892.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.284,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po pierwsze, warunki zatrudnienia i pracy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683893.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z radością przyjmuję też propozycję stworzenia planu działania przeciw podrabianiu produktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683894.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę jeszcze raz przeczytać sprawozdanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683895.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uderzające jest jednak to, że już teraz dostrzegliśmy kilka dzielących nas różnic\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683896.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.912,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zło czynione przez ludzi ich przeżywa, dobro częstokroć ginie pogrzebane z ich kośćmi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683897.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Głosowałem za tą rezolucją, bo kwestia energii to jest taki wielki sprawdzian solidarności europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683903.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.644,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dlatego Rada tak pozytywnie zareagowała na tę decyzję\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683904.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomimo stwierdzenia, że jest to nieuniknione, uważam, że powinniśmy się na to zdecydować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683905.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest bardzo ważne, że wysłuchali oni Państwa uwag\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683906.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy jest tu czterdziestu posłów, którzy zechcą wstać i złożyć wniosek w sprawie kworum?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39683907.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.752,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby to było bardzo proste, już byśmy to zrobili\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705187.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"demokracja to nie zupa błyskawiczna!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705189.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.624,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Okrzyk: „Wojna!“ rozległ się po całej Wielkopolsce i wszystkich ziemiach Rzeczypospolitej.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705191.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.56,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Poparliśmy jego umiarkowanie, jego gotowość do dialogu oraz niezachwianą wierność zasadzie niestosowania przemocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.364,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Działo się to jeno dla jego bezpieczeństwa, ale nie było mu wcale miłe.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705194.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wzywam Komisję i Parlament do szybkiej interwencji i obrony podstawowych praw naszych obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705205.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ach, ja niewdzięczna!...\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705206.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale już dobranoc waćpannom, czas spać.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705207.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie, musimy podjąć bardziej wytężone wysiłki w kwestii sankcji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705208.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.388,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kara śmierci jest najbardziej niegodziwym spośród wszystkich przejawów pogardy dla godności, cywilizacji i postępu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705209.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.212,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wypracowaliśmy to w naszym sprawozdaniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705215.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Proszę o przyjęcie zalecenia i chciałbym wyrazić podziękowanie za liczne poparcie, które otrzymałem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705216.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.312,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kto będzie za to odpowiedzialny?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705217.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Energia jądrowa ma do odegrania ważną rolę, gdyż pozwoli ona walczyć z efektem cieplarnianym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705218.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże zyski w ten sposób wygenerowane już nie powracają do gospodarki krajowej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_39705219.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"możemy naprawdę używać wszystkich narzędzi, jakie mamy obecnie do dyspozycji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535545.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ten instrument - europejska inicjatywa obywatelska - przybliży instytucje do ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535546.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"najważniejszym, najtańszym i najbardziej zrównoważonym dostępnym nam źródłem energii jest energia zaoszczędzona\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.916,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"wiarygodność i jedność\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535548.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie mam wyraźną prośbę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.356,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jesteśmy narodem, który umiłował wolność i demokrację\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ja także jestem wdzięczny wszystkim, którzy przemawiali podczas tej niezwykle istotnej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To w tej właśnie dziedzinie możliwe są do osiągnięcia największe korzyści dla środowiska\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535554.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Umowa międzyinstytucjonalna jest pilnie potrzebna\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535560.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.748,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mają one zasadnicze znaczenie dla jakości życia obywateli, a także dla europejskiej konkurencyjności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535561.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Parlament, podobnie jak dotychczas Rada Europejska, odmówił podjęcia trudnych decyzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535562.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pytam też przewodniczącego Parlamentu Europejskiego, Prezydium, przewodniczących grup\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535563.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To dla mnie zaszczyt, że mogłem pracować w dwóch omawianych obszarach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535564.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.328,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pomoc na wzbogacanie moszczem nie może być kontynuowana w obecnym kształcie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535565.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wspieramy państwa członkowskie we wprowadzaniu podobnych mechanizmów działania na skalę krajową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535566.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.576,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie ważne jest, abyśmy znaleźli elastyczne rozwiązania w odniesieniu do kontrowersyjnych szczegółów przedmiotowej dyrektywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535567.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trybunał stwierdził, że nowy system powinien zostać przyjęty w rozsądnym czasie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535568.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.14,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nikt nie mówił o Portugalii, że jest apatyczna w tej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535569.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To właśnie powinno być istotą tego europejskiego dnia pamięci\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535575.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepływ pracowników pomaga również ograniczyć marginalizację społeczną i ubóstwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535576.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oznacza to odrzucenie wszelkich form terroryzmu i przemocy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535577.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecne kryzysy pokazują dokąd może nas to zaprowadzić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535578.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.716,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze obecne doświadczenia to rzeczywista przyszłość transportu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.316,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koszty powinni ponieść ci międzynarodowi spekulanci, którzy osiągnęli ogromne zyski z deregulacji rynków finansowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.428,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie trudno sobie wyobrazić, że mogłoby być jeszcze gorzej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Klęski głodu, które już mają miejsce, stają się coraz gorsze\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.556,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlaczego my mamy to robić?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy nagradzać te państwa członkowskie, które już podjęły odpowiednie kroki w tym kierunku\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535584.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przenoszenie przedsiębiorstw oczywiście może się odbywać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535590.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.94,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Kolejnym kluczowym aspektem jest ustawiczna edukacja i szkolenie pracowników\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535591.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.7,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiem Panu jedno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535593.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie był to przypadek odosobniony\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535594.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.336,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Organizacja polityków, którzy, korzystając z niej, uczestniczą w światowym życiu politycznym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam, że można nam wystawić w tym zakresie dobre referencje\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535596.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby możliwa była adaptacja, konieczne będzie systemowe podejście uwzględniające odnawialne źródła energii\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przepisy te jednak doprowadziły do wzrostu kosztów pożyczek uzyskiwanych przez małe przedsiębiorstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30535599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są również inne poważne sprawy, które stanowią nie mniejsze wyzwanie dla interesu publicznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543070.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wydaje się, że w tym dokumencie pominięto jedną kwestię, którą jest rola sektora prywatnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543071.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po czwarte chodzi o antycypowanie, o ile to możliwe, przyszłych ruchów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543072.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym celu niezbędna jest jednak czytelna polityka europejska w sprawie klimatu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543073.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.228,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po trzecie, w razie wypadku, jakie zasoby są dostępne, by zapobiegać zanieczyszczeniu nadbrzeża?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543074.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Takie połączenie wymaga określenia na nowo sposobów przekazywania i zdobywania wiedzy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543076.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pragnę na koniec zaakcentować ponownie konieczność stworzenia konkurencji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543077.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niestety osoby odpowiedzialne za opracowanie tego dokumentu miały inne priorytety\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543078.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma wskazówek co do implementacji, co najwyżej sprzeczne oświadczenia\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543079.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję także osobom pracującym w sekretariatach za ich nieoceniony wkład\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543081.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słowo \\\"cyjanek\\\" jest synonimem słowa \\\"śmierć\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543082.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.708,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jak dotąd jest dobrze - w każdym aspekcie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543083.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy też po prostu są spychane na bok?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543084.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym wyrazić gorące podziękowania dla przewodniczącego Komisji i dla Komisji za ich pracę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543085.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego ważne jest inwestowanie w młodych ludzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543086.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rozwój sektora nuklearnego i odnawialnych energii rodzi poważne trudności, które muszą być rozwiązane\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543087.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gdyby były one wyłącznie pokojowe, nie trzeba by było nic ukrywać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543089.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.968,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na szczęście pamiętała Pani, żeby to zrobić zanim ten dzień faktycznie minął\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543090.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasza grupa nie sądzi jednak, by należało ją izolować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543091.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia rozszerza się, wzmacniając swoją siłę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543092.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto uzgodniliśmy stworzenie nowej struktury nadzoru finansowego w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543093.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję urzędującemu przewodniczącemu Rady za odpowiedź\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543094.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Te obowiązujące wytyczne nie sprzyjają spójności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543095.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.068,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bardzo uważnie śledzę wewnętrzną politykę Węgier\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543096.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.168,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Muszą ciąć koszty przelotów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543098.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pani przewodnicząca, panie komisarzu, przedstawiciele prezydencji, szanowni państwo\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543100.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Innymi słowy, stawiamy wszystko na głowie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543101.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Taka sytuacja przyczynia się do zmniejszenia liczby miejsc pracy i zwiększenia ubóstwa\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543102.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeszkody te opisano w komunikacie przyjętym przez Komisję we wrześniu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543103.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.876,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak jest to kompromis, który można przeżyć, a kompromis jest lepszy niż trzecie czytanie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543111.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie wiadomo, że działania samych krajów uprzemysłowionych nie wystarczą\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543112.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będziemy również przypominać o chińskich gwarancjach konstytucyjnych dotyczących wolności wypowiedzi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543113.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Właściwy sposób oszczędzania energii polega na edukacji obywateli europejskich i tworzeniu systemów zachęt podatkowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543114.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Podatek od sprzedaży jest zatem co najmniej tak istotny jak podatki bezpośrednie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543115.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W zeszłym tygodniu dotarły do nas dobre wieści\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543131.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.668,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Linie elektroenergetyczne i morska energia wiatrowa zasługują oczywiście na dodatkowe środki\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543133.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"nie tylko negocjacje, ale też inwestycje na rzecz lepszego wzajemnego poznania się\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543134.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Reformy w ramach paktu stabilności i wzrostu nie dają jednak równych szans wszystkim podmiotom\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543135.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Liberalizacja stosunków handlowych przyniesie wzajemne korzyści podmiotom gospodarczym i stworzy korzystniejsze warunki inwestowania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543136.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z radością przyjmujemy tendencje demokratyzacyjne w tych krajach i powinniśmy je wspierać\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543146.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.536,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Czy bierzemy pod uwagę szerszy wachlarz dziedzin sportowych?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543148.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Co możemy powiedzieć po dwóch miesiącach jego funkcjonowania?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543149.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.22,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to jedynie propozycja, którą mógłby pan ewentualnie rozważyć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543150.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja wyraża zdecydowane zaangażowanie na rzecz wspierania ofiar terroryzmu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543163.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.088,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie widzę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543164.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.348,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powiedział, że uważa go za interesujący\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543165.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pan i pańscy pracownicy macie kojący wpływ w tych problematycznych czasach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543166.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z tego względu poparliśmy poprawki będące głosem sprzeciwu wobec pomysłu wprowadzenia pułapów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543167.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie możemy już dłużej odwlekać decyzji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543183.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dla tych krajów oznacza to w szczególności\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543184.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jest to punkt starcia wielu kultur, w tym krajów wspólnotowych i zróżnicowanych państw trzecich\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543185.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"azyl jest obowiązkiem państw i prawem osób uciekających przed wojną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543192.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jako sprawozdawczyni, chciałabym prosić o odnotowanie następujących faktów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543193.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trudniej jest uzyskać akceptację europejskich wartości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543195.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeśli nie będziemy brali pod uwagę tego stanowiska, osłabimy pozycję Europy w tej debacie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543196.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.148,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niewiele mogę dodać, być może poza kwestią podstawy prawnej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543198.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.616,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niepokojący jest wpływ spekulacji powstałych w sektorze zbóż na sektor hodowlany\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543210.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.508,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Naprawdę proszę o odpowiedź przed Bożym Narodzeniem, abym mógł powiedzieć swemu wnukowi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543211.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.46,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto uwypuklam potrzebę wprowadzenia programów edukacyjnych w szkołach, aby uniknąć dziedziczenia stereotypów dotyczących kobiet\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543212.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W takim razie zabiorę głos jeszcze raz\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543213.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak jak pan powiedział, w Parlamencie Europejskim widać stosowną wolę polityczną\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543214.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.408,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dlatego takie działanie mogłoby stanowić jedno z podstawowych rozwiązań zapobiegania i eliminowania terroryzmu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543229.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Precyzyjne i starannie opracowane prawodawstwo leży w interesie wszystkich stron\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543230.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Zdrowie jest i powinno pozostać kompetencją krajową\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543231.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Był to jeden z najczęściej poruszanych tematów podczas poprzedniej debaty, którą wszyscy pamiętamy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543232.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dotyczy to nie tylko Gruzji, lecz przede wszystkim Ukrainy, ale także i innych państw\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543255.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób doszedłem do swojej końcowej uwagi, pani przewodnicząca\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543258.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W debacie padło stwierdzenie, że niektóre z określeń są zbyt otwarte\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543259.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.84,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasze zadanie polega na zmuszeniu producentów do korzystania z mniej szkodliwych materiałów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543264.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto też rozważyć przyczyny tych niebezpiecznych zjawisk\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543266.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym się upewnić, że dobrze zrozumiałem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543267.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.04,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję Pani za pracę w czasie negocjacji między Parlamentem a Komisją\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543268.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wierzymy w społeczeństwo społeczne, ale nie socjalistyczne, bo ono odrzuca tych, którzy myślą inaczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543271.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.52,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Transportu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543272.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tak właśnie było w przypadku Zimbabwe\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543273.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jeżeli ci się zdaje, że mi umkniesz z workiem, to się grubo mylisz.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543274.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Aby osiągnąć kompromis, byłem w Gdańsku negocjować z Polską i ośmioma innymi państwami członkowskimi\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543275.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie ma na świecie parlamentu, dla którego tura pytań nie byłaby świętością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543279.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.956,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Warto zwrócić uwagę, że prawo zwykle zakazuje dyskryminacji, a praktyka wskazuje na kontynuację dyskryminacji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543280.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.2,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na podstawie rezultatów możemy jasno zauważyć, że cierpliwości okazała się być najlepszą polityką\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543281.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.988,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"swojej nieco już zapomniałem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543282.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"żadna z tych podstawowych kwestii nie znalazła się na szczycie w porządku obrad\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543298.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Posłowie dowiedli też, że Parlament nie pozwoli się traktować jak marionetka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543299.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europejski Trybunał Sprawiedliwości uznał to działanie za niezgodne z prawem\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543300.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Panie i panowie, oto nasz cel\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543302.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednakże obecnie nadal znajduje się na etapie rozwoju\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543308.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak od tego czasu nie odniosłam wrażenia, że jest pan szczególnie gotowy do działania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543309.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz nadszedł czas, aby ustalić sposoby i środki wdrożenia dyrektywy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543310.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadszedł czas, aby to zrobić\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543311.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.78,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"cel polityczny i ideologiczny\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543312.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z przyjemnością pani słuchałam\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543323.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystko jest oczywiste\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543324.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Jednak samą rezolucją zajmiemy się podczas czerwcowej sesji miesięcznej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543325.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.86,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Na zakończenie debaty otrzymałam dwa projekty rezolucji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543326.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.5,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyjdźmy poza sferę dyskusji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543327.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.4,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Osobiście niepokoi mnie jeszcze coś, o czym chciałbym wspomnieć\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543349.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.3,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wybory do Parlamentu Europejskiego powinny stać się bardziej demokratyczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543350.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dziękuję komisarzowi za konstruktywne podejście do tej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543352.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.72,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Komisja zainicjowała zmianę standardów dotyczących nazewnictwa włókien tekstylnych w ramach kampanii \\\"Lepszego prawodawstwa\\\"\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543353.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nawet gdy je uzyskamy, nie ma gwarancji, że się nam uda, ale warto spróbować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543355.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Powinni ją znać kandydaci, którzy chcą ubiegać się o przyjęcie do strefy euro\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543383.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.96,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przeczytam tekst w języku angielskim\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543384.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.176,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebne są także zmiany w prawie międzynarodowym\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543385.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie chcemy tego zarówno jako przedstawiciele władz, jak i jako zwykli obywatele\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543387.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.816,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz jednak pragnę szczerze jej pogratulować\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543388.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.34,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ochrona danych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543389.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.888,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Pozwolę sobie jednak postawić sprawę jasno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543391.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dzięki temu zmniejszyłby się problem bezrobocia w Europie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543392.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W ten sposób zdołamy utrzymać wiodącą rolę w branży motoryzacyjnej na świecie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543403.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.076,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nadzór ten jednak powinien także służyć uświadamianiu konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543404.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wszystkim tym, którzy szkalują projekt tego traktatu chciałabym powiedzieć jedno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543405.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Będzie to najlepszy test\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543406.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wyłączenia z obowiązku wizowego zawsze opierają się na wzajemnym zaufaniu i wzajemnych zobowiązaniach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543407.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.12,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Potrzebne są tu połączone wysiłki i krajowe rządy powinny odegrać w tym istotną rolę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543413.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Obecnie potrzebujemy parlamentu światowego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543414.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Unia Europejska ma szczególny obowiązek chronienia podstawowych praw człowieka, a przede wszystkim praw dziecka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543415.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.06,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mowa o następujących projektach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543416.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.796,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mamy przewodniczącego Parlamentu Europejskiego, mamy przewodniczącego Komisji\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543417.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Europa pilnie musi dokończyć to, co rozpoczęła\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543438.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto napięta sytuacja finansowa zaczyna wpływać negatywnie na finansowanie instytucji gospodarczych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543440.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Są to pierwsze kroki w kierunku uczynienia z Unii Europejskiej państwa policyjnego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543449.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.516,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym wyraźnie zaznaczyć, że bez Ukrainy nie jest możliwa realna wizja współczesnej, bezpiecznej Europy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543450.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.42,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mówiąc krótko, potrzebne są dalsze badania\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543451.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.248,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Domy i pamięć o ich mieszkańcach zostały zniszczone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543470.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.688,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Z przyjaciółmi zaś należy otwarcie dyskutować o kontrowersyjnych kwestiach\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543472.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.976,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W tym aspekcie cieszy mnie odniesienie do emisji papierów wartościowych strefy euro\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543474.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.768,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Oczywiście sprawa ta zostanie przedyskutowana na posiedzeniach Transatlantyckiej Rady Gospodarczej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543475.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.436,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Słyszymy o porywaniu potencjalnych dawców i zabijaniu ich, by zdobyć organy\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543481.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.236,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym zwrócić państwa uwagę, że jedynie globalne przeciwdziałanie zmianom klimatu może być skuteczne\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543483.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.588,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ponadto istnieje problem spójności odnośnie do celu rozwijania norm społecznych i środowiskowych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543486.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.456,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wiele państw boryka się obecnie z problemami\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543487.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.868,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Każde państwo członkowskie powinno w dużym stopniu podejmować niezależne decyzje w tym zakresie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543497.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Początkowo jednym z elementów tej polityki będzie ułatwienie dostaw gazu i ropy dla Zachodu\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543498.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.996,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Partnerstwo wschodnie jest projektem na wiele lat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543499.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.32,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Uważam jednak, że osiągnęliśmy porozumienie w sprawie tych celów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543500.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.76,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Teraz złożenie podpisu pod traktatem i wcielenie go w życie należy do prezydenta Czech\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543517.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 9.0,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"do urzędu skarbowego, do rejestru handlowego, do firmy ubezpieczeniowej i do urzędu statystycznego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543518.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.6,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Należy działać i to działać szybko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543519.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.256,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Bezrobocia nie da się zażegnać tylko poprzez szkolenie bezrobotnych\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543520.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Polska w tamtym czasie postrzegana była jako jedno z państw hamujących proces integracji europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543521.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.948,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To nasz obowiązek jako Europejczyków, którym na sercu leży demokracja, wolność i prawa człowieka\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543528.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.74,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie można poprawić sytuacji mniejszości seksualnych czy też etnicznych bez wpływu na mentalność obywateli\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543529.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.528,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Gospodarstwa wielu osób zostały zniszczone\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543530.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.38,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Prywatyzacja usług publicznych i społecznych również prowadzi do zwiększenia liczby osób żyjących w ubóstwie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543531.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.448,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Rezultat\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543547.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.608,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Sprawdziłem to dzisiaj wieczorem i stwierdziłem, że tak nie jest\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543549.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.68,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dba ono nie tylko o dzieci, chroni także dłużnika\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543550.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To trochę za daleko\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543551.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Dyrektywa ta była niezwykle ważna w przeszłości i taką pozostanie również w przyszłości\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543553.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.896,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Przecież solidarność jest największą siłą Unii Europejskiej\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543579.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.92,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chciałbym prosić panią komisarz o informację w pewnej - moim zdaniem - istotnej sprawie\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543580.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 8.208,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Hiszpania przejmuje pałeczkę prezydencji Unii Europejskiej tuż po wejściu w życie traktatu lizbońskiego\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543581.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.636,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Trzeba teraz odzyskać zaufanie konsumentów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543582.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.156,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O rządzie, który rządzi bez demokracji, mam do powiedzenia tylko jedno\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543583.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.24,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Koniec z solidarnością\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543595.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.276,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Mam na myśli intergrupę\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543597.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.788,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Chcę podziękować wszystkim posłom, którzy włączyli się do tej debaty\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543598.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 7.02,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Wreszcie nie nakładajmy podatków od własności, lecz wprowadźmy opłaty za używanie pojazdów\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_30543599.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.048,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To ważne, by obowiązywała jedna procedura w zakresie wydawania pozwoleń na pracę i pobyt\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547774.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.864,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"I duch jego unosił się samotny i cierpiał z powodu swojej samotności.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547775.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ktoś znowu szedł, więc Cezary ociężale powrócił do swej łopaty.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547776.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nasi bracia sofiści, którzy byli daleko na Wschodzie.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547777.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.024,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— No, cóż, idziemy?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547778.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.776,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"To pytanie jest bezzasadne, proszę pana.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547814.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.016,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Najbliższy tydzień upłynął niemal cały na przygotowaniach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547815.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.056,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Ale w domu okazało się, że tak nie jest.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547816.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 5.784,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W głębi, pomiędzy filarami, przechadzało się kilku mnichów.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547817.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 2.856,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"O, dobrotliwy nasz panie!\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547818.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.704,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Niech się pan wystrzega tej brunetki i towarzystwa pijaków.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547834.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.696,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"A muszą się ukrywać, bo im nie wolno.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547885.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.8,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Może coś ci się w nim ciągle powtarza?\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547886.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.848,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"W pierwszych latach życia nie wolno dziecka oddzielać od matki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547887.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 6.096,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"— Zresztą, jeżeli nie wierzysz, popatrz sama spoza firanki.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547888.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.224,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Tam są Anka i Rena i one go poznają.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547889.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.824,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Lecz rozpoczęte zdanie zamarło mi na ustach.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547900.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 4.44,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Po prostu nie miałam z kim pojechać kajakiem.\"\n",
      "  },\n",
      "  {\n",
      "    \"audio_path\": \"D:\\\\kod\\\\src\\\\asr_pytorch\\\\common_voice_wav\\\\common_voice_pl_20547901.wav\",\n",
      "    \"duration\": 3.48,\n",
      "    \"text\": \"Nie kupuj kota w worku.\"\n",
